window.FWN_GODLY_STAY_HOME_DAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_STAY_HOME_DAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1401,"title":"Chapter 1401 The Ferocious and Powerful Lady","paragraphs":["Chapter 1401 The Ferocious and Powerful Lady","The continent, where the Bug Clan’s main nest was, shattered.","If all this energy was vented, half of the Heavenly Dragon Star Province would be destroyed.","Sixth Mind didn’t allow such a thing to happen.","He was scattering and neutralizing the energy after the outbreak.","Rumble!","All of a sudden, a trading group, consisting of more than a dozen spaceships, from the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven to the Heavenly Dragon Star Province, was swept away by a blue storm that seemed to have the size of the Star Area.","Every single one of the spaceships was a king vessel. However, they were all unable to withstand the might of the storm.","In just two breaths’ time, the dozen or so king vessels, as well as the people and goods inside, were all turned into fragments.","The precious spatial tunnel was a safe area cleared out by the Human Clan. For each section, there would be a planet stationed by humans.","There were 18 planets near the Heavenly Dragon Star Province.","The situation on those planets was similar to that of the king vessel fleet. However, this time, they turned into larger crushed rocks.","Those were continents left behind by the explosion of planets, and they looked like rubble.","There were so many of them that they covered the entire Star Area. Other than the 18 constructed Base Planets, there were a few tens of thousands of stars.","Under the impact of such meteorites, starting from the edge, they exploded and collapsed one after another. There were more and more asteroids. Soon, the entire Star Area was engulfed.","On the other side of the incident.","No one had stepped foot into the starry sky, and Starry Sky Beasts roamed freely in it.","However, all sorts of black energy spheres suddenly appeared.","They swallowed everything in that place.","But they did not dissipate and were still swirling around.","Just like the Blue Sand Wind Domain, everywhere in that place was possessed by hostile environments.","In the Star Dragon Area of the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.","“Reporting. E36, E37, and... 36 nodes of the spatial tunnel are wrecked at the same time. There seems to be a severe accident.”","“Let’s go and check.”","The fleet set off.","After they arrived at the site of the accident, alarms filled the spaceships.","“Alert! The energy fluctuations ahead are intense. King Vessel No. A32’s defensive layer is insufficient. The area affected by the energy fluctuations is constantly increasing. An immediate retreat is recommended.”","“Alert...”","What greeted them was an ink-black storm. There was no sunlight inside, and they could not see the end of it.","The harsh environment of the universe was displayed in this place.","“Detect its range.”","The system reported, “Beyond detection range.”","The spaceships flew to the side and reached a very far distance.","Rubble flew across the sky at an extremely fast speed. The flying meteorites were frightening.","“It’s over!”","“The Heavenly Dragon Star Province has been isolated.”","“With such a terrible environment, who can go in?” The leader sighed softly, “I’m afraid that for thousands of years, the Heavenly Dragon Star Province will not be able to get in touch with us. We need to report this matter to our superiors. The Star Dragon Area can’t have no subordinate Star Provinces, so we can only give up the Heavenly Dragon Star Province for the time being.”","“This matter has to be jointly reported by the major sects.”","“Let’s go. There’s nothing to see here.”","“...”","The departure of the fleet meant that the connection between the Heavenly Dragon Star Province and the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven was temporarily cut off.","Even though they were shocked by this, they were accustomed to it.","It wasn’t the first time that all sorts of unexpected events had occurred in the mysterious starry sky. However, it was extremely rare that they happened on such a large scale.","In the Heavenly Dragon Star Province, the changes went on.","In the Lo Family.","“Lili, I’ve just got the news that a lot of people disappeared.” Loshanwu took a deep breath and said, “They seemed to be devoured by space. Since Headmaster Shan isn’t here and Dragnet Academy is now rather chaotic, you should just stay home. Hmm? Lili? Lili!”","Lorry, who had just been beside him, silently disappeared.","Strange changes were taking place in many places.","“Changxiao, it won’t be a bad thing even if either of us disappears. We may go to the unknown world to experience.”","As soon as Qin Changxiao’s master finished speaking, he vanished directly.","The worst-case scenario was the Blue Sand Wind Domain, which had already gone extinct after the great explosion.","The ancient demonic beasts’ continent which had been devoured vanished as well.","After the fluctuations reached their peak, the probability of someone disappearing slowly decreased.","This process lasted for an entire month.","The people of the Heavenly Dragon Star Province referred to this month as the Astral Changing Era.","When everything returned to normal, a huge shadow appeared outside the Earth. He looked at the starry sky, sighed, and slowly disappeared.","In the Sea Dragon Star Area, more than half of the high-position officials of the enormous Heavenly Group were gone.","But Liu Qingfeng’s trump card began to show its power.","He monitored everything using his intelligent system.","He also had a portion of the high-position officials assist him. They were the most stable powers after the upheaval of the Sea Dragon Star Area.","It was a blessing in disguise.","The Heavenly Group released its power again and its influence expanded rapidly.","The changes in everything were over.","In the Heavenly Dragon Star Province, what they were facing was a reshuffle to start a new era.","As for Zhang Han, he was still sleeping.","The damage to his soul had impacted him greatly.","When the spatial turbulence started-","Swoosh!","Zi Yan felt that she had fallen into a world of light. “Is that the spatial tunnel?”","She had many things to say, but she couldn’t.","Zi Yan’s eyes turned red.","She felt greatly upset.","Swoosh!","The next second, she suddenly appeared on an island in the lake, standing by the cliff.","Great waves roared.","She felt a little cold, but she didn’t have her man who was very considerate enough to help put on her clothes around.","“Where am I?”","Zi Yan was at a loss.","She stood there in a daze for a long, long time.","The hesitation in her eyes gradually turned into determination.","“Even though we are hundreds of millions of miles away from each other, he will still come to find me.","“What I need to do...”","Zi Yan looked more and more indifferent, like an otherworldly fairy.","She looked down at the Space Ring on her finger.","With a flash in her eyes, a black robe appeared and covered her body. A bamboo hat slowly floated up to the top of her head and a light black gauze wrapped around the bamboo hat.","Both the robe and the hat were supreme defensive treasures.","She used them to cover her gorgeous face.","Zi Yan lightly murmured, “I can’t wait in one place.","“I need to get to know this world and find a way to go back.","“I need to fly.","“I need to...”","Zi Yan’s determination was stronger than ever.","Her desire for strength made the sign of Tiny Tot sleeping on her wrist lit up.","At the same time, rays of light burst out of her dantian and constantly hit her body.","Clatter!","This made her whole body shine and her strength rise steadily.","“Can I fly now?”","When the conditions were right, success would follow naturally. She could feel it. She lifted her right foot and stepped forward.","She successfully stepped on the void with one foot.","Step by step, she strolled through the void and slowly walked forward above the lake.","“GRWAAAAAH!”","An Exotic Beast in the water suddenly jumped up, opened its mouth, and came at Zi Yan.","But she didn’t move at all.","Light flashed across her eyes.","Buzz!","That big fish rolled its eyes and stopped breathing.","With a plop, it fell into the water.","It became the food of other Exotic Beasts.","Along the way, Zi Yan finally arrived on a continent.","She didn’t know what existed on this vast continent.","There were two suns, one big and one small.","Although she didn’t have a sense of direction, she found the right position and flew forward above the jungle at a low altitude.","“GRWAAAAAH!”","Terrifying fluctuations spread out from time to time.","“Should this kind of Exotic Beast be in the Shadow Refining Realm?”","Zi Yan had this feeling, but she was not sure.","She was a lot more cautious and took out several treasures to protect herself.","Under Zhang Han’s influence, she learned a lot.","However, in her subconscious, she felt that she did not panic in the face of such an environment. Instead, she found it a little familiar.","Finally, an Exotic Beast fixed its eyes on Zi Yan.","It was a Two-headed Green Wolf, which looked very scary.","“Ow! Ow! Ow!”","It growled in a low voice.","It was as if it were calling for its companions and telling them that there was a woman in their territory.","Moments later, one Two-headed Green Wolf after another gathered around.","“They can’t talk and are just ordinary Exotic Beasts.”","Zi Yan comforted herself.","She flew forward at a moderate speed.","But she knew that if she didn’t chase them away, it would be troublesome in the end.","Swoosh!","Zi Yan suddenly stopped and turned to look at the leading Green Wolf.","Light began to shine from her right hand.","The instant her right hand fell, expanses of light appeared out of thin air.","Bang!","With just one palm strike, she killed the leading Green Wolf.","She made five palm strikes.","For a time, the earth shook, rocks flew everywhere, and the wind whistled.","The huge pit stunned the rest of the Two-headed Green Wolves.","“Ow?”","“Ow? Ow? Ow?”","They looked at each other.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","They turned around and ran. Their speed was at least three times faster than when they arrived.","“They’re so weak.”","Zi Yan was slightly stunned.","“How strong are they?”","She didn’t understand.","These Two-headed Green Wolves, which were as powerful as Void-refining Realm Early-Stage beings, had all been pulverized by her alone.","It seemed that only she didn’t know how powerful and fierce she was.","She made breakthroughs at her will.","Zi Yan had no choice but to improve her strength. Her determination directly made her breakthrough in many realms.","“I need to find a city first and ask where this is.”","Zi Yan decided to fly in one direction.","In this way, she would definitely run into someone.","Just like that, Zi Yan began flying outward into the depths of the mountain range.","On the way, she encountered many birds and beasts.","They were all killed by her palm strikes, and she quickly adapted to this routine.","If one palm strike was not enough, she would make two, and if more was not enough, she would keep it going. Anyway, she could kill the other party sooner or later.","The strongest one she encountered was a giant black dragon. Its roar shook the place within three thousand miles, but it didn’t help.","The dragon was killed by Zi Yan’s 130 palm strikes.","From then on, the sounds in the jungle seemed to be much quieter.","Zi Yan did not encounter any other obstacles.","She didn’t know that the king of the Exotic Beasts’ jungle was dead.","All of its followers were terrified.","There were even some birds and beasts who kept telling their brothers about the news.","“Bad news, there is a female tyrant in our territory. She even beat Master Dragon to death...”","“Is Master Dragon’s inner pellet still there?”","“Yeah.”","“Hurry and snatch it!”","“...”","Until Zi Yan left the depths of the jungle, the turmoil there had just begun.","She had forgotten that Exotic Beasts’ inner pellets and flesh were actually quite precious.","She was not in the mood to consider these things now.","Her mind was full of thoughts about how to go back and how to make it easier for Zhang Han to find her.","Finally, in the outer region of the jungle, she sensed a group of people from a distance.","About a dozen people were fighting against a group of Exotic Beasts that Zi Yan didn’t know."]},{"number":1402,"title":"Chapter 1402 Submit or Die","paragraphs":["Chapter 1402 Submit or Die","“Ke Aodu, pay attention to the left flank.”","“What are you doing?”","“Ke Xiaomei, what are you doing? Focus! You still have three Barbaric Earth Beasts on your side. Attack them.”","“...”","There were only five middle-aged men in the group. The oldest was watching the ones in their teens or twenties battling ahead.","It could be seen that it was the five middle-aged men who led the youngsters of the family out to experience the outside world.","“Haha, our Ke Family’s younger generation is much more outstanding than before.”","Those middle-aged men watched the battles from aside while chatting.","“The best among them is Ke Aodu. He’s only 18, but he has reached the God Transformation Realm. When I was 18, I was only at Yuan Ying Realm Middle Stage.”","“It’s a sure thing that he’ll enter the Giant Axe Mountain. Even the ones from the Divine Wind Sect have come to contact him.”","“Those are all major sects. The patriarch hasn’t agreed on it yet. Let’s see which one of the sects can offer better benefits. When those youngsters enter the major sects, their lives will be different.”","“Hey, is there someone over there?”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The middle-aged men shared quick looks and began slaughtering the twenty or so Exotic Beasts in front of them.","Then, they all looked to the depths of the jungle.","Over there, a black figure was slowly walking over.","Judging from the slender figure, they knew that it was a woman. But with her face covered, no one could feel at ease.","The oldest middle-aged man said, “Guys, come to me.”","Everyone gathered around him and looked at the black-robed woman walking over.","When she was fifty meters away from them, the middle-aged man wanted to say something.","At this time, they heard a pleasant and light voice.","“What planet is this?”","“Hmm?”","The oldest middle-aged man in grey was stunned.","“She’s from another planet?”","“This is the Roman Star. What can I do for you?” said the man in grey as he cupped his hands respectfully.","“I have something to ask.”","Zi Yan waved her hand, and a hundred medium-grade crystals floated toward the other party.","“Ma’am, thank you for your courtesy, but we don’t need these. If you have any questions, feel free to ask us. However, it is best that you do not continue onward. Let us maintain a safe distance, okay?” the man in grey said.","At the same time, he displayed some power to send the crystal stones back.","However, he shockingly found that the energy he exerted couldn’t even make the crystal stones shake.","“So powerful!”","The man’s pupils constricted.","He watched the crystal stones float in front of him.","“Which Star Area does the Roman Star belong to?” Zi Yan asked.","“It belongs to the Osborne Star Area.”","“What kind of place does it belong to?”","“Ospine Star Province.”","“Which Astral Domain is it in?”","“The Ocean Astral Domain.”","Hiss","The man in grey clearly sensed Zi Yan holding her breath.","Even her voice trembled.","“Do, do you know about the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven?”","The grey-clothed man pondered for a moment before lightly shaking his head. “I’ve never heard of the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven. In fact, I’ve never even been to the Ocean Astral Domain. I apologize for my ignorance and lack of experience. If you have any more problems, you should go and ask the members of the major sects. They know more than I do.”","“Thank you.”","Zi Yan was silent for a while and then sighed. “Where is the nearest city?”","“The Bright Leaf City. Take the east, and it’s 600 kilometers away,” the man in grey replied.","After hearing this, Zi Yan was about to leave. But after taking a few steps, she stopped and said, “I don’t know if you can lead the way for me. I’ll pay you. I don’t know much about this place. You can introduce it to me.”","For some reason, upon hearing her pleasant and light voice, Ke Aodu, the young talent of the Ke Family, said unexpectedly, “Okay!”","Clatter!","The face of the man in grey changed slightly, and he glared at him severely.","“Young man, you’re too fearless!","“But you’re using your courage at the wrong moment.","“How dare you take her around without knowing her background?”","“Don’t mess around! I’m telling you guys, you’re going to be trained here for a week and you’re not going anywhere!”","Swoosh!","A hundred top-grade crystals flew over and interrupted the man in grey.","Gurgle!","There were gulping sounds all around.","“Well, I’m going back on my word.”","The man’s gaze struggled.","Zi Yan said lightly, “Since some of you have agreed, you should no longer refuse.”","It seemed to be a warning, which made the man in grey nod. “Okay.”","The matter was settled by going with the flow.","He took a hundred top-grade crystal stones and a hundred middle-grade crystal stones.","He commanded the team to stay five meters away from Zi Yan while heading out.","“Ma’am, may I ask if you’re not from this world?” The grey-clothed man said.","“My name is Ke Aodu. I said yes to your request just now.” Ke Aodu chuckled, “From your voice, I can tell that you are not a bad person.”","He seemed to be a playboy young master.","But it would definitely not work on Zi Yan.","“I’m not sure about that.” Zi Yan responded and then added, “I’m not from here.”","“Well, if you have any questions, I will answer them all the way. My name is Ke Zhan,” the middle-aged man said.","“Alright.”","“We came by a force vehicle.”","When they reached the edge of the jungle, Zi Yan saw a sightseeing car like a UFO levitating there.","“Ma’am, please get in the car.”","Everyone took their seats.","Many members of the Ke Family looked at Zi Yan curiously.","“Where does this mysterious lady come from?”","“Which sect is the most powerful here?” Zi Yan asked.","“The Giant Axe Mountain, the Divine Wind Sect, and the Flowing Light Sect are the most formidable. There are many sects on our planet and many of them are very powerful,” Ke Zhan answered.","“What realm is the leader of the Giant Axe Mountain in?” Zi Yan asked calmly.","“He’s in the Peak-Stage Void-refining Realm.”","Ke Zhan said, “Whether it’s the Sect Leader or the others, generally, when they reach the Void-refining Realm, they will leave for the Astral Domain after serving as Sect Leader for a hundred years. Therefore, most of the Sect Leaders of the three sects are at the Peak Stage of the Void-refining Realm, and the rest are at the Last or Middle Stage. There isn’t an Integration Realm cultivator on our planet.”","Zi Yan got to know it and felt that it was not difficult to reach the Peak-Stage Shadow Refining.","She thought for a moment and said, “What should I do if I want to establish a huge sect or rule this world?”","She thought that since the locals knew a lot about this place, they could answer her question.","Ke Zhan was dumbfounded. “What? Rule this world? That’s impossible!”","“Second Uncle, why would that be impossible? She can achieve it after defeating those people.” Ke Aodu got excited.","He didn’t expect this lady with a pleasant voice to be so ambitious.","“Well...” Ke Zhan’s expression changed slightly.","He felt that his reaction just now might have offended the other party.","Fortunately, she didn’t seem to mind it.","Swoosh!","A hundred pieces of top-grade crystal stones appeared.","Ke Zhan was dumbfounded once more.","“A heroic lady that offers top-grade crystal stones at any time.","“Wow, I like that so much!”","But he still felt greatly pressured.","“I need some locals to lead the way for me. Are you willing to do it?” Zi Yan asked.","“Well...” Ke Zhan hesitated for a moment. “I need to report this to my family.”","“Second Uncle, I’ll tell her about it.” Ke Aodu said, “Ma’am, if you want to dominate the world, then you definitely can’t strike the great sects. Even if you defeat those Sect Leaders, others won’t listen to you. The best place you should go is Sin City. Many great characters there cannot leave that place, and it is also the easiest place to gather forces.”","“Sin City!” Ke Zhan frowned slightly and said, “If you do want to dominate the world, that place can be a starting point, but I think it’s too difficult. Even if you manage to set up a big sect, it will take many years to develop it.”","“How powerful is your Ke Family?” Zi Yan asked.","“I’m not bragging, and let me tell you this.” said the other middle-aged man, his voice loud and clear. “Our Ke Family is a third-tier power. According to my investigation, our disciples are spread throughout 52 sects. When it comes to this, our family is ranked first and that’s well-known.”","“So, your family members know a lot about many sects.” Zi Yan thought for a moment and said, “If you guys work for me, I will take you to the Astral Domain and give you many spirit treasures and crystal stones for your development.”","“I can’t make the decision,” Ke Zhan said in fear.","But he felt that this rich lady in front of him might bring his family new chances. It might not be a bad thing to try.","“If you can conquer Sin City within a month, our family will assist you with all our might. I wonder if you can accept this condition.”","“Yeah.”","“And may I know your Taoist title?”","“Zi Yue.”","“Okay, I’ll keep it in mind. When we arrive in the city, I will prepare a map for you, as well as nice force vehicles...”","They had made a deal with each other.","The Ke Family members watched Zi Yan leave.","Someone asked Ke Zhan, “Patriarch, why did you agree to her proposal?”","Ke Aodu said. “Undoubtedly, if Heroine Purple Moon can do it, she must be an extremely powerful person. After all, she’s going to Sin City.”","“I don’t think she can do it,” Ke Zhan said slowly. “If she can achieve it, there’s nothing wrong with assisting her. If she can’t, we’ll see how things go in the future. She’s an expert, and it’s my goal to make friends with experts. Never say never, so I gave her such an answer.”","“It’ll be impossible for her to dominate Sin City within a month.”","Unexpectedly, in just ten days, the black cloud-like force vehicles slowly flew over.","The leader was Zi Yan in a black robe.","She went to Sin City where the forces were complicated.","The first thing she did was sneak into the City Lord’s mansion in the middle of the night.","Standing behind the City Lord, she lightly asked, “Submit, or die.”","Moments later, the City Lord surrendered.","Five days later.","“Submit, or die!”","It was unknown how many experts in the City Lord’s mansion were either threatened, intimidated, or killed.","Several bloody nights passed.","For the first time in history, Sin City was united by a queen. Her Daoist title was Zi Yue, and she was called the Moon Queen.","Even though those people submitted, it was not yielding because they now had a chance to enter the Astral Domain.","In this world, only the major sects controlled the fleet.","The technology here was not advanced.","There were originally eight magnates in Sin City. Taking the City Lord into account, there were nine of them in total.","Now there were only three people left. The other six people all protested and were directly killed by Zi Yan.","In fact, Zi Yan was not used to it.","She couldn’t help thinking, “I must be decisive and cold-blooded because my guardian is not around.”"]},{"number":1403,"title":"Chapter 1403 What a Lousy Stone","paragraphs":["Chapter 1403 What a Lousy Stone","She didn’t have Zhang Han by her side. As a lady, she could only use ruthless means to get the result she needed as soon as possible.","Of course, the effects were instantaneous. Sin City was completely conquered.","Zi Yan was too powerful for Sin City to resist.","Moreover, she had a lot of crystal stones, spirit treasures, and spiritual herbs.","She didn’t give too many of them out, but she also showed them to her core subordinates to stabilize their morale.","There was a new force named Mount New Moon in Sin City.","The Ke Family saw it this day.","When Ke Zhan saw the huge team, he was dumbfounded.","“Did she make it for real?”","At this time, the giant city was heavily guarded where there were second-rate sects.","Zi Yan came over and got straight to the point.","“This city is now mine. We’ll enter it three hours later. Kill whoever tries to resist.”","Her calm words were filled with decisiveness.","The hundreds of thousands of people behind her cheered and screamed.","They wanted to go in and plunder.","The sects in the giant city gathered a large number of people, up to three hundred thousand.","However, there was a large clan that did not participate in it, and that was the Ke Family.","They watched silently from the side, wondering if they were going to join in.","There was also a leader amongst the several hundred generals.","An armored elder shouted, “Who are you?”","“Why would you ask when you already know the answer?” the City Lord mocked.","“City Lord Lu, you even dare to send troops instead of guarding your city. Are you not afraid of having everyone turn their backs on you?” the elder coldly said.","“Sin City has become a thing of the past. From now on, a new force that we belong to is called Mount New Moon. Her name is Zi Yue, and she is our Mountain Queen!” City Lord Lu said in a loud voice, “From now on, Mount New Moon will compete for hegemony in the world. Anyone who refuses to accept it will be killed, and whoever disobeys will be killed. Also...”","His words were hostile and very arrogant.","This might not be a decent sect, but it was definitely a force that was developing rapidly.","“What did you say?”","The old man was furious. He pulled out his saber and pointed it forward.","Right at this moment, Zi Yan waved her hand casually.","Clatter!","A gust of powerful wind blew past, which was caused by Sea Moon Fan’s power that had been diluted several times.","Over ten thousand people were knocked flying by the powerful energy. As for the leading old man, he was also sent flying ten miles away and smashed into the mountain.","The whole field fell into dead silence.","“Enter the city!”","Zi Yan’s crisp voice resounded between heaven and earth.","The giant city was invaded and occupied.","But Zi Yan and her men didn’t plunder and carry out killings like the way people did in Sin City before.","Instead, they would occupy the territories of different powers and take away their cultivation resources.","Some of them set fires as well as killed and robbed some people. Zi Yan personally took the City Lord and the other core subordinates to patrol. 1,200 people were killed.","“What...”","Ke Zhan was convinced.","He let out a long sigh and felt as if he had been tricked into something.","“I’m worried about the fate of our Ke Family.”","But soon, it became a slap in the face.","Zi Yan directly divided the cultivation resources her subordinates had robbed.","The Ke Family had also received a sum of money for joining the force.","Ke Zhan was all smiling: “Since we’re going to rule the world, let’s start with a small sect first and I think the Setting Sun Sect will do it. It’s close, and it has many people. The Sect Leader and other high-position officials are not so powerful.”","A day later, thousands of members of the Setting Sun Sect died. The sect surrendered.","After Mount New Moon on this planet was established, its influence, under Zi Yan’s leadership, was like an initial hurricane, getting stronger and stronger.","Two months later, the empire of Mount New Moon dominated the Roman Star. Under the suggestion of hundreds of commanders, the Moon Queen was now called the Moon Empress.","The powerful Moon Empress was a woman of decisiveness and efficiency. She always wore a black robe, and her voice was pleasant to the ear. However, no one had ever seen her face.","She had become a legend on the Roman Star.","On this day, thousands of flying ships were gathered into a massive fleet, led by the Moon Empress. They flew toward Ospine Star Province. They needed to pass through that area and head toward the Ocean Astral Domain.","...","On Vast Heaven Star, the new entrance examination had begun.","The Crimson Sunglow Sect’s assessment transfer station was located on an island on the planet.","“What are you doing?!","“I’m not taking the exam!","“I’m not from here.”","Mengmeng appeared in the jungle, feeling a little sad. She looked up at the sky with tears in her eyes.","A few minutes later, two men in cyan came from the side. When they saw Mengmeng, who had delicate facial features, their eyes lit up and they came over to inquire.","“You must be kidding.” The long-faced man said, “Those who have come here are only to take the Crimson Sunglow Sect’s examination. You said that you’re not taking the exam. In that case, why would you be here?”","“It’s none of your business.” Mengmeng glared at him.","“Huh.” Another man’s eyes widened. After he came to his senses, an evil light flashed in his eyes, and he said something to the person beside him using Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","“All right then,” the long-faced man said. “Since you said you are not taking the exam, please come with me. After the verification, someone will take you to leave.”","Without hesitation, they took Mengmeng across the jungle and came to a group of buildings. They entered a house on the edge and set up a soundproof layer while entering.","Mengmeng watched coldly aside.","“Little girl.”","The fat man smiled evilly and approached her step by step. He thought he would see the little pretty girl’s panicked expression, and he liked seeing his target struggling.","At that moment, two clusters of white flames flashed in Mengmeng’s eyes.","It could be seen from the outside that the house suddenly lit up, and then the light dissipated.","Moments later, a figure walked out, who wore an azure robe and a hat and looked like a scholar.","It was Mengmeng disguised as a man. She was unhappy. Pouting, she squatted down, rubbed the dust on the ground with her hands, and rubbed it on her cheeks.","“I can’t attract too much attention.","“Since I’m not with my family, I must protect myself.","“Mummy, Daddy, I’m sure that you will come to pick me up as soon as possible.","“I’m waiting for you. Hurry up, or I’ll become a tyrant here in this place.”","Mengmeng adjusted herself to the new environment while repeating the same words.","“This is just a game. It is just a temporary separation.”","Walking on the street, Mengmeng calmed down a lot.","As she went deeper into that place, the little princess thought about a lot of things.","“Crimson Sunglow Sect?","“Which Crimson Sunglow Sect? The Crimson Sunglow Sect on the largest Vast Heaven Star in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven is one of the Four Great Sects of the Astral Domain. I wonder if it’s it.","“If so, I will have a clear route to return to the Heavenly Dragon Star Province.","“I’ll go back when the time is right. I’m not powerful enough, so I can’t just go anywhere I want. Things will be troublesome if I miss the chance to bump into Daddy.”","She walked to a square and finally saw dozens of people, who were all in their twenties.","“Hello. What’s your name?”","A lady smiled and said, “What a handsome young man.”","Mengmeng was stunned for a moment, and then she reacted. She ran her spiritual force to her throat and changed her voice, saying, “Nice to meet you, Older Martial Sister. I feel dizzy from my sleep. Where are we now?”","“We have come to the Vast Heaven Star by yesterday.” One of the young men laughed. “Try not to be too nervous. Just relax, and you’ll have a higher chance of passing the examination. Moreover, you came two hours earlier. The assessment won’t start after a while.”","Hearing these words, Mengmeng understood the situation.","This was the Vast Heaven Star.","The place where she was located was the location of the Crimson Sunglow Sect’s assessment.","“I see. Thank you for your guidance. I’ll sit over there and rest for a while.” Mengmeng pointed to the chair not far away.","“Go take a rest,” the Martial Sister replied.","Mengmeng went aside and sat down.","She thought about the situation of the Vast Heaven Star.","The Astral Domain of Vast Heaven was the center of powers of the entire Astral Domain. More than eighty percent of its powers were subsidiary powers to the Four Great Sects.","Those sects were located on the enormous Vast Heaven Star.","The Crimson Sunglow Sect was extremely proficient in illusions and other magical techniques. The Ling Sea Sword Sect was the number one sect in the Astral Domain.","The Authentic Martial Arts Sect was the top sect of Body Cultivation. The Heavenly Evil Sect specialized in fighting occult arts. It was said that many of its disciples were good at fighting and cold-blooded.","Those were all major sects. Mengmeng did not expect to arrive here in the blink of an eye.","“This place is great. Daddy will definitely find me easily here.","“I’ll just need to suffer for a while.”","More than an hour later, many candidates in their teens arrived one after another.","“All of you have experienced the preliminary test. The following test will be divided into three rounds, namely, the talent stone, the comprehension stone, and combat capabilities.","“The scores for the three rounds will decide the overall result, so don’t worry if you don’t perform well in a particular round. It should be noted that averagely speaking, 60 percent of the people who have made it here passed the test.”","It was only 60 percent, and four out of ten people would be eliminated on average, yet the host still emphasized it.","Many contestants were nervous and excited.","Mengmeng was the calmest here.","It didn’t matter to her whether she joined the sect or not.","“Now goes the talent stone assessment.","“The talent stone will show either red, orange, yellow, green, indigo, blue, or purple. Of the seven colors, red is the lowest and the passing line while purple is the best. If the stone doesn’t show any colors, it means that you have failed the talent stone assessment.","“The examination begins now.”","A protector from the sect had personally come to supervise the entire test.","One contestant after another went on stage.","Someone’s result was red, someone’s was colorless. The best one had the talent stone blue.","When that person’s result was presented, even the protector on the high platform opened his eyes, looked over, and nodded slightly with an expression of approval.","Soon, it was Mengmeng’s turn.","“What’s your name?”","“Zhang, Zhang Hanyang,” Mengmeng muttered.","“Zhang Hanyang. Got it. You may begin now.” The supervisor in charge of the talent stone nodded and began to record.","“Phew...”","Mengmeng took a light breath and thought to herself, “I can’t use too much strength. I’ll just run half of my power and casually make a middle-level color. Yeah. I’ll just run half of my power.”","Placing both hands on the stone, she slowly poured in half her energy.","Swoosh!","It turned red, orange, yellow, yellow, green, indigo, blue, and then purple.","The color of the stone, which was three meters high, kept changing and finally became deep purple.","Mengmeng was dumbfounded.","“What kind of lousy stone is this?”","The little girl’s face was full of confusion.","However, in the eyes of others, she looked dumbstruck just because she was too happy.","“Hey? What’s your name?” The Protector above looked at Mengmeng carefully.","“Zhang... Hanyang,” Mengmeng said.","“Good, very good.” The protector nodded with a kind smile.","“Little brother, congratulations.” Quite a few senior trainees around Mengmeng congratulated her. “Obtaining the best color means that you’re approved by the talent stone. You’re very talented, and you have boundless prospects.”"]},{"number":1404,"title":"Chapter 1404 Mengmeng Plans to Muddle Along","paragraphs":["Chapter 1404 Mengmeng Plans to Muddle Along","“I see. Alright. Thank you.”","Mengmeng responded perfunctorily and ran to the line where the people stayed after finishing the examination.","All eyes were on her.","Mengmeng was used to it, but now she felt a little guilty.","“I can’t have others recognize me while dressing up as a dude. I’ve used Daddy’s treasures, which should be okay.","“I’m a talented young man now. So it won’t matter if I try to act like a weirdo and an introvert. I’ll just need to calm down.”","Mengmeng raised her head, put her hands behind her back, and looked at the crowd calmly.","“What an expert!”","“He’s so powerful.”","“In the face of such a proud result, he remains calm and collected. This man will definitely achieve great things. I must build a good relationship with him.”","“...”","When they saw Mengmeng’s posture, many of them admired her. “He’s neither arrogant nor impetuous, and he’s completely calm and composed. That’s truly amazing.”","“Now begins the second assessment, the comprehension stone.”","This time, when it was Mengmeng’s turn, tens of thousands of people were focused on her. Among them, only three could make the stone turn purple.","In fact, those who could achieve that had already been admitted.","However, no one knew about that yet.","The comprehension stone was similar to the talent stone. One’s result would also be decided by the colors of red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo, and purple.","The two people who had reached the purple level had nice comprehension abilities. One’s result was blue, while the other’s was indigo.","On the contrary, two candidates who didn’t have much talent had stunning comprehension abilities. Both of their results were purple.","When it was Mengmeng’s turn, she looked at the comprehension stone ahead.","She silently prayed in her heart. “I’ll run one-third of my cultivation power. I can’t make any mistakes or I’ll become famous before entering the sect.”","Mengmeng pressed her palm on the stone and ran less than a third of her power.","Clatter!","The stone turned from red straight to purple without turning into other colors during the process.","Mengmeng’s super comprehension ability had even shocked Zhang Han before. It could be imagined what level she had reached.","“What?!”","“What’s going on? The comprehension stone is not working?”","“It didn’t turn into any other colors. It turned purple from red directly. Is he an insider? Did he pull strings?”","Many people were bewildered and stunned.","Even the protector above couldn’t remain calm any longer. With a flash, he came down and looked at Mengmeng excitedly.","He said, “Zhang Hanyang, are you willing to be my disciple?”","“What?”","Mengmeng was stunned and dumbfounded.","“What a lousy stone!","“I used less than one-third of my power and I passed?","“Alas, this is not what I expected.”","If anyone knew what she was thinking, they would probably burst into tears.","“It’s hard for us to pass the test even if we work ourselves desperately, but you managed to pass it and even show disdain to the comprehension stone.”","At the same time, Mengmeng was not used to being called Zhang Hanyang.","But she had to get used to it.","After thinking for two seconds, Mengmeng said hesitantly, “I...don’t know how to refuse you.”","“Well, as for this matter... Hmm? What did you say?” The protector first nodded then was in a daze.","“Did he just give me a refusal?”","“I said, I don’t know how to refuse you. Will I get any benefits if I become your disciple?” Mengmeng asked.","The protector was speechless and didn’t know what to say.","“Nonsense!”","A supervisor, said, “This is Protector Ma of our sect. He is very powerful and you’re lucky that he is willing to accept you as his disciple, but you even dare to refuse?”","“Eh? Don’t push it. He’s right.” Protector Ma waved his hand and said, “Zhang Hanyang, you can think about it first. There’s no hurry. Just tell me about your decision when you adapt to living in the sect.”","“Oh my god!”","The crowd gasped.","These words showed that it was a sure thing that the young man was about to enter the sect and become a protector’s disciple.","What kind of status would he have?","It should be noted that the protectors of the Crimson Sunglow Sect had high prestige and were able to chat and laugh with magnates of any region.","“Listen up. There can’t be any problems with the stones, so there’s nothing wrong with Zhang Hanyang’s scores. Let’s put an end to this matter. The assessment continues.”","After saying that, Protector Ma returned to his seat.","As for the others, they also continued to take part in the assessment, but more people were looking at Mengmeng.","It was time for the third round.","“In the combat abilities assessment, you will attack some inner-door disciples. You’ll attack, and they’ll defend. Present your strongest combat abilities.”","Mengmeng wasn’t worried to deal with this round.","After all, she could control her combat strength more casually. Furthermore, those Older Martial Sisters and Brothers were also very powerful.","All of the participants that came on stage were at least in Yuan Ying Realm. Some were in the Elixir Realm.","The four sects did not focus on one’s strength and realm but on talent and aptitude.","Mengmeng thought to herself.","“I’ll just use the combat capability of the Elixir Realm Last Stage.”","Mengmeng pretended to run her power hard to launch an attack.","Opposite her was a male disciple.","When faced with this attack, he easily neutralized it without moving at all.","“Zhang Hanyang, your combat strength isn’t high. It must be that you have just started cultivating. After you enter the sect, you’ll improve through hard cultivation.”","“Huh? I’ve been cultivating for a long time,” Mengmeng immediately said.","“There’s no need to be modest. How old are you? It’s normal for young people to be arrogant. What you mean by a long time is nothing more than one or two years, which is just a moment for cultivation.” The man was determined.","Judging from his expression, it seemed that no matter how the other party tried to explain, he could not hide the fact that he was a super genius.","“Alas!”","Mengmeng felt helpless.","She wanted to keep a low profile, but unexpectedly, it didn’t turn out well.","“This year’s contestants from the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven are just so-so. I haven’t exerted my full strength yet, but they are all so weak.”","Mengmeng didn’t think too much about it. She felt that something was wrong, but she didn’t think about how talented she was.","“The exam is over.","“Here is the promotion list. Those who have failed to advance can try again in the next assessment five years later.”","The protector waved his hand.","He glanced at more than a dozen outstanding disciples of this competition and finally fixed his eyes on Mengmeng. He took a deep look at her, made a gesture, and turned to leave.","Although there was no ranking, Mengmeng’s combat capability belonged to the lower-middle class.","But Zhang Hanyang’s name was still ranked first.","In actuality, the first two rounds were the most important.","Soon, those who had failed left with great disappointment.","Those who advanced were beaming with excitement. They were all smiles and delighted.","“From now on you’ll be the outer disciples of the Crimson Sunglow Sect,” said a supervisor. “I’ll take you to the sect. There’re 136 assessment points in total and about 500,000 disciples that have advanced. But only 100,000 of you will get to become inner-door disciples. Therefore, don’t think that you get to be lying flat just because you have passed the assessment just now. Now go to the outer gate with me.”","The group flew majestically at a low altitude, crossing mountains and rivers.","Three hours later, many teams could be seen gathering in the distance. There was a huge building complex in front of them, which was the location of the outer gate.","After they came to various areas and were settled down, Mengmeng blinked and looked around.","“Why haven’t I and the people around me been arranged?”","Unexpectedly...","“Guys, follow me,” the supervisor said with a smile.","“Where are we going?” a chubby boy asked.","“You are talented, so you are directly promoted as the inner-door disciples. You’ll choose different peaks for cultivation. Congratulations.”","“Wow!”","“We’ve become inner-door disciples!”","“...”","Many people were extremely excited, and most of them were in their teens.","Of course, some of them were relatively steady.","Mengmeng was among these people.","Because fundamentally speaking, she didn’t care about this place.","“Anyway, I’ll leave when Daddy gets here.”","There were very few people who flew into the inner gate. When gathered together, there were only about a hundred people.","They arrived at a hall.","Many of the people inside were in their twenties or thirties and came from different peaks.","“The ones in front of you are disciples from the various peaks. They’re here to receive you.”","The leading protector waved his hand and a picture appeared out of thin air.","“Here are the explanations for the subjects that every Peak Master majors in. You can make your decisions. Your Older Martial Brothers and Sisters will bring you to their peaks to familiarize yourselves with the environment.”","At first glance, almost all types were involved including soul techniques, occult arts, battle techniques, curses, body movements, Body Cultivation Methods, formations, pellet refining, beast taming, and illusions.","It was very detailed. Some Peak Masters majored in several types, but some of them only focused on one kind. Those newcomers did need to think about what they wanted to choose for a while.","“What should I choose?”","Mengmeng was a little stunned and didn’t know what to choose. But soon, her eyes fixed on a certain place.","“Orchid Peak majors in pellet refining, soul techniques, and illusions. This will do. Now I’m going to spend my days here. Anyway, I’ve learned something about pellet refining.”","Mengmeng didn’t know what level her pellet refining was at. She thought that according to her father’s standards, by which he could condense a pellet in the void, she had only learned superficial stuff about pellet refining.","“Then I’ll muddle along here for a while.”"]},{"number":1405,"title":"Chapter 1405 Dahei Emerges","paragraphs":["Chapter 1405 Dahei Emerges","“I’ll pick Orchid Peak.”","Mengmeng coughed softly and acted like a little boy, walking to an Older Martial Sister of Orchid Peak.","A total of six people chose Orchid Peak.","When they gathered up, the Older Martial Sister stared at Mengmeng and suddenly smiled. She directly stretched out to stroke Mengmeng’s face.","“Oh, what a handsome young man. Come with me, guys.”","After that, she stopped.","Mengmeng was stunned.","After a while, she snorted in her heart, “If I hadn’t reacted quickly, my treasure would have attacked you.”","Mengmeng always had a lot of automatic defensive treasures.","“Orchid Peak has one main peak, eighteen lower peaks, and sixty-eight outer peaks.” The Older Martial Sister said, “As the excellent disciples of this year’s assessment, you can choose to cultivate in the main peak or the lower peaks. If you choose the main peak, you can only stay in the dormitory. If you go to the lower peaks, you can have your own cultivation mansion.”","“Older Martial Sister, is there any difference between the main peak and the lower peaks?” someone asked.","“It takes about an hour to go to the main peak from the lower peaks, which would be quite inconvenient. Also, to prevent the place from being overcrowded, in the main peak, there are some activities that the people in the lower peak are not allowed to participate in. In addition, tools like furnaces you need for pellet refining and spiritual herbs in the main peak are relatively high-ranked, and the ones in the lower peaks are at one level lower, but they are still better than those in the outer peaks. In general, there are more amenities in the main peak, so, the core disciples would rather live together to stay there.”","Mengmeng realized what the Older Martial Sister’s words meant.","“That’s just like the difference between a first-rate city and a small city.","“The difference isn’t great anyway. I’ve got to live in a detached villa.”","“I want to live in the main peak.”","“Me too.”","Among a total of six people, five chose the main peak.","They thought that all of them would choose that place.","However, Mengmeng raised her hand and said, “I’ll choose an outer peak.”","“Hmm?”","Immediately, she caught everyone’s attention.","When the Older Martial Sister saw that it was Mengmeng, she said in surprise, “Zhang Hanyang, you, you should reconsider it. The main peak has more resources than the outer peaks.”","“It doesn’t matter.” Mengmeng said indifferently, “I like peace and quiet. Since I’ve chosen an outer peak, I should get a villa.”","“Fine. It’s up to you.” The Older Martial Sister nodded.","On the way to the main peak, the protector, who had thought highly of Mengmeng, communicated with the person in charge this time.","“There’s no information about Zhang Hanyang. His background is unknown.” The one in charge said, “The two missing inner-door disciples were at the place where Zhang Hanyang took the assessment. I wonder if he’s sent by other sects.”","“If that’s the case, why would he be so high-profile?” The protector frowned and said, “We can’t act rashly and we’ll just observe for a while.”","“Yes, sir.”","Seeing this, the person in charge did not dare to say that he doubted if Zhang Hanyang had something to do with the disappearance of the two inner-door disciples.","He thought that the protector wanted to keep the talented young man.","He didn’t intend to ask more. Instead, he recorded Zhang Hanyang’s name in the system and wrote down his identity at random.","No matter where he came from, they could just focus on observing.","“Where does he come from?”","The protector looked up at the sky.","“It doesn’t matter where he comes from as long as he could pass the test. Even if he’s a spy of the other sects, I’m afraid that they will likely be subverted. Hahaha.”","He seemed optimistic about it.","Mengmeng came to the main peak.","After going through a series of procedures, she met a problem.","She was required to have her identity information examined and verified.","Mengmeng was a little confused. “I just showed up here. Why would I have any identity information?”","The result was really strange.","“Hey, you’re the junior of the Zhang Clan from the Ourodic Planet. Not bad. Good luck with your cultivation.”","Mengmeng was dumbfounded.","She had no idea what was going on.","Just like that, she inexplicably became an elite disciple.","At the same time.","In the Crimson Sunglow Sect on the Command Beast Peak.","A leading supervisor said to the bald guy opposite him with a smile, “Junior Brother Xiong, a new batch of Exotic Beasts has arrived, and they’re all very nice. Take a look and choose whichever you fancy.”","The bald guy, who was addressed as Junior Brother Xiong, started laughing. He stealthily handed the leading supervisor a Space Ring and said, “Thank you, Senior Brother Mu.”","“You’re welcome. Hurry up and choose. We will drive them into the store soon.” Senior Brother Mu nodded.","Junior Brother Xiong rolled his shifty eyes and kept looking at the more than 100 Exotic Beasts.","“There are so many of them that they make me feel dizzy. Could you give me your recommendations?” said Junior Brother Xiong.","“No problem. That demonic tiger is quite good. There’s also a wild beast with pointy horns. However, it’s harder to tame them and will take a longer time. Oh, right. There’s a gorilla, but I forgot when I caught it. It is more spiritual. I think it’s nice as well,” Senior Brother Mu said.","He also glanced at the gorilla two meters high among the Exotic Beasts.","“This one is always asking for food, and it has a huge appetite. But that would be no problem at all for Junior Brother Xiong, as he has a rich family and can afford to raise such a beast.”","“How powerful are these Exotic Beasts?” asked Junior Brother Xiong.","“Not bad. Most of them are at the Yuan Ying Realm Peak Stage, and some of them are at the God Transformation Realm Early Stage. The strength of the demonic tiger and the wild beast with pointed horns is of that level. But once, the gorilla snatched away the food of the demonic tiger. They fought for a while, and they were well-matched. Even if the gorilla is not as powerful as the demonic tiger, its strength is almost equal to the latter. It should be between the Yuan Ying Realm Peak Stage and the God Transformation Realm Early Stage. The Exotic Beasts of this level are easy to tame. With your temper, you should choose the demonic tiger. After all, you have a temper, and you’ll eat it after taming it for some days.”","“Alas, if I fail by the end of taming, and I can’t perform the beast-taming seal, why should I keep it? I’ll just eat it instead.” Junior Brother Xiong chuckled and said, “I’ve eaten enough tiger meat. I’ll choose that gorilla.”","“Ow?”","The two-meter-tall gorilla rolled its eyes and cursed secretly.","“What the hell? Does this guy want to eat me?”","Yes, it was Dahei.","Dahei pretended to be a novice who had never seen the world. It shook its head. Driven by someone, it was put on with a collar and was taken away by Junior Brother Xiong.","“Damn it!”","Dahei was mad.","“I’m now taken away by someone?”","It didn’t want to yield.","“However, this is not Mount New Moon, and my host is not around. I need to hold back.”","Dahei gasped a few times.","Smack!","A long whip appeared in Junior Brother Xiong’s hand, which he used to slap Dahei. “Why are you gasping? Quiet down.”","“Ow?”","Dahei almost cursed.","“Hold back. Hold back.”","It widened its round eyes wide and tried to restrain itself.","It was forcibly led to a courtyard.","“My name is Xiong Fengran. From now on, I’ll be your host. If you are smart enough and listen to my orders, you’ll get a lot less beating. Do you understand?”","Xiong Fengran waved the long whip in his hand.","“Ow! Ow! Ow!”","Dahei nodded repeatedly.","It had no choice but to lower its head when it was in someone else’s place.","It was the first time that Dahei had learned to endure. It also knew that it was taking advantage of its master’s power. “Without my host around, if I die, my efforts will be in vain.”","“Haha, you are quite smart.”","Xiong Fengran lightly smiled and casually whipped Dahei. He didn’t whip it hard, but it carried a sense of warning.","“Be obedient, and you’ll get proper benefits. My dad is the Peak Host here.”","“Ow! Ow! Ow!”","Dahei patted its chest.","“That’s enough. I need to go on a date now. Let me see which Younger Martial Sister I’ll date today. It’s Jiang Ruohua.”","Xiong Fengran walked out while holding the communication device.","The first day passed. At noon the next day, he came back leisurely and was holding a petite Younger Martial Sister.","“This is a new Exotic Beast that I’ve just got. It’s very smart.”","“Hahaha, what is its name, Brother Xiong?” the girl coquettishly asked.","“I haven’t thought about it yet. What should I call it? How about I’ll name it Ziqing?”","“Senior Brother Xiong, you are so naughty. Hahaha, I like it.”","“Forget it, I’ll call it Big Fool.”","The two sat in the yard.","“Big Fool, go get me a glass of water.”","“Ow! Ow! Ow!”","“Okay. I got it.”","Dahei was untied from the rope around its neck. Patting its chest, it entered the house and turned its back to them.","When it was getting a glass of water-","“Ahem. Bah!”","Dahei spat its saliva secretly into the glass and sent it over happily.","“Go there and roll a bit.","“Spin in circles.","“Okay, that’s enough. Sit down and eat.”","Xiong Fengran threw a large piece of raw meat over, held Junior Sister Ziqing in his arms, and entered the room. After a while, there rang a rhythmic sound.","“He gave me only raw meat?”","Dahei grinned.","In this way, Dahei stayed here for more than ten days and occasionally went out with Xiong Fengran, getting familiar with the environment and this man.","It was sometimes whipped.","On this day.","“Big Fool, if you resist this beast-taming seal, I’ll braise you.” Xiong Fengran said in a cold voice, “I’ve eaten at least 80 to 100 Exotic Beasts before.”","“Beast-taming seal!”","When Xiong Fengran displayed the seal-","Crack!","A cracking sound rang out. It seemed that the collar had been shattered.","A figure slowly rose, which made Xiong Fengran dumbfounded.","Rumble!","After the punch, Xiong Fengran died.","Dahei seemed to be a little unsatisfied.","It threw another dozen punches until nothing of Xiong Fengran was left.","However, a huge crater was left on the ground.","Dahei changed its figure.","A playboy in a green shirt, Xiong Fengran, appeared again.","“Damn, how dare you show off in front of me? I could only kill you.","“Bah!”","Dahei, who transformed into Xiong Fengran, quickly made some firewood, put it into the pit, and lit it up. It skillfully set up a grill, inserted the raw meat, and began to roast it.","Two minutes later, five patrol teams arrived.","“Childe Xiong, what happened here?”","A man pointed to the cracked floor.","“The new Exotic Beast was disobedient and I ate it. Get someone to repair this place. When I’m full, I’ll go to teach Younger Martial Sister how to practice,” said ‘Xiong Fengran’ lightly and even a bit arrogantly.","“Okay.”","The members of the patrol teams nodded. They made the arrangement and turned to leave.","“He’s going to practice?”","“Hahaha. I wonder how many Younger Martial Sisters have been ruined by him.”","“Well, he can do whatever he wants since his dad is the Peak Host.”","“...”","“I need to make a trip to the Crimson Sunglow Sect. Perhaps I might be able to see my host and the rest.”","Dahei waited for a moment, ate some barbecue, and then went out leisurely.","It came to the foot of the mountain.","A tall woman quickly approached and said coquettishly, “Senior Brother Xiong, you promised to call me to practice last night. You stood me up.”","Bang!","As the beautiful woman got close, she saw a fist slowly approaching her face.","She was knocked unconscious in an instant and flew backward.","“What?”","Dahei smacked its lips and walked down the mountain."]},{"number":1406,"title":"Chapter 1406 Just Like Good Buddies","paragraphs":["Chapter 1406 Just Like Good Buddies","Bang!","Dahei blew on the fist.","“Alas, it’s the seventh one.”","Dahei felt a little ashamed after sending seven women flying with its fist.","It was not easy for Dahei to leave the territory of Command Beast Peak.","It wandered to other peaks.","Dahei visited a peak every three days.","Just like this, a month passed.","It came to the Orchid Peak.","“Ow?","“Ow! Ow! Ow!","“Hahaha.","“I can smell Little Master’s scent.”","Dahei was so happy that it danced with joy. It stuck out its big tongue and looked very delighted.","“Who is this person?”","“Isn’t he Xiong Fengran, the youngest son of Command Beast Peak Host?”","“This guy is crazy.”","“I think he is here to hook up with our junior sisters.”","“Keep an eye on him. If he dares to act rashly, we’ll beat him up.”","Many people were watching in the distance, but Dahei didn’t care at all and kept sniffing.","It walked on and off for six hours before it finally arrived at an exquisite courtyard.","Looking at a man at the back, Dahei asked, “Whose house is this?”","“Xiong Fengran, what are you up to? I advise you not to be too arrogant. This is Orchid Peak, not Command Beast Peak. Even if I break your legs here, your father can’t do anything about it,” a senior brother said coldly.","“I’m not here to make trouble, but to find a friend,” Dahei whispered.","An elder martial brother, who had lived in Orchid Peak for more than ten years, took out his communicator and looked at it a few times. “This is Zhang Hanyang’s house. Without his permission-”","Bang!","Before he finished his words, Xiong Fengran stamped his foot and sent him flying several tens of meters away. He directly smashed through the simple defensive layer of the courtyard manor and entered it.","“He’s here to make trouble!” The senior brother’s face darkened.","He also jumped into the defensive layer with dozens of people.","“Who are you?” Mengmeng shouted.","She was wearing cyan clothes and dressed as a man, who looked delicate in the eyes of outsiders.","“Little Master, Little Master, it’s me, Dahei. Boo-hoo, Little Master, I finally get to meet you.”","Dahei almost burst into tears and ran to Mengmeng.","“Huh?”","Mengmeng was stunned. “Da-Dahei?”","This was such a surprise to her that her beautiful eyes lit up.","“Wow, Dahei is here!”","“Presumptuous!”","That senior brother shouted. Seeing Xiong Fengran rush over, he was about to attack and said, “It’s okay, Junior Brother Zhang.”","“Hey, stop this!” Mengmeng exclaimed.","In her haste, she almost used her true voice, which sounded a little sharp.","Thankfully, everyone thought that Zhang Hanyang was just shocked.","But they also felt that Junior Brother Zhang was a little sissy.","“What?”","The senior brother frowned.","Dahei, with Xiong Fengran’s appearance, ran over excitedly. He put his arm around Junior Brother Zhang’s shoulder and began to talk with a smile.","“I finally found you, Little Master,” Dahei said.","Fortunately, Mengmeng responded quickly. “Little Master? Isn’t that the game we played when we were children? Now we’ve grown up. We’re good buddies.”","“What? Right. We’re good buddies. Little Master, come, let’s go check out my territory.”","“You have to call me Junior Brother Zhang. Now I am also a disciple here.” Mengmeng mediated.","Just like that, the two of them walked away with their arms around each other’s shoulders under everyone’s gaze.","Others found that Xiong Fengran’s words were incoherent, which made them confused. They saw that Junior Brother Zhang was also very happy while leaving with Xiong Fengran to walk down the mountain.","Mengmeng shouted from afar, “Well, thank you, senior brothers and sisters. I won’t be back in a few days. I’ll go visit his place.”","The two of them left the place quickly and walked to an empty area.","“Little Master, this is so terrifying. It happened so suddenly. I don’t know what to do since I got here,” Dahei said.","“Take your arm off me first.”","Mengmeng moved Dahei’s arm away from her shoulder and said, “You look so awkward now.”","“But I’m still Dahei. It’s just that I’m wearing a fool’s skin.”","“This won’t do. If my dad sees you-”","Swoosh!","Dahei withdrew its palm at lightning speed and broke out in a cold sweat. “If Host fails to recognize me and sees me hugging your shoulder, I will be beaten to death. No, no, Little Master, I’d better return to my own body. Xiong Fengran is too ugly.”","“Don’t change your looks. It will be over if you are seen by others.” Mengmeng looked around vigilantly and said, “By the way, how did you get into the sect?”","After hearing Dahei’s words, Mengmeng learned that Dahei appeared directly in the team of Exotic Beasts that was caught by the Crimson Sunglow Sect before it entered the sect and was chosen by a childe.","Mengmeng was amazed by what had happened.","She also briefly explained the situation when she came here.","As they chatted, they arrived at the Beast-reining Sect.","“Little Master, I’ll take you to have some nice food.”","Dahei walked in a cool manner, swaggering forward.","“Don’t call me Little Master. I’m Zhang Hanyang here, and you should call me Junior Brother Zhang.”","“No way! How can I call you Junior Brother?”","“Alas!”","She repeated it several times, but Dahei was too upright.","Mengmeng felt quite helpless. She covered her forehead and said, “You have to call me Junior Brother Zhang. What if others find out the truth and kill us?”","“Got it.”","Dahei didn’t look at Mengmeng but looked elsewhere. It had mastered the essentials. Without looking at Little Master, it could call her Junior Brother.","“Let’s go, Little Master. I dominate the Command Beast Peak.”","Dahei took the lead and went to the back mountain where some edible spirit beasts were raised.","“Greetings, Junior Brother Xiong.”","“Hmm,” Dahei said in a faint nasal voice.","It walked in directly, picked out two large spirit beasts, and took them away.","It took them back into the courtyard for a barbecue.","At this moment, the courtyard was renovated and looked brand new.","While Mengmeng and Dahei ate roast meat, some uninvited guests arrived. At dusk, five women arrived one after another. Three of them had swollen faces.","“How many girls has Xiong Fengran dated? He’s such a jerk.” Mengmeng was stunned.","“There’s a beaten girl who said that she would go to complain to Xiong Fengran’s dad.”","“What? Will it get you into trouble?”","Dahei was also a little scared.","After a while, the Peak Host did come over.","“What are you doing?” the Peak Host asked coldly.","“I’m-I’m discussing pellet refining with Junior Brother Zhang. I’m going to study it.”","“Huh?” The Command Beast Peak Host was stunned and looked at them suspiciously.","“Who are you?”","“Nice to meet you, Peak Host Xiong. I’m Zhang Hanyang, a new disciple of Orchid Peak.”","“You can refine pellets?”","“Yes.”","“How did you two know each other?”","“We’ve known each other for some time. We’re on good terms.”","“Aha. It just happens that I can refine pellets too.” Peak Host Xiong looked calm.","After examining Zhang Hanyang’s skills, he found that the young man did know how to refine pellets, and he was quite good at it.","“Did this brat actually start to focus on studies?”","Peak Host Xiong looked lightly at Xiong Fengran up and down.","He simply didn’t mind it any longer and said, “I don’t care what you’re going to do. Don’t cause me any trouble. I’m going out for a bit. If you dare to cause trouble on the other peaks, you won’t be able to stay in the Crimson Sunglow Sect any longer.”","After saying that, Peak Host Xiong left directly.","“Little Master, he seems not to care much about his eldest son.”","“It seems so.”","“Let’s stay at Command Beast Peak first and enjoy ourselves.”","“...”","No matter if it was Zi Yan, Mengmeng, or Dahei, they all had an easy time compared with others from the team.","More than a fifth of the people in the Heavenly Dragon Star Province disappeared, and they were swallowed up by the space turbulence.","Some groups of thousands appeared amongst the clans of the Starry Sky Beasts.","They felt despair upon seeing those beasts with their bloody mouths wide open.","Some people appeared on Barren Star, where there was no human. There were only some Exotic Beasts. To survive on a desolate star, one must be somewhat lucky.","As time went by, people gradually got used to the upheaval in Heavenly Dragon Star Province.","In the Dragnet Academy, the only three presidents that were left discussed and agreed that it must be maintained.","Many big families and even planets were no longer as vibrant as before.","Cultivators had very strong adaptability.","Everything seemed to have returned to calm.","In the Domain of Seven Desolations.","In the Sky Hall, Chu Qingyi sat by the side of the hall in a daze as she looked at the distant clouds.","Hiss!","Suddenly, a long gasp rang out.","Swoosh!","Chu Qingyi was pleasantly surprised.","She got up at lightning speed and came to the front of her petal haning basket. She looked at Zhang Han, who was lying there calmly, without blinking.","One second, two seconds...five minutes passed.","Zhang Han’s eyes moved. It seemed that it took him a lot of effort to open them.","“Master, you’ve finally woken up,” Chu Qingyi said.","“Where am I?” Zhang Han moved his mouth and said vaguely.","“We’re still in the Devil Palace in midair.”","Hiss!","Zhang Han took a deep breath.","It seemed that he had completely come to his senses. He frowned slightly and seemed to be in pain. He said, “How long has it been?”","“According to the time on Earth, it has been ten months,” said Chu Qingyi.","“What?!”","Zhang Han was shocked.","Gritting his teeth, he struggled to sit up with a bitter face.","Chu Qingyi was startled and hurried to support Zhang Han.","“Master, you, you’re injured,” Chu Qingyi said with a slightly pale face.","“It’s nothing.”","Zhang Han was stunned for five seconds and then sighed. “The matter is relatively serious. It’s the injury of the Great Domain.”","Soul cracks belonged to injuries of the Great Domain.","It was as if he were paralyzed. His consciousness was unable to control his body. He could control his head now. However, he still felt numb.","“Then...”","Chu Qingyi was stunned.","“I’m half disabled now.” Zhang Han was silent for a while and said slowly, “You’ve been in Mount New Moon for some time...”","When Chu Qingyi heard this, her expression changed slightly. “Master, are you going to abandon me?","“You’re my life savior. It took me quite some effort to have Ma’am and the team agree that I’ll be your disciple for ten years. You can’t chase me away.”","She was stubborn.","Chu Qingyi said a lot. She even looked a bit agitated and angry.","Zhang Han was stunned for a few seconds.","In the past, he might smile at her, but now, he was not in the mood.","“Very well. In that case, then... from today onwards, you will become my official disciple and also my fourth disciple.”","Chu Qingyi was delighted. “Thank you, Master!”","“It’s not convenient for me to fight now. I’ll teach you some occult arts and fighting methods. You’ll take me to find them,” Zhang Han said. “Let’s go back to the Sea Dragon Star Area first.”","“Master, can you move now?”","“Not for the time being.”","It wasn’t that Zhang Han couldn’t move, but that it would bring him harm. He knew that his injury would worsen a lot if he moved.","“Can we go down? The Demon Lords, Demon Monarchs, and the others are still down there,” said Chu Qingyi worriedly.","“I’ve said that I have the final say in this world.”","Zhang Han seemed to be a little tired and said, “A wisp of my will can kill all the people below the Tribulation Stage.”"]},{"number":1407,"title":"Chapter 1407 Ancient Road of Starry Sky","paragraphs":["Chapter 1407 Ancient Road of Starry Sky","“Master, you have great strength in this world, but does the strength belong to you?” Chu Qingyi couldn’t help but ask curiously.","“That’s because I can control the Source Energy of this world.” Zhang Han explained simply, “My own strength has not improved too much. It has been ten months. My daughter and wife must be waiting for me anxiously. I can’t waste any more time, and I’ll have to trouble you now.”","“It’s no trouble at all. Master, I will go with you to pick up Mengmeng and Ma’am at the fastest speed possible,” Chu Qingyi said.","After thinking about it, Chu Qingyi said, “You should take more rests now. Do you want to lie on the sofa or sit on it?”","As she spoke, Chu Qingyi took out a sofa, which was just like a massage chair.","Seeing this, Zhang Han controlled his body with his mind. He floated to the sofa and leaned against it before closing his eyes to rest.","It was not appropriate for a man to be lying in a petal hanging basket.","When Chu Qingyi thought of this, she put away the hanging basket that she had not used for a long time.","She assembled the parts on the sofa and made it like a wheelchair.","She wheeled it, left the hall, and floated down.","Zhang Han ran a bit of his power, and wisps of black energy appeared in the void.","If they kept flying like before, they didn’t know how long it would take them to reach the ground.","The space here was different, which still needed the assistance of world energy.","On the way down, Zhang Han learned about his physical condition.","The Immortal Body of the Five Elements was completed, whose aura was terrifying.","The body alone possessed the power of a Shadow Refining cultivator.","The defense was powerful and impervious to all methods.","Now that he had lost his soul sense and Yuan Ying, he couldn’t use many of his supernatural powers and occult arts, but the power of the Space-splitting Punch had increased a lot.","“I just can’t make an action easily.”","Zhang Han slightly ran his power as several medicinal pellets appeared. He took them to nurture his soul.","As long as his injuries eased, they wouldn’t affect his actions much.","“Injuries to the Great Domain are a problem after all.","“They can be only cured by ninth-tier Soul Fixing Pellets refined by ninth-tier soul attribute spirit treasures.","“Whatever. I must find my family as soon as possible.","“I can figure out how to deal with my injuries in the future.”","Zhang Han did not hesitate at all.","It was because he needed to protect some people more important than his life.","When Zhang Han and Chu Qingyi reached the ground, they saw the glacier, where there were still some people on it including several Demon Monarchs, some humans, and some high-position officials of the Exotic Beasts.","However, the Demon Lords were no longer present. Taoist Lord of Dragon and the other two who followed Zhang Han up the stair had also disappeared.","“Someone is coming!”","“It’s them! They’re coming down!”","“Report this to the Sect Leader now.”","“Go notify the Demon Lord.”","Chu Qingyi didn’t think much when faced with this kind of scene. Also, she was no match for those people.","But Zhang Han opened his eyes, which had an indifferent look in them.","Crack!","It exploded like a thunderclap.","Wisps of black mist and energy strips hidden in the void turned into a hurricane that whistled past.","Hundreds of creatures on the glacier disappeared.","“Seven-star Sword!”","Zhang Han’s eyes lit up.","The Seven-star Sword was drawn, cutting heaven and earth.","A spatial rift appeared.","Zhang Han said, “Let’s go.”","He closed his eyes again.","The king vessel that had been berthed not far from them seemed to tear through the void and rapidly approached them.","Chu Qingyi was in a daze. After two seconds, she came back to her senses and wheeled Zhang Han into the king vessel. The ship seemed to be swallowed up by the rift and disappeared into the void.","In the blink of an eye, the king vessel appeared in the Chaotic Region.","In this place, Zhang Han’s strength had returned to normal.","Without Yue Wuwei leading the way, it took them seven days to cross the Chaotic Region.","“Let’s go to Dragon Base Star first.”","Zhang Han remained sitting and would take some medicinal pellets every day. Now he could move his arms.","The main reason why he was recovering so quickly was to stabilize his injuries.","Finally, he saw quite a few familiar faces on the Dragon Base Star.","“Boss, you’re finally back!”","“Something terrible has happened in Heavenly Dragon Star Province.”","“Many people disappeared.”","“Chairman Liu and many high-position officials were just having a meeting right before they vanished.”","“We’ve searched the entire Heavenly Dragon Star Province, but we haven’t found them.”","“...”","Zhang Han asked them so questions and got to know the situation.","They had sent people to search everywhere in the entire Heavenly Dragon Star Province for ten months, but they couldn’t find their men.","Moreover, the surroundings of the Heavenly Dragon Star Province were either surrounded by space cracks or a terrible environment. It seemed that they were blocked and could not go out.","After hearing these words, Zhang Han felt quite helpless. He didn’t instruct these people much but just waved his hand.","“We’ll return to the Domain of Seven Desolations.”","He and Chu Qingyi returned to the king vessel and left.","“Master, why are we going to the Domain of Seven Desolations?” Chu Qingyi asked.","“We’ll take the Ancient Road of Starry Sky to go to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.”","“The Astral Domain of Vast Heaven is very vast.”","“If I keep searching, I’ll get to find them.” Zhang Han closed his eyes, leaned on the sofa, and rested.","Chu Qingyi sat on the sofa aside, lost in thought.","“You’re a Devil Shadow Clan member.”","An hour later, Zhang Han suddenly opened his eyes and said, “The Devil Shadow Clan is blessed with spatial techniques. There are 69 kinds of occult arts I’ve mastered suitable for you. Release your mind.”","Chu Qingyi froze upon hearing this.","She was secretly delighted. Pursing her lips, her eyes lit up.","She immediately sat up straight, closed her eyes, and released her mind.","Clatter!","Zhang Han passed the 69 occult arts to her with his mind.","This was the first time Chu Qingyi had obtained the occult arts suitable for the cultivation of the Devil Shadow Clan, as well as some sword moves and so on.","She was stunned while taking all sorts of occult arts in her mind.","After a while, she said sweetly, “Thank you, Master.”","“Start cultivating.”","Zhang Han leaned against the sofa with his eyes closed. He slightly raised his right hand, took out two medicinal pellets, and took them.","He was not happy to heal his injuries with medicinal pellets.","“My power is roughly at the Void-refining Realm Early Stage.","“With the Immortal Body of the Five Elements at the Mastery Realm, I am invincible in the Shadow Refining Realm.","“However, injuries to the soul will remain a problem.”","“Chu Qingyi,” Zhang Han said.","“Master, just call me disciple or Qingyi.”","“Okay. I won’t do much on this trip. Practice those occult arts well and I’ll guide you along the way,” Zhang Han said.","Chu Qingyi’s cultivation base was at the Void-refining Realm Early Stage, but most of the cultivators in the Middle Stage were no match for her. After strengthening her occult arts and supernatural powers, with the powerful talent of the Devil Shadow Clan, she could fight against the Last-Stage cultivators.","As for Zhang Han, he knew that he was invincible in the Shadow Refining Realm, but in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven, he would eventually meet someone who could be a match for him.","Now that there were more places involved with the Astral Domain, even Zhang Han had to be careful.","In the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven, the Integration Realm cultivators were considered high-end ones.","However, they were still unable to experience grand occasions.","Just like that, Zhang Han and Chu Qingyi arrived in the Chaotic Region.","It took them seven days to go to the depths of the region. Zhang Han controlled the Seven-star Sword to leave the spaceship and slash the void, where a crack appeared.","It wasn’t a casual cut but was aimed at a specific place.","The spaceship entered the Domain of Seven Desolations.","“Get us a guide,” Zhang Han said.","“Okay.”","Chu Qingyi thought for a moment before saying, “Shall we get that Taoist Lord of Dragon over here? He seems to know a lot.”","“We should just find someone we dislike to be our coolie.”","Zhang Han responded, “Alright.”","Chu Qingyi controlled the spaceship to advance.","At this moment, the Domain of Seven Desolations was still trembling.","“Six Demon Monarchs and more than a dozen elders of the Human Clan died in the glacier outside South Sea City. I don’t know who killed them. It seems to be Zhang Hanyang, the fierce man!”","“He’s too terrifying. He killed Stone Demon King with a single finger strike. He’s simply invincible.”","“Hey? Look up, guys. How could there be a spaceship coming?”","“Come up.”","Chu Qingyi’s claws stretched toward a few onlookers.","She caught five people.","They were all dumbfounded after entering the spaceship.","They didn’t dare to ask what was going on since they didn’t know these two people.","“Where is the Myriad Mountains Palace’s headquarters and is the Taoist Lord of Dragon over there?” Chu Qingyi asked.","“The headquarters of the Myriad Mountains Palace is located in the Myriad Abyss Mountains, but we don’t know where the Taoist Lord of Dragon is.”","“Give me the coordinates to the Myriad Abyss Mountains.”","After obtaining the coordinates, Chu Qingyi released those people.","The spaceship broke through the void and flew away at high speed.","Only when it was gone far did the City Lord and the law enforcement team rush over.","“What happened? What happened?”","After a few questions were asked, the matter was over.","Everyone was quite suspicious of the identities of the people in the spaceship.","Two hours later.","A spaceship appeared in the air above Myriad Mountains Palace.","“Taoist Lord of Dragon, come over and lead the way.”","Chu Qingyi couldn’t be bothered to get off and used the spaceship to raise her voice.","Clatter!","“Who’s there?”","“Who dares to cause trouble in the Myriad Mountains Palace?”","“Fall in! Fall in!”","The entire Myriad Mountains Palace was in a state of chaos.","Many elders flew into the air and were ready to fight.","“Who are you?”","Taoist Lord of Dragon’s figure appeared while his gaze was rather hostile.","Buzz!","Countless energy strips that seemed to be hidden within the Alternate Space suddenly appeared in the skies, locking down the area around the Taoist Lord of Dragon.","“Zhang, Zhang Hanyang?”","Taoist Lord of Dragon let out a shocked cry.","Now that Zhang Hanyang was invincible in the world, he was no match for him and did not dare to act rashly. At this time, he thought that his words had offended Zhang Hanyang that day, so Zhang Hanyang came to make trouble.","He couldn’t help feeling nervous as he hurriedly said, “Supremacy Zhang, please hold back. I don’t think I have offended you.”","“Cut the crap. Come up and lead the way,” Chu Qingyi said coldly.","“Phew...","“Right. She just said that they need me to lead the way.”","Taoist Lord of Dragon let out a slight sigh of relief.","Under the gazes of numerous disciples, he took the initiative to fly toward the king vessel in the air.","He was once a magnate, but that remained the past because an invincible figure had appeared in this world.","After he boarded the spaceship, he saw Zhang Han sitting on the sofa with his eyes closed.","Taoist Lord of Dragon was quite cautious. He cupped his hands and smiled. “Greetings, Supremacy Zhang.”","He also smiled and nodded at Chu Qingyi.","Chu Qingyi ignored him.","And Zhang Han did not speak either.","Chu Qingyi said, “Lead us to the Ancient Road of Starry Sky.”","“What? Where to?” Taoist Lord of Dragon was startled.","“The Ancient Road of Starry Sky.” Chu Qingyi frowned slightly.","“Well... the Ancient Road of Starry Sky is in the center of the Devil Palace. It’s controlled by the Demon Clan. Ahem, but if Supremacy Zhang goes there, they won’t dare to stop him. I know where it is.”","Taoist Lord of Dragon knew that since they had come to seek him out, there was no way they would let him leave.","He took the lead to go to the Ancient Road of Starry Sky.","On the way there, the Taoist Lord of Dragon said, “Those from the Devil Palace will not stop us, but there are many devils on the Ancient Road of Starry Sky. They are irrational beast-like creatures. Supremacy Zhang, you should make preparations in advance. If you wish to head to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven, you will have to kill your way to it.”"]},{"number":1408,"title":"Chapter 1408 Chu Family of the Astral Domain","paragraphs":["Chapter 1408 Chu Family of the Astral Domain","Zhang Han opened his eyes and asked calmly, “What is the exit of the Domain of Seven Desolations in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven?”","“Supposedly, it is a Dangerous Land, which is why very few members of the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven have been able to make it there,” the Taoist Lord of Dragon replied.","“I see.”","As soon as Zhang Han heard this, he knew that the Taoist Lord of Dragon didn’t know the exact details either.","“I might as well ask some Demon Lords about this.”","Three hours later, the spaceship reached the Devil Palace’s territory.","Located in an archipelago, it had a large area and many buildings.","A spaceship appeared in the void, which terrified quite a few demons.","“Who is there?”","A Demon Monarch flew into the sky.","“Call your Demon Lords over,” Zhang Han said in an indifferent voice.","This caused the Demon Monarch’s complexion to change and his body to tremble.","“Oh my god!","“It’s Old Demon Zhang.","“Shit. That devil is here! I can’t believe that he’s come to the Devil Palace.”","The Demon Monarch was a little taken aback. He didn’t dare move an inch and even forgot what Old Demon Zhang had just said.","“Hmm?”","A soul-shocking aura enveloped him.","Hiss!","The Demon Monarch’s body violently trembled as he hurriedly cupped his hands together and said, “Well, Senior, there’s no need to make a scene about this. If there is anything you need, just name it.”","“Go get your Demon Lords.” Zhang Han was getting impatient.","He didn’t have the mood to stay at this place.","He even added, “You have one minute.”","The Demon Monarch’s complexion changed. He quickly used Designated Voice-transmitting Technique to inform the remaining six Demon Lords.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","In just half a minute, several rays of light rushed over.","“Old Demon Zhang, how dare you come to my Devil Palace?","“Aren’t you afraid of getting yourself killed by the senior of the palace, the Demonic God?”","An injured Demon Lord had a very tough attitude.","But soon he became listless.","“Do you mean that weakling who hid?”","Zhang Han ran his power slightly and simulated the scene of that day with illusions where the Demonic God sneaked around the hall, looking around with great fear.","“He’s dead.” Zhang Han ended the topic.","“WHAT?!","“This couldn’t be!”","The six Demon Lords glanced at each other. They all seemed to be at a loss for what to do.","“We need to go to the Ancient Road of Starry Sky.”","After Zhang Han said that, he closed his eyes slowly and moved his right hand slightly.","Chu Qingyi nodded when she saw this.","She knew what she needed to do next.","She asked, “Where is the exit across the Ancient Road of Starry Sky?”","Demon Lord Tongtian on the far left thought for a moment before replying, “I’ve been there once and almost died. That’s a huge secret realm over there. Perhaps it belongs to the yang attribute. In short, the environment over there suppresses my cultivation level. I can’t even defeat God Transformation Realm creatures in that place.”","“A secret realm?” Chu Qingyi muttered to herself. “In other words, even you don’t know where the exit is. Have those who came here ever mentioned it?”","“They have. Some said that it was in the Vast Lake Star Area, some said that it was in the Flowing Sun Star Area, and some said that it was in other areas. In short, the statements are all different. However, the only similarity is that they’ve all entered that place by mistake,” said Demon Lord Tongtian.","“Take us there.”","Chu Qingyi lost interest in asking.","Every Star Area in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven was much larger than a Star Province.","There were many places where powerful and influential figures gathered in every area, including many world-renowned sects and the Four Great Sects.","Chu Qingyi was rather familiar with the few regions of the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven. The others might have been to those places before while some had only heard about them.","“The Ancient Road of Starry Sky is just ahead.","“That mountain is illusory, surrounded by Bounded Domains set by us.”","Demon Lord Tongtian dispersed the Bounded Domains. Strange fluctuations began to emanate from within. It was as if the mountain was moving in accordance with the flames.","“Get out.”","Chu Qingyi gave the Taoist Lord of Dragon a glance.","“I need to leave from here?” Taoist Lord of Dragon was shocked.","“I’ll be doomed, won’t I?","“There are six great Demon Lords out there, and we are still in the depths of Devil Palace.","“Is this necessary?”","“Did you hear me?”","Chu Qingyi glared.","Taoist Lord of Dragon was silent for a long moment before he let out a sigh and turned to leave.","After leaving the king vessel, he gave Demon Lord Tongtian and the others a stern look.","“You’d better not deceive Supremacy Zhang. Otherwise, the Human Clan will absolutely not let you off easily. Humph!”","He said that in a righteous manner, making others think that he was with Zhang Hanyang.","Demon Lord Tongtian and the others didn’t say anything.","They watched as the Taoist Lord of Dragon quickly departed.","However, when the king vessel entered the Ancient Road of Starry Sky-","“What does Supremacy Zhang have to do with you? You’re just flaunting your powerful connections to threaten others,” said Chu Qingyi indifferently.","Demon Lord Tongtian shouted, “Taoist Lord of Dragon, you truly are shameless.”","Zhang Han and Chu Qingyi did not know what happened between those people later.","They thought that it wouldn’t be easy for the Taoist Lord of Dragon to return to human territory.","“Master, is this the Ancient Road of Starry Sky?","“Why does it look like a rainbow?”","What came into view was darkness. There seemed to be faint starlight in the distance, but it was far away. There was a beautiful rainbow bridge under the king vessel.","Zhang Han said, “Many devils are hiding in the dark. Let’s go down and kill them.”","“Okay.”","Chu Qingyi had cultivated for a few days and had only learned a little about a kind of occult art.","She also wanted to go down and test her combat capability.","Therefore, she got off the king vessel in a flash.","“This space feels wonderful.”","She could completely feel that there were faults and pressure in the surrounding void. It was as if the space there had been compressed. Each step they took could cover thousands of miles in a normal area.","At the same time, she could sense fluctuations from the void.","There were many devils around.","There were many of them, ranging from the God Transformation to Shadow Refining levels.","However, there were relatively few Void-refining Realm devils. Chu Qingyi was only able to sense thirteen Shadow Refining devils. Among them, one was Middle-Stage and the others were Early-Stage.","“Cloud Flowerfall Sword Art!”","Chu Qingyi wielded her long sword and began to fight.","“Hidden Kill.”","Chu Qingyi cast the occult art she had just learned.","Her body instantly split into sixteen figures that flew in different directions. Each strike killed a devil.","These figures weren’t her fake bodies but rather a kind of spatial occult art. Every single attack was real, and the power was equivalent to Chu Qingyi’s attack power.","“Too fast.”","After Chu Qingyi finished one move, Zhang Han’s voice appeared in her ear.","“Okay.”","Chu Qingyi nodded. After thinking for two seconds, she attacked again.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Sword lights flashed.","She wiped out more than ten devils with one sword strike.","“Too slow,” Zhang Han said.","Chu Qingyi attacked again.","“You’ve been running the cultivation technique too fast, and you’re too slow with the condensing occult art.”","“...”","In just a day, the moves Chu Qingyi cast finally reached the initial success stage.","The thirty-two duplications were equivalent to attacking thirty-two times in an instant.","The attack was quite powerful.","After taking a recovery medicinal pellet, Chu Qingyi began to practice the next occult art.","She found it nice to achieve the initial success stage. She would learn first and then master what she had learned. She had obtained so many occult arts and planned to learn more first.","They slaughtered ten more days on the Ancient Road of Starry Sky before they finally saw the light ahead.","It hadn’t been a tough journey because all the powerful devils were killed by Zhang Han in the distance.","The Ancient Road of Starry Sky was wreathed in the Source Energy of the Domain of Seven Desolations, and it was just what Zhang Han wanted.","Swoosh!","When they followed the light and left, they found a relatively peaceful world where there was green grass and luxuriant trees.","Many spirit beasts could be seen in this place.","Most spirit beasts had low battle prowess while Exotic Beasts were the mainstream in the starry sky. However, surprisingly, the strength and cultivation bases of the spirit beasts here were actually very high.","“Most of them are in the Void-refining Realm.”","Chu Qingyi said, “Master, are we going to find the exit now?”","“I’ll go out and have a look.”","Zhang Han opened his eyes. Wheeled by Chu Qingyi, he left the king vessel and observed for a while.","After returning to the ship, they marched 300 miles southward.","Zhang Han went out again to observe the mountains and rivers. He also took out tens of thousands of crystal stones and set up the Heaven-earth Formation.","After that, they traveled a thousand miles eastward to observe and set up a formation.","After returning to the ship this time, Zhang Han commanded, “Take the sun as the east. We’ll march 167 miles at an angle of thirty-six degrees to the northwest.”","Chu Qingyi was stunned. “Did he find the exit or something?”","She was a little confused and intended to do as he said first.","When the king vessel arrived at the destination, she found that they were above a lake.","“Go 5,300 meters deep into the lake,” Zhang Han ordered.","The king vessel went under the lake and soon arrived at the place mentioned by Zhang Han.","Buzz!","The Seven-star Sword appeared.","It could be used to control the power of the starry sky. The sword unleashed ten sword lights that illuminated its surroundings.","Chu Qingyi saw that underneath this lake was an enormous city. Right after she could clearly see the outline of the city, it immediately grew fuzzy.","Zhang Han said, “Up.”","The spaceship went up and broke through the surface of the water.","A more surprising scene appeared.","They were currently in the cosmic void.","Behind the spaceship, a sea of water was slowly dissipating.","“Was that a secret realm?”","Chu Qingyi reacted and couldn’t help but say in admiration, “Master, it’s amazing that you found a way to leave the secret realm so quickly.”","“Go to the nearest planet and refresh the map system,” Zhang Han said.","The spaceship broke through the void. After its scouting superpower was activated, it leaped into the secondary space and advanced.","At this moment, Chu Qingyi hesitated a bit before she said, “Master, do you have a plan?”","“I’ll keep searching for the time being. If I really can’t find my family, I’ll take down a few sects to help me with that and issue some tasks at the same time,” Zhang Han said.","“I have a suggestion,” Chu Qingyi said. “You can come with me to my family’s residence first. My Chu Family knows a lot of great sects in the Astral Domain, and I can talk Patriarch Chu into helping you.”","“Okay.” Zhang Han nodded slightly.","He took out three medicinal pellets and took them before the king vessel quieted down.","Two days later, they finally arrived at a planet.","The technology of the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven was much more developed than that of the Star Province. King vessels were common in this place, and the equipment was more complete.","Zhang Han didn’t bother to replace the equipment on the king vessel he owned. He directly bought a brand new one with 500 million crystal stones and named it Eagle. It was famous for its speed and was relatively small. It was four times smaller than the previous king vessel.","The old king vessel was sold by Chu Qingyi.","When they arrived at the new king vessel, Chu Qingyi set the coordinates of the Chu Family.","Two seconds later, the ship entered the secondary space and left.","It would take them 20 days to get there.","Zhang Han’s complexion was much better. His limbs moved in harmony. After walking around the ship twice, he sat back on the sofa and rested.","“What’s the story between you and the Chu Family?” Zhang Han asked.","Everyone on his team knew some general information, but Zhang Han thought that since he and Chu Qingyi decided to go to her family’s place, he needed to find out the specific details about what happened between her and the Chu Family.","“I was originally a Chu Family servant girl.”","Chu Qingyi wasn’t used to giving long speeches. It took her a few seconds to gather her thoughts before explaining."]},{"number":1409,"title":"Chapter 1409 Mengmeng’s Pursuer","paragraphs":["Chapter 1409 Mengmeng’s Pursuer","“The Eldest Lady of the family is the patriarch’s daughter. Her name is Chu Qing.","“It was the First Queen who gave me the name, Chu Qingyi. It’s because she wanted me to take care of the Eldest Lady.”","At this point, Zhang Han raised his right hand and interrupted, “You are already my disciple. You don’t need to address anyone as Eldest Lady, let alone someone from the Chu Family.”","Zhang Han didn’t know much about her story, but he knew that the sister Chu Qingyi got along with her all the time and ended up ignoring her even while she was in danger.","Chu Qingyi’s expression froze. She was secretly delighted.","“Master has accepted me.”","“I’ve been accompanying Chu Qing since I was a child... learning some cultivation knowledge from her. She liked to play, and I could only accompany her all the time. Our grades were average, but I knew a lot. However, every time we took the examination, my scores would be much lower than Chu Qing’s, according to the instructions of the First Queen’s maids.","“When I was 12 or 13 years old, Chu Aolong, the patriarch, took me in as an adopted daughter. At that time, I was quite talented in cultivation.","“I cultivated with Chu Qing and competed with her. Our strength also increased a little. When I was 16, Chu Qing fancied a young talent back then, who was very famous in the Gray Pic Star Area.","“At first, we would attend some provincial meetings between the younger generation together, but later, that talented young man came to the Chu Family to propose marriage to me.","“Chu Qing broke off with me. I didn’t consent to the proposal, but the patriarch agreed to it on my behalf. He said that the young man and I would get married when I was twenty. I went to him for support but only got berated. The relationship between Chu Qing and me was getting worse and worse, and she was hostile to me.","“This went on until I was 17. Back then, we were in a secret realm, and Chu Qing’s life was in danger. In order to save her, I was placed in danger. She did not pull me. Just like that, she silently watched as I was devoured by darkness.","“All these years, my experiences in the Chu Family and the favors that I owe them are written off. I’ve cleared my debt by saving Chu Qing’s life.”","When Chu Qingyi spoke of these things, her expression was slightly complicated.","The Chu Family’s residence was the place where she grew up, but not her home.","“So, how important is the Chu Family to you?” Zhang Han asked.","In fact, he already knew the answer.","However, he needed Chu Qingyi to say it, and it was the decision that she had made.","Hearing this, Chu Qingyi was silent for two seconds and said, “I can’t sever ties with them, but they no longer matter to me that much.”","“Would you go back to the place that has once put you through hell for me?” Zhang Han asked.","“Master, you saved my life, and I got your martial arts heritage. That’s why I’m here today. At first, I planned to repay your kindness, but after spending time with you guys these days, I’m also in love with Mount New Moon,” Chu Qingyi said.","“Alas.” Zhang Han sighed softly.","Chu Qingyi blinked. She couldn’t help asking, “From what I remember and the martial arts heritage I got, your figure and aura seem to be very powerful, and why is that?”","Zhang Han thought for a moment and said, “The heritage you got should be the adobe I left while I was in the Mastery Realm or in the Tribulation Stage First or Second Tier.”","“What?”","Chu Qingyi’s gaze froze and she was somewhat stunned.","“Just take it as that I used to be very powerful and know much,” Zhang Han said simply.","“So why is it that your cultivation level has become lower?” Chu Qingyi asked curiously.","“Because I went to woo my wife. She was particularly difficult to pursue, and I spent all my cultivation to find her.” When Zhang Han spoke, there was finally a smile on his face. The unique gentleness in that smile belonged to Zi Yan alone.","“Ma’am is truly blessed.” Chu Qingyi’s tone carried a trace of envy.","“Hey, you will meet someone excellent as well in the future.” Zhang Han said, “How powerful is the speaker of the Chu Family?”","Patriarch was not necessarily the speaker of the family. Zhang Han was referring to the most powerful one.","“Chu Aolong, the patriarch, is at the Early Stage of the Integration Realm,” Chu Qingyi said. “It is said that one of the ancestors of the Chu Family has the strength at the Peak Stage of the Integration Realm and gets to talk with the leaders of the Four Great Sects. However, he travels all year round, and the last time he came back, it was more than 50 years ago.”","“Not bad.” Zhang Han nodded.","The alleged realm wasn’t necessarily one’s true stage. Some cultivators, who were said to be at the Peak Stage of the Integration Realm, might actually be at the Middle or Last Stage of the Mastery Realm.","For example, the leaders of the Four Great Sects of Vast Heaven Star were almost at the Early or Middle Stage of the Mastery Realm. But it was said that most of them were at the Peak Stage of the Integration Realm. However, no one could know for sure. It was uncertain. After all, the Sect Leaders were elusive, and it was hard for ordinary people to see them.","At present, those in the Early Stage of the Integration Realm could pressure Zhang Han.","His soul injuries had stabilized.","In theory, he could go all out once and it would not have a great impact on him. In fact, Zhang Han knew that once he attacked, his soul injuries, the scars of the Great Domain, would be more serious, which would make it harder for him to recover in the future.","But now, he could only focus on the present. Even if he took action, it wouldn’t matter. There would always be a way to deal with the scars of the Great Domain, which was still under control.","That was to say, if he wanted to take action, he had to take some medicine first. When he had enough of it, he could use the skill once, and then take the medicine again.","It was troublesome, but although he was injured, he managed to withstand the Demonic God’s attack, which was already not a bad result.","At least that was what Zhang Han thought.","“When we arrive at the Chus’ place, we’ll just follow your plan. We can’t waste time there.”","After saying that, Zhang Han closed his eyes and leaned against the sofa as if he was taking a nap.","Chu Qingyi’s lips moved as if she wanted to say something, but in the end, she did not disturb Zhang Han. She sat on one side and looked ahead, absent-minded.","In fact, she didn’t like to advocate things. She liked to follow someone’s plan because she was a little lazy.","But for her master, she could overcome all the difficulties.","After thinking for a while, Chu Qingyi closed her eyes and began to cultivate, evolving the occult arts she had just learned in her soul sense sea.","Every move could be regarded as a trump card.","Some even stunned her.","Time passed relatively quickly after she focused on studying.","In Crimson Sunglow Sect on Orchid Peak on the Vast Heaven Star.","“Junior Brother Zhang, let’s go and have a drink.” Xiong Fengran, disguised by Dahei, walked toward Mengmeng, disguised as a man, under the gaze of the crowd.","“This brat wants to drink with Junior Brother Zhang again.”","“Junior Brother Zhang, you can’t be dragged down to his level.”","“Xiong Fengran isn’t a decent person. Junior Brother Zhang, you can’t interact with the girls. It won’t be okay if you get taken advantage of. Come to hang around in my room when you have time.”","Someone said coquettishly, “Older Martial Sister!” A girl with two ponytails in her teens ran over and looked around angrily. Then, she looked at Mengmeng affectionately and said, “Junior Brother Zhang, don’t be afraid. I’ll protect you. Xiong Fengran, if you dare to take him to your Junior Sisters, I’ll go to the Command Beast Peak to beat you up.”","“Got it,” Dahei said patiently.","“Ahem, ahem.” Mengmeng was dumbfounded. She coughed softly and said, “Well, don’t worry, everyone. Elder Brother Xiong and I are going to discuss and study pellet refining.”","“Alright.”","“We’ll leave you to it now.”","The two of them left Orchid Peak as if they were fleeing.","On the way to the Command Beast Peak, there was a mountain forest.","“Little Master, that Older Martial Sister seems to like you more and more.” Dahei scratched its head.","“Alas.” Mengmeng sighed deeply and said helplessly, “Why hasn’t Daddy come to pick me up yet? I’m now the best at pellet refining among the disciples of Orchid Peak. I’m too eye-catching now. If it goes on like this, I’ll be exposed sooner or later.”","“I miss Host too. I don’t want to be like this. I want to return to my body.” Dahei looked aggrieved.","“I miss my father.” Mengmeng looked depressed.","She sat there with her head lowered and her big eyes blinking. There was a faint layer of light in them, which made her look like she was about to cry. She looked so pitiful.","“Little Master, why don’t I change into Host’s appearance to cheer you up?” Dahei said with a flattering face.","If outsiders saw their behavior, they would think that there was something wrong with Xiong Fengran and Zhang Hanyang.","“Scram.”","Mengmeng glared at Dahei and then wiped her eyes. “Dahei, there are only the two of us from Mount New Moon. Where do you think Mummy is? What about Grandpa and Auntie? Where are they? Are they safe?”","“They are. Mistress has Third Brother with her. She is so smart that she will definitely be safe. My host is so powerful that he will pick us up soon.”","“The Vast Heaven Star is so big, and so is the Crimson Sunglow Sect. I don’t know if Daddy can find me. This won’t do. I have to make Zhang Hanyang more famous. I have to work hard to study pellet refining.” Mengmeng said firmly, “Even if I am found to be a girl, I will make up a story about it.”","“Sure enough, you’re beautiful and also a great liar.” Dahei smacked its lips and said, “Little Master, I want to eat barbecue. Last time I was beaten by the idiotic Peak Host after eating, and now I am not allowed to catch the spirit beasts.”","“You shouldn’t have eaten those Plain Water Buffalos all the time. Even if you were trying to be a coupon clipper, you couldn’t just stick to one kind.” Mengmeng rolled her eyes grumpily.","After hanging out for two days, Mengmeng returned to Orchid Peak.","Every time she went to study pellet refining, she would always be followed by that Older Martial Sister.","“Alas, what should I do?","“This is tricking. She seems to be deeply in love with me. What should I do about it?","“Wait!”","Mengmeng was shocked.","“I now look very similar to Daddy when he was young.","“There won’t be some misunderstanding regarding this, will there? I can’t have gotten Mummy a rival in love, right?","“It seems that I have to find an opportunity to refuse this girl.”","Mengmeng was very decisive. After the class, the Older Martial Sister went shopping with Zhang Hanyang.","“Ahem, Senior Sister, I’m only devoted to pellet refining. Well...”","“Say no more. I get it.” The Older Martial Sister’s face was flushed as she said shyly, “I am the daughter of the Peak Host. I know that you’re pressured. When you achieve something in pellet refining, you can... Boo-hoo!”","As she fled, she kept whimpering.","“Alas!”","Mengmeng looked at her back in a daze, feeling helpless.","She said helplessly, “This Older Martial Sister is too weird.”","The little girl had been holding back her strength for such a long time, and she didn’t have fun. There was no way she could vent her emotions.","“I can’t just keep studying and cultivating like this.","“I need to study pellet refining harder. When Daddy finds me, I will be able to do whatever I want!”","Mengmeng missed Zhang Han and Zi Yan several times a day.","It was the same for them. They thought about each other every day.","At the edge of the Ocean Astral Domain, a force called Mount New Moon was growing rapidly.","They burned, killed, and plundered their enemies, and they disregarded unrelated powers.","Their hierarchy was strict. Their empress slayed the battlefield.","Countless cultivation resources were purely rewarded according to their contributions.","Like a virus, the new force began nibbling away at the tip of the Ocean Astral Domain."]},{"number":1410,"title":"Chapter 1410 Chu Family’s Gathering","paragraphs":["Chapter 1410 Chu Family’s Gathering","“Master, we’re almost there.”","Chu Qingyi heard the sound of the intelligent system. She stopped cultivating and looked at Zhang Han.","“Okay.” Zhang Han nodded.","“I have prepared the information of Ma’am, Mengmeng and others,” Chu Qingyi said. “Once we get to the Chu Family’s residence, I will explain the situation to the patriarch. I will mobilize the power of other sects and even offer a reward. That way, we will definitely be able to find Ma’am, Mengmeng as well as the rest of the team.”","“When we get there, you’ll decide what to do,” Zhang Han said.","He didn’t say much. Chu Qingyi understood what he meant. She just needed to get her job done as long as she didn’t waste much time.","The place where the Chu Family was located was called the Heavenly Double Star.","It was controlled by the Radiant Institute.","“The Radiant Institute is powerful and it’s in charge of sixty planets. The Heavenly Double Star is the main planet where the Chu Family is located. Most forces don’t know about it other than a few ones. Therefore, the Chu Family is rather mysterious to the Astral Domain.”","Chu Qingyi introduced the situation. “The Radiant Institute controls everything of the Heavenly Double Star. However, the location of the Chu Family is a forbidden area. Although the Chu Family is small, their overall strength is rather high. With Grand Master Chu present, many major powers will have to show them respect.”","“...”","During her explanation, the king vessel left the secondary space and slowly approached the space station of the Heavenly Double Star.","After parking the ship, Chu Qingyi wheeled Zhang Han’s wheelchair and took the aircraft into the space station.","“Your identity information, please.","“Why did you come to the Heavenly Double Star?”","Swoosh!","Chu Qingyi took out a black wooden token of authority, which was flickering with a faint dark light. She said lightly, “I’m Chu Qingyi.”","“What?”","The face of the person who asked the question changed slightly.","If she was only a guest, he could be a bit more arrogant, but when facing a Chu Family member, he did not dare to offend the other party.","“Milord, please wait a moment.”","He carefully examined the token and entered the name Chu Qingyi into the system.","The information was soon shown.","It was written in gray, which indicated that Chu Qingyi was dead.","“Is this person a sham?”","“My apologies. The system has crashed. I will go ask our leader.”","The man left quickly and contacted his superior in a hurry.","“Protector Miao, a member of the Chu Family by the name of Chu Qingyi has appeared here. However, according to the system, Chu Qingyi is clearly dead. I suspect that someone is using her name.”","“It’s fine. Let them in,” Protector Miao sneered. “Since that person is a member of the Chu Family, they will go to that place. The Chu Family’s disciples that have gone out to train have all returned. It is said that Grand Master Chu is returning. It just so happens that it’s his eleven-hundredth birthday. Naturally, the Chu Family’s place will be bustling with noise and excitement. Even if the one who has arrived is a sham, with Grand Master Chu there, who could possibly cause trouble? If even someone as powerful as Grand Master Chu is unable to stop them, how could you possibly stop that sort of powerful character?”","“Okay. I understand.”","He hurriedly replied and quickly arrived at Chu Qingyi’s side. He smiled and said, “Sorry for keeping you waiting for a long time, milord. The system has already been maintained and verified your identity. There’s no problem, you can go in.”","Chu Qingyi did not respond. She looked him up and down a few times before returning to the aircraft.","Under the staff member’s gaze, the aircraft slowly passed through and flew to the surface.","The Chu Family was located on Beast Overlooking Peak.","It was close to the sea on the Heavenly Double Star and near the Spirit Beast Mountains, where it was a forbidden area for the Radiant Institute.","No matter what, Zhang Han and Chu Qingyi could not disturb the Chu Family.","Actually, many members of the Chu family would frequently go to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven to train or tour the various planets like the Heavenly Double Star.","However, no one recognized them, and they didn’t make it public. To a few lower-ranked factions, the Chu Family was mysterious.","However, powerful forces like the Radiant Institute knew a lot about the Chu Family. They knew exactly how many members it had and what they looked like.","The Beast Overlooking Peak where the Chu Family lived was not a mountain. Instead, it was a mountain range extending for several tens of miles. Its surface area was very vast.","Arriving at the edge of the Beast Overlooking Peak, Chu Qingyi took out her token. Using energy, she opened the Bounded Domain maintained by Heaven-earth Formation surrounding the peak.","“This is the place of the Chu Family.”","Chu Qingyi said in a low voice, “One can take an aircraft in a tenth of the outer region. In the inner region, one can only fly at low altitudes.”","“Alright.”","Zhang Han nodded.","It was very normal. Some patriarchs valued their places and didn’t allow to have aircraft to fly randomly, and that was why they would make such a rule.","After flying for two minutes, they arrived at a mountain range where the aircraft was parked. After they disembarked, Chu Qingyi wheeled Zhang Han to stroll in the jungle.","“Who are you?”","Suddenly, more than a dozen men and women ran over.","The leaders were two men and a lady in their twenties. The rest were around seven to twelve years old.","They ran over to Chu Qingyi. Upon seeing a stranger, the lady in her early twenties asked, “You seem quite familiar.”","Chu Qingyi was silent for a moment before carefully examining them.","“We’re all twenty. I should have seen them before.”","The Chu Family didn’t have many people, only a few thousand. Almost everyone in the same generation knew each other, except for those geeks.","The two men in front of her were twins. The lady had a thin face and big eyes. She had a ponytail and looked lively.","After a few seconds of silence, Chu Qingyi said, “I’m Chu Qingyi.”","“I see. Wait, what?” The lady was suddenly stunned by those words. “Chu Qingyi? Chu Qingyi? Are you the foster daughter of the Patriarch? You should be Cousin Qingyi then.”","Looking at her pleasantly surprised look, Chu Qingyi felt somewhat relieved.","“Cousin Qingyi?”","The twins looked at each other.","“Cousin Qingyi, didn’t, didn’t something happen to you in the secret realm?” The lady asked, “Do you still remember me?”","“I can’t tell.” Chu Qingyi shook her head slightly.","Girls would change a lot after they grew up. She might have met her when they were young. When they matured, she almost couldn’t recognize her.","“I’m Chu Youyou, Chu Qi’s daughter,” Chu Youyou said.","“Okay. Noted.” Chu Qingyi faintly smiled.","The two twins did not say anything and their faces were grim.","“Ahem.” One of them seemed to be reminding her. “It’s great that Cousin Qingyi is back. She will get to be attending a wedding soon. The Grand Master is coming back as well. It’ll be his 1100th birthday and it’ll be such a lively time.”","Those words made Chu Youyou’s face change slightly.","She said with some uncertainty, “Cousin Qingyi, the person you are wheeling, uh, is he our cousin-in-law?”","Swoosh!","Chu Qingyi blushed immediately and hurriedly said, “No, no.”‘","“You haven’t returned to the Chu family for more than a decade. I heard from the elders that you and Cousin Qing had a love triangle. Now she is going to get married to Young Master Dong from Red Snow Mountain. Cousin Qingyi, you shouldn’t have come back during this time. Why don’t you stay at my place for a few days and go over after the wedding? Or you can have this man pretend to be your Cultivational Partner first?”","Chu Youyou was rather attentive and felt that Chu Qing’s return at this time was like a groom-stealing attempt. Back then, Chu Qing liked Young Master Dong, but he was still attached to Chu Qingyi.","Chu Qingyi pursed her lips and shook her head. “When will Chu Qing get married?”","“Seven days later.”","“That will be too late.” Chu Qingyi knew that Zhang Han didn’t want to waste time at all.","“Then how about staying at my place for a few days?” asked Chu Youyou.","She didn’t want to intervene, but she was still on Chu Qing’s side. After all, she knew Chu Qing, and Chu Qing was the Eldest Lady of the Chu Family. She wasn’t familiar with Chu Qingyi.","“The patriarch is also not here. Reportedly, he went out to see the Grand Master,” Chu Youyou added.","“Not here?” Chu Qingyi frowned slightly.","At this time, Zhang Han said, “Let’s rest for a few days first.”","“Okay.”","Chu Qingyi nodded and looked at Chu Youyou. “Cousin, sorry to trouble you these few days.”","“It doesn’t matter. I’ll take you there right away.” Chu Youyou gave the twins a look.","The two understood her meaning.","It wasn’t until Chu Youyou and the others left that they said seriously, “Brats, listen up. Do not mention Chu Qingyi’s matter to anyone. Understand?”","“Brother, it won’t be a big deal even if we tell anyone about her. Chu Qingyi is just the patriarch’s foster daughter, and she doesn’t have high status. Even if Young Master Dong likes her, it wouldn’t change anything. This engagement has been settled by the families from both sides.”","“You know nothing. Are you trying to upset Sister Qing?”","“...”","After saying a few words, the twins continued to move forward.","As for those mischievous brats, they were not tight-lipped. The news of Chu Qingyi’s return soon spread.","“What did you say?”","Chu Qing, who was sitting in her room, suddenly stood up and looked straight at one of her cousins. Her face changed slightly. “Chu Qingyi is really back? She is not dead?”","“Yes. She went to Chu Youyou’s place. Young Master Dong will be here in a few days. It’s best if Chu Qingyi doesn’t appear.”","Chu Qing was stunned and sat on the chair in a daze.","Her long hair reached her waist and her appearance could still be considered gorgeous, but in the end, she was still inferior to Chu Qingyi.","At that moment, Chu Qing had a complicated expression on her face.","Did she regret it?","She had left Chu Qingyi in the lurch back then. For a long time, thinking about it made her feel regretful.","However, her romance was her priority.","“It’s good news that she’s alive, but she shouldn’t have come back.”","The complicated expression on Chu Qing’s face slowly disappeared. She let out a long sigh and laughed. “Chu Qingyi is back, but she didn’t even come to visit me?”","“Cousin, it’s said that Chu Qingyi came back with a cripple. She said that he wasn’t her Cultivational Partner, but they were alone. Maybe there’s a relationship between them,” the girl said.","“She didn’t even give a notification while taking an outsider to the Chu family. Chu Qing has been away for more than ten years. Is she fully fledged?” Chu Qing sneered and waved her sleeve. “Send someone to keep an eye on her. I don’t want to see her on the days when I’m picked up.”","“Got it.”","The girl left the room slowly.","Chu Qing sat on the chair for a long while before she murmured in a low voice, “Since you’re not dead, that means I owe you nothing.","“You’re not welcome to my wedding. I hope you’re smart enough and behave yourself. Otherwise, don’t blame me for being rude.”","In the beginning, they had a good relationship, but later, they became enemies.","There was only a single reason for that, which was that Chu Qing was not good-looking enough.","Back then, when Chu Qingyi was in the Chu Family, she was also an outstanding disciple and followed the prescribed order of cultivation. She was now also an outstanding talent of the younger generation.","As mentioned to the younger generation, unexpectedly, news of Chu Qingyi’s return had just spread, and someone organized a gathering of the younger generation.","That person was one of Chu Qing’s younger cousins, who was in her early twenties.","She announced proudly, “Three days from now, we will hold a gathering of the younger generation at Chu Youyou’s place. You are all welcome to participate. I believe all of you understand what I mean.”","The implication was that they should go over to try out Chu Qingyi’s skills and see what was going on."]},{"number":1411,"title":"Chapter 1411 Targeted","paragraphs":["Chapter 1411 Targeted","The news of the gathering of the younger generation gradually spread among the Chu Family’s youngsters.","Even many elders knew about it.","But now was a special moment. Although Chu Qingyi had come back, no one offered to go over and visit her.","Some of the elders that Chu Qingyi had once contacted were there.","“Forget it. She’s not coming. We’ll just pretend that we don’t know she’s here.”","“We’ve also heard about what happened back then. Now that Young Master Dong is going to become Chu Qing’s Cultivational Partner, it’s best to have fewer troubles.”","This was what a few elders agreed.","The key was that Patriarch Chu was not at home, and they couldn’t decide on the matter.","However, the juniors didn’t think so.","“Chu Qingyi is back?”","A handsome white-clothed man put his hands behind his back and said gently, “It’s good that she’s not dead.”","“Young Master, will you go to the party held at Chu Youyou’s place in three days?”","“Do you think I should go and join in the fun?” the white-clothed man asked.","“I don’t think so. The patriarch hasn’t returned yet, so the matter hasn’t been decided yet. Also, you’re now a standout among the Chu family’s young generation, and there’s no need to lower your status to go over.”","“That’s true, but it’s not bad to occasionally lower my status and experience the feeling of looking down on all living things.” The white-clothed man smiled proudly.","His man’s expression changed. “Young Master, do you plan to go over? Shall I give them a reply then?”","“Sure.”","As soon as the man in white finished speaking, he moved, leaving shadows in the void. He jumped into a pool and began to wield his sword. Sword Qi was dancing and erratic.","He was a standout of the Chu Family’s younger generation after all.","He did have the strength.","It was because many people didn’t want to disturb Zhang Han that he was having a quiet time.","Three days passed in the blink of an eye.","“Master, it’s been three days. There’s still no news of Patriarch Chu. How about I’ll go to Second Grandpa Chu? Although he is not in charge, his status in the Chu Family is quite high,” Chu Qingyi offered.","“Since he’s not in charge, it won’t help even if you go to him. Let’s just wait for a few more days.” Zhang Han shook his head slightly.","“I have seven or eight days. It won’t help if I go out to look for my family. I might as well wait here and see what happens.","“If the Chu Family can’t help me find them, I’ll have to think of another way.”","“Master, you haven’t laughed for a long time.” Chu Qingyi thought for a moment and said, “Without Ma’am and Mengmeng around, you wouldn’t be in a good mood.”","“Yeah.”","Zhang Han sighed softly and said, “I’m very worried about them. Mengmeng is still young and hasn’t experienced the outside world alone. I’m afraid that she will be wronged, bullied, and in danger. As for my wife, I’m more worried about her. My father has a basic strength close to the God Transformation Realm. My mother’s strength is rather low, but she has enough social experience. My grandfather is an experienced martial artist. I’m not worried about him, and nor am I worried about Changqing, Zhao Feng, and Mu Xue. But Chen Chuan, Zhou Fei, Liu Jiaran, and some others have relatively weak strength. There are many uncertain dangers in the Cultivation World.”","“I’ll help you find them as soon as possible,” Chu Qingyi said in a firm tone. After thinking for a while, she added, “We won’t waste any time.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and said, “Whether we waste time or not will depend on the situation. We’ll just calmly keep waiting here. Patriarch Chu should be back soon.”","“Okay, I see. Master, shall I wheel you around to enjoy the scenery nearby?” Chu Qingyi asked.","“No, thanks. Let’s cultivate,” Zhang Han said and began to close his eyes to have a rest.","These days, he didn’t just lie on the sofa. His mind was constantly evolving the fighting methods suitable for his body. When his Immortal Body of the Five Elements reached the Mastery Realm, the power of the Space-splitting Punch would increase several times, but he also needed other means. With Zhang Han’s great experience, some of his occult arts and supernatural powers had gradually taken shape.","He had been thinking about how to continuously improve recently.","Chu Youyou’s residence was located on a small peak.","It was a manor with several high-tech buildings. There were antique houses as well as green grass, ponds, and lotus flowers. There were also many spirit beasts wandering on the large grass, and the most eye-catching one was a white horse.","When it was almost dusk, the courtyard in Chu Youyou’s place became lively.","Young men and women came one after another and gathered on the lawn, preparing for the party.","“Sister Youyou, when will you take me to the Oller Star again?”","“I want to go there too, Sister Youyou. Oller Star is such a fun place!”","“Hey, if you want to go out to have fun, you need to get your parents’ permission first. Without their permission, I don’t dare to take you out casually.”","“Sister Youyou, how do you get to go out at will?”","“Because I’ve grown up. Get it? You can also do that when you grow up.”","Chu Youyou had a good relationship with several children in their teens.","There were already fifty or sixty people gathered here, chatting in groups of three or five, and there were only 12 or 13 10-year-old children.","“Why is Chu Qingyi not here?”","“In terms of seniority, Chu Qingyi can also be considered our cousin.”","“What cousin? She is the patriarch’s adopted daughter, not his biological daughter. Without blood lineage, she would always be an outsider.”","“Cousin Qingyi is very beautiful. I still remember that I said I wanted to marry her. At that time, I was only seven years old.”","“...”","Those groups of three or five were talking a lot.","They chatted with each other first. It was not hard to tell that there were six or seven core figures present. They were all in their respective circles, and they were popular like the moon surrounded by stars.","Among all kinds of delicacies, the gathering had officially begun.","Right at this moment-","“Brother Kuangfeng is here?”","“What?”","“Cousin Kuangfeng is also here actually?”","Under everyone’s gaze, Chu Kuangfeng, the man in white, came over in a gentle and elegant manner. As a standout among the younger generation, he became the focus of the crowd as soon as he showed up.","“Brother Kuangfeng!”","“Come and take a seat over here.”","Many people greeted him.","Chu Kuangfeng nodded slightly and sat down on the edge. He looked around and did not find the person he wanted to see.","“Brother Kuangfeng, I heard that you have even mastered the Aurora Slash, one of our family’s three great occult arts?”","“I wonder if we’ll get a chance to see you perform it.”","“I’ve only learned a little of it,” Chu Kuangfeng said indifferently. However, there was still a trace of pride in his gaze.","To be able to master the Aurora Slash, he was comparable to some of the middle-aged men in the Chu Family.","Among the younger generation, he was fully deserving of being number one.","At this time, one of Chu Qing’s younger sisters said, “Youyou, we are not here just to enjoy some delicious food. Shouldn’t you go and invite Chu Qingyi over? She has been here for a few days. Shouldn’t she come over and say hello to us?”","“Cousin Qingyi doesn’t talk much. She’s not likely to come over.” There was someone in the crowd who spoke up for Chu Qingyi, who was also a young talent.","He had a good relationship with Chu Qingyi. When she got into the accident back then, he was 14 years old.","“Chu Ni, don’t talk nonsense.” The person next to him quickly pulled him back and said via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “Chu Qing is going to marry Young Master Dong soon. There was a dispute between them back then, so it’s better not to kick up a fuss at this time. After all, Chu Qing is the beloved daughter of the patriarch. It’s not good to make the situation awkward.”","Chu Ni frowned slightly, but in the end, he nodded slightly.","“She doesn’t talk much, but she’s not mute,” the woman chuckled and said. “Chu Youyou, we’re all very curious about Chu Qingyi. Some of us even forgot what she looks like. It’s not appropriate of you to keep us from meeting her.”","“Cousin Qingyi likes peace and quiet, so I arranged for her to stay in another residence. How about...”","Before Chu Youyou could finish her words, the woman interrupted her and said, “Why don’t we go there and invite her over together? You can’t represent her. How would you know that she doesn’t like parties?”","As soon as she said that, someone immediately echoed.","“That’s right. I remember that Cousin Qingyi used to like parties the most. She always dressed very beautifully.”","“Let’s go together. We wouldn’t know if she would like to join us before we get an answer.”","Before Chu Youyou could say anything, more than a dozen people stood up, which put a lot of pressure on her. It was as if they were forcing her to give in.","This gathering was not hosted by Chu Youyou. She did not have much say in the family. Thus, at this moment, she had no choice but to agree to their request. “Fine. I’ll take you there and ask her about it. It will be none of my business whether she chooses to participate in the gathering or not.”","The group of more than a dozen people followed Chu Youyou to the edge.","The atmosphere at the gathering became a bit weird.","Many people were chatting with Chu Kuangfeng, and he was perfunctory with them.","A few minutes later, Chu Youyou and the others arrived at the place where Zhang Han was staying.","They also saw the two people in the yard.","“Cousin Qingyi, there is a gathering. All the juniors of the Chu Family are present. Do you want to join us?” Chu Youyou asked.","“No,” Chu Qingyi replied simply.","She still didn’t talk much.","“Hey, Cousin Qingyi, there are a lot of your acquaintances in the gathering. You should at least go say hello to them, right?” A woman said, “Besides, you have brought a man back. Shouldn’t you introduce him to everyone?","“Not interested,” Chu Qingyi said indifferently.","“Chu Qingyi, it’s not good for you to do this.” A man, who was about the same age as Chu Qingyi, said, “We’re all very happy about your return. You...”","He had prepared a lot to say.","Before he could finish speaking, Zhang Han raised his hand and said, “Let’s go.”","Chu Qingyi’s face froze for a moment. Then, she nodded and wheeled Zhang Han to leave with them.","On the way to the gathering, the ones who had been talking grew silent.","When they arrived at the venue, Chu Qingyi looked around, nodded her head to greet everyone slightly, and sat down without saying anything.","“Cousin Qingyi, it’s so good that you’re back alive!” Chu Ni was pleasantly surprised. “Cousin Qingyi, you’re getting more and more beautiful.”","“Yeah.”","Someone else echoed and praised Chu Qingyi first.","In less than a minute, someone changed the subject when he spoke.","“Sister Qingyi, who is the man in the wheelchair next to you? Why don’t you introduce him to us? Is he our cousin-in-law?”","“He is my master.” Chu Qingyi looked at her indifferently.","“There may be some schemes behind this gathering. If these people have any tricks up their sleeves, they can just use them. I’ll take them.”","“What?”","“He’s actually Cousin Qingyi’s master?”","“Chu Qingyi, how come you’ve acknowledged an outsider as your master? Have you forgotten the family rules?”","“According to family rule No. 60, you are only allowed to get a teacher and not allowed to get a traditional master. Those who violate this rule will be expelled from the family.”","“Cousin Qingyi has been away for more than ten years. It seems that she no longer has our family in her heart.”","“...”","A lot of words were quite aggressive.","However, Chu Qingyi was a woman of few words.","She frowned and said in a cold tone, “What a bunch of wimpy kids. You’re in no place to comment on the way I handle things.”"]},{"number":1412,"title":"Chapter 1412 Whom Do You Think You Are","paragraphs":["Chapter 1412 Whom Do You Think You Are","As soon as Chu Qingyi finished speaking, Chu Ni suddenly laughed and looked at the stunned crowd with a playful expression.","There were three different kinds of people present. Half of the crowd was hostile to Chu Qingyi while many others were onlookers. There were very few people who were partial to Chu Qingyi, and Chu Ni was one of them.","“Huh.”","Chu Kuangfeng, the most powerful youngster of the Chu Family, lightly smiled, picked up the teacup, and took a sip of tea.","“Chu Qingyi, you’ve only been away for more than ten years. How can you be so arrogant? How dare you call us wimpy kids? Brother Kuangfeng is still here. He’s","number one among the younger generation of the Chu Family. His reputation has spread far and wide,” someone said.","It seemed that they wanted to use Chu Kuangfeng to teach Chu Qingyi a lesson or to suppress her.","Someone chimed in.","“Yeah. Sister Qingyi, you haven’t been back for more than ten years. There are many young talents in our family, and Brother Kuangfeng is the most outstanding one. He is even deeply loved by Second Grandpa and the patriarch.”","“Since you have acknowledged an outsider as your master, you must have learned a lot of moves. Why don’t you exchange a few with Brother Kuangfeng? It’ll help broaden our horizons, and we’ll also get to see how powerful your master is.”","“He’s a man in a wheelchair. How strong could he be? Maybe he was beaten into that state.”","The sarcasm in those voices became more and more intense.","This made Chu Qingyi’s face completely turn cold. “What did you say? If you dare to talk nonsense again, I’ll cut off your tongue.”","A trace of pressure spread out, which made people’s faces slightly change.","“Chu Qingyi, you’ve just returned. First of all, you haven’t visited your elders. Secondly, you’ve brought an outsider with you. Thirdly, you’ve acknowledged this outsider as your master. Not to mention that you’ve broken the rules, it doesn’t make sense for you to threaten your own family now,” said the man who was about the same age as Chu Qingyi.","“Chu Qingyi has just returned. It’s indeed not appropriate for her to exchange some moves with me.”","At this time, Chu Kuangfeng suddenly spoke. His eyes were a little playful. He looked at Zhang Han and said, “Since you are Chu Qingyi’s master, let me compete with you in martial art.”","Clatter!","All of a sudden, there was an uproar in the field.","Many people were extremely excited.","They thought that it couldn’t be more appropriate to let Chu Kuangfeng suppress Chu Qingyi.","“Young man, why don’t you get out of your wheelchair and compete with Brother Kuangfeng?”","“Yeah. Since you’ve come to our Chu Family as a guest, you should at least show us respect by exchanging a few moves with him, right?”","“Let me do it.” Chu Qingyi’s face was ice-cold. She suddenly stood up, intending to teach this group of boys a lesson.","“Chu Qingyi.” Unexpectedly, Chu Kuangfeng smiled and shook his head. “I’ve just said that you’ve just returned. It’s not good for you to compete with me.”","“There’s nothing wrong with that,” Chu Qingyi said coldly.","Chu Kuangfeng shook his head repeatedly. He looked at Zhang Han and said, “Since you came here, you haven’t dared to say a word. I’m very suspicious of how you became Chu Qingyi’s master. If you can defeat me, maybe...”","Upon hearing his words, Zhang Han glanced at him indifferently and gently said, “Who do you think you are?”","“What?”","At first, the people present were quite dumbfounded. They couldn’t even believe their ears. “Did I mishear him?","“Wait... The others all look shocked. It seems that I didn’t mishear him.”","All of a sudden, it became quiet in the field.","As for Chu Kuangfeng, his face gradually became gloomy. He stared at Zhang Han with a fierce fighting spirit and said with a fake smile, “You’re a man in a wheelchair, and yet you dare to ask me that question?”","“Aha.”","Zhang Han smiled, shook his head slightly, and said lightly, “Let’s go back.”","“Okay.”","Chu Qingyi glanced around with cold eyes. She did not say anything more and left directly.","As soon as they took a few steps, the crowd burst into an uproar.","“Bah, he doesn’t even dare to fight Brother Kuangfeng, and he pretends to be a supermundane master. That’s just hilarious.”","“Shameless! He’s too shameless! Talking is all he can do!”","“Does he think that he can be very presumptuous in this place just because Chu Qingyi is here?”","“How dare you! Stop right there!”","Even Chu Kuangfeng’s lackeys were about to step forward to stop them.","Unexpectedly, Chu Kuangfeng raised his right hand and looked at their backs with a faint smile, saying, “We’ve already greeted Chu Qingyi since her return. It’s not appropriate for us to fight today. We just need to watch the show.”","Seeing his expression, Chu Qing’s little sister immediately came to a realization.","Chu Kuangfeng was talking about the matter between Chu Qing and Young Master Dong. In fact, after more than a decade, Young Master Dong might not have had any feelings for Chu Qingyi, but it was unknown whether someone would bring up the past again.","“He wouldn’t be trying to cause trouble, right?”","Chu Qing’s little sister’s heart skipped a beat.","After all, although Chu Qing was the Eldest Lady of the Chu Family, she was still a female. Chu Kuangfeng represented the outstanding talent of the young generation and he received attention. Also, Grand Master Chu would return this time, and Chu Kuangfeng would definitely be groomed. In terms of status, his was actually a bit higher.","It was also because of this that Chu Qingyi had a slightly worried look on her face when they left the party venue.","“Chu Kuangfeng is now the talent of the Chu Family and has a good relationship with many elders. If he is behind...”","Chu Qingyi was worried that this would affect the progress of the matter and waste time.","“It’s nothing. There are some things that cannot be forced. Just try your best,” Zhang Han said.","“I see,” Chu Qingyi replied.","They returned to their residence.","Zhang Han set up some crystal stones around the yard and a hidden Heaven-earth Formation.","With Zhang Han’s formation skills, no one could find it.","In case the Chu Family’s Grand Master was too tyrannical, he had to leave a way out. To put it bluntly, it was a formation used for escaping.","If there was only Patriarch Chu who was in the Early Stage of the Integration Realm, Zhang Han would not be worried. He was just afraid that Grand Master Chu, who was allegedly at the Peak Stage of the Integration Realm, had broken through to the Mastery Realm.","In just a dozen years of cultivation, Zhang Han had reached the Void-refining Realm Early Stage and was a top genius in the entire Cultivation World.","But compared with some aged monsters, he was still a little inferior.","That was why Zhang Han had to make more preparations.","The sullen atmosphere at the banquet lasted for more than ten minutes.","Almost all of the people were speaking for Chu Kuangfeng. However, Chu Kuangfeng did not seem to mind what Zhang Han had said.","He was the only one who knew whether he really minded it or not.","Even Chu Youyou said, “That man is indeed a bit over the line.”","It was easy to imagine that they were almost going to denounce Zhang Han.","But since Chu Kuangfeng didn’t challenge him, no one else could steal the limelight.","The matter was left unsettled.","It was quietly spread among the elders of the Chu Family that night, the man Chu Qingyi had brought back, who was her master, spoke rudely to Chu Kuangfeng by saying “who do you think you are?”","“So arrogant. He seems to have forgotten who he is and even dares to talk big in our territory,” an older senior said.","“Chu Qingyi is just an adopted daughter, after all.”","“When the Patriarch comes back, let him know everything.”","In the eyes of these elders, what Zhang Han said was equivalent to disrespecting the Chu Family head-on.","Since he was so arrogant, the Chu Family would definitely not be indifferent.","However, it was not good for anyone to overstep their boundaries and teach him a lesson.","Finally.","On the fifth day.","Chu Youyou ran to the courtyard where Zhang Han and Chu Qingyi lived, which was like a quadrangle.","“Cousin Qingyi, the Patriarch is back. He’s very happy to hear that you’re back. He asked you to wait for him in the Azure Dragon Palace,” Chu Youyou said. Her expression was slightly complicated. She hesitated for a moment as if trying to remind her of something, but in the end, she did not say anything.","However, her expression seemed to have reflected the situation.","It was just that there were bad rumors recently.","It didn’t matter to Chu Qingyi.","Chu Qingyi said, “Master, I’ll go pay him a visit now.”","“Go ahead,” Zhang Han nodded and said.","Only a few minutes after Chu Qingyi and Chu Youyou left, Zhang Han’s eyes moved slightly. He looked to the side and saw a figure flying over quickly from mid-air and landing in the pavilion aside.","There was a trace of solemnness on Zhang Han’s face. He could feel that the person who came had been in a high position for a long time and was hostile.","“What is your name?” the middle-aged man asked coolly.","“I’m just a nobody.” Zhang Han looked him up and down and said, “You asked Chu Qingyi to wait for you, but you came here. If you have anything to say, just say it.”","“Hahaha, interesting.”","The square-faced middle-aged man chuckled and then his smile gradually disappeared. He asked, “Are you from the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven?”","This time, Zhang Han just ignored him.","The middle-aged man was not anxious. After five seconds of silence, he suddenly got up and approached Zhang Han until he was two meters away from him.","He looked him up and down, saying, “You’re in a wheelchair. Were you born disabled? Or is it an acquired disability? Well, it doesn’t seem to be glorious either way. Let’s not talk about this. I heard that you are Chu Qingyi’s master?”","Zhang Han still did not respond.","He didn’t want to bother him at all.","The middle-aged man laughed as if he were performing a one-man show.","“Chu Qingyi is my adopted daughter. Back then, I saw that she was a pretty girl with good cultivation talent, so I took her as my adopted daughter. I thought that in the future when she got married, she would get me a nice relationship with some powerful force.","“But her cultivation speed is getting faster and faster, which makes people look at her with new eyes. Unfortunately, more than a decade ago, something unexpected happened in the secret realm. I thought she had died, but I didn’t expect that she would come back now. This is a great joy.","“Without Chu Qingyi, our Chu Family would still be powerful. With her around, it would only be adding icing on the cake.","“As for what I want to tell you, even if Chu Qingyi is someone that our Chu Family does not want, who do you think you are... to be her master?”","He emphasized the words “whom do you think you are”, which was what Zhang Han previously had said.","Zhang Han was still silent.","These didn’t seem to affect his mentality at all.","Patriarch Chu smiled faintly when he saw this.","“Since you have come, you are a guest. Regardless of whether or not you understand the rules of the Chu Family, I will solve the problem after Chu Qing’s wedding. Young man, don’t think that you can act unscrupulously here just because Chu Qingyi got your back. She is nothing to our family. She is merely a woman. Furthermore, do not think that the Chu Family members have a very good temper. If you wish to leave this place, you will after defeating Chu Kuangfeng.”","After that, Patriarch Chu snorted, turned around, and left.","Zhang Han looked at his back several times and shook his head slightly.","It was obvious that Patriarch Chu valued boys more than girls.","He had come here to express his stance and help Chu Kuangfeng vent his anger.","Zhang Han understood that he was protecting his family, but he wanted to slap him for his male chauvinism."]},{"number":1413,"title":"Chapter 1413 Marry Her Off Along with Chu Qing","paragraphs":["Chapter 1413 Marry Her Off Along with Chu Qing","After thinking about it, Zhang Han decided to let it go. He was currently full of energy, but he could only make a move once. If he wanted to make a second move, he would have to constantly take drugs and recover.","It was not worth it to waste his energy on Patriarch Chu.","“Alas!”","Zhang Han sighed softly, looked at the scenery in front of him, and murmured, “If my daughter were here and heard him talking to me like this, she would definitely be anxious, hahaha.”","At the thought of Mengmeng, Zhang Han felt better.","But it only lasted for a few minutes before he became depressed again.","“Mengmeng, wait for me to pick you up.”","Zhang Han touched his forehead.","He was also very worried about Zi Yan’s situation.","Although she had Tiny Tot with her, Zhang Han would still be worried.","Just like Zi Yan and Mengmeng, they also missed him all the time.","He had thought that he would soon rule the world and pick up them in an invincible manner.","He never had thought that he would end up like this.","If they saw him like this, they would definitely feel extremely distressed.","However, if he was beside Zi Yan and Mengmeng, Zhang Han would not have been lying on the sofa all day.","On the other side.","Chu Qingyi was currently in the Azure Dragon Palace.","There were more than a dozen elders in the hall.","Chu Qingyi knew all of them. When she walked in, she greeted everyone.","“It’s good to have you back.”","“I didn’t expect that you would come back after more than ten years. We were also very sad when we heard that you had an accident at that time.”","“It’s just that I’ve heard from some juniors that you’ve got an outsider to be your master. Is that true?” someone asked.","As soon as those words were said, everyone was silent, waiting for Chu Qingyi’s answer.","If she said that it wasn’t true, then it didn’t matter. They would just teach the man a lesson.","However-","“That’s right. I brought my master back this time.” Chu Qingyi directly admitted it in front of everyone.","Smack!","“This is absurd!”","The oldest man slammed the dragon chair and said, “That’s ridiculous. Chu Qingyi, as a member of the Chu Family, how could you recognize an outsider as your master?”","“I’m the adopted daughter of the Chu Family, and I’m not a family member officially,” Chu Qingyi replied calmly.","“What?”","What she said made many people present quite dumbfounded.","“What did she say?”","“You, you are so rebellious.” The old man was so angry that he glared at Chu Qingyi. His momentum was surging. It seemed that he wanted to teach her a lesson.","At this moment, Chu Qingyi smiled coldly.","“Back in the secret realm, I saved Chu Qing’s life. A life for a life. It’s just that I didn’t die. She has your nurture and care, so I don’t think I owe you anything. So, you don’t need to use any statements as elders to lecture me.”","She was not a woman of many words, but her words made others rendered speechless.","The old man did not know what to say for a long time.","The main reason was that he didn’t know the inside story.","“A life for a life?”","He didn’t know about it, and even the other elders didn’t know.","“Qingyi, you said you saved Chu Qing in the secret realm?” a beautiful woman asked.","“Let’s not talk about the past,” Chu Qingyi said. “What I want to say is that I can be considered half a member of the Chu Family. Seniors, please don’t put pressure on me with righteousness. I know what I should do.”","His words were a little harsh, but they made the crowd even more shocked and suspicious.","“Could it be that something happened in the secret realm?”","“In fact, I think you’re right.” The beautiful woman smiled and said, “Qingyi, you haven’t been back for more than ten years. I agree with you on acknowledging your master. But as for the Patriarch, you’d better inform him about it properly. May I know your master’s name and strength? Please tell us so that we can rest assured.”","“I don’t know about Master’s cultivation level.” Chu Qingyi shook her head.","If soft tactics didn’t work, then hard tactics would.","A middle-aged man snorted and said, “He’s lying in a wheelchair all day long. He’s just a good-for-nothing. What strength can he have?”","“Third Uncle Chu, be careful with your words.”","Chu Qingyi’s eyes turned cold.","The power of the Void-refining Realm Early Stage spread out.","A treasured sword would turn sharp due to tempering.","At this moment, Chu Qingyi was like an unsheathed sword, which was sharp and stunning.","Her eyes were fixed on the middle-aged man who had spoken rudely.","How many Void-refining Realm experts were present?","Less than five people.","Although the Chu Family was powerful, not every one of the members was.","Moreover, how many years had it taken them to reach the stage of the Void-refining Realm?","“You, you’ve reached the Void-refining Realm?”","The old man on the stage suddenly opened his eyes wide.","The others could not help but gasp.","Void-refining Realm masters were the backbone of the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven. In the Chu Family, one would be a high-position official if one was in the Void-refining Realm.","Chu Qingyi was only about thirty years old.","As a Void-refining Realm cultivator, she had the right to join the Four Great Sects and could even develop to become a chief supervisor or protector in the future.","When the crowd thought of this, the atmosphere in the hall became a little strange.","“I’ve obtained an opportunity back then, and I’m confident in my own strength. If any of you elders want to exchange moves with me, I’m willing to play along,” Chu Qingyi said with a cold smile.","It was actually a warning.","Chu Qingyi felt that these elders were a little too arrogant.","Even though some of them were friendly, they were still suppressed by others.","“That’s fine. I would just reveal my realm then.”","In the Cultivation World, the strong were respected.","The Void-refining Realm was not a low level here.","“Terrific. Qingyi, you’ve actually reached the Void-refining Realm!”","Suddenly, a pleasantly surprised voice came from outside the hall.","Patriarch Chu came over in a hurry with a smile.","“Patriarch.”","Chu Qingyi didn’t call him “Foster Father”.","This made Patriarch Chu’s eyes dim slightly, and he felt unhappy.","“We have two things to celebrate now. Chu Qing is going to marry Young Master Dong, and you’ve come back. How wonderful.” Patriarch Chu laughed out loud.","“Patriarch, I have something to ask the family for help,” Chu Qingyi said.","“What is it?” Patriarch Chu asked,","Chu Qingyi hesitated for a moment and said, “We want to find some people who are in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.”","“No problem.” Patriarch Chu nodded gently and said, “After Chu Qing gets married, we’ll talk about it in detail. Come on, Qingyi, take a seat and talk to us. Where have you been all these years? Have a talk with us...”","When Chu Qingyi heard this, she felt helpless. However, she still sat down and perfunctorily said some unimportant things.","During this period, she also beat around the bush and said that she wanted to find some people.","However, Patriarch Chu, the wily old fox, did not agree to it face to face. His attitude was ambiguous. He wouldn’t help until Chu Qing was married.","Chu Qingyi had no choice but to say a few words to the elders before returning to her residence.","She then told Zhang Han about the situation, which was as he had expected.","Patriarch Chu wouldn’t easily agree.","However, since Chu Qingyi had revealed her cultivation of the Void-refining Realm at the Early Stage, the Chu Family would also attach great importance to it. After Chu Qing got married, they might still be willing to help her.","However, accidents were always happening.","Young Master Dong was here.","It had been six days since Zhang Han and Chu Qingyi had arrived at the Chu Family’s place.","Young Master Dong was dressed in white. He descended from the sky at noon and landed directly in the courtyard like the arrival of Patriarch Chu.","“You’re back?” Young Master Dong was quite handsome. He had a high nose bridge and big eyes. At this time, he was looking at Chu Qingyi with a complicated expression.","Chu Qingyi glanced at him and said, “I didn’t expect you to have some informants in the Chu Family.”","Since he knew that she was here, it must have been some insider who told him.","“After learning that you died in the secret realm, I was extremely sad.” Young master Dong seemed to be infatuated with her.","However, she had no feelings for him.","Chu Qingyi shook her head slightly and said, “Young Master Dong, there’s no need to say all of this.”","“Haha, I like your aloof appearance.” Young master Dong laughed.","“You’re getting married to Chu Qing tomorrow. Don’t you think it’s a little inappropriate for you to come to my place today?” Chu Qingyi frowned slightly and looked at the sky.","“What’s wrong with it?” Young Master Dong laughed and said, “I’ve been flirted with by so many girls but never got close to any of them. I just wanted to get close to you, Chu Qingyi, but you didn’t give me a chance.”","Judging from Young Master Dong’s expression, he was not frivolous. Instead, he seemed a little carefree.","Swoosh!","A figure quickly flew over.","“Young Master Dong, why are you here?” It was a woman, Chu Qing’s younger sister. With a smile on her face, she said, “Our Eldest Lady is waiting for you to see her in the bedroom.”","“Okay.”","Young Master Dong nodded and left with the woman,","Chu Qingyi did not respond at all.","However, Zhang Han suddenly said, “This is not a simple man.”","“What?” Chu Qingyi was stunned for a moment.","Under her somewhat confused gaze, Zhang Han said softly, “He’s also a member of the Devil Shadow Clan. Judging from his aura, he awakened much earlier than you. This means that his strength is at least at the Void-refining Realm Middle-Stage.”","“What?!”","Chu Qingyi was a little taken aback.","She was not shocked by the strength of Young Master Dong, but by his status as a member of the Devil Shadow Clan.","A few seconds later, Chu Qingyi asked curiously, “Master, how could you tell?”","Zhang Han smiled without saying anything.","The Heaven-earth Formation in the yard was not just a decoration.","But Zhang Han felt that it was the Young Master Dong who deliberately leaked a trace of his aura.","“What’s the relationship between him and Chu Qingyi?","“It seems that tomorrow’s wedding banquet...” Zhang Han was lost in thought.","He felt that it was not as simple as it seemed.","But it was none of his business, and he didn’t care about what others were planning.","Young Master Dong came to the Chu Family one day earlier. His first stop was Chu Youyou’s house to meet Chu Qingyi. Was it a revival of old love?","This matter caused many of the Chu Family elders to be extremely displeased.","That night, the Chu Family’s place was decorated with lanterns and ribbons.","The joyful atmosphere began to spread.","Early the next morning.","The force that Young Master Dong belonged to was led by the Sect Leader, and more than a dozen core members had arrived.","The leader of the group was the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak.","He was as famous as the Chu Family’s Grand Master and had a prominent reputation.","Patriarch Chu was a little confused when he saw him.","Logically speaking, there was no need for the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak to personally attend this sort of occasion.","“Senior Aurepeak, please take a seat.”","Patriarch Chu, together with dozens of core characters, welcomed them with faces full of smiles.","“There’s no need for the courtesy, Patriarch Chu.”","Everyone began to chat here.","The wedding ceremony was also being prepared.","“Patriarch Chu.”","Young Master Dong’s father, Sect Leader of the Red Snow Mountain, said with a smile, “When we talked last time, we agreed not your daughter, Chu Qing, but your adopted daughter, Chu Qingyi to marry my son. It’s a good thing that our kids are getting married, and our two families can now bond. But I really liked Chu Qingyi from back then. I have a request. I wonder if you can consider it.”","Originally, he would need to wait for Patriarch Chu to ask what was his request.","However, the Sect Leader of the Red Snow Mountain simply said, “My son will marry Chu Qing. After they get married today, as a maid, Chu Qingyi will also marry him as a maid. My son loves her much, and this will make our two families closer. As for the betrothal gifts, I’ll give the amount ten times greater than before. What do you think?”","The plot was revealed in the end.","Patriarch Chu’s eyes narrowed slightly.","“So this is the reason why the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak has personally come over.","“He came here in person for the sake of Chu Qingyi?","“What’s so nice about her?”","Patriarch Chu didn’t quite understand since he valued boys more than girls.","But he had really considered this matter.","Patriarch Chu waved his hand and said, “Men, go and get Chu Qingyi over.”"]},{"number":1414,"title":"Chapter 1414 Big Brother Hanyang","paragraphs":["Chapter 1414 Big Brother Hanyang","When the crowd saw Patriarch Chu’s response, everyone in the Chu Family thought that he would agree.","After all, they knew that he preferred boys over girls.","They thought that it didn’t seem to be much of a big deal to give Chu Qingyi away as a bonus.","But Patriarch Chu obviously would not easily agree to this matter.","He smiled and said, “A few days ago, when my adopted daughter, Chu Qingyi, came back, I was very happy. I even specially invited several elders of the family to welcome her back. Chu Qingyi has worked hard. She has been outside for more than a decade, and her cultivation has reached the Void-refining Realm Early-Stage. I even reported this matter to the Grand Master. He is very gratified and has a very good impression of Chu Qingyi. If I agree rashly to let her marry into your family, it will be hard for me to make things right for our Grand Master.”","“Is that so?” The expression of the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak changed slightly. He waved his hand and said, “Since Brother Chu also knows, I’ll talk to him in person when he comes back.”","As soon as he said that, Young Master Dong became excited.","He never would’ve imagined that the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak would actually speak up on his behalf.","The person with the highest status present was the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak. The Chu Family had used their Grand Master as an excuse, who was a bit more powerful than the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak.","However, he still insisted on talking Grand Master Chu into it.","Young Master Dong couldn’t help but sigh with emotion.","“Grand Master went to visit an old friend a few days ago. He may come back tonight,” Patriarch Chu said with a bright smile.","“Patriarch Chu, do you have any objections to this marriage? We can talk about it,” the Sect Leader of the Red Snow Mountain said with a smile.","In his opinion, Patriarch Chu undoubtedly thought that the leverage was not enough, so he might as well add some more. Anyway, Red Snow Mountain was rich.","After thinking for a while, the Sect Leader of Red Snow Mountain said something to Patriarch Chu via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","Patriarch Chu’s eyes narrowed slightly. After two seconds of silence, he smiled.","“In fact, I also agree with this matter. Chu Qingyi has been with Chu Qing since she was a child. They grew up together and are good sisters. I can rest assured if they can be together with Young Master Dong.”","What he said meant that he had roughly agreed to this matter.","Before the laughter of the Sect Leader of the Red Snow Mountain could spread, Patriarch Chu suddenly changed the subject.","“But I’ve never intervened in the juniors’ relationship affairs. Chu Qing likes Young Master Dong, but Chu Qingyi may not like him. When she gets here, I’ll ask her about her opinion first, and then we can discuss it.”","“Alright.” The Sect Leader of the Red Snow Mountain nodded.","He snorted in his heart. “Greedy.”","He had thought that Patriarch Chu was merely asking for extra betrothal gifts, so he directly agreed to offer precious treasures. However, Patriarch Chu still did not agree to the matter right away.","“What does Patriarch mean by this?”","Several elders of the Chu Family secretly transmitted their voices to each other.","“Chu Qing is his biological daughter, and Chu Qingyi is his adopted daughter. He is going to marry both of them to Young Master Dong at the same time? Isn’t that a little too indecent? He thinks too highly of the Mount Blood Sect.”","“That’s right. Our family is more powerful than the Mount Blood Sect. How could he do this?”","Some people couldn’t understand why Patriarch Chu would do this.","In the end, this matter was heard by Chu Qing, who was doing her makeup.","Smack!","Chu Qing was so angry that her face turned livid. She smashed the things in front of her.","“Chu Qingyi! Why did she come back at this time? What’s so good about her that Young Master Dong can’t forget about her? Why?”","She vented her anger.","The maids were scared out of her wits.","However, the ceremony had to be held at noon. After a short while, Chu Qing calmed down.","After about half an hour, Chu Qingyi walked into the Dragon Phoenix Palace.","“Hmm?”","When the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak and the others saw that Chu Qingyi was wheeling a man, they couldn’t help but size him up.","“This is Chu Qingyi’s teacher who taught her martial arts in the outside world. She brought him back to attend Chu Qing’s wedding and pay a visit to the Chu Family,” Patriarch Chu said.","“He is my master,” Chu Qingyi said in front of everyone. Then, she greeted them. “Greetings, Red Snow Mountain Leader, Patriarch.”","Patriarch Chu didn’t respond, and his face was even slightly darkened.","The patriarch would be very angry when a woman from his family dared to deny his words in front of him.","“Alright.”","The Sect Leader of the Red Snow Mountain smiled and said, “Chu Qingyi, you’re indeed very beautiful. No wonder you could charm my son.","“I’m way flattered,” Chu Qingyi replied in neither a servile nor overbearing manner.","“A talented man and a beautiful woman. You are a match made in heaven,” said the Red Snow Mountain Master.","As soon as he spoke, some of the core members on his side echoed.","“Yeah. Young Master Dong has adored Qingyi since he was a child.”","No matter what the people of Red Snow Mountain said, Patriarch Chu did not say a word.","He seemed to have forgotten what had just happened.","The crowd gradually fell silent.","Chu Qingyi wheeled Zhang Han to the left. It was as if they were here to watch the fun.","“Chu Qingyi.”","Patriarch Chu said, “Just now, I promised to have you marry Young Master Dong with Chu Qing. It’s still early. Go backstage and dress up. When the ceremony begins, you two can go on stage together.","What he said was very abrupt.","But it made the Red Snow Mountain Master laugh.","Young Master Dong looked pleasantly surprised as he looked at Chu Qingyi with a smile.","“Congratulations, Young Master Dong.”","The others congratulated him in succession.","Chu Qingyi’s expression changed slightly.","She had offended the patriarch a little just now. She knew that he was not happy.","“If I refuse it now, I will completely break off relations with the Chu Family.","“I won’t get to handle Master’s affairs, and we have wasted so much time here.","“What should I do?”","Chu Qingyi was stuck in a difficult position.","“Patriarch Chu, you shouldn’t have been so hasty to make such a decision.”","The atmosphere had just been a little lively and joyful, but with Zhang Han’s words, it fell into silence.","Many people’s eyes were fixed on Zhang Han. Some were scrutinizing him, some were cold, and some were dissatisfied with him.","In short, none of them gave him any nice looks.","“What did you say?” Patriarch Chu’s face darkened.","“Chu Qingyi doesn’t have any biological parents with her. She has performed the apprentice ceremony with me. I’m her master, so I’m also like her father. Therefore, I won’t agree to let you marry your adopted daughter off, Patriarch Chu,” Zhang Han said calmly.","“Master.” Chu Qingyi gently bit her lower lip with a complicated expression on her face.","“Don’t be like this.” A voice suddenly sounded in Zhang Han’s ear,","It was Young Master Dong’s voice transmission. He said something in a hurry.","Zhang Han frowned slightly.","After looking back and forth between him and Chu Qingyi thoughtfully, he finally shook his head slightly.","“Chu Qingyi grew up in my Chu Family. I am her adoptive father, and I raised her. Who do you think you are? What right do you have to give orders in the Chu Family?” Patriarch Chu said coldly,","“You’re too arrogant.” Another high-level official of the Chu Family slammed the table and stood up. He glared at Zhang Han and said, “How dare you! If it weren’t for the great event today, I would have killed you just because of what you said just now!”","Zhang Han took a look at the person who spoke.","He was at the Void-refining Realm Middle-Stage.","He seemed to be tyrannical.","However, he couldn’t even defeat Chu Qingyi in terms of real strength.","The only person whom Zhang Han was afraid of in the hall was the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak, who was watching the fun from aside.","He was at the Integration Realm Peak-Stage.","The gap between them was too great.","However, Zhang Han could still escape.","Fortunately, he had already prepared for this.","At this time, he glanced around and said calmly, “Do you think you’re infallible? Qingyi, let me ask you, between the Chu Family and me, who will you listen to?”","When Chu Qingyi made a decision, she never hesitated. When she heard this, she said directly, “I’ll listen to you, Master.”","Swoosh!","Patriarch Chu’s expression kept changing.","In the end, his face turned livid.","“Very well. Men, capture these two pieces of trash and take them to Hurricane Cliff!”","Hurricane Cliff was the place where the Chu Family was specially built to imprison sinners. It was under a cliff that howled with hurricanes all year round. The Heaven-earth Formation there was set by their Grand Master.","When someone was blown by the wind there, he would feel as if a knife were cutting him.","Generally speaking, only those who had made a big mistake would be sent to Hurricane Cliff.","“Patriarch Chu, there’s no need to get angry.”","Just as someone from the Chu Family was about to take Zhang Han and Chu Qingyi away, Young Master Dong quickly said, “I have some feelings for Chu Qingyi, but there are some things that can’t be forced. Patriarch Chu, I appreciate your kindness. It’s already my luck to have Chu Qing accompany me.”","“Chu Qingyi, hurry up and apologize to your adoptive father. Do you want to be locked up with your master?” a female senior said sternly,","In fact, she was also giving Chu Qingyi a way out.","By doing so, Chu Qingyi would be fine. However, her master would still have to be punished.","But no one would ever expect Chu Qingyi to be so stubborn.","“Let’s go, Master.”","Chu Qingyi knew that she would definitely not be able to get their business done.","She was about to wheel Zhang Han to leave.","At this time, Zhang Han was also ready to cast a spell to let them leave here as soon as possible.","The atmosphere was tense.","“Hasn’t the ceremony begun yet?”","A faint voice rang out from the plaza outside.","“The Grand Master has returned!”","Patriarch Chu’s expression changed, and he immediately stood up and took the lead to welcome Grand Master Chu.","The Sect Leader of the Mount Blood Sect, Young Master Dong, and the others also got up and followed him. When the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak passed by, he glanced at Zhang Han and Chu Qingyi.","He said with a faint smile, “It would appear that you all will not be able to escape punishment today. Grand Master Chu’s temper is not very good. Girl, if you are to agree to the marriage, I will protect you and your master.”","After saying this, he walked out of the hall.","Outside the hall, Grand Master Chu’s long beard fluttered as he and an old friend slowly descended from the sky.","“Grand Master.”","“Grand Master.”","The people of the Chu Family greeted him in succession.","“Brother Chu, you’ve finally returned,” the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak said with a laugh.","Grand Master Chu smiled faintly as he said, “Brother Azurepeak, I was in a hurry to return because I heard that you were coming. I’m glad that I managed to make it in time.”","“This is the Old Taoist Honghu. Seeing how lively my Chu Family is today, he insisted on coming here to take a look.” Grand Master Chu couldn’t help but laugh.","It seemed that he and Old Taoist Honghu were good friends.","“Old Taoist Honghu? The one who established the Sky Suppressing Lake?” Patriarch Chu was stunned.","“Greetings, Senior Honghu.” The Sect Leader of the Red Snow Mountain greeted.","“Greetings, senior.”","The others spoke successively.","The atmosphere was lively.","At this time, in the main hall.","“Master, things are not going well. Shall we escape through the back door?” Chu Qingyi reminded Zhang Han in a low voice,","“Wait a minute.” Zhang Han frowned and looked at Grand Master Chu with a little confusion.","However, he also took out a gem with his right hand. He could activate the formation at any time and leave as fast as he could.","“Grand Master, Senior Honghu, Senior Azurepeak, please come in,” Patriarch Chu said with a smile.","At the same time, he waved his hand and gave instructions to a middle-aged man, “Take those two out.”","“Who?” the middle-aged man asked subconsciously.","Patriarch Chu felt helpless and glared at him. “Those two irrelevant people!”","“Oh, I see.”","The middle-aged man was just about to take action.","Looking at Patriarch Chu’s expression, Grand Master Chu glanced at the hall. He recognized Chu Qingyi, so he asked, “Which two?”","Chu Qingyi had reached the Void-refining Realm Early-Stage at such a young age. Grand Master Chu thought highly of her.","Patriarch Chu had a bad temper and in front of the old ancestor, there was no need to pretend, so he said honestly, “The two trash that affects the atmosphere.”","“I see.”","With the guests around, Grand Master Chu didn’t say much about the matter, and he was not in charge of the household affairs.","But when he took the lead to walk into the hall, before he could get inside, he saw the person in the wheelchair clearly.","Buzz!","Grand Master Chu’s expression changed drastically. His eyes bulged and they nearly popped out of their sockets.","When he stopped, Patriarch Chu, who was following closely behind him, bumped into him.","“Grand Master, what’s the matter?” Patriarch Chu asked in a trance.","“Brother Chu? What are you doing?” The Taoist Lord of Azurepeak didn’t know what was going on.","Beside him, Honghu also asked curiously, “Old Chu, what’s wrong?”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","More and more eyes were focused on Grand Master Chu’s face.","He looked like he was suffering from a seizure. His facial muscles kept trembling, and even his beard was trembling. He looked like he was having a serious illness.","Clatter!","Patriarch Chu’s heart skipped a beat. “Could it be that the Grand Master is sick?”","However, what happened next completely stupefied Patriarch Chu and made him dumbfounded.","Everyone saw the Chu Family’s Grand Master, who was over a thousand years old, trembling. He stretched out his right hand and wanted to go forward, but he did not dare to move.","It was not until ten seconds later that he asked in an incomparably trembling voice, “Big... Big Brother Hanyang?”","“What?”","Countless gasps could be heard all over the place.","Everyone’s eyes were fixed on the man in the wheelchair.","“What?","“Big Brother Hanyang?","“Grand Master Chu calls him Big Brother?”","At this moment, the surroundings were deathly silent, and countless people felt a chill run down their spines as if they had a blade to their backs.","Under the watchful eyes of everyone, Zhang Han looked at Grand Master Chu with a faint smile and said, “If I remember correctly, you are... Chu Zheng?”","Rumble!","Patriarch Chu staggered and felt a lack of oxygen in his brain.","However, the blow had only just begun.","“Yes, yes, I’m Little Zheng. Big Brother Hanyang, do you still remember me?”","They saw that Grand Master Chu was as happy as a child.","Rumble!","It was as if a bolt from the blue had struck them.","Patriarch Chu’s legs went limp, and he collapsed to the ground.","“Not good!","“Poor me...”"]},{"number":1415,"title":"Chapter 1415 The Title of Han Yang Immortal","paragraphs":["Chapter 1415 The Title of Han Yang Immortal","Poof!","Many people in the Chu Family were almost choked to death by their own saliva.","“Chu Qingyi’s master is actually Grand Master’s Big Brother?","“How is this possible?","“He is still so young. How could this be?”","The Sect Leader of the Red Snow Mountain and the others were also dumbfounded.","The most powerful figures present were none other than Patriarch Chu, Old Taoist Honghu, and the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak.","Of the three, the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak was slightly inferior, while the other two were roughly on par with each other.","They thought that everyone would be having a good time by merely entering the hall to have a good chat.","Who would’ve thought that Chu Qingyi’s master was found to be Grand Master Chu’s Big Brother?","“Good heavens!”","Young Master Dong was dumbfounded.","“Where did Chu Qingyi get her master? He’s so awesome!”","“Hurry up, get the banquet ready.”","Ancestor Chu waved his hand and said in a happy and hurried tone, “Take out all the finest treasured liquors in the house.”","“Yes, yes, yes.” Patriarch Chu, who was sitting limply on the ground, quickly patted his butt and stood up. He seemed to be making the arrangements.","“There’s no need to drink. The Chu Family doesn’t welcome me very much.” Zhang Han’s expression became calm.","No one had paid attention to Zhang Han’s calm expression before. Some people even sneered in their hearts. “Are you putting on airs?”","However, now, everyone was looking at Zhang Han’s calm expression.","They instantly felt that it was unfathomable.","Humans were truly strange.","Hearing Zhang Han’s words, Grand Master Chu was stunned. He glanced at the expressions of the Chu Family members and seemed to have understood something. His facial muscles trembled, and everyone could hear his anger and even a trace of shock.","He looked at Patriarch Chu coldly and said, “When I’m not around, did anyone of you neglect my Big Brother Hanyang?”","“Shit!","“I’m doomed!”","Patriarch Chu broke out in a cold sweat. In just a few seconds, his back was soaked with sweat, and he felt as if he had fallen into an ice cave.","“Little Zheng, calm down. Those who are ignorant are innocent.” Zhang Han waved his hand.","His expression was still calm.","However, Grand Master Chu’s face was slightly pale, and his beard was trembling with anger.","“Who has neglected my Big Brother Hanyang? Step forward!”","The most powerful person on the scene was Grand Master Chu. When he was angry, his aura rippled out.","“He’s in the Mastery Realm!”","Zhang Han slightly narrowed his eyes.","He also felt a little strange and uncertain.","“Although I took care of Chu Zheng a bit back then, it will be troublesome if he turns against me.”","After thinking for a while, Zhang Han added, “Forget it. Patriarch Chu didn’t make a mistake. He only said to me, ‘who do you think you are’. It’s just a small matter. It’s just verbal disrespect.”","“What?!”","Patriarch Chu’s eyes widened as he raised his right hand.","Smack!","With a fierce slap, Patriarch Chu was sent flying.","Clatter!","The Chu Family members were all shocked.","Previously, they thought that Grand Master was just angry on the surface, or he just wanted to show it to Brother Hanyang. But now, after this slap, Patriarch Chu’s skin and flesh were torn open and he was almost dead. Grand Master didn’t seem to be joking at all. In their opinion, he even wanted to kill someone.","He was already showing mercy since it was the Patriarch. If it were someone else, he would have been crippled.","Not only the Chu Family members but also the Sect Leader of the Red Snow Mountain and the others were frightened.","The Taoist Lord of Azurepeak grinned, a bit dazed.","Old Taoist Honghu looked left and right but did not dare speak.","“Alas!”","Zhang Han sighed softly and said, “Patriarch Chu really didn’t do much. He just wants to lock me up at Hurricane Cliff, right?”","“You!”","Grand Master Chu flew into a rage. “Guards, lock this bastard up at Hurricane Cliff!”","“Grand Master.”","A senior from the Chu Family said in a tearful voice, “Grand Master, you can’t do that. The Patriarch is very diligent and he also...”","“Very well. Since you are so loyal, then go with him and you’ll be locked up as well.” Grand Master Chu’s words were very effective. After the surrounding people heard those words, they immediately grabbed Patriarch Chu and the person who just spoke and locked them up.","Zhang Han touched his chin and said, “It is indeed not easy for Patriarch Chu.”","Patriarch Chu was desperate.","“Boo-hoo. I beg you to stop talking.”","“Earlier, he said that if I wanted to leave, who should I defeat first? That young genius?” While speaking, Zhang Han glanced at Chu Qingyi.","“It’s Chu Kuangfeng.” Chu Qingyi’s mouth trembled slightly.","She was confused and wanted to laugh.","“Master is simply too evil.”","“Chu Kuangfeng? Come out now. Get lost! Lock them up together!”","Grand Master Chu glared around. His irascible temper was finally revealed. Those who had a good relationship with Patriarch Chu in the crowd were all pointed at by him. He said, “You, you, and you, all of you, go to Hurricane Cliff and repent!”","This time, more than half of the people were given the order to go to Hurricane Cliff.","“What?”","“Grand Master!”","Some people were dumbfounded and wanted to plead for mercy, but they were quickly pulled by the people around them.","“How dare you speak at this time?”","Under other people’s gazes, Patriarch Chu and a large number of people were escorted to Hurricane Cliff.","“Brother Chu, today is a day of great joy. Why don’t we have a good chat with this Big Brother and temporarily set this matter aside? You’ll punish them tomorrow.” The Taoist Lord of Azurepeak couldn’t help but try to persuade him.","“Set this matter aside? A day of great joy? No, that won’t do. We won’t hold the wedding today. I’m going to only entertain Brother Hanyang today. I won’t do anything else.” Grand Master Chu’s bad temper rose.","He didn’t show due respect for feelings at all.","Taoist Lord of Azurepeak let out a bitter laugh and then shook his head helplessly.","At the same time, the crowd was even more curious about the identity of the person in the wheelchair.","“Is he Grand Master Chu’s relative?”","Young Master Dong, the Red Snow Mountain Leader, and the other high-position members of the Chu Family did not dare to speak at this time.","Grand Master Chu didn’t even let this matter go for the sake of the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak, so even if any other people said anything, it wouldn’t work.","“Big Brother Hanyang, please take a seat.”","Grand Master Chu didn’t want to waste time on others. He flashed into the main hall and waved his hand, saying, “You just stay by the side. I’ll wheel Big Brother Hanyang.”","“Grand Master, Master is not used to being wheeled around by others,” Chu Qingyi explained in a low voice.","“Is that so?” Grand Master Chu looked back and forth between Zhang Han and Chu Qingyi and suddenly came to a realization. “Sorry, it’s my fault for being nosy. You’ll wheel the wheelchair and let’s go sit over there.”","Judging by his expression, he must have thought that Chu Qingyi was Zhang Han’s woman.","Zhang Han sighed and was wheeled to the main seat by Chu Qingyi. Grand Master Chu sat down beside him, looked ahead, and ordered, “The others can leave now. Go and prepare for the banquet.”","“What?","“Who are ‘the others’?”","Everyone looked at each other. The Chu Family members left immediately, and no one dared to stay there. Even their patriarch was taken away, so they were definitely “the others”.","Aside from the Sect Leader, Young Master Dong, and the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak, the rest of the people from the Red Snow Mountain all retreated.","When the crowd left, Old Taoist Honghu felt that it was the right time.","Sitting aside, he asked with a smile, “Well, we haven’t known who this Big Brother is.”","Judging from his appearance alone, Old Taoist Honghu was even older than Zhang Mu.","It was still a little weird for him to call Zhang Han that.","“Ha, let me make a grand introduction. This is my, um... first cultivation teacher, Han Yang Immortal.”","As soon as those words were said-","Poof!","Old Taoist Honghu’s eyes were wide open and his body was numb. He immediately sat upright, but he seemed to feel that it was not respectful enough. He quickly stood up and stood still with a confused look on his face.","“Poof! Ahem, ahem...”","Taoist Lord of Azurepeak and the Red Snow Mountain Master both spat out a mouthful of water. They coughed twice, not daring to make a sound. They were so stifled that their faces were completely red.","“Han, Han Yang Immortal?”","Old Taoist Honghu stammered, “Brother Hanyang, nice to meet you.”","He had a good relationship with Grand Master Chu. All along, he had heard Grand Master Chu say many times that he once had a particularly amazing teacher. When he talked about his first cultivation teacher, Grand Master Chu’s eyes were always filled with reverence and yearning.","He had cultivated for 1,200 years, but it was less than 1% of the time his teacher had cultivated.","What sort of terrifying natural endowment and strength was that?","Moreover, those who could be called Immortal Masters were at least at the fourth tier of the Tribulation Stage.","It was no exaggeration to say that even those at the Tribulation Stage First Tier were already invincible in these people’s eyes.","Not to mention that Zhang Han was in the fourth tier.","There were nine tiers in the Tribulation Stage. The battle power of someone in the Tribulation Stage would double with each tier he advanced.","“Greetings, Immortal Master. Please forgive me for offending you earlier,” the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak said as he rose to his feet, his voice trembling.","He was really scared.","“Greetings, Immortal Master,” the Red Snow Mountain Leader said respectfully.","“Greetings, Immortal Master.”","Young Master Dong came to his senses and immediately greeted Zhang Han.","“You’ve also offended my Big Brother Hanyang?” Grand Master Chu suddenly turned to look at the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak.","“Well...” The Taoist Lord of Azurepeak was completely stunned.","He could even hear his own heartbeat, and he was extremely nervous.","Immortal Masters were lofty figures who were moody. Occasionally, some of them would pass by the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.","There were some who obtained shocking opportunities. After receiving a bit of guidance, their accomplishments would be limitless.","When some people offended the Immortal Master by just saying something unpleasant, they could be killed with a snap of the Immortal Masters’ fingers, and no one could stop them.","There were even several large sects that had died in the hands of some Tribulation Stage experts.","How powerful were those people?","This was why the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak was beginning to feel a bit terrified.","He didn’t know what the relationship between Chu Qingyi and Han Yang Immortal was. “If she is his woman... I acted as a peacemaker and even said something arrogant in front of him. If I offended him, the consequences will be unimaginable.”","“He didn’t offend me. He just said something, which was not inappropriate.” Zhang Han shook his head slightly.","He also felt a little strange.","If Mengmeng, Zi Yan, and the others were by his side, Zhang Han would probably laugh out loud and even have a funny talk.","But at this time, he was not in the mood to do that.","Perhaps Grand Master Chu had already noticed something.","He said, “You can go out and have a rest first. I have something to talk about with Brother Hanyang.”","“Okay, we’ll leave you to the room. See you later, Brother Hanyang,” Old Taoist Honghu said with a smile.","“Brother Hanyang, I’ll punish myself with three jars of wine later for saying the wrong thing previously,” the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak said.","They excused themselves one after another and walked out of the main hall.","During this period, Young Master Dong was in a daze and subconsciously glanced at Chu Qingyi.","“Life is always full of surprises.","“Chu Qingyi got an Immortal Master to be her master.","“Is he simply her master, or is there something going on between them?”","Young Master Dong didn’t know what was the deal between them.","He kept thinking about some dirty scenes.","“Why are you still here?”","Grand Master Chu glanced at Chu Qingyi.","The look on his face revealed his dissatisfaction with her staying.","He didn’t show any mercy to her at all. It was as if all Grand Master Chu cared about was Brother Hanyang at this time.","Zhang Han said, “She can stay here.”","After he met with some old friends, the little secret between him and Zi Yan that he was reborn from the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier was almost about to be made public.","Chu Qingyi didn’t know about this yet. When she heard what Grand Master Chu said, she was stunned on the spot.","“Brother Hanyang.”","Grand Master Chu’s face was filled with respect, confusion, and fear.","“When you were at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier, you were required to take divine tribulation and attracted the legendary divine thunder over the sky. Thousands of Tribulation Stage experts personally witnessed it. But I heard that you didn’t manage to survive.”","“Huh.”","Zhang Han smiled faintly and said with a little emotion, “I didn’t make it, so now I’m half-crippled. Maybe you can kill me with just one finger.”","Hiss!","Grand Master Chu gasped and said, “Please don’t joke with me, Brother Hanyang. I wouldn’t dare to hurt you.”","“The divine thunder over the sky has a great impact on me.” Zhang Han sighed softly and said, “But it’s a wonderful impact. Who knows if it’s a blessing in disguise?”","He was reborn and started a family. He had Zi Yan, Mengmeng, his parents, a sister, etc. He had a good life and was happy.","It was all thanks to the divine thunder over the sky.","Otherwise, what fun would there be in life if he was alone for his entire life?","That was what he thought, but when Grand Master Chu heard his story, he was stunned. “What?! Brother Hanyang used to be so powerful, and now he’s having an even better life? “Doesn’t that mean his natural endowments are several times more terrifying?”","He was really shocked.","But he was also very delighted and said happily, “Congratulations, Brother Hanyang. Hahaha, if you encounter the divine thunder over the sky again this time, you will just smash it with your fist! You’re so invincible!”","Zhang Han was silent for a moment.","It seemed to be a misunderstanding.","“I’m not that strong now. You can think of it as that I’m still recovering,” Zhang Han said.","“Got it. The divine thunder over the sky is so terrible. It will take you some years to recover.” Grand Master Chu smiled and said, “Brother Hanyang, your strength hasn’t recovered yet. You should stay at our place for the time being, right? If you need something, I’ll just get it for you. When you recover, I think... I want to go out with you to broaden my horizons. I haven’t been to the Center Galaxy yet.”","While speaking, Grand Master Chu looked a little coy.","Chu Qingyi felt a chill run down her spine when she saw that.","“By the way, Brother Hanyang, there is something very strange.”","Grand Master Chu said, “Sect Leader Ning told me the news about you. He has been back several times. He said that there is no longer the legend of Han Yang Immortal in the entire Cultivation World.","“I asked him what he meant. He said that many people don’t know Han Yang Immortal, and they hadn’t even heard of the title. It’s strange because many experts have seen you passing the tribulation with their own eyes. It took Sect Leader Ning decades to understand that only those who were familiar with you could remember you. The others don’t know about you. It’s as if Han Yang Immortal’s deeds had been erased from those people’s memories. This is terrifying to think about.” Grand Master Chu said, “What kind of power can affect the Cultivation World?”","When Zhang Han heard this, his eyes narrowed slightly. After a moment of silence, he said, “Maybe it’s because of the Law of the divine thunder over the sky. I didn’t summon the divine thunder alone. I can feel that there’s only one divine thunder in the Cultivation World. It’s not difficult for it to follow some patterns or change some rules. It doesn’t matter if the world knows me or not.”","“You’re still so carefree.” Grand Master Chu smiled bitterly and said, “If it were me, I would definitely not be able to reach this state of mind. I wonder why you came to my family this time?”","“I need to get something trivial done. It’s not convenient for me to go around now, so Qingyi suggested that we come to the Chu Family to pay a visit. I didn’t expect to see you here,” Zhang Han said.","“That’s a great surprise. Hahahaha.” Grand Master Chu laughed and said, “Fortunately, you’re here. Otherwise, how many years would it take for me to see you again?”","The implication was that they could only meet when Zhang Han was undergoing his tribulation.","“I was afraid you would forget about me.” Grand Master Chu said with a smile, “Over the years, I’ve experienced life and death many times. Every time I’m in a life-and-death situation, an image would always flash across my mind. You said to me when I was young that there’s no such thing as a situation where there are sure deaths.","“This sentence has a great impact on me. As the saying goes, there would always be a slim chance of survival even if there is a crisis. I worked hard and finally found a way out in several secret realms. Now I have reached the Mastery Realm. It took me 1,200 years to do that, which is very excellent, isn’t it? Well, am I awesome in this respect?”","Grand Master Chu looked at Zhang Han with expectation.","He seemed to want to get some praise.","Chu Qingyi was a little stunned when she saw this.","She couldn’t understand how much impact it would have on a young man when Zhang Han went through the tribulation and gave him guidance.","It was an experience that affected Grand Master Chu’s cultivation much.","Moreover, Zhang Han was now taking Chu Zheng on a tour for some days.","Grand Master Chu thought much of his first cultivation teacher.","“Now that you have advanced to the Mastery Realm, you can be considered a genius.”","Zhang Han nodded, and his tone seemed a little reluctant.","Chu Qingyi was very skeptical. “Is this a compliment?”","Unexpectedly, Grand Master Chu laughed and said, “Thank you for taking care of me back then, Brother Hanyang. Otherwise, I might not have been able to become a cultivator in my whole life.”","Back then, Chu Zheng did not possess any talent for cultivation. He was only an ordinary mortal and even possessed an incomplete body.","He was a doorman in a restaurant. Because of this, Zhang Han was quite interested in him. He took him on a tour and finally changed his incomplete physique.","And now, Grand Master Chu had reached the Mastery Realm.","He knew that he had suffered a lot, so he had always regarded Zhang Han as his great benefactor.","Without Zhang Han’s enlightenment at the beginning, he would have had no opportunities later in his life.","“Brother Hanyang, why don’t you stay here for a few more days?” Grand Master Chu sincerely invited him.","“I’m here mainly to do something,” Zhang Han said.","“Right.” Grand Master Chu patted his forehead. “Brother, if you need anything, just say it. As long as I can do it, I’ll go through fire and water to get it done without hesitation.”","“It isn’t that serious.”","Hearing what Grand Master Chu said, Zhang Han couldn’t help laughing. After thinking for a while, he said, “After I failed to pass the tribulation, I began to cultivate again. I got married, and I have many followers. There were dozens of people with me when I went out. There was an accident and we were swallowed by space. I didn’t know where they have been scattered, so I came to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven to find them. I heard that the Chu Family has some prestige in the Astral Domain...”","“You need to find some people. Is that all?”","Before Zhang Han could finish his words, Grand Master Chu patted his chest and said, “Brother, don’t worry. Leave this matter to me. I’ll contact some old friends in person and mobilize all my forces to look for your family.”","At the same time, he couldn’t help but ask, “What kind of space devoured you? Where were you before?”","“I was in the Heavenly Dragon Star Province.”","Hiss!","Grand Master Chu gasped when he heard that.","He couldn’t imagine what kind of spatial power could transmit someone to this place from so long a distance.","“If Sect Master Ning and Elder Bai know that you’re still alive, they would definitely be delighted. Unfortunately, they are no longer in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven,” said Grand Master Chu with a smile.","“Where are they?” Zhang Han asked.","“The last time we met was in the Ocean Astral Domain. Sect Leader Ning is really amazing. He’s been training his mind since a hundred years ago and preparing to cross the tribulation. Now, he may be at the Tribulation Stage,” Grand Master Chu said with a rather emotional look.","“Really? A hundred years should be enough.” Zhang Han slightly narrowed his eyes.","Sect Leader Ning, Elder Bai, and the others were the few old friends Zhang Han had.","“Now, has the Cultivation World also become prosperous?”","They hadn’t seen each other for a long time. Zhang Han didn’t know what it would be like when they met."]},{"number":1416,"title":"Chapter 1416 The Plot Is Revealed in the End","paragraphs":["Chapter 1416 The Plot Is Revealed in the End","“Brother, you said you were looking for someone, but you don’t know their identities?” asked Grand Master Chu.","“I have the information here,” Chu Qingyi said.","“That is to say, you don’t know where they are now, so you can only look for them in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.” Grand Master Chu thought for a moment and said, “I’ll arrange it right away. This is more important.”","While speaking, Grand Master Chu waved his hand and said, “Honghu, Azurepeak, come in here.”","Clatter!","“Let’s go in.”","The Chu Family members also came in. Dozens of people stood aside.","Only Old Taoist Honghu and the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak dared to sit next to Grand Master Chu.","The rest of the people, including the Red Snow Mountain Leader, were all respectful.","After all, it was an Immortal Master that sat before them.","Some of the Chu Family’s core members of the younger generation looked extremely nervous.","On the day of the gathering, they said a lot of unpleasant things.","If Zhang Han bore a grudge against them, all he needed to issue was an order and the Grand Master would punish them severely.","Fortunately, he did not give such an order.","Zhang Han didn’t say anything about them from the beginning to the end.","This sort of disregard caused the group of juniors to be slightly discouraged.","People’s feelings were complicated.","If he ignored them, they felt that he didn’t take them seriously. If he minded what they had said, they would be scared.","“Send us a copy of all the information about those people’s identities,” said Grand Master Chu to Chu Qingyi.","“Okay.”","When Chu Qingyi heard this, she sent a message to three people.","There were photos, names, and other basic information.","“Brother Chu, what’s this?” the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak asked.","“With you here, it will save me a lot of trouble. I need your help. Brother Hanyang is looking for these people, who are all his relatives. They have been devoured by space and it is unknown where they are,” Grand Master Chu said. “Let’s use the forces we can mobilize and try our best to find them in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.”","“Let’s put up a reward,” Zhang Han said. “We’ll provide accurate information. Whoever finds a person will be rewarded with 100 million crystal stones.”","Poof!","Taoist Lord of Azurepeak almost choked on his own saliva.","How many times had he done that?","“100 million crystal stones for a person? Oh my god, it’s so crazy. How could a few billion crystal stones be given away so easily?”","The corners of Old Taoist Honghu’s mouth trembled. “I can’t wait to find them.”","“Hahaha. That’s not a big deal to him. Brother Hanyang has plenty of crystal stones and treasures.” Grand Master Chu laughed. “I once said that he was called Rich and Emperor-like Immortal Master by other experts who are at the Tribulation Stage. He is fabulously wealthy.”","“We’ll definitely do our best to get this done.” Old Taoist Honghu’s expression turned serious. “If any forces under my command find those people, we won’t take the reward. We’ll just take it as a chance to befriend Brother Zhang.”","“The same goes for me. We’re on the same side. We don’t need crystal stones,” the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak said.","It sounded like a lot of crystal stones, but they didn’t need ordinary ones anymore. Moreover, the friendly relationship of a Tribulation Stage master was so so much better.","“You’re being too courteous,” Zhang Han said helplessly.","Judging from the situation, even if they had to pay, they would do their best to look for his family.","“That’ll do. They’re very strong-willed.","“These people regard me as an Immortal Master. In fact, I’m only in the Void-refining Realm at the moment, and I can’t make a move casually.","“This seemed to be a lovely misunderstanding.","“But even so, I’ll still become a Tribulation Stage expert in the future.","“It’s also necessary to build a good relationship with powerful forces in advance.","“Given their temperaments, they will probably still offer to help if they know about the truth.","“However, they won’t be so respectful by then.”","“You should know that you guys are getting a great bargain.” Grand Master Chu said in a somewhat dissatisfied tone, “Let me tell you, even those famous Tribulation Stage experts want to run errands for Brother Hanyang, but still he let you help him. It’s really a great honor to you.”","“Hahaha, yes, the key is that we are all locals, aren’t we?” Old Taoist Honghu said with a smile, “We are familiar with the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven and many big sects. By contacting them, we will get the job done faster.”","“However, if the Four Great Sects also offer to help, it will be much simpler to get this done,” the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak suddenly said. “More than 80% of the forces here belong to them. In fact, Brother Hanyang, you can go to their Sect Leaders. We have some prestige in the Astral Domain, but we can’t compare with the Four Great Sects.”","“Why should he go to them? Do you think it’s so easy to do Brother Hanyang a favor?” Grand Master Chu asked before Zhang Han could answer.","“We’ll still benefit from this then.” The Taoist Lord of Azurepeak began to laugh.","“The Four Great Sects...” Zhang Han shook his head and said, “When I was traveling here, there were Eight Great Sects.”","“Yes.” Old Taoist Honghu nodded. “It used to be the Eight Great Sects. Later, after several great wars in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven, some sects were destroyed and some were annexed. In the end, only the Four Great Sects were left on the Vast Heaven Star. After hundreds of years of development, the alliance forces became more and more numerous. The situation changed. In the end, the Four Great Sects became the leader with thousands of subsidiary forces.”","“What’s the point of talking about that? Didn’t the Sect Leaders of the Eight Great Sects back then still have to behave themselves when they saw Brother Hanyang?” Grand Master Chu snorted. “It’s just that he doesn’t want to recruit their powers, so he came to me.”","“It doesn’t seem to have much to do with you,” teased Old Taoist Honghu.","“It’s God’s will. Someone in our Chu Family has become Brother Hanyang’s disciple. God blesses our Chu Family.” Grand Master Chu sighed with emotion.","Hearing this, Chu Qingyi had goosebumps all over her body.","“Let’s not just sit here and get down to business. Isn’t someone getting married today?” Zhang Han said.","His words worked as soon as he spoke.","Grand Master Chu said straightforwardly, “Who’s going to get married today? Let them continue.”","“Right.” The Taoist Lord of Azurepeak hesitated for a moment and then said, “Shouldn’t their parents be present when they get married?”","Hearing this, Grand Master Chu snorted and said, “Why? Patriarch Chu didn’t do a good job. He dared to offend Brother Hanyang. I won’t spare him.”","His serious attitude made everyone in the Chu Family nervous and they didn’t dare to speak. They were afraid of offending Zhang Han.","“Forget it, it’s not a big deal.” Zhang Han waved his hand slightly.","Grand Master Chu showed him much respect. His attitude was very unyielding. However, he was actually also concerned about his family’s younger generation.","He firmly believed that if Zhang Han got angry, he could kill all the people present with a single thought.","“Brother Hanyang, I’ll ask them to come out first. After the ceremony is over, I’ll lock them up. Will that be okay?” Grand Master Chu asked tentatively.","Zhang Han was quite helpless.","After he nodded, Grand Master Chu gave the order for Patriarch Chu to temporarily come out.","The wedding ceremony was held as scheduled.","As the bride, Chu Qing had also heard of what had happened earlier.","There was a super powerful man in the house, Han Yang Immortal.","He was the Big Brother of Grand Master Chu and his first cultivation teacher back then.","Also, Chu Qingyi was the disciple of Han Yang Immortal.","The news came too suddenly, and Chu Qing was a little dumbfounded.","When she heard that the wedding couldn’t be held, her face turned even paler and she looked more powerless.","She was desperate, but the surprise soon came.","“The wedding can proceed?","“Wonderful!”","Chu Qing burst into tears of joy.","She adored Young Master Dong much.","When she entered the venue, she swore that she had never been so nervous since she was a child.","The ceremony was very simple.","After she arrived, Young Master Dong lifted her red veil.","“Alas!”","Young Master Dong let out a soft sigh.","“Am I marrying the Eldest Lady of the Chu Family just like this?”","As the two of them stood in front of each other, Chu Qing couldn’t help but ask via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “Young Master Dong, do you still like Chu Qingyi now?”","“Yeah.”","After receiving the answer, Chu Qing inevitably felt disappointed.","“I like you more. You two are different.”","Young Master Dong’s leisurely words made Chu Qing overjoyed.","The two advanced together.","When they went offstage to greet everyone-","“Grand Master.”","The two of them bowed to Grand Master Chu.","But before they could bend down their waists, Grand Master Chu raised his eyebrows and said, “What’s the matter with you two? Don’t you know whom you should bow to first?”","“What?”","Chu Qing was taken aback.","Young Master Dong reacted faster.","He immediately took Chu Qing to Zhang Han.","“Senior Hanyang, nice to meet you. It’s my great honor to be able to marry Chu Qing in front of you,” Young Master Dong said.","“Nice to meet you, senior.” Chu Qing felt a little guilty. She lowered her head and did not dare to look at Zhang Han.","The gathering a few days ago was ordered by her.","If the Grand Master found out that she had offended his Big Brother, he would definitely punish her.","Zhang Han had seen countless people in his life. When he saw Chu Qing’s appearance, he knew that she was deeply in love. For the sake of Young Master Dong, she could do a lot of things, such as leaving Chu Qingyi in the lurch at that time.","Whether one was good or evil depended on whom one was dealing with, and there was no clear boundary.","However, Zhang Han still said at this time, “I think you owe my disciple an apology.”","Clatter!","Chu Qingyi’s shoulders were trembling slightly.","She felt a sense of warmth in her heart.","She had finally realized how good it felt to be cared for by her master.","Chu Qing’s face turned slightly pale when she heard that.","“Hmm?”","Grand Master Chu’s eyes narrowed.","Under everyone’s gaze, Chu Qing slowly raised her head.","She looked at Chu Qingyi and said, “I’m sorry. I love him, and I regret what I’ve done. You saved me back then, but I...”","“That’s enough.” Chu Qingyi raised her right hand, stroked her hair, and said calmly, “We’re even now. I have nothing to do with the Chu Family. I’m just Master’s disciple now.”","“Why would you have nothing to do with us?” Grand Master Chu became anxious when he heard this. “We can’t break off the relationship. So what if you’re an adopted daughter? You can still be very close to us.”","Chu Qing had a complicated expression on her face. Her mouth moved, and she wanted to say something. However, she was unable to.","“Continue.”","Zhang Han waved his hand.","Chu Qing was a little confused. “Should I continue apologizing or something?”","Fortunately, Dominic was quick-witted. He pulled her away and took the initiative to say hello to Grand Master Chu.","After they greeted the Grand Master, they needed to greet Patriarch Chu and the others who had come back.","At this time, Patriarch Chu was listless, like a frosted eggplant.","He sat silently at the side. There was no longer any arrogance in him.","“Father.”","“Father-in-law.”","Patriarch Chu got up subconsciously. He lifted his butt halfway before he sat back and nodded as he said, “Very well.”","He was also quite perturbed.","After the ceremony was over, the banquet continued.","The several thousand people from the Chu Family, as well as the people from the Red Snow Mountain, were having a sumptuous banquet in the plaza.","“Brother Hanyang, shall we have a drink?”","At the innermost table, there were only a few people, who were Old Taoist Honghu, the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak, Grand Master Chu, Zhang Han, and Chu Qingyi.","Next was the place where Patriarch Chu, the Sect Leader of the Red Snow Mountain, and the others took their seats.","They chatted for a while at the dining table.","When they were almost done eating, Grand Master Chu said, “Those who were punished just now, go to Hurricane Cliff and reflect on your mistakes for a month.”","“Yes, Grand Master.”","Patriarch Chu and the others all got up.","Seeing this, Zhang Han said, “You’ll make up for your mistakes by doing what I told you to do properly.”","After all, he was a senior.","Patriarch Chu couldn’t help but lament with emotions.","“Look at him. He spared us right when he sees fit. Judging from his bearing, he is indeed an Immortal Master. He’s amazing.”","“Get it started now. Contact the forces immediately. I’ve already sent you the identity information,” said Grand Master Chu to Patriarch Chu.","Patriarch Chu stood up and said, “I’ll absolutely do my best!”","“The same goes for you,” the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak said.","“Yes, sir,” the Sect Leader of the Red Snow Mountain replied immediately.","Several senior experts were all present. They contacted the Sect Leaders of the major sects and issued the tasks.","However, they still needed to contact some forces in person.","Grand Master Chu made contact with them right on the spot and sent some of them messages. Feeling worried, he sent people out to look for Zhang Han’s family.","The reward was 100 million crystal stones for one person found.","Under the discussion of many people, this matter began to be hyped up.","“Brother Hanyang, would you like to stay at our place for the time being?” Grand Master Chu asked enthusiastically.","“Sure.”","Zhang Han nodded. He didn’t choose to stay in the residence newly arranged for him.","After the banquet, he and Chu Qingyi returned to Chu Youyou’s house.","He began to wait.","The forces in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven were very complicated.","There were signals in each Star Area that were used for communication.","But people could only spread the news in distant places by going there personally.","Many people from the Chu Family brought Grand Master Chu’s voice transmission jade slips to personally visit the famous experts.","Under deliberate publicity, more and more forces were aware that there were rewards with more than five billion crystal stones in total that had been put up.","Originally, only 1% of the sects in the Astral Domain could be found by the Chu Family, Red Snow Mountain, and Old Taoist Honghu.","However, due to the stunning rewards, 10% of the sects had learned about the news.","This was truly incredible.","“100 million crystal stones for each person found?”","“I’ll make a fortune overnight, won’t I? Hah, I like it. It’s been decided. I’ll stop cultivating these days and go to look for those people.”","“There’s information about their names, characteristics, and appearances. The missing person notices are on all the major websites and space stations. When they take the initiative to contact us, we will get 100 million crystal stones.”","“Grand Master Chu, Old Taoist Honghu, and the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak... With their guarantee, there will definitely be no problems with the crystal stones.”","“I’m going to change the sound system of the spaceship into a sound wave. I’ll play these missing people’s names and look around. There will always be opportunities.”","“...”","It was unknown how many people were attracted by the rewards.","The influence gradually spread.","In next to no time, almost half of the Astral Domain knew about this matter.","On the Reylo Star.","“100 million for one person found?","“It’s indeed Brother Han’s style.","“Son, let’s save 200 million for your Uncle Zhang. We’ll go to the Heavenly Double Star on our own.”","Zhou Fei was leading Chen Chuan on a street filled with delicacies.","Without Chen Changqing by her side, Zhou Fei kept a low profile and became more careful.","She was also worried about her husband. However, he was the famous Emperor Qing and she believed that he would be safe with his strength.","It was already a great blessing for her to be able to stay with Chen Chuan.","“Great, we’re going to Uncle Zhang. I wonder if Daddy is with him. Is Sister Mengmeng also waiting for us there? Also, Nina and the others, Auntie Zi Yan...” Chen Chuan was extremely excited.","The two of them spent some crystal stones and took the magnetic vehicle to the space station.","The journey was long. Ten days later, they finally reached the Heavenly Double Star.","Zhou Fei, wearing a hat, led Chen Chuan to the space station and said to a man, “Excuse me. Where should I go to get the reward for finding the missing person?”","“What?!”","The man was alarmed.","“Please wait.”","He immediately ran to the person in charge of the space station, Protector Tu of the Radiant Institute.","“Lord Tu, there’s a woman outside with a wanted person.”","“Hmm? How many people are with the missing one?”","“Only one. Furthermore, it’s a woman. Judging from her aura, her cultivation level isn’t high.”","“Let’s go and have a look.”","Protector Tu immediately got up and walked out.","Along the way, he had a lot of ideas.","He had already been stuck at the God Transformation Realm Peak Stage for more than a decade.","He was at the bottom of the ranks of the protectors in the Radiant Institute.","It was unknown how many people had mocked him.","He hadn’t received many resources from the sect over the years.","“100 million crystal stones!”","With these crystal stones, he could totally buy precious treasures and break through to the Void-refining Realm. At that time, he could go to another Star Area, conceal his identity, and develop himself in a new sect. In this way, he would be able to stand out in the future.","“Shall I do it or not?”","Protector Tu hesitated for a moment.","“I’ll observe the situation first.”","Protector Tu slightly narrowed his eyes and strode over.","When he saw Zhou Fei, his divine sense immediately spread out.","It didn’t matter even if he made such a move as he was in his own territory. If the other party was an expert, he could just admit his mistake later.","“She has some protective treasures?","“She can’t notice my soul sense.","“This person is definitely below the God Transformation Realm.","“That is to say...”","Protector Tu was full of smiles. “May I confirm the identity first?”","“Okay.” Zhou Fei nodded.","“My name is Chen Chuan. I’m Chen Changqing’s Chen.” Chen Chuan was not afraid of the strange environment at all. He introduced himself.","“Please wait.”","Protector Tu held the communication device and looked at it for ten seconds. Then, he said with a smile, “Okay now. I can confirm your identity. Come with me. I’ll send you to the ones you need to go to.”","Zhou Fei and Chen Chuan followed Protector Tu, entered an aircraft, and flew to the Beast Overlooking Peak.","They were about 25 kilometers away from the peak in the deep mountains and old forests.","Protector Tu said, “We need to walk from here. The ones who are looking for you are from the Chu Family. They’re of noble status, and aircraft are not allowed to fly in the air.”","“Okay.”","Zhou Fei held Chen Chuan’s hand and got off the aircraft with him.","“Wait a minute, Miss. Please come with me. You can’t be given 100 million crystal stones until your identity is confirmed,” Protector Tu said amiably.","“I need to go with you alone?” Zhou Fei frowned slightly.","“Yes, this is a necessary procedure.” Protector Tu nodded.","He looked so harmless.","But in fact, he had already decided to make his move.","“Sorry, I can’t separate from him.” Zhou Fei shook her head and refused.","“That’s a pity. Don’t you want the 100 million crystal stones?” Protector Tu asked.","“It’s none of your business whether I want the 100 million crystal stones or not. Besides, I think you’re just the person in charge of the space station, not the person in charge of this matter. You’re in no place to tell me what to do,” Zhou Fei said in a deep voice.","“Now, why would you still struggle?” Protector Tu sighed softly, “There is a reward of 100 million crystal stones for each person found, but it isn’t stated whether he needs to be alive or dead. I’m sure that they want him alive, but there are no other specific requirements. If I kill you and disable him, I will still have 100 million crystal stones. Why don’t you cooperate with me?”","“It turns out that you want to kill and loot!” Zhou Fei was angry.","At the same time, she was even more terrified.","She was afraid. She was afraid that she would die. She was even more afraid that something would happen to Chen Chuan. Also, she was afraid that Chen Changqing would not be able to see her and their son.","“I advise you to stop.”","Zhou Fei forced herself to calm down and said, “We all have treasures with us. If you are to take action, our relatives will find out as soon as possible.","“Oh, really?”","Protector Tu grinned hideously and walked forward step by step. “It just so happens that I also have some treasures with me.”","Clatter!","He took out a ceramic jar and threw it up.","It was suspended in the air more than 10 meters above the ground. It released energy and formed a hidden Bounded Domain.","This kind of Bounded Domain could block out any divine sense, will, aircraft, and other detection powers.","The plot was revealed. He wanted to kill and loot.","“Go to hell.”","Protector Tu’s eyes were filled with cruelty and excitement."]},{"number":1417,"title":"Chapter 1417 I’m Afraid You’re Doomed","paragraphs":["Chapter 1417 I’m Afraid You’re Doomed","Protector Tu had strong killing intent.","He planned to kill Zhou Fei and then cause damage to the little kid’s soul and make him an idiot.","“Taking 100 million crystal stones to make a living elsewhere is way better than staying in the Radiant Institute.”","A sinister smile gradually appeared on his face.","A long broadsword appeared in his right hand. The blade was light blue. He slashed forward.","Like a wave of fire, the broadsword light whizzed and rushed at the mother and son.","“AH!”","Chen Chuan screamed, and his face changed greatly. He had never been in such a situation.","But Zhou Fei needed protection, so Chen Chuan didn’t hesitate. Although he was scared, he still widened his round eyes and shouted, “I’ll kill you!”","The attack of the Innateness Realm, along with the fire-like broadsword light, did not leave any impact on Chen Chuan and Zhou Fei.","“Chen Chuan, come back!”","Zhou Fei’s face changed and she quickly stopped Chen Chuan, who was about to rush forward.","The young boy was so strong that Zhou Fei almost fell from pulling him.","After all, Zhou Fei was an adult and had seen so much of the world, so she knew how to deal with the danger now.","She took out more than 30 defensive treasures at a time and activated them.","All kinds of rays of light covered her and Chen Chuan.","Together, they had about 130 kinds of sixth-tier defensive spirit treasures.","It would still take a long time for them to resist the attacks of a God Transformation Realm Peak-Stage cultivator.","“How to contact my brother-in-law?”","Zhou Fei was extremely anxious. “Brother Han, can you feel us? If you get here late, we’ll be finished.”","Bang!","On the outermost layer of light, the broadsword light caused a violent fluctuation.","With a hack of his broadsword, Protector Tu cut off half of the outer layer of defense.","“Hmm?”","Protector Tu raised his eyebrows slightly and said in surprise, “You have so many defensive spirit treasures? But it’s useless. You don’t have the strength. No matter how many treasures you have, you’re just a waste.”","While speaking, Protector Tu’s eyebrows relaxed, and a playful smile appeared on his face.","“I’ll slowly crack your treasures.”","Swoosh!","He performed an occult art and launched eight beams of broadsword light.","The outermost layer of defense trembled violently before shattering. Then, the next layer of defense was also shattered by this strike.","However, more than 30 defensive treasures could buy the mother and son some time.","The spirit treasures were a comprehensive defense. Some were capable of withstanding soul attacks while some were mainly used to defend occult arts.","At first, it took Protector Tu less than a minute to breach the five layers of defense on the periphery.","However, the following defense was extremely solid, and it took him more than a dozen occult arts to break it.","“What a tough one.”","Protector Tu snorted and said, “This can only buy you a little time. No one here can feel you here. Prepare to die.”","At this time, Protector Tu was like a farm ox. He was very diligent and constantly attacked.","Gradually, he breached 30 layers of defense.","“The last two, hahaha!”","Protector Tu’s breathing was faster than before. Obviously, he was a little tired after high-frequency attacks.","Zhou Fei was in a panic at first, but then she gradually calmed down.","She tugged at Chen Chuan’s hand and did not let him speak.","“If Elder Sister Yan were here, what would she do?”","Seeing that there were only two layers of defense left, Zhou Fei tried to think in a different way.","“Huh.”","Her face turned pale.","She raised her head and looked straight at Protector Tu, saying in a flat tone, “The last two?”","Clatter!","Without saying anything more, Zhou Fei once again took out more than 30 kinds of treasures.","These were her last batch of treasures. Next, she would need to use Chen Chuan’s.","However, when Protector Tu saw these treasures, his pupils shrank.","“Damn it!","“Why would she have so many?”","He had a faint feeling that something was wrong.","Generally speaking, people without much strength would have a powerful backer to own so many treasures.","“This won’t do.","“I have to kill her!","“Otherwise, the consequences will be unimaginable.”","Protector Tu became more determined.","“If I let her go and let her go back to her backer, who may be more powerful than the Radiant Institute, I’ll surely get killed, won’t I?","“The safest way is to leave the Radiant Institute. In that case, I still have to kill the woman and earn 100 million crystal stones.”","“If you want the crystal stones, I can give you 50 million.”","Zhou Fei used psychological tactics to slowly crack the other party’s mentality.","“Really? Okay. Come out then. I’ll take you to the Chu Family.” Protector Tu’s attack slowed.","“Ask them to come over. I’ll give you the crystal stones on the spot,” Zhou Fei said.","At this moment, Zhou Fei had already known the result.","As expected-","“You want to play tricks? Girl, you’re too inexperienced. You were still a baby when I went to explore and kill.” Protector Tu sneered and launched an attack again.","“Huh.”","Zhou Fei had no choice but to sneer to show her disdain.","But she was actually very anxious.","If this went on, she and Chen Chuan would soon run out of spiritual treasures.","“Am I really going to die?”","Zhou Fei’s heart ached.","What she didn’t know was that when the blue defensive energy on the periphery of the second batch was shattered, a will quietly spread out.","On the Beast Overlooking Peak.","In Chu Youyou’s residence.","Grand Master Chu and Zhang Han were playing chess, while the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak, Old Taoist Honghu, and Chu Qingyi were watching the fun.","A month or two passed quickly for cultivators.","Old Taoist Honghu and the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak also stayed here, intending to help Brother Hanyang with his business.","Young Master Dong and Chu Qing returned to the Red Snow Mountain.","The Sect Leader of the Red Snow Mountain, a group of high-level officials, and the high-level members of Old Taoist Honghu’s forces were also gathered there.","“Big Brother, your chess skills are really good!”","Old Taoist Honghu applauded and praised, “Amazing, amazing! Old Chu’s chess skills aren’t very good. He’s not Big Brother’s match.”","“You don’t say. Big Brother has seen many more things than us. He’s in a high state of mind, that’s why he’s good at playing chess. Even ten of Brother Chu may not be a match for him,” the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak said, unwilling to fall behind.","Zhang Han was speechless.","This kind of thing happened too frequently.","“Hahaha.”","Grand Master Chu roared with laughter. “How can I possibly be his match?”","Under normal circumstances, with Grand Master Chu’s temper, he would definitely be furious if these two people mocked him. But now, he was laughing happily after losing.","The three aged men circled around Zhang Han and called him Big Brother with great sincerity.","At first, Chu Qingyi felt very awkward, but gradually, she got used to this.","Originally, she had planned to have little to do with the Chu Family, but Grand Master Chu was unwilling to do so. Now, her status in the family had risen, and she had simply surpassed Patriarch Chu.","“Master is still the most powerful.”","Chu Qingyi glanced at Zhang Han with her beautiful eyes and thought to herself. “Even his admirers are at the Grand Master level.”","Zhang Han was playing chess, but his mind was in turmoil.","There was no way for him to calm down.","As long as he couldn’t find Zi Yan and Mengmeng, he wouldn’t be able to rest easy.","He was often impatient, and he was in a bad mood.","He kept feeling anxious and uneasy. Zhang Han’s state of mind was almost comparable to the one he had when he was demonized in the Domain of Seven Desolations.","“Alas!”","Zhang Han sighed softly and put down his piece. “Be serious.”","“I’ve taken it very seriously, but my chess skills are no match for yours.” Grand Master Chu smiled bitterly and looked at the chessboard. After a while, he shook his head and said, “I’ve lost the game again.”","“Old Chu, get out of the way. I’ll play the next game with Big Brother.”","Just as Grand Master Chu rose to his feet, a trace of will touched Zhang Han.","Swoosh!","Zhang Han’s face changed, and his eyes were fixed on the east.","Swoosh!","He made an incantation gesture with his right hand.","Clatter!","An aircraft appeared from the ground of the lawn in the backyard. It floated in the air and hovered above them. The whole process lasted less than a second.","Zhang Han moved and got into the aircraft alone.","Bang!","The aircraft operated at full speed and flew straight into the distance like a bolt of lightning.","The whole process only lasted for three seconds.","Grand Master Chu had lifted his butt halfway, and Old Taoist Honghu hadn’t reacted in time.","“Oh no, something’s wrong!” Chu Qingyi exclaimed in shock.","“Follow him now!”","Grand Master Chu and the other two immediately got up and flew into the air.","They followed Zhang Han as fast as they could. When they reached the periphery, Grand Master Chu wanted to let down the Bounded Domain.","Suddenly, he found that there was a magic formation on the aircraft, which directly broke the Bounded Domain to leave.","“What...”","Old Taoist Honghu said in alarm, “Big Brother is indeed formidable. His means are so powerful!”","“You don’t say.”","Grand Master Chu said, “Something must have happened. Can it be that his relatives are here?”","“Let’s go. Let’s take an aircraft and follow him.”","Taoist Lord of Azurepeak waved his hand.","In the parking area of the aircraft, a black aircraft quickly arrived.","They entered and caught up with Zhang Han.","Soon, they reached the destination 50 miles away.","“What?!","“Why would someone be here?","“What should I do?”","Seeing the aircraft in the distance, Protector Tu’s face changed greatly.","“Not good! I need to run now!”","He didn’t get the crystal stones, but he had to escape. Protector Tu was furious.","“Why is that?","“I have set up a barrier, but it did not work.","“I underestimated her.”","Protector Tu no longer hesitated. He picked up his own jar and immediately flashed away to take his aircraft and fly quickly to the Radiant Institute.","There was no turning back for him after what he had done.","When the Radiant Institute discovered this matter, they would definitely punish him severely.","He might as well take the opportunity to find a way to get some treasures from the treasure house before he left.","The aircraft left at an extremely fast speed.","As for Zhang Han’s aircraft, it was parked here.","“Feifei, Chen Chuan.”","He breathed a sigh of relief and said, “Get on the aircraft.”","It would be a surprise if he found Mengmeng or Zi Yan. However, finding Zhou Fei and Chen Chuan was a very good situation.","Both of them were not very powerful, so it was not safe for them to stay in the outside world.","“Brother Han.”","The rims of Zhou Fei’s eyes reddened, and her endless pressure finally dissipated.","“Uncle Zhang, that bad guy was going to kill us!” Chen Chuan shouted.","“Well, everything’s fine now.”","Zhang Han comforted them. After they got on the spaceship, they immediately followed Protector Tu’s spaceship in front of them.","At this moment, the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak and the others had already caught up.","Protector Tu’s spaceship was far away on the horizon.","Grand Master Chu asked, “Big Brother, what’s going on?”","Zhang Han’s face darkened, and he only said, “I need to go and kill someone.”","The magic formation outside his aircraft appeared.","It was advancing extremely fast.","Even the aircraft gave off an alarm.","“How can they be so fast?”","In an instant, the distance between Zhang Han and Protector Tu was shortened by half.","Protector Tu in the front was shocked.","“I’ll go back to the sect first. Outsiders are not allowed to enter.”","Protector Tu was frightened.","On the way.","His aircraft led the way, followed closely by Zhang Han’s, which was thousands of meters behind. A few kilometers behind them were the aircraft of the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak.","“It’s over!","“Big Brother wants to kill some people.”","Grand Master Chu’s heart was pounding.","“You don’t know that Brother Hanyang once destroyed 10 super sects and slaughtered trillions of people. I’m afraid that the Radiant Institute will be destroyed.”","“What?! He massacred trillions of people?!” The Taoist Lord of Azurepeak and Old Taoist Honghu were both shocked.","“Phew...”","Grand Master Chu exhaled a long breath and said, “Although he is quite easy-going now, it will be unimaginable when he loses his temper.”","“The Grand Masters of the Radiant Institute are on fairly good terms with us. As for this...” The Taoist Lord of Azurepeak didn’t know what to do.","“Yeah. They also treat my family well. The key is... Alas, what should we do? I’ll try to stop Brother Han.” Grand Master Chu had a sad face. He wanted to plead for mercy for the Radiant Institute, but he didn’t dare to say it.","Suddenly, out of the corner of his eye, he saw Chu Qingyi, and his eyes lit up.","“Hey, Qingyi, what are you waiting for? Hurry up and stop your master. Otherwise, blood will flow like a sea on this planet.”","“What? Okay.”","Chu Qingyi was a little stunned.","After thinking for a while, she said to Zhang Han via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “Master, the Radiant Institute has a good relationship with the Chu Family. Don’t, don’t slaughter the sect.”","Zhang Han was stunned when he heard this.","“Don’t slaughter the sect?","“Why would I do that kind of crazy stuff?”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and sent a voice message back, “I won’t. I’ll only get even with that person.”","Hearing this, Chu Qingyi relaxed a little and said, “Master said that he wouldn’t slaughter the sect. He’ll only get even with that person.”","“What?”","Grand Master Chu was dazed for a few seconds. Then, he remarked, “It seems that Brother Hanyang’s temper has improved a lot. I didn’t expect him to say that.”","“Actually, Master is quite easy-going. He would even put up with outsiders sometimes,” Chu Qingyi said.","“No, that can’t be,” Grand Master Chu said with certainty. “Girl, you’re still too young. Back then, Han Yang Immortal killed half of the cultivators in the Cultivation World. What a terrifying person he was! Even many Tribulation Stage masters didn’t dare to look at him.”","“Brother Chu,” the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak said, “how come we’ve never heard of such a famous figure?”","“Because the divine thunder over the sky has affected the rules. You don’t understand the tribulation, and neither do I.” Grand Master Chu didn’t want to say too much about this, so he shook his head and stopped talking.","The Taoist Lord of Azurepeak and Old Taoist Honghu fell silent as they imagined the various scenes that had possibly occurred.","“Brother Hanyang is truly awesome!","“But now, his aura doesn’t seem to be very strong.”","In fact, they also had all kinds of doubts since Zhang Han was sitting in a wheelchair and his breathing was erratic.","It was at this time that Grand Master Chu’s words dispelled their doubts.","“The divine thunder over the sky was too horrible, so Brother Hanyang is not in a good condition. He is still recovering. With his ability, it’s very easy for him to get back to the Tribulation Stage. He has countless spirit treasures. With casual guidance, he can bring you into the Tribulation Stage,” Grand Master Chu said.","“Oh my god!”","The two gasped.","“That’s the Tribulation Stage we’re talking about here!”","“What about you?” Old Taoist Honghu asked.","“Me?”","Grand Master Chu chuckled. “It was fate that brought me to see Big Brother again. I’ll definitely follow him wherever he goes.”","As he spoke, there was actually a trace of shyness on his face.","“Well, if possible, I also want to be his disciple.”","Poof!","Old Taoist Honghu and the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak were both flabbergasted.","Chu Qingyi was in a daze for a few seconds.","“If Grand Master becomes Master’s disciple, he will be the fifth disciple.","“Is he going to call me Senior Martial Sister?","“Grand Master calling me Senior Martial Sister?”","Chu Qingyi immediately found it too weird.","“Notify the Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute now.”","The Taoist Lord of Azurepeak warned, “Do it now, otherwise, I’m afraid that there will be a great disaster. We’re almost falling behind.”"]},{"number":1418,"title":"Chapter 1418 Intimidating","paragraphs":["Chapter 1418 Intimidating","In Zhang Han’s spaceship.","Zhou Fei was still in a state of shock, but she could tell from the video shown on the screen that they had come to the outer gate of the Radiant Institute. Ahead of them was the inner court.","On the way here, she also read some news about the Radiant Institute.","Rumor has it that there was a Grand Master who was very powerful and famous. The Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute was often cultivated in seclusion. There were countless disciples in the sect, and they were all very powerful.","However, Zhou Fei only had Zhang Han with her.","“Brother-in-law, maybe we should just let it go. Nothing much happened to us anyway,” Zhou Fei whispered.","Hearing this, Zhang Han shook his head slightly and looked at the front with indifference.","He increased the speed.","The aircraft accelerated again.","It soon approached Protector Tu’s aircraft.","At this time, Protector Tu in the aircraft was frightened.","“How could they be so fast?!”","Cold sweat dripped from Protector Tu’s forehead. “If it goes on like this, how am I going to the treasure house to get the stuff?","“I don’t care. They have no evidence of me anyway. It’s more important to stay alive.”","Protector Tu’s face was ferocious.","The moment he flew into the inner court, he immediately gave an order to a patrol team nearby.","“Take down the aircraft on the back that has broken in!”","“Yes, sir!”","The patrol team had five small aircraft.","As soon as they got the order, they were on alert.","Five small aircraft led hundreds of drones rising from the buildings and aimed at the aircraft behind Protector Tu’s.","“Brother Han.”","Seeing this, Zhou Fei’s face slightly changed.","“Since he had you terrified, he must die today!”","Zhang Han smiled and looked ahead.","Buzz!","Light burst out from his eyes.","The power of the Immortal Body of the Five Elements was overwhelming.","It was as though space itself had been torn apart.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Countless drones, as well as the aircraft in the way, all burst into flames in the air and exploded.","“Alert!”","“Alert!”","The alarm system of the Radiant Institute rang out urgently.","“Enemy attack!”","“Kill them now!”","Protector Tu roared.","The soundwaves spread in all directions.","Many people were alarmed, including the supervisors, chief supervisors, and even several protectors.","As soon as they received the news, they immediately rose into the air.","However, what they saw were two aircraft moving forward at high speed.","“What’s happening?”","Some people were shocked.","“Since the aircraft can reach the surface, they have already been checked by the space station. How could there still be trouble?”","“What does he think he’s doing? How dare he cause trouble in the Radiant Institute?”","“Chase after them!”","While they were still in a daze, the aircraft had long since flown far away.","However, the Radiant Institute’s defensive system was quite powerful. It was divided into different levels.","At a certain distance, all kinds of combat aircraft slowly rose into the air, let go of Protector Tu’s aircraft, and locked onto Zhang Han’s.","There were 3,000 combat aircraft in this group.","“AHH...”","Zhou Fei exclaimed and her scalp went numb.","There were enemies’ aircraft in front of them, and they seemed to be ready to fire in the next second.","Zhang Han saw this and simply waved his hand.","Countless crystal stones flew out of the cabin door. Like a large net, they covered the front of the aircraft.","A formation was formed.","Its defense was so powerful that it was able to withstand the suppression of the attacks.","After Zhang Han’s aircraft passed by, the big net suddenly burst into dazzling light and turned into sharp arrows.","The second round of aircraft was burned and turned into a sea of fire.","“Heavens. What sort of mean is this?”","“Is that a formation? That’s impossible. How can a formation have such a powerful transformation?”","It was simply too difficult for one’s defense to instantly transform into a powerful offensive.","The disciples of the Radiant Institute were shocked when they saw this from a distance.","Protector Tu’s face changed again, and he was a little regretful.","“Who’s that person at the back?","“It’s the Grand Elder!”","He felt that he was somewhat doomed. However, he had an idea. He didn’t dare to contact the Sect Leader, but he could contact the Grand Elder.","“The Grand Elder has the strength of the Void-refining Realm Last-Stage.","“How dare they chase after me?”","Protector Tu’s face was ferocious.","“He’s dead for sure since he took action in the inner court of the Radiant Institute!”","Without hesitation, he immediately sent five distress messages to the Grand Elder.","“Grand Elder, please save me. Someone’s causing trouble in the inner court. He has killed many disciples.”","The Grand Elder replied, “Where are you?”","Protector Tu sent the coordinates.","He was greatly relieved.","Taoist Lord of Azurepeak and the others were right behind him.","When they saw the mess, Old Taoist Honghu muttered, “Brother Hanyang is so decisive when he attacks.”","Grand Master Chu said, “In any case, with his temper, he has already shown me respect by not killing too many people. It’s just that Sect Leader Mi hasn’t replied to my message yet. I don’t know if he has seen it or not.”","“Azurepeak, your aircraft is terrible. It can’t keep up with them at all,” Old Taoist Honghu said anxiously. “It will be too late when we catch up with them.”","They continued to fly forward.","After a few minutes, they finally arrived at the core area of the inner court.","In the air not far ahead, there was a large group of people, led by the Grand Elder of the Radiant Institute.","There were more than 10,000 high-end combat aircraft all around.","Zhang Han’s aircraft was floating quietly in the void while Zhang Han, Zhou Fei, and Chen Chuan were standing in it.","At this time, the elders and protectors from the Radiant Institute were not looking too good.","But when they saw Grand Master Chu and the others, the Grand Elder cupped his hands and spoke in a manner that was neither servile nor overbearing, “Greetings, Senior Chu, senior Azurepeak, and senior Honghu.”","“Alas!”","Grand Master Chu sighed softly and asked, “Where is Sect Leader Mi?”","“The Sect Leader isn’t here. However, I have already sent someone to inform him,” the Grand Elder said.","“About this matter-” Grand Master Chu thought for a moment and said, “Who is he?”","He pointed at the man standing next to the Grand Elder.","“He’s Protector Tu of my sect.”","“He started it. That’s why my Big Brother was chasing after him,” said Grand Master Chu. “Hand him over and perhaps we can stop the killing.”","The Grand Elder was slightly displeased with Grand Master Chu’s words.","But he looked at Zhang Han with a dignified look.","“Who is Grand Master Chu’s Big Brother?”","“Stop the killing?”","The Grand Elder frowned and said, “Senior Chu, what you said is disappointing. The Heavenly Double Star is the best place in our institute. The Beast Overlooking Peak is a forbidden area. We’ve given it to your family for more than a thousand years, and we are on good terms. You asked me to just hand my guy over indiscriminately. If I hand him over today, won’t I be too ashamed to stay in the sect in the future?”","“Don’t ignore my advice. If my Big Brother gets angry...” Grand Master Chu said.","Before he finished speaking, Zhang Han smiled. His smile was very light and faint. He said, “So you don’t want to hand him over?”","Hiss!","Grand Master Chu gasped when he saw Zhang Han like that. He did not dare to interrupt.","“I will if Protector Tu is really in the wrong,” the Grand Elder said flatly.","“Grand Elder, what did I do wrong?” Protector Tu said, “It was obvious that they were trying to kill me. When I guarded the space station before, my subordinate told me that there came a wanted person. The reward was issued by the Chu Family. Therefore, I tried to take them to the Chu Family. I found that the woman looked kind, and also, because of the Chu family, I didn’t guard against her. I took out some spiritual treasures that were used for verification. However, when she saw the treasures, she coveted them and suddenly attacked me. If I didn’t have some personal Defense Treasures with me, I would have been trapped. I almost died before I rushed back to the sect. I...”","He looked like he was about to cry.","Zhou Fei was so angry that her face turned slightly pale.","In addition, several protectors of the Radiant Institute around echoed.","“Yeah. Protector Tu has been working so hard for so many years. He’s indeed a righteous man.”","“He is in charge of some business matters of the space station. He was still working when he led the way. He is worth learning from.”","“Protector Tu is definitely right. Some others may be greedy and ungrateful.”","The Grand Elder waved his hand and said, “Senior Chu, Protector Tu has been in the sect for so many years, and he is indeed loyal. That woman sneaked up on him...”","Before he finished speaking, Protector Tu burst into tears. “Grand Elder, I’m lucky that I’m not dead, but it doesn’t matter. Those who don’t know the truth are innocent. For the sake of the Chu Family, we should stop pursuing this matter. We can’t let a woman affect the relationship between the two forces.”","His act touched many people.","Protector Tu was indeed usually good at pretending, and the work he was responsible for included verifying spirit treasures.","However, he wasn’t required to verify many of them, and when he did his job, he needed to verify the spiritual treasures in batches.","Did he need to verify the spirit treasures when he led the way?","There were also those who doubted if there was something fishy.","But at this time, they would definitely not say it. After all, they were partial to him.","“Bullshit!”","Zhou Fei said angrily, “It’s obvious that he wants to get 100 million crystal stones.”","“Lady, please mind your words,” the Grand Elder said discontentedly. “It’s just 100 million crystal stones. It may be a lot to you, but in our eyes, it’s just a small sum.”","“Elder Feng, don’t make a mistake. He’s not good enough for you to stand up for. I’ve already told your Sect Leader about this matter. Hand him over now. It has nothing to do with you,” Grand Master Chu spoke again.","The Grand Elder refused, “Senior Chu, it’s not that I don’t want to hand him over, but that I can’t. I have to be reasonable in everything I do. It’s not that I disrespect you. That man has just destroyed a lot of aircraft, and the crystal stones he needs to pay for the damage have reached hundreds of millions. Moreover, did he show respect to the Radiant Institute by making such a scene in the inner court? Doesn’t he look down on us too much? Does he think that there is no one in charge in the institute?”","“Alright then!”","Grand Master Chu snorted and didn’t say anything.","Zhang Han watched aside calmly for a few minutes.","Seeing that the Grand Elder was the only one who stood up for Protector Tu, he decided to stop waiting.","He looked at the Grand Elder and said, “Either you’ll kill him, or I’ll kill you before killing him.”","Beep! Beep! Beep!","The communication device of the Grand Elder rang urgently.","However, he paid no attention to it and stared forward. “Don’t go too far. This is the Radiant Institute. I haven’t said anything about you causing trouble here!”","“No, Elder Feng!”","An urgent voice suddenly came from the distance.","Right at this moment, Zhang Han’s figure flickered under everyone’s gaze.","Bang!","A mist of blood flew out from the crowd in front.","The Grand Elder had disappeared.","There were phantoms in the air.","As for Protector Tu, the young man grabbed him by the neck and took him back.","The man was so young and was Grand Master Chu’s Big Brother. Everyone seemed to realize his identity by now.","“What...”","The Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute finally arrived. He transformed into a ray of light in the distance and swiftly flew over.","“You have evil intentions toward my people.” Zhang Han looked at Protector Tu indifferently and said, “Why would you even think that I can’t kill you?”","“You...” Protector Tu’s face turned ashen.","“How could such a young man be a secret tyrant?”","“Senior, please hold your anger!”","In the distance, the Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute roared.","Protector Tu had thought that he could be saved.","However, he thought it the wrong way.","“Let me kill him!” the Sect Leader yelled from afar.","Protector Tu was stunned.","“I’m doomed.”","The many protectors and elders of the Radiant Institute were all shocked.","Under their stunned gazes, Protector Tu’s body turned into a faint mist and slowly dissipated from the world.","In the territory of the Radiant Institute, Zhang Han killed Protector Tu in front of the Sect Leader and all the high-level members, as well as the Grand Elder who had stood up for him, in passing.","He punished them as a warning to others.","It was one of his means that had been perfectly mastered.","After the Sect Leader said his words, at this moment, Zhang Han was floating in midair. He alone had shocked the entire Radiant Institute."]},{"number":1419,"title":"Chapter 1419 Guidance","paragraphs":["Chapter 1419 Guidance","“Greetings to...Big Brother.”","Under everyone’s gaze, Sect Leader Mi was sweating profusely. He quickly flew to Zhang Han and greeted him with a big bow.","Poof!","Countless people were stunned, and the sound of gasping could be heard frequently.","“What did the Sect Leader just call him?","“Big Brother?","“Oh my god. This man just killed Grand Elder and Protector Tu.","“However, the Sect Leader still has to welcome him with a broad smile.","“What...”","Many disciples of the Radiant Institute were dumbfounded.","“Big Brother, I didn’t manage the sect well that I had scum in the sect. I should have killed him myself. I’m really ashamed that I had to trouble you to help clean up the sect.”","Sect Leader Mi’s words were both emotional and reasonable.","It was as if Zhang Han had just gotten rid of an evil man for the people.","Sect Leader Mi had received a message from Grand Master Chu, which only said, “Someone in your sect has offended my Big Brother. Let me tell you, he is an Immortal Master, and he is also a very cruel and murderous Immortal Master.”","The moment Sect Leader Mi received the news, he was scared silly.","When he contacted the sect’s defensive intelligence system, he got a lot of pictures, which made him feel frightened.","He immediately came over and tried to contact the Grand Elder, but he couldn’t get in touch with him, and this guy didn’t pick up the communication.","The Grand Leader stood up for Protector Tu, and he was doomed as well.","“The cruel Immortal Master...” Sect Leader Mi’s back was wet with cold sweat.","In the face of Sect Leader Mi’s apology, Zhang Han did not respond in a friendly manner. He looked very calm, but his eyes were cold.","“If such a thing happens again, there will be no need for your sect to exist.”","After saying that, Zhang Han turned around and walked toward the entrance of the aircraft with Zhou Fei and Chen Chuan.","“Phew...","“This matter is finally over now.”","Sect Leader Mi heaved a sigh of relief.","However, when the Immortal Master in front of him walked to the entrance, he stopped, turned sideways, and looked at him.","Gurgle!","Sect Leader Mi couldn’t help but swallow hard.","He was extremely terrified.","“What, what can I do for you, Big Brother?” Sect Leader Mi said in a trembling voice.","“My sister-in-law and nephew were frightened. What do you think we should do?” Zhang Han asked.","“I will definitely come to them and apologize in person,” Sect Leader Mi immediately said.","“Huh.”","Zhang Han smiled faintly and entered the aircraft with his people. The aircraft turned into a stream of light as they left directly.","After he left, Sect Leader Mi wiped his forehead. When he saw that his palms were covered with sweat, he felt physically and mentally exhausted. He felt even worse than going through a big battle.","“It’s true that to be in the king’s company is tantamount to living with a tiger.”","Sect Leader Mi could still feel his heart beating violently. He cupped his hands to Grand Master Chu behind him and said, “Thank you for informing me of this, Senior Chu.”","“My family and your sect have been friends for a thousand years. How could I not tell you what happened?” Grand Master Chu shook his head slightly.","Sect Leader Mi was deeply moved.","He nodded heavily, and then his face darkened greatly.","He looked at the disciples of his sect and said in a cold voice, “Inform all the chief supervisors and the other higher-ups to wait for me in the Frost Palace!”","It was obvious that there was going to be a lecture.","Clatter!","In the face of the Sect Leader’s rising anger, no one dared to say anything. They all left in disgrace.","Then, Sect Leader Mi flew to Grand Master Chu and the others and cupped his hands.","“Thank you very much, Senior Chu, Senior Azurepeak, and Senior Honghu. If it weren’t for your help, the consequences would be unimaginable.”","“You just need to thank Brother Chu for that he’s sent voice transmission messages to Big Brother multiple times. Given Big Brother’s temperament, he probably would’ve destroyed the entire Radiant Institute.” The Taoist Lord of Azurepeak let out a light sigh.","“Yes. Senior Chu, I must thank you a lot,” Sect Leader Mi said.","“Instead of thanking me, you should try to ease Big Brother’s anger. He said that his two relatives were frightened. Your sect was supposed to be destroyed, but now you have a chance to live. Sect Leader Mi, remember, Big Brother has a lot of spirit treasures. Don’t try to fool him with things of no grade,” Grand Master Chu said.","“I won’t, of course.” Sect Leader Mi’s heart ached a little.","It seemed that he was going to pay a heavy price this time.","“We’ll go back first. I’ll talk to my elder brother.” Grand Master Chu and the others excused themselves and left.","With no one around, Sect Leader Mi’s face was cold as he looked at the Frost Palace.","If Zhang Han had heard their conversation, he might have found it funny.","It was a bit weird for him to bully people by flaunting his formidable power.","“Uncle Zhang, you’re amazing,” Chen Chuan said with admiration and envy. “So many people didn’t dare to say anything to oppose you. I’m going to become a powerful expert like you in the future.”","“You’ll have to work hard on your cultivation then,” Zhang Han said,","“Brother Han, how could you...be so powerful?” Zhou Fei was a little confused.","“It’s because Grand Master Chu has helped me a lot,” Zhang Han said with emotion.","If it weren’t for Grand Master Chu, he and Chu Qingyi would have probably fled from the Chu Family’s place and then issued a reward. The efficiency would be much lower when they slowly search for Zhang Han’s team.","But now, with Grand Master Chu and the other two personally holding down the fort, and with the Chu Family taking the lead, and several other sects acting as the vanguard, the reward was much more authoritative.","“Brother Han, how did you know Grand Master Chu?” Zhou Fei said, “Who is he? How powerful is he?”","“He’s at the Early Stage of the Mastery Realm,” Zhang Han said.","“What?”","Zhou Fei was instantly dumbfounded.","The Mastery Realm masters were at a very high level.","“Grand Master Chu is in the Mastery Realm, yet he still addresses my brother-in-law as Big Brother.”","Zhou Fei said with emotion, “I found out that you can make a name for yourself wherever you go, Brother Han!”","Zhang Han shook his head without saying a word.","He only made a few moves, and his soul trembled.","A flaw appeared in his control over his body.","Therefore, when they returned to Chu Youyou’s residence-","“You two will stay in that room.”","Zhang Han pointed to the room on the west side. There were three rooms in this small house, one for Zhang Han, one for Chu Qingyi, and the other for Zhou Fei and Chen Chuan.","He arranged a temporary residence for them.","“Brother Han, what’s going on with you?”","When Zhou Fei saw Zhang Han sitting back in his wheelchair and taking two medicinal pellets, her face changed.","“Uncle Zhang!” Chen Chuan was also taken aback.","Zhang Han lay lazily on the chair, feeling like he was disabled.","“I’m fine.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and said, “I just need to rest for a while.”","“Brother Han, you...” Zhou Fei said, “Are you really fine?”","“Yeah.”","“When that incident happened, where did you show up?” Zhou Fei asked.","“Chu Qingyi and I stayed in the main hall.” Zhang Han thought for a moment and said, “I was ambushed by the Demonic God of the Domain of Seven Desolations and my soul was damaged a little, so I took a rest. I just woke up. I came to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven from the Ancient Road of Starry Sky. Several sects have issued some rewards. We should be able to get some people back.”","“It’s been almost a year.” Zhou Fei’s eyes were slightly red, “I wonder how my husband, Elder Sister Yan, and Mengmeng are.”","“Let’s wait a little longer, at least two weeks, and at most one month. If there’s no news of them, I’ll think of other ways,” Zhang Han said.","He let out a long sigh inwardly.","He was most worried about Mengmeng and Zi Yan. Both his parents and grandfather were experienced, so they were safe when they were in the outside world. He thought that it would be good for others to travel around.","It was Sir Mysterious’s Sixth Mind that had taken action. He would definitely control the situation and would not be teleported to those desolate areas, such as the Starry Sky Beast’s and the ancient demonic beasts’ areas.","What Zhang Han didn’t know was that many people had been teleported to very horrible places at random.","Sixth Mind also had a certain level of control over his own people.","“How did you get together?” Zhang Han asked.","Zhou Fei said, “I got very lucky. I had a lot of crystal stones in the city. I found a place to live and then posted a search notice on all kinds of information networks. I also issued some tasks. Later, someone took Chen Chuan to me.”","“You were lucky.” Zhang Han nodded. “I would be much more relieved with Chen Chuan being with you. As for Changqing, I’m not worried about him. He must be doing well out there.”","“Yeah. He’ll definitely come to us,” Zhou Fei murmured.","Even so, reality had always exceeded her expectations.","The well-known Emperor Qing wasn’t doing well currently.","He was inside an Ancient Mine.","“Hurry up and dig!”","The place was heavily guarded. Many mining cultivators brandished shovels about, digging downward.","This was where the crystal stones were dug.","Chen Changqing was one of the mining cultivators.","His Space Ring had been confiscated. He had nothing with him. His face was dirty with stains.","“Alas, it’s been eight months. I’ve been mining here for eight months.”","Chen Changqing was depressed.","There were only a few people who could be enjoying themselves as Mengmeng did.","Soon, the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak and the others returned to Zhang Han’s side.","“Brother Hanyang.”","Grand Master Chu said, “Are you in a better mood? How about I play chess with you?”","“No, thanks.” Zhang Han shook his head and showed no interest in Grand Master Chu’s proposal.","“Sect Leader Mi said that he would bring some great gifts tomorrow and apologize in person,” Grand Master Chu said.","“I see.”","Zhang Han was not very interested in this.","But he just looked that way. After considering it, he thought that he did need some high-end special spirit treasures now.","In the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven, seventh-tier spirit treasures were not rare, but they were not seen everywhere either. Eighth-tier spirit treasures were rather rare.","There were almost no ninth-tier spirit treasures, and even if there were, they would be brought from the outside world.","The treasures here were almost the same as those in the Silver Dragon Galaxy. There were not many ninth-tier spirit treasures in the entire Cultivation World, and Profound-grade treasures were even rarer.","However, the numbers of eighth-tier spirit treasures were not the same in different regions.","This time, Sect Leader Mi would probably bring some good stuff with him when he came to apologize.","Zhang Han looked at Grand Master Chu and asked, “It’s awesome that you could reach the Mastery Realm in 1,200 years, but I don’t know if you have the talent to reach the Tribulation Stage. What cultivation methods are you cultivating now?”","Swoosh!","Grand Master Chu’s expression changed slightly. He was so excited that his palms trembled.","“Big Brother is going to teach me again!”","“Ahem. Guys, you need to step aside first.” Grand Master Chu waved his hand to the people beside him.","The Taoist Lord of Azurepeak and Old Taoist Honghu were quite envious, but they still left and walked to the side. Chu Qingyi entered another room and talked to Zhou Fei.","At this moment, Grand Master Chu set up a soundproof cover.","“Big Brother!","“What I’m practicing now is...”","Grand Master Chu was honest, and he trusted Zhang Han.","He told him about his cultivation method and his situation in one go.","After hearing what he said, Zhang Han nodded and shook his head from time to time. He agreed with some of the cultivation methods Grand Master Chu talked about, but some of them were inappropriate.","Under the gazes of the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak and Old Taoist Honghu, Zhang Han said something to Grand Master Chu.","“Judging from Brother Chu’s expression, he must have benefited a lot.”","“Old Chu really has a powerful backing. I envy him. Many people would not even dare to dream of having the support of an Immortal Master.”","“I wonder if we can also get some guidance.”","“We should first get our jobs done. There will eventually be a chance.” Old Daoist Honghu had a determined look on his face","As for Zhang Han, he was now in the Void-refining Realm Early-Stage. When he first came to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven, he already had three followers at the Grand Master Level."]},{"number":1420,"title":"Chapter 1420 Using a Holy Object to Get What He Wants","paragraphs":["Chapter 1420 Using a Holy Object to Get What He Wants","With the support of Grand Master Chu, Old Taoist Honghu, and the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak, it would be easy for Zhang Han to search for the rest of his team in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven. The efficiency would be at least dozens of times higher.","Moments later, Grand Master Chu’s face flushed with excitement. He thanked Zhang Han repeatedly.","“Thank you, Big Brother.”","“You can leave now. I’m going to take a rest.” Zhang Han waved his hand.","As soon as he said that, the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak and Old Taoist Honghu, who had been about to speak, exchanged glances. They were quite helpless.","“Let’s go. We’ll talk after we go back in case Big Brother gets disturbed.”","Grand Master Chu grinned from ear to ear as he pulled the two away.","“How was it?”","After they left Zhang Han’s place, Old Taoist Honghu couldn’t help but ask, “What did Big Brother teach you in there?”","“Hahaha.”","Grand Master Chu laughed in a low voice and shook his head. “I can’t tell you. I can’t.”","His proud look made the two tempted.","However, Grand Master Chu still couldn’t help showing off.","It was not until the two others asked four or five times that he whispered, “He taught me a set of unprecedented cultivation methods, which is so profound that I’ve never heard of it before. He also told me about three kinds of occult art, all of which are trump cards. Big Brother said that if my cultivation methods and the three kinds of occult art reach the Mastery Realm, I can defeat more than 80% of the people at the Mastery Realm Middle-Stage and fight against those at a higher level!”","“What?!”","“How formidable!”","“Good heavens!”","Old Daoist Honghu and the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak couldn’t help but gasp.","In fact, Zhang Han knew very well that although they were doing well in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven and were all at the level of Grand Masters, they had no one to rely on in the overall environment of the Cultivation World. They did not know the cultivation methods and other resources of the upper class. Many people like them would stop at this level for the rest of their lives.","It was precisely because of this that the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak and Old Taoist Honghu didn’t have any ill intentions and simply stayed behind to help out.","Time revealed a person’s heart. They believed that constant dropping would wear away a stone. They could benefit a lot from the Immortal Master’s casual guidance of occult arts and cultivation methods.","“You said that my brother-in-law has been lying on a chair all the time because he was seriously injured?”","Zhou Fei bit her lower lip and said, “If Elder Sister Yan and Mengmeng knew about this, they would definitely get upset and cry.”","She felt a little distressed, not to mention Zi Yan and Mengmeng, who would always stick to Zhang Han.","“Alas!”","Zhou Fei sighed softly and said, “Everyone got separated all of a sudden.”","“Maybe it’s not a bad thing,” Chu Qingyi said. “Just as Elder Yue said, it’s nice for everyone to experience.”","Chu Qingyi was used to being alone, so when she encountered this kind of situation, she didn’t feel bad as others did.","However, some people were feeling very uncomfortable.","At this time, Mengmeng had already become very famous in the sect.","She was number one in the pellet refining field among the new disciples and even surpassed many of her senior brothers and sisters.","“Zhang Hanyang is such a genius in pellet refining.”","“He’s so promising. He’s deeply loved by the Orchid Peak Host.”","“Even the Peak Host wants to take him as a disciple, but Zhang Hanyang didn’t agree. It’s really strange. Are all the geniuses so weird?”","Many disciples of the Orchid Peak would always talk about this.","In less than a year, the new disciple had made a name for himself on Orchid Peak. His strength was shocking.","However, the protagonist of the discussion, Zhang Hanyang, was alone beside a waterfall at this time. He was sitting on a branch and staring blankly at the waterfall.","“Little Master.”","Xiong Fengran ran over from the back.","“What’s up?”","Mengmeng immediately wiped her eyes, pursed her lips, and turned her face to the side. “Dahei, why are you here?”","“I’m here to see you, Little Master.”","Dahei happily climbed up the tree and sat next to Mengmeng. “I’ve been grounded for a month this time. I came here as soon as I got released.”","Xiong Fengran and Zhang Hanyang, these two young men, were very famous at Command Beast Peak.","Because it was unknown how many spirit beasts they had secretly eaten.","“I miss my dad,” Mengmeng said sulkily.","“I miss my host, too.” Dahei smacked its lips and said, “I don’t want to stay here anymore. I want to get back to my own body. Being a human being is too miserable.”","“Stop talking. If you say any more about this, I will cry.” Mengmeng pursed her lips and looked like she was about to cry.","“Oh, don’t cry, Little Master. If you do, it will make me want to cry, too,” Dahei said.","“You are so annoying.” Mengmeng’s eyes were red.","“Ow! Ow! Ow!”","Dahei couldn’t help but let out two cries. It was as if it wanted to hit its chest to vent its sadness.","Unexpectedly, Dahei’s face suddenly changed.","“Little Master, someone’s here!”","Swoosh!","Mengmeng immediately stood on the branch, adjusted herself, and rolled her eyes several times.","She turned back to have a look.","“What?”","Mengmeng was a little dumbfounded, and she immediately felt helpless.","Fortunately, she was no longer sad.","“Junior Brother Zhang, when I found that you weren’t at Orchid Peak, I thought that you must have come here to enjoy the scenery,” the girl who came over said excitedly.","“Why are you here, Senior Sister?” Mengmeng asked.","“I’m here to see you.” The beautiful senior sister ran to Mengmeng happily.","“Well, didn’t I tell you about myself last time?” Mengmeng stood on the branch and looked at the girl who flew to her.","“What do you mean?” the young senior sister asked curiously.","“I told you that I like men,” Mengmeng replied matter-of-factly.","Of course, the man she liked the most was the most handsome in her eyes.","“Junior Brother Zhang.”","When the senior sister heard that last time, she was a little devastated. It had been a long time since she last came to Mengmeng.","However, Mengmeng underestimated her determination.","At this time, the domineering senior sister from Orchid Peak looked at Xiong Fengran angrily.","“I warned you last time. I told you that if you dared to pester Junior Brother Zhang again, I would teach you a lesson!”","She glared at him fiercely and then looked at Mengmeng with gentle eyes again. “Junior Brother, I’ve thought it through. There may be something wrong with your mentality. When it comes to the relationship between men and women, the way of Yin and Yang is...”","As she spoke, a blush flashed across her face.","She was very shy, but she still insisted continuing, “It’s a wonderful thing. I’ve inquired about it secretly. Well, Junior Brother Zhang, you haven’t experienced it yet. I, I can help you correct your preference. As long as you are willing, we...”","She looked as if she would be at the mercy of Junior Brother Zhang.","Mengmeng was dumbfounded.","“What? Senior Sister, are you, I...” For a moment, Mengmeng didn’t know what to say.","“Even if I tried to dodge her all the time, I still failed.","“This is exhausting.”","“You’re leading him astray!”","Dahei said discontentedly, “Go away. Junior Brother Zhang doesn’t like you.”","“I’ll try my best to make him like me. Who do you think you are? How dare you say that about me? Believe it or not, I’ll get you grounded again!” the senior sister said angrily.","She was sometimes irritable and sometimes gentle.","She was a really complicated girl.","“Senior Sister, please give me some time to consider it. I want to be alone now.”","Mengmeng was scared out of her wits. She felt that the senior sister was way out of the line.","She hurriedly said a few perfunctory words and then ran away with Dahei.","“Humph!”","The senior sister stamped her feet in anger behind them and said, “Xiong Fengran! I’ll teach you a lesson sooner or later!”","It seemed that in her eyes, Xiong Fengran was the bad guy who had taken her man away.","After what she had done, Mengmeng and Dahei went somewhere else. The Command Beast Peak was too dangerous for them to stay. They were almost blacklisted, and many places did not welcome them.","They could do nothing about it. After all, they had eaten too many spirit beasts secretly.","“Little Master, where are we going?” Dahei said, “Why don’t we go back to the Heavenly Dragon Star Province?”","“We can’t go back,” Mengmeng said. “The route in the starry sky there has collapsed. It will take us at least three years to go there. Maybe in a few days, Daddy will come to find me. We can’t leave for the time being. We’ll wait for him here. If he still hasn’t arrived by then, sooner or later, I’ll be well-known in the whole sect. When Zhang Hanyang’s reputation spreads in the Astral Domain, it’ll definitely be easy for Daddy to find me.”","“How about I go out and make some arrangements?” Dahei asked.","“No need for that. The Astral Domain of Vast Heaven is too large,” Mengmeng said rationally.","The little girl was very smart, and she was now 16 years old.","She was about to come of age. She had a stunningly gorgeous appearance. Like Zi Yan, she was extremely good-looking, but her delicate facial features had been hidden for nearly a year.","Even if she dressed up as a man, she would be more handsome than any good-looking young man on Earth.","Even the senior sister was unable to extricate herself from Mengmeng’s charm.","She had been trying her best to teach Xiong Fengran a lesson.","Nowadays, Zhang Hanyang had a lot of female fans in Orchid Peak and was a popular target.","The next day.","The Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute personally came to the Chu Family’s residence to deliver some great gifts.","The spirit treasures were dazzling.","His attitude was sincere. He took out the treasures, but he didn’t expect Zhang Han didn’t even lift his eyelids.","“Are these not enough?”","The Sect Leader thought to himself. “Or is it that they’re not good enough?","“Could it be that he is a little greedy?”","After pondering for a long while, he suddenly made up his mind. He took out a few treasures that were of little value from the Space Ring. The grades of those treasures couldn’t be judged by their looks.","“Maybe there is some good stuff in these. Whether there is or not, these treasures are the last ones I have.”","Unexpectedly, as soon as he took those treasures out-","“Huh?”","Zhang Han suddenly opened his eyes. With a soft cry of surprise, he moved his right hand, and a half-meter-high jade cauldron among the treasures floated in front of him. He looked at it and his eyes lit up.","“Senior, I obtained this jade cauldron by accident. I can’t tell what kind of treasure it is, but I feel that it should be a sixth-tier low-grade spirit treasure,” said the Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute.","“Not bad.” Zhang Han nodded and said, “It’s indeed a sixth-tier spirit treasure. I’ll take it and you can take away the rest. We’re even now.”","“I can’t thank you enough, Senior.” The Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute was delighted.","At the same time, he sighed with emotion. “I misjudged him just now.","“Why would the powerful Immortal Master care about this little bit of wealth I have?”","However, just as he had such an idea, Zhang Han said, “Guys, do me a favor.”","“Just name it, Brother Hanyang. There’s no need to be so courteous with us,” said Grand Master Chu.","“Yeah. We would always be at your service, Big Brother,” the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak said.","Old Taoist Honghu and Sect Leader Mi of the Radiant Institute also nodded repeatedly.","“I have a detailed list of the special spirit treasures above the sixth tier I need.” Zhang Han wrote down more than 90 kinds of spiritual treasures.","“So many!”","“There’s such a large number.”","“You also need eighth-tier spirit treasures?”","Those people’s bodies trembled as they were extremely shocked.","“Why do you need so many spirit treasures, Big Brother?”","“I need them to cast magic.” Zhang Han waved his hand and said, “The ones from not only your sect but also others will do. I will exchange them with crystal stones or spirit treasures.”","“Alright. I’ll make the arrangements.”","The Taoist Lord of Azurepeak immediately nodded.","Without any hesitation, they contacted their subordinates and made the arrangements.","Zhang Han looked at the jade cauldron in front of him quietly and smiled gently.","“Sect Leader Mi, I didn’t expect that you would give me such a surprise.”","He could sense some Myriad Wood Chaotic Qi.","Zhang Han’s eyes lit up.","At first, he thought he had sensed it wrong, but he didn’t expect that there was a lot of Myriad Wood Chaotic Qi hidden in the jade cauldron.","This was a special kind of energy that had a wide range of uses.","It was a sharp weapon that could be used to cast curses. He could use it to kill enemies from a Star Area away.","Of course, there was a precondition to this.","And Zhang Han happened to know a method named Blood Source Incantation.","He could use it to find his close relatives.","Zhang Han was very confident about using it to find Zi Yan, Mengmeng, Zhang Guangyou, Rong Jiali, and Zhang Li.","However, it might not work on finding Zhang Mu, Rong Jiaxin, and others.","This was also a good thing that made Zhang Han very happy.","If the people of the Cultivation World knew that the holy object of incantations, the Myriad Wood Chaotic Qi, was used to find people, they would probably be dumbfounded.","But that was Zhang Han’s style of doing things.","He did not mind using a holy object as long as it could help him get what he wanted."]},{"number":1421,"title":"Chapter 1421 The Blood Source Incantation","paragraphs":["Chapter 1421 The Blood Source Incantation","However, Zhang Han needed many high-end treasures to cast the Blood Source Incantation.","The spirit treasures he wanted were at least sixth-tier ones, and the best ones were eighth-tier. He needed dozens of precious and rare spirit treasures. Fortunately, he was in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven, and he might not get the things he lacked in other places.","“Big Brother, I remember you have a lot of spiritual treasures,” said Grand Master Chu in puzzlement.","At this moment, Zhang Han showed a gentle smile on his face.","“My treasures are in a different place. They’re waiting for me to find them.”","When Zhang Han said that, the listeners thought differently as he did.","They were not thinking about the same thing at all.","Zhang Han missed his family.","Grand Master Chu and the others believed that Zhang Han’s treasures were all left in high-end Galaxies, where the Tribulation Stage experts were rampant.","In those places, there would be extremely terrifying secret realms, as well as large ancient Relics.","At the same time, there were many dangers.","However, many experts at the Tribulation Stage had adobes in many secret realms.","“Presumably, Brother Hanyang’s treasures are all in those places, so he needs to find a way to get some treasures now.”","Grand Master Chu thought that he understood the situation very well.","He said with great enthusiasm, “We’ve got the detailed list. Let’s take action as soon as possible. I’ve read the list. I know who has the eighth-tier spirit treasures. I’ll go and talk to him in person. I should be able to get them with something. As for the rest, they’re not particularly rare, and we can eventually get them. But Big Brother, it will take some time.”","“Okay. That’s fine. Thank you for your hard work.” Zhang Han nodded.","They started getting this matter done, and some high-position officials were contacting everyone they could reach. The most important thing for the major forces was to put out the reward and the tasks of finding people.","When outsiders found the wanted and sent him to the Chu Family, they would receive 100 million crystal stones. If the ones from those sects found the person, they would not receive this reward. However, there were other rewards. As for what they were, the higher-ups did not mention it. It seemed that the rewards wouldn’t be shabby.","The only forces who had such a rule were the Red Snow Mountain of the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak, the Radiant Institute, Old Taoist Honghu, and the Chu Family. In truth, the Chu Family didn’t even count, and there weren’t many people in total.","Recently, a lot of juniors had gone out to have fun.","Even Chu Youyou was the same since her Grand Master’s Big Brother was staying at her place.","“Just the thought of it makes me crazy.”","Chu Youyou was having fun with a few friends on a prosperous recreational planet.","“Mei, you never would’ve imagined that when I recall it now, I find that the man is truly frightening. Even his gaze is extremely deep and unfathomable,” Chu Youyou said with a serious expression.","“Don’t tell me you’ve taken a fancy to him,” a woman in a long dress teased. “Youyou, you’re not young anymore. It’s normal for you to be in love.”","“Don’t talk nonsense. If my Grand Master hears you, he’ll break my legs,” Chu Youyou said carelessly.","There were a total of six people, including one man and five women.","Chu Youyou had a good relationship with the woman in a long dress next to her, so she spoke more casually.","“Mei, isn’t your family also very powerful on the All-peace Star? I haven’t gotten any news about the wanted ones here. Why don’t you send someone to look for them? If those people are found, you will get 100 million crystal stones. That’ll be a lot.”","“Okay. Send the information to me when you have a rest in the evening. I’ll ask someone to look for those people,” Mei said casually.","She didn’t really care about the matter. “Looking for dozens of people in the vast crowd? It’s simply too hard. It’s even less likely to succeed than winning the lottery.”","However, something out of her expectations happened after a whole day of having fun.","In the evening, Chu Youyou checked into a luxurious hotel.","She was next to the open-air platform on the top floor.","“Please get me a pot of fine ancient tea.”","Chu Youyou sat there and controlled her communication wristband, preparing to send a message to Mei.","“Hello, Miss. Here is your ancient tea.” A low voice came from the side.","It was a woman wearing a maid’s uniform. Her hair was a little messy. She held a tea set and placed it on the table in an orderly manner. When she poured the tea, she sprinkled some on the table.","This could be considered a mistake for a waiter.","“My apologies.”","The woman took out her tools, wiped the table, and turned to leave.","“I think I’ve seen her somewhere before?” Chu Youyou was a little confused.","She looked at the table, on which the common characters of the Cultivation World were written, “Save me.”","“Huh?”","Chu Youyou was silent for a long time.","“Should I help her?","“I’ll go take a look.”","She got up and walked to the waitress’s workplace. When she entered the corridor, she saw the woman in a corner.","“Come here now!”","There was an old woman in the front who spoke in a stern tone.","“Wait a minute.”","Chu Youyou called out and strode over. When she saw the waitress’s face clearly, she was stunned and immediately checked her communication wristband to confirm the information. Then, she said in shock, “Are you Liang Mengqi?”","It was a shot in the dark.","She never thought about finding anyone. Unexpectedly, when she came out to have fun, she found a wanted person.","“Yeah,” Liang Mengqi responded, with hope in her eyes.","“Who are you?” The old woman walked over with a gloomy expression.","“It doesn’t matter who I am.” Chu Youyou’s tone was very harsh.","Her Chu Family was prestige in this place, not to mention that she had friends with her.","“You broke into the staff’s place for no reason. I haven’t held you accountable, but you’re talking back to me instead?” The old woman’s tone directly weakened.","She was also afraid of offending the other party.","“I am Chu Youyou of the Chu Family.”","Chu Youyou took out her token and said, “If I remember correctly, this hotel belongs to the Phoenix Stream Sect. I am friends with your Eldest Lady, Ling Mei, and you...”","Before she finished her words.","“I’m sorry for my mistake.”","Those who adapt to circumstances were wise.","Chu Youyou reprimanded the old woman and then left with Liang Mengqi.","In a few days.","In the Chu Family’s residence.","“What did you say?","“You’ve actually found a wanted person?”","Grand Master Chu just happened to be going to Chu Youyou’s house. Not far from the door, he met Chu Youyou, who had just returned.","“Yes, Grand Master. I inadvertently... Ahem.” Chu Youyou coughed softly and said, “I went out of my way to look for these people. I also knew that you and the senior were in a hurry to find them. When I was searching, I accidentally discovered her. Her name is Liang Mengqi.”","“Nice to meet you, Grand Master Chu,” Liang Mengqi said.","She was about the same age as Chu Youyou, so she addressed Grand Master Chu as Chu Youyou did.","“Don’t, don’t call me that.” Grand Master Chu immediately shook his head and asked, “What’s your relationship with my Big Brother?”","“He’s my boss,” Liang Mengqi said.","“I see.” Grand Master Chu let out a sigh of relief. “It turns out that she’s just an employee.”","“Also, my husband is my boss’s first disciple.”","Grand Master Chu was speechless.","He then said, “Just call me Senior Chu. Let’s go and meet Big Brother.”","He led the way into the courtyard. The Taoist Lord of Azurepeak and Old Taoist Honghu were locked in a stalemate as they played chess.","Zhang Han was sitting on the side, drinking tea. Chu Qingyi was making tea for him, while Zhou Fei and Chen Chuan were cultivating beside them.","“Boss!”","When Liang Mengqi saw Zhang Han, her eyes turned red, and she couldn’t maintain her emotions.","“Mengqi?” Zhou Fei was a little surprised. “Come here.”","After Liang Mengqi took her seat, Zhou Fei listened to the narration of her experience.","She landed on a relatively savage planet. There were natives whose strength was not very high, and the place was filled with tribes. Liang Mengqi had lived in the wilderness for a month, and she had a tough time. Later, she was almost caught to be the wife of the brigand chief. When she escaped, she met a patrol team of some forces and was taken away. She had been trained in the hotel for two months. In fact, as a waitress, she was required to attract some powerful childes to strengthen the connections of the hotel.","As a result, a young master did take a fancy to her a few days ago. After the last resistance, she had been beaten twice.","She was being lectured these days. If she hadn’t met Chu Youyou, the consequences would have been unimaginable.","When Liang Mengqi spoke, sometimes she would cry, and Zhou Fei’s eyes were slightly red. She could empathize with her. It had been eleven months, and she was not doing okay.","“It’s no big deal to suffer a little. It’s fine as long as you end up well.”","Zhang Han also lamented.","When he met Liang Mengqi for the first time, she was still wearing a bikini and was very lively. At that time, she was interested in him. Later, she found that she only admired him, and what she had with Zhao Feng was true love.","Now Liang Mengqi had become much more mature.","“Little Zheng.”","Zhang Han’s eyes turned cold.","“I’m here, Big Brother.” Grand Master Chu immediately ran to his side.","Liang Mengqi was in a daze.","She found it quite strange that Grand Master Chu, who had white hair and a long beard, called Zhang Han Big Brother.","But she did not expect that Zhang Han would stand up for her.","Zhang Han said flatly, “Send your men to fill that hotel and inform them that the sect will come and apologize to her in five days.”","According to Liang Mengqi’s words, he knew that the sect was not very powerful. Since Grand Master Chu had high status and was in the Mastery Realm, as long as he didn’t hurt the Four Great Sects and the forces that had a strong relationship with them, there would be no problem with him doing anything else.","Zhang Han did this in order to calm Liang Mengqi down. After all, she needed to vent her anger after her terrible experience.","Grand Master Chu patted his chest as he spoke, “Okay. I’ll make the arrangements right away!”","He had completely become Old Demon Zhang’s lackey and his good brother.","“Chu Youyou, since you found Meng Qi, this is for you.”","Zhang Han took out a Space Ring casually.","Everyone knew without thinking that there were 100 million crystal stones in it.","“I, I, I...” Chu You Ran’s face turned red.","She did not dare to accept it since Grand Master Chu was staring at her with widened eyes.","“Big Brother, I can’t go back on my word. My family’s junior found the wanted person. How could she take your crystal stones? This is not okay. Take the Space Ring back now,” Grand Master Chu said.","“It’s normal to reward someone with merits. Are you trying to stop me?” Zhang Han smiled faintly.","“No. I wouldn’t dare to stop you. I just don’t want you to waste the crystal stones.” Grand Master Chu smiled awkwardly.","“Little Zheng, did I teach you in vain back then?” Zhang Han asked.","“Take the Space Ring now. This is the little something that Big Brother rewarded you.” Grand Master Chu immediately changed his words. “It’s not much. Big Brother has a lot of money.”","In front of Zhang Han, Grand Master Chu was not calm at all. In fact, he was much more lively than ever.","Chu Youyou took the Space Ring in a daze. Only after she left did she cry out in surprise, “Wow! I’m rich now!”","Zhou Fei, Chen Chuan, and Liang Mengqi, who were all low-level martial artists, came back, which made Zhang Han more relaxed.","What did this mean?","Since they were all in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven, it meant that the low-level cultivators in their team had been taken care of.","As expected.","On the seventh day.","Someone sent two people over.","“Brother!”","“Brother!”","Two voices rang out.","It was made by Zhang Li and Liang Mengqi.","Zhang Li and Liang Hao were so lucky that they ended up together.","They were very excited to meet Zhang Han, but Zhang Li was still very worried when she saw him lying on the chair. She asked about his well-being.","On the 10th day, Rong Jiaxin was sent over.","On the 11th day, Wang Ya came back.","On the 16th day, Wang Ming was sent over.","Zhang Han also offered a lot of reward crystal stones, but the more people that were sent over, the better Zhang Han’s mood was.","On the 20th, 23rd, and 26th days, some people were sent over.","Now, Zhang Han had 13 people gathered.","“Very nice.”","Zhang Han was very satisfied with this result.","More than half of the team’s lower-level members had come. As Elder Yue had said, the others also needed to explore the outside world on their own, so Zhang Han thought that they might as well go and experience.","They would display their powers when they were in danger. Zhang Han was also optimistic about those people on the team.","Everyone had their own abilities.","One month went by,","It didn’t take long, but Zhang Han’s patience had been worn out.","He did not want to wait any longer.","After Grand Master Chu and the other two arrived, Zhang Han asked, “Have you gathered all the spirit treasures?”","“We’re still short of three kinds. We’ve already bought the rest by using something to exchange them,” said Grand Master Chu.","“Okay.” Zhang Han nodded. With the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak and Old Taoist Honghu here, he said, “I don’t have many resources here now. I’ll give you two sets of cultivation methods later.”","“Oh my god!”","Old Taoist Honghu gasped.","He was utterly shocked.","But after the shock, the two were ecstatic.","“Hahaha! Thank you, Big Brother! Hahaha!” The Taoist Lord of Azurepeak couldn’t help but laugh from ear to ear.","They all had no powerful backing. If it weren’t for Brother Hanyang, they all knew that they might remain at their current level for the rest of their lives.","But now, everything was all different.","They had the chance to break through to a higher realm.","“Big Brother, as for the rewards, the news has been spread in about one-fifth of the surrounding areas, but we still can’t get to a large area and can’t inform some forces. If we want to be more efficient, I think we still need to ask for help from the people of the Four Great Sects,” said Grand Master Chu.","“We don’t need to do that yet.”","Seeing that the three of them were almost done with their business, Zhang Han revealed some news. “My physical condition is not very optimistic. Not long ago, a Demonic God launched a sneak attack on me when I was cultivating in seclusion. I was injured.”","“What? Then... Big Brother, why don’t we get you some healing medicinal pellets?” the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak asked.","“I’m fine. It’s just a short-term impact.” Zhang Han waved his hand.","When he refined the ninth-tier Soul Fixing Pellets later, he would be able to recover from his injuries. It was just that he had some problems during this period.","Upon hearing Zhang Han’s words, Old Taoist Honghu and the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak didn’t think much about his injuries.","An injured Immortal Master was still powerful.","Some people might even have some ideas about it in secret.","But they did not.","Grand Master Chu’s friends had similar personalities to him. They were all very honest people.","An hour passed.","Old Taoist Honghu ran out with an ecstatic look, “Hahaha. I can’t believe that there would be such an exquisite cultivation method in the world!”","The next hour.","The Taoist Lord of Azurepeak seemed to have drunk too much. He staggered as he walked forward, his face flushed.","“Wonderful, wonderful!”","He was naturally pleasantly surprised when he got what he wanted.","Five days later.","In front of Zhang Han, the spirit treasures he needed were all gathered.","It wasn’t easy to achieve this.","At the very least, the three forces had spent quite a bit, and at least half of their treasure vaults had been emptied.","“I’m going to cast a spell. All of you should leave now!”","Zhang Han got up from his wheelchair and slowly walked to the center of the yard.","“Can I stay?” Zhang Li asked in a low voice.","“No. You’d better go out. Don’t disturb me.” Zhang Han shook his head.","“Humph!”","With a snort, Zhang Li pulled Liang Hao out.","But the more Zhang Han behaved in this way, the more worried she became.","After they left, Zhang Li was still worried and asked, “Why would he need so many spiritual treasures to cast magic? Can he do it? Why didn’t he ask you guys to help him?”","In fact, she was referring to Grand Master Chu and the other two when she said “you guys”.","The others weren’t strong enough, but the three of them definitely were.","“Miss, we’re clumsy and Big Brother wouldn’t dare to use our help.” Grand Master Chu bitterly smiled.","These people became anxious and waited.","Clatter!","A layer of light undulations swirled around the entire residence, tightly sealing off all probing.","“It’s about to start.”","Zhang Han stood in the center of the yard and looked up at the sky with a special soft smile on his face.","“Wait for me,” he muttered in a low voice.","The jade cauldron was taken out.","Dozens of kinds of spirit treasures, including sixth-tier, seventh-tier, and eighth-tier ones, began to float and shine in the Heaven-earth Formation set up by tens of thousands of top-grade crystals, and mysterious energy was released.","“With my blood!","“Blood Source Incantation!”","Zhang Han’s eyes suddenly burst into red light.","He placed his hands on the jade cauldron.","Less than a second later, Zhang Han’s hands turned blood red. Wisps of blood floated out and turned into blood mist energy. The energy was absorbed into the jade cauldron and merged with the Myriad Wood Chaotic Qi.","One drop of blood, two drops... They were like a stream.","Zhang Han’s palms were very red.","But from his arms to the rest of his body, he gradually turned pale all over.","He was afraid that his energy was not enough.","There was only one drop of blood essence left in his whole body.","If it weren’t for the fact that his Immortal Body of the Five Elements was strong, there would definitely be some problems.","“Blood Source Incantation!”","Zhang Han’s voice was soft. With countless wills, he controlled the Heaven-earth Formation and activated all kinds of spiritual treasures that served as the formation eye.","Wisps of energy, in all kinds of colors, along with the most important Myriad Wood Chaotic Qi and his blood, constantly flowed into the jade cauldron.","A spell was cast.","Rumble!","It was as if a clap of thunder had struck the courtyard.","The whole world had turned red.","In the unseen senses, Zhang Han felt that the two wisps of blood mist seemed to have cut through the void and were constantly shuttling in two directions.","Those were the places where Zi Yan and Mengmeng were.","The Blood Source Incantation was connected into threads, which meant that they were safe and alive.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Zhang Han continued to stimulate his energy.","He saw it.","One of the red threads showed that the location was in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven. It was neither too close nor too far away. As for the other thread, he didn’t know how far the location was away, but he could feel that it was in another Astral Realm, which was so far away that he could not even tell how far away it was.","Crack!","The energy inside the jade cauldron was worn out.","The last bit of energy formed a red heart-shaped seal in Zhang Han’s right palm.","It was done. The Blood Source Incantation had lost the support of energy, and Zhang Han couldn’t afford to hold on any longer. Generally speaking, no one below the Tribulation Stage dared to use this kind of incantation.","“Wait for me.”","Zhang Han staggered, and he had to stop with every step.","He walked a dozen meters for a minute before he sat down on the chair, took two medicinal pellets, and fell asleep.","One day, two days, and three days had passed.","“It’s been three days. Why is it not over yet?” Zhang Li and the others were very anxious outside.","“Can I go in and check on him?”","“Don’t do it,” the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak said. “He has so many high-grade spirit treasures here. They must be incredibly powerful. It’s normal for him to cast magic for a month, much less three days. Let’s not disturb him for now.”","“Let’s wait a little longer. Don’t worry,” said Old Taoist Honghu.","Four days passed.","The fifth day was about to pass.","Almost everyone was waiting silently outside the yard.","“Are you all waiting here?”","Zhang Han’s voice came from inside the courtyard.","The Bounded Domain on the outside had dissipated.","“Of course, we have to wait. None of us knows what’s in there, and you don’t let anyone stay there,” Zhang Li said resentfully.","They didn’t dare to stay inside. When Zhang Han cast the Blood Source Incantation, the scene would be rather miserable.","But in fact, everything was all under Zhang Han’s control."]},{"number":1422,"title":"Chapter 1422 Entering the Vast Heaven Star","paragraphs":["Chapter 1422 Entering the Vast Heaven Star","Zhang Han would try his best to find Mengmeng and Zi Yan, no matter how far away they were from him and how much he had to go through.","Now that he had received the news of them, Zhang Han felt at ease.","“You will stay here and rest for the next few days.”","Zhang Han said to the crowd, “I guess more people will be found later.”","“Brother, what are you going to do?” Zhang Li’s face changed slightly.","“I’m going to pick up your sister-in-law and the others,” Zhang Han replied.","“Do you need our help?” Grand Master Chu said, “Don’t worry, Big Brother. Just let us know if we can help.”","“Yeah. Where are you going, Big Brother?” the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak asked.","Hearing this, Zhang Han raised his hand and said, “You guys will stay here. Take this place as a base and try to find as many people as you can.”","While speaking, Zhang Han looked away.","“Lili, you and Liang Hao can travel on the Heavenly Double Star. This planet is not too small...”","Zhang Han looked at the crowd and gave them some instructions.","He was the most serious with Liang Mengqi.","He said in a deep voice to her, “Mengqi, you had a miscarriage, so your body is a bit injured. I’ve left you twenty-one medicinal pellets. Take them according to my instructions. Once you’ve recovered, you’ll be fine as long as Xiaofeng is with you.”","“Got it.” There was disappointment in Liang Mengqi’s eyes.","She had thought that she would give birth to a son for Zhao Feng, but she did not expect such a thing to happen.","She felt very helpless.","“Master, I can go with you,” Chu Qingyi said.","She wanted to follow Zhang Han’s lead.","“Yeah. Big Brother, the three of us can go with you. The two of them will stay behind. I can be your assistant or something,” Grand Master Chu said.","As soon as he spoke, Chu Qingyi stopped talking.","“I may go to the Vast Heaven Star first,” Zhang Han said.","“The Vast Heaven Star?” Old Taoist Honghu’s face froze for a moment. “Outsiders can’t enter that place. Even if they can, they can only enter a few trading cities. They can’t go anywhere else at all.”","“The key is how long one stays there. If it’s just one or two days, one can make a trip to several trade cities,” Grand Master Chu said. “I knew Elder Jonaf of the Ling Sea Sword Sect back then, but it’s said that he was killed by a sneak attack of the Heavenly Evil Sect during a mission. Now, I don’t know any people there.”","“The Four Great Sects of the Vast Heaven Star aren’t that easy to enter.” The Taoist Lord of Azurepeak laughed bitterly. “They don’t even care about the powers outside. The rules of the Vast Heaven Star are very strict, and it’s not easy to enter. However, I do know of a way. If you can pass the trials of the Mysterious Towers, you’ll be brought to the sect and tested with the outer disciples. This is the fastest way to get inside the Vast Heaven Star.”","Zhang Han frowned slightly when he heard that.","He began to ponder.","“The Astral Domain of Vast Heaven is huge, which is 30,000 times larger than the Heavenly Double Star. Many cultivators can only circle the planet once in decades by flying. There are a lot of opportunities on the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven, as well as several battlefields and horrible mountain ranges full of Exotic Beasts.”","Grand Master Chu said, “Looking for someone on the Vast Heaven Star is like finding a needle in a haystack. The key is to know where they are. The Four Great Sects are heavily guarded. Once we get discovered while entering, we will definitely be in trouble.”","When it came to the Vast Heaven Star, the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak and the others were powerless, even if they wanted to go there.","They didn’t have an idea to deal with the problem.","Although their individual strength was relatively high, the Vast Heaven Star on the Vast Heaven Star did not care.","Zhang Han asked after a while, “Where are the Mysterious Towers?”","He had a way to force his way in, but if he wanted to enter in a safer way, he needed to pass the trials and enter a sect with a normal identity to look for the people on his team.","“There are only two Mysterious Towers. One is in the Authentic Martial Arts Sect, and the other is in the Ling Sea Sword Sect.”","Grand Master Chu said, “The number of inner-door disciples in the Authentic Martial Arts Sect is the least, even smaller than that of the outer-door disciples. That’s because they attach more importance to Body Cultivation. They are the number one Body Cultivation sect in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven. The Ling Sea Sword Sect majors in swordsmanship and has many people, but it fights against the Heavenly Evil Sect all year round. Many talented disciples of the two sects have been targeted by the other sect. I heard that if people can kill any one of them, they can get a lot of spiritual treasures.”","“Little Zheng, take me to the Mysterious Tower of the Ling Sea Sword Sect,” Zhang Han said.","It was in line with his wishes that the place was filled with constant battles and chaos.","“Okay.” Grand Master Chu nodded with a smile, “Big Brother, when do we set off?”","“Now,” Zhang Han said without hesitation.","Grand Master Chu was speechless.","“We are setting off now?","“He decided it so quickly.”","Grand Master Chu said, “We’ll go to the space station. The Radiant Institute has a king vessel called the Torrent, which is at the level of S102 and very fast. If we take that spaceship, we’ll probably be able to reach the destination in about ten days.”","“Alright.”","Zhang Han nodded slightly. With a pale face, he glanced around the crowd again.","“You guys will have a good rest here. With Honghu and Azurepeak around, you will be safe. If you need anything, you can ask them for help.”","“Yes. If you need anything, just let me know.” The Taoist Lord of Azurepeak thumped his chest. “Don’t worry, Big Brother. We’ll be waiting for you here.","Honghu also said, “The cultivation method you gave me is too profound. I reckon I will cultivate it in Old Chu’s place for several years.”","Without a doubt, he was going to guard this place, not even returning to his own residence.","In the crowd’s reluctant farewells, Grand Master Chu wheeled the wheelchair and entered the aircraft with Zhang Han. The aircraft rose into the air and disappeared into the horizon.","Liang Mengqi, Zhang Li, Chu Qingyi, and the others also knew that as long as Zhang Han couldn’t find Zi Yan and Mengmeng, he would not be at peace.","As for the others who were missing, because of what the crowd had experienced, they were a bit more at ease. The places they were teleported to were not that terrible.","Those people were stronger and their means were also more powerful. They had been taught by Zhang Han personally.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","Zhang Li patted Liang Mengqi on the shoulder and said, “Don’t worry, Mengqi. Zhao Feng may be having a good time out there.”","“Yeah,” Liang Mengqi responded.","However, inside the Ancient Mine.","Clang! Clang! Clang!","“Hurry up and dig!”","Some of the guards shouted with cold faces. From time to time, they would swing their whips to whip the miners.","“Alas. I don’t deserve this...” Chen Changqing sighed deeply and sadly.","“Eh? Brother Qing?”","A familiar voice rang out from the side.","“Xiaofeng?”","Chen Changqing was a little pleasantly surprised.","He felt a little better upon seeing his family.","“You’re here too?”","“Yeah. What a coincidence that you’re also here.”","“I’ve been here for ten months.”","“In that case, I was teleported to the mine a month earlier than you. I’ve been here for eleven months.”","“Xiaofeng, you are more miserable.”","“...”","Zhang Han and Zhang Li were indeed siblings. They had been too confident about the others’ situations, but they had jinxed it.","Zhao Feng and Chen Changqing, the two miserable brothers, met in the Ancient Mine. However, their chances of escaping were slim.","Grand Master Chu had personally requested borrowing the highest-end king vessel in the Radiant Institute.","“Let’s go to the Vast Wood Star.”","It would be a long journey.","Grand Master Chu introduced, “Big Brother, the Vast Heaven Star is different from the past. There are only five planets in its surroundings, and they are renamed Vast Gold Star, Vast Wood Star, Vast Water Star, Vast Fire Star, and Vast Earth Star. They’re equivalent to the offices of the Four Great Sects. Vast Gold Star belongs to the Authentic Martial Arts Sect, Vast Wood Star belongs to the Ling Sea Sword Sect, Vast Fire Star belongs to the Heavenly Evil Sect, and the other two planets are the Crimson Sunglow Sect’s.","“The conflicts between the Four Great Sects never end.","“However, the fights between the Ling Sea Sword Sect and the Heavenly Evil Sect are the most serious. There are often big battles between the two sects. The Authentic Martial Arts Sect would occasionally participate in the battles. They would train their disciples in different periods and fight against the Ling Sea Sword Sect or the Heavenly Evil Sect. It seems reckless. Only the Red Glow Sect has fewer battles. They seem to be adopting a low profile to gain more. They have the largest number of disciples, and they would fight against other sects occasionally, but they would keep those fights to small sizes.","“If we go to the Ling Sea Sword Sect and want to enter the sect at a non-examination time, we’ll have to pass the trials of the Mysterious Tower. It’s said that it has 20 floors. If we pass 10 floors, we can enter the outer court. If we pass 15 floors, we can enter the inner court. If we pass 18 floors, we can become the chief disciples and the talents fought over by various peaks. No one has ever passed all 20 floors yet.","“Big Brother, you can clear all the 20 floors easily, and you will get to shock the other party. You can choose any peak you want.”","Zhang Han, however, shook his head without saying anything.","It would be too high-profile to pass all the 20 floors.","Zhang Han only wanted to find his family now.","“When I went out to travel last time, I passed by the Vast Gold Star and saw the Mysterious Tower. It was so high that it reached the clouds. Those who went in there to experience had to line up. More than 10,000 people went there and took the trials every day. It is said that only one in ten thousand people can succeed. On average, there will be one person who passes the trials in 10 days.","“It’ll probably take us a few days to wait in line.","“AH!”","Grand Master Chu suddenly let out a cry of alarm.","“Hmm?” Zhang Han glanced at him.","“I forgot that one should be at least under 100 years old to take the trials. Big Brother, I don’t even know how old you are. I suppose that you don’t meet the requirements! Why don’t we go back and discuss it later?”","Zhang Han closed his eyes again and said softly, “My body is very young.”","Grand Master Chu’s mouth quivered.","“Could it be that Big Brother has reforged his body, or has he been possessed by someone?”","Since he couldn’t figure it out, Grand Master Chu didn’t ask any more questions. He told Zhang Han everything he knew about the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven and then began to cultivate.","When he was with Zhang Han, he could ask him anything he didn’t understand, and he enjoyed it.","A dozen days passed in the blink of an eye.","Grand Master Chu was still lost in his learning from Zhang Han. “We’re almost there.”","After passing through a few patrol posts at the space station, they finally came to the surface.","The tall towering Mysterious Tower was right in front of them.","As Grand Master Chu had said, there were a lot of people queuing.","In the past ten days, Zhang Han had taken seven medicinal pellets and his soul had recovered.","As long as his injury of the Great Domain was stabilized, there would be no problem.","At this point, Zhang Han subconsciously didn’t want to take the wheelchair.","“Big Brother, why are you up? Sit down now. I’ll wheel you,” Grand Master Chu said quite enthusiastically.","Zhang Han’s face darkened when he heard that.","“I took the wheelchair to rest. It’s not that I’m disabled.”","“Huh?”","Grand Master Chu had nothing to say in response.","He followed Zhang Han obediently and walked to the street where people lined up to enter the Mysterious Tower.","The scene was extremely lively. It was as if those people had come to the capital to take the exam.","Many people came with companions. They stood on both sides of the street, where there were more people. The line was in the middle of the continent.","One could hear the discussion of the surrounding crowd.","“About 4600 people failed today. The best one only managed to pass the fifth floor.”","“The trials of Mysterious Tower on the Golden Wood Planet are especially difficult.”","“But those who are able to pass will enter the outer court of the Ling Sea Sword Sect, and they will have a different status.”"]},{"number":1423,"title":"Chapter 1423 The Assessment","paragraphs":["Chapter 1423 The Assessment","The Four Great Sects, even their outer disciples, had a lot of prestige in other places.","To be able to enter the Four Great Sects meant that one’s potential was passable and very likely to become a master.","But all this was not worth mentioning in Zhang Han’s eyes.","He stood in line without saying anything.","Some people in the line even looked at him curiously.","A young woman greeted him.","“Fellow Daoist, may I ask where you are from?”","Zhang Han did not even raise his eyelids.","He ignored her.","This caused the young woman to be quite dissatisfied.","“Humph. How dare you be so arrogant?","“When I pass the Mysterious Tower’s assessment, I will ignore you as well if you come to talk to me.”","She waited for a while.","The woman turned around again and said, “If you’re mute, then forget what I just said.","“However, if you are cold and aloof, you deserve to be scolded.”","Zhang Han gave her a look.","He couldn’t be bothered to say anything.","He was still silent.","The woman with a round face turned around, and a tall man in front of her chatted with her casually.","However, the woman did not respond to him.","She seemed to be a little upset with Zhang Han and didn’t want to talk.","After Zhang Han waited a few hours in line, it was finally about to be his turn.","“Remember, my name is Meng Ling’er,” the young woman said with a light snort.","A few minutes after she entered the Mysterious Tower, her ranking continued to rise.","She passed thirteen floors.","“Good heavens!”","“Finally, someone has passed the test.”","“It’s Meng Ling’er. It’s that young lady who was in the line just now.”","“She still has two more floors to go before she becomes an inner-door disciple.”","“Even if she only makes it to the thirteenth floor, she can basically pass the outer-door assessment. I wonder which sect this talent is from.”","A lot of people in the crowd gasped.","Meng Ling’er ran out and looked at Zhang Han with pride.","When she arrived at the place for promotion, an inner-door disciple congratulated her before she sat down on the chair aside.","At this time, it was already dusk. The disciple felt that she was lucky to be the only one who had passed the trials.","Unexpectedly, after a few minutes, Zhang Hanyang passed 11 floors.","He passed the trials and became an outer-door disciple.","“Another one has passed.”","“Two people pass the test in a day. It’s horrifying. It seems that this has not happened in more than 50 years.”","The Four Great Sects of the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven were a sacred land on the Vast Heaven Star.","Almost all of the outstanding disciples would pass the official assessment.","However, a small number of them had avoided the assessment and gained some new opportunities, and their strength had improved by leaps and bounds.","However, there were only a few such people.","Although the Four Great Sects were powerful, there were also many outstanding talents who would stay in their own sects. Only when the time was right would they go to the Four Great Sects for further development.","“Congratulations, Big Brother,” said Grand Master Chu via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique from afar.","“You can go back now. Take good care of my family for me,” Zhang Han replied.","“Don’t worry. As long as I’m alive, they will definitely not be in any danger,” said Grand Master Chu solemnly.","“Alright.”","Zhang Han smiled at him and nodded.","Only then did he sit down on the chair aside to rest.","“You, you actually passed as well?” Meng Ling’er said in shock.","“Not bad. Two have passed the trials today.”","The inner-door disciple said with a smile, “Meng Ling’er and Zhang Hanyang. Well, Meng Ling’er, you passed 13 floors. You’re talented, and it won’t be a big problem for you to pass the inner-door assessment. Zhang Hanyang, you’ve only passed 11 floors, and the assessment will take place in a month. You need to work harder. You two will be tested with tens of thousands of outer-door disciples in the same area, and only one-tenth of you will pass the assessment.”","Zhang Han listened to what the disciple said, but he wasn’t quite interested in taking the assessment.","Meng Ling’er looked like she was only seventeen or eighteen years old, and she was quite lively.","Finally, Meng Ling’er said very angrily, “Zhang Hanyang, can you speak or not?","“We will be assigned to a place of the outer court. We may even be assigned to the same residential area. I have entered the sect before you. You may need to call me Senior Sister.","“You can’t speak. Don’t just sit here and be an eyesore.”","She looked very angry.","She was a bit like Mengmeng.","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and said, “I’m tired after the long journey. I need to rest.”","“Hmm? You’re not mute!","“You can talk. Where do you come from?”","“...”","Zhang Han suddenly felt a little regretful and wondered if he should have ignored her.","After two hours, another inner-door disciple came over to take over the work.","“Oh? Two people? You’re so lucky. You have two qualified people once you supervised the trials. According to the previous probability, I don’t think there will be one person passing the trials in three days under my supervision.”","“Hahaha, that’s not how it is. Maybe three people will pass the trials under your supervision tomorrow.”","The disciple who was leading Zhang Han and Meng Ling’er smiled and took the lead in leaving.","The inner-door disciple said, “Get on the spaceship.","“You are about to enter the Vast Heaven Star, the largest planet in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven. Among the Four Great Sects, our Ling Sea Sword Sect’s strength belongs to the upper class. Remember, after you enter the outer court, you will be a member of the Ling Sea Sword Sect. Don’t disgrace the sect when you travel in the outside world.”","“Got it,” Meng Ling’er said in a perfunctory tone.","Zhang Han did not respond at all.","He was rather silent.","In the eyes of the inner sect disciple, however, it was a sign that Zhang Han was inexperienced.","“They don’t dare to speak and are sullen. Many of the new disciples are the same. I guess they will start to joke around after they get familiar with the environment in a few days.”","The competition in the Ling Sea Sword Sect was very fierce.","Those who stood aloof from worldly affairs were simply not suited to experience the outside world.","Many disciples had just arrived at the sect, so they had to get familiar with the environment before they could be carefree and casual.","“The flight will last for about five hours.”","The inner-door disciple said, “I’m going to cultivate. You can learn about the sect’s information from the system on the spaceship.”","After that, the inner-door disciple who led the team walked into the practice room.","“Hey.”","Meng Ling’er sat beside Zhang Han and called out to him.","Unexpectedly, the man next to her closed his eyes and slept there. It was as if he didn’t even see her.","Meng Ling’er gave a cold harrumph and said nothing.","She was in a good mood after passing the trials, so she didn’t care much about Zhang Han ignoring her.","About four hours later, they were about to reach the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.","Zhang Han opened his eyes and browsed through some basic information in the system.","The information was rather comprehensive. There was information about the territories of the Four Great Sects, the Exotic Beast Mountain Range, several large battlefields, the sea area, and so on.","“The current situation is somewhat different from a thousand years ago.”","Back then, the Eight Sects were still here. Zhang Han didn’t travel here for a long time. After about a decade, he went to the Silver Dragon Galaxy.","He silently kept the information in mind.","After a while, the spaceship left the secondary space.","“The Vast Heaven Star is so big!”","Meng Ling’er had been prepared for it. In fact, she had even heard of how enormous it was. However, when she saw it, she was still shocked.","The huge planet appeared in front of them. It was as if there was no end of it in sight. Their spaceship was as small as a grain of dust compared to the planet.","“Huh.”","The inner-door disciple came out and said, “We’ve arrived. One can only come to the Vast Heaven Star through the space station. Although it is huge, the air layer of the Vast Heaven Star is very tightly guarded. The space station can detect everything unusual from a distance. This is the highest-end science and cultivation gathering place in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven. If you pass the inner-door assessment, you will feel that in the Vast Heaven Star, you will be surpassed by countless people if you slack off a little.”","“...”","As he spoke, the spaceship arrived at a space station. After passing through it smoothly, they took the aircraft to the ground. They could see cities and many large areas comparable to those of the large sects in the outside world.","The space station was like the security room of a university.","“In front of us is City A311 of the outer court.","“Meng Ling’er, you’ve passed 13 floors. You’ll stay in Villa No. 18 in Maple Villa District. Zhang Hanyang, you’ll stay in Villa No. 106.”","“The difference between us is huge.”","Meng Ling’er blinked.","They arrived at the Maple Villa District.","“How come his villa is right behind mine?” Meng Ling’er said in confusion.","“They’re different,” the inner-door disciple said. “Your villa is facing the Great Clear Lake in a good direction, and you can enjoy the scenery at any time. The people who stay in the villas at the back don’t have this kind of benefit. Don’t look down on the Great Clear Lake. In fact, there are more than a hundred kinds of occult art in the waves here. Whether you can comprehend them or not depends on your cultivation.”","“More than a hundred kinds of occult art?” Meng Ling’er chuckled.","She felt happy.","“I’m leaving. The basic principles are all in your room. You can read them by yourself.”","After saying that, the inner-door disciple who led the two here left.","Zhang Han silently walked to his villa.","When he reached the door, a small intelligent ball flew over.","It scanned Zhang Han’s body from top to bottom.","“Recording the appearance information.","“Recording...”","Bang!","A puff of smoke came out as Zhang Han pushed the door open and entered.","“It’s time.”","Zhang Han sat cross-legged on the floor. After he ran his power, a lot of Formation Stones emerged.","Clap! Clap!","The Formation Stones were shattered, and the energy was stimulated on the red seal in his right hand.","Zhang Han instantly felt a few strands of red silken threads.","There were five of them in total.","One of them was very clear. It seemed to have broken the void, leading to a certain place.","The other three threads, however, were quite weak.","The last one was indistinct and difficult to sense.","Swoosh!","Zhang Han immediately ended the Blood Source Incantation.","The red seal couldn’t be used often. Once his energy was exhausted, he might not be lucky enough to encounter the Myriad Wood Chaotic Qi.","“Map.”","Zhang Han conjured up a map of the Vast Heaven Star.","His eyes were fixed on the northwest area, where the coordinates indicated.","“Crimson Sunglow Sect?”","Zhang Han frowned slightly.","“The detection in midair of the Vast Heaven Star is not weak, and it’s difficult for spaceships to cross the sect. With my current strength, I’m far from enough to achieve it.","“I’m afraid it’ll take a hundred days to cross the Exotic Beast Mountain Range with the speed of the Seven-star Sword in the Crimson Sunglow Sect.”","After thinking for a while, Zhang Han began to check the basic information of the sects from an energy wristband.","“The fifth war zone.”","The Ling Sea Sword Sect and the Heavenly Evil Sect had been fighting all year round, and their inner disciples had countless training tasks, one of which was to go to the war zone.","“It would be a waste of time to go there now.","“The inner-door assessment will take place in a month. If I accept the logistics mission of the war zone and go to the fifth war zone, which is not too far from the Crimson Sunglow Sect, I’ll be able to reach there in ten days.”","After Zhang Han thought it over, he took a medicinal pellet and began to comprehend the essence of the Immortal Body of the Five Elements.","The power of the Space-splitting Punch could be continuously improved, perfected, and integrated with the Law and attributes, resulting in different results.","After making up his mind, Zhang Han began to cultivate in seclusion for a month.","It wasn’t until the day of the inner-door assessment that Zhang Han opened his eyes. There was a flash of light in them.","He got up, left the villa straightforwardly, and followed the crowd to the downtown area.","There were many people in a huge field.","“In the assessment, you’re required to fight against five inner-door disciples. As long as you defeat them or obtain their approval, you will pass.”","“There are 1,350 inner-door disciples over here.”","“You can start the assessment now. Choose your opponents on the stage and begin the battle.”"]},{"number":1424,"title":"Chapter 1424 The Earth Dragon Peak","paragraphs":["Chapter 1424 The Earth Dragon Peak","“I’ll go first.”","“There’s no hurry, Zhong Chengfeng. I’ve been cultivating hard for a year. Now I’m finally going to have my cultivation tested. You’d better wait!”","“I’ll go on the stage first and set an example for you.”","“Just wait and see how I beat up the inner-door disciples.”","Many people were arrogant.","Looking at the young and vigorous outer-door disciples, the inner-door disciples wearing the same green robes smiled without saying anything.","“Do they think that they’re powerful enough to teach the inner-door disciples a lesson?”","The dozens of rings that had attracted everyone’s attention were soon filled.","The person who said that he would beat up the inner-door disciples looked arrogant, but his heart was beating violently.","“After a year of hard work, it’s time for the assessment. We’ll see whether I succeed or fail today.”","“You, you, you, you, and you!”","He randomly pointed at five people.","He recognized none of these inner-door disciples, and they didn’t need to be selected.","“You are very arrogant.”","One of the inner-door disciples stepped onto the stage first and stared at him coldly.","The air was filled with killing intent, which was like the wind after the rain, making people feel cold both physically and mentally.","The inner-door disciples often fought to the death in the outside world. How could they be the same as those outer-door disciples who were groomed in a delicate environment?","Just their momentums alone were enough to show their differences.","Swoosh!","As expected.","The inner-door disciple rushed forward, and with only half of his strength, he knocked the person who shouted to beat up the inner-door disciples out of the ring.","That person’s face was slightly pale.","“How could there be such a huge gap between us?”","“You’re not good enough. You’d better be more groveling with this little ability.”","After teaching him a lesson, the inner-door disciple left indifferently.","That outer-door disciple’s face turned slightly pale.","“I lost too quickly.","“He’s so powerful!”","At the same time, on the dozens of rings, many inner-door disciples were discussing.","“He’s too weak.”","“After a year of hard work, he’s only at such a level? I just want to say that he’s truly rubbish.”","“He can’t even withstand three moves from me. How is he going to enter the inner court?”","“The current outer-door disciples are getting worse and worse.”","“...”","Many outer-door disciples gradually became depressed.","The place became quieter and quieter. In the end, very few people spoke.","The inner-door disciples examined these people by first lecturing them that they shouldn’t think that they could pass the assessment just because they had some ability.","“It’s too hard to pass the assessment!”","“When will there be a winner?”","Many of the rather famous outer-door disciples in this city were defeated one after another.","However, there were quite a few people who truly had some tricks up their sleeves, and they didn’t rush to fight against the inner-door disciples.","That was because they knew that during every term’s inner-door assessment, many inner-door disciples liked to abuse outer-door disciples first.","That was to say, if they were to challenge the inner-door disciples first, there was a high chance of them losing.","Gradually, the outer-door disciples seemed to have discovered this.","None of them was willing to go on the stage.","Many rings had been emptied.","The chief supervisor on the side said in a cold voice, “If you don’t even have the courage to fight, how would you be qualified to enter the Ling Sea Sword Sect?”","At this time, anyone who stepped onto the stage would become the center of attention.","If someone won against an inner-door disciple, they would enjoy endless glory, and even the chief supervisor would treat them differently.","Zhang Han didn’t try to be the center of focus.","He remained in the same spot in silence.","Finally, there was someone who couldn’t hold back.","“Let me have a try.”","A white-robed young man jumped into the ring and quickly pointed at five inner-door disciples. “Senior Brothers, please go easy on me.”","“It’s Han Qianmeng.”","“It’s him. If he can’t win, then this assessment will be too... too... unreasonable.”","There was a lot of discussion in the crowd.","One of the several inner-door disciples went up to the stage.","“I’ve heard of you. You’re doing pretty well here, but I won’t hold back.”","“It will just be a knock between us.”","Han Qianmen chuckled, and a long sword appeared in his right hand.","Clang! Clang! Clang!","It was a fierce battle with his opponent.","In just fifteen seconds, the inner-door disciple stepped back more than ten meters with surprise in his eyes.","“Not bad. You can defeat me while I use sixty percent of my strength. You’ve passed my test.”","“Thank you.”","Han Qianmen made an obeisance by cupping one hand in the other before his chest, looking humble.","The outer-door disciples gradually began to talk more and more.","Many people fixed their eyes on Han Qianmen.","He won against all the four other outer-door disciples.","The first disciple who had defeated all his opponents in the inner-door assessment of this city had appeared, and his name was Han Qianmen.","For a moment, he had endless glory, and countless envious words were heard frequently.","“Amazing.”","Meng Ling’er ran to Zhang Han and said with a chuckle, “I can pass the test as well, but you... I don’t think you will, nerd. Why aren’t you worried at all?”","Zhang Han ignored her.","Meng Ling’er was unwilling to give up.","“Can’t you be a bit emotional?","“Hey, have you ever said anything since you got here?”","“What...”","Zhang Han exhaled and said, “Go up there.”","He ran his power slightly.","Meng Ling’er could sense an irresistible force, and she was immediately thrown into the ring.","“What the hell?”","Meng Ling’er was dumbfounded.","“What’s going on?","“This man... Damn it, he’s powerful!”","“Why are you waiting for? Choose your opponents now.”","One of the inner-door disciples urged Meng Ling’er.","She glared at him. “What’s the rush? I’ll choose you! Come here and I’ll kill you!”","She continued to pick out the other four.","Her battles had begun.","She had a tough fight in the first round, but she still won in the end.","Finally, she won four rounds and lost one round. She passed the test.","As time went on, more and more disciples passed the test.","The attacks from the inner-door disciples were not as fierce as before.","This made the disciple who had first jumped into the ring feel extremely annoyed. “I shouldn’t have gone up there so soon!”","At last, only a few dozen people were left.","“Hurry up and get on the stage. The results of the assessment will be released immediately,” the chief supervisor urged.","Zhang Han followed the crowd to a ring.","He pointed to the five people closest to him.","Swoosh!","As soon as the first person stepped into the ring, Zhang Han gently threw a punch before he could stand firm.","Seeing this, the inner-door disciple did not draw his sword but met the attack with a punch.","Bang!","He stepped back for dozens of meters and left the edge of the ring.","“What...”","His pupils constricted. “This person definitely has the strength of an inner-door disciple.”","A friend next to him mocked, “Did you go easy on him?”","He jumped into the ring and threw a punch before Zhang Han could make a move as if to prove that he was better than the man just now.","Bang!","Zhang Han made another punch.","The second inner-door disciple stepped off the stage at a faster speed.","“What?”","The person who left the stage was taken aback. “I’ve used seventy percent of my strength, but I still failed to defeat you.”","The third one flashed into the ring. In less than three seconds, he got off the ring.","“Can I pass now?” Zhang Han asked.","“Yes.”","“I’ll stop fighting then.” Zhang Han was not interested in the test, so he went straight to the crowd where the advanced disciples were.","Meng Ling’er stood aside and said, “You sure have a personality.”","However, the inner-door disciples looked at each other.","Someone asked a question that they were curious about and shocked them.","“Do you think that Zhang Hanyang used all his strength just now?”","“Damn!","“Who knows?","“His strength is unfathomable.","“This is shocking even if he has faked his performance.”","“Now, I’ll announce the list of the ones who have advanced.”","The chief supervisor, who was in charge of this place, glanced at Zhang Han before he glanced ahead and announced, “For those who have lost, you will get a score from each of the five inner-door disciples who have fought against you. Each of them has 10 points. There are 50 points in total. Those who have more than 30 points will be addressed as inner-door disciples.”","Clatter!","Instantly, the scene fell into an uproar.","This was an opportunity for the outer-door disciples who had lost.","There was no such a good thing in the last inner-door assessment.","The list of the advanced ones was announced.","The number of people who were finally promoted to inner-door disciples was settled.","“All of you, follow me to the sect.”","The ones who had advanced took the transport spaceships. Flying at a high speed, they arrived at the inner court in two hours.","There were several large cities around the inner court.","At a glance, Zhang Han knew that the inner-court area was filled with ancient buildings on mountain peaks.","Generally speaking, this was the case for the sects that had been passed down.","“You’ll rest in the guest rooms today and choose the peaks tomorrow.”","More than a dozen spaceships arrived at the center of several buildings. The inner-door disciples entered the buildings and checked into the rooms that had been arranged.","From a distance, one could see that there were people coming and going in every building not far away.","The passing rate for the inner-door assessment was roughly 10%.","However, the number of people who passed was still so many. It could be imagined how many outer-door disciples there were.","The major sects naturally attracted many people.","Zhang Han checked into a guest room and had a good understanding of the peaks.","The easiest way to get to the fifth war zone was to go to the Earth Dragon Peak, a peak that specialized in formations.","Even the newly recruited disciples could take on tasks and go to the war zone to assist in setting up the Heaven-earth Formation or set up some formations on the defense line of the sect’s territory.","They could walk around.","The next day, when the sun had just risen, the peak meeting began.","There were excellent disciples from the various peaks, with the lowest being the chief supervisors and the highest being the protectors.","They personally introduced the characteristics of their peaks. In order to attract disciples, they also put in a lot of good words for their peaks.","For example, someone gave such an introduction.","“There are too many female disciples in Flower Sea Peak, especially the beautiful ones. There are more ladies than men at our peak. Therefore, we hope that some male disciples can come. Well, many female disciples have said that they want to date and get themselves a Cultivational Partner.”","“That’s despicable!”","“They even dare to use this kind of trick!”","Many of the peak representatives were furious.","“Our Pellet-refining Peak has a vast territory. Each disciple can receive three medicinal pellets for cultivation every month.”","“Crimson Training Peak needs fresh powers. Join our peak and you can get a spirit treasure.”","It sounded very tempting, but they didn’t say what level the medicinal pellets and the spirit weapons were.","However, everyone also knew that what the Ling Sea Sword Sect would offer was not bad.","The most aloof one was a disciple from the Sword Edge. When he spoke, a sword light gathered from the sky, representing the will of the sect.","“In the sect, the Sword Edge is the strongest. We specialize in battles. Cowards are not allowed to enter.”","He sounded cold and indifferent.","However, he received thousands upon thousands of responses, and the roars shook the heavens and earth.","Most of the people who came to the Ling Sea Sword Sect were going to the Sword Edge.","Seeing this, the representative of the Sword Edge added, “Sword Edge has recruited three hundred thousand people this time. Too many have signed up, and they need to be selected through the second examination.”","Those people all wanted to go to the Sword Edge, but it wouldn’t take all of them.","Every year, millions of people would succeed in the inner-door assessment. These people were the elites of the younger generation in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.","It sounded like there were a lot of them, but in fact, the success rate was very low.","However, Zhang Han was not attracted to those forces at all.","He went straight to the Earth Dragon Peak. Without taking the exam, he directly joined the sect.","The selections went on for the whole day. Except for the Sword Edge, all the other peaks had finished their selections. When the second assessment of the Sword Edge was over in a few days, they could still take in a batch of disciples."]},{"number":1425,"title":"Chapter 1425 Junior Brother Zhang Is a Good Man","paragraphs":["Chapter 1425 Junior Brother Zhang Is a Good Man","“Congratulations to you for joining Earth Dragon Peak.","“You will follow me to the outer peaks. The Earth Dragon Peak has 36 main peaks and 531 outer peaks.","“You will cultivate in the No. 7 outer peak. You can take some tutors’ classes. There will be open classes and some small classes where you can learn from the senior brothers.","“You’ve just joined the sect, so most of you will study the array of formations. When you feel that you have learned enough, you can take the tasks and go to set up the formations on the spot if you want to practice. As for the places, some of them are safe, such as the ones near the sect, and some are on the defensive line of the war zone. According to the difficulty of the tasks, you will get different points. The points are very useful, so don’t waste the initial points.","“That’s all I have to say. If you need more information, you can check on your own. The most important thing you need to do is go through the rules of the sect. I need to remind you that your points will be deducted if you violate the rules.”","The leader of Zhang Han’s team simply instructed them.","The main force set off for the Earth Dragon Peak.","The Astral Domain of Vast Heaven was huge. It took the high-end spaceship six hours to arrive at the Earth Dragon Peak of the Ling Sea Sword Sect.","Their residences had all been arranged properly. However, they were just new disciples. Their information needed to be recorded in the system, including the rooms they stayed in and various serial numbers.","Zhang Han stayed in a small manor, which was located in a large building complex.","The front yard was a training ground, while the back yard was a training field that was used for practice and evolving the array of formations. There were training rooms, lounges, and so on. It was very complete.","It could be said that the manor was fully equipped.","However, the thoughtful service could not attract Zhang Han.","After entering the house, he sat down on a chair and rested.","After his soul was injured, he usually liked to sit down and lie down.","“My identity has not been recorded in the system. I cannot accept any tasks yet.","“I can check out the treasure vault of the Ling Sea Sword Sect.","“If there are enough seventh-tier and eighth-tier spiritual herbs in that place, there will be a slight chance of success for me to refine the ninth-tier Soul Fixing Pellets.","“However, will I possibly get to achieve it?”","Zhang Han let out a soft sigh.","He felt that he might be delusional.","Without a ninth-tier Soul King Flower, it was practically impossible to refine a Soul Fixing Pellet.","“The medicinal pellets are only enough for me to replenish my energy a few times.”","Although Zhang Han had a lot of spirit treasures with him, he didn’t refine many medicinal pellets.","The soul-replenishing pellets could be used to maintain his energy twice. That was to say, in addition to this time, Zhang Han could take action three times.","“It’s about time to get some spiritual herbs.","“I need to find my family first and set aside everything else.”","Zhang Han leaned back on the sofa, closed his eyes to rest, and gradually fell asleep.","At noon the next day, all his identity information was recorded in the system.","In fact, it only took a few seconds for the staff to record the information, but the review would take a longer time.","After it was done, Zhang Han immediately clicked open the character hall on the website.","It showed that Zhang Hanyang, the disciple of the Earth Dragon Peak, got 50 points.","“I can take on a one-star mission.”","The one-star missions were the most basic and easiest.","At first glance, he found that those missions were about tracking pets or running all kinds of errands.","“There’s no mission in the fifth war zone?”","Zhang Han’s brows were knitted.","“I’ll go to the fourth war zone then.”","He was okay with whatever he did as long as he could save time.","When Zhang Han just made a decision, a brand new mission appeared.","“In the defense line of the fifth war zone, in the Compound Dragon Mountain Range, the detective formation needs maintenance and to have its formation eye replaced. The task requires ten people, led by Qijun. There will be 5 points for the task.”","It was merely an assisting task. Since it was issued by Captain Qijun, it should be a task given to him by the higher-ups. He was casually finding some disciples who could help run the errands.","“Taking it!”","Zhang Han was extremely fast.","He took the mission and confirmed it.","In just three seconds, the mission that offered only five points recruited enough people.","The system prompted, “Please gather before the Mission Hall of Earth Dragon Peak. You will be departing in four hours.”","“The efficiency is pretty good.”","Zhang Han was very satisfied with this result.","He got up and walked out of the manor. After determining the direction, he took a flying disk in the courtyard and flew at a low altitude.","He reached the Mission Hall.","Captain Qijun was standing on one side. There were already eight people in front of him, and Zhang Han was the ninth one to arrive.","Qijun sized him up and said, “A newcomer?”","“Yeah,” Zhang Han replied.","His information was on the list, so Qijun naturally knew about him.","“You know the basic array of formations, I suppose?” Qijun said casually, “If you don’t, you can make something to eat and drink for everyone on the way. You’ll be responsible for serving tea and running errands. It’s not easy for a newcomer to get five points, which can be regarded as welfare for you.”","“How generous.”","Zhang Han nodded and said with a faint smile, “Thank you, Senior Brother Qijun.”","“There’s no need for the courtesy.” Qijun waved his hand, and his expression was imposing.","After that, he stopped talking to Zhang Han, looked at the people beside him, and said, “This task is simple. We’ll succeed for sure. But it will take three months for us to go back and forth. We just need to cultivate or study the array of formations.”","After a few minutes, the last person arrived.","It was Meng Ling’er.","She also joined the Earth Dragon Peak.","“Senior Brother, I’m here to earn some credits,” said Meng Ling’er directly.","“You’re so straightforward, but I like it. Let’s go now.”","Qijun smiled and led the crowd to the aircraft area on the side.","“Eh? You’re also here?”","When Meng Ling’er saw Zhang Han, she ran to him and said, “Did you also join the Earth Dragon Peak? Why didn’t I see you...”","She had a lot of questions. Which one should he answer first?","Zhang Han was silent for two seconds and then suddenly said, “Have you taken the things you need?”","“What do you mean?”","“I mean the medicinal pellets.”","“Why would I take those for no reason?” Meng Ling’er was puzzled. “One can’t take them all the time. If you have too many, your body won’t be able to take it. You don’t even know that?”","“You are really... full of energy,” Zhang Han said.","“I’m simply lively.”","After a brief talk, they walked into an aircraft.","“This is the Level S No. 31 Aircraft, the Leaflike, which is relatively fast. It will take us about 16 days to arrive at the fifth war zone,” Qijun said. “There are only three training rooms in the small aircraft. You can share them.”","After that, he walked into a room.","As for the rest of the crowd, they also went in different rooms separately, preparing to cultivate for more than ten days.","Zhang Han had planned to sit in the lounge. He found that Meng Ling’er was in high spirits.","After thinking for a while, he walked into a practice room.","“Newcomer, you should go to the opposite room.”","There was only one person in this practice room, and he was a senior from the previous session. He was silent all the way, but right now, he was naturally arrogant.","“Is that so?”","Zhang Han stepped forward to him and squeezed his hands at the same time. In the cracking sound, he said softly, “I minored in pellet refining. In fact, my fists are quite tough now.","...","A few seconds later.","The inner-door disciple quickly ran out of the room. If one looked carefully, one would find that he was in a mess.","The man rushed into the opposite room like a gust of wind.","“Huh?”","Meng Ling’er seemed to have discovered something.","She ran over and came to the room where Zhang Han was.","She tried to pull the door open.","“It can’t be opened?”","She knocked on the door a few times, but it didn’t work. Then, she ran to the opposite room.","It was only then that she discovered that there were four people respectively in the other two rooms.","That was to say, she was alone in the lounge, Qijun occupied a room, and Zhang Hanyang also occupied a room. As for the other eight people, each four of them shared one.","“Hey?","“As newcomers, we are both treated well.”","She found it great that she and Zhang Han could have their own places.","On the first day of Zhang Han’s staying in the room, he took out hundreds of Formation Stones, which were almost used up. He placed a lot of them around the room and took out some crystal stones. After that, he rested.","Sixteen days later.","Qijun’s voice echoed, “We’ll arrive at our destination in ten minutes. Everyone, get ready. I’ll activate the outer formation. You will go to the warehouse and get something to exchange for the formation eye.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The people all walked out of the rooms and came to the hall.","“Where’s the newbie?” asked Qijun.","They couldn’t help but look at the room where Zhang Han was.","At this point, Zhang Han raised his fist and threw it at the place below the aircraft.","Bang!","The spaceship was destroyed.","Zhang Han’s reminder rang out.","“What?","“An Earth-Piercing Beast!","“Run!”","Rumble!","The spaceship was torn into pieces, and flames burst out.","Qijun and the others instantly defended themselves. They flashed to the place hundreds of meters away and looked back.","A giant Exotic Beast that was more than 30 meters tall was roaring at them.","“An Earth-Piercing Beast?”","“What kind of Exotic Beast is it?”","“Where is the newbie?”","“Not good! Run now!”","When they saw the Exotic Beast chasing after them, they fled in panic.","They were so scared that their faces turned pale.","Fortunately, after the enormous Exotic Beast let out a few cries, it burrowed into the ground and disappeared.","“What’s that?”","The group of people was frightened.","“Is the newcomer dead?”","“It’s only been a day since he entered the sect, and something unexpected has happened. This...”","“Alas, the world is unpredictable.” Qijun sighed deeply and said, “It’s not certain either tomorrow or an accident would arrive first. Fortunately, Junior Brother Zhang alarmed us beforehand, otherwise, we might have been in trouble. He’s a good man.”","Listening to the words of the people around her, Meng Ling’er felt a bit dizzy, and it was impossible to tell what she was feeling.","“Did he really die?","“It can’t be.”","She was a little suspicious.","None of the people noticed anything unusual. They looked at the badly damaged parts of the ground and helplessly sighed.","At this moment, a streak of green light was rapidly flying through the jungle.","Zhang Han’s face was calm.","Even if he had lost his soul sense, he still had a lot of means.","It was not easy for him to cast illusions, so he set up an illusory formation.","At this time, Qijun and the others were still under the formation’s impact.","After about a few minutes, it dissipated.","They would still complete their mission, but they just lost a person.","“Crimson Sunglow Sect.”","Zhang Han looked at the front.","Walking alone in the jungle made him feel like he was now in his previous life.","Inadvertently, the rays of the setting sun sprinkled on his body, giving rise to a faint radiance.","It was as if a king had descended upon the world. An otherworldly aura began to ripple out.","This was a mental state, as well as an incomparably powerful will.","After walking for a whole day, Zhang Han could feel the aura of the battle.","“The fifth war zone.”","He looked around, concealed his figure, and silently passed through the formations one by one.","These extremely dense detection, defense, and other formations were nothing to Zhang Han.","“The fifth war zone is a place with abundant spirit treasures, where there are many secret realms.","“The competition is fierce.","“The Ling Sea Sword Sect and the Heavenly Evil Sect are locked in a fierce battle here, and people from the other two sects enter from time to time.”","Information about the fifth war zone flashed across Zhang Han’s mind.","The place didn’t have large-scale battles all the time but was extremely chaotic, so it was called the fifth war zone.","Zhang Han only knew the brief situation.","But that didn’t matter.","If he wants to pass, even the gods and ghosts will have to give way.","Nothing ventured, nothing gained!"]},{"number":1426,"title":"Chapter 1426 Reunion","paragraphs":["Chapter 1426 Reunion","“Kill him!”","“Kill Wuxin of the Ling Sea Sword Sect!”","“Whoever can take his head will be rewarded with seventh-tier spirit treasures and 100,000 crystal stones.”","A group of people was chasing after a man in armor.","“Hahaha, you want to kill me? Try to get me then!”","The armored man laughed out loud. His aura was arrogant.","However, his eyes were very serious.","The group of people behind him were not weak, and there were even two famous disciples of the Heavenly Evil Sect among them.","“I have to escape.”","Just as the armored man was trying to figure out a way to break the deadlock-","Swoosh!","A figure swiftly whistled over from the horizon, as fast as lightning.","“Someone is coming!”","The crowd was on guard.","The figure flying at a low altitude passed them in a flash, and the wind generated by the impact of his body and the air was coming at them.","“Who’s that?”","“He’s definitely not some unknown person.”","“Crap. Wuxin is running away!”","“...”","Zhang Han was flying at full speed.","His will was consumed quickly, but it didn’t matter. With the help of the recovery medicinal pellets, he could fly at a high speed for half a day within a day, and the energy in his body could be maintained at 60 to 70 percent.","In five days, Zhang Han had crossed half of the fifth war zone.","There were obstacles on his way from a desolate place to a place where there were many battles. Zhang Han used some small tricks to cross those places directly. He never insisted on fighting, nor did he want to fight against anyone.","In his opinion, these small conflicts, even if there were any treasures on the battlefields, were not worth his time at all.","Ten days later, Zhang Han had crossed the fifth war zone and was located on the edge.","Here, he could always see some teams of the Heavenly Evil Sect.","However, since Zhang Han was using the concealment method, these people didn’t discover him.","After finding the right direction, Zhang Han rushed to the Crimson Sunglow Sect.","Another twenty days passed.","After more than a month, Zhang Han finally arrived at the border area of the Crimson Sunglow Sect.","He was still in the outer court area.","Bang!","In the forest, a young couple who was about to have sex in the wild was knocked out by Zhang Han.","Taking the man’s token, Zhang Han put on a hoodie and a black cap before he went straight into the city.","There were all young people in the prosperous city. Some were in their teens, and some were in their twenties.","They were waiting for the annual inner-door assessment in three days.","Many people spoke of this matter while entering and leaving the city.","“The passing rate of the assessment of the Crimson Sunglow Sect is only 5%. Five out of a hundred will pass. It’s very difficult.”","“Don’t be discouraged. If you get very lucky and your performance is amazing, you will pass.”","“Thank you for your blessing.”","While walking on the street, Zhang Han secretly sensed the seal of the Blood Source Incantation.","One of the beams of red light pointed in the direction of the Crimson Sunglow Sect’s inner court.","“They’re in the inner court.","“I didn’t spend much effort to pass through more than a thousand layers of array formations to reach the outer court.","“But the inner court is different. Its detection and defense are stronger. Although I can go there, there is still a chance to be discovered if the sect has a sound intelligent detection system.","“I’ll enter the sect’s inner court as a disciple.","“The information of the outer-door disciples....”","After thinking for a while, Zhang Han decided to talk to an inner-door disciple about this matter.","There was a designated place for someone to replace his identity information in the city. Zhang Han went straight there, found an inner-door disciple, and threw some crystal stones at him.","“Senior Brother, I want to have my identity information changed. I can’t use the original one.”","A hypocritical smile appeared on Zhang Han’s face.","“Hmm?”","The inner-door disciple frowned and stared at the 100,000 crystal stones in front of him.","Swoosh!","Zhang Han took out another 10,000 medium-grade crystal stones and said, “This matter is rather troublesome. Can you do me a favor?”","Clatter!","The inner court disciple’s brows relaxed and he thought to himself. “This brat knows how to handle things.","“I appreciate him.”","He smiled faintly and said, “There would be several people like you who come to me for something like this every month. You fail to judge people well and accidentally provoke people you can’t afford to offend. It’s good to have your identity changed. But after I record the new one in the system, it will only last for three years. After that, you have to personally update your identity information in the office. Otherwise, the token won’t work.”","“Okay, got it.” Zhang Han nodded.","“Come here. I need to scan your facial features.”","Zhang Han did as he was told.","“There’s no information about you.” The senior brother’s eyes turned cold, and he quickly put away the crystal stones. At the same time, he said sternly, “Which sect do you come from?”","Zhang Han was silent for a moment.","He looked at the man in front of him and said, “I’ve come here for revenge, to kill my enemies, and to join the Crimson Sunglow Sect to train for a few years.”","“Huh!” The inner-door disciple sneered.","Swoosh!","A batch of crystal stones appeared in the room again, shining.","“This is nice.”","The man found Zhang Han pleasing to the eye again. He accepted the crystal stones and sighed softly. “As cultivators, we should let go of our grudges and act according to our original intention. This is something that everyone is envious of. I don’t care what you are doing here. In short, you now have a suitable identity of an outer-door disciple. Your identity only lasts for a year. What are you going to do in the future? You can figure it out by yourself. I can’t mind your business in the inner court.”","“Okay.”","Zhang Han nodded slightly.","“What’s your name?”","“Zhang Hanyang.”","“What?! What’s your name again?” The inner-door disciple was shocked. “What are you up to?”","His face changed slightly.","“What?”","“What’s your name again?” the man asked.","Zhang Han was silent for a moment and said, “Zhang Hanyang. I’m from another Astral Domain.”","“I see.” The man exhaled and said, “You share the same name as someone else.”","“What do you mean?” Zhang Han’s eyes lit up slightly as he asked this.","“There is a relatively powerful newcomer in the pellet refining field on Orchid Peak of the inner court, who is called Zhang Hanyang. He is very favored there. It is said that the Eldest Lady of Orchid Peak is going after him hard. She adores him so much that even the Peak Host can’t do anything about this matter. It wouldn’t work even if he grounds that young man.” The inner-door disciple recorded the information for Zhang Han.","“How old is that man called Zhang Hanyang? How could he be so famous?” Zhang Han asked in curiosity.","He didn’t know that he was smiling inadvertently.","“He’s only in his teens, about sixteen or seventeen years old. Anyway, that boy looks rather feminine and doesn’t have any masculinity at all. Who knows that the Eldest Lady of Orchid Peak just likes that kind of man?”","There was jealousy in his tone.","“Then, I’d better not call myself Zhang Hanyang. My name shall now be Yefeng,” Zhang Han said.","“Yefeng? Okay.” The man nodded and recorded it in the system. Soon, he took out a token and said, “You are now an outer-door disciple. I have recorded your identity information briefly. Take this smart wristband. It contains your basic information. I advise you not to make trouble. After you walk out of this place, you’ll have nothing to do with me, but I will pay attention to you. Do you understand?”","From what he said, he meant that Zhang Han should not make trouble in the near future.","Zhang Han was not here to make trouble. He nodded and said, “Thank you, Senior Brother. I’m just here to learn, not to make trouble.”","“Goodbye, Junior Brother Yefeng.” The man smiled and waved his hand. “If you don’t pass the assessment this year, you can come to me in the future if you need anything.”","“Alright.”","Zhang Han returned a smile and turned to leave.","After he walked out of the door, his eyes lit up slightly.","“Mengmeng.”","Now that he had finally found one of his sweethearts, Zhang Han, who had been repressed for a long time, was a little relieved.","He sensed the smart wristband and then walked to his own residence.","The smart wristband could also be detected and located, but it did not matter. Zhang Han really did not intend to make trouble.","He sat in his room and rested for three days.","It was time for the assessment.","The situation was similar to that of the Ling Sea Sword Sect, but there were more people who took the Crimson Sunglow Sect’s assessment.","Zhang Han passed it with ease.","“Congratulations on entering the inner court.”","“After you enter the sect and select a peak later, you’ll be able to live in the Crimson Sunglow Sect.”","The Crimson Sunglow Sect had higher efficiency.","The fleet sent the ones who had passed the assessment to the inner court, led by the disciples of the bigger peaks.","“I choose Orchid Peak.”","Zhang Han made a choice and went straight to the peak.","“This is where Orchid Peak is.","“You’ll all stay on the outer peaks. The places you can watch are the outer and lower peaks. You can’t go to the main peaks at will.","“It will probably take you a few months to take a look at the outer and lower peaks.”","The leader said a few instructions and turned to leave.","Many disciples were arranged to stay on different peaks, each of which was as large as a city.","In fact, it required some knowledge to select the sect’s peaks.","Zhang Han lived in a big house. The buildings were almost the same. The better residences had manors and adobes with abundant spiritual Qi, but if one wanted such a mansion, one had to make contributions to the sect.","These were not a problem for Zhang Han at all.","After he entered his place, he bound the basic information. After sensing the red seal, he immediately went out. The whole process took less than five seconds.","Three seconds were wasted on binding the system. One second was spent on the entry, and one second was spent on leaving the house.","It could be seen from this that Zhang Han was very eager.","Swoosh!","A beam of light streaked across.","Zhang Han flew quickly toward a lower peak.","He could not control his speed at all.","He didn’t even notice a slight vibration in his soul when he was in his fastest state.","This was the first time in history that Zhang Han had experienced that kind of feeling.","He needed to see his little princess as soon as possible.","He could not wait any longer to see her.","“I’ll get to see her soon. Sensing the red seal’s energy, I can tell that she’s right ahead.","“I’m coming, Mengmeng!”","At this time, Mengmeng was in the yard with a pellet formula in front of her.","It was a treasure of the sect.","Within a single pellet formula, one could at most comprehend fifteen different pellet-refining methods.","She was very hardworking.","“Although I’m now a little famous, Daddy has not found me yet, so I’m not famous enough.","“If he still can’t find me, I’ll make my name known throughout the entire Crimson Sunglow Sect.","“If it doesn’t work out, I’ll make my name known on the Vast Heaven Star.","“It will definitely work. I can only succeed.”","When Mengmeng got serious, her terrifying talent for pellet refining made her progress by leaps and bounds.","Her bright eyes reflected the pellet furnace. As the flames slowly burned, she skillfully controlled the flames she shot out.","Swoosh!","Suddenly, someone flew over from behind and landed in the courtyard.","Mengmeng’s eyes flickered, and she felt a little helpless. “Is Senior Sister here again? Alas, what should I do?”","However-","“Mengmeng.” A soft call rang out.","Zhang Han’s voice was very soft as if he was afraid of disturbing the petite figure in front of him.","Rumble!","Mengmeng’s whole body trembled violently. Her eyes widened in an instant, and she was stunned.","But she was not slow when she turned around.","Swoosh!","Mengmeng turned around and stared at Zhang Han in front of her in a daze.","“Am I dreaming?","“It’s the scene that appeared in my dreams many times. Is this real or illusory?”","“Mengmeng, I’m sorry that I’m late.”","It was the first time that Zhang Han had experienced this kind of heartache and sadness.","His eyes were red, and he stood a few meters away from Mengmeng without blinking.","“Dad.","“Dad!”","Mengmeng called out twice. Her lips were pressed together and trembled slightly. Her beautiful big eyes were filled with tears.","Wisps of tears rolled down her face uncontrollably.","“Boo-hoo!”","Mengmeng threw herself into Zhang Han’s arms as fast as she could. She held him tightly with both hands, for fear that he would disappear in the next second.","“Daddy!","“Daddy, why did you come so late?","“Boo-hoo.","“I’ve missed you so much.","“I’ve been waiting for you for so long. I’ve been waiting every day. I don’t dare to go out or leave. I was afraid you couldn’t find me.”","As she spoke, Mengmeng choked with sobs, which completely covered her voice.","In the yard, under the shade of the tree, Mengmeng was crying hard in Zhang Han’s arms.","The longing, worry, and depression of a year turned into tears as she vented her emotions.","As the wind blew, the negative emotions slowly dissipated."]},{"number":1427,"title":"Chapter 1427 Mengmeng’s Ambition","paragraphs":["Chapter 1427 Mengmeng’s Ambition","Mengmeng cried.","Zhang Han’s eyes were also red.","She had gotten used to Zhang Han’s company in her daily life when she didn’t have to think about anything and was carefree. She was used to seeing her father every day. His gentle smile was like the sun, which made her feel warm.","While she was under such circumstances, it was conceivable that Mengmeng was depressed because she hadn’t seen her family for a long time.","At this moment, she was crying hard.","She got the piece of cloth on Zhang Han’s chest wet.","“It’s okay now. It’s okay.”","Zhang Han gently touched Mengmeng’s head with his right hand and used the other to gently pat her back.","But his effort was in vain. As long as Mengmeng started crying, she could not stop.","After a full five minutes, Mengmeng sobbed and said, “Dad... Daddy, did you... miss me?”","“I did. I’ve been thinking about you day and night,” Zhang Han said softly.","“Then why didn’t you come to pick me up?”","“I...”","Zhang Han didn’t know what to say.","He felt that whatever he said would just be an excuse. He was very guilty, so he said, “I’m here too late. I really wanted to come earlier, but...”","“I knew it.” Mengmeng sobbed a few times before continuing, “I knew you must have wanted to pick me up earlier.”","At this point, she felt much better.","Her crying helped relieve her pressure and sadness.","She held Zhang Han tightly in her arms and looked up at him from time to time.","“Where’s Mummy?”","“She...” Zhang Han’s expression froze for a moment. “She’s in a place rather far away. I haven’t been there yet.”","“Let’s go now. Don’t waste time. Mummy must miss us very much.” Mengmeng let go of Zhang Han, raised her hands, and wiped her tears.","“We don’t need to rush into it yet.”","Zhang Han’s gaze was a little complicated. Perhaps he was struggling.","He had been thinking about this problem along the way. Should he take Mengmeng with him?","In fact, he planned to settle Mengmeng in the Chu Family’s place, which was relatively safe. In his case, he took action less and less often, and he had a long way to go. He might encounter dangers, and he would never put Mengmeng in danger.","In short, Zhang Han didn’t dare to take Mengmeng with him.","In the past, when he was not injured, he thought it was safest for her to stay with him. But now that there was something wrong with his body, he had to consider things in a different way.","Mengmeng had no attachment to Orchid Peak at all.","“Daddy.”","Mengmeng raised her head slightly. Her eyes were unusually bright at this time, blinking. Suddenly, she giggled a few times.","“Hahaha, this is awesome. I knew you would definitely find me.”","“Definitely.” Zhang Han smiled.","After Mengmeng vented her sadness, she couldn’t help smiling. At this time, she was very happy.","“I waited for you for such a long time that it got me worried. What took you so long?”","Mengmeng pouted. She pretended to be unhappy as she said in a childish tone, “You don’t like me anymore, do you? Are you into someone else? You’re here so late!”","Her tone was full of resentment.","It was as if the man in front of her had broken her heart.","Zhang Han didn’t know how to react. He said helplessly, “I slept for ten months and spent two months looking for you. I didn’t waste any time on the way here.”","“Hee hee, I knew it,” Mengmeng said with a grin.","She held Zhang Han in her arms as if she were a little kid.","“It’s wonderful that you’re finally here to pick me up!”","Right at this moment.","Swoosh!","A figure quickly flew over from not far away along with a cheerful voice.","“Junior Brother Zhang, I’m here to see you. My father will start the class in a while. Let’s go to study.”","Swoosh!","When the girl landed in the yard, she saw Zhang Hanyang throwing himself into a man’s arms.","“Good heavens!”","The girl’s eyes widened. “Junior Brother Zhang, why, why are you with a different man now?”","“What?”","Mengmeng was stunned.","“Why did Senior Sister come over at this time?”","Zhang Han was also a little confused.","“What does she mean by that?","“Oh my god!”","In an instant, Zhang Han gasped.","“Could it be that Mengmeng has a boyfriend?”","Mengmeng rolled her eyes. She was no longer as calm as she used to be when she was in the sect. She became lively again.","“Ahem.”","She coughed softly and suppressed her voice. “That’s right. I’m now with a different man. Let me introduce him to you. This is our new junior brother, well, my new darling.”","“Junior Brother Zhang.”","The young senior sister’s eyes trembled slightly.","“Alas, this is crazy.","“When will I get to help Junior Brother Zhang change his sexual orientation?”","“Senior Sister, you can go back first. I’m not going to class today.” Mengmeng waved her hand generously and said, “I need to talk with my new darling.”","“This is not okay.”","The young senior sister was quite sulky.","She didn’t have a good temper, but when she was at Mengmeng’s place, she had to be calm.","At this moment, she stamped her feet in depression, looked at Zhang Han with hatred, and turned to leave quickly.","She looked like she was going to eat Zhang Han alive. It was as if Zhang Han had taken away her man.","Zhang Han found it quite unbelievable.","The senior sister left.","Before Zhang Han could ask her anything, Mengmeng took his arm and said, “Daddy, let’s go there.”","They sat down in a pavilion in the yard.","“So what’s up with the new darling you mentioned?” Zhang Han couldn’t help but ask first.","“It’s a long story.”","Mengmeng grinned and said, “As soon as I came here, I met two inner-door disciples who were both perverts. They took me to a remote room.”","She paused.","Zhang Han’s eyes were slightly gloomy.","Even though he knew that everything was fine and she was fine, he was so angry that he couldn’t hold back his killing intent when he heard this.","“I killed them.”","Mengmeng pursed her lips and laughed. Then, she snorted softly and said, “Humph, how dare those two idiots act arrogant in front of me? I couldn’t let them stay alive, could I? Later, I thought I should keep a low profile here. With my pretty looks, I disguised myself as a man and passed the assessment. I sneaked into the inner court. I thought that I would make a name for myself so that you could find me sooner, so I studied pellet refining hard. Now I’m very famous. The Peak Host keeps asking me to be his disciple, but I didn’t agree.”","“Later, that senior sister fell in love with you.” Zhang Han smiled softly and then asked in confusion, “From what she said just now, you have got a friend before me, right?”","“Yes. His name is Xiong Fengran,” Mengmeng said with a hint of cunning in her big eyes.","“Who is Xiong Fengran?” Zhang Han asked with a smile.","“He’s the youngest son of the Command Beast Peak Host,” Mengmeng said.","Zhang Han’s breathing quickened a little. “And then?”","“What do you mean by then?” Mengmeng said with a smile, “We usually hang around and hug each other. Senior Sister thinks that I’m with Xiong Fengran, so she always wants to help me change my sexual orientation. Also, she doesn’t know that I’m a girl.”","When Zhang Han heard this, his pupils shrank and he got up. “Where is Command Beast Peak? I’ll go and take a tour. Yeah. It’ll just be a tour.”","“You don’t need to go over. He’s here.” Mengmeng pointed to the figure flying over from the horizon.","Zhang Han looked over in that direction.","“Ow?”","Xiong Fengran’s eyes were wide open, and he increased his speed.","“My host! Ow! Ow! Ow!”","Dahei happily called out in its original voice.","“Huh?”","Zhang Han’s eyes lit up and he couldn’t help laughing.","“This girl is truly naughty.”","“My host.”","Dahei was flying. When it arrived at the yard, it turned into a chimpanzee that was about 1.5 meters high. It was about to carry Zhang Han.","Zhang Han had no choice but to be held by Dahei.","“My host, I missed you so much!”","Dahei was roaring.","“Alright. This should be enough.”","Zhang Han patted Dahei on its head, looked at Mengmeng, and said with a smile, “How did you guys meet?”","“Dahei found me.” Mengmeng said, “It has also been on the Vast Heaven Star. It was taken to Command Beast Peak and was taken away by a guy named Xiong Fengran. He wanted to eat Dahei, but Dahei killed him. No one else knows that Dahei can transform, so he pretends to be Xiong Fengran and has been staying on Command Beast Peak for a while. Later, he found me.”","“That’s nice.” Zhang Han smiled.","Mengmeng said with a smile, “I was quite surprised when we met.”","“...”","They didn’t stop talking and just sat there chatting all afternoon.","“I miss your cooking, Daddy,” Mengmeng said.","“Okay.” Zhang Han smiled and said, “I still have some ingredients left from the ones I brought from the mountain.”","He had never eaten or taken out the rest of the ingredients.","He walked into the kitchen and began to cook.","About half an hour later, he made braised ribs, braised pork trotters, and so on, which were all Mengmeng’s favorite dishes.","It was an extremely sumptuous meal. Zhang Han even roasted an entire pig for Dahei to eat.","“It would be great if Mummy were here.”","Mengmeng was sometimes happy and sometimes disappointed. She was worried about how Zi Yan was doing.","“I guess she should be doing nice. Her strength is erratic. Whoever messes with her would suffer a lot. There won’t be a big problem since she has Tiny Tot with her.”","Zhang Han thought for a moment and said, “However, I need to go and find her as soon as possible. I’m not going to take you with me this time.”","“What?” Mengmeng’s face changed. “How can you not take me with you? No! Can you bear to leave me here alone?”","“No.” Zhang Han sighed softly and said, “But there’s nothing I can do about it. It will be a long way to go. Your mum is not in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven. It will be very dangerous to cross the Star Area.”","“I’m not afraid of danger!” Mengmeng suddenly put down her cutlery and looked at Zhang Han with a little grievance.","“Mengmeng, I love you.”","Zhang Han rarely said the word “love”, but at this time, he said it affectionately with a hint of self-blame in his tone. “But I can’t guarantee your safety with my current situation.”","“What, what happened to you?” Mengmeng suddenly noticed something. She looked at Zhang Han carefully with her big eyes.","Seeing this, Zhang Han knew that he had no choice but to say it.","He took a light breath, smiled, and said, “Last time, in the main hall in the air, the Demonic God of the Domain of Seven Desolations launched a sneak attack on me at the critical moment when I was condensing the embodiment. I had been sleeping there for 10 months, and my soul was damaged. Therefore, when I take action, I would be restricted a lot. However, I need to find your mum and your grandparents, so...”","“Dad, why did you get hurt?”","Mengmeng’s big bright eyes were filled with tears.","“There was nothing I could do about it.”","Zhang Han raised his hand to touch Mengmeng’s head and said, “I will definitely come back within a year. I can feel that your mum is in a place very far away, but not so far either. Well... in the Astral Domain, there is a very safe place. It’s the Chu Family’s place, where Chu Qingyi used to live. I used to teach their Grand Master. I want you to stay at their place for a while. A year will pass very fast when you cultivate.”","“Daddy, you’re hurt. I should take more care of you. I’m also very powerful now. I’m already at the Elixir Realm Peak Stage. I’ll soon reach the Yuan Ying Realm,” Mengmeng said.","She just did not want to be separated from Zhang Han again.","“But, if I drag you down, I can stay here.” Mengmeng changed her tone and said in a low voice, “I’ll cultivate hard and wait for you to come back. I won’t hold you back. When I become powerful, I can protect you.”","As she spoke, Mengmeng raised her head and wiped away the tears at the corners of her eyes.","In the depths of her eyes, a trace of determination flashed.","It was a determination to cultivate, a desire to become powerful.","She hoped that she could stay by her family’s side no matter what happened, and she could also protect her parents in the future.","On this day, in the Crimson Sunglow Sect on Orchid Peak on the Vast Heaven Star.","Under the night sky, Mengmeng’s ambition for cultivation took root and grew in her heart."]},{"number":1428,"title":"Chapter 1428 Here’s a Reward for You","paragraphs":["Chapter 1428 Here’s a Reward for You","“She has grown up after all.”","Zhang Han’s heart was full of emotions.","If this were to happen when Mengmeng was a little kid, it would be impossible for Zhang Han to leave.","But at the same time, he didn’t feel great about this.","“Mengmeng.”","Zhang Han sighed softly and said, “It’s not that I’m afraid of encountering any enemies, but I’m worried that I’ll encounter some terrible secret realms and so on. In the Astral Domain and the Galaxy, there are countless secret realms, but there are more of them in those desolate Star Areas. Once I’m not careful enough, I won’t be able to take good care of you.”","“I see,” Mengmeng muttered. “I won’t go this time, but I’ll definitely go next time.”","Her tone was full of confidence.","Zhang Han smiled with relief and said, “Okay. I’m sure that you’ll be very powerful in the future.”","“Humph.” Mengmeng snorted softly and said, “Couldn’t you wait to tell me this until we finish the meal? You made me lose my appetite now.”","...","Zhang Han said with a laugh, “You’ve grown up now. In two years, you will be an adult. Haha, you’re still so beautiful even if you’re disguised as a man. No wonder the senior sister is fascinated by you.”","“Alas, that’s so awkward.” Mengmeng grinned and said, “Senior Sister has been wooing me for a long time. I don’t know how to deal with it.”","“You handled it quite well,” Zhang Han said with a smile. “As a girl, when you dress like a guy, you do get to indeed protect yourself in certain situations. The thing is that you are so pretty. If you were dressed in ordinary clothes, I guess a lot of people would keep thinking about you all the time.”","“I’m pretty because I inherited my looks from your good genes and Mummy’s,” Mengmeng muttered.","After resting for a few minutes, she picked up her cutlery and began to eat the food in front of her.","Dahei, on the other hand, had been eating the whole time and couldn’t stop eating. The food it was having was so delicious.","“Several sects have put up a bounty in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven, where the Chu Family is located. It is estimated that a group of people can still be found.” Zhang Han explained the situation in the Chu Family. “Including Feifei, Chen Chuan, Lili, and Liang Hao, there are already more than a dozen people in the Chu Family’s place. I plan to send you there and then pick up your mum. In fact, it will be just like how things were when we were on Earth – I would go pick your mum up when she is on a business trip. It will be just that simple. Since I’ll have a long way to go, I don’t want you to go through the trouble.”","“When will you set off then? I want you to spend a few more days with me,” Mengmeng said pitifully.","“I sure will spend some nice time with you then,” Zhang Han said with a smile. “I haven’t seen you for so many days. I’ve missed you badly.”","“It’s awesome that we have the same idea!” Mengmeng said with a chuckle.","The atmosphere gradually became more and more cheerful.","...","It was Zhang Han’s plan to tell Mengmeng about it first. He knew that she would definitely understand his intention because she was also very worried about how Zi Yan was doing, and she was very sensible this time.","If Mengmeng was mentally prepared, she would be in a much better mood when he left. Otherwise, she would be even more upset if she suddenly learned that he was going out alone.","Happy times always passed by very quickly.","Mengmeng and Zhang Han were chatting in the yard in the middle of the night, while Dahei was snoring next to them.","They simply had too many topics of conversation.","“Daddy, I still remember it very clearly that when I was a child, you spanked me.”","“That is not possible!”","“It’s true. I even cried.”","“You’re mistaken. I didn’t spank you. I just patted your butt gently a few times. That was not spanking.”","“How was it not spanking? Humph! If it weren’t, I wouldn’t have remembered it.”","“Was it your mum who did it?”","...","“...”","“I have had a good memory since I was a child. I can still remember the scenes when you wooed Mummy.”","“You don’t remember how naughty and sharp-tongued you were during some days. Your words were harsh. You said that enemies from afar must be killed, beaten to death, and their bodies will sink into the sea. You said those stuff.”","“.......”","“Daddy, I want to lie on your lap and sleep.”","“Okay. Sweet dreams.”","Zhang Han was sitting on the bench, and Mengmeng was lying down with her head resting on his leg.","Dahei didn’t have such nice treatment. It returned to Xiong Fengran’s appearance and lay on the other side.","Soon, Mengmeng fell asleep the way she did when she was a child.","Running his power a bit, Zhang Han controlled the temperature and humidity around him to make it the most comfortable environment for the human body.","He lowered his head to look at Mengmeng’s cheek, and his eyes were filled with tenderness.","...","The father’s love was deep.","Those who could feel it would be very touched.","The next day, the sun had just risen.","A figure flew over from a distance.","“Junior Brother Zhang, I’m here to see you!","“I have something to tell you.","“AH!”","When the senior sister saw Junior Brother Zhang, the new junior brother, and Xiong Fengran, she found that the three of them were on the same bench.","Her expression changed greatly. She stared blankly for a long time, feeling wronged. Then, she fled in a hurry. “Poor me...","“How could Junior Brother Zhang be with two guys at the same time?","“Good heavens!","...","“Xiong Fengran has been very hard to deal with, but now Junior Brother Zhang has another lover.","“What should I do to help make him change his sexual orientation?”","She felt that this was the first time in her life that she had to deal with an unprecedented problem.","“I’ll make it happen. Go get him!”","The senior sister took a deep breath and thought of what she had prepared today. She turned around and decisively flew to Mengmeng’s residence.","She shouted from a long distance away, “Junior Brother Zhang! Junior Brother Zhang! I have something to discuss with you.”","“Huh?”","Mengmeng opened her eyes. She had been sleeping too soundly.","She was in a daze, but when she saw the senior sister, she quickly came to her senses. She immediately smeared a layer of fluorescent powder on her face, which made her look like a man again.","“Senior Sister, why are you here so early?” Mengmeng greeted her.","“Hello, Senior Sister,” Zhang Han said with a smile.","...","“Hah.” Mengmeng pursed her lips and couldn’t help laughing.","“That’s so funny.”","It was early in the morning, and she was amused.","“Humph!”","The senior sister snorted and glared at Zhang Han. Dahei was still snoring next to him. It was sleeping soundly and hadn’t woken up.","“Junior Brother Zhang.”","The senior sister looked at Mengmeng and her eyes softened again. She said softly, “Follow me. I have something very important to tell you.”","“What is it? Can’t you just tell me here?” Mengmeng said casually.","“Well... I can’t.” The senior sister’s expression revealed a trace of shyness.","“Alas. Fine. I’ll go with you. Why would you have to tell me in secret?” Mengmeng stood up and said, “Let’s go to the room and talk. You need to make it quick. I haven’t washed up yet.”","“I promise that I’ll make it quick.”","The senior sister ran over and pulled Mengmeng into the room.","“Oh my!”","The senior sister’s breathing quickened.","Clatter!","Mengmeng suddenly had a bad feeling about this.","“I don’t want to know it anymore,” Mengmeng suddenly said.","“Don’t go!”","The senior sister immediately said, “Just hear me out, and I won’t bother you any longer.”","“Huh?”","Mengmeng felt that this was a good proposal, so she nodded and said, “Okay, go ahead.","The senior sister’s neck turned red as well as her face.","She waved her hand and set up a soundproof layer to prevent the detection of Divine Senses.","However, this could stop Zhang Han.","But he seemed to have understood something after looking at the room for a while. He was a little stunned and immediately stopped his investigation.","In the room.","The young senior sister put her hands on her collar and moved.","Her special clothes were suddenly completely scattered.","Her tender, firm, and curvy boobs were revealed.","“Junior Brother Zhang, men are only attracted to women. It’s not okay for guys to do it. I’m willing to help you... I can give it a try for you. Let’s take Pair Cultivation.”","“AH!”","Mengmeng exclaimed and immediately covered her eyes with her hands.","But then she came to her senses.","“Hey, I’m also a girl!”","She left a crack through her fingers, took a look at the senior sister’s body, and then blocked her eyes.","“Her boobs are bigger than mine.","“Humph!”","“You see.”","The senior martial sister showed a happy smile and said, “You are shy and peeping, which means that women are the most attractive to you.”","“No, no, no, Senior Sister, in fact, you’ve been misunderstanding me,” Mengmeng said.","“I’m not mistaken.” The senior sister said, “You are the only man who can make me fall in love. I like you and want to be your Cultivational Partner.”","“It’s not okay for you to act this way,” Mengmeng said with a wry smile.","“It is. Junior Brother Zhang, I’ve heard that it’s a wonderful thing to have sex. Come on!”","“Stop this.”","“Come on. As long as you give it a try today, if you don’t want to see me in the future, I won’t show up in front of you, okay?”","“Senior Sister... Alas,” Mengmeng sighed deeply and said, “I really can’t agree to this.”","While speaking, Mengmeng suddenly put down her hands and looked at the senior sister with a natural expression.","She could not see any desire in Mengmeng’s eyes.","She got sad for a moment.","“Why?","“Could it be that he’s really not the slightest bit interested in me?”","“I don’t care. Since you’ve seen my body, you’re mine. I’ll tell my father about this later.”","The senior sister suddenly acted shamelessly.","She had planned it beforehand.","But she had never expected that-","“Senior Sister, you shouldn’t have done all this.”","Mengmeng pressed her right hand against her coiled-up hair.","Clatter!","Her long, beautiful hair was spread.","With her exquisite facial features, she was simply like a handsome young man.","However, as the light on Mengmeng’s face flickered, the senior sister was stunned.","“What an exquisite face!”","Mengmeng was like a fairy from the heavens, and her stunningly gorgeous appearance caused others to feel ashamed.","“WHAT?!”","The senior sister was astounded.","“Senior Sister.”","Mengmeng used her original voice, which was light and pleasant.","“I’ve always been a girl. How could I agree to that?”","“I... Boo-hoo, you lied to me!”","The senior sister seemed to have broken down. She immediately put on her clothes and left with her face covered.","“Alas, this is crazy.”","Mengmeng walked out of the room and sighed. “My first wholehearted pursuer turns out to be a girl.”","“She’ll be fine in a few days.” Zhang Han looked at the back of the senior sister.","“Daddy, let’s go. I’ll show you around Orchid Peak today.”","Mengmeng puffed out her chest and raised her head, looking very proud and mighty.","“Okay, let’s have a look at your territory,” Zhang Han said with a smile.","“Ow! Ow! Ow!","“I’ll go, too.”","Dahei woke up and happily followed Zhang Han.","They walked out of Mengmeng’s residence, followed the mountain road, and walked to the buildings at the foot of the mountain.","Mengmeng’s residence had been changed, which was many times better than those of ordinary disciples.","On the way, the first disciple they met was an inner-door disciple who came here a few years ago. He greeted Mengmeng upon seeing her.","“Greetings, Junior Brother Zhang.”","With Mengmeng’s status in the Orchid Peak, any disciple who was rather weak would be polite to her when they met. In Orchid Peak, Mengmeng was almost on the same level as the chief supervisor.","And the protectors were superior to the chief supervisors.","“Well, greetings.”","Mengmeng had returned to her usual dress. At this time, she nodded slightly and said with a proud look, “Here’s a reward for you.”","Swoosh!","A streak of light flashed.","A fourth-tier spirit treasure, a one-meter-long green mountain sword, floated to the front of the disciple who greeted her.","“Oh my!","“I got a fourth-tier spirit treasure with a simple greeting?”","“Thank you, Junior Brother Zhang.” The disciple thanked Mengmeng repeatedly.","Mengmeng continued to go down the mountain.","“Good morning, Junior Brother Zhang. It’s an honor for me to see you.”","“Morning.” Mengmeng replied casually, “Here’s a reward for you.”","Another fourth-tier spirit treasure, the long sword, showed up and was given out.","Mengmeng was in a good mood, so she liked everyone here.","After she walked for two hours, more than a hundred spirit treasures were rewarded.","These were nothing to Mengmeng.","The little girl was now very rich.","However, her state of happiness didn’t last long.","Three figures quickly flew over from the side.","The leading one was a long-faced man with a cold look, who was aiming at Zhang Han.","Zhang Han didn’t need to think to know that they were here for Mengmeng.","“They don’t seem to have good intentions.”","“Zhang Hanyang, our young master wants you to go to him,” the long-faced man said lightly.","“Whose young master?” Mengmeng was shocked.","“Our young master!” the man said in a deep voice.","“Your what?”","“Our young master!”","“What young master are you talking about?”","“Our young master!”","The man suddenly came to his senses and was furious. “Are you toying with me?”","“Whom am I toying with?”","“Zhang Hanyang, are you trying to get yourself killed?” The long-faced man’s face was terribly gloomy.","Hearing this, Zhang Han felt a little strange. He kept feeling that this guy was challenging him.","But in fact, the man was talking to Mengmeng.","“Mengmeng is called Zhang Hanyang in this place.","“But this is not okay!”","“If you have something to say, just say it. If you don’t, get lost,” Zhang Han frowned and said.","He got a little impatient. He didn’t need to take action to kill these people in front of him and could kill them with his mind in seconds.","“Zhang Hanyang.”","The long-faced man looked at Mengmeng and said in a cold voice, “You’d better know things better. It’s a great honor for you to be summoned by our young master.”","“Who’s your young master?”","“Are you asking while you know the answer?” the long-faced man asked.","The others echoed, “Behave yourself, kid. Young Master Xuan Chen is the number one disciple amongst the younger generation of the Crimson Sunglow Sect. He wants to see you, a mere new disciple. How dare you not go? Are you trying to get yourself expelled?”","They were very arrogant, but they had the power to be so.","Many disciples could see them from afar. The senior ones, who had been around for several years, were all discussing with each other.","“They’re Xuan Chen’s subordinates.”","“What are they doing here? Are they looking for trouble with Junior Brother Zhang?”","“Alas, I’ve said that Xuan Chen has always liked the Eldest Lady of Orchid Peak, and recently she seems to be pursuing Zhang Hanyang. This matter can’t be hidden forever. Since Xuan Chen has heard about it, how could he remain indifferent to it?”","“Since they’re here for Zhang Hanyang now, they’ll definitely teach him a lesson.”","“That might not necessarily be the case.” Someone sighed. “Xuan Chen has superb methods. Perhaps he’ll be able to cause Junior Brother Zhang to crash and burn and not dare to appear in front of the junior sister. Why is Xuan Chen so famous? It’s unknown how many outstanding geniuses in the sect have suffered losses at his hands.”","“...”","Zhang Han knew what kind of person Xuan Chen was as soon as he heard those conversations.","He was just rather outstanding among the disciples.","The Sword Edge of the Crimson Sunglow Sect was divided into two parts, which were South Mountain and North Mountain. Xuan Chen was known as the number one disciple in South Mountain among the modern disciples. It sounded like a nice title, but he was just the top among the newcomers.","“Zhang Hanyang, I’ve given you the chance, and you should just take it,” the long-faced man coldly said.","Zhang Han’s brows furrowed.","Mengmeng’s eyes narrowed slightly.","However-","“Go to hell, idiot!”","Under everyone’s gaze, Xiong Fengran turned into a stream of light and rushed forward quickly.","He raised his huge fist.","Bang!","With one punch, the long-faced man who led the team spat out blood and flew backward for a thousand meters before falling into a small lake.","“How dare you attack him?!”","“Xiong Fengran, you’re courting death!”","The long-faced man’s companions were unable to restrain their rage.","However, they did not have much strength. They were destined to be lackeys.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","Dahei’s hard fist smashed down.","Those people, without exception, all flew backward, landing in the lake.","Dahei raised its middle finger to them and said with a snort, “Suckers!","“How dare you be so arrogant in front of me when you’re so weak?","“If this happens again, I will beat you to death!”","The discussions in the distance grew even louder.","“Has Xiong Fengran gone mad?”","“How dare he attack Xuan Chen’s men?”","“With Xiong Fengran’s intelligence, he will be tortured by Xuan Chen. Xiong Fengran is not favored on Command Beast Peak, and he is not even welcomed.”","“...”","“Go back and tell your young master that I’m not someone he can see whenever he wants.” Mengmeng’s eyes were cold. “Those who wish to see me have to wait in line!”","She was domineering when she said that.","Zhang Han even felt that she was very cute.","“It’s quite interesting that she’s making a dominant image of Zhang Hanyang.”","Under many people’s gazes, those people quickly fled.","“They’re really crazy.”","Mengmeng muttered, took Zhang Han’s arm, and said, “Let’s go to Lotus Peak to enjoy the scenery. There are a few interesting places here. Let’s go and visit them.”","Mengmeng planned to take Zhang Han to hang around in this place for two days and enjoy the beautiful places.","“The Vast Heaven Star is so big!”","Mengmeng said, “I haven’t toured around in the sect yet, but I’m already familiar with Orchid Peak and Command Beast Peak. I heard that the Four Great Sects take up less than 30% of the area of the Vast Heaven Star.”","“The Vast Heaven Star is indeed very big. When I come back, I’ll take you and your mum here to have some fun,” Zhang Han said with a smile.","“Okay!”","They continued to stroll forward.","As soon as they arrived at the foot of the mountain, they saw a white-robed man with a sword hanging on his waist standing on a huge stone at the edge of the forest in front of them.","He looked at Mengmeng and smiled faintly.","“I’m Xu Hang.”","He said that he was Xu Hang and not that his name was Xu Hang.","The words he used meant that this person was at least a famous expert.","As for whether it was true or not, it was still unknown, but in his heart, it must be so.","“I’ve heard of you. You’re Xuan Chen’s most capable subordinate,” Mengmeng said calmly. “What now? Do you want to fight me?”","“No,” Xu Hang replied, shaking his head. “I’m just here to warn you not to continue playing with fire. Otherwise, things won’t be as peaceful as they are now.","“To be polite first, then aggressive, I like it.”","“Don’t think that we can’t do anything to you just because you’re favored in the Orchid Peak,” Xu Hang said lightly.","“This is the last piece of advice for you. Do keep it in mind.”","After that, Xu Hang turned around and left. His body movements were elegant and imposing.","“Daddy, Dahei, we don’t need to pay attention to this kind of person.”","Mengmeng said, “They are self-righteous as if they are invincible in the world.”","“Who’s Xuan Chen?” Zhang Han asked.","“He’s just a relatively powerful disciple. Anyway, I don’t know much about him and I’ve never seen him before,” Mengmeng muttered.","“We’ll just let it go. We can’t have irrelevant people disturb our mood. It’s not worth it.”","Mengmeng restrained herself for Zhang Han’s sake.","Zhang Han also tried to restrain himself because he didn’t want to affect Mengmeng’s mood.","Dahei didn’t say anything. Because it had just hit Xu Chen’s men, the atmosphere was depressed for a few minutes.","They decided to let Xu Hang go.","If it weren’t for their forgiveness, Xu Hang would have suffered."]},{"number":1429,"title":"Chapter 1429 Great Acting Skill","paragraphs":["Chapter 1429 Great Acting Skill","“Daddy, isn’t this place beautiful?”","“Yeah, it is.”","“I’ve been here a few times before, but the scenery today is the most beautiful,” Mengmeng said with a chuckle.","Why was the scenery so beautiful?","Because he was by her side.","“You’re about to turn eighteen.”","Zhang Han patted Mengmeng on the shoulder and said, “Time flies. You’ve grown from a little kid to a big girl in a flash.”","“Everyone grows up,” Mengmeng said.","“...”","Mengmeng and Zhang Han enjoyed the scenery together, and they felt very nice.","After strolling in the mountain forest for a long time, they returned to Mengmeng’s residence.","On the way, they heard a piece of news.","Many people were discussing it.","“Have you heard of the training in the Wind-Witches Evilland?”","“Yeah. I heard that a group of secret realms has appeared over there. It is said that there have been more than a dozen small secret realms discovered by the Authentic Martial Arts Sect first. They took over eleven secret realms and obtained a lot of treasures from them.”","“It is said that secret realms in groups would erupt in the Wind-Witches Evilland. I remember that the last time this happened in the Omo District was 30 years ago. A total of 156 small-scale secret realms appeared, with countless treasures and even eighth-tier spirit treasures!”","“Oh, my god. Eighth-tier spirit treasures?”","“Yes, the outbreak back then even alarmed the Four Sect Leaders. But I heard from a conversation between Elder Ma and someone else that there are about 50 secret realms this time. The level of the secret realms is at the middle level, so it is very suitable for the indoor- disciples to practice.”","“Not only the Authentic Martial Arts Sect, but also the Heavenly Evil Sect, the Ling Sea Sword Sect, and our Crimson Sunglow Sect will send a lot of people over.”","“This is the home field of many young talents. They can not only gain experience in the secret realms but also assassinate the wanted ones of other sects.”","“It’s killing two birds with one stone. They’ll be challenged and selected during the practice.”","Along the way, Zhang Han and Mengmeng had heard a lot about this practice.","When someone saw Mengmeng, he even greeted her with a smile and said, “Junior Brother Zhang, the trip to the Wind-Witches Evilland will be an opportunity to gain experience every few decades. You are peerless in pellet refining, but your strength may not be very powerful. Why don’t we team up and go there? As long as you prepare enough medicinal pellets in advance, we will reward you with satisfying treasures.”","“Yeah. Junior Brother Zhang, go with us.”","A small number of people came over to invite Mengmeng.","“Not for me. I’ll see how it goes.” Mengmeng waved her hand every time and didn’t accept the invitation.","When she was about to get back to her peak, a sect announcement was issued on the communication wristbands of every disciple.","It was sent by the mission hall of the Crimson Sunglow Sect.","“There are likely to be small secret realms in the Wind-Witches Evilland. The sect has decided that each peak gets to send 10,000 people to the Wind-Witches Evilland to gain experience, and who wants to go needs to sign up in advance. The specific list will be released one day before the departure day.”","In the past, this kind of mission would be released three days in advance.","The main reason for it was that the Peak Hosts or high-position officials would first select a group of excellent disciples. Or if they wanted any disciple to train and practice, they would have to choose them in advance. Later, they just chose randomly, or they could let the system directly select the disciples.","“Daddy, shall we go and check it out before we go back?” Mengmeng blinked and was a little eager to have a try.","“Sure.” Zhang Han smiled and said, “Let’s sign up.”","“Yeah, let’s sign up.”","The two of them signed up immediately.","However, the next day, when the list was released, Zhang Han didn’t see his name on it.","Zhang Hanyang was on the list. That was Mengmeng, but Yefeng’s name wasn’t on it.","“Daddy, why isn’t your name on it?” Mengmeng said, “I’ll go to talk to the Peak Host!”","“Forget it. Asking for his help will be too troublesome. I’ll just follow you there,” Zhang Han shook his head and said.","“Alright then.”","Mengmeng did not doubt her father’s ability. Everything would work as long as he said it would. He always got to achieve success.","“Ow! Ow! Ow!”","Dahei shouted, “My name is also on it. Xiong Fengran. What a filthy name it is.”","“Dahei.” Mengmeng suddenly had a schoolbag in her hand. She said with a smile, “Do you miss it?”","“Can I change back to my original appearance?” Dahei said in a surprised tone. It scratched its head and looked at Zhang Han.","“Sure,” Zhang Han replied casually.","“This is great!”","Dahei was happy. It returned to its original form and became a half-meter-tall chimpanzee. It patted its chest and said, “I don’t want to be a stupid human.”","After saying that, it felt that something was wrong, and quickly added, “I just don’t want to be stupid Xiong Fengran. Ahem, bah!”","After Dahei finished speaking, it ran to Mengmeng’s schoolbag quickly and lay down on the bed inside. During this period, it also said, “My host, please call me when it’s time for dinner.”","“Okay. Go to sleep.” Zhang Han nodded seriously.","Unexpectedly, Dahei slept for a whole day and night and did not wake up until it was about time to set off.","“Ow...”","Mengmeng and Zhang Han walked through the jungle and went to gather. Dahei stuck its head out and pouted, saying, “My host, don’t you love me anymore?”","...","“Get lost!”","Zhang Han threw an Exotic Beast’s inner pellet at Dahei and scolded it.","“Okay.”","Dahei happily held the inner pellet and withdrew it into Mengmeng’s schoolbag, ready to grab a bite.","Mengmeng and Zhang Han walked to the gathering place.","“Hi, Senior Sister.”","Mengmeng said hello to the young senior sister.","She naturally was okay with her.","The senior sister had a complicated expression on her face.","But faintly, she seemed to be a little disdainful. She didn’t even pay attention to Mengmeng. With a snort, she turned her head away from Mengmeng.","“Even though she’s pretty, she’s still a slutty woman!”","...","The young senior sister snorted in her heart.","She was a little jealous of Mengmeng’s beautiful face. She didn’t expect that Junior Brother Zhang Hanyang was a girl, and she was so beautiful.","“She’s powerful. She’s talented and accomplished in pellet refining.","“But she’s not a good person.","“Any woman who would take a fancy to Xiong Fengran is disgusting.”","She would never expect that Xiong Fengran currently was not a human at all.","“If I’m not mistaken.”","The young senior sister suddenly turned around and said with sharp eyes, “Junior Brother Yefeng, you’re not on the list. What are you doing here? Do you want to break the sect’s rules?”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The young senior sister’s change of attitude left everyone shocked.","However, this made the two people not far away sneer.","“Hah, look at the Eldest Lady of Orchid Peak. Her expression is so fake. She doesn’t even know how to act.”","“Yeah. Has she heard that Senior Brother Xuan Chen is going to deal with Zhang Hanyang?”","“I don’t think she has heard of it. Could it be that someone reported it? That’s why she pretended to be cold to Zhang Hanyang to protect her little lover?”","“Mind your words! Nothing is going on between her and Zhang Hanyang. Even if there is, it’s not something we can talk about, understand?”","Sometimes, the truth was hard to believe.","But at this time, the young senior sister meant what she was doing.","She even wanted to take revenge.","“My name isn’t on it?” Zhang Han said flatly.","His eyes lit up.","The senior sister’s eyes froze for a second. Then, she nodded and said, “How would I know? I just don’t like you. Hah, you’re just a new disciple. How dare you participate in this kind of practice? You really don’t know your place.”","She also meant it.","After that, she turned around and went to other places.","She no longer paid attention to Zhang Han.","It would be very simple for him to use a little trick to affect the senior sister’s thoughts.","It was easy to imagine how difficult it would be for others to stop Zhang Han from going wherever he wanted to go. They could hardly stop him.","Knowledge was precious, and it was the same in the Cultivation World.","Zhang Han followed Mengmeng steadily into the large transport aircraft. The fleet of hundreds of thousands of people went all out to the Wind-Witches Evilland at full speed.","At the same time, the information of the Wind-Witches Evilland had been sent to many disciples who were participating in the training.","“The Wind-Witches Evilland is a place surrounded by evil spirits all year round. Evil spirits sometimes affect people’s minds. It’s best to prepare some pure Yang treasures.”","“We can also use the medicinal pellets, talismans, formation flags, and so on that will come in need.”","“I heard that the Heavenly Evil Sect has also sent a lot of people this time. They are targeting the Ling Sea Sword Sect and have a list of people they must kill.”","“All the people that get on the list are young talents.”","“The talents are all gathered. This is a grand event.”","“There are also many young talents of our sect, such as Xuan Chen, the No.1 martial artist in the South Mountain of Sword Edge, Xu Hang, his right-hand man, and Meng Zhou, the No.1 martial artist in the North Mountain.”","“The Crimson Sunglow Sect’s law enforcement hall is led by the Third Elder, right?”","“The Third Elder, Taoist Heavenlight, is very powerful. With him around, nothing unexpected will happen to us on our trip.”","“...”","From a lot of discussions, Zhang Han learned about the situation of the team of the Crimson Sunglow Sect this time, but only the general situation. In fact, what they said was all basic information, and they didn’t know the inside news at all.","The fleet continued flying.","They had traveled for 13 days with the speedy aircraft.","During this period, Mengmeng either cultivated or stayed by Zhang Han’s side, telling him stories about her on the Vast Heaven Star.","“How could Zhang Hanyang from the Orchid Peak act so indecently while traveling?”","“I know that he likes men, but it’s not okay for him to act this way.”","“This is just inappropriate!”","“This kind of person shouldn’t be allowed to participate in the training.”","“...”","Some people around were whispering.","But Mengmeng couldn’t hear them. She had already set up a soundproof layer, and it wouldn’t matter even if she heard them.","She was a little princess, to begin with.","Thirteen days later, the fleet arrived at their destination.","“Take a rest in the aircraft. You can team up on your own. Each team contains 30 people. You can explore the small secret realms here. If you discover anything, you can report it to the others.”","The leader, Taoist Heavenlight, who was also the Third Elder, issued the rules.","“Later on, some outstanding disciples get to choose their own training teams first.”","He allowed some talented disciples to act as captains, mainly to give them a chance to practice.","Xuan Chen and the other outstanding figures were the first to choose their teams.","When it was Xu Hang’s turn, he glanced at his big brother, Xuan Chen, in his aircraft.","He smiled and began to count the names.","“Hua Churan of Orchid Peak.","“Zhang Hanyang of Orchid Peak.","“Xiong Fengran of Command Beast Peak.”","Smack!","The third name was black on the display.","“He didn’t come?","“All right then. It would be just a small lesson for him.","“But Zhang Hanyang...”","A cold light flashed in Xu Hang’s eyes.","“Hua Churan, the Eldest Lady of Orchid Peak. I’ll have her see Zhang Hanyang die with her own eyes!”","After that, Xu Hang randomly selected some weaker disciples.","A small squad was formed.","On Mengmeng’s side, when the team was formed, there were hints about gathering places.","More than a dozen ordinary disciples from the Orchid Peak were selected.","When they heard that their captain was Xu Hang, they were all pleasantly surprised.","“Wow! I’m so lucky that Senior Brother Xu Hang chose me!”","“We have a great backing now. With Senior Brother Xu Hang around, our training will definitely be much easier.”","They looked at the envious eyes of the others.","These people’s faces were full of joy. They were extremely enjoying this.","But Zhang Han thought for a while.","“What does Xu Hang mean by choosing the Eldest Lady of Orchid Peak and Mengmeng?”","Following the crowd out, they gathered at the edge of a cliff of a mountain below.","These long rows of mountain peaks were all the closest to the Wind-Witches Evilland.","The captains of the teams that could stand here were almost all renowned characters in the Crimson Sunglow Sect.","In fact, everyone knew that the situation was the same for the other three sects. Everyone got to have talented disciples leading the teams. The ones who didn’t like staying in teams could be lone wolves. In any case, this was their own choice.","Soon, everyone in Zhang Han and Mengmeng’s team had gathered.","“Hey?”","Xu Hang still remembered Zhang Han, the new disciple, Yefeng.","He laughed disdainfully. “You’re called Yefeng, aren’t you? With your meager strength, how dare you come to the Wind-Witches Evilland on your own accord? How should I punish you for violating our sect’s rules?”","“Who do you think you are? Do you think you can punish us?” Mengmeng was unhappy.","She might ignore the mean words toward her sometimes, but she would never tolerate anyone targeting her father.","“Hmm?","“Hah. Hahaha!”","Xu Hang was a little surprised. He was unhappy, but he let out an unexpected and disdainful laugh.","“Interesting. Very interesting!”","He muttered to himself, shook his head slightly, and stopped looking at them. He inadvertently glanced at Hua Churan, the Eldest Lady of Orchid Peak, and said, “The Wind-Witches Evilland is in front of us. There are a few rules in my team. First, you have to listen to my instructions. Second, don’t leave the team without permission. Third, you should be careful not only of ghosts here but also of the disciples of the other three sects. Since ancient times, those sects have been hostile to our Crimson Sunglow Sect because we are the strongest among the Four Great Sects. That’s all. Let’s set off.”","With an indifferent tone, Xu Hang took a flying ship and advanced.","The others were flying in all kinds of ways. Some of them used their swords to fly, while others were flying directly. Zhang Han and Mengmeng were among them.","Mengmeng was now carrying a schoolbag, which was different from before.","However, Xu Hang’s words made Zhang Han’s eyes freeze.","Judging from everyone’s expressions, they all felt that the Crimson Sunglow Sect was the strongest, but it was actually on par with the other three great sects. In addition, they had quite a bit of enmity toward the other three sects.","“Yefeng, you came out without permission. Stay closer to me when you’re training later. After all, you’re a new disciple. Now, you’re here mainly to broaden your horizons.” Xu Hang turned around and said kindly, “Junior Brother Zhang is a genius in pellet refining on Orchid Peak. I don’t know how strong his combat capability is, nor do I know yours. I’ll protect you guys. Of course, I’ll also need Junior Brother Zhang to provide some medicinal pellets at critical moments.”","“Huh?”","Mengmeng felt that something was wrong. “Why is Xu Hang suddenly so nice to us?”","Just as she was about to say something, Zhang Han looked thrilled. He made obeisance and said, “Thank you for taking care of me, Senior Brother Xu Hang. I’m very grateful for your help.”","“It’s all right.” Xu Hang kindly waved his hand and said, “We’re all from the same sect. I’ll definitely take good care of you, but you have to be obedient.”","At a glance, Zhang Han found that there was a deep meaning in his eyes.","“Will this guy take action?”","He laughed heartily and said, “You’re truly a nice senior brother!”","Seeing this, the others were much more relaxed. Some of them echoed with a smile.","“Yes, I’ve long heard of Senior Brother Xu Hang’s name. Everyone knows that he’s powerful and has a good temper in the sect.”","“That’s right. I’ve been admiring Senior Brother Xu Hang for a long time. I’ve finally seen him in person today.”","“Senior Brother Xu Hang is so amazing.”","Xu Hang got a group of fans immediately.","“I am a strict person. Usually, I like to communicate and chat with others. We are all fellow disciples. We can treat each other as friends. There is no need for you to be so reserved when you are with me,” he said with a smile.","“It’s so nice of you, Senior Brother Xu Hang.”","The crowd was completely overwhelmed by Xu Hang’s demeanor.","It was rare to see someone with such a good temper and strength.","Mengmeng, however, blinked her eyes. She was very smart. From her father’s reaction just now, she could guess that Xu Hang was definitely going to make trouble.","She couldn’t help but be even more vigilant against him.","“Bastard, are you trying to trick us?”","Xu Hang said some more nice words to Zhang Han and Mengmeng, and his attitude became more and more friendly. However, he only chatted with them for a while, and most of the time, he chatted with others. Soon, everyone on the team got along well.","The atmosphere was light.","However, as they went deeper into the Wind-Witches Evilland, Xu Hang gradually stopped talking. From time to time, he looked around with a grave look.","“Qitian, Zhongxi, Oulan, the three of you go to the left and investigate. Stay within 500 meters of us. I can support you at any time if there is anything unusual.”","In a valley, Xu Hang said, “Maji, the six of you go to the right side and investigate. If there is anything strange, report it to me immediately. It’s too quiet here. Maybe there are some ghosts or some small secret realms.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The nine people who had been called out were divided into two teams and searched the mountains on both sides of the valley.","Quite a few of them were very nervous.","“Did we just bump into something terrifying?”","“AH!”","Suddenly, a shocked roar came from the right side.","A shadow of a withered tree appeared from the man’s side. It seemed that it was going to attack him.","“Just a weak ghost. How dare you make trouble here? Ardent Sun Slash!”","Xu Hang glared at the frightened disciple and shouted, “Retreat! I’ll deal with the enemy!”","Swoosh!","A huge blade light flashed by.","The shadow of the withered tree trembled and then dissipated.","The whole process only took ten seconds.","The disciple said gratefully, “Thank you, Senior Brother Xu Hang!”","“Gather up. It’s all right here.”","Xu Hang waved his hand.","The group of people who went out to investigate returned.","Everyone had seen how capable Xu Hang was with their own eyes. The might he exerted just now was so strong that it didn’t look like an attack from a disciple of the younger generation at all.","Some people even said, “He’s just like a protector of the sect.”","It was a little exaggerated.","Mengmeng commented on Xu Hang in her heart. “What a fancy act.","“He’s so hypocritical.”","However-","“Junior Brother Yefeng, are you used to the environment here?” Xu Hang asked with a smile.","Zhang Han tried his best to pretend to be nervous and said in a somewhat nervous tone, “Ahem, I’m not used to it. I feel a little depressed. Fortunately, we have you watching our backs. Otherwise, I wouldn’t know what to do.”","“Well, you’re a newcomer. This is your first time training, and you tend to be nervous.” Xu Hang laughed.","He looked as if he was recalling his past.","Xu Hang then lowered his voice and said, “Follow up. Let’s continue forward toward the central region. If we’re lucky, we’ll be able to encounter a small secret realm.”","A tense atmosphere was created.","“Daddy, you’re really good at acting!” Mengmeng’s amused voice appeared in Zhang Han’s ear.","“Ahem.”","Zhang Han coughed softly and said via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “Anyway, I have nothing to do. I feel like teasing him.”","“You’re so mean,” Mengmeng said with a grin.","“Whether he’s intentional or not, we’ll soon find out,” Zhang Han said. “Generally speaking, this kind of person, who is clearly hostile but suddenly tries to please us, is almost always plotting in secret.”","“I can feel it, but I’m not sure. I just have to be on guard against him.”","“You’re smart. It will be nice if you don’t trick him,” Zhang Han said with a laugh. Then, he reminded her, “But since we are not in the sect, we should be careful and protect ourselves. That’s the most important thing.”","“Got it.”","In the group.","Xu Hang talked to everyone from time to time, while Zhang Han and Mengmeng chatted with each other via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique at the back.","As for Hua Churan, the Eldest Lady of Orchid Peak, she followed the team silently, looking at Mengmeng from time to time.","Her expression would always be complicated.","During the trip, Xu Hang would send someone to investigate the surrounding situation from time to time.","Two days later.","“Junior Brother Yefeng, although you are a newcomer, you need to gain experience. Go to the right side and investigate with Junior Brother Zhang,” Xu Hang smiled and said.","Zhang Han said with a bright smile, “Okay, Senior Brother Xu Hang.”","Mengmeng and Zhang Han were exploring the mountain forest on the right.","As they walked, Zhang Han suddenly shouted, “What is it?!”","The ones on the team were all shocked.","Xu Hang’s eyes flickered. “Is that a God Transformation Realm ghost?”","In the depths of the forest, he had long since sensed some clues.","However, after Zhang Han went over-","“Senior Brother Xu Hang, come here now!","“There’s a ghost here!”","Zhang Han shouted.","Swoosh!","After waiting for three seconds, Xu Hang quickly flew over. Looking at the ghost that floated out of the darkness, he attacked with anger.","“Go to hell!”","Boom!","The saber radiance he shot out hacked forward and killed that ghost.","He said to Zhang Han with certainty, “Junior Brother Yefeng, don’t be afraid. No one can do anything to you with me here.”","“Thank you for saving my life, Senior Brother Xu Hang!” Zhang Han cupped his hands and said.","“Haha!”","Mengmeng’s facial muscles trembled. She was trying to hold back her laughter.","“What’s Daddy doing? He always makes me laugh.”","Just at this moment.","Boom!","On the mountainside, a huge rock suddenly slipped down.","A pitch-black hole was revealed where there was energy swirling and ripples rippling.","“Is this... a small-scale secret realm?”","Xu Hang was delighted.","More than 80% of the small secret realms would have a lot of precious treasures.","“Good heavens!”","Zhang Han exclaimed. “Senior Brother Xu Hang, you’re so powerful. You’ve created a small secret realm with one strike. That’s amazing!”","Upon hearing this, Xu Hang was stunned.","“What does that have to do with me?","“That stone should be...","“Forget it.”","He didn’t know what was going on. At this time, he found Zhang Han somewhat pleasing to the eye as he said with a smile, “Junior Brother Yefeng, take it easy. Let’s keep a low profile. At first, I just felt some energy fluctuations, but I didn’t expect it to be a small secret realm.”","“Wow!”","Mengmeng clapped her hands and exclaimed, “Senior Brother Xu Hang, you’re amazing!”","Xu Hang said seriously, “All right, let’s go into the small secret realm. Remember, when you enter it, you must be careful and listen to my orders.”","Everyone gathered together. When they began to enter, Xu Hang stared at Mengmeng’s and Zhang Han’s backs with a sneer.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","31 people from the team all entered the small secret realm.","The scenery here was very similar to that of the outside world. There was no sun and the sky was dim. They were also in a jungle. However, there was an ancient town in the canyon ahead.","The surrounding jungle was pitch-black, so dark that one couldn’t even see their fingers. Only the ancient town was a little brightly lit.","It was deathly silent, and even the sound of one’s breathing could be heard.","This sort of absolute silence and darkness caused one to shudder with fear.","It was as if there was something terrifying hidden in the jungle.","“We can’t stay here for long. Go with me to the ancient town.”","Xu Hang’s voice was low and urgent.","“The exit has been removed and it isn’t here. It’s in that ancient town. Let’s find the exit first!”","Xu Hang was quite troubled by the situation here. He could not figure out what was going on.","He assigned the guys in the most appropriate way.","“Qitian, you guys lead the way in the front and move forward in the line-up of six thorns.","“Hua Churan, you guys stay in the middle and keep an eye on the surroundings. If anything happens, alert us immediately.","“Oulan, you guys stay at the back of the team and be ready to support us at any time.","“Zhang Hanyang, Yefeng, you two follow me at the back. If anyone is injured, you can provide some medicinal pellets to help him.”","Everyone’s assignments had been divided.","Then, Xu Hang said, “Let’s go now. I doubt if there’s something terrifying behind the jungle.","“Once something happens, you guys run first and I’ll cover you.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The group moved forward quickly.","Xu Hang was at the end of the team. A few meters in front of him were Zhang Han and Mengmeng, who were Yefeng and Zhang Hanyang in Xu Hang’s eyes."]},{"number":1430,"title":"Chapter 1430 Senior Brother Is a Good Man","paragraphs":["Chapter 1430 Senior Brother Is a Good Man","“Take out your Defense Treasures. Don’t be careless!”","Hua Churan, the Eldest Lady of Orchid Peak, had been heartbroken recently. She even started doubting everything she had learned and worried about gains and losses. She didn’t talk much along the way, but at such a serious moment, she still reminded her teammates.","A lot of people in the crowd immediately took out some defensive or detection treasures, which were all Yang treasures.","As they searched their surroundings, they quickly advanced.","“Good heavens!”","“Why can’t we get out of this place?”","“The ancient town is clearly not far ahead, but we have been moving for five minutes, and the distance remains the same.”","Hiss!","Many people gasped in horror.","“We’ve been in place all this time. We’ve been trapped!”","Everyone felt a chill down their spine.","They had never imagined that they would encounter such a strange scene.","Even though they had all kinds of Defense Treasures, it was in vain. There was no way to get out of this place at all.","Xu Hang frowned and said sternly, “Don’t panic!”","This kind of attitude was his true nature.","At this point, he couldn’t help but become cautious.","“Roc-suppressing Wing Formation!”","He took out several Formation Flags and set up a formation. Then, he activated the Fire of the Magic Eye and lit up the nearby area.","The crowd immediately discovered that there were dense red dots in the jungle.","Upon closer inspection, they found that those were the eyes of some creatures.","The blood-red eyes seemed to reflect the bloodthirsty killing intent.","The surroundings had been seen through.","The crowd also noticed that the direction of the ancient town was still in front of them, but there seemed to be a circular square around them. They had been circling this place before.","Creak!","Suddenly, the dense red dots started to move.","When the crowd got closer, they suddenly found that each one of these creatures was more than one meter long.","“Bloodthirsty Bat Kings!”","“Oh no!”","“Run now!”","Hua Churan’s face turned pale. She cried out in shock and fled with the others.","During this period, everyone took out all kinds of Defense Treasures and kept attacking backward, trying to stall for time. However, the distance between the Bloodthirsty Bat Kings and them was getting shorter and shorter.","“Let’s go!”","Kaleb shouted coldly.","Several jets of saber radiance were launched.","The group fled in a panic and ran madly toward the ancient town in front.","The number of bats was increasing.","“Be careful, Junior Brother Tong!”","A man shouted in shock and hurried to help Junior Brother Tong on the periphery.","However, in a panic, the Defense Treasure Junior Brother Tong took out was broken, and all the attacks he launched were drowned.","“AH!","“Stay away from me!”","He was caught by three bats and retreated dozens of meters. Then, many bats swarmed over and tore him apart.","“Don’t shout!”","Mengmeng reminded the others. As she launched her attacks, she retreated with Zhang Han.","“Let’s leave!”","Xu Hang led the group to flee.","He seemed to have inadvertently glanced at Mengmeng. With a flash of light in his eyes, he slowly raised his right hand and finally put it back.","He didn’t lend a helping hand to the people around him. He just watched coldly and waited for an opportunity.","However, he suddenly found that Junior Brother Yefeng was also staring at him.","“Is he that scared?”","Instinctively, Xu Hang thought that Yefeng wanted to follow him and escape.","“Watch out!”","Seeing that Hua Churan had been attacked by more than a dozen Bloodthirsty Bat Kings, Xu Hang finally made a relatively powerful move and forced those bats to retreat.","At this time, the crowd was near the ancient town.","...","The sky seemed to have brightened a little. Was it because of the lights in the ancient town?","No one knew.","However, fewer and fewer Bloodthirsty Bat Kings were chasing after them. It was not until they were a hundred meters away from the ancient town that these terrifying creatures turned around and left.","As the crowd fled, three of them were killed.","Only 28 people were left in the team of 31 people.","“Take a three-minute break. Three minutes later, we’ll enter the ancient town and find a way out. This is not a place we can explore.”","With a slightly gloomy face, Xu Hang looked at the team and said in a cold voice, “I’ve already told you how to face danger. Is this how you do it? The formation is in disorder!”","As he spoke, he let out a deep sigh and said with a sad look, “In such a short time, we lost three people. Three junior brothers. They shouldn’t have died! It’s my fault! I didn’t take good care of them!”","“Senior Brother Xu Hang!”","His words were very touching.","“It’s not your fault. Please don’t blame yourself.”","...","“Perhaps that’s fate!”","“Senior Brother Xu Hang, you have already done your best.”","After receiving a few words of comfort, Xu Hang sighed and said, “Although I’m heartbroken, we still have to deal with this place, so you must obey my orders from now on. Only in this way can we have the greatest chance to leave this place alive! This small secret realm is absolutely dangerous. You must be careful and listen to me. If anyone dares to disobey my orders, he will be severely punished when we get out.”","No one refuted his words.","Some of them even agreed with him.","Three minutes later, he turned to look at the ancient town.","After staring at it for a few seconds, Xu Hang suddenly said, “As I said just now, there might be dangers at the rear of the jungle, and there were the Bloodthirsty Bat Kings. Now, there may be a crisis in the ancient town, because even the Bloodthirsty Bat Kings don’t dare to enter this place. Therefore, there are now changes to the previous formation. I, Zhang Hanyang, and Yefeng will be in the front, and Hua Churan... will be on guard in the middle. The others stay in the back and get ready to support us at any time.”","“Senior Brother Xu Hang, you’re the best!”","“Senior Brother Xu Hang, you’re so nice to me. I’ll listen to your commands when we leave this place.”","“...”","A few people were moved.","Even Hua Churan said with a complicated expression, “Xu Hang, I misjudged you before. I didn’t expect you to be so responsible.”","“I hear you. After all, we have never done a task together before. How could you believe the rumors about my indifference? All right now. Let’s enter the ancient town and find the exit. Our team can’t take this small secret realm down. Let’s find more teams to explore it together,” Xu Hang nodded and said.","After that, he took the lead in walking to the ancient town.","The ancient town was extremely quiet.","Every house seemed to be covered with dust and full of a dead atmosphere.","The strange thing was that each courtyard had a lush tree.","This place seemed to be full of vitality.","“Daddy, what’s going on here?” Mengmeng asked via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","“This is an ominous place,” Zhang Han said. “Those were Bloodthirsty Ghost Bats just now, not Bloodthirsty Bat Kings. Ghost Bats feed on evil spirits. They like blood, so they are relatively cruel. As for the ancient town, every courtyard has a dead soul. Every dead soul is nourishing the Demonic Vines. Those trees that look lush are the truly terrible things here.”","“Should we let them know this?”","“Xu Hang clearly knows some formations, so he should be able to see the layout of the ancient town. He knows that the exit is in the north, but he took us in from the southeast and headed west. It seems that he doesn’t know that there are Demonic Vines here.”","“What does that mean? What is he going to do?” Mengmeng frowned and looked at Xu Hang.","“Let’s wait and see what he will do.”","After Zhang Han said that, the two of them followed Xu Hang silently.","After walking westward for half an hour, the team did not encounter any danger in the ancient town.","“Senior Brother Xu Hang.”","“There’s a light in the courtyard over there. Is it a treasure?”","“There is a light! It seems to be a spirit treasure?”","A few disciples pointed to a courtyard not far from the side street, where there was a faint white light flashing.","Xu Hang said, “Let’s go and check it out.”","This time, his speed was much faster.","When the crowd arrived outside the courtyard, they looked into it.","Under the tree in the courtyard, there was a sword inserted in the root of the tree.","“A fifth-tier spirit treasure!”","Quite a few disciples were pleasantly surprised.","However, Xu Hang’s eyes were fixed on a gem below the long sword.","It was the Step Refining Stone, a top-grade sixth-tier weapon-refining spirit treasure.","He needed this kind of treasure.","“Mind-clearing Spell.","“Illusionary Eye!”","Xu Hang cast several spells to clear the surroundings. When he found that there was no danger around, he opened the defensive layers of the five kinds of spiritual treasures.","“Everyone, wait here. There may be a crisis in the courtyard. I’ll go and take out that long sword.”","After saying that, Xu Hang entered the courtyard with a flash.","The first thing he did was to put away the gem, and then he pull out the long sword.","Clang!","The sound of a sword being drawn rang out in the courtyard.","Clatter!","Leaves shook faster and faster without any wind, making clattering sounds.","The scene became more and more bizarre.","All of a sudden, a faint black shadow of a withered tree came out of the tree.","When Xu Hang saw the shadow of the withered tree, his expression changed drastically. “Demonic Vine!","“Not good! Run now!”","He finally knew the crisis in the ancient town.","“It’s actually a Demonic Vine!”","Demonic Vine was very difficult to deal with. It stayed unscathed by all kinds of attacks and belonged to the Yin soul type, but it could create real branches.","Every single branch was a dead soul it absorbed, and they possessed extremely strong might.","“Hua Churan, follow the street and run north now!”","Xu Hang let out a shocked cry.","He felt that the Demonic Vine was flying toward him from his back.","He turned around and swung his long saber angrily. The saber radiance whistled past, mixed with the power of the raging fire.","However, this only managed to slow down the Demonic Vine a little.","Even his saber radiance did not cause any damage in the courtyard.","“This is too strange.”","This caused Xu Hang to be even more shocked.","He quickly made a few strikes.","He slipped into the crowd and shouted, “Take out all your Defense Treasures. Let’s display our moves together!”","Many people did as he said.","The more people there were, the greater the power. They immediately stopped the Demonic Vine behind them.","It was slightly slower than the crowd.","“It won’t be able to catch us!”","Some disciples let out a sigh of relief.","Clatter!","However, they didn’t expect that as soon as they finished speaking, the whole street, as well as the courtyards nearby, would be filled with rustling sounds.","The trees in the courtyards were shaking as if the Demonic Vines hidden within were awakening.","“Crap!”","Xu Hang cursed in his heart.","He took out a golden talisman and unfurled it.","His speed increased.","In the blink of an eye, he came to the front of the team.","“I’ll find the exit for you. Follow my route!”","After that, Xu Hang’s figure turned into a stream of light.","He gave no further instructions to the crowd behind him.","Seeing this, Hua Churan gritted her teeth and also took out a magic treasure, a Strider Talisman.","Her speed increased dramatically.","At this critical moment, the means of escape were quite important. Everyone figured out various ways to cope with the situation.","Those who were able to flee quickly would definitely not be slow.","The faces of the few disciples at the back turned pale.","“AAAAH!”","“Save me!”","Mengmeng was a little hesitant. She looked at Zhang Han.","“Sometimes, you need to keep a boundary in your heart.”","Zhang Han said earnestly, “What does the life and death of others have to do with me?","“That’s not right or wrong, but it would make you feel better. Helping them would just be lifting a finger. I’m not teaching you to be indifferent all these years, but to keep you safe. Mengmeng, you’ve grown up. In the future, you should do things according to your mood. Your happiness should be your priority.”","As he spoke via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, Zhang Han smiled gently and ran his mind slightly.","He would use the most correct method, using the least amount of power, to intimidate the Demonic Vines.","Buzz!","No one noticed that the Demonic Vine, which was chasing after them, suddenly became slow and hesitant. The leaves in the courtyards on both sides of the street also trembled much less than before.","If things went on like this, except for five or six people who could escape quickly, the others would all die here.","A small secret realm could provide people with treasures, but it could also make people die without their bodies left. Opportunities and crises coexisted.","“Got it.”","Mengmeng pursed her lips and smiled. “Anyway, as long as you’re here with me, I’ll be happy.”","They fled to the side of the street in the center of the ancient town, where the trees of the Demonic Vines trembled most violently.","After a while, the frequency became much lower, and Zhang Han withdrew his mind.","More and more Demonic Vines chased after them.","But judging from those creatures’ speed, it should not be a problem for the crowd to escape.","“Over here! Hurry up and come!”","To the north of the ancient town, at the edge of the town, there was a white vortex, which was the exit.","At this moment, Xu Hang was flying back. When he saw that the Demonic Vines were in the distance, he was immediately relieved. His eyes flickered slightly as if he was thinking about something.","He took the initiative to walk up to the crowd and said loudly, “I’ve finally found the exit. Hurry up! Flee!","“The ones in the back before now have the priority to leave first. Hua Churan, Zhang Hanyang, and Yefeng, you will stay here and help me resist the Demonic Vines!","“Don’t hesitate. Everyone else, hurry up and leave.”","Everyone was quite moved by his words.","During this trip to the secret realm, Senior Brother Xu Hang had truly done his best. He had found the exit, but he tried to help them out at once instead of leaving on his own.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Looking at the hundreds of Demonic Vines behind him, Xu Hang thought about the time and speed he needed.","He took Hua Churan with him to take action together.","At the same time, he made sure that Zhang Han and Mengmeng would not pass him and leave.","Zhang Han said via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “Did you see that? He has evil intentions.”","“Humph!”","Mengmeng also noticed Xu Hang’s unusual behaviors and snorted softly.","After the main force left, only four people were left.","“Hua Churan, you need to leave first!”","Swoosh!","Hua Churan nodded and quickly flew to the exit of the whirlpool.","When she was still a dozen meters away from it, Xu Hang said loudly, “Zhang Hanyang, Yefeng, hurry up and leave. I’ll cover you!”","His voice was quite urgent. He attacked frequently, and his moves were bold and powerful, which made him seem invincible.","However, in the face of the Demonic Vines, he was still forced to retreat step by step.","He seemed to be fighting hard.","Hearing what he said, Zhang Han and Mengmeng flew to the exit. Before they approached, Hua Churan turned her head and looked at Xu Hang, who was in a battle, with mixed feelings.","She sighed softly and said, “Senior Brother Xu Hang, I misjudged you before.”","After that, she was about to enter the exit.","Xu Hang was trapped by a Demonic Vine, and the energy attacks launched by the withered branches were like whips.","The slaps caused him to tremble.","“Zhang Hanyang! Yefeng! Leave now! Take the news out!”","His roar resounded through the area within a kilometer.","At this time, Hua Chuchu’s figure had completely disappeared at the exit.","The plot was revealed in the end.","As Xu Hang looked at Zhang Han and Mengmeng’s backs, a sneer suddenly appeared on his face, but his tone contained deep hatred and resentment.","“Junior Brother Zhang! Junior Brother Yefeng!","“Huh. You won’t be able to escape!”","Buzz!","He took out a box-shaped spirit treasure.","After he opened it, Zhang Han and Mengmeng were covered by a layer of light.","“Come to me!","“Shadow Displacement Transposition!” Xu Hang said with a grim smile.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Countless energy locked onto Zhang Han and Mengmeng. The light wave was like a big net, covering the two of them and then flickering.","Their positions had suddenly changed.","At this time, standing not far from the exit, Xu Hang looked at the two people behind him, shaking his fingers and sneering with a contemptuous look.","However, he said with great care, “Junior Brother Zhang! Junior Brother Yefeng! You won’t die in vain. I’ll lead the army of the sect to suppress this place and avenge you!”","After that, he went straight into the exit, and his upper body left first.","“How dare you provoke Brother Xuan Chen! You’re courting death!","“Phew. I’ve finally come out.”","Xu Hang was much more relaxed.","He could also see that there were more than twenty people waiting anxiously in the valley outside, waiting for him to return.","However-","Bang!","One of his legs was suddenly grabbed by something.","“What?”","Xu Hang’s pupils constricted.","He felt that an irresistible force was pulling him back.","“No!’","Xu Hang let out a furious roar, his face contorted with rage.","He didn’t even have time to react before being dragged back. When he could see clearly, he saw a tall figure appear before him.","“What is it?”","He saw two perfectly round eyes.","“Is this a King Kong?”","Xu Hang was stunned and at a loss for what to do.","“Throw him back!” Mengmeng said in a huff.","“Get lost!”","Dahei let out a curse.","It grabbed Xu Hang’s leg and threw him away with force.","Swoosh!","Xu Hang turned into a stream of light and was quickly thrown into the center of the ancient town.","“AH!","“No!”","“Zhang Hanyang!”","His eyes were red as he let out a resentful roar.","However, his voice was soon covered by another earth-shattering voice.","“Senior Brother Xu Hang!”","Zhang Han cried out in pain.","He then winked at Mengmeng.","Dahei became smaller and returned to Mengmeng’s schoolbag.","The Demonic Vines, which were far away, didn’t dare to get close to them.","As for Zhang Han, he held Mengmeng’s hand unhurriedly and walked into the exit leisurely.","After they went out, Zhang Han’s face immediately changed.","His face was full of sadness. He looked in the direction of the exit and pounded his chest and stamped his feet.","“Senior Brother Xu Hang! You got yourself in danger to save me. At the last moment, you gave me your Space Ring. You fought against the Demonic Vine even though you had to die! Senior Brother Xu Hang! You shouldn’t have done this!”","“Huh?”","Mengmeng was stunned.","“Why is he so good at acting?”","“Let’s hurry and leave!”","Hua Churan’s eyes quivered. After hearing Zhang Han’s words, she felt sad and watched the exit disappear. Xu Hang had not yet come out.","This kind of feeling was too sad.","It was a depressing scene.","But the team must have a captain.","Hua Churan knew that she was under a lot of responsibilities.","She had a bitter look on her face. She had never expected that the small secret realm they explored this time would be so dangerous that even Captain Xu Hang would die.","As the crowd thought of the scenes that had happened before where Xu Hang was so nice to them, many people’s eyes turned red.","Zhang Han also looked sad.","He showed a state of powerlessness and said in a very sad tone, “Senior Brother Xu Hang is a good man.","“He sacrificed himself for our sake. He is a great person.”","Gurgle!","Mengmeng couldn’t help but swallow.","“Oh my god!","“Daddy is now a better actor than Mummy.","“Could it be that he learned his acting from her?","“Is this like one that lies down with dogs will rise up with fleas?”","Mengmeng just learned something new.","Seeing that Zhang Han was sad, the crowd all comforted him.","“Senior Brother Xu Hang is a good man. Don’t be too sad, Junior Brother Yefeng. There’s no way we could resist those attacks.”","“Yeah. Senior Brother Xu Hang might not have died in there. Let’s inform the sect as soon as possible. If they find out that he is trapped in a small secret realm, they will definitely send people to rescue him.”","“Senior Brother Xu Hang can’t die!”","Hearing their words, Mengmeng suddenly felt quite helpless. She touched her forehead.","There was probably not even a single bone left of Xu Hang now."]},{"number":1431,"title":"Chapter 1431 Interrogation","paragraphs":["Chapter 1431 Interrogation","“We’ll wait again. First, we’ll ask the nearby teams for help. Then, we’ll report to the higher-ups that there is a dangerous secret realm here.”","No one knew if Xu Hang was still alive in the secret realm.","Hua Churan had no choice but to act as the captain. She didn’t like the feeling of carrying a heavy burden, so she could only ask others for help.","At the same time, she looked at Mengmeng and said, “You two were the last ones to come out. What did Senior Brother Xu Hang say? Did you see where he was at last? Also, how did the exit disappear?”","In the face of her doubts, Zhang Han let out a long sigh and said, “Before we came out, Senior Brother Xu Hang was entangled by dozens of Demonic Vines. He was struggling. We tried to save him, but he wouldn’t allow us to do so. He even gave me his Space Ring...”","As Zhang Han spoke, he opened his palm. In it was a Space Ring, which was a treasure from Xu Hang.","Giving such a private treasure to someone else meant that Xu Hang was most likely dead.","Everyone was well aware of this, so the scene gradually quieted down.","After a long wait.","Finally, five squads arrived in succession.","“Protector An is busy with something. A huge secret realm has appeared in the central area. Our Third Elder, Taoist Heavenlight, has led a team there. We’re also ready to go there and provide reinforcements. Now that the people of the Heavenly Evil Sect have learned about it, we have to hurry up. We just passed by here and heard that something happened to your team. How could something go wrong while you’re led by Xu Hang?”","“Senior Brother Xu Hang is trapped in a small secret realm nearby. The enemies, the Demonic Vines, are very powerful. Hurry and save him!” a disciple said.","He made it very urgent.","However, after searching the surrounding five miles, the squads didn’t find the entrance. As for Hua Churan and the others, they didn’t know anything about it. The environment here was completely different from the entrance to the secret realm they had been in.","“Spatial magic. This secret realm is not to be underestimated. We can’t find him. Xu Hang will have to rely on his own luck to get out.”","The captains of the several teams shook their heads and sighed.","“There’s no time to lose. We’re going to the central area. Junior Sister Hua, why don’t you come with us? We can make proper arrangements when we arrive at the place.”","His proposal was rejected.","“No, no. There are more crises in the central area. It’s easy to meet the people from the other three sects there. If we go there while taking care of them, it will be more dangerous. I feel that they should leave the Wind-Witches Evilland first and go back to the base to wait. They can form a new team soon.”","Their strength was not high, and it would be a burden if they had more people join them.","After thinking for a while, one of the captains said, “Junior Sister Hua, if you want to go to the central area, you can follow me. The rest of you’d better go back to the base.”","“I... Okay.” Hua Churan’s expression was complicated. After thinking for a while, she finally nodded.","If she went to the central area, she could stay by the Third Elder. If she go to the base outside, she would have to wait bitterly.","After thinking for a while, Hua Churan decided to follow the other teams.","“You guys go back the way you came.”","The others were not treated so well, and they were not willing to be a burden.","Hence, everyone could only watch as those squads left.","“We are the only ones left.”","A senior disciple said, “We can’t be in disorder. I’ll be the captain for the rest of the journey. No objections?”","“You want to be the captain? Who do you think you are to be the captain?”","“You can’t do it. Your strength is not as high as mine. It’s not appropriate for you to be the captain.”","“We don’t need a captain. We just need to go back the way we came.”","The group was in a mess.","Zhang Han glanced at Mengmeng and gave her a look. Then, the two of them walked into the depths of the jungle and followed the route that those teams were taking.","“Zhang Hanyang, Yefeng, where are you two going?”","The people behind them called out twice, but they were ignored.","The crowd then left helplessly.","“Daddy, are we going in the right direction?” Mengmeng said, “Three of those teams are flying in other directions. Are we sticking to one team?”","“Those teams have gone to a secret realm not far away and are ready to support other teams,” Zhang Han said.","As he spoke, he suddenly said, “Eh?”","“What’s the matter?” Mengmeng was stunned.","“The secret realm they’re going to is discovered by your Aunty Xue,” Zhang Han said slowly, with a slightly strange look.","“Aunty Xue is here?” Mengmeng’s eyes lit up.","“Then let’s hurry over there.”","The little princess had a good relationship with Mu Xue.","At this time, in the front.","In the team where Hua Churan was, while the guys were chatting with each other, someone told Hua Churan the latest news.","“The situation is just as the elders expected. The other sects have also sent out many young talents as well.”","“We’re going to a super canyon. It’s said that Mu Xue, the new talent of the Heavenly Evil Sect, found it. She’s very powerful and has many moves. No one knows what her limit is. More than ten talents of the Heavenly Evil Sect have been taught a lesson by her.”","“The disciples shall be challenged and selected during the practice. There are more and more talented ones. There are also quite a few talents in our Crimson Sunglow Sect.”","“Of course there are. It’s precisely because we have too many stunningly powerful disciples that we don’t often have only a few characters who are said to be quite formidable like the three other sects. But in actuality, they’re just nobodies. They all have to make way for us when they meet us.”","“...”","After hearing these comments, Zhang Han told Mengmeng that Mu Xue was also there.","It was naturally a good thing for them to reunite with one more person.","...","With someone leading the way in the front, the rest could be at ease. Zhang Han and Mengmeng followed them leisurely. Dahei stuck out its head from time to time and watched for a few minutes before going back to sleep.","Just like that, they advanced for three more days.","They had finally arrived at their destination.","There were quite a few teams in the jungle of a huge canyon.","Some of them belonged to the Heavenly Evil Sect, a few of them were from the Authentic Martial Arts Sect, and Crimson Sunglow Sect had the most teams.","There were many disciples in groups of three to five.","Hua Churan looked around and didn’t find the Third Elder.","“The elder and an elder of the Authentic Martial Arts Sect have entered a big secret realm. They need to do a simple investigation and then let the main force in.”","“I guess it won’t take long. The Authentic Martial Arts Sect has also discovered this place. In another two or three days, their teams will also come.”","“There were dozens of people who entered first. I heard that there were treasures, as well as spiritual herbs, everywhere in that secret realm. However, most of them were snatched away by Mu Xue. She hasn’t come out yet.”","“...”","...","Through other people’s chats, it was not difficult to detect the situation here.","“Let’s go forward.”","Zhang Han took Mengmeng forward, intending to feel the fluctuations of the Relic near the canyon.","On the way, they could occasionally see a team of dozens of people in the forest.","Someone shouted, “Which sect do you belong to?”","“How dare you stroll around here without wearing the token of the Heavenly Evil Sect? Do you want to die?”","Seeing this, Zhang Han was stunned. It turned out that the teams wandering out here were occupying territories.","“But what’s the point of that?”","Zhang Han looked at them silently, then retreated hundreds of meters with Mengmeng and walked forward through the gap on the side.","If Mu Xue was not in the secret realm, Zhang Han could just watch the fun from behind. But since she was in it, he planned to explore it first.","Only by getting to know the situation could he have more ideas.","Zhang Han and Mengmeng walked to the front.","“Hmm?”","Hua Churan, who was not far away, frowned and said in an unfriendly tone, “What are you two doing here?”","“Mind your own business,” Mengmeng snorted and said.","“Huh.”","Hua Churan’s face was cold and she didn’t say anything, but the men beside her were confused.","“Senior Sister Hua, who are these people?”","“Zhang Hanyang and Yefeng.” Hua Churan said with a cold face, “They are irrelevant people who don’t follow the rules. Don’t worry about them.”","As the team moved forward to the place where the Crimson Sunglow Sect was stationed, the number of people gradually increased. There was a large group of people closest to the valley, among whom stood Xuan Chen, who had long been famous.","“Junior Sister, nice to see you here.” Xuan Chen revealed a smile when he saw Hua Churan.","“Senior Brother Xuan Chen,” Hua Churan greeted him.","She was quite strange. She knew that Xuan Chen liked her, but she didn’t feel anything for him. On the contrary, she was loyal to Zhang Hanyang, who had just joined the sect, and she didn’t even hesitate to give herself to him.","“However, Zhang Hanyang is actually a girl!”","Thinking of this, Hua Churan had mixed feelings.","Now that she saw Xuan Chen, she became more indifferent. She just didn’t have any feelings for him.","“I heard that you would also take this training, so I had Xu Hang choose you. But... did something happen to him?” asked Xuan Chen.","“Yes. Something went wrong. He’s trapped in a secret realm.” Hua Chuchu’s voice was lower.","No one knew if he was dead or alive.","“I heard that you guys were hunted down by the Demonic Vines in the secret realm. Except for Xu Hang, Zhang Hanyang, and Yefeng, the rest of you escaped,” Xuan Chen said slowly.","“Yes. In order to save people, Senior Brother Xu Hang...”","“Senior Brother, Zhang Hanyang and Yefeng are over there.”","“Is that so?” Xuan Chen’s brows rose slightly. “Call them over.”","“Yes, sir.”","A few of his men left with a dozen people.","“They were the only ones in there. Junior Sister Hua, you don’t mind me overstepping my authority and asking about your Orchid Peak’s new disciples, do you?” Xuan Chen asked, smiling.","“That’s okay.” Hua Churan’s face did not change.","This instead caused Xuan Chen to narrow his eyes.","He seemed to hear a few discussions around him.","“I heard that Xu Hang is trapped in a secret realm.”","“It means that he’s probably dead.”","“I feel sorry for him. Xu Hang is so smart, and he has never schemed against others.”","Xu Hang and Xuan Chen naturally had some enemies, so the crowd couldn’t help but ridicule them.","However, this didn’t cause Xuan Chen’s expression to change. It was unknown whether or not he was angry.","“Senior Brother!”","Everyone thought that Xuan Chen would deliberately make things difficult for the two newcomers.","To their surprise, four or five of the men he had sent out ran back with slightly swollen faces.","“Zhang Hanyang and Yefeng didn’t listen to us at all. They started a fight and hit us!”","“They also said that if you want to see them, you should go there in person. They don’t have time to answer to you, a small potato.” Just two sentences.","The people who did not get along with Xuan Chen laughed and said, “These newcomers are interesting.”","“Hahaha.”","Xuan Chen also laughed. He looked at his subordinates and his tone was a little cold.","“You all are truly useless trash!","“Fine. Since they don’t want to come, I’ll go and see them.”","As he spoke, Xuan Chen’s figure flashed, and he took the lead to move forward.","Hua Churan’s face slightly changed.","“It will not be okay if Xuan Chen gets angry.”","“Humph!”","Some of the geniuses present snorted coldly. “How dare the newcomers be so arrogant? I guess they don’t know the rules of our Crimson Sunglow Sect well enough!”","The one who spoke followed the team with a cold face.","“Fortunately, the elder is not here. Otherwise, they would be punished severely.”","There were still some people who were close to Xuan Chen, and they all followed him.","Because Xuan Chen had great fame, quite a few people who had conflicts with him also followed him.","“Anyway, it’s useless to wait here. I might as well go over and watch the fun.”","There were hundreds of people who’d left the front of the Crimson Sunglow Sect’s station."]},{"number":1432,"title":"Chapter 1432 Enough with Your Absurd Excuses","paragraphs":["Chapter 1432 Enough with Your Absurd Excuses","“We know that they are the new disciples of the sect. Those who don’t know might think they are some big shot. How shameless of them to ask Senior Brother Xuan Chen to personally go over.”","On the way there, it was inevitable that some people who catered to those in power would rush to express their opinions.","“Arrogant to the extreme! I’ve never seen such arrogant people before!”","“I’m going to smash their faces into pieces!”","“Since they dared to disrespect Senior Brother Xuan Chen, they must be taught a lesson. A hard lesson! As new disciples, they should know what kind of attitude they should have toward senior brothers!”","There were many people who were adding fuel to the fire because they all knew that Xuan Chen was powerful and would not lose.","With Xuan Chen’s prestige among the Crimson Sunglow Sect’s new disciples and his status as the chief disciple, how could he be someone that a newcomer could afford to cross?","If Xuan Chen was to deal with a great enemy, then the current situation would probably be completely different.","It would probably be completely silent. Some people were saying some caring words to Xuan Chen. They were merely saying it. When it came to an actual fight, they would not help out.","Hundreds of people from the Crimson Sunglow Sect were walking to the side of the canyon, attracting the attention of some disciples of the Heavenly Evil Sect.","Very few people from the Authentic Martial Arts Sect saw it.","The Crimson Sunglow Sect had the largest number of people present. The Authentic Martial Arts Sect was second to it, and the Heavenly Evil Sect had the fewest people.","Under everyone’s gaze, Xuan Chen took the lead and flew quickly. It was obvious that he had something to deal with.","The other two sects also knew of Xuan Chen.","“What is he going to do?”","The group of people from the Heavenly Evil Sect approached.","“Daddy.”","Mengmeng tugged at Zhang Han’s hand and said, “They’re here.”","“Yeah. I see them.” Zhang Han smiled and said, “It’s just a group of contemptible scoundrels. Mengmeng, just wait and see. Since he wants to deal with you, he will find a way to put himself on the moral high ground and then make a move justly.”","“I see.”","Mengmeng nodded and blinked.","She was still dressed as a man. Zhang Han was not used to it at first, but since the little princess was happy to do so, he let her dress as she pleased.","“Zhang Hanyang, Yefeng.”","When Xuan Chen was a few dozen meters away, he stopped, his eyes calm.","“What’s the matter?” Zhang Han asked.","Hua Churan was stunned when she saw his posture.","“Why does he look like a completely different person from before?”","The scene quieted down.","Even Xuan Chen’s subordinates restrained themselves, wanting to add fuel to the fire and reprimand the two new disciples.","They needed to leave this kind of opening to Xuan Chen.","Some of them had playful expressions, some were indifferent, and some looked eager for a fight.","There was no doubt that they had already regarded Zhang Hanyang and Yefeng as pushovers.","Xuan Chen laughed, and his eyes gradually became sharp.","He suddenly shouted, “Zhang Hanyang, Yefeng, as disciples of Orchid Peak of the Crimson Sunglow Sect, do you admit your guilt?”","“What guilt?” Zhang Han suddenly smiled and looked at Mengmeng.","His eyes seemed to be saying, “What do you think? He began to perform.”","“You have committed a grave sin!”","Xuan Chen said in a cold voice, “Xu Hang is a good Junior Brother of mine. He led a team to explore this place as well as Hua Churan, Zhang Hanyang, Yefeng, and others. They found a secret realm. When they entered it, they were attacked by Demonic Vines. Junior Brother Xu Hang helped cover up for them. Zhang Hanyang and Yefeng accompanied him on both sides. Not only did they not help Xu Hang, but they also pushed him into the abyss. They murdered him for his wealth. Now, do you admit your guilt?”","Zhang Han and Mengmeng just stood there and quietly watched Xuan Chen’s acting. It was as if it had nothing to do with them.","Xuan Chen saw that the other party did not answer, so he sighed.","“Everyone knows Junior Brother Xu Hang’s character. He is not a selfless person. In fact, I thought that something did happen to him, but you were wrong. You are so wrong.","“You shouldn’t have taken out his Space Ring. He values his Space Ring the most. He would never give it to someone else unless he’s dead. But you took out the ring. Both of you got him killed. You got the captain who was protecting you killed.”","Everyone looked shocked after hearing this.","Some people wouldn’t listen to Xuan Chen’s one-sided statement, but something of what he said was still recognized.","Xu Hang would rather die than take out the ring. It could not be ruled out that he had been attacked at the most critical moment.","But did he have good intention when he recruited these disciples from the Orchid Peak?","Some people shook their heads secretly and said, “I’m afraid he wanted to trick them, but he was tricked instead. I think Zhang Hanyang and Yefeng are not easy to deal with.”","“Junior Sister Hua, let me ask you, was it the three of them that were at the very back? Xu Hang could have escaped, but an unknown accident occurred. Am I right?” Xuan Chen asked.","Hua Churan’s face stiffened slightly.","“Is it time for me to make a choice?”","She didn’t know whether she should take Zhang Hanyang’s side or Xuan Chen’s side. Xu Chen needed an excuse to make a move, and she could just provide this excuse.","She looked at Xuan Chen, the people around him, and the people from the Heavenly Evil Sect and the Authentic Martial Arts Sect in the distance.","Hua Churan was under a lot of pressure and a little confused.","Finally, she looked at Mengmeng, took a deep breath, and nodded heavily.","...","“That’s right. When I left, Senior Brother Xu Hang was not far away from the exit. He could have escaped. As for what happened in the secret realm, I don’t know.”","“That’s the truth. People’s hearts are unpredictable.” Xuan Chen shook his head and said, “Zhang Hanyang, the sect has treated you well. How dare you harm an indoor-disciple? What punishment do you think you deserve? Yefeng, you’ve just joined the sect, but you’ve already done such a disgraceful thing. Who are you?”","“Damn it!”","The lackeys around finally found an opportunity, and some of them cursed.","“How dare you kill Senior Brother Xu Hang? I’ll kill you both!”","“They’re the ones who got Xu Hang killed!”","“...”","Since Zhang Han and Mengmeng didn’t speak, everyone thought that they had been scared silly.","Xuan Chen waited for two minutes. Then, he slowly walked forward. His pace was not fast as he advanced step by step.","He liked to slowly exert pressure on his enemies in this way, and he could even appreciate the changes in their expressions.","He would love to see panic, fear, and despair on their faces.","...","He loved trampling on his enemies.","However, when he was halfway there, he was confused.","“Are these two poker-faced? There’s no expression on their faces.”","“Today, on behalf of the sect, I will take down these two people. If they resist, they will be severely punished without exception!”","Xuan Chen did not say that he would kill them without exception, but that he would punish them severely.","If he wanted the other party to resist, he couldn’t kill the words. In this way, if the other party resisted, he would be able to kill them without mercy.","Mengmeng suddenly said, “He’s so despicable!”","“Do you want to fight him?” Zhang Han asked.","“Yeah.”","“Go get him then.”","Zhang Han patted Mengmeng on the shoulder.","She stepped forward to greet Xuan Chen.","“They’re resisting me?","“Hahaha. Very nice!”","Xuan Chen was delighted, and a sinister smile appeared on his face. A three-foot-long Greenpeak Sword appeared in his right hand. “You asked for it!”","“Oh no! Xuan Chen wants to kill them!”","Quite a few people had a bad feeling about this. Perhaps if Xuan Chen fought them, he would either kill them or disable them.","But judging from Xuan Chen’s posture, he seemed to want to kill them with one strike.","Boom!","Suddenly, a loud noise was heard from a lawn in the center of the valley.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Everyone instantly looked over.","Xuan Chen also sped up.","Smack!","Another loud noise was heard.","However, this voice seemed to be coming from nearby.","Xuan Chen turned back to have a look.","“Senior Brother Xuan Chen!”","Swoosh!","A man was sent flying backward and spat out several mouthfuls of blood in midair.","Someone from the crowd who had sharp eyes could even see a few teeth.","Poof!","Xuan Chen was sent flying a thousand meters away, his face badly mutilated.","“What?!”","The people who saw it clearly turned pale with fright.","“Senior Brother Xuan Chen!”","“What did you do?!”","Xuan Chen’s lackeys, as well as Hua Churan and the others, were all stunned when they looked at Zhang Han and Mengmeng.","Mengmeng was also stunned.","“I didn’t use too much strength. How did I send him flying with one strike?”","She looked to the side and saw an arm retracting into her schoolbag.","“Dahei is really naughty.”","Mengmeng didn’t even get to see its move.","This meant that Xuan Chen had not only taken a slap from Mengmeng, but also a fierce punch from Dahei.","Xuan Chen hadn’t been beaten to death because he had some foundation.","“You’re really good at acting.”","Mengmeng looked ahead and snorted. “You’re such two-faced villains. If you want to deal with us, just say it. Enough with your absurd excuses. You’re just scumbags. Bah!”","“Oh my god!”","She said that in front of everyone.","“Wow! He’s so domineering!”","“Hahahaha.”","There was a burst of laughter from the disciples of the Heavenly Evil Sect, and many people began to kick up a fuss.","“The disciples of the Crimson Sunglow Sect have quite the character.”","“Incredible!”","The ridicule of the disciples of the Heavenly Evil Sect made many people angry and embarrassed.","They couldn’t figure out what had just happened.","However, since Zhang Hanyang could beat Xuan Chen to such a state, he was obviously not an ordinary man.","“You...”","Hua Churan stared at Mengmeng, a little stunned.","Zhang Hanyang’s attainments in pellet refining were not bad in Orchid Peak. He was thought highly of by others. But no one knew whether his strength was high or not.","“How dare you!”","There were still some high-position officials of the Crimson Sunglow Sect present.","The protectors didn’t bother with this matter earlier. After all, Xuan Chen was quite respected in the sect.","But now, it didn’t matter if Xuan Chen was beaten, but it would affect the reputation of the sect, so they couldn’t remain still.","Three protectors flew over at the same time.","They looked at Mengmeng with severe expressions.","“Men, capture these two and bring them to the sect’s law enforcement hall!”","Boom!","Just as they were about to make a move, something strange was happening within the valley.","In the central area, a dazzling white light suddenly burst out.","The light cluster was about ten meters high.","A black figure suddenly came out of the light cluster.","Swoosh!","The one in black looked around and immediately flew to the Heavenly Evil Sect’s station without hesitation.","Just five seconds after the black figure left.","Swoosh!","Another figure quickly appeared.","“Elder!”","Many from the Crimson Sunglow Sect shouted.","The old man who’d come out from the light cluster was the Third Elder of the Crimson Sunglow Sect, Taoist Heavenlight.","His face was a little gloomy at this time. He glanced around with his sharp eyes and finally fixed his eyes on the escaping one in black.","He let out a loud shout, “Hand over the things, or die!”","He quickly caught up with the black figure.","Swoosh!","Another figure appeared.","It was an elder of the Authentic Martial Arts Sect.","After he came out, he laughed out loud.","“Heavenlight, you’re truly shameless to fight over something with a junior!”","While speaking, he stretched out his right hand.","Buzz!","A giant palm print whistled forward.","A hint of anger appeared in Taoist Heavenlight’s eyes as he delivered a backhand blow with his sword.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","After their attacks collided, a gale howled.","The scene also quieted down.","Everyone watched as the one in black flew quickly toward the side of the jungle.","“Wusi, are you sure you want to stop me?”","Taoist Heavenlight’s voice was cold.","“I’m not trying to stop you. I just don’t want to see you bully a junior. I’m afraid that you’ll be disgraced.” Elder Wusi sighed softly with a beaming expression.","“Humph!”","Taoist Heavenlight snorted and looked at the black figure, then said coldly, “People of the Heavenly Evil Sect, you have one minute to send this person to me.”","The Heavenly Evil Sect’s Protector Xu, who was here, frowned and asked, “Elder Heavenlight, what do you mean by this?”","“She took something she shouldn’t have taken,” Taoist Heavenlight said coldly.","The big shots of the major sects were talking, and they were very hostile.","Many disciples could not help but be alarmed.","Even Xuan Chen did not dare to say anything. He would deal with Zhang Hanyang and Yefeng after the elders’ affairs were settled.","But no one had expected that at this moment, the disciple named Yefeng suddenly said, “Xue, come here.”"]},{"number":1433,"title":"Chapter 1433 A Hunt-down","paragraphs":["Chapter 1433 A Hunt-down","Crack!","When Mu Xue, who was flying in the air, heard this voice, she staggered and almost fell to the ground.","But then, her eyes were full of surprise.","“What?!","“Master?”","She hurriedly turned to look at the source of the voice.","She saw him.","He was standing at the edge of the jungle.","She hadn’t seen her master for a long time.","Mu Xue’s heart trembled a little.","“He’s still handsome and invincible!”","“Master!”","Mu Xue was so excited that she flew over at a faster speed.","Protector Xu of the Heavenly Evil Sect said, “Get over here!”","Judging from his look, it seemed that Mu Xue was one of the talented disciples of the sect. Although he is no match for Taoist Heavenlight, at least he had the power to speak to him. “If it doesn’t work, I can just run.”","“Senior Sister Mu Xue, come over here.”","“That old fox Heavenlight is about to catch up to you.”","To their surprise, Mu Xue completely ignored them and turned a deaf ear.","“Stop now!”","Taoist Heavenlight was getting rather angry.","He took out a fan from his pocket, unfolded it, and waved it. A ray of multicolored light flashed and covered Mu Xue in an instant, which slowed down her speed.","Mu Xue felt as if she had fallen into a mire, unable to move an inch.","Her expression changed slightly.","“Break!”","At this time, Zhang Han was no longer silent. With blue light flashing in his eyes, he broke the small Bounded Domain created by Taoist Heavenlight with his mental power in a violent way.","“Hmm?”","Elder Heavenlight narrowed his eyes slightly and looked at Zhang Han very sharply.","“Let’s go.”","Zhang Han held Mengmeng’s hand and walked forward.","Mu Xue rushed over even faster and stood beside them.","“Master!","“Master, you’re here!”","Mu Xue couldn’t stop smiling. Standing in front of Zhang Han, she looked like an obedient fangirl.","“Who is he?”","Mu Xue looked at Mengmeng and was a little surprised, but she could tell something between her eyebrows. She couldn’t help laughing and said, “You are so naughty.”","“You’re naughty,” Mengmeng retorted.","Hua Churan, Xuan Chen, and the others were all flabbergasted by what had just happened.","“What’s going on?”","“Who are you?” Taoist Heavenlight asked.","“Interesting.”","The elder from the Authentic Martial Arts Sect chuckled and retreated to the side, intending to watch the fun.","“Elder!”","Xuan Chen had finally found an opportunity to complain.","“Those two people are Zhang Hanyang and Yefeng, disciples of the Orchid Peak. They have got conspiratory intentions coming to the sect. They are extremely scheming and got Junior Brother Xuan Chen killed with a scheme. Just now, I tried to take them down, but they launched a sneak attack on me and hurt me. I never thought that my junior brothers could do such a sneak attack!”","He found an excuse for his injury and also spoke of Zhang Han and Mengmeng’s crime.","After he spoke, because of the return of the Third Elder, the people around Xuan Chen did not panic at all. They felt that it would not be adding fuel to the fire, but timely assistance. Therefore, they rushed to speak.","“Zhang Hanyang is extremely cruel and ruthless. If it weren’t for the fact that Senior Brother Xuan Chen is powerful, he would have been directly killed just now.”","“That’s right. Zhang Hanyang set up a trap and killed Senior Brother Xu Hang. He even launched a sneak attack on Senior Brother Xuan Chen in front of everyone and insulted our sect. We can’t let this guy stay alive!”","“The two of them have committed grave sins. If we don’t execute them directly, it won’t be enough to relieve the hatred in our hearts!”","“...”","Their words were full of emotion and reasoning.","However, the expression of the Third Elder, Taoist Heavenlight, did not change much.","He looked at the protectors of the Crimson Sunglow Sect and asked, “Is this true?”","“It’s... it’s true.” One of the protectors thought for a moment and felt that Xuan Chen’s words were correct.","...","“Orchid Peak’s disciples?”","The Third Elder raised his eyebrows slightly and said in a commanding tone, “Get over here.”","However, when he saw the way they looked at him as if they were looking at a fool, his face darkened.","He said, “As disciples of the Crimson Sunglow Sect, you have done such an odious thing. Now, I declare that Zhang Hanyang and Yefeng, two disciples of the Orchid Peak, should be put to death.”","“Mu Xue, come back!”","Protector Hua of the Heavenly Evil Sect spoke again.","Mu Xue turned her head and said playfully, “Protector Xu, I’m not going back. I’m with my master now.”","She wasn’t worried in the slightest. Taoist Heavenlight, the Third Elder of the Crimson Sunglow Sect, or any elder of the Authentic Martial Arts Sect would fail. Her honored master was a great devil, and he was invincible.","However, the great devil was currently pondering on how to escape unscathed.","“Should we flee now?”","“Did you get a lot of things from the secret realm?” Zhang Han asked.","...","“Yes. There are so many of them!” Mu Xue was in high spirits. “Almost all of them are spiritual herbs. Some of them are particularly high-quality. There are more than 500 sixth-tier ones, and more than a dozen of them are of higher grades than the sixth-tier ones. There are two in particular whose auras are particularly powerful. I couldn’t get them. It took me three days to find an opportunity to pull them out. That old man found it and chased after me relentlessly. In the end, I still managed to escape.”","“Mu Xue! You’re a disciple of the Heavenly Evil Sect. How could you take a disciple of another sect as your master?” Protector Hua’s face darkened.","“It’s my pleasure.” Mu Xue did not show him any respect and directly retorted.","Protector Xu was so angry that his face turned livid.","“Did you hear that? She has nothing to do with you now. Does the Heavenly Evil Sect still want to get involved in this?”","Taoist Heavenlight revealed a hint of a cold smile.","He didn’t expect that the female disciple of the Heavenly Evil Sect would play along so well. This was just what he wanted. If he took action directly, people would inevitably gossip about it.","There were quite a few people from the Heavenly Evil Sect who could suppress Taoist Heavenlight.","“Hahaha.”","Taoist Heavenlight moved and rushed to Zhang Han.","“Elder Heavenlight, be careful! They’re very good at plotting!” Xuan Chen shouted.","It wasn’t that he was afraid that Elder Heavenlight would be injured, but that he wanted the other party to die for sure.","The pain on his face didn’t matter to him, but the pain in his heart caused him to hate them for real.","“They slapped me in the face in public. They caused me to lose my prestige!”","“He’s made his move!”","“Elder Heavenlight is going to kill them!”","Countless disciples of the Crimson Sunglow Sect were shocked, and the discussions gradually died down. Many of them even held their breath and watched the scene attentively.","Protector Xu of the Heavenly Evil Sect shouted at Mu Xue with a cold face, “Come back now!”","He was even prepared to take on Taoist Heavenlight’s rage.","However, Mu Xue turned her head and cupped her hands.","“Elder Xu, thank you for your kindness, but I have to follow my master.”","Elder Xu was so angry that his body began to tremble. “Uneducable! What an uneducable disciple!”","Even if he glared at her, it was in vain.","She had given up the sect’s protection, and Taoist Heavenlight was taking advantage of this. He had every reason to catch her. Even if he killed Mu Xue, the Heavenly Evil Sect would not be able to oppose it.","On the side of the Authentic Martial Arts Sect, a few people shook their heads when they saw this.","“It seems those three people are going to die.”","“Unfortunately, I’ve also heard a little about Mu Xue’s fame. She’s also one of the talents, but now she’s going to die during her cultivation.”","“Why can’t they just forbear? In the Cultivation World, the law of the jungle prevails. They could have relied on the Heavenly Evil Sect for the time being, and they wouldn’t end up dead.”","In the midst of many discussions, Taoist Heavenlight, like a stream of light, rushed to Zhang Han.","Zhang Han, however, only took five steps forward.","He quietly stared at Taoist Heavenlight, who was in front of him.","“Die!”","Behind Taoist Heavenlight, a faint shadow of a long sword suddenly condensed, accompanying his figure.","His supernatural power and his secret occult art came one after another.","His supernatural power displayed great power. After all, he was an Integration Realm expert. When he made a move, heaven and earth would change dramatically.","As for his offensive occult art, it seemed to have turned into a sharp thorn, attached to his right arm, and swooped down straight.","“So powerful!”","Protector Xu of the Heavenly Evil Sect slightly changed his face.","It was as if he could foresee what would happen next: the three of them would be killed in one move, their flesh and blood flying in all directions. He couldn’t bear to watch, so he closed his eyes.","A second, two seconds, and three seconds later.","Bang!","A dull sound echoed across the entire valley.","All of the disciples’ hearts trembled.","“It’s over.","“Alas!”","Protector Hua let out a long sigh in his heart. He had been still quite optimistic about Mu Xue.","“What a pity.”","“Poof!”","However, what he heard next made Protector Xu quite confused.","There were many exclamations of horror around.","“Wh...what?!”","“Impossible. How is this possible?!”","“He sent Taoist Heavenlight flying with a single punch?”","“How did he do it?”","“Hmm?”","Protector Hua was directly stunned.","“What’s going on?”","He opened his eyes. When he saw the scene clearly, his pupils contracted rapidly.","Taoist Heavenlight’s body was bent like a shrimp. Like a stream of light, he flew backward for thousands of meters.","Even Protector Xu saw the confusion on Taoist Heavenlight’s face,","“What’s happening?”","He hurriedly asked the people next to him.","Someone answered, “Protector Xu, Taoist Heavenlight flew over, and then his attack was absorbed by that man. No, it’s on his body. He actually sent Taoist Heavenlight flying. This man is so terrifying!”","In fact, this was the case.","After Taoist Heavenlight was sent flying for a while, Zhang Han waved his sleeve and glanced at the people of the Crimson Sunglow Sect with calm eyes.","He said, “The Third Elder of the Crimson Sunglow Sect is just so-so.”","Smack!","His words were like a public slap in the face to the Crimson Sunglow Sect.","Taoist Heavenlight felt that this was a form of humiliation.","“You’re courting death!”","An angry roar rang out in the distance.","Taoist Heavenlight was enraged.","He moved even faster, as fast as lightning.","But at this time, Zhang Han, however, walked back with Mengmeng and Mu Xue.","“Let’s go.”","Clatter!","Zhang Han took out a handful of dead leaves with his right hand and flipped them up.","It was as if leaves were falling all over the sky.","The three were covered by the leaves. After the leaves fell, they disappeared.","“Shadow Displacement Transposition!”","Taoist Heavenlight’s gaze was cold and sinister. “He’s already set up a formation?”","He glanced around and suddenly, his gaze froze in the distance, only to see a stream of light quickly disappearing in the jungle.","“They try to run?","“Hahahaha.”","Taoist Heavenlight was so angry that he laughed.","“Crimson Sunglow Sect disciples, listen up!","“Everyone, go and hunt down Zhang Hanyang, Yefeng, and Mu Xue! If you meet them, kill them all!”","“Yes, Third Elder!” Xuan Chen’s voice was extremely loud.","The Crimson Sunglow Sect’s protectors and chief supervisors all began to contact the teams nearby and gave out a mission.","“Arrest Zhang Hanyang and Yefeng, the disciples of Orchid Peak, and Mu Xue, the disciple of the Heavenly Evil Sect. If they don’t cooperate, you can kill them.”","Just like that, a huge hunt-down was about to begin.","“They, they actually escaped?”","Protector Xu of the Heavenly Evil Sect had a strange look on his face. “I didn’t expect that Mu Xue’s master was so powerful.”","“Protector Xu, shall we...?” one of his subordinates asked with hesitation.","“Forget it.” Protector Xu shook his head and said, “Since Mu Xue has made her choice, just let her go. Tell others not to discuss this matter randomly. Mu Xue’s master is not a disciple of the Crimson Sunglow Sect..."]},{"number":1434,"title":"Chapter 1434 Is This a Joke?","paragraphs":["Chapter 1434 Is This a Joke?","The Heavenly Evil Sect could not interfere in this matter.","Protector Xu was only a protector. Whether in terms of strength or status, he was far inferior to the Crimson Sunglow Sect’s Elder Heavenlight.","In this place, the elder of the Authentic Martial Arts Sect could fight against Elder Heavenlight head-on, but the number of people from the Heavenly Evil Sect was too few.","Without the right to speak, they could only watch.","“Kill them!”","Xuan Chen shouted coldly, and his voice shook the area for more than 10km.","However, before he could finish his words, he found that the three people ahead of him had disappeared into the jungle.","Boom!","Taoist Heavenlight instantly broke through the ten-fold sound barrier, charging forward at high speed.","“Where do you think you are going?”","He could see the three people in front of him from a distance.","“I’m close!","“I’m even closer!","“As long as I catch them, they will suffer a fate worse than death.”","In just three minutes, Taoist Heavenlight was only 800 meters away from the three.","At this moment, the three of them stopped. Zhang Han suddenly turned around and looked at Taoist Heavenlight indifferently.","“Who do you think you can catch with your meager skills?”","Taoist Heavenlight’s face changed slightly as he heard this mocking remark.","Clatter!","The three turned into withered leaves, which drifted away with the wind.","“What’s that?”","Taoist Heavenlight’s pupils contracted.","“An escaping skill that even I can’t see through?”","“Hahahaha.”","In the back, the elder from the Authentic Martial Arts Sect laughed heartily. “Interesting, interesting. Being toyed with like this, old thief Heavenlight, to think that you’d end up like this!”","“You!”","Taoist Heavenlight was furious, and even his eyes were slightly red.","If it were a nobody mocking him, he would’ve killed him with a wave of his hand.","However, the other party was someone with real status and strength. They were on equal footing. He mocked him, which made him quite upset and really angry.","He had indeed been toyed with.","If he had known earlier, he would not have been able to chase after them so easily.","“Crimson Sunglow Sect disciples, listen up! Use all of your energy immediately! We must find the three of them, even if we have to dig three feet underground in this Wind-Witches Evilland!”","Hence, the second order was given.","They no longer treated the great secret realm as an important matter and turned to hunt people down instead.","In this regard, the disciples of the Authentic Martial Arts Sect and the Heavenly Evil Sect watched a wonderful show.","It was great news that the Third Elder of the Crimson Sunglow Sect had suffered a loss.","In a small-scale secret realm.","The sky was bright and clear. This was a plain. The area of the secret realm was not large, and it was not very dangerous.","“Master, how did you know that there would be a secret realm here?” Mu Xue asked curiously.","“On the way here, I discovered 12 secret realms. Judging from the energy level, it is the weakest here. There are no treasures or danger,” Zhang Han replied.","“Daddy, you’re amazing,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","After that, Zhang Han took a long breath, took out three medicinal pellets, and swallowed them all at once.","Swoosh!","Mengmeng and Mu Xue’s countenance changed slightly.","“Daddy, what’s going on with you?” Mengmeng’s shining eyes widened.","“Master.”","Mu Xue’s face was grave because Zhang Han had taken three top-grade sixth-tier medicinal pellets.","What kind of injury would require him to take three pellets at once?","She and Mengmeng were not rookies in cultivation. Even though they were at the entry level, they still knew about these things.","The wind was blowing gently, and the sun was shining on their bodies, which was warm. However, especially Mengmeng, they were having bad feelings.","Zhang Han didn’t answer them, but closed his eyes and frowned.","After all, the Third Elder, Taoist Heavenlight, was a master in the Integration Realm.","Zhang Han used all his strength and planned for a long time before he sent him flying with a punch.","With his current state, he could not completely control the Immortal Body of the Five Elements. There were too many restrictions on him.","...","“Dad.”","Fortunately, Mengmeng was by his side. Otherwise, Zhang Han would have been lying on the chair again.","After more than ten seconds, Zhang Han opened his eyes, exhaled, and said with a smile, “I’m fine. It’s just a small problem. I’m all right now.”","Zhang Han patted himself on the chest while speaking.","“Ow! Ow! Ow!”","Dahei stuck its head out of Mengmeng’s schoolbag and said bluntly, “I can smell it. My host is not in good health now, and his soul is injured.”","In some aspects, Dahei was also sensitive.","“What? Your soul is injured?” Mengmeng pursed her lips and almost cried. She said with distress, “Dad, what’s going on with you? Tell me.”","“I’m really fine. See? I’m all right.” Zhang Han said with a smile, “Well, don’t think too much about this. We can leave after a short rest here.”","“No!” Mengmeng looked at Zhang Han stubbornly and said, “You have to tell me. I have grown up now.”","Zhang Han sighed in his heart.","...","He didn’t want to say it, but it seemed that he couldn’t retort Mengmeng.","“Master, you have to tell us what’s going on. Well... Master, look at these,” Mu Xue said while running her power a bit.","Thousands of spiritual herbs appeared. She said, “These are the spiritual herbs I got before, as well as the ones I obtained from the secret realm just now.”","“Eh?”","Zhang Han made a sound of surprise.","“You have eighth-tier Nether Dragon Leaves and eighth-tier Crystal Demon Essence?”","These two kinds of eighth-tier spiritual herbs were pretty good, and she had more than a dozen kinds of seventh-tier spiritual herbs.","He also understood why Elder Heavenlight was going after them. In the end, he had taken a fancy to the spiritual herbs.","“These are... not bad. These are of great use to me.”","There were 16 kinds of spiritual herbs in total, 13 of which could be used by Zhang Han to refine the ninth-stage Soul Fixing Pellets.","“I also have a lot here.”","Mengmeng took out hundreds of kinds of spiritual herbs at a time, which were not as many as Mu Xue’s. It was because Mu Xue didn’t know how to refine pellets. She would save up all the spiritual herbs she got. Mengmeng consumed a lot of them when she refined pellets.","“I’ll take them first. Many of them are quite useful. Wonderful.”","Zhang Han took the spiritual herbs with a smile, thought for a moment, and said, “As I said before, I was attacked in the Devil Palace. At that time, my soul was injured, and I slept for ten months. It’s not a big problem. Don’t worry. Mengmeng, give me some crystal stones, and I’ll need to use them later.”","Originally, he also had crystal stones, but he tried to distract Mengmeng’s attention. In addition, what she had was almost all top-grade crystal stones.","“Okay.”","Mengmeng pouted, hollowed out her Space Ring, and took out all the crystal stones.","“Mengmeng, you’re so rich!” Mu Xue covered her eyes and said, “I’m about to be blinded by the light.”","“I don’t need that many.” Zhang Han couldn’t help laughing.","“Oh, take them all. What’s mine is yours, isn’t it?” Mengmeng snorted.","“These are enough.”","Zhang Han took about one-third and said, “Little rich lady, put them away. After we have a good rest, we are going to escape.”","“This is the first time we’ve fled.” Mu Xue was a little excited. “I’m so excited.”","Zhang Han was speechless.","He had only said that, and she had taken it seriously.","“Does she really think that these nobodies of the Crimson Sunglow Sect can capture me?”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly.","“Daddy, you have to take good care of yourself. Only in this way can you take good care of Mummy and me,” Mengmeng said seriously.","“Got it, wicked girl. Now you’re even meddling in my business.” Zhang Han touched Mengmeng’s head.","“I have to. I’m so worried about you.”","“...”","Seeing Zhang Han and Mengmeng chatting, Mu Xue smiled from time to time on the side.","Although adventuring in a place unknown was risky and exciting, she still liked to watch her master’s family quietly.","“It’s just that Ma’am isn’t here yet.”","“Master, where is Ma’am?”","“She’s somewhere quite far away. I’ll pick her up after I’ve settled you in.”","As they chatted, they moved forward.","There was no danger at all, but they found a few third-tier and fourth-tier spiritual herbs.","“This is the exit. After we get out, we’ll flee to the Ling Sea Sword Sect and take a spaceship to the Vast Wood Star.”","Zhang Han told them the route.","They were all ready to go.","After leaving the secret region, they appeared in the Wind-Witches Evilland.","There would occasionally be some gales here. It just so happened that when they came out, a gale whistled by.","After finding the right direction, the three walked within the jungle.","From time to time, they could see teams from the Crimson Sunglow Sect.","Without exception, what these people said was roughly the same.","“If we can catch those three, we will be rewarded with 300,000 crystal stones. 100,000 on each person!”","“The key is that there will be even 500 points, which can be exchanged for many sect occult arts.”","“We must catch them and kill them. How simple is that? After discovering them, I’ll just do this, that, that, that, ambush them, and then collect the rewards!”","“...”","Many people were fantasizing that they had won the rewards.","“It’s said that Yefeng is very powerful. He exchanged a blow with the Third Elder and was not at a disadvantage.”","“That’s impossible. If he could defeat the Third Elder, he wouldn’t run away. The elder was just caught off guard. But even so, we won’t be able to defeat Yefeng. We’ll also get a lot of rewards when we find him and report the news.”","“Some people say that Yefeng only used a magic treasure, so his real strength is not very high. I guess he was seriously injured by the Third Elder’s attack.”","Gradually, they could see the teams more and more frequently.","“Dad, look out. There’s also a group of people over there.”","“Master, there are too many people from the Crimson Sunglow Sect.”","Hearing the words of the two, Zhang Han stopped.","He nodded. “It is indeed a waste of time. The Crimson Glow Sect really does think highly of themselves.”","“They have a large number of people,” Mu Xue reminded him. “If we are discovered, we will soon be besieged. The Crimson Glow Sect has the most people among the Four Great Sects.”","If it were in the past, Mu Xue would never have said that.","But now that her master was injured, she had to have more scruples somehow.","However, she couldn’t imagine how many stunning means Zhang Han had.","“Since they want to hunt us down, let’s teach them a lesson!”","Zhang Han smiled faintly.","Now that he had returned to his peak state, he did not intend to keep escaping.","Not far away from a pool, a team of more than 30 people was patrolling quickly.","“You guys are looking for me?”","A man sat cross-legged by the pool and waved to those people.","“He’s here!”","“Notify the Elder now!”","“Elder, we’ve found Yefeng. The coordinates of the target have been sent.”","“Let’s surround him first. Be careful.”","These people were surrounding him from a distance, but Zhang Han suddenly spat out a few mouthfuls of blood, and his breath was weak.","“Hahaha, this is great. He can’t hold on.”","They were getting closer and closer.","When they were within a hundred meters from him-","Clatter!","Under their gazes, Zhang Han suddenly turned into a cloud of blood light and covered them.","The light slowly faded, and so did these people. They had disappeared without a trace.","In another place.","A team of people had been walking. They suddenly saw an unusually fierce fog coming, and then they were killed.","At the same time.","Taoist Heavenlight was on-site at the center of the squads.","His communication device suddenly rang.","Beep! Beep! Beep!","The dense sounds made him frown slightly.","After he turned on the device, he heard a series of messages from more than a dozen different teams.","“Reporting to Elder, we’ve found Yefeng!”","“Elder, we’ve found Zhang Hanyang. The coordinates have been sent.”","“We’ve discovered the targets...”","“Damn it!”","The Third Elder’s face turned pale. He was furious.","“They sent out coordinates from more than a dozen places at the same time. Is this a joke?”","However, what happened next caused his expression to change drastically.","“The communication devices of the team led by Hao Wu, the disciple of Sword Edge, are all broken. It is suspected that their team has been annihilated.”","“The Command Beast Peak disciples...”","A series of teams had been suspected to be annihilated.","This caused Taoist Heavenlight to be enraged.","It was simply stunning."]},{"number":1435,"title":"Chapter 1435 Scared out of Their Wits","paragraphs":["Chapter 1435 Scared out of Their Wits","“Dammit!”","Taoist Heavenlight was not angry that hundreds of his men had died. Instead, he was mad because Zhang Han and the others were provoking him.","“Listen up. Pass down the order. Inform everyone to gather their squads and form teams of a thousand people. Those fleeing ones must be found, and the rewards will be doubled!”","What Taoist Heavenlight said caused all of his subordinates to be intrigued. The last part of his words was echoing in their minds. “The rewards will be doubled.”","“Wow, not bad.”","Although they were intrigued, they still had to do what they were told.","After the order was given, the squads began to assemble.","There were more than three hundred thousand disciples from the Crimson Sunglow Sect with more than three hundred teams in total running amok in this place.","But after all, they had encountered a troublesome situation.","“Hahahaha!”","“Are you from the Crimson Sunglow Sect? Who are you looking for?”","“I’ve heard that a traitor has appeared amongst the disciples of the Crimson Sunglow Sect and that even the Third Elder has been sent flying. Amazing, this is the Crimson Sunglow Sect’s style alright.”","These were mockeries from the Authentic Martial Arts Sect.","In still some other places.","“Xuan Chen from the Crimson Sunglow Sect? Who do you think you are? Scram! This is the Ling Sea Sword Sect’s territory!”","When the Heavenly Evil Sect’s main force passed by, they asked, “Are you sure that you want us to take a detour?”","It seemed that a fight was about to break out at any moment.","When the Crimson Sunglow Sect’s teams thought of the fact that disciples of the Heavenly Evil Sect were cold-blooded and good at fighting, they compromised.","The search didn’t go well, but the situation was getting worse.","Mengmeng showed up and shouted, “I’m here. Come and catch me if you can!”","“Chase after him!”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The thousand-man squad quickly gave chase.","When Mengmeng ran to a mountain forest, her figure suddenly disappeared.","“A secret realm!”","“I’ve found a secret realm. Zhang Hanyang must have escaped to it.”","“Go in and catch him!”","“Would there be an ambush?”","“There are only three of them. How are they going to ambush us?”","“Let’s enter the secret realm!”","After the thousand-man team entered the secret realm, Zhang Han and the other two appeared at the entrance. He took out a black gem and performed a formation.","“Explode!”","The entrance was bombarded.","They continued forward. After they walked for more than ten miles-","“Explode!”","The exit was bombarded as well.","Without the entrance and exit, the secret realm would disappear from this world. The spiritual Qi there would gradually dry up, and once the resources were exhausted, it would become a Deadland. There would be nothing left but a few more skeletons.","Just like that, the three of them advanced in the direction of the Ling Sea Sword Sect while launching an ambush and killing enemies.","Mu Xue was completely stunned.","Her master hadn’t deployed the slightest bit of battle strength but had used all sorts of methods to destroy the Crimson Sunglow Sect in pursuit.","“He’s just too formidable.”","Gradually, the Heavenly Evil Sect, the Authentic Martial Arts Sect, and the Ling Sea Sword Sect all noticed that something was wrong.","“Who’s that person?”","“He’s Zhang Hanyang from the Crimson Sunglow Sect, also known as Yefeng. His companion is Mu Xue from the Heavenly Evil Sect. But the main attacker is Yefeng. He has hidden his strength very well and is very skilled.”","“The Crimson Sunglow Sect has been disgraced terribly here!”","Some people had been watching the fun.","As for Elder Heavenlight, he cared a lot about his prestige.","When he learned of the news one after another, he was completely stunned.","“Team 1 is out of contact.”","“Team 13 is out of contact.”","“Team 158 is out of contact.”","“Team 36 is out of contact.”","“Team...”","58 teams were out of contact in three days.","...","“Nearly sixty thousand people are out of reach. Did they just vanish into thin air?","“Oh, how is that possible? I don’t even need to think to know that these people are doomed!","“What should I do? Should I withdraw the troops?”","Elder Heavenlight was very conflicted. He still had a trace of hope that if he could find Zhang Han and the other two and kill them in front of the Four Great Sects, he would be able to regain some respect.","As such, he remained silent and did not give any further orders.","As a result, the hearts of the teams in the search sank.","Among Xuan Chen’s team-","“Senior Brother, 58 teams are now out of reach.”","“I, I know that.” Xuan Chen’s face was slightly pale, and he still had a lingering fear. He was scared.","“They’re simply too terrifying. Did I manage to dodge a bullet at that time?”","But he was also quite upset.","...","“Did they not kill me just because they look down on me?”","“Senior brother, I wonder which team will be out of touch right away.”","“He’s a devil. He’s just a devil. The thousand-man squads can’t catch him at all, and we might even get killed. If we keep searching him, we would be simply asking for him to kill us.”","“Brother Chen, I don’t know what the Elder is thinking, but he doesn’t care the slightest about our safety. I don’t want to continue searching. There’s no hope at all.”","“Senior Brother, let’s stop. What if we bump into them? You’ve offended them before.”","His core subordinates’ words caused Xuan Chen to feel a bit of embarrassment.","But his reputation obviously mattered to him more than his life.","“Get lost!","“All of you, get lost!","“What’s the use of saying that to me? Go talk to the Elder about it if you can!","“The search continues.”","Xuan Chen’s expression was cold.","However, it terrified many people, causing the team to fall silent while their minds simply reached a miserable state.","Some of them even started to be displeased with Xuan Chen because it was a matter of life and death for everyone.","However, things would always change.","Just as the team continued to advance, Xuan Chen gave another order.","“Where are you going? Go back and search! I suspect that they are behind us. Backtrack now.”","“What...?”","“Senior Brother, you’re awesome!”","The subordinates of Xuan Chen immediately laughed.","“Yeah. Let’s go back and search. It’s not against the rules to backtrack.”","The whole team was relaxed.","There were even some junior sisters who offered to play a tune.","Xuan Chen did not forget to woo Hua Churan and said with concern, “Junior Sister Hua, you will be safe with me. Don’t worry.”","However, in the melody-","“Where are you going?”","A faint voice resounded throughout the entire forest.","They looked up and saw three figures standing on an old tree in front of them.","“AH!”","Xuan Chen exclaimed with shock.","More than a thousand people’s hearts were beating fast in extreme fear.","“Run now!”","The team had long been scared out of their wits. They didn’t want to fight anymore. They wished they had eight legs to escape.","However, after they looked around, they found that other than this forest, the rest of the place was completely dark.","Clatter!","Xuan Chen’s heart seemed to skip a beat.","“Please spare me!”","Xuan Chen, who was normally very natural and unrestrained, was the first to beg for mercy.","Following that, the others began to beg one after another. There were even people who started to cry with snot and tears.","“If you want to live, you can.”","Zhang Han said indifferently, “I’ve kept the names of two of you in mind. Xuan Chen and Hua Churan. Xuan Chen has evil intentions and once asked Xu Hang to try to kill me and my daughter. Therefore, I’ll give your team a chance.”","“What chance would it be?” Xuan Chen was first filled with despair, then hope.","“First of all, if you kill Xuan Chen first, I’ll let you live,” Zhang Han said.","Swoosh!","The scene quieted down.","Xuan Chen was horrified. He flashed forward for dozens of meters, looking around vigilantly. He was so nervous that he was almost suffocated. The cold sweat on his forehead could not be stopped flowing.","“Senior Brother, be careful. Don’t fall into his trap.”","Several of his core subordinates hurried to protect him.","“Don’t come over!”","Xuan Chen almost shouted these words out, but he thought that he would surely be killed by Yefeng alone. With his several subordinates assisting him, he could resist the attack for a while. His strength was the highest among his team, so he might have a chance to survive. He just needed to prevent others from approaching.","“You only have ten seconds.”","Zhang Han began his countdown.","Xuan Chen’s subordinates looked at the crowd that was ready to move and shouted, “Don’t come any closer!”","Seeing how loyal they were, Xuan Chen relaxed slightly. He constantly thought about how to get a chance to survive.","However, in the next second, a voice sounded in his ear.","“Senior Brother, for the sake of everyone’s survival, you can just die in peace.”","Poof!","A long sword pierced through his chest.","Xuan Chen turned around and found that it was the one who was the best at assassination among his men.","“You!”","Xuan Chen’s eyes almost split apart from rage.","Poof!","It was another strike.","Another subordinate of his shouted, “Senior Brother. We want to live. This is one life for 999 lives. You should offer yourself up!”","Poof!","Poof!","The six men beside Xuan Chen all took action.","“He’s dead! He’s dead! You said you’d spare us.” Some seemed to have gone mad.","Under enormous pressure, they were about to go crazy.","“You still need to deal with Hua Churan.” Zhang Han turned to look at the girl.","When Hua Churan’s face turned pale, Mengmeng said in a low voice, “Daddy, for the sake of how hard she tried to pursue me, just spare her.”","“Okay.”","Zhang Han nodded and said, “I’ve said that I would give you a chance to live. Here it is.”","After that, the three of them turned around and left.","The scene was deathly silent. The crowd had just survived a disaster.","“Guys!","“All of you!","“You didn’t complete the mission.","“Only by killing Xuan Chen can we survive. The six of us have taken action. As for the others, each of you must give him a strike. Whoever doesn’t do it will die!”","Xuan Chen’s six subordinates were also afraid that they would be in a bad situation if the news got out after they left.","However, the rest of the crowd would associate with their evil deeds if everyone attacked Xuan Chen, they would get to prevent such a situation from occurring.","Apart from Xuan Chen, there were nine hundred and ninety-nine people left among the thousand.","It could be said that he had been cut into pieces.","However, after everyone gave him a strike, they suddenly discovered that it was still pitch-black around.","“AHHH! He lied to us!”","“He would not let us off.”","“Wait! He said he would give us a chance to live. Does he mean that we need to find it by ourselves?”","“There’s still a chance!”","It was indeed a chance to survive.","After Zhang Han cast the illusory formation, Xuan Chen and the others entered the secret realm directly.","Zhang Han had hidden the exit of this secret realm very well.","But he also told Hua Churan about it.","However, he also instructed her that only ten people could leave the secret realm.","After the ten people left, the energy of the formation would burst out and blow up everything.","However, Hua Churan remained silent in the crowd. She didn’t take the opportunity to leave alone until she assembled a squad to search for the exit.","“Everyone has their own selfish motives.","“There’s nothing wrong with what she chose to do.","“Let’s go.”","Then, Zhang Han took Mengmeng and Mu Xue out of the secret realm.","During this period, Mu Xue looked at Zhang Han with worship and admiration.","Her master was usually so easy-going, but now he was as sharp as a blade.","He didn’t usually act this way, but once he played tricks, the consequences were too terrifying.","They dealt with the Crimson Sunglow Sect’s teams as they advanced.","Until more than 80 teams were lost, Taoist Heavenlight’s heart was filled with terror.","“What sort of enemy is he?","“How did he do it?","“How could a human being be so powerful?”","On this day, Taoist Heavenlight was helpless.","In fact, many teams had already set foot on the return journey, and some of them were even standing still, extremely alert to their surroundings.","They were nearly taking the grass and woods around as their enemies. The sound of the wind scared the shit out of them.","But after all, some disciples, the ten people led by Hua Churan, were still alive and brought back the news.","“He’s a devil!","“He summoned an evil place. No one could get out of it. We found a slim chance of survival in the desperate situation.","“Only the ten of us made it alive.","“We can’t go after him. If we keep searching, everyone will die!”","Unknowingly, the name Yefeng had become a synonym for terror."]},{"number":1436,"title":"Chapter 1436 A Fight Through the Air","paragraphs":["Chapter 1436 A Fight Through the Air","When it was dusk that day, a piece of news was sent to the Crimson Sunglow Sect.","According to the disciples of the Heavenly Evil Sect, Zhang Hanyang had shown up and was talking to Elder Heavenlight through the air.","Of course, the man called Zhang Hanyang people were referring to was not Zhang Han, but Mengmeng.","She flew in the air, disguised as a man, and looked ahead with a faint look.","“Taoist Heavenlight, don’t you want to hunt us down? We will arrive at Illustrious Peak in a day. Do you dare to come?”","When it got to this point, the signal of the intelligent communication was intermittent.","But the message could still reach the other party.","When Elder Heavenlight learned of this, he was so angry that his face paled.","“The news is delivered by the Heavenly Evil Sect. This is way out of the line!”","“Now that you’ve escaped from the Wind-Witches Evilland, I’ll post a reward to arrest you on the Vast Heaven Star. Even if you manage to escape, the entire Astral World will be searching for you. You’ll remain as fugitives for the rest of your lives!”","Taoist Heavenlight expressed his stance with hatred.","After the message was transmitted to Zhang Han and the others.","“Uh, Mu Xue, why don’t you just call them?” A disciple from the Heavenly Evil Sect suggested.","Their team happened to run into Zhang Han and his fellows.","They had also heard of Yefeng, who was powerful.","They were happy to see the Crimson Sunglow Sect suffer a setback, and were also happy to watch the show.","Therefore, that disciple made such a suggestion.","Mu Xue did not respond. She just glanced at Zhang Han.","“Okay.”","Zhang Han nodded.","“Start the communication.”","“The call has been connected.”","Zhang Han’s virtual shadow appeared on Taoist Heavenlight’s side, while Taoist Heavenlight’s virtual shadow appeared in Zhang Han’s place.","They looked at each other through the air.","Taoist Heavenlight’s heart was filled with rage.","“What are you staring at?”","With Zhang Han around, Mengmeng was full of confidence. Thinking of the conversation just now, she snorted and said, “Old bastard Heavenlight, since you aren’t powerful enough, stop asking your disciples to go to get themselves killed. What you’re doing will get you to no end.”","“What did you say?!”","Taoist Heavenlight had many disciples by his side.","Upon hearing Mengmeng’s words, many people actually revealed expressions of approval.","Soldiers were meant to fight against soldiers. It was obvious that the other party was not someone that the disciples could deal with. If Taoist Heavenlight had them brace themselves to deal with Zhang Han, they would be courting death.","“Hahaha.”","Taoist Heavenlight was so angry that he began to laugh. “Excellent. You’ve successfully angered me.”","“Bah! Shame on you. You’re taking advantage of your power to bully us,” Mu Xue sneered and said.","“Now that things have reached this state, there’s no point in saying more. I’ve been defeating powerful enemies all my life, so why would I be afraid of you brats?” Taoist Heavenlight said, “If you are confident enough in your strength, you can challenge me to a battle.”","“There’s no need for that.”","At this time, Zhang Han said, “We will arrive at Illustrious Peak in half a day. It will take us one day to leave from the northeast of the peak, cross the fifth war zone, and leave from the Ling Sea Sword Sect to the Vast Wood Star.”","He used his calm words to describe his true plan.","This was the route Zhang Han had planned to take. He said it directly in front of everyone. He was not afraid of being chased by Taoist Heavenlight.","His attitude of contempt was presented by his words.","Taoist Heavenlight chuckled. “Do you think you can bewitch me by just naming a random place?”","“Hahahaha.”","Zhang Han suddenly burst out laughing.","He cut off the communication.","Swoosh!","Taoist Heavenlight’s face instantly became incomparably gloomy.","“Elder, is he trying to lure us? He actually wants to escape from a different place.”","“I think so. He just named a place that is away from him. He is afraid that Elder would find him, so he came up with such a bad idea.”","“Elder, do we need to go there?”","“...”","On Zhang Han’s side.","They were moving forward at a high speed, taking a flying shuttle that they had snatched.","“Daddy, do you think that old bastard Heavenlight will come?” Mengmeng asked in a curious tone.","“I don’t know,” Zhang Han smiled and said.","...","“It’s likely that there’s a 50% chance that he will come over,” Mu Xue said. “Whether he comes or not, he has no other choice.”","“But I think there’s a 70% chance that he’ll come and have a look,” Zhang Han said.","“If he does come over, should we...” Mu Xue was stunned.","...","On Taoist Heavenlight’s side.","Taoist Heavenlight waited for two hours before leaving from the side of the squad. He had been planning to leave in secret.","However, one of the protectors shouted, “Elder, Elder, where are you going?”","Another chief supervisor called out, “First Elder, if you need anything, just tell us!”","More and more people began to speak, which made Taoist Tianhua’s eyelids tremble slightly. “You’ll go to the great secret realm first. I need to take a trip to deal with something.”","As for where he would go, it was self-evident.","It was not until Taoist Heavenlight disappeared into the distance that several protectors and supervisors looked at each other.","...","“Let’s go to the Illustrious Peak as well.”","“We’ll be there in a day. According to what Zhang Hanyang and the others said before, we should have about half a day to find them.”","“It’s not mainly about finding them but preventing the Elder from being trapped.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The group of people set off one after another and quickly rushed to Illustrious Peak.","At the same time, the news quickly spread.","Some people from the Ling Sea Sword Sect, the Heavenly Evil Sect, and the Authentic Martial Arts Sect, who had nothing to do, went to the Illustrious Peak to watch the fun. It didn’t matter if there would be no show. It would just be a wasted trip.","Generally speaking, such people had certain strengths and didn’t need to be training and fighting here.","The elder of the Authentic Martial Arts Sect was one of those people.","A day quickly passed by as many people continued on their way.","Swoosh!","When Taoist Heavenlight arrived at Illustrious Peak, he headed toward the central region.","When he arrived at the northeast area, he waved his right hand, and all kinds of palm-sized small detective devices floated out of the aircraft.","Thousands of them were flying in all directions in a dense manner.","“Hey, what a coincidence, old bastard Heavenlight.”","The elder of the Authentic Martial Arts Sect soon came to him.","“Get lost!”","Taoist Heavenlight’s face darkened.","However, he felt the auras coming from other directions.","“God damn it!”","He cursed inwardly.","The leading elders of the Ling Sea Sword Sect and the Heavenly Evil Sect had all come.","That was to say, the leaders of the Four Great Sects for this training in the Wind-Witches Evilland were now all present.","The elders of the Ling Sea Sword Sect and the Heavenly Evil Sect, who had been at war all year round, were not at loggerheads when they met. They looked at each other and even greeted each other.","“You haven’t died yet?”","“How could I have died before you?”","“You may not be able to live for long.”","“I think YOU won’t live for long. Your sect is going down with you.”","“...”","After greeting each other, they remained silent and watched the fun from the side.","“I’d first heard that a new disciple had appeared in the Crimson Sunglow Sect and sent Elder Heavenlight flying with a punch.”","The elder of the Heavenly Evil Sect had an exaggerated expression on his face. “I didn’t believe it, but now that I’ve seen Elder Heavenlight personally come to arrest him, I believe it. I even want to get to know that new disciple. What kind of person could do such a...”","Normally speaking, if he said “rebellious” next, Taoist Heavenlight would definitely not say anything about it.","However-","“-could do such a delightful thing? It truly makes me happy. It’s been a long time since I’ve laughed like this. Hahahaha.” As the elder of the Heavenly Evil Sect spoke, he loudly laughed.","Taoist Heavenlight’s face was ashen from anger, but he had a way to deal with this kind of mockery. He coldly said, “No wonder your Heavenly Evil Sect isn’t a match for the Ling Sea Sword Sect.”","“Hey, Elder Heavenlight, it seems that you don’t understand the current situation. I guess you have gone stupid due to your seclusion.” The elder from the Heavenly Evil Sect chuckled. “We’re here for the show. Elder Heavenlight, please begin your performance.”","“God damn it!”","Taoist Heavenlight was so furious that his chest trembled violently, and his lungs were about to explode.","“Found them.”","Taoist Heavenlight suddenly found that a detector was ringing.","The three people locked on by the system appeared in his sight.","“Why are they spotted so soon?”","Taoist Heavenlight narrowed his eyes.","He moved and chased after them at a high speed.","After a while, when he arrived at the place-","“Eye of Illusion Breaking!”","Taoist Heavenlight’s eyes glistened. He suddenly burst into laughter and said, “An insignificant trick. Do you think you can hypnotize me?”","Buzz!","With a wave of his hand, he sent out a wave of air that covered the three figures.","“They are indeed here!","“How bold.”","Taoist Heavenlight knew that Zhang Hanyang and the other two were in the area near the Illustrious Peak.","However, as for their exact location, he didn’t know it.","The game of cat and mouse had just begun.","“I’ll see how you can escape.”","“Shadowless Duplications.”","Taoist Heavenlight was, after all, quite capable.","Using his hard-earned supernatural power, he sent 99 figures flying in all directions searching all over this place.","Seeing this, the faces of the elders from other sects froze.","“He already has 99 duplications?”","“That old bastard Heavenlight’s escaping supernatural power is still very powerful,” the Sect Leader of the Authentic Martial Arts Sect said.","“...”","It was obvious that they approved of this move.","“Hmm?”","Even Zhang Han, who had sensed it in the distance, felt a little impressed.","It was a nice move, but unfortunately, Taoist Heavenlight couldn’t use it to find him.","This was a trial through the air between him and Taoist Heavenlight.","Taoist Heavenlight wanted to catch him and find some clues about his whereabouts, so Zhang Han needed to prevent that from happening.","Right now, he could only attack once, and he was far beyond Taoist Heavenlight’s match. If he wasn’t injured, he might be able to fight Taoist Heavenlight head-on.","Zhang Han was absolutely confident in his strength. Just like now, he dared to tell the other party his route.","He was 100% certain that Taoist Heavenlight’s trip would be a wasted one.","“Daddy, are we too close to him?”","Mengmeng subconsciously lowered her voice.","“It’s all right.”","Zhang Han chuckled and said, “You’ll see how I toy with him. No matter when it is, you need to stay calm in the face of your enemies. Look at Taoist Heavenlight. He’s furious, but even if he’s angry, he has to stay calm. His 99 figures are in the Nine Ultimate Soul-searching Formation, which has formed a big net that has spread to the surroundings. They can feel all the souls.”","“Are we going to be discovered then?” Mu Xue was stunned.","Hearing this, Zhang Han shook his head slightly and said, “This little bit of cultivation is not enough for him to do that.”","As he spoke, he performed an incantation gesture with his right hand.","Around the central area of the Illustrious Peak, the formation that Zhang Han had set up earlier lit up in eight directions.","“Are you looking for me?”","“Are you looking for me?”","“...”","Eight thousand-foot-tall illusions appeared, and a great deal of soul power spread out, turning into ripples and forming a tide nearby. After it swept away, Taoist Heavenlight’s eyes were fixed.","“Why was that?”","Because in his perception, the place where there were souls was red. It was just like how infrared rays and thermal detectors worked. But now, his vision was full of red, just like a sea of fire.","Taoist Heavenlight couldn’t help but feel shocked. “How did he know my ability hidden in my supernatural power?”","“Wind!”","Taoist Heavenlight once more executed another spell.","The ninety-eight figures raised their hands and formed an incantation gesture. A formless hurricane blew away the spreading soul power.","“It’s not enough.”","Zhang Han’s eight illusions looked indifferent. Suddenly, a black light emerged from more than 100 places on the ground and opened an evil spirit cave deep underground around the Illustrious Peak.","It was as if a volcano erupted with endless black mists spreading.","“What kind of skill is this?”","The protectors, supervisors, and the others who had come with Taoist Heavenlight were all stunned.","The ordinary disciples and protectors of the other three sects were dumbfounded.","Even the three elders started to frown. One of them had a very serious expression on his face, and one gasped.","They were thinking the same thing. “Who on earth is Yefeng?”","It was not until this moment that they realized that they thought they had previously overestimated Yefeng, but it turned out that they had underestimated him far too much.","It was rare to see such a method of fighting in the air. Even ordinary elders could not master it."]},{"number":1437,"title":"Chapter 1437 Leaving with Ease","paragraphs":["Chapter 1437 Leaving with Ease","“Yefeng!”","Taoist Heavenlight’s eyes narrowed.","He was good at fighting, but he was not very good at this kind of illusory fighting method.","After seeing what was going on, he dispersed 98 figures.","“Earthfiend Image!”","Buzz!","Elder Heavenlight’s hands were clasped together with his fingers upward, and his eyes were shining. Behind him, a huge embodiment illusory figure that was thousands of feet tall appeared.","That was the illusory figure of the Earthfiend, its body in tatters, faintly discernible.","The tall illusory figure stretched out its arms, and an irresistible suction force appeared in them.","The endless black mists transformed into a storm that was completely absorbed by the embodiment.","“Hahaha, what a cheap trick. You should put it away so as not to be an embarrassment!”","“Yefeng!","“You can’t get away!”","Elder Heavenlight madly laughed, “Blood Spiritual Technique!”","When this technique was displayed, the pupils of the elder from the Ling Sea Sword Sect shrank. “How could he know one of the three great occult arts of the Heavenly Evil Sect?”","“Could it be that the two sects have some sort of relationship?”","“What a good move. It’s an eye-opener.” The elder of the Ling Sea Sword Sect glanced at the elder of the Heavenly Evil Sect.","“He once killed my sect’s Elder Mu, searched his soul, and obtained the complete Blood Spiritual Technique.” The Heavenly Evil Sect Elder said indifferently, “The Ling Sea Sword Sect has never been our sect’s opponent, and we disdain to get allies. Even if we do, we wouldn’t join hands with the Crimson Sunglow Sect.”","The Heavenly Evil Sect and the Ling Sea Sword Sect were mortal enemies.","They didn’t like the Crimson Sunglow Sect either, and they were rather friendly to the Authentic Martial Arts Sect.","However, it was true that the Authentic Martial Arts Sect didn’t care about worldly affairs, was brave and good at fighting, and didn’t participate in other disputes, just like the Crimson Sunglow Sect did.","In fact, the relationships between these sects had been quite complex when the rebellions of the Eight Sects occurred. It lasted to the point where the Eight Sects turned into the Four Great Sects.","Each sect’s elders and protectors had enemies or friends in the other three sects.","In the face of friends, even if the sects were at war, they would still show mercy. If they were facing enemies or dealing with opponents that they didn’t know, they would be basically trying all means to kill the other party.","With regards to the Blood Spiritual Technique, they only voiced a few opinions before they turned to watch the show attentively.","“I think that Taoist Heavenlight won’t be able to catch the other party.”","“Yefeng does have some skill.”","“It’s just that I don’t know which force he is from.”","There were even elders who were intrigued. “If such a figure joins my sect, he’ll absolutely make our sect known in the world.”","“Blood Spiritual Technique. Search for his trail!”","A wisp of blood-red light swirled around Taoist Heavenlight’s eyes as he stared at the eight distant illusory figures.","He believed that the illusory figures were definitely connected to the Original Body.","If he could see through the illusion and find the connection, he would be able to know the real location of the other party.","“Found it!","“I’m about to catch you!”","Taoist Heavenlight had discovered a strand of a vague connection that was nearby the eight illusory figures, and it was guiding them in a direction.","“I’m about to catch you right now!”","At this moment, Taoist Heavenlight was sneering in his heart.","“You’re too unskilled at this kind of technique.”","The eight illusory figures spoke at the same time, stretched out their right hands, and pointed forward.","It was the Qing Ming Seal.","Clatter!","An enormous circular seal was formed in the air above Taoist Heavenlight, suppressing his soul.","All of a sudden, he felt a strong sense of defiance in his control over the Blood Spiritual Technique.","“Hmm?”","Taoist Heavenlight’s pupils contracted.","“Blood Spiritual Technique. Draw!”","Alternating the incantation, he broke through the suppression of the Qing Ming Steal and changed his attack method.","However, at this time, Zhang Han’s eight illusory figures were smiling faintly.","“Taoist Heavenlight, you’ve disappointed me. I thought you were proficient in some magical techniques, but I didn’t expect you to only have a smattering of skill.”","“What shameless boasting!” Taoist Heavenlight’s heart sank, and his face was filled with rage.","He felt that he might not be able to catch Zhang Han.","“You’re just a coward who only knows how to hide and doesn’t even dare to fight face-to-face. How dare you talk big?” Taoist Heavenlight sneered and said, “If it were a head-on fight, you would definitely die within three moves.”","“Whatever.”","...","Zhang Han only said one word and then slowly disappeared.","“He ran away?”","There was nothing Taoist Heavenlight could do. He stood where he was and spread out his divine sense.","But he couldn’t find any clues.","“We’re here.”","Three figures suddenly appeared on a mountain peak.","“Hmm?”","Taoist Heavenlight’s pupils shrank. He could sense with his divine sense that those figures were real.","“They really dare to show up?”","The others were all stunned.","“Is he courting death?”","...","“Glowing Sun and Moon Slash!” Taoist Heavenlight didn’t hesitate. A sword appeared in his right hand, and then he slashed out with a shocking strand of sword Qi that tore through the void.","Rumble!","Before the sword Qi reached them, the three figures slowly dissipated.","The sword Qi hit the mountain peak and destroyed half of it. Rubble flew in all directions and the wind howled.","This caused Taoist Heavenlight to be even more enraged.","“Look over here.”","Zhang Han and the other two appeared again on the right side far away this time.","They seemed real in the detection of Taoist Heavenlight’s divine sense.","However, Taoist Heavenlight looked like he didn’t want to take action.","“Just leave. I don’t need to personally capture you. Countless sects will make their move. You will still have to flee,” he said calmly.","“You’ve overestimated your Crimson Sunglow Sect,” Zhang Han said calmly. “Are you sure you won’t go after us?”","A smile appeared on Taoist Heavenlight’s face when he heard those words. “No.”","“Alas!”","Zhang Han sighed softly and said, “You’re secretly casting an incantation right in front of me. Do you think I can’t detect it?”","Taoist Heavenlight’s face instantly changed.","“How did he find out that I’m casting an incantation?”","But since he had started his move, he had to finish it.","“Seven Souls Hunting Technique!”","Three rays of red light covered Zhang Han and the other two. Above them, there were three marks.","The incantation had been completed.","“Hahahaha! I’d love to see how you can escape now!”","Taoist Heavenlight was so excited.","The other three elders, however, had complicated looks on their faces.","“He actually dared to allow the Seven Souls Hunting Technique to be successfully executed. Yefeng is too careless.”","“Whether he’s doing this on purpose or not, his means are superb. However, Yefeng is too careless. How could he not be on guard against a treacherous character like that old bastard Heavenlight?”","They couldn’t help but sigh inwardly.","Because they had witnessed how the Seven Souls Hunting Technique worked before. Once it was performed, there would be a seal on the enemy from 700 meters above the head.","“Shit. Run now!”","Zhang Han and the other two’s faces changed greatly, and they quickly fled in all directions.","“You have no way to escape.”","Taoist Heavenlight used the fastest speed he had ever been able to reach.","After he rushed over and made his move, he thought he had succeeded and couldn’t help sneering.","“You’re just a junior who knows a little about magic! Go to hell!”","He attacked with anger. Waves of flames surged, crushing downward.","“You’ve been tricked again.”","Zhang Han suddenly stopped, turned around, and looked at him mockingly.","Hiss!","When their figures dissipated, the incantation seal connecting the sky dissipated.","Taoist Heavenlight’s face was livid.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","His moves burned down the forest within a kilometer.","“Yefeng!”","Elder Heavenlight roared in a repressed and angry tone.","At this moment, he was beyond furious.","Even the elders of the Authentic Martial Arts Sect and other sects did not mock him. They were not afraid of him, but they did not want to fight against Taoist Heavenlight here.","They could be at war, but it would not be necessary.","“What a strange technique!”","“Amazing. Even I failed to tell it just now.”","They had to admit that Zhang Han’s means were superb.","This sort of ability was extremely useful regardless of whether it was used for fleeing or fighting.","“Are you still trying to find us?","“You will only fail.”","The three figures were constantly flashing around Elder Heavenlight.","“I’m gonna kill you!”","Taoist Heavenlight was on the verge of going mad. He unleashed a series of powerful attacks, trying to destroy everything around him.","The illusion figures of Zhang Han and the other two kept dissipating. They appeared from another place and were attacked again, but they took the initiative to disappear before the attacks reached them.","This went on.","A minute later, Taoist Heavenlight suddenly stopped moving.","He flew into the air, his expression gloomy. “When I catch you, I’ll definitely cut you into pieces and burn your soul for ten thousand years!”","“Why would you think you can do that?”","Zhang Han and the other two’s figures changed to another place along with every word he said.","In the end, the three figures appeared in the distance and were very close to the fifth war zone.","“We are here. For real,” Zhang Han said, looking at Taoist Heavenlight.","“I don’t believe you!”","Taoist Heavenlight looked like he would never make a move.","He really wasn’t going to take action.","However, Zhang Han’s figure was real.","“You’re so stupid!”","Mengmeng mocked Taoist Heavenlight in the distance.","He could’ve stopped attacking after testing the waters from the very start. Still, he had been dreaming and attacking wildly.","“Hahaha.”","Taoist Heavenlight laughed and said, “This little trick doesn’t work. You managed to escape today, but at a certain point, you will be caught. Don’t worry, one day, someone will send you to me!”","“Alas!”","Zhang Han sighed with emotion.","“Since you’re not coming, we’ll be leaving.”","As he spoke, he turned around and left with Mengmeng and Mu Xue.","Taoist Heavenlight didn’t know if their current figures were real, nor did the other three elders.","Until the end.","In the distance, Zhang Han cast a spell, and his Qi and blood were surging.","In that case, their figures were real this time.","“Yefeng! I’ll definitely kill you!”","Taoist Heavenlight felt humiliated, and he let out an angry roar.","His voice spread far and wide.","“Hahaha.”","Zhang Han’s chuckle came from the distance.","It was faint laughter, but it made Taoist Heavenlight feel as if the voice was a slap in his face.","He had lost all his prestige.","“Humph!”","Taoist Heavenlight didn’t want to look at the faces of the ones from the other sects. With hatred in his heart, he flicked his sleeves and left.","The others watched as Zhang Han and the other two slowly disappeared from their sight.","It was obvious that Yefeng had won the battle several times over.","“He is truly an extraordinary person.”","The elders of the other three sects repeatedly sighed with emotion. After they finished watching the show, it was time for them to go to the great secret realm to train their disciples.","The disciples would be challenged and selected during the practice. It was unknown how many talented ones would become stepping stones for others and die here this time, and it was unknown how many of them would rise and become famous.","However, during this training in the Wind-Witches Evilland, no one could steal the thunder from the name Yefeng.","He was the one who’d caused the Third Elder of the Crimson Sunglow Sect to suffer a loss and be toyed with.","On the other side.","Zhang Han and the other two were traveling by spaceship. They were advancing at a high speed, but the route they took was very smooth.","Zhang Han had spent 100,000 top-grade crystal stones on this battle.","It was quite a lot while he had spent many gems, Formation Stones, and Formation Flags as well.","In just a few minutes, he exchanged blows with Taoist Heavenlight, and the cost was not low.","But Zhang Han still did so.","“Daddy didn’t want Taoist Heavenlight to suffer a setback or be toyed with. He’s just a nobody. When I have enough strength in the future, I can just kill him at will.”","Zhang Han slowly said, “I just want to show you what means you can have when you try to escape. What you learned just now is actually merging the escape occult art into the formation and carrying out meticulous control. You have learned quite a few occult arts. Practice more, and you will naturally comprehend this ingenious combination in the future.”","“...”","Zhang Han’s purpose was to teach Mengmeng some means.","It could be said that if no one taught her and Mu Xue these methods, they might not be able to comprehend them until they reached the Tribulation Stage.","However, what Zhang Han said made Mengmeng shake her head.","“This is so complicated. I don’t think I can get them at all.”","Zhang Han was speechless.","“It’s okay. Take your time to learn. I’ll teach you.”"]},{"number":1438,"title":"Chapter 1438 Come and Go Freely","paragraphs":["Chapter 1438 Come and Go Freely","“I’m not in a hurry to learn that anyway. I still have a long way to go,” Mengmeng harrumphed and said.","“Yeah. You still have a long way to go. After we pick up your mum, let’s take a nice tour of the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven,” Zhang Han said with a smile.","“What about Grandpas and Grandmas?” Mengmeng asked, “Do you know where they are?”","“I can sense where my parents are, but as for your mum’s parents...” Zhang Han sighed softly and said, “I can only try to look for them. My parents have been in the martial arts world for many years and have experience, but your other grandparents aren’t that skilled. However, I feel that they should be in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven. I’ve been searching for them. Now we’ll go back to the Heavenly Double Star to see if anyone’s there.”","“Okay. I see.” Mengmeng pursed her lips and said, “I don’t know why, but everyone separated all of a sudden.”","“So, in order to avoid such a situation in the future, I will teach you more skills.” Zhang Han smiled.","Only after Zhang Han found Mengmeng have he been smiling sometimes.","After all, the little princess was the apple of his eye.","“I don’t want to study. I’ve been very tired from studying pellet refining recently. I haven’t rested yet.” Mengmeng snorted and said, “Anyway, I won’t leave you in the future, unless...","“Unless what?” Zhang Han’s face froze. It was as if he had expected something.","As expected-","“Unless I have a boyfriend. What will you do if I get married in the future?” Mengmeng said with a grin.","“Ahem, ahem, ahem.” Mu Xue coughed a few times. Then, she blinked, thought for a moment, and finally shook her head.","She was wondering exactly what sort of person would be able to be even more outstanding than her master.","If any guy wanted to marry Mengmeng, he had to pass Zhang Han’s test.","Mu Xue had been in the Heavenly Evil Sect for a year, and even the top few experts were far from enough to be a match for Zhang Han.","She wondered if anyone would be qualified to match Mengmeng.","“Mengmeng will be able to get married in the future... right?","“Geez. That’s a tough question.”","“Don’t intimidate me. I won’t teach you then. Forget it, I’ll teach you slowly from now on so that you’ll keep learning for the rest of your life.” Zhang Han glared at Mengmeng slightly, which aroused her cute laughter.","The little princess had grown up a lot after all.","Her voice was much more mature than before, but it was still so pleasant to the ear. Her laughter was very infectious.","She was Zi Yan and Zhang Han’s child in the end.","“When we find everyone, let’s go back to Earth!”","Mengmeng said, “I haven’t been back for a long time. I’m about to drop out of school.”","“You’re right. It’s been more than two or three years since we left. Time flies too fast in the Cultivation World,” Zhang Han shook his head and said.","“If only we can find our relatives soon,” Mengmeng muttered.","“Haha, I’ll take you to the Heavenly Double Star, and then I’ll go and look for them. It won’t take long,” Zhang Han said.","“You’re going to leave me behind again.”","Mengmeng puckered her lips.","She was now still disguised as a man.","Mu Xue felt a little awkward while looking at Mengmeng, so she said, “Mengmeng, you should change back to your normal clothes. You’re so beautiful, but you’re dressed as a boy now.”","“I’m used to it. Besides, we’re running for our lives. If my original appearance is discovered, won’t it be easier for others to remember me?” Mengmeng said.","“You should change back into your original look.”","Zhang Han smiled and said, “No one would know you when you look like a young pretty lady. Where is Zhang Hanyang of the Crimson Sunglow Sect? No one in the world will know if we don’t tell others.”","“Hua Churan, that senior sister, has seen my real appearance before,” Mengmeng said.","“I see. She would be one of the few people who know the truth then.”","Zhang Han couldn’t help laughing. He waved his hand and set up a Bounded Domain to connect to Mengmeng’s schoolbag. Mu Xue and he were both outside the Bounded Domain.","When the light dissipated, Mengmeng had her looks changed. She was wearing a set of white sportswear with her long hair draping over her shoulders and was about to tie her hair into a ponytail. She was a young beautiful lady again.","“You’re so pretty. As our First Princess of Mount New Moon, you’re getting more and more beautiful,” Mu Xue teased. “It’s said that a girl changes a lot when she grows up and that a beautiful kid would eventually turn into an ugly grown-up. But you have always been good-looking since you were born.”","“You should know how good-looking my parents are,” Mengmeng harrumphed and said.","“Alright. Let’s go.”","Zhang Han raised his hand and pinched Mengmeng’s face, saying, “Now you can be smug.”","“I’m not being smug.”","“Master, do you think Taoist Heavenlight would issue any reward missions? We’re going to the Ling Sea Sword Sect. What should we do if we’re discovered? The Four Great Sects, such as the Crimson Sunglow Sect, would occasionally cooperate with some other sects,” Mu Xue suddenly said.","“It’s also possible.” Zhang Han nodded. “The Four Great Sects, especially the Ling Sea Sword Sect and the Heavenly Evil Sect, would cooperate when necessary despite their fierce fighting. If Taoist Heavenlight of the Crimson Sunglow Sect releases some rewards and cooperates with others, we may be discovered while going to the Ling Sea Sword Sect. The intelligent detection system here is relatively complete. What’s more, we have treasures that we obtained from the great secret realm, which even Taoist Heavenlight is tempted by. If the Ling Sea Sword Sect finds us, they may take action. In short, we have to observe everything. When we are about to arrive at the Ling Sea Sword Sect, we have to prepare some plans in advance to prevent the unexpected.”","“But what kind of plans should we prepare?” Mengmeng asked curiously.","“The ones for escaping, of course.”","Zhang Han smiled slightly.","They set off for the journey again.","On the way, Mu Xue controlled the flying shuttle to avoid all kinds of battles and headed for the Ling Sea Sword Sect.","Zhang Han fiddled with some spirit treasures while making introductions to Mengmeng.","“This is the Explosive Ray Pill.","“It’s a kind of hallucinatory medicinal pellet, like a bomb. When we get out of here, we can use it to make explosions. The light will not only sting our enemies’ eyes but also suppress their divine senses. It can be used for escape.","...","“The Great Heavenly Stone can be integrated with three kinds of occult arts and be activated in an instant. While the other party is using occult arts, attacking would not be the best choice. In the current situation, I can integrate one illusionary secret skill, one trap secret skill, and one small-scale specific suppression secret skill. With three skills, it can hold off the enemy within a kilometer at least for about 10 seconds.”","For the battle, ten seconds was not a short time.","“This is a Formation Flag. There are many kinds of Formation Flags, which can be refined according to your own thoughts. Being proficient in the arrays of formations is also a great way to deal with enemies. Mengmeng, your formation skills are not bad. When the time comes, I’ll teach you something more profound.”","“Okay,” Mengmeng replied happily.","A few days later.","“We’re about to leave the fifth war zone.","“I also have an identity in the Ling Sea Sword Sect. I got in by participating in the inner court trial. I’ll try to see if my identity works,” Zhang Han said casually.","The three of them walked into a huge city. Zhang Han was dressed in ordinary clothes, while Mengmeng and Mu Xue were tightly covered in their robes.","They used the tokens of the two disciples of the Ling Sea Sword Sect they had picked up on the way.","In every sect, the inspection was not that strict by the walls outside the city gate.","One could pass through the city gate by taking out a token.","...","However, there were still people who noticed them.","“Who are those people?”","A patrol team member came over and asked, “Are you Zhang Hanyang?”","“I am.” Zhang Han nodded. “They are Hu Xiao and Hu Jun of the Great Bamboo Peak. They have been bewitched and can’t be exposed under the light.”","“I see.”","The person who questioned them was deep in thought. He looked at Mengmeng and Mu Xue carefully, but since they were under black robes, he could not tell anything unusual from them.","He looked at his communication wristband, clicked on it a few times, and finally nodded.","“No problem. Sorry to have disturbed you.”","After saying that, he smiled and turned to leave.","Zhang Han watched him leave steadily with a frown.","That man’s pace was so regular that he seemed to be deliberately relaxing.","But it still needed to be discussed as to whether it was his habit to act like this.","Zhang Han and the other two walked on the street and went straight to the flying base.","“We’re going to the Vast Wood Star.”","“Please wait.”","In the entrance building of the flight base, after Zhang Han finished speaking, the staff began to type and check on the system.","After a short moment, the female staff’s expression changed slightly.","“There are still two hours before the spaceship sets off to the Vast Wood Star. You need to take the spaceship over there. Please go to Hall 31 to line up and wait.”","“Okay.”","Zhang Han nodded.","They walked along the road signs.","When they were halfway there, they suddenly entered a corridor on the side.","Zhang Han said, “We need to go to a different place. We can’t leave from here.”","“Why? Have we been discovered?” Mengmeng asked in confusion.","“Yeah.”","Zhang Han shook his head helplessly.","Their figures slowly disappeared at the end of the corridor.","In less than a minute, a chief supervisor led a team of more than 30 people and rushed here.","“Where are they?”","When they saw the empty corridor, they couldn’t help but be stunned.","“No wonder they were able to escape from Taoist Heavenlight. This power is most definitely not something that an ordinary person can possess.”","The chief supervisor sighed softly and said, “If I had known that it was them earlier, I would have made my purpose clear. The sect only wants them to hand over some spirit treasures as protection money. They were so keen to perceive it.”","...","A few moments later, Zhang Han and the other two appeared outside the city.","“Where are we going now?” Mu Xue asked.","“There is another city 300 miles in the east. We’ll take a spaceship there to leave,” Zhang Han said,","“But aren’t we... on the wanted list?” Mengmeng muttered.","“We’re just here to see if that’s the case,” Zhang Han said. “We just need to get to know the situation.”","“So we’re here mainly to see if we’ve been wanted.”","Hearing what Mengmeng said, Zhang Han shook his head and smiled.","Anyone would need some experience to keep their guard up, just like the sixth sense, which was very illusory.","They set off for the journey again.","After taking a few detours, they soon traveled through a few hundred miles and arrived at the other city.","This city was called Atadamor City.","It was smaller than the previous one.","“Let’s just directly sneak in.”","Zhang Han cast two formations and entered the city with ease.","“Master, is it also easy for the people of other sects to get into te city?” Mu Xue asked.","“It’s not difficult to enter the outer-court area.” Zhang Han nodded and said, “It’s just that it’s not necessary. There’s nothing quite important in that area. If someone takes action there, it can’t be easily withdrawn. It’s not so easy to sneak into the inner court. The facilities here are very complete.”","“I see.” Mu Xue suddenly came to understand.","She didn’t think too much about it before. If the higher-ups of the Heavenly Evil Sect attacked the outer courts of the other sects, they would also have their outer courts attacked in turn.","It could be done, but not necessary.","No one wanted to see the scene become too chaotic.","Where there should be chaos, there would be chaos. That was where the war zones were. Also, where there should be peace, there would be peace. It has also been an unwritten rule of the Four Great Sects for many years.","Unless, like a thousand years ago, when the Eight Sects were engaged in a chaotic battle, the entire Vast Heaven Star was covered in the flames of war.","“We’re going to take the spaceship,” Mengmeng said to Dahei, who had just woken up.","“Ow.”","When they were about to walk to the spaceship base, Zhang Han raised his eyebrows and suddenly had a strange look.","“Hold it. Let’s go to another place first.”"]},{"number":1439,"title":"Chapter 1439 I Knew You Wouldn’t Bear to Leave Me Behind","paragraphs":["Chapter 1439 I Knew You Wouldn’t Bear to Leave Me Behind","“Where are we going, Daddy?” Mengmeng asked out of curiosity.","“Let’s go ahead.” Zhang Han took the lead.","About a few hundred meters away, there was an antique restaurant.","“Please come in!","“Come and take a seat over here.”","“I already have a reservation.” Zhang Han casually threw out a few crystal stones.","“Thank you, milord.”","The waiter stopped and watched Zhang Han and the others go upstairs.","They went straight up to the fifth floor. Near the window, there was an inconspicuous person sitting there. It was a woman in plain clothes. She was sitting there drinking tea, and it was hard to notice her.","There was a pot of wine and a few dishes, most of which were meat, on her table, but she didn’t seem to have started dining yet.","“Huh?”","Mu Xue let out a soft cry of surprise and said with a smile, “It’s her.”","“Is that Auntie Leng Yue?” Mengmeng rolled her eyes and said, “Shh, let’s sneak over there.”","Zhang Han shook his head with a laugh, walked over, and sat down directly on the chair.","At first, Leng Yue was still looking out of the window with a frown, thinking about something.","Suddenly, she felt someone approaching and sitting down. When she turned around and saw who it was, she was stunned.","Her pupils constricted.","“B-boss?”","She was so surprised to suddenly see Zhang Han.","She was so excited that her face turned red.","“How, how could you be here?” Leng Yue immediately stood up and asked in surprise.","“Hee hee, we were just passing by. It was Daddy who spotted you,” Mengmeng said.","“Sit down. We haven’t had lunch yet and are here for a free meal,” Zhang Han said in an easygoing manner.","“Okay.”","Leng Yue sat down obediently and looked around. She smiled and said, “I finally get to see you, boss.”","“Did you join the Ling Sea Sword Sect?” Mu Xue set up a soundproof layer and said, “I joined the Heavenly Evil Sect.”","“I joined the True Martial Arts Sect,” Leng Yue replied.","“Then why are you in the territory of the Ling Sea Sword Sect?” Mu Xue was puzzled.","“Yeah. It can be dangerous if you’re discovered here,” Mengmeng said.","Zhang Han sighed softly and asked, “Are you here to find someone?”","“Yeah.”","Leng Yue nodded slightly and said, “Ah Hu, Elder Meng, Jiang Bing, and Yun Feiyang also joined the Authentic Martial Arts Sect. I can feel that many of our people should be on the Vast Heaven Star. So, I went to the Heavenly Evil Sect and found Instructor Liu and Xu Yong. Later, I was discovered, so I fled and came to the Ling Sea Sword Sect. I’ve found Jiang Yanlan over here, but I haven’t gone anywhere else yet. ”","“Holy cow!” Mu Xue was shocked. “How come you’ve found so many people? I didn’t see Instructor Liu and Xu Yong in the Heavenly Evil Sect.”","“The Four Great Sects have vast territories. It’s not strange that you didn’t find them,” Zhang Han said.","Leng Yue’s character was different from Mu Xue’s. Mu Xue was careless. She came here just to cultivate first. When her master found her, she would leave. Leng Yue was thoughtful. Since she came to the Cultivation World, she didn’t like strange environments and strangers. She was very concerned about her friends in the security group. Therefore, she searched everywhere for them and found some of them.","“Boss, should I contact them now and ask them to come here?” Leng Yue asked.","This made Zhang Han ponder for a while.","He shook his head and said, “The Vast Heaven Star is actually a nice place. At the very least, it is the center of the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven. You should stay here for the time being. I have to go to other Astral Domains. It won’t help much if you go to the Chu Family’s place.”","In terms of training, the Vast Heaven Star would be the best place.","People like Ah Hu, Instructor Liu, and Leng Yue had already learned a lot of occult arts. Cultivating in such an environment was indeed helpful for their development.","Therefore, Zhang Han was willing to let them gain experience during this period.","In fact, Mengmeng had mastered more occult arts, and she had learned more things than others from Zhang Han.","She also needed to gain experience, but Zhang Han didn’t allow her to.","He was still worried. Even if she were to train, she would have to do it under his supervision or when he was nearby.","“It’s also nice to stay here,” Mu Xue said. “But I’ll go with Master. I’ll go to the Heavenly Double Star first to see what’s going on. Leng Yue, will you go with us?”","Leng Yue was a bit confused. “Heavenly Double Star?”","Zhang Han explained, “The Chu Family is located on the Heavenly Double Star, which is the family where Chu Qingyi used to live with. Their Grand Master was one of my younger brothers in the past. He helped me advertise the rewards to find our people. Now, there are more than a dozen people there, including Lili and Liang Hao. That place is now considered a base, so it is very safe.”","“I see.” Leng Yue hesitated for a moment. She then shook her head and said, “I’d better continue to look for the guys here. I’ll also tell them the good news.”","“Thanks for your hard work,” Zhang Han said with emotion.","He had established the security group back then so that he could travel with convenience.","In fact, he didn’t expect things to turn into the current situation.","The thing was that he didn’t supervise the security group much, but this group of people followed him wholeheartedly.","It was not only because Zhang Han was an expert. There were thousands of masters in the world. There was always someone stronger than him, but not every expert’s subordinates were so loyal.","“Not at all,” Leng Yue smiled.","...","“Auntie Leng Yue, be careful here. We’ll leave in a while, but we’ll come back to pick you and the others up in a year or two,” Mengmeng said.","“Okay,” Leng Yue nodded and said.","“Let’s eat.”","They ate and talked.","About an hour later, Leng Yue watched Zhang Han and the other two leave.","As for Mu Xue, she had two plans. She planned to go to the Heavenly Double Star to check things out. After her master left alone, if there was no obstacle there, she would go back to the Vast Heaven Star. Moreover, she felt that Mengmeng would not want to stay on the Heavenly Double Star. Given how soft-hearted her master was to Mengmeng, he might taking her with him again. In that case, Mu Xue might also go with them and set off on the journey.","The boundless starry sky was mysterious and beautiful. While going with her master, she would be able to get all the things she needed. Rather than staying here, it was far better for her to follow her master.","After leaving the restaurant, Zhang Han and the other two went all the way to the flying base.","In the previous city, they had been discovered. But here, Mu Xue found that while following Zhang Han straight away, they didn’t need to worry about anything. No one stopped them or inspected them. Just like that, they easily entered an aircraft and took off. They switched to another spaceship at the space station, came to the Vast Wood Star, and then changed to another spaceship. After that, they headed for the Heavenly Double Star.","They spent the rest of their journey cultivating.","Zhang Han got new spiritual herbs. Except for the main ingredients of the Soul Fixing Pellet, the other spiritual herbs were all refined into soul-restoring medicinal pellets.","...","He got his soul restored to some degree.","Zhang Han also began to prepare some spirit treasures that could assist in a battle.","Given his current situation, he should try to take action less.","“We’ve arrived at the space station of the Heavenly Double Star.”","It was a smooth journey.","They came to the Chu Family’s place on the Beast Overlooking Peak.","“Big Brother, you’re back!”","Grand Master Chu, the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak, and Old Taoist Honghu were waiting at the entrance to welcome Zhang Han.","When they saw Zhang Han, they all rushed to greet him.","“Big Brother, I haven’t seen you for quite a few days, and you look much better!”","“Good news, Big Brother. We’ve found nine more people. There are a total of 25 people now.”","“...”","When Mengmeng saw the three old men calling Zhang Han “Big Brother”, she was stunned on the spot.","Mu Xue, on the other hand, was a little alarmed.","These three people were powerful figures at the Grand Master level, but unexpectedly, they were as docile as kittens in front of her master.","“Master is so awesome!”","Mu Xue felt like she was about to prostrate herself to Zhang Han.","The admiration in her heart was overwhelming.","Zhang Han nodded and said, “Let’s see whom you’ve found.”","The group flew toward the hall.","Old Taoist Honghu said, “Brother Hanyang, I’ve prepared a titanium wheelchair for you. This is definitely more comfortable than the one you’ve been sitting in before. Here! Brother, please take your seat!”","While speaking, he took out a brand new and bright wheelchair.","“What?” Mengmeng was taken aback again,","Taoist Lord of Azurepeak slapped his forehead, cursing in his heart. “Dammit! Old Taoist Honghu is so scheming! How could he be so considerate?”","Grand Master Chu, however, was a little confused. He looked around and sighed to himself. “I’ve been inattentive.”","However, he noticed that Zhang Han’s face was a little darkened.","He could not help but laugh.","“This flattery seems to be a bit excessive.”","“Thank you, but I don’t need it now,” Zhang Han said grumpily.","“Dad, you’ve been sitting in a wheelchair before?” Mengmeng was quite shocked and even more distressed. She said angrily, “Hey! Why didn’t you tell me anything about it? Am I still your daughter?","She was quite dissatisfied.","“Alas.”","Zhang Han quickly said with a smile, “Sweetie, I was afraid that you would worry about me. Besides, at that time, I was just lazy and a little weak. I’m fine now.”","“Humph! I don’t want to talk to you.” Mengmeng turned her head and pursed her lips.","Zhang Han was helpless and amused. He began to pamper her.","As Zhang Han spoke, the cold sweat on Old Taoist Honghu’s forehead increased a little.","In the end, his forehead was covered in sweat.","He felt so ashamed that he wanted to smash the wheelchair that he had bought at a high price.","Taoist Lord of Azurepeak snickered to himself.","Grand Master Chu laughed openly.","Mu Xue blinked her eyes and secretly observed the situation.","After being pampered for a while, Mengmeng was in a good mood, but she still pretended to be angry after rolling her eyes.","This went on until they arrived at Chu Youyou’s residence.","“Dad, Mom.”","Zhang Han looked delighted.","He didn’t expect Zi Qiang and Xu Xinyu to be found.","There were also Liu Qingfeng, Liu Jiaran, and other people with relatively low strength.","In the end, their group was still favored.","Zhang Han knew very well that if it weren’t for Sir Mysterious’s Sixth Mind, everyone would have been in a more difficult situation.","But why was it that Zi Yan was in another Astral Domain?","His parents were not here either.","It might be a matter of probability.","Six Mind could transport the people in his team to the Human Clan’s territory.","However, their exact location was not certain. They could be anywhere.","“Grandpa, Grandma.”","Mengmeng started greeting everyone. “Aunt, Uncle...”","“Mengmeng!”","Zi Qiang and Xu Xinyu hurriedly pulled Mengmeng and inquired about her well-being. They didn’t let her go until a long time later.","“It’s great that we can meet.” Liu Qingfeng laughed and said, “I’ve also heard that there are such problems in the entire Heavenly Dragon Star Province. We were very lucky. I heard that the passage from here to the Heavenly Dragon Star Province has been destroyed. There are too many starry turbulences over there, so we can’t go through the passage. If we want to go back...”","“It’ll take another year or two,” Zhang Han said.","Liu Qingfeng nodded and said, “It just so happens that I can familiarize myself with the environment here. The things in the Astral Domain are indeed much more advanced.”","Liu Qingfeng also saw some business opportunities in this place.","However, his group couldn’t gain a foothold here with its current power, so Liu Qingfeng just wanted to get familiar with the place.","At noon, everyone had a meal in the courtyard.","When they heard that Zhang Han was going to leave in the evening, there was a moment of silence.","Mengmeng, in particular, stopped laughing and got a little unhappy.","Until the night came, Grand Master Chu, the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak, and Old Taoist Honghu were all standing at the entrance to the courtyard.","Zhang Han got ready and was about to leave.","Behind him were more than 20 people on the team.","“Brother, you must be careful when you are out there. You must pick Zi Yan and our parents up.”","“Brother Han, be careful.”","All of them were saying goodbye to Zhang Han.","It seemed a bit sad.","But in next to no time, the atmosphere became different.","“Dad, I want to go with you.”","Mengmeng pursed her lips and said in a wronged and weak tone, “I want to stay with you. You don’t even know how I made it through the past year.”","As she spoke, there were tears in her big bright eyes.","Seeing this, Zhang Han seemed to be numb. He stopped in place and quietly looked at Mengmeng.","His sense of reason told him that he couldn’t take her with him. What if it was risky?","However, life was like this. Sometimes, love could suppress reason.","Zhang Han seemed to be worried that Mengmeng would cry, so he immediately said, “Okay!”","“Mm!”","Mengmeng was stunned at first, and then she was overjoyed. She immediately raised her hand, wiped the corners of her eyes, and ran to Zhang Han happily, wrapping her arm around his.","“Humph! I knew you wouldn’t bear to leave me behind!”"]},{"number":1440,"title":"Chapter 1440 Danger","paragraphs":["Chapter 1440 Danger","Hearing this, Zhang Han couldn’t help but smile bitterly.","“Alas!”","He clearly didn’t want to take her with him.","But he just couldn’t help it.","Thinking about it, he was a little conflicted. Was this right or wrong?","However, he knew that he also wanted to take Mengmeng with him from the bottom of his heart.","“Hahahaha.”","Zhang Han was also in a bad mood just now. Now that he had agreed to Mengmeng’s proposal, he calmed down and let nature take its course. He could not help laughing.","“I want to ride the wind and waves, step on the stars and seas, not fear the vastness of heaven and earth, and live as if I’ve been dreaming and intoxicated for a thousand years.”","Clatter!","When Grand Master Chu looked at Zhang Han, who was in a good state and carefree, his heart trembled.","“It is it! This is the feeling I had when I followed Big Brother to look down on the world and roam the starry sky.”","To him, it was a rather emotional moment.","As for other people, Chu Qingyi’s eyes lit up.","But her reaction was still a little slower than Mu Xue’s.","Mu Xue was jumping very high and shouting, “Master! Master! I want to go with you! I want to go too! I’ll serve you tea and water. You need someone to serve you!”","“Master, I want to go too. I, I can... I...” The words Chu Qingyi wanted to say had been said, which made her quite upset.","She was silent for two seconds. In the end, her pretty face turned red, and she did not know what to say.","Everyone present was familiar with her. If outsiders saw her, they would wonder what the pretty lady was thinking. “Could it be that she could sleep with him?”","Those who knew the truth obviously didn’t think so.","Chu Qingyi and Mu Xue looked at Zhang Han with some nervousness.","Would he take them with him while he was already taking Mengmeng?","It was unknown.","Everyone knew that Zhang Han listened to everything that Mengmeng said, but he wouldn’t necessarily do that with others. To be more exact, his reason would always suppress his feelings for others.","“You two...”","Zhang Han started pondering.","As for Grand Master Chu and the other two senior experts, they held their breaths.","“Will he take them with him?","“If he does, will we also have a chance to go with him?”","At that moment, the three Grand Masters actually started to panic.","“Fine.”","Zhang Han suddenly sighed softly and said, “You two can go with me.”","“Hurray!”","“Amazing!”","Mu Xue was so happy that she couldn’t help saying, “Master, you’re invincible!”","“Hahaha.” Chu Qingyi was not as excited as Mu Xue appeared to be, but she could not hide her smile either.","“Big Brother!”","Grand Master Chu suddenly shouted, “You must have a capable subordinate! Look, they are all ladies, not men. Some situations will be definitely hard for them to handle. But it will be different if you have me. Big Brother, let’s discuss it. You should take me with you.”","“And me!”","Old Taoist Honghu immediately echoed, “I’m the most suitable for errands.”","“Big Brother, the two of them are more powerful than me, but I know a lot. I also have a Level S90 spaceship. It won’t be a problem for us to travel across the Astral Domain, and it’ll be safer for us to travel there,” the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak said.","“Alas!”","Zhang Han didn’t know how to react as he looked at the scene.","“Brother Han, since you’ll be taking so many burdens, I’ll go as well,” Zhang Li said.","“I’m not a burden!” Mengmeng said discontentedly, “I’m not. I’m even more powerful than you.”","She seemed to be worried that there would be too many people quarreling, and Zhang Han would not bring anyone with him.","“I’ve reached the God Transformation Realm,” Mu Xue said, “and my combat capability is not bad. I can help clear the way for Master.”","“I’m at the Void-refining Realm Early-Stage, and I can kill enemies,” Chu Qingyi said.","Originally, with Chu Qingyi’s character, she would not have said anything. However, she was truly unable to contain herself anymore.","“I’m at the Early Stage of the Mastery Realm. If we run into anything in the desolate Star Areas of the Astral Domain, Big Brother won’t need to take action. I’ll handle it.”","“I’m at the Peak Stage of the Integration Realm,” Old Taoist Honghu said, “and I’m proficient in...”","“No matter what you’re proficient in, it won’t work. You’re far inferior to Brother Hanyang in this aspect.” Grand Master Chu retorted.","Old Taoist Honghu’s face froze, and he cursed in his heart. “Fuck. We’re in the same boat, and yet he traps me.”","“Zheng can go with us. The rest of you stay here.” Zhang Han thought for a moment and said decisively, “Honghu, Azurepeak, you two will guard this place. The trip will take us more than one year, two at most. When I return, I’ll help you advance to the Tribulation Stage.”","...","Hiss!","The two of them gasped, unable to restrain their excitement.","The others shook their heads one after another, and they didn’t say anything in the end.","“Big brother, the Level S90 spaceship is parked at the space station. I’ll send you there and transfer the authority to you. I haven’t used it much since I bought it. It’s all new and can be used with ease,” the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak said.","The value of the spaceship was incomparable to the ability to reach the Tribulation Stage.","He planned to give the top-notch Level S90 spaceship, a top spaceship in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven, to Zhang Han as a gift.","“Bye-bye, everyone. See you next year!”","Mengmeng waved her hand at the crowd with a smile.","After they said goodbye, Zhang Han, Mengmeng, Chu Qingyi, Mu Xue, and Grand Master Chu were the small team that was about to set off.","Taoist Lord of Azurepeak personally escorted them to the space station.","During this period, Grand Master Chu also made arrangements for Patriarch Chu to cooperate fully with the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak and Old Taoist Honghu in completing the mission of placing a bounty on the Astral Realm to search for Zhang Han’s relatives.","...","Bang!","A muffled sound rang out for just two seconds.","The Thunder Snake, the Level S90 spaceship, seemed to have cut through the void and entered the secondary space. It began to shuttle through it.","Zhang Han’s first stop would be the northern border of the Vast Heaven Star in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.","What was there? What would they encounter on the way?","Grand Master Chu and the others were looking forward to it.","...","On the other side, in the Ocean Astral Domain.","There were about a thousand spaceships in the huge fleet, which were mighty.","This was the fleet of the Purple Moon Empire. They set off on the journey and annexed other forces around the Ocean Astral Domain.","At the same time, the Moon Empress’s reputation was also gradually revealed.","“It’s a lady. It’s said that she’s extremely ugly. She doesn’t dare to meet anyone, and lives under a black cloak all year round.”","“She is very cruel. The Purple Moon Empire is too cruel.”","At the edge of the Astral Domain, many forces were discussing recent events.","The Purple Moon Empire was one of the forces that people often talked about.","“Which one do you think will win this battle between the Purple Moon Empire and the Blackhill Empire?”","“It must be the Purple Moon Empire that will win. They have a large number of people and can attack without any scruples. They’re always going all out. Such a force is the most terrifying.”","“No, no, no, it must be the Blackhill Empire that will win. Have you forgotten that they have something to do with the Sacred Wolf Mountain?”","“The Sacred Wolf Mountain...”","As soon as these words were spoken, countless people gasped.","“That’s one of the top-tier forces in our Astral Domain.”","“The number of people in the Sacred Wolf Mountain is relatively small, but their power is too terrifying. Even the Illusory Sea Manor has to be careful with them.”","“In terms of scale, the Illusory Sea Manor is also the largest force in the Ocean Astral Domain.”","“If the Sacred Wolf Mountain makes a move or leaks any news about dealing with the Purple Moon Empire, the Purple Moon Empire will be destroyed.”","“Without the approval of those major forces, the Purple Moon Empire won’t be able to achieve much in the Ocean Astral Domain.”","“Hold on a second! The latest news is that the Sacred Wolf Mountain has taken action...”","During a lot of discussions, an enormous war in the starry sky had begun.","The fleet of the Purple Moon Empire was pressing down on the border, heading for the Blackhill Empire.","When the fleet was about to approach the final battle zone, many alarms sounded in the spaceships. “Traces of space are detected. A large fleet has arrived.”","At first, they thought that it was the fleet of the Blackhill Empire, and they were all ready to fight.","“Moon Empress.”","Zi Yan was sitting in the control room of the central spaceship, while dozens of high-position officials were standing behind her.","Ke Zhan, one of her right-hand men, said with a smile, “The Blackhill Empire is very powerful, but it is definitely no match for us. They have a lot of resources. After we conquer the force, we can also travel through space and go to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.”","The reason why the Purple Moon Empire was very fierce was that they had no worries. Many high-position officials knew that they were going to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven to develop and gain a foothold there.","On the other hand, if an emerging force wanted to establish itself in the Ocean Astral Domain, it would have to be approved by the Illusory Sea Mansion and the other two major sects. Only with a certificate would it be able to gain a foothold. Without a certificate, it would be ostracized and even dealt with.","The Purple Moon Empire was filled with all sorts of people.","It would be a problem for a huge force, but Zi Yan didn’t care.","The Ke family was one of the teams that assisted her.","At first, the Ke family was very worried, and many of them even refused to join Zi Yan’s force.","But later, they changed their minds.","Now that Ke Zhan had become a high-position official of the empire and held great power, he might not even agree to any request to return.","Great power was not something easy to walk away from.","Upon hearing what Ke Zhan said, many people present laughed.","“That’s right. The Blackhill Empire is too weak, especially their king. He is indecisive and suspicious. I assisted him for 79 years, but he wanted to kill me without hesitation. If it weren’t for my great luck... Hahaha, we’re finally attacking the Blackhill Empire. I’m looking forward to the day when they are dumbfounded.”","“The Blackhill Empire is bound to lose.”","“Enter combat mode.” Ke Zhan checked the time and ordered the fleet to prepare for battle.","Weapons came out of the spaceships one after another. The pitch-black muzzles were reflecting a terrifying light.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The enemy fleet appeared in front of them.","“How, how is that possible?”","Ke Zhan’s expression changed drastically. “It’s the Sacred Wolf Mountain’s fleet!”","“Oh no!”","The control room suddenly fell into silence. It was so quiet that one’s breathing could be heard.","After a moment of silence, many people started to panic.","“Why is the Sacred Wolf Mountain here?”","“What are they doing here? It’s over. We’re doomed!”","“The attack of the Sacred Wolf Mountain definitely represents the three sects’ will. What should we do? What should we do?”","While everyone was panicking, a firm voice was heard.","“We’ll fight!”","It was Ke Zhan who shouted, “We have no way out. Let’s fight. If we win, we’ll run far away. If we lose, at worst, we’ll all be dead.”","“That’s right, there’s no way out.”","“Prepare for battle. Sacred Wolf Mountain, I’d like to see what you’ve got!”","“Kill them!”","Once again, the control room was filled with fighting spirit.","But the next blow soo came.","“Look, look ahead!”","A thousand-foot-tall silver mecha appeared in the void, and a figure in white slowly floated into it.","“It’s the Fifth Heavenly King of the Sacred Wolf Mountain.”","As Ke Zhan spoke, he closed his eyes.","Zi Yan couldn’t help but look up at the screen. A series of information flashed across her mind.","The Mountain Lord of the Sacred Wolf Mountain was a super expert at the Tribulation Stage First Tier. He had six Heavenly Kings under his command, each of whom was at the Peak Stage of the Mastery Realm.","It was the Fifth Heavenly King who had arrived, which put Zi Yan under a lot of pressure.","“He’s in the Mastery Realm. I’m far from being a match for him.”","But she didn’t say anything to show her attitude.","She had to pretend to be strong.","Without ZhangHan by her side, she gritted her teeth and decided to continue to act as a cold-blooded empress."]},{"number":1441,"title":"Chapter 1441 The Reappearance of the Clown","paragraphs":["Chapter 1441 The Reappearance of the Clown","“Let’s run.”","Ke Zhan said powerlessly, “We can’t fight anymore. The large-scale dispatch of troops by the three sects represents their stand. Just the Blackhill Empire alone wouldn’t get to ask for Fifth Heavenly King’s help.”","“All we can do is run.”","Someone said, “If we can escape, it will be our best ending.”","“But guys, look around!”","A high-position official’s voice was full of fear.","At first glance, they saw the ones of the Sacred Wolf Mountain in front of them and a fleet in the distance behind those people.","It was the Blackhill Empire’s fleet.","There were other fleets of the Black Mountain Empire in all four directions. Without a doubt, the crowd had been besieged.","“Alert, space turbulence interference.","“Alert, space magnetic force interference.","“Alert, unable to jump into the secondary space.","“Alert...”","A series of alarm sounds that made people desperate rang out.","Zi Yan closed her eyes, feeling helpless and powerless, but her tone was extremely cold.","She said indifferently, “Retreat according to the original route.”","Zi Yan’s words could stabilize the morale of the army.","“Retreat!”","Ke Zhan gritted his teeth and gave the order.","As their fleet moved, the silver mecha in the distance also flew over quickly. It seemed that the Fifth Heavenly King was about to take the lead in the charge.","“Open the defensive ring.”","Countless fleets gathered to form a formation. The energy cabins were activated and the defensive barriers were activated.","At this moment, the enemy ships in many directions began to suppress Zi Yan’s fleet with firepower.","Endless artillery blasts bombarded the defensive barrier.","This was a war of attrition, and it was obviously very difficult for the Purple Moon Empire to evacuate.","Fortunately, more than a thousand of their spaceships were high-end ones from the Astral Domain, so their defense was very strong. They also had thousands of medium-sized spaceships waiting for orders in their rear.","“Get more reinforcements!”","After Ke Zhan gave the other, his men replied, “Sir, the fleet in the rear has been attacked... AHH!”","With a loud boom, the communication was cut off.","The faces of all the people present gradually darkened.","“We’re doomed. DOOMED.”","“Even if we jump into the secondary space, which is something that we can’t achieve, we will still be hunted down.”","“Escaping is just too difficult.”","“We shouldn’t have expanded so unscrupulously. We should have followed the prescribed order and received the approval of the three great sects to develop.”","It seemed that some people were going to complain.","At this moment, the morale had started to be undermined.","Zi Yan said in a cold voice, “Open the cabin door.”","The cabin door opened, and under everyone’s gaze, a stream of light quickly flashed past.","“What is this?”","A little penguin happily walked to the gate.","It was cute, but at this time, no one cared about how it looked.","But everyone also knew this little creature might have some ability. Otherwise, why would Moon Empress release it?","“Murmur. Murmur.”","Tiny Tot cried out twice and walked out in a wobbly manner. Just like that, it followed the corridor to the end. When the outer cabin door opened, it jumped out.","“Coo!”","It was as if a soul cry was reverberating in the starry sky.","Boundless black light began to appear, blocking the besieging energy.","A crack was created.","“Let’s run!”","“This is great!”","“Run now!”","“What’s this big guy?”","Everyone present was stunned.","Even the silver mecha that was charging forward was shocked.","...","After seeing it clearly, the Fifth Heavenly King gasped.","“Is, is this a Roc? A young Roc! Hahaha, a young Roc, and it’s alive! We must catch it!”","He could only watch as a piece of the blockade was swallowed up and a crack appeared.","The hundreds of high-end spaceships of the Purple Moon Empire crossed the exit and jumped into the secondary space to escape.","“Lock on to the target. Go after them!”","The Fifth Heavenly King retrieved his mecha and returned to the spaceship in a flash. A hunting had begun.","“Leave the secondary space.”","Ke Zhan said hurriedly, “Inform all the rear troops to evacuate and announce the route in the schedule.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The fleet jumped out of the secondary space and got back in less than five seconds after the message was sent.","They had to make full use of every second.","...","As soon as they jumped into the secondary space, the huge fleet that had been going after them also appeared in this void. Then, the fleet jumped into the secondary spatial space and chased after them relentlessly.","According to the escape route, they would travel from the border area to the other side of the Ocean Astral Domain and then set foot on the way to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.","Originally, it would have only taken them a little time, but now, the situation was not so optimistic.","“At this rate, we’ll be caught within ten days. I’m afraid they’ll send someone to ambush us in advance.”","A trace of worry appeared on Ke Zhan’s face.","One good thing was that the enemy didn’t know their escape route, so it would be hard for the other party to ambush them in advance.","Even so, they had to think of a way within the next ten days. At the very least, they needed to stall the pursuers.","One day, two days, three days had passed...","On the tenth day.","“Alert. A magnetic force explosion is happening. The spaceships are about to jump out of the secondary space.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","When the fleet jumped out of the secondary space, the crowd suddenly found that two enemy fleets were already awaiting them.","Endless firepower, along with all kinds of besiege moves, came at them.","Only five seconds later, the army chasing after them appeared in the starry sky.","“We’re doomed!”","“Let’s fight. Fight to the death!”","“Let’s try to escape. Moon Empress will take us to escape.”","The battle had begun.","The cultivation of the Fifth Heavenly King was matchless, and no one on Zi Yan’s side could resist his attacks.","With just one move, the Fifth Heavenly King controlled the huge mecha and immediately destroyed a spaceship with his broadsword. He held the broadsword in his right hand, and with every wave, he could destroy a spaceship.","At this rate, he would not be able to kill more than a thousand spaceships.","The atmosphere of despair and fear was spreading.","“What should we do?”","Many people were asking Zi Yan.","“What should we do?”","The Fifth Heavenly King was in the Peak Stage of the Mastery Realm, and he was so much more powerful than them.","Only at this moment did they realize that in the eyes of the three sects, destroying some faction from the outer regions was as easy as crushing an ant for them.","The Fifth Heavenly King said coldly, “Hand over the Roc and I’ll spare your lives.”","“Moon Empress, if we hand over that Roc, we won’t have to die!”","Some people began to try to persuade Zi Yan.","They earnestly advised, “As long as there is life, there is hope. If we hand over that Roc, we can even build a good relationship with the Fifth Heavenly King and develop our force here. Isn’t it better than going to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven?”","“That’s right. If we have the protection of the Fifth Heavenly King, the Blackhill Empire wouldn’t dare to oppose us. In fact, they would even hand over an enormous territory.”","“Moon Empress, that’s just a spirit beast. Hand it over.”","In the face of these voices that disturbed her, Zi Yan was a little tired.","She didn’t want to think too much. She didn’t want Tiny Tot to be handed over.","However, if they refused to hand it over, her subordinates would die.","As for her, what would happen to her if she was caught by the Fifth Heavenly King and her appearance was exposed to the public?","Whether the Fifth Heavenly King bestowed on her the title of his concubine or gave her to the others, Zi Yan would not be willing to take it, even if she would get killed for her resistance.","After thinking about it for a while, she found that she was running out of options.","“Honey, what should I do?”","Zi Yan gently bit her lower lip.","Just as she was at a loss.","Just as everyone thought that the Purple Moon Empire was about to be destroyed.","Just as the Fifth Heavenly King felt that he was going to get a young Roc.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The vast starry sky around them seemed to have been blown by the wind.","Wisps of light black smoke suddenly appeared. Gradually, the mist became extremely large as it kept growing bigger. It seemed to be a space turbulence.","“Hmm?”","The Fifth Heavenly King stopped, turned around, and looked over with sharp eyes.","Many warships stopped attacking. While besieging the fleet of the Purple Moon Empire, they were also on guard.","Suddenly, the black mist that filled the sky turned into a huge figure.","“What’s that?”","It was a demonic figure.","All of a sudden, the black mist kept surging, and the area expanded ten times over as if it was going to cover all the spaceships present.","Unexpectedly, a clown mask appeared out of the black mist.","“Demonic Ghost King Clown?”","Zi Yan’s face changed.","The Demonic Ghost King Clown, who had caused a sensation in the Sea Dragon Star Area back then, had actually appeared in the Ocean Astral Domain.","Its size, as well as the size and aura of the black fog, became much larger.","Zi Yan was very clear that this was the Dark Mask, a Profound-grade treasure that her husband had once possessed.","As for the Demonic Ghost King Clown, it was Ding Jiuming, who had sold his soul to the devil.","“Tsk, tsk...”","His hoarse laughter made people shudder in fear.","“Who are you?” The Fifth Heavenly King’s voice was clear and bright, not showing any fear.","“You can call me Lord Demonic Ghost King.”","“Hah.” The Fifth Heavenly King sneered. “You don’t deserve that title.”","“You are very confident,” the clown said in a hoarse voice. “I am going to devour you.”","Clatter!","In the black mist, thousands of spaceships slowly revealed their full appearances.","These spaceships that the Demonic Ghost King Clown had controlled and used as bases were still useful.","With stunning brilliance, endless firepower was pressing down on the Fifth Heavenly King’s fleet.","At the same time, countless Yin Spirits that had been refined also launched attacks.","Many people were under attack.","A powerful demonic sound instantly gave tens of thousands of people headaches.","“Kill him!”","The Fifth Heavenly King’s face was gloomy. He sent someone to fight against the clown while he went straight to Zi Yan.","He was willing to pay any price to obtain that young Roc.","At first, he didn’t take the Demonic Ghost King Clown seriously. He sensed that this thing’s strength wasn’t too high.","Unexpectedly, none of his subordinates were able to defeat the clown.","“My Lord, save us!”","“Please help me, milord.”","Many of his men and spaceships were pulled back by the black mist.","The Fifth Heavenly King’s face darkened when he saw this.","“God damn it!”","He faced the clown and charged straight over. At the same time, he ordered, “Continue to besiege the Purple Moon Empire.”","“Coo!”","Right at this moment, Tiny Tot appeared again. With a shocking roar, it swallowed up the blockade, leaving a huge gap in it.","Zi Yan’s fleet once again fled into the secondary space.","“Go after them!”","The Fifth Heavenly King was about to go mad with anger. He had waited so long for the chance to get a Roc to come.","If Zi Yan’s fleet escaped in the secondary space like this, he didn’t know when he would get to attack them again.","“Go to hell!”","With hatred in his heart, he struck out and destroyed 30% of the power of the clown’s shadow with two moves.","It was quite powerful for a Peak-Stage Mastery Realm master.","“Tsk, tsk...”","The Demonic Ghost King Clown laughed in a low voice, and the black mist slowly dissipated.","He drifted away, but he had also lost a lot of energy.","“Go get them!”","The Fifth Heavenly King was so angry that his face turned pale. After saying that, he put away his mecha and returned to the king vessel.","A new round of pursuit began. This time, however, the Fifth Heavenly King knew that it seemed to be a war of attrition.","The one with more crystal stones and more powerful spaceships would be the winner.","It was just a tug-of-war. He didn’t care if the hunting would take a year or so.","The process was not important, and he only needed a satisfactory result."]},{"number":1442,"title":"Chapter 1442 The Limitless Sect","paragraphs":["Chapter 1442 The Limitless Sect","In the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.","It took Zhang Han and his companions a month to get to the other end of the Astral Domain.","“That’s the disadvantage of being in the territory of the Four Great Sects. There are many places where there are restrictions on flights,” Grand Master Chu said. “Otherwise, with the speed of the Thunder Snake, we would have been able to arrive in ten days.”","“It will be much better after we leave the Astral Domain,” Zhang Han said.","What Grand Master Chu meant by advancing at a high speed was flying three times faster than their current speed, but it meant flying ten times faster than their current speed to Zhang Han after they left the Astral Domain and fly in the Barren Astral Area.","But the others didn’t know that.","“If we leave the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven, we’ll encounter too many adverse environments and Starry Sky Beasts in the Barren Star Area,” Grand Master Chu said. “Big Brother, do you have any ideas?”","“Let’s go to the Flowing Astral Domain first.” Zhang Han glanced at them and said, “There is no Space Passage between Astral Domains, but there are many images of the ones that have been there before. I set up a Cosmos Formation according to three hundred Star Maps. Nothing but an extremely adverse environment will stop us.”","The Cosmos Formation required a lot of things, but the most important thing was the Seven-star Sword, which had the power of the starry sky.","Without the Seven-star Sword, he wouldn’t be able to set up the formation.","At the edge of the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven, after resting for half a day, Zhang Han processed the spaceship. In addition to the most important Cosmos Formation, there were also several defensive formations. The spaceship was fully armed.","“We’re too fully prepared.” Grand Master Chu scratched his head when he saw this. “But do we need to do this? A normal flight will take us at most ten days or half a month. Using so many spirit treasures...”","He felt that it was a bit wasteful.","“I have to get there as soon as possible.” Zhang Han sighed softly. He looked at the distant starry sky and seemed to be talking to himself, “She is still waiting for me.”","It was just a waste of some resources, so it didn’t matter to him.","“Let’s go.”","Zhang Han and Grand Master Chu got into the spaceship.","“Daddy, are we going to set off now?” Mengmeng blinked and looked around.","She didn’t feel that their current flight was any special, which was the same as the flights in the Sea Dragon Star Area.","Mu Xue leaned back in her chair and said, “Master, do you want to have tea? I’ll make you some.”","“No, thanks.” Zhang Han shook his head and stroked Mengmeng’s head. “We’re about to set off. This flight is estimated to take us a month to reach the Flowing Astral Domain.”","While they were talking, Chu Qingyi came over from behind and said, “Master, all the energy cabins have been refilled with top-grade crystals.”","“What?”","Grand Master Chu’s eyes widened. “This, this is too wasteful, Big Brother. Using only top-grade crystals to refill the cabins is great consumption.”","A top-grade crystal stone was equivalent to 10,000 low-grade ones.","There were a total of 18 energy cabins in the spaceship. How many crystal stones would it cost to fill all of them?","Just thinking about it made him astonished.","“Yeah. Master, aren’t energy cabins usually filled with Energy Stones? What’s the benefit of using top-grade crystal stones other than good low-grade ones?” Mu Xue asked curiously.","“Energy Stones are suitable for a normal flight while the energy circulation will be much slower during a battle. Low-grade crystals can improve the spaceship’s speed and motive power. While using top-grade crystals, the energy can be very strong and stable, which won’t cause a negative impact on the fuel consumption of the energy cabins. For example, if we use Energy Stones, we can advance five miles in a second while we can cover 50 miles using low-grade crystal stones and over 1,000 miles using top-grade ones. The differences between them are great. If we don’t use top-grade crystal stones, we won’t be able to reach the Flowing Astral Domain within a month.”","“What...” Grand Master Chu seemed to have realized something. “Big Brother, do you mean that we need to go to the other side of the Flowing Astral Domain?”","“That’s right.”","Zhang Han nodded.","Grand Master Chu gasped. “That’s incredible.”","The distance between the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven and the Flowing Astral Domain wasn’t too far. A normal flight between the two places would take two to three months.","However, by doing that, one would only reach the edge of the Flowing Astral Domain. It would take four to five months to reach the core of the Flowing Astral Domain, and another four to five months to get to the other side. In other words, it would normally take a year for one to reach the other side of the Flowing Astral Domain from the place where Zhang Han’s group was currently at.","And it would only take Zhang Han one month to fly there.","This was an extremely incredible speed.","All of a sudden, Grand Master was amazed by Zhang Han’s means.","“If that’s the case, it really isn’t a waste of resources,” Grand Master Chu finally said.","Swoosh!","A second later, the Thunder Snake entered the secondary space and began its journey.","One day, two days... twenty days later.","“Daddy, is this how people fly in the Cultivation World? We stay in the spaceship all the time and then go out when we arrive at our destination,” Mengmeng asked.","“That’s what people mostly do on the way.” Zhang Han nodded. “The universe is very large. We don’t know where the edge is, and we can’t see anything else on the way. Some Star Areas are so barren that there’s nothing in them. The Human Clan only occupies a small part of the Cultivation World, so there’s nothing to see on ordinary trips.”","“Are we just going to fly around like this?” Mengmeng looked around.","“Not really. Sometimes, we’ll encounter rare Starry Sky Beasts. Not all of them are fierce. Some feed on the energy of heaven and earth and don’t want to fight. They won’t pay attention to others even if a group of people passes by.”","“I’ll show you an example.”","Zhang Han thought for a moment and had the spaceship slow down. They could leave the secondary space at any time while detecting some external energy.","After half an hour.","“Capture the images outside.”","Zhang Han gave the order to the system.","The spaceship’s speed slowed down a little.","The scene outside was shown on the screen.","In the void of the universe, an incomparably huge whirlpool of seawater was spinning rapidly in front of them, like a hurricane.","...","Above the whirlpool, lightning flashed and thunder rumbled, great waves overflowing into the heavens.","Zhang Han said, “This is the terrible environment in the starry sky.","“If it weren’t for the spirit formation I set up in advance, we wouldn’t have been able to pass through this region. Judging from the size of the whirlpool, it will take us at least a month to make a detour.”","“Why will it take so long?” Mengmeng said, “We can reach the Flowing Astral Domain in a month. Why will it take us more than a month to leave this big whirlpool?”","Grand Master Chu said with a smile, “Young miss, you’ve got it wrong. If this were a normal flight, it would take us at least a year to get to the Flowing Astral Domain. Since we’re not taking a normal flight, we can advance very fast. What Big Brother means is that it would take one a month to avoid this kind of big whirlpool while flying in the void instead of the secondary space.”","“That’s right.” Zhang Han nodded. “In fact, there are opportunities in such a large-scale adverse environment. Maybe there are some secret realms in it. If we fly in the void, we would need to observe, and it’s easy to encounter an energy storm in the secondary space, which would be dangerous. We have the Seven-star Sword and the Cosmos Formation, so we can avoid the influence of this environment and travel across the secondary space.”","After Zhang Han finished speaking, the spaceship sped up a little while surrounded by the energy of the Cosmos Formation.","The spaceship entered the whirlpool of the sea and passed through it.","Five days later.","“Look over there, the two clans of Starry Sky Beasts are fighting.”","The spaceship slowed down and caught sight of the fierce battle between the two clans.","...","Tens of millions of Starry Sky Beasts were engaged in fierce battles.","The scene was truly shocking.","After a few days, the energy cabins were operating at a high speed, so the spaceship needed adjustment.","“Take a rest for half a day. Xue, go and replenish the crystal stones in the energy cabins,” Zhang Han said.","“Okay.”","Mu Xue immediately set off to replenish the crystal stones.","There were several planets nearby. Judging from the pictures captured by the spaceship, the scenery there was quite good.","But Zhang Han did not rest.","He walked into a room.","“Blood Source Incantation!”","Once again, he performed the seal on his palm with all his strength.","Three silky threads were in the same direction, and the fourth crimson thread was indistinct.","This thread was intermittent, which represented Zhang Mu.","“Grandpa is not close to us.","“I didn’t sense it clearly before, but now it seems that they are in the same Astral Domain.”","Zhang Han let out a sigh of relief.","After half a day.","“There is no other way.”","Zhang Han said, “It will take us about three months to arrive at the next Astral Domain.”","...","This journey was not as fast as before for Mengmeng.","Sometimes, she would be anxious. “Why haven’t we found Mummy yet? Why aren’t we there yet? She must have been waiting too long.” She was often worried and anxious, so of course, she would be upset.","In the past few months, Mengmeng would either be cultivating or staying with Zhang Han.","Grand Master Chu and the other two cultivated all day.","Time flew when they were busy.","Three months passed in the blink of an eye.","When they reached the edge of the Astral Domain, it took them another two months to cross it.","After Zhang Han sensed their surroundings, it took them two months to reach another Astral Domain. Then, they spent another month crossing the Astral Domain.","At this time, they had already spent nine months on their journey.","Zhang Han once again cast the Blood Source Incantation.","“We’re close!","“We’re very close!”","He was a little anxious and excited.","“I’m finally going to see Ma’am,” Mu Xue said.","“Let’s go now so that I can see Mummy soon.” Mengmeng couldn’t wait.","“Okay, let’s go. Our next stop will be the Strange Wind Astral Domain.”","This time, the distance they needed to travel was not very long.","Because between the two Astral Domains, there was a Space Passage, which was a very safe place. There were even several planets with supplies.","It only took them twenty days to reach the Strange Wind Astral Domain.","After another ten days, they arrived at the center of the Astral Domain.","The edge of the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven was a place like the Sea Dragon Star Area.","When people talked about the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven, they usually meant its central region. Other places in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven, such as Heavenly Dragon Star Province, would be referred to respectively.","After Zhang Han and his group arrived at the central area of the Strange Wind Astral Domain.","“Two of our guys are here.”","Zhang Han sensed the Blood Source Incantation and directly controlled the spaceship to head for the destination.","“Our goal is the Orloff Star.”","Everyone had a clear division of labor.","Grand Master Chu inquired about the basic information of the Astral Domain, the major forces, and so on.","Chu Qingyi and Mu Xue inquired about the situation on the Orloff Star.","Mengmeng was sitting next to them, waiting.","“The Orloff Star is the home planet of the Limitless Sect. No one is allowed to enter without the identity of an inner-door disciple or an invitation,” Chu Qingyi said.","“That’s not correct.”","Mu Xue suddenly said, “The Limitless Sect is holding an auction that would be held every 100 years. It’s very popular. It’s free to enter their space station recently, so everyone can go there to participate in the auction. The Auction City is open to the public. The restriction Chu Qingyi just mentioned has been removed in the Auction City. We can’t come and go freely in other places, but we can do that in the Auction City.","“The Sect Leader of the Limitless Sect is called Fu Yangtian. He has a very high status in the Strange Wind Astral Domain. It is said that his strength is at the Last Stage of the Mastery Realm, which is the same for most of the Sect Leaders of the major sects in this Astral Domain. There are some at the Peak Stage, but there aren’t any in the Tribulation Realm. Even if there are, they have gone to other places for further development.”","The Strange Wind Astral Domain was not big, even a little small, but its overall strength was not low. Grand Master Chu’s face froze a bit.","“The situation we’re facing is not great. We will still need to count on Big Brother. Shit, he’s not in a good state now.","“Looks like we’ll have to keep a low profile.”"]},{"number":1443,"title":"Chapter 1443 Murderous Intent","paragraphs":["Chapter 1443 Murderous Intent","Eight passageways at the space station were exclusive for the people who came for the auction.","Zhang Han and his group waited in line while taking a sightseeing aircraft.","After the inspection, the staff let them pass. They arrived at the Auction City according to the route in midair arranged by the Limitless Sect.","“This city is very large.”","Mu Xue looked around and said, “The tallest disc building in the central area must be the auction house, right?”","It was a city full of science and technology. There were many intelligent machines cleaning or patrolling the streets and alleys, serving everyone.","Many pedestrians could also be seen on the main streets.","There were many hotels and buildings, and many aircraft were shuttling back and forth along the designed routes.","It was a very lively and bustling scene.","“According to the information I read just now, every auction is a great gathering of the Limitless Sect, which is very famous in the Strange Wind Astral Domain. Moreover, the Limitless Sect would take out some precious treasures every time, including several kinds of eighth-tier spirit treasures,” Chu Qingyi said. “Some other sects would also send their men over to auction some spirit treasures, and the most famous one was a ninth-tier gem. In the end, it was bought by a big sect at a high price.”","“Hahaha, spirit treasures are nothing to Big Brother,” said Grand Master Chu with a loud laugh.","“We’re still short of treasures now.” Mengmeng muttered, “Especially spiritual herbs.”","She seemed to be reminding him that he should pay Zhang Han some protection money.","Grand Master Chu didn’t say anything. He provided a lot of spiritual herbs for Zhang Han as well as issued a reward. The Chu family, the Taoist Lord of Azurepeak, and Old Taoist Honghu also spent a lot of crystal stones on putting out a bounty.","“Let’s find a hotel to stay in for now,” Zhang Han said.","“I’ll do it.”","Mu Xue nodded. She was in charge of various logistic work including serving tea to Zhang Han.","After a while, Mu Xue found a hotel. It was a cylindrical skyscraper.","Everyone had booked a room, which was full of a sense of technology.","After they checked in, Zhang Han sat in his room.","He sat on the sofa and closed his eyes.","His mind was constantly focused on the red seal on his palm.","“Blood Source Incantation!”","Clatter!","Two red threads, which were much brighter than before, flashed away in his perception.","“Daddy!”","Mengmeng, Grand Master Chu, and the others entered the room.","“Master, is there any news?” Mu Xue asked.","“Yes.”","Zhang Han nodded slightly and said, “They’re in a place quite far away. Let’s rest for three hours, and then we’ll set off.”","“Okay.”","They waited in silence for three hours.","Zhang Han got everything ready in an orderly manner.","He once again sensed the seal of the Blood Source Incantation.","“Let’s wait for now.”","Zhang Han frowned slightly and said, “The seal is moving. Judging from the direction... they may also come here. Let’s wait and see first.”","“Will they come here?” Grand Master Chu thought for a moment and said, “I guess they will. The people of the Limitless Sect definitely don’t want to miss this auction. It won’t be long. The auction will start in three days.”","“Yeah.”","Zhang Han nodded slightly.","Time passed slowly while they were waiting.","But the good news was that when Zhang Han sensed again that night, the distance was getting closer and closer.","Their guys were very likely to be in the Auction City.","The next day.","There were still two more days before the auction.","Zhang Han could finally clearly feel the source of energy.","“They’ve entered the city!”","Zhang Han suddenly got up.","The crowd quickly went out and took a small-scale aircraft to the Auction City.","They moved very fast on the streets.","Finally, they arrived in front of a manor’s main entrance.","The manor was called King Luo Dong’s Mansion.","“You are not allowed to enter without an invitation letter.”","As soon as Zhang Han and the others got close, they were stopped.","There were a total of eight guards at the gate of King Luo Dong’s Mansion, who were all dressed in armor and looked very well-organized.","...","“Tell King Luo Dong that an old friend has come to visit,” Zhang Han said flatly.","As soon as he said that, the expression of the captain of the guards changed slightly. However, the guards still stop them. “His Grace is busy. If you want to visit him, please contact King Luo Dong after the auction.”","“Hmm?”","Grand Master Chu frowned and used his power of the Mastery Realm to cover that place.","The leading guard’s face changed.","He was sure that the other party was in the Mastery Realm with such overwhelming power.","However, he was unable to tell exactly how powerful Zhang Han and his group were.","After hesitating for a while, he finally said, “Milords, please wait a moment. I’ll go and ask His Grace for further instructions right away.”","As he spoke, he turned and left in a hurry.","Zhang Han and the others were waiting here.","“Big Brother, do you know King Luo Dong?” Grand Master Chu asked via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","...","“No, I don’t,” Zhang Han replied.","Grand Master Chu sighed in his heart. “Big Brother indeed has the power to come straight to someone he doesn’t know.”","In fact, Zhang Han had heard from Mu Xue that King Luo Dong’s Mansion was the residence of Luo Dong, the First Elder and one of the main figures of the Limitless Sect.","No matter what, since Zhang Han already knew that their guys were in there, he would use the simplest method to get in and talk.","In the Strange Wind Astral Domain, the ones in the Mastery Realm were not little people but elites at the top.","Therefore, a few minutes later, the captain of the guards came out of the mansion and said, “Milords, please come in.","“His Grace is busy with some private matters. Please wait for a few moments. You can have some tea and rest here.”","Zhang Han and the others were arranged to stay in a hall.","After about half an hour, an old man with sharp eyebrows and small eyes came to them. He gave off a very fierce sensation.","King Luo Dong looked them up and down before he asked, “Who are you?”","“We’re here to look for two people. They’re in your mansion,” Zhang Han replied calmly.","Zhang Han’s combat capability was higher than his cultivation level, which was the Void-refining Realm, but he was far inferior to the Mastery Realm masters.","As for King Luo Dong, he was a cultivator in the Middle Stage of Mastery. It was said that his combat capability was comparable to that of some cultivators at the Last Stage of Mastery Realm, and he was very powerful and had a prominent status in the Strange Wind Astral Domain.","“Hahaha.”","King Luo Dong laughed. “Who do you think you are? Do you think that you can look for someone as you please?”","There was a questioning tone in his voice.","But he was also on the alert. “Who on earth are these people?","“Where are they from?” He couldn’t sense anything unusual from Zhang Han’s group. “There is a master in the Mastery Realm among them. They’re not here to make trouble, are they? Are they really here to find someone?”","All kinds of questions popped up in King Luo Dong’s mind.","Clatter!","Without saying a word, Zhang Han directly took out more than 50 crystal stones, which were the Thunder Yang Crystals.","“Supreme-grade crystal stones?”","King Luo Dong’s pupils contracted.","It was obvious that the other party was not an ordinary person to possess supreme-grade crystal stones.","Swoosh!","Zhang Han put away the crystal stones and said, “I’ll take them away when I find them. The crystal stones will be yours.”","“Okay.”","King Luo Dong did not hesitate.","Dozens of top-grade crystals were of great value and use, especially great for collection. After all, supreme-grade crystals were so rare that they were almost impossible to find.","“Guys, bring all the people in the mansion here.” King Luo Dong waved his hand.","“No need to do that. I’ll find them myself,” Zhang Han said.","He was always calm, which confused King Luo Dong.","But he was very disgusted with this, and he began to dislike Zhang Han.","However, for the sake of the supreme-grade crystal stones, he could endure it.","King Luo Dong got up and walked forward silently. When he reached the gate, he paused for a moment and then asked Zhang Han and the others to walk beside him.","“You can look for your men in the mansion, but I’ll keep these crystal stones no matter whether you’ll get to find them or not,” King Luo Dong said with a faint smile.","“Okay.”","Zhang Han agreed without any hesitation.","After sensing the seal of the Blood Source Incantation, he noticed that two threads were connected to the backyard in his mind.","He walked straight through the path, the pond, and the edge of the martial arts practice field.","When he saw the scene clearly, Zhang Han’s face suddenly changed.","He was panting, and his eyes were filled with killing intent.","As if he couldn’t hide it anymore, he closed his eyes.","“Grandpa, Grandma!”","Mengmeng exclaimed and ran over.","When King Luo Dong looked at Mengmeng’s figure, his eyes were filled with surprise.","The young girl seemed to be to his liking.","Under everyone’s gaze.","Next to the martial arts practice field, Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali were standing beside a huge stone pillar with flames burning on its surface.","They were both injured. Their faces were pale, and their breaths were in disorder. Chains were tied to their feet, which made them look like prisoners. The chains, which should have been brown, were slightly red under the flaming stone pillar. The temperature was obviously high.","Seeing this, Zhang Han could not hide the anger in his heart at all.","“Humph!”","Grand Master Chu snorted coldly. As if he could not suppress his aura, he looked at King Luo Dong with sharp eyes.","However, King Luo Dong didn’t care about it at all. He observed very carefully. Through some reactions, he felt that the most powerful one among these people was the old man in the Mastery Realm, who was very likely to be in the Early Stage.","He ignored Grand Master Chu and continued to observe Zhang Han. The only person he was uncertain about was this man.","If he had known Zhang Han’s cultivation level, he would have already robbed the crystal stones.","Now he guessed that these people couldn’t suppress his strength, but he still had fear of the forces behind them. If they had amazing backgrounds, he would have to wait and see.","“Han, Mengmeng.”","Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali’s consciousness was a little blurred at first, and they didn’t come to their senses until Mengmeng approached them. They couldn’t help but be surprised.","Mengmeng cried. She held the two of them in her arms and controlled the Dark Cold Fire to expel the heat of the chains.","“Here are the crystal stones. Now I’ll take my guys away.”","Zhang Han spoke very slowly. He was afraid that he could not suppress his killing intent. He knew that he had to stay rational, at least in King Luo Dong’s Mansion. He had to calm down.","“So you want these two people?”","King Luo Dong narrowed his eyes and said, “Do you know how big a mistake they have made?”","Zhang Han didn’t respond.","“What mistake did they commit that made you punish them like this?” Mu Xue said with a cold face.","“Hahaha.”","Mu Xue looked quite pretty to her. He did not show any anger in the face of her unfriendly attitude.","He said indifferently, “I was refining the most important treasures, which I had accumulated for many years. I wanted to get the ninth-tier spiritual Qi, but they suddenly interrupted me. It cost me so many spiritual treasures. How much do you think they should pay for me before I can let them go?”","“What?!”","Chu Qingyi’s expression changed slightly. “You can’t refine a ninth-tier spirit treasure. You’re demanding an exorbitant price!”","Mu Xue echoed, “Ninth-tier spirit treasures are so rare. How could they be casually refined?”","Swoosh!","King Luo Dong’s face darkened slightly. He stared straight at Chu Qingyi. A wave of soul power pervaded the air. His voice turned cold.","“Do you think this is a place where you can be presumptuous? If you say more bullshit, I’ll kill you!”"]},{"number":1444,"title":"Chapter 1444 Blowing Up the Auction City","paragraphs":["Chapter 1444 Blowing Up the Auction City","“How much do you want before you can let them go?” Grand Master Chu said, suppressing the anger in his heart.","“I’m not giving you the exact number. As long as it’s satisfactory, you can take them away,” said King Luo Dong.","“A kind of ninth-tier spirit treasure and 10 kinds of eighth-tier spirit treasures.” Zhang Han suddenly turned around.","“Okay. Give me,” King Luo Dong immediately said.","If the other party could really take out so many treasures and had a powerful background, he would have to be careful in the future. However, he had never thought about letting Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali go for no good reason.","What he said was true, but what he had tried to refine was an eighth-tier spirit treasure instead of a ninth-tier one. He deliberately said that in order to ask for more spirit treasures.","“You can have them after the auction.”","Without saying more, Zhang Han waved his hand and took out dozens of supreme-grade Thunder Yang Crystals. “These are the interest. Before I come back, I don’t want to see my guys get hurt. If they are still the same as today, I will kill you and make the entire Limitless Sect your burial objects.”","“What did you say?” King Luo Dong asked with a frown.","He was even more uncertain about the background of the other party, but the crystal stones Zhang Han offered were real. He waved his hand, withdrew the flame pillar at the edge of the field, and then cast a restriction to suppress Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali.","At the same time, he said lightly, “That little girl will stay behind as the deposit before you return.”","“Are you fucking risking your neck?” Grand Master Chu was furious, and his aura soared.","The field turned silent.","Three seconds later, King Luo Dong chuckled and said, “I was just kidding. You don’t have to take it seriously. I’ll wait for you to pick these people up after the auction.”","Zhang Han gave him a meaningful look, turned his head, and looked at his parents.","Zhang Guangyou wanted to smile, but his facial muscles seemed to hurt a little. He twitched the corner of his mouth a few times, shook his head slightly, and motioned for Zhang Han not to be impulsive.","Rong Jiali silently looked at Zhang Han with the same expression.","They didn’t say anything, but Zhang Han realized their intentions.","Swoosh!","Zhang Han turned around and walked away.","Grand Master Chu glared at King Luo Dong fiercely.","Mengmeng’s eyes were filled with resentment as she looked at King Luo Dong with hatred.","However, she received a frivolous look from him.","On this day, they came to King Luo Dong’s Mansion. Instead of picking Zhang Han’s parents up, they saw the last scene they wanted to see.","Zhang Han’s heart ached, and he blamed himself. He was angry, but he was powerless. He did not have the power to fight against King Luo Dong head-on.","After leaving King Luo Dong’s Mansion, they went back to the hotel without saying a word.","Zhang Han’s voice was a little hoarse when he said, “Give all your crystal stones and spiritual treasures to me.”","“Okay.”","All the people, including Grand Master Chu, took out their Space Rings and handed them to Zhang Han.","Zhang Han directly took away all the crystal stones, leaving behind a lot of top-grade crystal stones. He also took their gems, Formation Stones, and so on.","He returned the Space Rings to them. Each of the rings contained a lot of medium-grade and low-grade crystal stones.","At the same time, he listed a series of names with a pellet formula.","“Buy these things.”","Grand Master Chu was experienced and knowledgeable. After he read the list for a moment, his expression changed slightly. “So many? Big Brother, do you want to... blow up King Luo Dong’s Mansion?”","Zhang Han’s face darkened slightly. He looked out of the window at the scenery outside and said in a low and hoarse voice, “I’ll blow up the Auction City.”","If they were to blow up King Luo Dong’s Mansion, King Luo Dong would definitely be on guard.","However, they would have a higher chance of success to blow up the Auction City.","Since ancient times, the rage of a monarch would cause a bloody scene.","Zhang Han’s anger would not be easily quelled.","At the same time.","In the martial practice field of King Luo Dong’s Mansion.","King Luo Dong stood in the distance, looking at Zhang Guangyou and his wife with indifferent and even contemptuous eyes.","“That man just now is your son?” he asked.","Neither Zhang Guangyou nor Rong Jiali answered.","“Haha, you’re really stubborn.”","A dark-colored whip appeared in King Luo Dong’s right hand, which was only one meter long.","Smack!","When he swung it, the whip drew out a green glow. When it struck their bodies, it did not cause any physical pain, but rather, pain to their souls.","He was whipping their souls.","Seeing the pained looks on their faces, King Luo Dong seemed to feel much better.","After dozens of whips, he withdrew the whip.","“I’d like to see if he can take out those spirit treasures.”","When he turned around and left, the giant flame rock appeared again, suppressing the two people. It seemed that the temperature was much higher than before.","“Can you hold on?” Zhang Guangyou asked in a hoarse voice.","...","“Yes.”","“Han will save us after we hold on for a few days.”","“Yeah, I know.”","Rong Jiali’s eyes were red-rimmed.","She cried with joy.","In the hotel room.","When Mu Xue, Grand Master Chu, and Chu Qingyi went out to buy the things Zhang Han listed.","“Daddy, we must beat King Luo Dong to death. He’s so hateful.” This was the first time that Mengmeng had said something like that to Zhang Han.","Zhang Han nodded very seriously and said, “King Luo Dong must die. Even if we can’t kill him this time, we will come here to finish him off in the future.”","After that, Zhang Han touched Mengmeng’s head and sighed softly, “Don’t worry, we will successfully pick up your grandpa and grandma.”","“I know. We’ll do it,” Mengmeng said with her lips pursed.","...","No one could be happy at this time when they saw their loved ones suffer.","The next day.","Before the opening of the auction, more and more people gathered at the Auction City, coming and going.","Grand Master Chu and the other two went out to buy the spirit treasures Zhang Han needed, but they only bought 30% of the treasures.","It was still far from Zhang Han’s goal.","“The things we need include many rare treasures, which can’t be bought now. Why don’t we go to the auction and see if we can get them there?”","Grand Master Chu said, “The auction will last for three days. If everything goes well, I think we can get all the items in one or two days.”","They did have to wait until the auction began.","On this day, they only bought 10% of the things they needed.","Now they had got 40% of the things on the list.","Because they had bought a lot of things, they had spent a lot of money.","The grand auction on the Orloff Star began.","The auction halls were filled with people.","A towering building was the center of the auction.","The VIPs were allowed to go to the auction venue inside the tower.","But there were only 9,999 seats in the venue.","The huge square outside that could accommodate millions of people was about to be overcrowded at this time because too many people were participating in the auction.","At the same time, the defense set by the Limitless Sect here was like an impenetrable net, which was tightly strict. It was no exaggeration to say that even if a fly flew in, they would still know.","Under such circumstances, it could be imagined how difficult it would be for Zhang Han to blow up the city.","Even Grand Master Chu felt that they might fail.","“If it weren’t for the decline of Big Brother’s strength, these people would not have a chance to stop him. Alas.”","Grand Master Chu sighed softly.","Assumptions didn’t matter but the reality.","“The 36th auction held by the Limitless Sect is about to begin!”","“Next is the first batch of items to be auctioned. If you want to bid, just increase the crystal stones according to the system’s instructions.”","Clatter!","The first batch of auction items had a thousand different types.","Among them, the fifth-tier and sixth-tier spirit treasures were the majority, and there were a few decent treasures.","At the bottom of the tower, there were several big screens projected, from which all kinds of auction items could be seen.","“There are six things we need.”","Chu Qingyi looked at the auction items carefully and said, “Number 10, 18, 25, 56, 72, and 91.”","“I’ll bid.”","Grand Master Chu began to raise his price.","Every time the price was raised, the number, seat number, and the number of crystal stones on the screen would be changed.","There was an auction for the VIPs in the high tower, and there was a V sign in front of their seat numbers.","The price of the treasures was a little higher than usual.","Zhang Han’s group bought all the six kinds of spiritual treasures that they needed.","“The second batch of spiritual treasures!”","They needed 32 of the 1,000 kinds of spirit treasures being auctioned.","“I’ll bid,” said Grand Master.","He spent another sum of crystal stones to buy the treasures they needed.","After the third, the fourth, the fifth, and so on batches of the spirit treasures were auctioned.","At 3 p.m. in Auction City on Orloff Star, Zhang Han got all the spirit treasures he needed.","A lot of crystal stones were spent.","Fortunately, Mengmeng had a million top-grade crystal stones.","Chu Qingyi, Grand Master Chu, and Mu Xue also had a lot of crystal stones.","Even so, they had spent a lot this time and didn’t have many crystal stones left in their storage.","The auction on the first day was over.","They got the spirit treasures needed at the auction and returned to the hotel.","Zhang Han, dressed in black, said to the others, “Wait here. I’ll go out at night. I’ll be back before the auction ends in about two days.”","“Big Brother, do you need my help? How about I go with you?” Grand Master Chu asked.","“I’m okay. Thanks.”","“Daddy, you have to be careful.”","Mengmeng repeatedly reminded him.","Under the cover of night, a figure left the hotel, went to the street, and went to the shade of a park.","“Secret Disappearance Technique. It’s been a long time since I’ve used it...”","Zhang Han felt the dark night.","His figure slowly disappeared.","Without practicing the Divine Walking Trick, it was against the physical characteristics to perform the Secret Disappearance Technique. It didn’t require combat capability, and it was harmful to the body, but it was quite suitable for the current situation.","The auction on the second day was still extremely popular.","Each time, there were thousands of kinds of auction items, countless in total.","There was a highlight on this day, which was the eighth-tier medicinal pellet treasures.","They were precious treasures that could help a cultivator at the Peak Stage of the Integration Realm to break through to the Mastery Realm.","It was unknown how many people tried to get those medicinal pellet treasures at all costs, spending a lot of crystal stones.","The treasures were twice as expensive as usual.","But people could do nothing about it. It was hard to get those treasures usually and one needed great luck to obtain them. Even though people knew the price was high at the auction, they still wanted to buy those treasures.","On the third day of the auction, which was also the last day, the number of treasures being auctioned decreased.","“There will be a hundred kinds of auction items during each bidding.","“It can be said that today’s auction is a high-quality one because there are no spirit treasures below the sixth tier.”","Many people present were shocked when they heard this.","Most of the millions of people in the square were here to watch the fun now.","A high-quality auction was a game between distinguished guests.","As soon as the first batch of auction items appeared, a lot of exclamations came.","“Oh my god, all the auction items are seventh-tier spirit treasures!”","“What an incredible action held by the Limitless Sect!”","“There are hundreds of kinds of seventh-tier spirit treasures!”","The Limitless Sect had deliberately arranged this.","There were a lot of sixth-tier spirit treasures for bidding on the last day of the auction.","60% of the spiritual treasures were sixth-tier and 40% were seventh-tier.","As for eighth-tier spirit treasures, there were only seven of them, which took up less than 5% of the treasures being auctioned.","On the second day of the auction, an eighth-tier medicinal pellet was auctioned.","Today there were six kinds of eighth-tier spirit treasures presented.","It attracted great attention.","The auction came to an end.","Grand Master Chu, Mengmeng, and the others were sitting in their original places, observing.","But they were not in the mood to bid. They were all thinking about when Zhang Han would be back.","“Let’s go.”","Zhang Han’s voice suddenly came from behind.","Swoosh!","Their expressions changed. Seeing Zhang Han nodding slightly to indicate that he was ready, they quickly left the venue.","“Daddy, you’re finally back. Where are we going?” Mengmeng asked.","“We’ll go to King Luo Dong’s Mansion.” Zhang Han quickened his pace and said, “Let’s move faster, otherwise, King Luo Dong will notice us.”","They stepped on the aircraft and quickly headed for King Luo Dong’s Mansion.","While they were halfway to their destination, the figure of the Limitless Sect Leader was projected on the tower in the center of the city. His loud voice spread to every corner of the giant city.","“I hereby announce that this auction of the Limitless Sect now concluded with a perfect ending!”","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Many fireworks rose to the sky.","When they gave off dazzling special effects, Zhang Han’s eyes flashed with brilliance.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","More than a million people in the venue and tens of millions of people in the city felt that the ground was shaking, and countless places were bursting into monstrous flames. Huge rocks were flying in all directions, and dozens of symbolic buildings collapsed with a loud bang while mists pervaded the air.","All the people who attended the auction were amazed when they saw this.","“What kind of fireworks are these?","“Their explosion effect is too powerful.”"]},{"number":1445,"title":"Chapter 1445 King Luo Dong Is Enraged","paragraphs":["Chapter 1445 King Luo Dong Is Enraged","“What?!”","“What’s happening?”","“Something’s wrong!”","Many people from the Limitless Sect were instantly stunned.","“Who did this?”","An extremely furious voice shook heaven and earth. The face of the Limitless Sect Leader was livid as he bristled with anger.","By then, everyone realized what was going on.","The Auction City had been attacked.","“Who has the guts to attack the Auction City?”","Many elders of the Limitless Sect flew into a rage and gave the order.","“Seal off the entire city!”","“The whole planet is now on high alert. Send out all the combat aircraft. We must catch the culprit!”","With a cold face, the Sect Leader of the Limitless Sect cupped his hands to the crowd.","“I’m sorry that this happened.”","As he spoke, the entire city was filled with dust, which seemed to be desolate for a moment.","He slowly said, “If you want to leave, please wait for a moment. Our people will let you go after inspection.”","Everyone was required to be inspected, but there were also many big shots who were famous in the Strange Wind Astral Domain, so they naturally couldn’t be stopped. However, those with low status would probably have to waste some time here.","After that, the Sect Leader of the Limitless Sect said with a cold face, “Go and catch them. Catch all suspicious targets.”","There were some people from underground forces in the Auction City.","It was clear that they were going to suffer a blow.","The words spoken by the Sect Leader of the Limitless Sect shocked the millions of people present.","“Someone is actually attacking the Auction City.”","“Oh my god, the Auction City has been blown up like this. Although not many people are injured, many buildings collapsed. This happened right in front of the forces from the whole Astral Domain. It’s such an embarrassment to the Limitless Sect!”","“What an embarrassment! Limitless Sect is now completely humiliated!”","“They should be enemies of the Limitless Sect, right? To be able to create such a commotion, they have to at least prepare for a few years. This is terrifying.”","“Who did Limitless Sect offend?”","Many onlookers were also happy to watch the fun.","They didn’t feel sad at all for Limitless Sect being humiliated. Instead, they gloated. After all, such a scene was rare to see in a hundred years.","The scene was not chaotic, because after the explosion, everyone had noticed that the bombardment energy could not cover this area, nor could it affect them, the Dao Seeking Cultivators with great strength.","At first, King Luo Dong, who was standing next to the Sect Leader of the Limitless Sect, looked calm.","When the Sect Leader and some elders were dealing with the matter, he felt that something was wrong, so he stood there and thought for a few minutes.","Suddenly, his face changed, and his eyes froze.","He’d finally realized that when the other party drew the attention of everyone by blowing up the city, they might be using it to cover up the things they were doing in the dark.","Swoosh!","His face changed slightly.","He immediately took out his communication device and contacted his subordinates at King Luo Dong’s Mansion.","“The situation in the mansion...”","Before his men could finish their words, noises began to ring out from the call.","Sizzle!","Following that, his men exclaimed.","“Your Grace, bad news, the whole, the whole mansion has been blown up!”","“Crap!”","King Luo Dong’s pupils contracted rapidly.","“What did you just say?!”","He thought of the man he had seen earlier.","He finally realized that the treasures that man had promised him were nothing more than empty words. That man had been preparing to rescue those two people the past few days.","“Hah. How scheming!”","A dangerous light erupted from his eyes, extremely cold, with killing intent surging in them.","“Do you think I didn’t make any preparations?”","He sneered, hung up the call, and dialed another number.","Soon after, the call was connected.","King Luo Dong asked directly, “Is everything okay with the chamber? You have to keep an eye on it, especially the two people.”","One second, two seconds, three seconds...","No sound could be heard for a few moments.","...","“What’s going on? “The signal is cut off?”","King Luo Dong was slightly taken aback.","He thought there was something wrong with the communication device. Just as he was about to hang up, an extremely cold voice came from the other end of the line.","“King Luo Dong, I’ll kindly accept the treasures in your chamber. Also, you need to stay alive and wait for me... to come and kill you.”","Buzz!","The call ended.","“AHHHH!”","King Luo Dong roared in his heart.","He widened his eyes in anger.","“As expected, it’s that young man!","“How did he find my chamber?","...","“One of my men is there, who’s in the Peak Stage of Integration Realm. How could he fail to guard the chamber for a few moments?”","Bang!","King Luo Dong instantly broke through the sound barrier and flew to his mansion at an extremely fast speed.","He had a hobby. He liked to place many of his valuable treasures in his big chamber. It could even be said that his chamber was like a small imperial palace, surrounded by many formations. They were very strong in defense, including science and technology defense, investigation defense, etc.","“The spirit treasures that I’ve kept for hundreds of years are all gone?","“It, it can’t be!","“How did he do it? In such a short time?”","King Luo Dong was going mad.","He did not expect this to happen at all.","“Seal off the entire city! I must kill him! I must kill them all!”","King Luo Dong was furious.","He sped all the way back at high speed.","But when he arrived at King Luo Dong’s Mansion and looked at the ruins in front of him, the veins on his forehead bulged.","He quickly came to the chamber.","The chamber, which had been like a palace back then, was now in ruins.","There had been third-tier, fourth-tier, seventh-tier, and even eighth-tier spirit treasures in the chamber, but now they were all shattered into pieces.","Every time he looked at a spirit treasure, his face would grow paler, and the killing intent in his heart would increase.","“Damn it!","“Bloody hell!","“AAAAH!”","King Luo Dong thumped his chest and stamped his feet.","In a rage, he waved his hand and smashed the surrounding buildings into ruins.","His eyes were blood-red.","He was full of murderous intent. He gritted his teeth and frowned.","The other party came and went without leaving a trace. What should he do to catch them?","He made a gesture of casting with his right hand and suddenly sensed something.","“Soul Seal. That’s right. I should use the Soul Seal!”","When King Luo Dong thought of the punishments for those two, his eyes lit up.","Swish! Swish! Swish!","He simply took out a kind of eighth-tier spiritual treasure along with five kinds of seventh-tier spirit treasures with five attributes.","Using six kinds of spirit treasures made him feel a little distressed, but he had gone mad.","He swore that he would kill them all.","“Soul Seal! Start!”","As soon as King Luo Dong cast the spell, wisps of cyan energy surged out from his right hand and converged on the spiritual treasures. The gold-attribute treasures shone with a red glow, and the wood-attribute spirit treasures flickered with cyan light. The earth-attribute treasures were brown, the water-attribute treasures were white, and the fire-attribute treasures were black.","This was the Soul Seal that was finally formed by the control of King Luo Dong’s occult art with the five elements.","This technique could be used to lock onto his targets according to the blood he had been stained with within 30 days. It was also a tracking occult art.","This occult art was many times more powerful than the tracking technique of Taoist Heavenlight from the Vast Heaven Star.","This technique could break all the illusions and target the other party without any obstructions, which proved that this technique was quite formidable and that it was something worth mentioning.","However, it required a lot of spirit treasures to perform this occult art.","Buzz!","At the moment when the incantation was successfully cast, King Luo Dong felt that two wisps of blood Qi were rapidly moving forward underground not far from the city.","“You want to escape?","“Hah. There’s no way that you’ll get to do it!","“Guards!”","King Luo Dong shouted.","The place seemed to be silent. His men were either dead or disabled.","He didn’t have any subordinates that could come in handy now.","“Third Elder, bring your men and follow me to hunt down the culprits who destroyed the Auction City!”","King Luo Dong sent a message and real-time coordinates. Then, he moved and quickly flew out.","At the same time.","In a dark river deep underground, Zhang Han and the others were fleeing forward quickly.","When the whole city was bombarded, Zhang Guangyou had already known that his son was coming to save him.","He did not expect it to happen so soon.","Not long after, Zhang Han’s parents were rescued.","After the initial joy of their reunion and even tears of joy, they began to flee.","Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali’s physical and mental conditions were much better after they took a few medicinal pellets.","“If it weren’t for you, we wouldn’t know what to do. When we showed up on this planet, we didn’t disturb King Luo Dong at all. We appeared a few meters away from him, and he was refining an eighth-tier spirit treasure back then.”","Zhang Guangyou gave a brief account of what happened when they had just arrived.","As soon as he finished speaking, both his and Rong Jiali’s eyes suddenly lit up with red light.","It then dissipated, but there was a red dot in the depths of their pupils.","When Grand Master Chu saw this, his expression changed drastically.","“Crap, we’ve been locked onto!”","“What?!”","Mu Xue was taken aback.","“How did he track us?”","Zhang Han’s face darkened slightly. He frowned and waved his hand, shooting out hundreds of top-grade crystal stones to form a formation.","Wisps of light, like sharp swords, shot toward Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali.","Zhang Han said, “Mom, Dad, please hold it in for a moment.”","He continued to cast spells. The crystal stones appeared again. Along with his power, they formed eight black branches, which wrapped around his parents.","Buzz!","“Oh my god!”","When the sharp sword energy pierced into their heads, they couldn’t help but gasp.","It hurt a lot, but they gritted their teeth and endured the pain.","When the sharp swords dissipated, the red dots remained in their pupils.","They didn’t move after the black branches wrapped around them.","They were still as if they couldn’t be removed at all.","“This is Soul Seal Incantation Technique.”","Zhang Han frowned, shook his head, and finally sighed.","“I can’t break this Soul Seal without appropriate spirit treasures.","“Let’s run.”","Zhang Han turned his face and looked back. It was as if he was looking through the void to stare at King Luo Dong.","His eyes flickered with a cold light.","“It can’t be breached?”","Rong Jiali’s face slightly changed.","She began to feel sad. As Zhang Han’s parent, she naturally didn’t want to drag him down.","Seeing this, Zhang Han said, “Even if we’re locked onto by the Soul Seal, I still have a way to escape. King Luo Dong is alone, and even if he has the help of the entire Limitless Sect, he’ll have no chance to stop me.”","He spoke slowly, which made him appear confident.","In fact, Zhang Han was a little stressed, but he was rather angry.","He was quite pissed.","King Luo Dong was on his kill list.","Unfortunately, Zhang Han was not very powerful right now, and he was even injured.","“Let’s go!”","Zhang Han waved his hand and shot out another 10,000 top-grade crystal stones.","At this time, he would do anything to get his group to escape no matter how many crystal stones he needed to spend.","At the same time, he displayed ten kinds of formation, which turned into various kinds of light and surrounded the crowd.","They advanced even faster as if there was a strong wind blowing behind them.","They rapidly advance following the Dark River underground.","They kept making turns but still failed to get rid of the other party’s pursuit.","Rumble!","A shocking sword light split the earth from above and came slashing down."]},{"number":1446,"title":"Chapter 1446 Please Stop What You’re Doing","paragraphs":["Chapter 1446 Please Stop What You’re Doing","“Humph!”","Grand Master Chu grunted coldly.","The sword light was shot by King Luo Dong, who caught up with them.","When Grand Master Chu saw this, he leaped dozens of meters up, lifted his saber, and slashed.","The sword and the saber collided, causing the soil and stones of the Dark River to fly in all directions and the river to surge.","“Damn you rats! I’ll kill you today!”","King Luo Dong kept chasing.","As a Middle-Stage Mastery Realm master, he kept displaying all kinds of moves.","In the Cultivation World, the gap between each stage would grow greater along with the level of the realms.","Grand Master Chu was in the Early Stage of the Mastery Realm. However, in the face of King Luo Dong, he held on for a few minutes. After that, he was injured and had some internal injuries.","Gradually, some aircraft began to appear in the surroundings.","They were sent by the Limitless Sect. Several elders were assisting King Luo Dong in the attack from the side, which made Zhang Han’s group desperate.","It seemed that they could not escape.","“Son...”","Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali exchanged a look.","Their hearts trembled and twitched as they felt extremely upset. However, they were also extremely determined with their opinions.","The two of them had been married for many years, and they understood what each other’s looks meant.","They had to leave the group. That way, the Soul Seal wouldn’t work. They needed to lead those people somewhere else so that Zhang Han and the others could leave safely.","All parents in the world would do anything to keep their children safe.","“Don’t talk!”","Zhang Han frowned slightly and looked at them with some anger.","He waved his hand.","A set of formations appeared, suppressing the two on the spot, not allowing them to move at all.","“Don’t cause trouble.”","Zhang Han softened his tone and said, “Don’t overthink this. Trust me, we can escape.”","“Son.”","Rong Jiali cried and said, “Let us go. You need to take Mengmeng and everyone else away.”","“Listen to us. Come to save us when you have the strength to do so,” Zhang Guangyou said.","However, before they could finish their words, Zhang Han used his mind to cover the two with a sound-proof cover.","“Zheng, defend with all your might and keep holding on.”","Zhang Han’s eyes were grave. He took out more than a dozen medicinal pellets and threw them at Grand Master Chu.","“Don’t worry, Big Brother.”","Grand Master Chu took a deep look at Zhang Han and said, “For thousands of years, I had more than a dozen teachers, but you are the only one who is worth my respect and admiration. If it weren’t for you, I might have died a long time ago. Today, even if I die here, I will do my best to escort you to leave.”","His words moved the crowd.","Even Chu Qingyi did not expect that Grand Master Chu would be so determined.","Only Zhang Han and Grand Master Chu knew the reason behind this.","Back then, Chu Zheng was clearly a cripple. In fact, he might not even be able to live to be 30 years of age.","When Zhang Han was touring around, he saw him, took him to travel in the Cultivation World, finally cured him, and left him with a lot of cultivation resources.","Zhang Han had changed Grand Master Chu’s future. At this moment, Grand Master Chu was very determined.","He took the medicinal pellets, ate three, and rushed forward.","He held the saber in his right hand, and his moves were bold and powerful. The saber radiance swept in all directions.","It made the nearby elders in the Integration Realm not dare to get close to him.","They were waiting. They were waiting for King Luo Dong to kill the Mastery Realm master and then go up to kill the rest of the evildoers.","“Hahaha, I thought you had some skills, but you’re actually more than twice as weak as I imagined.”","King Luo Dong’s killing intent was awe-inspiring, and his power was mighty.","With just three strikes, he made Grand Master Chu vomit blood and retreat.","“Hold on a bit longer. We’ll be able to leave this place after a while.”","Zhang Han looked at the terrain and found that they were passing by a grassland. In front of them was a mountain range.","When they got there, Zhang Han was ready to take action.","“Bah!”","Grand Master Chu spat out a tooth, stared at King Luo Dong, and said, “You son of a bitch.”","“Ow! Ow! Ow!”","Dahei shouted from the side and also wanted to go to battle.","However, its strength was far inferior to King Luo Dong.","...","Mengmeng, Chu Qingyi, and Mu Xue were the same. Even Zhang Han couldn’t participate in the battle.","Grand Master Chu was the only one fighting for their group.","“Go to hell!”","King Luo Dong launched another attack.","Every time he made a move, Grand Master Chu’s injuries would worsen.","“We’re almost there!”","They were still ten kilometers away from the mountain range.","However, Grand Master Chu could no longer withstand the attacks.","He retreated to Zhang Han’s side, gasping for breath.","“You can’t run.”","King Luo Dong waved his hand and said, “Surround them! I want to kill them slowly!”","...","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Many elders and spaceships were surrounding Zhang Han and the others.","“There’s no way out.”","Grand Master Chu said softly, “I’m glad that we are together even if we’re going down.”","“This is not what we deserve!”","Zhang Guangyou closed his eyes.","Mu Xue’s face was slightly pale. Chu Qingyi was silent.","Mengmeng blinked, and the atmosphere was gloomy. But when she saw the calm look in Zhang Han’s eyes, she knew that there was always a way out. Her father must have a way.","“Run!","“Keep running!","“What a bunch of losers!”","King Luo Dong approached them step by step, his eyes full of resentment.","“How dare you destroy my chamber, take those people away under my nose, and blow up the Auction City?","“You will be subjected to the cruelest torture in the world!","“Coincidentally, I know a lot of penalties, and you’ll get to try them one by one.”","Just when King Luo Dong was 100 meters away from Zhang Han, which was somehow in line with a certain direction, a scornful smile suddenly appeared on Zhang Han’s face.","“You think you’ve won?”","“Hmm?”","King Luo Dong’s eyes narrowed.","Clatter!","The figures of Zhang Han and the others suddenly turned into petals, which fell with the wind.","“What?!”","King Luo Dong’s pupils contracted.","He immediately sensed the Soul Seal.","His face instantly darkened. He suddenly turned around and saw Zhang Han and the others appear in the distance behind him.","Zhang Han even waved his hand.","“It’s impossible for you to catch us with your lame chasing ability. King Luo Dong? Do you think you are qualified to be a king?”","Hiss!","King Luo Dong gasped and felt that he was about to go mad out of anger.","“Get’em! Get’em! Go after them with all your might! Don’t let a single one of them escape!”","King Luo Dong roared.","More than 10,000 aircraft were chasing after Zhang Han and his group at an extremely fast speed. Of course, the fastest one was King Luo Dong.","Zhang Han and the others fled quickly to the distance. When the aircraft got closer to them, they fled underground. When they were about to enter the ground, Zhang Han sneered again.","“Hahaha, I guess the Limitless Sect is just so-so. King Luo Dong, I can toy with you. You are just a clown!”","Rumble!","King Luo Dong’s face turned lived and red.","The faces of the other elders were also very darkened, but they did not dare to speak now, for fear of angering King Luo Dong.","Just as they were about to go after Zhang Han and the others, the petals that fell to the ground were suddenly blown by a light wind. They kept rotating and finally turned into faint figures.","“Let’s leave!”","Zhang Han said in a low and anxious voice, “It won’t last long. Let’s enter the mountain range and go to the space station.”","“This, this is amazing.”","Even Grand Master Chu, who was seriously injured, could not help but exclaim.","“What kind of escaping method is this?","“It’s terrifying.”","He didn’t even dare to imagine what kind of expression King Luo Dong and his men would have when they found that Zhang Han’s group wasn’t in the direction they were going.","“I guess they’ll surely be astounded.”","When King Luo Dong and his men came to the place where Zhang Han and the others had gone underground, King Luo Dong cast the Soul Seal again, and his face completely changed.","“Where are they?","“They’ve temporarily sealed the Soul Seal?","“That can’t be possible.”","There was disbelief in his eyes.","But after a few seconds, he sneered.","“Search the area within a thousand miles! He won’t be able to suppress it for long before the Soul Seal disperses!”","He could sense the existence of the Soul Seal, which was formed mainly by eighth-tier spirit treasures. How could the Soul Seal cast by his occult art be dissipated so easily?","However, King Luo Dong was indeed being toyed with.","Zhang Han used his mind to control the most powerful formation covering his group.","He was very tired, and his power was consumed very quickly, but he had to hold on.","If this method didn’t work, it would be even more difficult for them to escape.","“Let’s go to the sky and seize an aircraft,” Zhang Han said.","The group immediately flew into the sky.","At this time, high up in the sky, there were combat aircraft patrolling every once in a while.","As they approached one of the aircraft, the scouting system did not notice them at all.","Zhang Han looked at Grand Master Chu and said, “Use the Mind-manipulating Technique first.”","“Okay!”","Grand Master Chu’s aura soared. His eyes shot out two beams of light, which covered an aircraft.","“Soul Suppressing Skill.","“Use the Soul Killing Technique.","“Use the fire attribute to burn the aircraft’s central system.”","Clatter!","Just as the spaceship lost control, the system was locked on. The spaceship stopped running on its own and floated in the air, waiting for the rescue aircraft.","At this moment, Zhang Han and the others quietly entered the spaceship.","“Send a report that there’s a system failure, and we need to go to the space station to repair it.”","Grand Master Chu nodded his head and did as he was told.","It was not common for the system to fail, but it happened a few times every year.","Therefore, the captain of these spaceships allowed the aircraft Zhang Han’s group was on to leave.","Zhang Han and his companions flew to the space station and soon arrived.","In the void, the defense was very tight, but they were not spotted.","As they passed by the Thunder Snake, they immediately left the aircraft and got into the Thunder Snake.","The system’s voice rang out, “The spacecraft has been fixed.”","Zhang Han said quickly, “We’ll leave by force. Use the particle cannons to bombard the space station and then leave.”","As he spoke, the Bounded Domain around them started to tremble. The suppression of the Soul Seal was no longer under their control.","The system’s voice rang out again, “The first energy cabin has been activated.”","Grand Master Chu was enraged. “Don’t follow the routine. Start all the energy cabins at the same time.”","If the system could speak its mind, it might say, “Dammit. That will ruin my accessories!”","But it would not say that.","The system replied, “Activating the energy cabins at the same time.","“The particle cannons are ready.”","Clack! Clack! Clack!","The spaceship kept shaking, making the equipment that was used to fasten the spaceship in the surroundings tremble as well.","At this time, the space station system took the initiative to issue an order to the spaceship.","“Thunder Snake, please stop what you’re doing!","“Thunder Snake, please stop what you’re doing!","“Thunder-”","Poof!","An enormous pillar of light shot forward.","The space station’s automatic defense immediately rose, but except for the main body, several branches that extended from the space station were all shattered by the firepower released by the particle cannons.","Clatter!","The Soul Seal no longer worked.","King Luo Dong immediately noticed that they were near the space station.","“Damn it!”","King Luo Dong was so angry that his face turned pale. “We’ve been fooled!","“Go after them!","“Lock on to their spaceship and chase after them!”","After giving the order, King Luo Dong quickly rose into the air. He wanted to take his warship to chase after his opponent.","It seemed that a fierce hunt-down was about to begin.","King Luo Dong was both shocked and angry.","“How did they get to the space station?","“How did they escape from the detection of the Soul Seal?”","He couldn’t figure out how they managed to escape at all."]},{"number":1447,"title":"Chapter 1447 Like a Duck to Water","paragraphs":["Chapter 1447 Like a Duck to Water","Swoosh!","The Thunder Snake jumped into the secondary space and flew to the edge of the Astral Domain.","Using the perception of the Blood Source Incantation, Zhang Han could feel that the red silken thread was clear but very far away.","But he didn’t think it was far away now.","Still, he had to cross the Strange Wind Astral Domain.","After the spaceship got into the secondary space, the system issued a warning, “Alert. There is a large fleet in the rear secondary space.”","The Limitless Sect was hot on the heels of Zhang Han’s group, especially King Luo Dong.","He was determined to kill them.","“It’s just a hunt-down, which will at most cost me a year. I don’t care.”","Moreover, he believed that the other party’s energy stones or crystals were not enough for them to escape too far.","The fleet of the Limitless Sect was the kind that was prepared for war, so they had a lot of reserves.","One day, two days, three days had passed...","Ten days later, the Thunder Snake arrived at the border of the Strange Wind Astral Domain. Further ahead was the Barren Star Area, where few people lived. If one was lucky, one would not encounter any trouble on the way. If one was unlucky, one could even be engulfed by a Space Storm.","Swoosh!","The Thunder Snake jumped out of the secondary space.","Zhang Han cast the Blood Source Incantation again. After he sensed Zi Yan’s location, the Thunder Snake jumped into the secondary space again and began a long-distance journey.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","As soon as the Thunder Snake left, hundreds of spaceships appeared in the void, locked on to their target, and continued to chase after it.","“This will only cost me some crystal stones.”","King Luo Dong’s face darkened. He waved his hand and said, “Go after them!”","The pursuit began.","It was just like the situation on Zi Yan’s side.","“It’s been ten months, and they’re still fleeing.”","The Fifth Heavenly King of the Sacred Wolf Mountain had a terrifyingly strong will to hunt the Purple Moon Empire down.","He didn’t just want to destroy the Purple Moon Empire, but more importantly, he wanted to get the young Roc.","Holy beasts like Rocs were extremely rare. If they were bred, even the most ordinary Roc could easily reach the Tribulation Stage.","He was determined to catch that young Roc.","It didn’t matter even if he had to spend a few years.","At the same time, the Blackhill Empire also wanted to annihilate the Purple Moon Empire to establish its prestige. It had been a long time since they had experienced such a big battle.","“Report! Three hundred spaceships have run out of energy. They can’t continue to fly.”","One of the Fifth Heavenly King’s subordinates said, “It’s estimated that they’ll replenish the reserves of Energy Stones in four hours. They’ll head to the predetermined attack destination in half a day.”","“Alright.”","The Fifth Heavenly King responded lightly.","He also felt a bit troubled.","The other party had been fleeing for too long. It seemed that they had a lot of Energy Stones or crystal stones in reserve.","“Seems like they’re well-prepared.”","“You keep taking turns in the North District of the Ocean Astral Domain. Where exactly are you fleeing to?” The Fifth Heavenly King frowned. He was unable to tell Zi Yan’s plan at all.","In fact, even the calculations and the attack locations predetermined by the system had failed to do that.","“They’re doing anti-prediction. They’re just fleeing aimlessly.","“It makes me hard to go after them.”","“However, you don’t have any follow-up resources, so you will be caught up someday.” The Fifth Heavenly King was quite relaxed.","He noticed that when the other party rested, they only dared to stay for a few minutes. They exchanged some crystal stones in the void, and they had already given up a lot of spaceships. Obviously, they did not have many crystal stones left.","In fact, he was also surprised several times. At first, he expected to catch the target in a month, but he failed to catch up with them in ten months.","The reserve of the Purple Moon Empire was terrifying to the extreme.","In fact, Zi Yan’s fleet was not in a good situation either.","“Moon Empress, a spaceship’s energy is running out,” said Ke Zhan.","“Give it up,” Zi Yan responded. Her tone was calm, but she felt powerless.","After fleeing for so long, they still hadn’t managed to escape.","The crystal stones were about to be used up.","She was losing the support of her people.","They could still hold on for a few more days, which was their final struggle.","She was waiting for Zhang Han. Even if she had to spend more time, she had to keep fleeing until her husband came to her.","After her fleet made so many twists and turns in order to escape, they didn’t even go out of the Ocean Astral Domain.","The current resources were not enough to support them to make long-distance travel.","...","“What should I do?","“Will he come?”","Zi Yan had been thinking about Zhang Han and Mengmeng every day. Sometimes, the images of them would come to her mind.","Of course, she did not expect that Zhang Han was also running for his life.","“Master, the crystal stones are only enough for us to hold on for ten days.”","It was a message that made people feel a little desperate.","Zhang Han was silent for a while before he said slowly, “We’ll jump out of the secondary space every three hours.”","In the last ten days, the Thunder Snake left the secondary space every three hours to capture the Star Maps and the environment around.","Seeing this, King Luo Dong couldn’t help but sneer.","“They definitely don’t have many crystal stones left!","“Continue to go after them!","...","“I’ll teach them a lesson when their energy is exhausted.”","The second day, the third day, the seventh day, and then the ninth day had passed.","Zhang Han’s group still had one more day before the energy would be used up.","The atmosphere in the Thunder Snake was a little dull.","“Beep! Beep! Beep!","“A large-scale anomaly has been detected in the galaxy.","“Alert, the spaceship can’t go through. Alert, the spaceship can’t go through.”","The system automatically ordered the spaceship to jump out of the secondary space.","The scene in front of them shocked Grand Master Chu.","The others were all confused while Zhang Han’s eyes were full of surprise.","“A secret realm!","“This is such a big secret realm!","“Oh my god, where are we?”","There was an endless blue light in front of them like the constantly flashing aurora. They couldn’t see the end of it at all.","According to the system of the spaceship, the area was estimated to be as large as half of a Star Area.","Grand Master Chu was no stranger to this kind of energy. It was a secret realm. However, it was the first time that he had seen such a large-scale secret realm.","Zhang Han immediately said, “Go near that place!”","The spaceship flew quickly through the void and slowly approached the secret realm.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","When they were halfway there, the fleet of King Luo Dong arrived.","“What?”","When he saw the scene, his face changed. “Such a large-scale secret realm. Inform the sect and send the coordinates.”","All sorts of secret realms would appear in the Barren Star Area.","If he was looking at a small-scale secret realm, he wouldn’t pay attention to it. But it was a secret realm with such a shocking scale. He didn’t know how long it had been there. There must be precious treasures or ancient inheritances inside.","That was no small matter.","One of his men said anxiously, “King Luo Dong, they’re going to the secret realm!”","“Huh.”","King Luo Dong sneered and said, “Although there are many entrances to the secret region, they are not easy to find. Do they really think that they can find those entrances? We’ll catch them before they do that!”","Smack!","It was like a slap in King Luo Dong’s face from a distance.","As soon as he finished his words, the spaceship ahead of them disappeared.","Mengmeng put it away into her Space Ring.","Zhang Han and the others went into the light layer without hesitation.","They entered the secret realm!","“How did they find the entrance so easily?”","The corners of King Luo Dong’s mouth trembled slightly, and he gritted his teeth.","“Let’s go over. Some of you stay here to wait, and the rest of you follow me into the secret realm!”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The spaceships quickly flew over.","Following the direction Zhang Han and the others had just entered, King Luo Dong and his men entered the secret realm one after another.","This place was a forest.","The trees were a hundred feet tall, and the grass was three feet tall.","Humans seemed to be shrunk a lot here.","“The spiritual Qi is so rich.”","“This secret realm should be very large. I wonder how many treasures there will be.”","“When the whole sect comes here, we’ll fully explore the secret realm.”","“Be careful! There might be something terrifying here.”","There were about a dozen thousand people who came here with King Luo Dong.","The troops of the main force entered one after another. After the vanguard entered, they raised all kinds of energy barriers, but there seemed to be no danger at all.","King Luo Dong did not wait for the following army to enter.","With more than 2,000 people beside him, he sensed the Soul Seal and looked in a certain direction.","“There! Let’s go!”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","They quickly flew through the forest at a speed that was not slow.","King Luo Dong could feel that those scoundrels were not far away.","However, there would always be accidents.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","There was a huge explosion of energy.","There were no casualties, but a deep pit that was dozens of meters deep had been blasted into the ground.","“Hmm?”","King Luo Dong looked at the deep pit, and his pupils contracted.","There were countless holes in that pit.","At the bottom of the deep pit, there were several one-meter-long red ants.","Each ant’s foot was like a saber.","This kind of creature was called Saber Ant.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Densely packed Saber Ants crawled out of the holes. As they walked, they hissed and looked up. Suddenly, they began to attack.","To everyone’s surprise, these ants had transparent wings on their backs and they could fly.","The people from Limitless Sect were all shocked.","“Oh no, each one of these ants has the strength of the God Transformation Realm!”","“Let’s go. Let’s go!”","Some of the elders didn’t seem to want to continue fighting.","However, if they retreated, the troops in front and the troops in the rear would be separated.","“Some of you stay behind to kill these ants!”","King Luo Dong’s face darkened. “The rest of you follow me to hunt them down!”","At this time, he was very clear that it was those scoundrels who had just blown up the ant nests.","“That guy did it! Dammit!”","How many ant nests were there?","It must be a lot.","However, King Luo Dong’s main force still had to gather. If the ones who stayed behind needed to keep up with the teams, the first thing they had to do was to suppress those ants.","It wouldn’t be long before all the teams entered the secret realm.","However, the good times didn’t last long. There were more than a thousand people fighting against the Saber Ants.","The rear teams quickly entered, and groups of people came up.","Ten minutes later.","Rumble!","Hiss!","Terrifying fluctuations emerged from the ant nests.","The Saber Ant Kings, which were at the Peak Stage of the Integration Realm and more than 10 meters long, appeared.","They were the Saber Ant Mother’s personal guards. Over ten of them had appeared at once, causing people’s scalps to go numb.","The team was helplessly separated, and the people behind them had to make a detour to keep up.","However, King Luo Dong and his men arrived at a river that was ten thousand meters wide.","He looked at the many eagles in the air, the looming Exotic Beasts in the water, and the faint light that had just dissipated in the air.","King Luo Dong got extremely terrified.","It wasn’t hard to figure out who had angered these Exotic Beasts.","King Luo Dong said angrily, “Dammit!","“Take a detour!”","His voice seemed to have frightened something.","Wisps of smoke suddenly rose from beneath their feet and covered their bodies.","Creak!","The eagles were irritated and swooped down as if they had seen easy targets.","The Exotic Beasts in the river also quickly followed the people, looking forward to their arrival in the area of the river.","King Luo Dong took a deep breath.","“Shield your aura and give it your all to chase!”","They had to use many methods to get rid of the pursuit of the beasts here.","They crossed the river and came to the other side of the land.","King Luo Dong sensed the Soul Seal and found that the other party was five times farther than when he first came in.","It had only been a short time.","In fact, when Zhang Han saw such a secret realm, he was stunned.","He also sighed with emotion in his heart.","“As expected, there is always a way out!”","Zhang Han had explored countless secret realms. Although King Luo Dong was older, he had always stayed within the Strange Wind Astral Domain, and he had rarely gone out to see the outside world.","Moreover, in the Cultivation World, how could one see the scenery of a higher level before reaching the Tribulation Stage?","For all sorts of reasons, it was destined to be an extremely difficult hunt-down for King Luo Dong."]},{"number":1448,"title":"Chapter 1448 Hanyang Long Time No See","paragraphs":["Chapter 1448 Hanyang Long Time No See","“Are we safe for real?” Mengmeng repeated her question.","After they entered the secret realm, Zhang Han only looked around for two seconds and then took them to fly at a fast speed.","During this period, he also took out some crystal stones and set up an ambush.","They also encountered strange beasts on the way, but Zhang Han could always avoid them or cast a spell to force them back.","They didn’t encounter other trouble. When they crossed the river, Zhang Han said, “We’re safe now.”","After he said that, Grand Master Chu had a strange expression on his face. “I’m afraid that only an expert like you would have the confidence to make us safe in the secret realm, Big Brother.”","“Let’s go and see what is inside this secret realm.”","Zhang Han led the group to move forward quickly. Sometimes, they were very careful. It took them a few minutes to walk only dozens of meters.","However, with them leading the way in the front, the team of King Luo Dong in the rear encountered some trouble, which was relatively limited.","At the same time.","In the depths of the secret realm, in the center area, there were numerous mountain peaks that seemed to have been carved.","The mountain peaks were of different colors, and the mountain ranges below were continuous. Some people could occasionally be seen walking here.","“Have you found that black dog?”","“How dare they snatch from our Illusory Sea Manor? They are truly courting death!”","“That black dog is too fast and scheming. Elder Li is very powerful, but that black dog always robs the weak and never faces Elder Li head-on.”","“Be careful. There are many spiritual treasures in this secret realm, especially spiritual herbs. Someone has seen that the black dog has taken a kind of ninth-tier spiritual herb, as well as more than a dozen eighth-tier ones. It also snatched countless seventh-tier ones. It’s like a black dog with a herb garden.”","“It’s really weird. Our sect has millions of people, but we’ve failed to catch a dog. Besides, we have Elder Li leading the team and more than a hundred other elders. Why can’t we catch it?”","“That dog’s nose is very sensitive. It can smell experts’ odor. No matter how hard the elders try to conceal themselves, it would not work.”","“It’ll be a great merit if we catch the black dog. Unfortunately, it’s not something we can do.”","“I hope Elder Li has a solution. Although our sect is powerful, there are also many people from other sects here, especially those from other Astral Domains. They are not easy to deal with. So far, more than 30,000 disciples of our sect have died. This is only the preliminary estimate. In fact, there are more of them. We should be careful.”","At the center of the secret realm, there seemed to be an incomparably large game going on.","Not just the Illusory Sea Manor but the other large sects also issued an order.","“Whoever finds that black dog will be rewarded with a seventh-tier spirit treasure.”","“Whoever catches that black dog will be rewarded with three kinds of eighth-tier spirit treasures!”","“If you find that dog, you’ll get 3,000 points.”","“....”","The various rewards made many disciples go crazy.","In fact, only the high-level officials present knew how many spirit treasures the black dog had taken.","It took them a lot of effort to clear the way from the periphery to the core area. They saw a Bounded Domain, the core spirit treasure of this secret realm, and a huge herb garden.","Unexpectedly, a black dog was frantically plundering that herb garden, which was a hilarious scene.","“It’s been a year!” The Illusory Sea Manor’s Elder Li looked at the countless mountain ranges in front of him and sighed softly, “We have obtained nothing. All the secret realm’s supreme treasures have been snatched away by that black dog. Where is it from?”","It had always been the great sects that fought over treasures in the great secret realms.","Now, it turned out to be a competition for a dog-pursue.","It was almost a peaceful scene.","When people from different sects bumped into each other, they didn’t go tit-for-tat like before.","“Have you found the black dog?”","“No. What about you?”","“I can’t even see its tail.”","“Well, let’s continue to search. I hope you can find the black dog soon. I don’t want to stay here.”","“Gee, thanks. I don’t want to find it. Someone else will do it.”","For a period, the black dog especially led the crowd to plunder the nests of the local Exotic Beasts.","Because of this, many people died.","One day, two days... ten days later.","Hiss!","A slight sniff sounded in the dark of the forest.","Swoosh!","Like a bolt of black lightning, a black figure flew forward at an extremely fast speed.","Moments later, a woman in cyan ahead was about to take a sixth-tier spiritual herb.","The black figure flickered, and the spiritual herb was gone.","“What?”","The woman was stunned. After a short while, she exclaimed, “It’s the black dog. That black dog is here!”","“Search for it now!”","Many disciples in the surroundings were in a state of chaos and got busy for quite a while before they helplessly stopped.","They weren’t as fast as the black dog and couldn’t find it.","...","According to the rough estimations of the major sects, the black dog’s instant speed was no less than that of a full-speed aircraft. Moreover, it was more flexible and could hide its aura better. It was difficult to sense its presence as it was just like an illusory ghost.","In fact, it didn’t matter how fast it was. There were too many people present who could deal with it.","The thing was that those powerful people could not meet the black dog at all.","It had been hiding the entire time. It had a special method of sensing one’s aura.","It kept avoiding the elders, and the others couldn’t catch up with it. For a moment, they were in a rather awkward situation.","Many elders shook their heads and sighed softly. “I’m afraid only the Tribulation Stage Supreme Experts can catch that black dog. Even Elder Li of the Illusory Sea Manor, who is at the Peak Stage of the Mastery Realm, can’t do anything about it. We don’t have any chance at all.”","Having been here chasing after a dog for half a year, the major sects got to know each other and even had sympathetic feelings.","Hiss!","This black dog was, of course, Little Hei.","It sniffed every once in a while, and Little Hei finally realized the power of its Treasure-sniffing nose.","“Before Master comes to pick me up, I’ll save more treasures.”","...","Little Hei had never stopped, which was also the reason why the major sects called it a Treasure Dog.","The secret realm was so large. Who could stand it while 80% of the treasures were taken away by a dog?","The dog-catching competition was still ongoing.","Little Hei finally revealed its weakness to them.","“Hiss, hiss, hiss...","“Ow!","“Ow! Ow!”","Little Hei usually used its Treasure-sniffing nose as usual. Suddenly, it was stunned, and its pupils contracted rapidly.","It began to shout.","“Awoooooooo!”","The sound waves were extremely loud and spread out in all directions.","“Master!”","Little Hei stared into the distance and flew away in a straight line at its fastest speed.","It could sniff the smell of its host and Little Master.","It didn’t pay attention to the others as long as it could sense these two auras.","At that moment, Little Hei was as happy as a puppy.","When it was flying wildly-","“Woof!”","It even let out a familiar bark.","But most of the time, it was roaring.","Little Hei was telling its master that it was coming. “I’m coming for you!”","But it was still too far away from Zhang Han and his group, so they couldn’t hear it.","However, the people of all the major sects present heard it.","Someone exclaimed, “Did that black dog actually let out a roar?”","Someone asked suspiciously, “Is this a trap?”","Someone said angrily, “Provocation! This is purely a provocation! It’s insulting us!”","But at the same time, they were very fast. They rushed to the source of the sound. Some of them who didn’t hear the sound was also informed by their subordinates and quickly flew over.","“Elder Li, it’s over there. That black dog is very fast. It’s flying ahead.”","Many subordinates of the Illusory Sea Manor reported the news.","Swoosh!","Elder Li’s speed was extremely fast. In fact, there was even a trace of joy on his face.","In this secret realm, his strength was the strongest. When he caught the black dog, he would no longer need to be subservient to others and could easily walk away.","He rapidly flew over","Moments later.","The faces of many elders from other sects changed slightly.","“Elder Li, you’ve come so quickly.”","“Of course, I have to.” Elder Li said lightly, “That black dog has finally appeared in our sight. If we don’t take action now, we may not have another chance to do it.”","“Elder Li, you made us feel a lot of pressure.” Someone said with a bitter smile.","“We’re in the same boat. Whoever is capable and has more means will be able to catch that black dog. We are getting along quite well with each other in this secret realm, so I feel that the competition later should not be too fierce. How about stopping at where it should?” Elder Li said.","He was not afraid of these people, but he was afraid of their alliance.","All the major sects also had their own ideas in mind.","There was only one black dog.","It didn’t matter who caught it. What mattered was whom the treasures would end up with.","Most likely, even the elders of small powers would have to hand over quite a few treasures before being able to leave unscathed.","In this regard, the pressure on the small forces in the secret realm was very great.","“Found it!”","There were more than a hundred people in the front, 30% of whom were elders from the Illusory Sea Manor.","One of them cried out in alarm, “It’s up ahead!”","From a distance, they could see a black shadow rushing forward like a stream of light. The black dog didn’t seem to care about being discovered, nor did it care about the people chasing it from behind. It flew forward in a hurry.","“Is there something important ahead?”","Someone said, “It must be something that the black dog cares about very much. Otherwise, it wouldn’t have flown like this without even hiding its aura.”","“No matter what it is, I’m only interested in that dog!”","Swoosh!","The elder who spoke suddenly took out a flying supreme treasure. It was a disc with a diameter of two meters. His speed had obviously increased.","When the others saw this, they all cast their supernatural powers and picked up their speed.","But the fastest one was still Elder Li.","He sneered in his heart. “The black dog is mine!”","He had to get the black dog in front of him.","The black dog had gotten too many spiritual herbs, which were quite valuable, especially the ninth-tier ones. They were all rare in the world. Who wouldn’t be tempted by those?","“Where do you think you are going?”","Some of the elders began to attack.","However, no matter how hard they tried, their moves did not have much of an impact on Little Hei because it was far away.","An intense pursuit began.","On Zhang Han’s side.","They were sitting on the edge of a cliff on the side of a waterfall.","The scenery was not bad, and there was an open space.","“Take a two-hour break.”","Zhang Han waved his hand.","Dahei began to roast some meat, and the others also sat down.","“I didn’t expect that we would bump into a secret realm. It’s hard to predict what will happen in the world. I’m afraid that King Luo Dong will regret it later.” Grand Master Chu sneered. “He should’ve let your parents go directly instead of doing all of this.”","Along the way, Zhang Han set up many traps, which were enough to make the other party suffer a lot.","“Daddy, when will we go to find Mummy?” Mengmeng asked in a low voice.","“You haven’t found Yan yet?” Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali’s faces changed slightly.","“Not yet.” Zhang Han sighed and said, “But soon we will.”","As he spoke, he gently patted Mengmeng on the shoulder and said, “We’ve almost used up all our crystal stones now, so we need to pass through this secret realm and leave in another direction. If there are any Dao Seeking Cultivators of the Human Clan in this secret realm, we can rob some crystal stones by the way.”","“Okay,” Mengmeng replied.","She sat there in a daze.","This kind of travel could not make her happy. Only by reuniting with all her family and taking adventures together with them could she be truly happy.","Just as Mengmeng was feeling a little depressed.","“Awoooooooo!”","A loud cry came from a distance.","“Hey!”","Mengmeng’s beautiful big eyes slowly widened.","Little Hei had grown up with Mengmeng.","How could she not be able to recognize this voice?","“Little Hei!”","Mengmeng suddenly stood up straight, her eyes shining, and looked to the side.","“Is Little Hei here?” Mu Xue was pleasantly surprised.","“It’s Little Hei,” Chu Qingyi also stood up.","“Ow! Ow! Ow!”","Dahei was so excited that its body kept rising, turning into a 150-meter-tall giant. It kept pounding its chest with its fists and shouted, “Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!”","It responded with its roaring.","“Awoooooooo!”","Little Hei’s cry came again.","This was a kind of sound-making skill. The sounds spread very fast while Little Hei was still some distance away from here.","But it would only take three or two minutes for Little Hei to arrive.","“Hahaha.”","Dahei shouted, “Second Brother, come here!”","“Little Hei is back!” Mengmeng said, “Daddy, Little Hei is back!”","“I can hear it.”","Zhang Han smiled.","He got up with Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali.","Everyone looked to the side, while Grand Master Chu was in a daze. He looked at Dahei, whose feet were taller than him. It was the first time that he had seen a chimpanzee that could transform.","“No. It can’t be!”","Grand Master Chu’s expression changed. “This is a King Kong? The legendary King Kong?”","His way of looking at Dahei suddenly changed.","No one could answer his question.","In fact, except for Zhang Han, no one else knew the current state of Dahei.","Zhang Han didn’t know much about it. He only knew that Dahei was growing and on the way to the King Kong Realm.","But there was still a long way to go before Dahei could become a real King Kong.","“Little Hei.”","Mengmeng wanted to fly over to meet it.","“Master, Little Master, don’t come over. Run now!”","Little Hei said that via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","Mengmeng’s pretty face changed.","Zhang Han observed for a while. He took out thousands of crystal stones with a wave of his hand and set up a formation that could increase everyone’s speed. He was ready to withdraw.","From afar, they could see a black shadow rapidly approaching from the sky above the mountain range.","But soon, more and more figures were chasing after it.","The distance was not close, but it was not far for Dao Seeking Cultivators.","“Prepare to flee now!”","Grand Master Chu came to his senses. He felt that the other party was not ordinary, and his face changed dramatically.","Especially Elder Li, who made him feel greatly intimidated.","“Hahaha, we’re finally going to catch that black dog!”","Someone roared loudly from the back.","The situation seemed to be slightly critical. It was a critical moment.","Zhang Han, however, froze a bit.","He waved his hand and said, “Let’s wait.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","He took out the last few crystal stones in his pocket, which were about 50,000 crystal stones. He set up more than a dozen layers of magic formations, ready to take action when the opportunity was right.","Little Hei was getting closer and closer.","The distance narrowed from a thousand meters to a hundred meters.","Swoosh!","Little Hei came to them.","“Master, Little Master!”","Little Hei sat in front of Zhang Han and Mengmeng, wagging its tail. It raised its head slightly and looked at the two with clear eyes. It opened its mouth and stuck out its tongue. It looked a little tired.","On Little Hei’s neck, there was a necklace, which was tied to a Space Ring.","“Little Hei!”","Mengmeng wrapped her arms around Little Hei’s head.","“There are so many people behind us. Daddy, why don’t we run now?” Mengmeng also noticed the people chasing after Little Hei.","However, Zhang Han remained still.","He narrowed his eyes and looked ahead. “We’ll keep waiting.”","Gurgle!","Grand Master Chu swallowed a bit.","He was a little nervous, but suddenly, he also exclaimed in surprise, “Hey? Tsk, tsk, hahaha.”","Abruptly, Grand Master Chu began to laugh loudly.","He no longer seemed to be afraid at all.","Gradually, under everyone’s gaze, hundreds of people came over in a mighty manner.","They were quite shocked and bewildered when they saw Zhang Han and the others.","They stayed levitating a kilometer away because they couldn’t feel Zhang Han’s aura.","“Are they experts?","“We’d better be careful and figure out the situation before taking action.","“If those people are powerful, whoever comes forward will be asking for trouble.”","“Is that black dog their pet?”","“Who are those people?”","“Which force do they belong to?”","Many people had their doubts.","Some impatient people could not help but ask.","At that moment, Elder Li suddenly flew forward and loudly laughed as he said something that caused the expressions of everyone present to change greatly.","“Hahahaha!","“It’s Hanyang!","“Greetings to Han Yang Immortal!”","Elder Li clasped his hands in the air and paid his respect.","Zhang Han also smiled and said, “Elder Li, you haven’t changed.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The expressions of the hundreds of people present were largely the same.","At first, they were stunned, and then they were shocked with their face pale. Cold sweat soon flowed down their faces.","“What the hell?","“Han Yang Immortal? An Immortal Master?","“A super expert who’s above the fourth-tier Tribulation Stage?”","Countless people gasped in horror.","At the same time, they also finally came to a realization.","“That black dog belongs to the Immortal Master!”","They sighed. “So it turns out to be the Immortal Master’s dog. Then everything makes sense. It’s only natural that it’s formidable.”","Just at this moment.","“Master.”","Little Hei spoke the human language, “They have been trying to catch me for more than half a year.”","Hiss!","The hundreds of people gasped in unison.","Many of them looked at each other and found that they had the same expressions in their eyes, which meaning was – they should run now.","An elder with eagle-like eyebrows said, “My apologies. My granddaughter is about to labor. I have to go back and check on her.”","Swoosh!","He broke through the sound barrier in an instant and didn’t dare to join in the fun at all. When he fled, he was frightened and prayed in his heart. “Don’t attack me, Immortal Master! Please don’t attack!”","After running far away, he found that his clothes were all wet with sweat.","After he started fleeing, the others all followed him.","“I’m sorry, I got lost. How did I get here?”","“Well, my inner-door disciples asked me to go back for dinner. I shall excuse myself now.”","“I should go back to take some medicinal pellets. See you around.”","“...”","In just a minute, these people had all run away.","Out of trust for Elder Li, they all ran away, and no one dared to stay.","Because Elder Li was the strongest on the spot, so how could it be fake when he called the other party an Immortal Master?","“These people sure run fast.” Grand Master Chu laughed heartily. Then, he cupped his hands and said, “Greetings, Elder Li.”","“Zheng.”","Elder Li quickly flew over, glanced at him, and laughed. “Why are you following Hanyang again, kid?”","After teasing Grand Master Chu, he looked at Zhang Han.","The two of them exchanged a glance.","“Hahahaha!”","Elder Li laughed, raised his arm, and hugged Zhang Han.","He softly said, “Hanyang, long time no see.”"]},{"number":1449,"title":"Chapter 1449 Revival","paragraphs":["Chapter 1449 Revival","“It’s really great to see you.”","Elder Li’s voice was a little trembling. He was excited.","“We all thought that you had died under the divine thunder over the sky. Unexpectedly, you are still alive. This is really good news!”","“Alright now. We’re two grown men. We don’t need to hug each other.”","Zhang Han shook his head and smiled.","Elder Li loosened his grip, looked at Zhang Han, and burst out laughing.","He was venting his happiness.","“Ow?”","Little Hei was a little confused.","The others were puzzled as well.","Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali found it very strange that their son had such connections in the Cultivation World. He had such a strong network of connections.","“Come, Elder Li, let me introduce you.”","Zhang Han smiled and said, “These are my parents.”","Hiss!","Elder Li couldn’t help but gasp. He immediately cupped his hands and said, “Nice to meet you, Uncle and Auntie. My name is Li Shan.”","Zhang Guangyou felt a little awkward to hear a gray-haired old man call him uncle. He waved his hand and said, “Well, just call me brother.”","“No, that’s not appropriate. In terms of seniority, I should address you that since you’re his close relatives.” Elder Li shook his head.","“This is my daughter, Mengmeng.” Zhang Han introduced, “Mengmeng, you can... call him uncle.”","“Nice to meet you, Uncle Li.” Mengmeng greeted Elder Li in a crisp voice and was also a little curious.","“Nice to meet you.” Elder Li rubbed his hands together.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Three kinds of treasures appeared in his palms, all of which were seventh-tier spirit treasures. He said, “Well, Uncle, Auntie, and Mengmeng, I went out in a hurry and didn’t bring many spirit treasures with me. These are my gifts for our first meeting. Please don’t refuse.”","“Haha.” Zhang Han laughed and gave them a look.","“Thank you, Uncle Li.” Mengmeng took the treasures decisively.","Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali looked at each other and also took the treasures.","“These two are my disciples.”","“Nice to meet you, Elder Li.”","“I’m Dahei, working for my host.” Dahei kept shrinking and turned into a one-meter-tall chimpanzee.","“Good, very good. It’s promising to become a King Kong in the future. Amazing. Only you, Hanyang, can be so powerful.” Elder Li repeatedly praised, “And this black dog, we didn’t even see it for once since we started going after it half a year ago. I really didn’t expect it to be your spiritual pet. It’s amazing, really amazing.”","“Elder Li, you’re flattering me.”","Zhang Han shook his head.","“Han, may I know who he is? Can you introduce him?” Zhang Guangyou couldn’t help but ask curiously.","“Do you have a lot of acquaintances here?” Rong Jiali echoed.","Elder Li was stunned. He looked at Zhang Han with amusement and said, “Didn’t he tell you? Han Yang Immortal is the top master in the Cultivation World. Didn’t he tell you that?”","Gurgle!","Chu Qingyi swallowed a bit.","“Master is indeed a great devil. How powerful is he since he’s the top master in the Cultivation World?”","Mu Xue’s face was full of reverence.","“Dad, Mom.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and said, “There is one thing that I haven’t told you yet. I... When I was in the Cultivation World for 500 years and was undergoing the Thunder Tribulation, I attracted the divine thunder over the sky and failed, but I was reborn. Five years after I left the Zhang Clan in Shang Jing, I was reborn and got us to the Cultivation World. It has been a thousand years since I passed the tribulation. I don’t know much about the profound meaning of time.”","“Daddy, you, you’ve been in the Cultivation World for 500 years?” Mengmeng snorted and said, “You have never told me any of that. I was wondering why I’ve never heard you mention Han Yang Immortal in those stories you told before. Those are clearly stories about you.”","“Haha.”","Elder Li said with a smile, “He should be punished. This kid hid everything from you. He really deserves to be punished.”","“Fine.” Zhang Han pulled a wry face.","“But you may not know that in the circle where Hanyang was in the Tribulation Stage, he was almost invincible. There were no more than five people who could fight against him. At that time, he was too powerful and very rich. He had countless crystal stones, countless spirit treasures, and many Profound-grade treasures,” Elder Li said.","“It’s just a pity that after the incident of the divine thunder over the sky, Han Yang Immortal’s name no longer exists in this world. No one has ever heard of him. In fact, many people don’t even know him. It’s as if he had never appeared in this world. Only those who are familiar with Hanyang have these memories, including the nine of us from the Cloud Shadow Sky, such as Zheng.”","As he spoke, Elder Li sighed repeatedly. “What profoundness is this? It’s unimaginable and too terrifying.”","“Maybe the divine thunder over the sky triggered the rules of the Cultivation World.” Zhang Han didn’t understand, so he could only guess.","“It’s common for one to possess another’s body, but this is the first time I’ve heard of something like a rebirth,” Elder Li said. “What realm are you in now?”","“Around the Void-refining Realm.” Zhang Han thought for a moment and said, “Or about the Early Stage of the Integration Realm.”","He did not know which realm he was in exactly.","His soul sense sea and Yuan Ying were gone. He had long since parted ways with the traditional cultivation methods.","“That low?”","Elder Li was stunned.","...","In fact, those realms weren’t low, but he felt that it was low when it came to Zhang Han.","“How long has it been since you were reborn?” Elder Li asked.","“Thirteen years,” Zhang Han replied.","Poof!","Elder Li almost couldn’t catch his breath. He rubbed his chin and said, “Forget about it.”","“It’s been more than a thousand years. You should have all passed the Tribulation Stage, right?” Zhang Han asked.","“Well...”","Elder Li’s face froze. He shook his head and said, “It’s a long story. Let’s not talk about this for now. We’ll go to my sect’s territory first. We must have a good drink today.”","“Well, Uncle Li,” Mengmeng rolled her big eyes and said, “my dad is injured. Do you have any healing treasures? Please lend them to my dad and he will return them later.”","“You’re injured?”","Elder Li frowned and immediately grabbed Zhang Han’s wrist with his right hand. He sensed it carefully and said, “Hey, where is your soul sense sea and dantian?”","...","His face immediately changed.","“I can’t explain my cultivation situation clearly. Now I have a scar on my soul’s Great Domain, so I need the ninth-tier Soul Fixing Pellets.” Zhang Han sighed softly. “Those are not that easy to refine. Besides, the materials...”","“Master, I’ve got the treasures you may need here.”","Little Hei ran to Zhang Han’s side, shook its head, and held the necklace in its mouth. The ring was just exposed.","“Really?”","Zhang Han touched Little Hei’s head with a smile and took over the ring.","During this period, Elder Li also said, “It does have a lot of spiritual herbs. Let’s see if they can work.”","Zhang Han’s mind entered the Space Ring.","His expression gradually froze. “So many treasures? You even have the ninth-tier Sun Soul Flowers?”","He didn’t expect that there would be so many treasures in the ring, which were five times more than what he had at his peak after his return.","“I got them all in this secret realm,” Little Hei said shyly.","“Good job, brother.”","Dahei gave Little Hei a thumbs-up.","“Soul Fixing Pellet. Soul Fixing Pellet...” Zhang Han immediately began to ponder.","There were a lot of spiritual herbs. Not every kind in his pellet formula could be seen here, but there were still many spiritual herbs that could be replaced, and the methods to refine the Soul Fixing Pellets were not fixed.","“I also have some spiritual herbs with me.”","Seeing this, Elder Li was very generous and took out some spiritual herbs from his Space Ring.","There were more than a dozen kinds of seventh-tier ones, several eighth-tier ones, and many sixth-tier ones. There were almost a thousand kinds, which were all Elder Li had.","“These are what I need.”","Zhang Han stared at the spiritual herbs and took hundreds of them with a wave of his hand. He felt that they were all unreal, “Did I just get everything I need?”","“That’s great.”","Elder Li said, “Since you’re injured, this can’t be delayed. Shall we go back now?”","“We’ll do it here.”","Zhang Han thought about it, looked behind him inadvertently, and said, “Two or three days will be enough. I’ll wait for someone along. Elder Li, protect me. Zheng, help me refine the pellets.”","“Okay.” Elder Li straightforwardly nodded his head.","Grand Master Chu, however, was a little nervous. “You want me to help refine pellets? I can’t. I don’t know much about pellet refining. What if something goes wrong...”","“You’ll just be assisting. It’s fine.”","After saying that, Zhang Han directly sat cross-legged on the ground, closed his eyes, and adjusted his mentality.","Refining the ninth-tier Soul-replenishing Pellets was a large-scale project. Even though Zhang Han knew all the details, he could not afford to make any mistakes.","The chance of success was about 50%.","Whether or not he succeeded would also depend on luck.","Because the energy in Zhang Han’s body was not enough to support the refining process, Grand Master Chu assisted him from the side. With Elder Li protecting him, he would sure be safe.","Zhang Han shut his eyes and rested for two hours.","He suddenly opened his eyes and took out a fifth-tier pellet furnace. After a moment of silence, he realized that the energy of the fifth-tier furnace was not enough.","“Why are you using a fifth-tier furnace?” Elder Li was stunned. He took out an eighth-tier furnace and said, “This is the furnace of my sect. Just use it.”","“Okay.”","Zhang Han nodded and stood in front of the furnace. After running his power a bit, he summoned all kinds of spiritual herbs, a total of 1,221 kinds, and made them float before him.","There were all kinds of treasures, ranging from the ninth-tier ones to the fifth-tier ones.","This was a huge project.","“What should I do?” Grand Master Chu asked nervously.","“Just listen to my instructions. You’ll just shatter the spiritual herbs, calm the energy, and control the fire,” Zhang Han said.","These were auxiliary means, and Zhang Han could also make subtle control. His main task was to guide the energy to merge.","“Daddy, can I help you control the flames? I’m pretty good at pellet refining now,” Mengmeng volunteered.","Zhang Han was stunned and said with a smile, “Okay. I’ll be more relieved with your help.”","“I will not make any mistakes.”","Mengmeng’s little face was full of seriousness.","She could now share some of her father’s burden.","So Zhang Han began to refine pellets. His right hand slid forward.","Under his control, three of the spiritual herbs floated to the mouth of the pellet furnace.","“Shatter the herbs.”","“Alright!” Grand Master Chu was startled. He quickly ran his energy and shattered the spiritual herbs. Then, he stared at the furnace with his round eyes, as if he had a deep hatred for it.","In fact, he was extremely nervous. There was only a single portion of spiritual herbs, and he couldn’t afford to fail. Just thinking about it made him stressed.","However, after shattering the spiritual herbs, he controlled the energy to enter the pellet furnace.","It seemed to be very simple. He didn’t need to do anything else.","“Reduce the fire by one-third,” Zhang Han said.","Mengmeng immediately reduced the fire when she heard that.","The little girl was very skilled at controlling fire. Zhang Han was quite gratified to see her like this.","“Who said that women are not as good as men? My daughter is amazing.”","With his mind, Zhang Han gently poured the energy of the spiritual herbs into the furnace, neutralized it, and then carried out a new round of circulation.","“Shatter the herbs.”","Patriarch Chu did as he was told.","“Increase the fire by 1%.”","“...”","More than a thousand kinds of spiritual herbs were put into the furnace in an orderly manner.","During this period, there were several times when the energy surged.","It was as if the furnace was on the verge of explosion.","Seeing this, Elder Li got nervous.","The others even held their breaths, for fear of disturbing Zhang Han, who was refining pellets.","“Don’t worry, everyone. His success rate of pellet refining is terrifyingly high,” Elder Li said. “Even though he needs to refine the ninth-tier medicinal pellets, his success rate is still 70%.”","He didn’t know that there was a hint of nervousness in his tone.","Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali exchanged a look.","It could be seen that Elder Li was sincerely concerned about Zhang Han.","When Zhang Han was in the Cloud Shadow Sky, there were some disputes in the beginning. Later, he had a good relationship with the Eight Elders, especially the First Elder and Sect Leader Ning. The nine of them were like brothers. Later, with Zhang Han joining them, they saw his development step by step. He left the Cloud Shadow Sky and went to the vast world. Then, he became a master step by step. He passed the Mastery Realm, the Tribulation Stage, and the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier.","He had returned several times, and each time he returned, the spirit treasures he gave them, as well as cultivation methods and occult arts, were piled up into a mountain.","The reason why they were able to advance to their current level was largely due to Zhang Han’s help.","Elder Li hadn’t seen Zhang Han for so many years, and he even thought that he had died. Now that they had suddenly met, he was naturally overjoyed.","The day passed.","When the last kind of spiritual herb, the ninth-tier Sun Soul Flower, was put into the furnace.","Buzz!","A white beam of light rose from the furnace to the sky, as if it had lit up the sky.","Many people even thought that a supreme treasure had appeared in that direction.","The changes were simply too intense.","On Zhang Han’s side, with the appearance of the light beam, a burst of fragrance spread out to the surrounding.","The emergence of a ninth-tier medicinal pellet was not as simple as it seemed.","The fragrance of the medicine was like a hurricane, blowing in all directions.","“Awooooo!”","Creak!","Many Exotic Beasts couldn’t help but rush over in groups.","Elder Li bitterly smiled when he saw this unusual movement.","Next, he might have to carry out a great battle for protection.","Unfortunately, he didn’t ask his men from the Illusory Sea Manor to come over.","“I can inform them.”","Elder Li patted his forehead. He wasn’t doing something indecent, so what was there to be afraid of?","Therefore, he took out the talisman and sent out a message.","“Illusory Sea Manor’s disciples, gather here!”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","It was unknown how many people were flying over at high speed.","Soon, more than 100,000 people had gathered and formed a large circle on the mountain a kilometer away.","As the number of people increased, the number of Exotic Beasts they encountered also began to increase.","At the same time, in the distance behind.","“Damn it!”","King Luo Dong cursed and killed a unicorn that was flying toward him.","There were only 30,000 people left in the team next to him. The other teams had dispersed, and some of them were blocked at the back.","The traps that were hard to discover made him suffer.","They were not very powerful, but they could always attract many Exotic Beasts.","King Luo Dong and his men had just left the unicorn area.","A light beam suddenly rose ahead.","“A supreme treasure?”","King Luo Dong’s eyes lit up slightly. He sensed the Soul Seal and said, “He’s also in that direction. Let’s go over now.”","Moments later.","King Luo Dong and the others looked at the violent Exotic Beasts around them.","He was a little confused. “Why are there so many Exotic Beasts? Are they all fighting for the supreme treasure?”","He quickened his pace.","On Zhang Han’s side.","When the energy of the Sun Soul Flower was fully refined.","“Pellet Condensing!”","Zhang Han’s eyes were shining brightly.","His mind’s power, which only had 20% left, burst out.","In the pellet furnace, a large amount of energy suddenly converged toward the center.","A medicinal pellet began to take shape.","The moment it condensed.","Crack!","The sky was originally clear, but suddenly, dark clouds covered it, and lightning fell.","This was the Thunder Tribulation when a ninth-tier spirit treasure appeared. The rules of heaven and earth could not be avoided.","Seeing this, Elder Li rushed into the air.","The Thunder Tribulation of the Soul Fixing Pellet was not a difficult one to deal with. Elder Li cast all kinds of moves to fend off the tribulation.","Swoosh!","The Soul Fixing Pellet flew out of the furnace.","Zhang Han grabbed it at once.","“Let’s take a rest.”","Zhang Han looked at Mengmeng and said softly, “I will be alright soon.”","As he spoke, he took the medicinal pellet and sat cross-legged in the air two meters above the ground. There seemed to be a layer of faint brilliance emitting from his body.","The energy of the Soul Fixing Pellet was released.","In Zhang Han’s soul perception, streams of clear water were constantly repairing his soul, which made him feel extremely comfortable.","The cracks on his soul were being repaired at a level that could be seen with the naked eye.","At the same time, along with the completing of his soul, he could feel that the Immortal Body of the Five Elements was growing.","His strength, defense, physique, and other aspects were all improving.","The completeness of the soul was the completion of the body.","It seemed that the Immortal Body of the Five Elements was about to reach its peak.","Zhang Han’s aura also gradually became stronger.","“That’s strange.”","Elder Li frowned slightly and was a little surprised.","In his senses, Zhang Han seemed to exist in this world, but at the same time, he didn’t seem to exist. It was very illusory.","Elder Li wondered what kind of magic this was.","It took Zhang Han a whole day and a half to refine the pellet.","After he took the medicinal pellet, his aura continued to rise.","“Master is finally getting better!” Mu Xue was very excited.","“It wasn’t easy,” Chu Qingyi said.","“That’s good, that’s good.” Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali also relaxed a little.","As soon as Zhang Guangyou said that, his face changed. “Oh no, King Luo Dong is coming.”","“There is a reaction from the Soul Seal. He has just sensed it,” Rong Jiali quickly said, “and he’s not far away.”","“What?!”","Grand Master Chu was subconsciously taken aback.","“Who is King Luo Dong?” Elder Li frowned slightly.","“Well.”","Grand Master Chu relaxed again. He exhaled and said, “King Luo Dong is an elder of the Limitless Sect in the Strange Wind Astral Domain. It’s him who has been hunting us down all the way here. Big Brother was injured before, so he had no choice but to do this.”","“Hunting you down?” A cold light flashed across Elder Li’s eyes. “What’s the cultivation level of King Luo Dong?”","“The Middle Stage of Mastery Realm. The Last Stage at most,” Grand Master Chu said with uncertainty.","“That guy is particularly detestable,” Mu Xue said. “He injured Master’s parents. Master had a hard time saving them.”","Zhang Guangyou sighed softly at this time, and then his eyes gradually became sharp. “We didn’t get to defeat him before, but we do now. I want to say that King Luo Dong should be killed!”","“Alright! I’ll take that guy’s head later.”","Elder Li’s face darkened a little.","“There are too many of your men here. If he sees them, he will run away.” Mengmeng couldn’t help reminding him, “Uncle Li, get your guys to hide now.”","“Okay.”","Elder Li nodded and waved his hand.","“Disciples in front of me, step aside and make way for an area of ten thousand meters. Hide, all of you.”","The people from the Illusory Sea Manor all started to move.","At the same time, the surrounding Exotic Beasts could not smell the medicinal fragrance, so they dispersed.","The disciples of the Illusory Sea Manor moved quickly behind the Exotic Beasts, concealing their figures.","And at this moment, Zhang Han’s aura was getting stronger and stronger.","This aura represented the terror that was about to awaken."]},{"number":1450,"title":"Chapter 1450 Invulnerable to All Techniques","paragraphs":["Chapter 1450 Invulnerable to All Techniques","Zhang Guangyou said with a sullen face, “He’s close!","“He’s very close!","“King Luo Dong just used the Soul Seal again.”","“He’s here?”","Elder Li looked ahead. It seemed that in the distant forest, there was a group of people rapidly passing through. He could vaguely sense their auras.","“How could they have the nerve to use such a poor concealment technique?”","With his hands clasped behind his back, Elder Li took a few steps forward.","At the edge of the cliff on the side of the waterfall, he looked ahead indifferently.","One minute passed. Two minutes.","The conversation over here gradually came to a halt.","“Hahahaha! I’ve finally caught you all!”","King Luo Dong’s laughter suddenly sounded.","At the same time, a large group of people quickly advanced from both sides and surrounded Elder Li and the others.","“Why aren’t you running any longer?","“I dare you to keep running!”","King Luo Dong could finally vent the hatred in his heart. He did not care about the extra person on the other side. His tone was bone-chillingly cold.","“You dare to play tricks on me? I’ll make sure you end up well. Don’t worry, you won’t die so easily.”","They had gone through countless hardships along the way.","Even many of King Luo Dong’s subordinates looked resentful as if they couldn’t wait to go to the battlefield and kill the enemies in person.","Unfortunately, they knew that the other side had too few people. It would be King Luo Dong’s business to make a move.","“Stupid ass, you will definitely die today.” Dahei raised its middle finger.","Little Hei bent itself and stared at the weaker enemies around it.","Once the battle began, it would let the other party know what cruelty meant.","“How dare you be so stubborn when you are about to die?”","King Luo Dong walked forward slowly. He also noticed Elder Li. For a moment, he did not intend to move forward too fast. He looked at Zhang Han like a cat playing with a mouse and said, “Is he cultivating in seclusion? Or is he dreaming?”","“I’m afraid he was scared out of his wits when he found out we were coming.”","Many of King Luo Dong’s men mocked Zhang Han.","“He’s a fool. Otherwise, how could he have dared to offend King Luo Dong?”","“He’s not powerful enough, but he’s bold. He won’t have a good ending since he has messed with King Luo Dong.”","“It’s understandable that he’s scared out of his wits. After all, he is facing King Luo Dong.”","“What a bunch of losers. They can no longer escape after only running for a dozen days.”","“...”","The voices grew louder and louder.","They had been in a hurry on the way, but now they were calm when they saw the wanted ones.","But some people didn’t want to listen to their nonsense.","Mengmeng looked at Elder Li and said, “Uncle Li, I don’t want to see their ugly faces anymore.”","Elder Li smiled and said, “Okay, I’ll go and kill them all now.”","As soon as those words were said, King Luo Dong turned quite vigilant.","One of his men couldn’t help but say, “You old thing, you want to kill tens of thousands of people by yourself? You’re overestimating yourself!”","“By myself?”","Elder Li slightly frowned and slowly raised his arms.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","He patted the air three times.","Clatter!","In the distance, birds and beasts were flying everywhere.","Some terrifying monsters seemed to have appeared in the jungle.","But there were too many of them.","This was the case in the huge forest ten thousand meters away.","A large cloud appeared from the forest and floated up in the next second.","Upon closer inspection.","Hiss!","King Luo Dong gasped.","“How many people are these?”","It was impossible to tell. A rough estimate was that there were at least seven to eight hundred thousand people.","...","Tens of thousands of them were surrounding the people in the front with hundreds of thousands of men surrounding the former.","It was so majestic that it looked like a dark cloud was pressing down on a city.","It gave people a deep sense of pressure.","“So many people?”","“Good heavens!”","“Flee! We need to escape!”","“Can we break through the blockade?”","“What should we do? What should we do?”","The men of King Luo Dong were stunned.","Even King Luo Dong began to have a bad feeling.","He looked at Elder Li, “Who are you?”","...","“Do you even deserve to know my name?” Elder Li retorted.","“So you want to fight to the death?” King Luo Dong said in a cold voice, “It’s not so easy to kill me.”","“Bumptious.”","Elder Li didn’t waste his breath. He took a step forward and stepped into the void.","He was about to make his move.","He was about to kill the enemies in front of him.","In fact, he didn’t even have to do it himself. The disciples in his sect could do it.","However, he chose to fight in person for no other reason than to avenge Zhang Han.","But he had just taken a step forward when a voice sounded from behind them.","“I’ll kill him.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Many people turned to look at the person who spoke.","They saw that the man, who seemed to have been cultivating in the air, was already standing on the ground.","It was Zhang Han.","He had woken up.","His soul was complete, and his state was at its peak. Even his Immortal Body of the Five Elements had reached its most perfect state.","“You’re awake? You want to do it?” Elder Li retracted his leg and smiled. “Okay. Show me how your current cultivation is.”","“You’ll be surprised,” Zhang Han said.","He stretched his neck and arms before shooting a glance at King Luo Dong. He said, “This feels awesome.”","Clack! Clack! Clack!","The bones in his body kept making crisp sounds.","He knew that his constitution had been upgraded to a perfect state, and his current state was at the Peak Stage of some kind of upgrade.","As long as he did not break the balance in his body, he would always have a super high combat capability.","However, he had just gotten on the track with his Figure Refinement. As such, how could the current situation be maintained forever?","Under everyone’s gaze, Zhang Han moved and stepped forward.","His speed was not fast, and he was even in a leisurely state.","While walking, he looked at King Luo Dong and sneered.","“Trash like you have no idea how powerful a master at the Mastery Realm Middle-Stage can be.","“Fortunately, you’re merely a dabbler. That’s why we were able to escape from you.","“King Luo Dong, you bullied my parents. I should suppress you for thousands of years.","“But I don’t want to. I can’t waste my time on you.","“Tell me, how would you like to die?”","He walked to the edge of the cliff.","Zhang Han showed no aura at all, just like a mortal.","Cold sweat trickled down from the forehead of King Luo Dong.","He was both shocked and angry. He was afraid of the hundreds of thousands of enemies around him and the old man instead of Zhang Han.","When he heard this, he began to think.","If they could capture Zhang Han and restrict him, they would still be able to leave safely.","“I’ll kill you first as an interest!”","King Luo Dong had the killing intent, but now was not the time to kill Zhang Han.","He angrily said, “You’ve been running away like a slick mouse. How dare you boast in front of me?”","“Hahaha.”","Zhang Han suddenly chuckled. He shook his head, glanced at Mengmeng, his parents, and said softly, “I’ll be back soon.”","After that, his figure suddenly moved.","Boom!","He instantly broke through the sound barrier and rushed to King Luo Dong.","“Come on!”","With a sword in his right hand, King Luo Dong shouted. It was a seventh-tier spirit treasure.","He swung his sword from top to bottom.","A thousand-foot-long sword light, with monstrous power, seemed to cut the void and quickly slashed at Zhang Han.","“Break!”","Zhang Han’s right hand slapped forward.","The energy of the five elements appeared and broke down the occult art from the inside.","“Hmm?”","King Luo Dong’s eyes narrowed slightly.","“How could it be resolved that easily?”","He could not help but feel his heart grow heavier.","“Ninth Heaven Killing!”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Sword Qi danced in the air, and endless sword radiance seemed to turn into a bloody mouth from the Ninth Heaven and devour Zhang Han.","“This won’t work.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and said in a low voice, “Because I... am invulnerable to all techniques.”","Buzz!","In an instant, Zhang Han’s eyes were shining with cyan light.","He spread out his arms.","The innate ability of the Immortal Body of the Five Elements could absorb thousands of sword lights.","He pointed forward with his right hand.","A large amount of energy flowed forward.","It was as if a monstrous sea had suddenly poured down from the sky, carrying mighty power.","Huge waves rose. Each wave turned into a sword ray.","The entire roaring sea energy was like a combination of Sword Qi. When the sword edge appeared, its terrifying sharpness shocked everyone present.","“This is sword-arts?”","Many of King Luo Dong’s subordinates’ faces turned pale.","“How come this young man, who had a hard time escaping before, has become so powerful?”","“Could it be that he has been pretending all this time? Was he trying to lure us here and wipe us out?”","“What... King Luo Dong will win. King Luo Dong will definitely win.”","They were looking forward to the performance of King Luo Dong.","However, at this time, King Luo Dong’s heart was also a little heavy. He looked at the surging sea of sword light whistling toward him.","He suddenly shouted, “Rising Wind and Returning Sword.”","King Luo Dong controlled the sea with the strong wind and exchanged blows with Zhang Han head-on.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The two kinds of supernatural powers collided with each other, shaking heaven and earth, causing the wind to blow and the clouds to surge.","A great battle now began.","“How dare you act insolently in front of me with only this level of skill?”","King Luo Dong seemed to be relieved, and he looked at Zhang Han calmly.","“This brat turns out to be impressive-looking but useless.”","“Alas!”","Zhang Han sighed and shook his head.","“I thought you could easily crack my move. After all, what I just performed is the energy of your move, but you used an occult art twice more powerful to fight against it. Such Tao of the sword is just a superficial skill.”","“Hahahaha!”","King Luo Dong suddenly laughed and said, “It doesn’t work to play tricks. You’re just a loser. Even if you break through a few realms, you will still be no match for me. After all, you don’t know the power of Mastery Realm.”","As soon as those words were said, Elder Li, who was standing behind them, was both angry and amused. He pointed to King Luo Dong and looked at the people beside him.","“Where did this foolish guy get his confidence from?”","“He’s quite famous in the Strange Wind Astral Domain,” Mu Xue said in a sarcastic tone.","“I’ve never heard of the Strange Wind Astral Domain. It’s just an unknown small place that can’t even be compared to a district in a large Astral Domain.” Elder Li laughed mockingly. “No wonder he’s so ignorant. It turns out he’s just a native who’s never been in the outside world before.”","“That’s not the point,” Grand Master Chu said. “What’s amusing is that he’s just too arrogant. Does he really think he’s invincible under heaven?”","Dahei said, “He’s just a stupid ass.”","The ridicule on the other side was heard on the spot.","King Luo Dong also heard it, and he secretly cursed his enemies.","But he didn’t say anything. He only hoped to capture the brat in front of him and threaten the other party so that he and his men could leave. That way, he would be known as invincible.","“What’s your name?” King Luo Dong stared at Zhang Han and slowly asked.","In the face of such a question, Zhang Han remained calm and slowly said, “Do you deserve to know it?”","“What?!","“God damn it!”","Elder Li had said that King Luo Dong didn’t deserve to know his Taoist title.","Now, this young man only said a few words, but it made King Luo Dong even angrier.","“You’re extremely arrogant!”","Clang!","A long sword suddenly appeared in the right hand of King Luo Dong.","“This sword is called Gale Sword! I got it by chance. Although it’s a seventh-tier spirit treasure, its power is no less than that of an eighth-tier one with me using it. With this sword, I’ve killed 130 Dao Seeking Cultivators in the Integration Realm and seriously injured one at the Early Stage of the Mastery Realm. You should be proud that you’ll die under the Gale Sword!”","“Hahaha, is that so?” Zhang Han burst out laughing.","King Luo Dong was indeed very confident. In fact, he was even conceited.","“It’s just a small seventh-tier spirit treasure. Is it that precious to you? It’s even just an ordinary sword.”","Zhang Han didn’t seem to be in a hurry to kill King Luo Dong at his peak state.","Swoosh!","A one-meter-long sword also appeared in his right hand.","“Seven-star Sword!”","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes slightly and said, “It can move the power of stars. It’s one of the Profound-grade treasures. King Luo Dong, with your vision, you should know about the Profound-grade treasures, right?”","“Profound-grade treasures?” King Luo Dong snorted and said, “You’re just pretending.”","“He has never even heard of a Profound-grade treasure, but he’s in the Mastery Realm?” Elder Li frowned and said, “It seems that the Strange Wind Astral Domain and King Luo Dong are even worse than I imagined.”","King Luo Dong’s mouth twitched.","He’d heard of Profound-grade treasures, but he’d never seen one, and he didn’t believe that the treasure in Zhang Han’s hand was a Profound-grade treasure.","He just didn’t bother to explain.","As King Luo Dong pointed his sword at Zhang Han, his momentum became more and more powerful.","Clang!","The long sword left his hand and turned into a stream of light. It was a very simple sword-commanding skill, but it made outsiders feel that his Gale Sword was getting faster and faster, and more and more Sword Qi was coming out.","Around the Gale Sword, the sword radiance seemed to cut the heaven and the earth, looming.","“King Luo Dong is displaying his sword-commanding skill!”","Many subordinates of King Luo Dong couldn’t help exclaiming.","“King Lou Dong went into closed-door training in the Cold Sword Cave in the Ice Impasse for a hundred years before he comprehended the Shock-kill Sword-commanding Technique. I remember that last time he sparred with eight masters in the Mastery Realm, he used this sword-commanding technique to win a great victory.”","“Many masters at the Integration Realm also died under his Shock-kill Sword-commanding Technique. King Luo Dong is using the Gale Sword. he will definitely win!”","It was as if they were encouraging themselves.","Many of King Luo Dong’s subordinates were discussing, which temporarily stabilized their morale.","Although there were hundreds of thousands of people on the periphery, they could leave safely as long as their side won.","They didn’t know that the hundreds of thousands of people were also quite curious at this time.","“Who is that young man?”","“Watch your mouth! Don’t speak nonsense! That’s an Immortal Master!”","“What? An Immortal Master? How is that possible? An Immortal Master can kill a person with a single glance.”","“Maybe he just enjoys battling. What do you know? Elder Li can’t have lied to us.”","“...”","The crowd was talking about it, and almost everyone was full of curiosity.","Under many people’s gazes, Zhang Han gently pointed the Seven-star Sword forward and said, “Starlight.”","Buzz!","In an instant, the power of the starry sky within a radius of 10,000 kilometers gathered rapidly, forming hundreds of meteor-like beams of light around Zhang Han.","They all attacked the sword moves of King Luo Dong.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","It was difficult for King Luo Dong’s sword to move even an inch.","The sword seemed to have fallen into a quagmire. It moved slower and slower and finally stopped in the void.","“What?!”","King Luo Dong was slightly taken aback.","“Can his sword really control the power of stars?”","“Return!”","King Luo Dong controlled his long sword to fly back.","“Sword-commanding techniques can’t be used in this manner.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and commanded with a thought, “Go!”","The Seven-star Sword transformed into a stream of light.","It was as if he was using his mind to control the long sword to fly without using any fancy buffs.","However, King Luo Dong felt that there were infinite mysteries within.","“He’s reining the sword!","“It’s the original sword-commanding skill!”","“Sword Wall!”","King Luo Dong raised his sword and cast a defensive supernatural power.","Clack! Clack! Clack!","When the wall of Sword Qi was broken, Zhang Han’s sword dissipated most of its power and floated back to Zhang Han.","“What is a sword?”","Zhang Han turned his head and glanced at Mu Xue and Chu Qingyi, who were behind him.","It was as if he was going to display his power.","The moment he finished his words, Chu Qingyi, Mu Xue, and the others didn’t even bear to blink.","“Hundred Swords Killing!","“Thousand Swords Dance!","“Myriad Arrows Dragon!”","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","One after another, massive sword moves came pouring down.","These were just basic sword moves. They hadn’t even been integrated with an occult art, so their power had been greatly reduced.","However, the face of King Luo Dong still changed greatly.","There were three sword moves, each of which had sharp Sword Qi. It was so sharp that he felt like he would be cut by it even if he was a kilometer away.","“So powerful!","“What powerful sword moves!","“How is this possible?”","King Luo Dong finally had a bad feeling about this.","He started to feel nervous.","“How could an ordinary person possibly possess such sword moves that have extremely profound profundities?”","“Myriad Swords Formation!”","King Luo Dong cast a supernatural power of Tao of the sword.","That was his final struggle.","After all, he was at the Mastery Realm Middle Stage. When he cast his supernatural power, he blocked the three basic sword moves from Zhang Han.","Swoosh!","King Luo Dong no longer wanted to use a sword.","He felt that if this went on, even his confidence in winning would be worn out.","Buzz!","King Luo Dong’s eyes lit up.","“Illusions?","“This won’t work.”","Zhang Han waved his hand and broke the scene that King Luo Dong was about to cast.","“Divine Soul Curse!”","King Luo Dong’s face turned livid, and he once again performed his trump card.","Zhang Han sighed softly and said, “Your incantation is so bad.","“Break!”","He stretched out his right hand and clenched it in the air.","The illusionary spell was crushed by his palm strike.","“You, you...”","King Luo Dong’s face changed again.","“Reincarnation Seal!”","King Luo Dong’s eyes were wide open. “I’ll kill you with the Reincarnation Seal!”","A seventh-tier spirit treasure box appeared in his hand. He cast an earth-shattering seal that gradually condensed in the void a thousand feet away.","“I can break it with a flick of my finger.”","Zhang Han’s expression was calm as his finger moved.","The Reincarnation Seal started to disintegrate from the inside.","In just two seconds, it dissipated between heaven and earth.","“How is this possible?!”","The face of King Luo Dong became fierce.","“These methods can’t work on him?","“How did he break them?","“How could this be?”","A series of questions appeared in the mind of King Luo Dong.","He really could not understand it.","However, how could he possibly understand the might of the perfect Immortal Body of the Five Elements?","“I can’t use magic!”","King Luo Dong’s mind was racing.","“Close-range combat!","“By only using close-range combat can I defeat him!”","With the long sword in his hand, he kept making sword moves and slowly approached Zhang Han.","At the same time, Zhang Han stepped into the void and also rushed forward.","He was also waiting for close-quarters combat.","The Immortal Body of the Five Elements was invulnerable to all kinds of attacks. However, he had no soul sense sea or Yuan Ying, so he could not use those supernatural powers and occult arts he had in the past","He couldn’t take down his opponent in a fight across the air.","But he could in close-range combat.","If King Luo Dong knew that Zhang Han was a strong Body Cultivator at this time, he would rather die than get close to him.","But he didn’t know that. He even thought that he had found the way to victory.","“Myriad-meter-long Cold Radiance!”","During the battle, as King Luo Dong found that he was close enough to Zhang Han, he performed an occult art at his fastest speed.","Dozens of shadows were left behind in the air behind him.","He attacked with the long sword in his hand.","“Watch out!”","Elder Li subconsciously called out from behind.","“That’s not an ordinary move!”","“I’ll kill him!","“I have to kill him!”","King Luo Dong roared in his heart.","“My victory is imminent!”","In the face of the oncoming sword tip, Zhang Han raised his hand.","Clang!","It was as if the sound of metal colliding resounded throughout the area.","In that instant, King Luo Dong’s face changed.","His men were stunned.","Elder Li was also taken aback. His expression was rather odd.","“What’s that?”"]},{"number":1451,"title":"Chapter 1451 You’re Actually a Body Cultivator","paragraphs":["Chapter 1451 You’re Actually a Body Cultivator","“He took the sword with one hand! And it’s King Luo Dong’s sword!”","The faces of many subordinates of King Luo Dong gradually turned pale.","“Am I seeing things?”","“Is this happening? Did he take the sword with one hand without getting injured? Is that possible?”","Countless people gasped and were shocked.","The hundreds of thousands of people on the periphery also fell into silence.","“So powerful!","“He’s really powerful!”","This was the only thought they had.","The most shocked one in the field was none other than King Luo Dong, who was about to draw his sword and leave.","He did not expect this to happen at all.","“You!”","Just as King Luo Dong was extremely shocked and wanted to escape.","“Break!”","Zhang Han’s eyes were shining brightly, and his right hand slapped forward.","Clack! Clack! Clack!","The Gale Sword made a crisp sound from the inside.","A crack appeared on the edge of the sword.","Swoosh!","King Luo Dong suddenly opened his eyes wide.","“My seventh-tier spirit treasure!”","Clack!","A second, a third... densely packed fissures spread out across the entire Gale Sword.","Clatter!","Except for the hilt, the long sword turned into powder and slowly fell. It was crystal clear, like a colorful light.","“My Gale Sword!”","King Luo Dong exclaimed and felt tortured.","“This is my favorite sword!”","“I’m gonna kill you!”","King Luo Dong was even more furious.","He stayed rational while he was angry. He was going to fight this hateful young man in close combat.","“I’ll cripple him. I’ll use him to threaten his group. I’ll slice him apart piece by piece!”","“Explosive Fist!”","Buzz!","King Luo Dong retreated more than 10 meters. He gathered his strength, activated his supernatural power, and threw a punch.","Before his punch arrived, the wind of the fist had already arrived.","The shadow of the Explosive Fist formed by his occult art smashed toward Zhang Han.","Without giving him any time to react, it instantly covered Zhang Han.","“You’re too weak.”","Zhang Han sneered and shook his arms.","Buzz!","A layer of sparkling light enveloped him.","The Explosive Fist’s shadow wasn’t able to get close to him.","“The true fist is here!”","The figure of King Luo Dong suddenly trembled. He had just used an illusionary method while his real body was behind Zhang Han.","His sinister voice also rang out from behind.","“Is that so?”","Unexpectedly, Zhang Han turned around in advance, gathered his strength in his right hand, and threw a punch. It turned into an arc and smashed backward.","Bang!","An astonishing muffled sound rang out. It was as if two giant mountains had collided.","The fists of the two clashed.","For a moment, King Luo Dong felt that his right arm was a little numb, and his internal organs and even his brain were trembling because of the punch.","“What a powerful force!","“Is this also a supernatural power of boxing?”","...","“Eagle Claw!”","King Luo Dong changed his move. His right hand seemed to have turned into an eagle’s claw. Its sharpness was not inferior to his swordsmanship.","King Luo Dong said fiercely, “I have observed the giant eagles’ claws for thirty years before comprehending the Eagle Claw. This move will definitely end you!”","“Not good enough.”","Zhang Han made another punch.","Bang!","It was another well-matched collision.","King Luo Dong’s right hand went completely numb.","However, he felt that he might be able to defeat this man within a few moves.","“Although he appears to be very calm, he is actually panicking in his heart. He’s already in a slight rush to attack.”","King Luo Dong felt a little more relieved.","...","Enduring the numbness in his right hand, he hurriedly cast two supernatural powers.","Bang!","Gradually, his right hand became more and more numb.","“I’ll use my left hand instead!”","King Luo Dong gritted his teeth and looked like he wanted to kill Zhang Han right away.","He once again cast several occult arts with his left hand.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The two men fought fiercely in the air at close quarters.","Even many sounds could be heard every second.","This type of battle was even more intense, making one’s blood race even more.","“Why hasn’t King Luo Dong taken him down yet?”","The subordinates of King Luo Dong felt that the army on the periphery was getting closer and closer, so they got a little anxious.","They were even more nervous about the chances that King Luo Dong couldn’t even win in close combat. If he did, they would be in danger.","“Your Majesty!","“You must win!”","Many people roared in their hearts.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","The fierce white-hot battle lasted for ten minutes.","King Luo Dong’s right hand first went numb, then his left hand, his right leg, and finally his left leg. During this, his right hand recovered a bit, and then this went on again and again.","During this period, he also took out several kinds of spirit treasures by surprise, but they all didn’t help.","“Why does he have so many supernatural powers?”","King Luo Dong began to feel anxious.","He kept attacking at a higher frequency.","However, Zhang Han did not move.","This seemed to have become a fierce battle of one-sided attacks.","King Luo Dong was the attacker, while Zhang Han was the defensive one.","The attacker gradually became numb, while the defense side was relatively relaxed.","“This is the perfect Immortal Body of the Five Elements.","“A perfect body.","“Its mysteries are boundless.”","Zhang Han now had a better understanding of his physical condition.","“Go to hell!”","After King Luo Dong kept preparing for an entire 10 minutes, he finally found a chance.","When Zhang Han raised his right hand high, he flashed and appeared on Zhang Han’s right side. A black dagger appeared in his hand, which was highly toxic, and he stabbed it at Zhang Han’s neck.","He was the only one who had the antidote to the poison. When Zhang Han was poisoned, it would be good for their retreat.","He had been waiting bitterly for Zhang Han’s mentality to slack.","In the end, this moment had come.","“This battle is finally going to end!”","When the tip of the dagger was about to touch Zhang Han’s skin, King Luo Dong was overjoyed and breathed a sigh of relief.","His limbs were numb now. This battle was too difficult. He had used all his means, but he had not been able to defeat his opponent. How could he have known that this young man was so powerful?","Poof!","He could feel that the tip of the dagger had pierced through the other party’s neck.","“I win!”","He was about to be overjoyed.","Clatter!","Zhang Han’s figure slowly dissipated.","At the moment when King Luo Dong slacked off, he only felt that his right shoulder was patted.","“Are you looking for me?”","The calm voice made King Luo Dong shudder.","Bang!","He only felt that his back had been severely smashed.","Poof!","King Luo Dong spat out a mouthful of blood.","“Oh no!”","He was greatly shocked. “I can’t get to kill him. I need to run!”","He had been going after Zhang Han for more than ten days, but in the end, he was now going to be hunted down.","King Luo Dong fled at his fastest speed.","“You won’t succeed.”","Zhang Han’s eyes narrowed slightly. He took half a step forward with his left foot and stepped back with his right foot.","Boom! Boom!","It was as if he had broken through the void. He raised his fist.","It was the Space-splitting Punch.","A punch was thrown.","Buzz!","The space around King Luo Dong suddenly began to tremble.","Zhang Han was really about to tear open the space.","King Luo Dong’s speed now became incomparably slow.","As Zhang Han’s punches fell one after another, he seemed to be unable to stand them.","“AAAAH!","“That’s impossible!”","King Luo Dong cried out in pain. He used all kinds of escaping supernatural powers, only to suddenly felt as if a spaceship had been disrupted and could not enter the secondary space.","There was no way for him to escape.","“What kind of magical power is this?”","Swoosh!","Zhang Han’s right arm began to charge.","He moved and quickly flew toward King Luo Dong.","Zhang Han had been accumulating strength while flying for hundreds of meters.","The power of the Immortal Body of the Five Elements was integrated into this punch.","“This punch is for hurting my parents!”","Bang!","When his fist landed, it actually brought about a thundering sound.","“You, you...”","King Luo Dong shuddered in fear.","He could feel that this punch posed a great threat to him.","“Myriad Swords!”","He once again executed his supernatural power of Tao of the sword.","Zhang Han wasn’t defending himself at all. After countless wisps of sword Qi approached him, it was all absorbed by his body and strengthened the power of his punch.","Swoosh!","The face of King Luo Dong changed drastically.","He no longer dared to make a move. He could only watch as the punch smashed toward him.","Boom!","The entire body of King Luo Dong was sent flying backward.","He was dumbfounded.","His meridians were cracking inch by inch, and even his Yuan Ying had been cracked.","“You!”","King Luo Dong’s face was ashen, but he roared with great resentment, “You! You are a fucking Body Cultivator!”","He was filled with regret.","“Damn it! I’ve been tricked!","“He only shows himself by now that he’s a Body Cultivator.","“It turns out that all his previous moves were not supernatural powers but the power of his body!","“I’ve been fighting against someone who practices Body Cultivation in close combat for so long...”","King Luo Dong felt that he had been fooled so badly.","“You want to kill me? You won’t get to do it so easily!”","King Luo Dong suddenly roared, “One day, I will find you and kill all of you!”","Bang!","His entire body suddenly exploded into a bloody mist.","However, a trace of his soul and Yuan Ying Realm power were about to sneak away.","If he could find an opportunity to possess someone else and recultivate his skills, he might be able to return to the peak in the future.","It was just that this would be the most miserable way because his Great Domain was limited.","He had less than a 1% chance to exceed his previous cultivation.","“You want to run?”","Zhang Han’s eyes gradually became sharp.","He looked in a direction and said coldly, “As I said, you will definitely die today.”","Buzz!","Zhang Han controlled his soul sense and blocked the air hundreds of meters ahead of him according to the rules of the Space-splitting Punch.","“AAAAH!”","It was as if a soul was roaring in that place, which was none other than King Luo Dong.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The leaves on the ground flew up and covered the place where King Luo Dong was.","Zhang Han turned his head and said, “Mengmeng, set him on fire.”","The feeling of being burnt by the Dark Cold Fire was not good.","The bone-chilling flames completely extinguished King Luo Dong.","There was dead silence in the field.","The subordinates of King Luo Dong felt a chill run down their spines as if they had fallen into an ice cave.","“Master is invincible! He’s too powerful!” Mu Xue looked at Zhang Han as if she were looking at a god.","“Master...” Chu Qingyi’s reaction was also the same.","Mengmeng showed a face of admiration. She had a familiar feeling as she again saw her father looking down on the whole world and suppressing the whole place.","Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali exchanged a look and smiled.","They were so proud of Zhang Hanyang.","Although Zhang Guangyou was always ridiculed as the weakest in the Zhang Clan, he had never been afraid of anyone since he had Zhang Han as his son.","“My father may not be as powerful as others, but my son is invincible.”","On the other side, the people of the Limitless Sect began to beg for mercy.","“Milord, please let me go. I’m just a disciple of the sect, following the orders of the elders.”","“I didn’t do anything...”","The scene went a bit chaotic.","Zhang Han floated in the void with a calm look. He turned around, went back to the edge of the cliff, and said lightly, “Handle this.”","“Okay.”","Elder Li nodded and waved to nearly a million people on the periphery.","“Kill them!”","The sound of killing shook the sky.","Countless people charged over.","Their combat capability was more than ten times higher than that of King Luo Dong’s men.","A massacre was being carried out in that area.","“Hanyang, I can’t believe you chose to take Body Cultivation.” Elder Li acted as if he hadn’t heard the shouts of killing outside. He looked at Zhang Han and said with a smile, “You can even kill someone at the Mastery Realm Middle-Stage. It seems that it won’t be long before you return to the Tribulation Stage again.”","“It will take some time,” Zhang Han nodded and said.","He was currently in the perfect state of the Immortal Body of the Five Elements.","If he could keep this state, he could escape unscathed in the battles against masters in the Middle and Last Stages of the Mastery Realm. He could also kill ordinary cultivators at the Early Stage of the Mastery Realm.","King Luo Dong was just an expert from a small Astral Domain. He was at the bottom of the list of those at the Mastery Realm Middle Stage.","Once a cultivator lost the courage to advance and hid in the same place, he would not make further achievements for the rest of his life.","After all, not everyone could get the chance to be reborn like Zhang Han.","“Today, we have to celebrate and drink 3,000 glasses of wine!”","Elder Li laughed out loud, as though he wanted to get drunk.","“There’s no hurry in this.”","Zhang Han shook his head and said, “I have something to trouble you with, Elder Li.”","Elder Li’s expression changed slightly when he heard this. He waved his hand and said, “Don’t be so courteous to me. Just tell me what you need.”","Zhang Han took a light breath and said, “I need to look for my wife. I know where she is. In order to be safe, I need you to go with me.”","“Alright.”","Elder Li hesitated for a moment and then nodded. He waved his hand and beckoned dozens of his subordinates over. “Take your men and leave with me. Elder Ma, you and the other elders and protectors stay here and continue to explore the secret realm. When you think you’re done exploring, you can go back. Just tell them that... I met an old friend and need to go out for a while. I’ll be back after I’m done with my business.”","“Yes, Elder Li.”","Elder Ma nodded.","He asked his men to disperse and lead their own teams.","There were about a hundred thousand people. They marched forward in a mighty manner, ready to leave this place.","They walked on the mountains and rivers.","“This secret realm is very large. It’s the central continent, surrounded by the sea, as well as some subsidiary continents. Farther away from the subsidiary continents, there is a peripheral continent. I don’t know how long this secret realm has existed. It is said that someone came here from the peripheral continent. It took them five years to get here. We were lucky and directly appeared on the central continent.”","Elder Li said on the way, “We’re not far from the exit. Our fleets are all there.”","It was not that far, but it took them two more days to get there.","The exit was on the mirror-like ground.","The group started to leave.","As soon as they jumped into the mirror, they appeared in the void of the universe. They were now on the periphery of the huge energy layer of the secret realm.","They also saw that thousands of king vessels were levitating in the void where their fleet was located.","“Let’s wait for a moment until everyone is in place. About 100 spaceships will leave with us,” Elder Li said.","The group entered Elder Li’s spaceship. Only a few of them were in the lounge.","The other core subordinates were all scattered in different spaceships.","“Where are we going?” Elder Li asked.","“There.”","Zhang Han pointed to the Star Map on the screen and said, “Fly in a straight line for five days first.”","“Okay.”","The intelligent system controlled the spaceship to jump into the secondary space and begin a new round of flight.","This time, the fleet was heading straight for Zi Yan.","Zhang Han was going to pick her up.","The difficulties he had gone through still couldn’t stop his footsteps.","A few minutes after he sat down, a large sum of wine and meat was brought up.","There were eighty dishes for a total of eight people.","There were more than a hundred jars of wine on the side.","“This wine is called Clearwind Intoxication. You’ll feel drunk after drinking it. Now, let’s have a good drink,” Elder Li said with a smile.","“Okay.”","Zhang Han remembered that in the past, he often drank with Elder Li and the others in the Cloud Shadow Sky. After he left, every time he came back, he would have a good drink with them for a few days.","At the table, Zhang Guangyou had a much more relaxed time.","He picked up a jar and poured a bowl of wine. Just as he picked it up, he wanted to propose a toast to Elder Li.","He said amiably, “Elder Li, I’m so glad that we met you in the secret realm. You helped us solve a big problem...”","“Well, Uncle Zhang, you are being too courteous.” Elder Li straightened his body, grabbed a jar of wine with his right hand, and said, “I have to make a toast to you first.”","Gurgle. Gurgle. Gurgle.","The jar of wine was completely drained by Elder Li.","Zhang Guangyou was dumbfounded.","“How can one drink like that?”","He was a bit stunned.","“He just finished a jar at once?”","“Well...”","Elder Li looked at the bowl of wine Zhang Guangyou just poured and said with a smile, “I’ve just finished mine. You can drink as much as you want. Since you’re in my place, make yourself home.”","“That won’t do.” Zhang Guangyou shook his head repeatedly and picked up a jar of wine with his right hand.","Gurgle, gurgle...","It took him twice as much time as Elder Li did. After he finished drinking, Zhang Guangyou’s face suddenly turned red, and he sighed inwardly.","“This wine is so strong!”","“Hahaha. Amazing!”","Elder Li laughed and then looked at Zhang Han, saying, “Here. Drink this jar of wine for our reunion and your well-being!”","“Cheers!”","Zhang Han held up a jar and gulped the wine down.","The two of them drank from the jar. The others present did not feel that it was inelegant. Instead, they thought that Elder Li and Zhang Han were unrestrained and frank.","It was natural for a man to do anything once he was thought highly of by others.","Without needing anyone to ask, Elder Li began to tell his story after five to six jars of wine.","“When I was in Cloud Shadow Sky, I was only at the Yuan Ying Realm Last Stage. Sect Leader Ning, the other seven elders, and I were all brothers who had gone through thick and thin together. I didn’t agree to the establishment of the sect at that time, but for convenience and a fixed residence, we still did it. In my opinion, Sect Leader Ning and Big Brother Bai were smart. The sect gradually developed and expanded. Later, for the sake of honor and to become stronger, those juniors worked very hard. I found that quite interesting.","“When did Hanyang go there? 1,500 years ago, he was still a greenhorn who knew nothing. I remember that he had a grudge against several protectors in the sect. The sect was big, so it was normal for them to have disputes. We didn’t care much about it. I didn’t expect that Hanyang would defeat them all with ease later. His speed of improving his realm suddenly became the fastest in the younger generation of the North Peak. Then, he defeated the top master of the South Peak, became the strongest talent, and then became a protector. At that time, his strength was almost the same as mine.”","“...”","As Elder Li recounted what had happened to Zhang Han in the Cloud Shadow Sky, he sighed with emotion.","Mengmeng listened with great interest and laughed from time to time.","The others also focused on what Elder Li said. Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali realized that Elder Li and Zhang Han had been together for such a long time.","“It’s all in the past. It’s been too long.” Zhang Han slightly shook his head.","When old friends met, they would definitely reminisce about the old days.","When they were almost done chatting, Elder Li smiled and asked, “Well, are you going back to the place you’ve always been looking for?”","“Yeah,” Zhang Han chuckled and said.","“Is that place in our Sea Dragon Star Area?” Elder Li asked.","“I’m not sure. It’s like a hidden secret realm. There’s a very low chance that one can get out of it, but without particular guidance, others would never get to find it,” Zhang Han said.","“I see. I was wondering why you almost turned the entire Sea Dragon Star Area upside down back then,” Elder Li laughed and said. “If I have a chance, I’ll go visit your hometown.”","“We can go there after I pick up my wife,” Zhang Han said casually.","“I’m afraid now is not a good time.”","Unexpectedly, Elder Li’s face froze slightly, and there was a hint of bitterness in his words."]},{"number":1452,"title":"Chapter 1452 Desperation","paragraphs":["Chapter 1452 Desperation","“What’s the matter?” Zhang Han asked in confusion.","“It’s hard to explain all in just a few words.”","Elder Li finished a jar of wine and said, “Hanyang, as you know, you gave us a lot of spiritual treasures and even a lot of rare Elemental Sources to enhance our aptitude for cultivation back then.","“Only in this way could we have a chance to reach a higher realm. Otherwise, I’m afraid that the God Transformation Realm would be our limit. We cultivated until we reached the God Transformation Realm Peak Stage and then went to explore the outside world.","“It took us about two hundred years to practice in several sects after we reached the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven. At that time, we had reached the Void-refining Realm.","“Sect Leader Ning and Elder Bai were the first ones to reach the Integration Realm. The rest of us reached the Void-refining Realm Peak Stage. We left the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven and went to the barren Star Areas to gain experience. We passed through hundreds of secret realms and wandered around the various Astral Domains.","“In the end, we were all in the Integration Realm and came to the Ocean Astral Domain hundreds of years ago.","“When we were practicing in the Illusory Sea Manor, Sect Leader Ning and Elder Bai reached the Mastery Realm and were chosen by the Sect Master. Later, we encountered a life-and-death crisis in a secret realm in a barren Star Area, and Sect Master saved us. At that time, we planned to go to the Silver Dragon Galaxy.","“However, Sect Master said that he was going out to travel. After he left, he was worried about the sect, so he asked us to take charge of it. Although he said that, later he requested us to repay him for saving us.","“He wanted us to refine our main Soul Lamps, but we weren’t willing to. It became a bit unpleasant. Later on, Sect Master swore with his soul that he would return the Soul Lamps in a hundred years. He asked us for that just to be at ease.","“At first, we were very grateful that he saved us. We discussed it, and then... we agreed in the end. However, once we did something wrong, the appointed time would be added. Now more than 300 years have passed, and we can’t leave. Sect Master wouldn’t let us go. He is now at the Tribulation Stage First Tier. The brothers and I have been dealing with almost all the affairs of the sect, and he has several core subordinates to assist us.”","Elder Li’s words made everyone silent.","Zhang Han also knew that Elder Li had simplified his story.","“What happened before they agreed?” The Sect Master must have used something to threaten or tempt them, or he had used something they were afraid of.","Otherwise, no one would be willing to hand over the Soul Lamp to someone else.","The Soul Lamp was closely related to the main soul. Once the other party harbored malicious intentions and used some means, the consequences would be unimaginable.","“Isn’t this just a shameless act?” Mu Xue snorted.","“Sort of. There’s nothing I can do about it.” Elder Li sighed and laughed.","He had long been used to it.","“However, we can do whatever we want in the Ocean Astral Domain. We cultivate the same as usual. If we want to leave the Astral Domain, we just need the Sect Master to agree to it in person. Moreover, he doesn’t let too many people come out every time. The Sect Master of the Illusory Sea Manor has a strong sense of security. If he doesn’t give us a chance to leave, we won’t be able to either.”","Elder Li said, “But, Hanyang, since I’ve learned that you’re still alive, I’m relieved. I think you’ll come to pick us up in less than a hundred years. That’s good. We’ll get our business done here. When you’re fully developed, come over to talk. Sect Master wouldn’t dare to say no. Haha, you’re Han Yang Immortal. I mean it. If he knows your past reputation, I’m afraid he’ll piss his pants in fear.”","“It won’t take a hundred years.”","Zhang Han shook his head and said, “It won’t be long before I return to the Tribulation Stage. But there’s still a way... There was an elder who reached the Tribulation Stage. He should be at least at the third tier. Unfortunately, our team was swallowed by the space, and I don’t know where he is now.”","“Is that so?”","Elder Li Shan laughed and said, “It’s okay. Time is not a problem. Hope is the most important thing. There’s no need to trouble others. We’ll be fine in the Illusory Sea Manor for the time being. If there’s a chance this time, let’s go there together. I believe that Sect Leader Ning, Elder Bai, and the others will be very happy to see you.”","“After I pick up my wife, I’ll go there when I have a chance,” Zhang Han nodded and said.","“Who is your wife?” Elder Li was a little curious, and his expression was strange. “I wonder what kind of woman can... be with you.”","“She’s a super beautiful woman,” Mengmeng said with a snort.","“Haha, don’t get me wrong. I didn’t mean to offend you. What I meant was that your father had never spoiled the Saintly Women and Divine Women of those sects in the past. When he disliked them, he would send them flying with a single slap,” Elder Li laughed and said.","The others present had strange looks on their faces when they heard this.","“Was Zhang Han so short-tempered?”","“That’s why I’m curious. How did they end up together?” Elder Li asked with a smile.","“I know that.” Mengmeng took the initiative to say, “When my dad was wooing my mum, he always put in a lot of effort. I keep that all in mind. He was so romantic at that time. Daddy even sang songs for her.”","Swoosh!","The smile on Elder Li’s face froze.","“What the hell?","“Their daughter saw it. What...”","Seeing that Elder Li looked quite confused, Zhang Han said, “She’s our biological daughter. We had her first before we got together.”","“I see. I see.” Elder Li exhaled and said, “I almost misunderstood. May I know who your wife is?”","“She’s not an ordinary cultivator. She’s very powerful. Well, she has a Roc, an Ancient Cursed Roc,” Zhang Han said.","“Well, I’m sure she’s not ordinary... Wait! What did you say? She has a Roc?”","Gurgle!","Elder Li swallowed a bit in a daze.","“What level is she at to have a Roc?”","He and his companions had never seen a Roc, which was the king of the Exotic Beasts since they were young.","That was something that high-end Tribulation Stage experts could only see when they traveled around.","“You’ll see it in a few days.” Zhang Han smiled and said, “We married for love, and it has nothing to do with cultivation.”","“Wow.”","Elder Li also smiled. He picked up a jar of wine and said, “Drink a jar for your love, Hanyang.”","“Cheers.”","“...”","Five days later, they got out of the secondary space.","After Zhang Han sensed the direction, they continued on the journey.","However, Elder Li Shan was bemused.","...","“Judging by the direction, she seems to be in the Ocean Astral Domain.”","Hearing this, Zhang Han nodded slightly and said, “It’s a 70% chance that she’s there. The Ocean Astral Domain is very large. I’ve been there a few times. It should be the largest Astral Domain in the Silver Dragon Galaxy.”","Elder Li smiled and said, “Yes, it’s large, but the Astral Domains there are not too big. If it is the place she’s in, things will be convenient. The Illusory Sea Manor is a top sect in the Ocean Astral Domain. Although my brothers and I have some restrictions, we still have very high status in the sect.”","“Alright.”","Zhang Han nodded slightly and said, “I just hope this can be done as soon as possible.”","The red seal’s energy reaction was about to dissipate.","And the closer he got to Zi Yan, the more anxious Zhang Han became.","It had been two years since he last saw her.","How was she doing?","Zhang Han had always been worried about her.","But he was helpless.","...","“She must be missing me very much. She must be waiting for me to pick her up.”","Although her disappearance had nothing to do with Zhang Han, he still blamed himself in his heart at this time.","Two years had passed. During the first ten months, he had been asleep in a palace in the void in the Domain of Seven Desolations.","After he woke up, it took him two months to find Mengmeng on the Vast Heaven Star before setting off.","It had been another year since they started to travel around.","After calculating, he found that Mengmeng was already 17.","In the Cultivation World, time flew by too fast.","Swoosh!","The spaceship reappeared in the void. Zhang Han confirmed the direction and then continued to move forward.","During these days, Zhang Han and Elder Li also talked about their cultivation.","Originally, Sect Leader Ning and Elder Bai were both about to advance to the Tribulation Stage First Tier. And they were even one step away from the Tribulation Stage.","Unfortunately, they failed in the end.","For some reason, the energy of the Thunder Tribulation was very high, and there was no problem with their state of mind, but something unexpected had happened.","It was hard to predict what would happen in the world. Now, Sect Leader Ning and the eight First Elders were all at the Peak Stage of the Mastery Realm.","Tribulation Stage was a barrier. After crossing it, one would truly get into the upper echelons of the Cultivation World.","However, no matter how hard they tried, they could not reach it.","Just like that, Zhang Han and his group were getting closer and closer to the Ocean Astral Domain.","A few days later, they arrived at a small Star Area on the edge of the Ocean Astral Domain.","They kept advancing and were getting closer and closer to the Astral Domain.","When they came to its edge, Zhang Han sensed the Blood Source Incantation and clicked on the coordinates of the Star Map in the system.","“We’ll go there.”","The fleet set off again.","In the secondary space, they flew at high speed.","The territory of the Ocean Astral Domain was vast. It truly did require some time for them to get to their destination.","On the other side, where the Fifth Heavenly King of the Sacred Wolf Mountain and Emperor Ao, the Blackhill Empire’s ruler, was at.","The two armies were still hunting down the Purple Moon Empire.","On this day.","“They’ve stopped!”","“Their fleet has stopped. Finally, they can no longer keep flying!”","When the Fifth Heavenly King’s teams left the void of the universe and saw many aircraft fleeing to a barren planet, they were overjoyed.","“It’s been a year. We’ve been chasing after them for a whole year. Now we’re finally getting them!”","“That detestable Purple Moon Empire should have been destroyed long ago.”","“How can they escape after going to the surface of this planet? Hahahaha, they’re courting death!”","“It means that their resources have been exhausted, and they can no longer fly in space.”","“Hurry up and inform the Fifth Heavenly King that we’re about to catch them.”","Many people were so excited that they could not control themselves.","It seemed that a great battle was about to take place, making everyone feel thrilled.","When the Fifth Heavenly King’s men informed him.","“Hmm?","“They abandoned their fleet and fled to the Barren Star?”","The Fifth Heavenly King strode out of his closed-door training room and came to the central control room. He sat on his chair and looked at the screen to capture the scene.","He faintly laughed and said, “Let them run. Let them all go to the Barren Star. Disperse the fleet and send out the detection aircraft to lock down this planet in all directions.”","At this time, the Fifth Heavenly King’s eyes seemed to be filled with a hint of mockery.","He supposed the other party should know that fleeing to the Barren Star was basically a dead end. They had no choice but to make this choice.","On the other side.","“Emperor Ao, the other party has finally stopped.”","Someone from the Blackhill Empire had come to report.","“Is that so?”","Emperor Ao’s face lit up with joy. “Wonderful!”","The strength of Emperor Ao of the Blackhill Empire was at the Last Stage of the Integration Realm. The most peripheral forces in the Astral Domain did not have much strength. Some of the Sect Masters were even in the Void-refining Realm. Some of the Sect Leaders of the lower-class sects were even in the God Transformation Realm. If that weren’t the case, the Purple Moon Empire would not have risen so quickly in the peripheral area.","“What did Fifth Heavenly King say about this?” Emperor Ao immediately asked.","“He didn’t say anything. He just said that he will let these people escape to the Barren Star first, seal off the planet, and then play with them slowly,” the subordinate replied.","“Hahaha, since the Fifth Heavenly King is in such a good mood, we’ll just watch from the side.” Emperor Ao laughed and said, “By the way, install the signal tower and do a live broadcast in our Wood Elven Star Area at the same time. The signal here is not great, so this matter should be done as soon as possible. When we catch the other party, I will tell all the people in the Wood Elven Star Area what will happen to the Purple Moon Empire for going against the Blackhill Empire!”","As he spoke, he actually began to grow excited.","What did he mean by his plan?","First, the Blackhill Empire would destroy the rising Purple Moon Empire.","Second, it was the Fifth Heavenly King who took action. He was one of the giants of the Sacred Wolf Mountain, and Emperor Ao had a backer there.","If this matter was handled properly, no one in their Star Area would dare to go against the Black Mountain Empire.","In fact, Emperor Ao knew very well that the reason why the Fifth Heavenly King would personally lead the team to carry out a hunt-down for a year was that he was going after that young Roc.","It had nothing to do with him, Emperor Ao.","The people on their side took action and quickly built a small space station outside the planet. The materials and procedures were not complicated, and the construction of the signal tower could be completed in about a day.","When the Blackhill Empire started to build the signal tower, the Fifth Heavenly King had already received the news.","He didn’t pay attention to this.","In his eyes, the Blackhill Empire was just a third-rate force.","If it weren’t for the fact that Emperor Ao would provide him with a lot of resources every year and he happened to take a walk around after his close-door training, he wouldn’t have come here.","However, it turned out that it was good to walk more. He actually spotted a young Roc.","If he could tame the Exotic Beast that tempted him, he would benefit greatly.","After chasing for a year, he consumed a lot of Energy Stones and crystal stones.","However, these things meant nothing to him.","“This game is about to end.”","The Fifth Heavenly King looked at the scene on the screen indifferently.","Many aircraft had fled to the surface. But where could they go? They had no way to escape from this planet.","There were also a lot of voices around Zi Yan.","“We’re done for! We can’t escape!”","“I told you back then that we shouldn’t have recklessly expanded our force. No one listened to me. Now, we’re all going to die.”","“Moon Empress, say something. You’re so powerful. Why can’t you take everyone with you to escape?”","“Enough!” Ke Zhan frowned and said, “The expansion was so fast before, but didn’t you enjoy the extra cultivation resources we got? Haha, you now sound so righteous. After you got that resources, didn’t you attack faster? Are you kidding me by saying this now?”","“Ke Zhan, what are you pretending for?” Someone said coldly with dissatisfaction, “If you hadn’t followed Moon Empress earlier and had such an identity, things would’ve been different. Don’t forget your own realm. Strength is the most important thing in the Cultivation World!”","“You!”","Ke Zhan’s face turned livid, and then he took a deep breath and said, “Let’s not talk about strength. We’re all on the same side now, so there’s no need for unnecessary arguments. We need to think of a way to escape from a weak point in their defense.”","“Everyone can make sarcastic remarks.” An old man in the crowd said slowly, “It’s you decision-makers who put the whole group in danger. I hope that when disaster befalls us, you will be the first to take it.”","The crowd was wavering.","Some even beat their chests and stamped their feet in regret. “I should have left the team privately back then, otherwise, I would not have ended up like this!”"]},{"number":1453,"title":"Chapter 1453 The Final Negotiation","paragraphs":["Chapter 1453 The Final Negotiation","The crowd was wavering, and the team seemed to be on the verge of collapse.","Ke Zhan looked at Zi Yan with a wry smile and said, “Moon Empress, do we still have any hope?”","“Hope...” Zi Yan was silent for two seconds. She spoke as if she were talking to herself, “Yes. My husband will pick me up. Yeah.”","She came to her senses and said in a determined tone, “We still have hope. Although I’ve never said it, that’s the truth. My husband will come to pick me up.”","“May I know who your husband is? What cultivation level is he at?” The others’ expressions changed slightly.","Even those who were complaining had stopped.","Everyone’s eyes were fixed on Ziyan.","No one saw the expression on her face under the black robe, but her tone gave people hope. “I don’t know the specific realm, but when my husband was cultivating, an accident happened. The space was torn apart. I was teleported a long distance to come here...”","Zi Yan was telling the truth, but what she said was ambiguous.","However, everyone present was a little shocked. “He created spatial rifts during cultivation? What kind of strength does he have?”","“He can’t be a Supreme Expert, right?!”","“Moon Empress’s husband is definitely not ordinary!”","“Does this mean that... we still have a chance?”","Zi Yan nodded and said, “Yes. As long as my husband gets here, we will be safe.”","They had some hope in despair. It shut the complaints of those who were complaining.","“Call for all the aircraft. I’m Ke Zhan. We’ll escape to the surface. We still have reinforcements and hope. Moon Empress’s husband is on his way here. When he arrives, we’ll be safe!”","Ke Zhan sent the message to many aircraft.","They had hope again.","In this place, although some people formed alliances quickly, there were still some people who were loyal.","The moment they heard the news, they all laughed. Someone joked, “So our Moon Empress has a husband.”","“Moon Empress’s voice is particularly pleasant to the ear. She should be a beautiful lady. I used to believe the rumor that Moon Empress is ugly.”","“How powerful is Moon Empress’s husband? She didn’t say what realm he was in.”","“Anyway, we have reinforcements. Let’s buy some time on this planet.”","“...”","Everyone’s idea had changed from “no way to escape” to “how to buy time on this planet”.","The fleet was vast and mighty.","On the way, everyone was worried about whether the enemy’s fleet would launch a bombardment.","Unexpectedly, they came to the surface of the planet very smoothly.","The fleets in the void of the universe looked at them quietly as if they were deliberately letting their prey escape first before continuing the game of hunting.","Some people also noticed that the enemy’s fleets were sending out a lot of aircraft to seal off the planet.","Five hours passed.","“Your Majesty, the blockade is complete.”","One of the Fifth Heavenly King’s subordinates reported.","The Fifth Heavenly King didn’t even raise his eyes and said in a flat tone, “Begin the bombardment and force them to a continent.”","Several of his subordinates were already used to his means. Bombarding a planet could totally destroy it. The Fifth Heavenly King had bombarded many Barren Stars as well as civilized planets before.","When Emperor Ao of the Blackhill Empire heard the news, he burst out laughing.","“Send out all the king vessels to assist in the bombardment.”","In the void of the universe where the planet was located, king vessels were lined up in a certain area.","“Ion Energy Cannons are prepared to charge.”","The countdown for the bombardment began. 60, 59, 58...","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Huge light beams began to fall from the sky to the ground.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","A large-scale bombardment was launched.","The ground cracked, huge stones flew in all directions, and ashes began to wreak havoc on the ground.","“They’ve begun bombarding the planet.”","Many people around Zi Yan began to speak.","“As expected, their first wave of attacks is to bombard us and force us to a certain place.”","“We still have a few choices. First, go to a cave under the glacier. Second, go deep into the sea. Third, go to an underground cave that’s deep enough. Fourth, stay on the surface and wait for them to finish bombarding the continent. Then, we’ll go back and forth to hide. No matter which way we use, we’ll be able to buy some time.”","“I suggest that we divide into several teams and hide separately. Except for a few people like the Fifth Heavenly King, we don’t need to be afraid of most of them.”","They analyzed and considered all kinds of situations.","However, to their surprise, the bombardment lasted for a whole day and night. The enemy blew up the planet three times.","After the bombardment of the king vessels was over, some KW3019 bombers got to the surface one after one.","“Alert. Underground Energy Bombs detected.”","...","This time, many people’s expressions changed. “They’re going to bombard the planet further? Aren’t they afraid that the planet will explode?”","If they really blew up the planet, they would also suffer heavy losses, and even most of them would not be able to escape.","Under normal circumstances, even if they were chasing after enemies, they wouldn’t blow up a planet so decisively. Moreover, they were clearly aware that Moon Empress still had the legendary Roc in her possession. So, how could the Fifth Heavenly King possibly make such a bad decision when he had taken a fancy to the Roc?","Many people knew that even if the other party bombarded the planet like this, it was just their means. Before the Fifth Heavenly King got the Roc, it was impossible for him to kill the people of the Purple Moon Empire.","However, they were still scared.","“What should we do?”","Many of the people from the Purple Moon Empire were at a loss.","Many of them were injured by the explosion, and those who were unlucky even died directly.","“It can’t go on like this.”","An old man, one of the core members who couldn’t hold it in any longer, suggested, “Since the Fifth Heavenly King wants us to gather, let’s just do it. We can take this chance and negotiate with him. Moon Empress’s husband is not an ordinary person. The Fifth Heavenly King would be more or less wary of him.”","“That’s right. Let’s gather. If this goes on, no one can take it.”","...","“We can indeed negotiate with the Fifth Heavenly King.”","“We have no choice. When our spaceships ran out of Energy Stones and couldn’t move forward, we had already lost. Even if we lose, we have to see the reality.”","These words resonated with the crowd.","It was true that when their spaceship couldn’t move forward, they had lost completely and simply.","The only and most important bargaining chip they had now was Moon Empress’s Roc.","Ke Zhan was silent.","The general trend could not be stopped. Judging from the reactions of the dozens of high-position officials present, almost 90% of them agreed with this decision.","It was as if they were forcing Moon Empress to abdicate. He knew very well that the ultimate price might be the sacrifice of Moon Empress alone, but how could they, the high-position officials, escape?","“This won’t work.”","Ke Zhan did not say anything. He did not have much of a say in any decisions in this group.","“Inform all the teams to gather in the plain area here.”","Some people overstepped their boundaries. They didn’t even ask Zi Yan, Ke Zhan, and a few other decision-makers before directly giving the order.","The others did as they were told and informed their subordinate teams one after another.","Around the planet, many teams began to rise to a low altitude and quickly gathered in the plain area where Zi Yan was.","“Your Majesty, they’ve assembled!”","One of the Fifth Heavenly King’s subordinates reported.","“So soon?” The Fifth Heavenly King finally opened his eyes, which were shining. “When they gather together, send out everyone to seal off the area.”","“Yes, Your Majesty!”","The men of the Fifth Heavenly King began to take action.","Countless aircraft densely flew to the ground and began to set up an encirclement.","After hearing the news, Emperor Ao of the Blackhill Empire immediately stood up from his seat.","He stared at the screen and waved his hand, saying, “Drop the Hurricane Bombs at the gathering place to blow away the dust. Next, I want all the forces in the Star Area to witness what will happen to the Purple Moon Empire!”","Just as the Fifth Heavenly King’s men took action, dozens of artillery shells exploded in the sky.","The violent wind howled and blew in all directions from the explosion point.","A clean place appeared on the planet with foul air.","However, this land seemed to be about to face an even greater disaster.","Just six hours later, the people on Zi Yan’s side gathered on the plain.","There were too many combat aircraft around, and the enemy forces were gathering there.","It was as though a great battle was about to begin.","“With the Fifth Heavenly King here, we have no chance to escape.”","Even a few core subordinates of Zi Yan thought of this.","“I thought I could buy some time, but the Fifth Heavenly King’s means are too fierce. For us, the safest way is to hand over Moon Empress.”","“As long as the restrictions are appropriate, nothing will happen to us. We’ll see if Moon Empress can...”","“No one wants to die,” someone rejected. “Moon Empress is very decisive in the killing.”","“Haha, after such a long time, we have also figured out Moon Empress’s cultivation realm. It is nothing more than the Void-refining Realm. To tell you the truth, Emperor Ao of the Blackhill Empire is a master in the Integration Realm.”","Everyone seemed to have their own thoughts. They formed cliques and waited for the arrival of the Fifth Heavenly King.","“Start the live broadcast now!”","Before Emperor Ao of the Blackhill Empire was about to depart, he gave his subordinates the order.","On their special website, a live broadcast was on.","“What kind of live broadcast is this? The destruction of the Purple Moon Empire? Is this happening?”","“It seems to be a barren planet on the camera.”","The number of viewers gradually increased. Even some of the noble families in the Star Area where the Blackhill Empire was located couldn’t help but gasp when they saw the Fifth Heavenly King on camera.","“It’s been a year, and the Fifth Heavenly King is still hunting those people down. What did the Blackhill Empire do to win the Fifth Heavenly King’s favor?”","“Looks like we’ll have to have a completely new appraisal of the Blackhill Empire’s power.”","The effect was not bad. It was almost the same as what Emperor Ao had expected.","But at this moment, Emperor Ao was standing beside the Fifth Heavenly King, looking very well-behaved.","The group of people flew through the void, with the Fifth Heavenly King leading the way. Behind him were a few of his core subordinates, as well as Emperor Ao and the others.","Behind them were many aircraft.","It was a vast and mighty army pressing down.","From the sky, they could see the Purple Moon Empire’s aircraft legion and the core members standing in the center.","“Hahaha. Purple Moon! How do you feel now?”","Emperor Ao laughed out loud. From a distance, he said arrogantly, “How dare you challenge our Blackhill Empire? The Purple Moon Empire has committed a grave crime. The so-called Moon Empress, your leader, has not been recognized. Even the three magnates have agreed to destroy her. As the remaining evils of the Purple Moon Empire, you’ll die today! The Fifth Heavenly King is here. Why aren’t you kneeling yet?”","He was extremely arrogant.","However, in the eyes of Ke Zhan and his men, the winner had the right to be arrogant.","Even so, no one paid any attention to Emperor Ao.","They all knew that the decision-maker was the Fifth Heavenly King, so Emperor Ao had nothing to do with this.","“I really didn’t expect that a small force could keep escaping under my nose for a whole year.”","The Fifth Heavenly King suddenly spoke.","He looked at Zi Yan and said flatly, “It is said that no one has ever seen the face of the Purple Moon Empire’s Moon Empress. Now that you have become a prisoner, take off your tattered black robe and show me your face.”","“There’s no need for this. Fifth Heavenly King, just tell me what you want,” Zi Yan said calmly.","She was very calm at this time. In the face of such a situation, she knew that she had to be calm.","“It’s simple. Hand over what I want,” the Fifth Heavenly King said bluntly.","“What if I don’t hand it over?” Zi Yan said.","“You don’t?”","The Fifth Heavenly King smiled. His smile was a little playful, but there was a cold light in his eyes.","He flicked his sleeve.","Rumble!","He grabbed a mountain from a distance and threw it into the air. The invisible energy magnified the mountain dozens of times and smashed it into the crowd of the Purple Moon Empire.","“AAAAH!”","More than ten thousand people were killed or injured in a single strike.","Many people began to panic.","No one had expected the Fifth Heavenly King to be so ruthless and make a move as soon as he spoke.","“Will you hand it over now?” the Fifth Heavenly King asked again.","“No.” Zi Yan’s palms trembled slightly.","This feeling was simply too terrible.","Rumble!","Another powerful attack killed thousands of people.","“Will you hand it over now?”","“No.”","Zi Yan closed her eyes.","There were already a lot of words lingering in her ears.","“Moon Empress, hand it over! We won’t die if you hand it over!”","“Many people have died. They are all your brothers who have fought with you for your empire!”","“Moon Empress, everyone’s lives and deaths are in your hands.”","Some high-position officials even said, “Fifth Heavenly King, don’t kill us. We can persuade Moon Empress.”","“Hmm?”","The look on the face of the Fifth Heavenly King became more playful. He smiled faintly and said, “Okay. I’ll give you 10 minutes.”","At this moment, the Fifth Heavenly King was like a god that controlled life and death.","What he didn’t know was that a series of fleets were speeding over from the secondary space not far away."]},{"number":1454,"title":"Chapter 1454 Kill Them! And Spare No One","paragraphs":["Chapter 1454 Kill Them! And Spare No One","“Moon Empress!”","Someone pounded his chest and stamped his feet, crying in grief.","“You can’t just watch us die! We’re all your brothers who fought for you!”","Many of the weaker subordinates shouted, “Moon Empress, hand it over! Hurry up and hand over that Exotic Beast. Is it more important than our lives?”","“Moon Empress, stop being so selfish!”","Many high-position officials said via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “Moon Empress, don’t hand it over in such a hurry. Before you do it, you must ensure everyone’s safety.”","“It’s better to do it after all of us leave, or make the Fifth Heavenly King make an oath.”","“Our lives are in grave danger. You have to hand it over. You must be clear about the current situation.”","“...”","In the face of so many voices, Zi Yan was quite helpless at this time.","But there were also a small number of people who were silent.","For example, Ke Zhan had been silent the whole time. When the ten minutes given by the Fifth Heavenly King were about to end, Ke Zhan said, “Moon Empress, ever since the Ke family and I followed you, we have witnessed and even created many miracles. We have no regrets about this and respect your choice.”","Ten minutes had passed.","The Fifth Heavenly King shook his head slightly and said, “It seems that your dear Moon Empress doesn’t care about your life and death.”","“Haha.” Emperor Ao behind him laughed coldly and said, “They’re just a mob. Do they really think they’re working for a wise ruler? And a woman at that?”","“Hand it over.”","The Fifth Heavenly King moved, and endless pressure spread out. It seemed that he was going to take action in person.","“Even if I die, you can’t get it.” Zi Yan’s voice was a little sad, and what she said instantly stopped the pace of the Fifth Heavenly King.","There was a trace of gloom in his eyes.","He was really afraid of this. He didn’t want to have his time wasted.","“Humph!”","The Fifth Heavenly King snorted coldly and unleashed his full power at the Last Stage of the Mastery Realm, unleashing a thousand-meter-tall palm strike.","Rumble!","With a single move, over ten thousand people died.","The hearts of the people watching from the side went cold, as though a great chill had spread from their backs to their entire bodies.","“Zi Yue!”","Someone cursed, “You really are a selfish person. Even if I die and become a ghost, I’ll keep haunting you!”","“Damn it. You don’t care at all about us. I can’t wait to kill you!”","“Fifth Heavenly King, this has nothing to do with us. Please show mercy. We can help you catch Purple Moon. Don’t kill us!”","“...”","Emperor Ao clapped his hands. “Interesting, really interesting. Purple Moon, what are you still pretending for? Hurry up and do as you’re told!”","The Fifth Heavenly King calmed down and said with a faint smile, “Tell me, what can I do to make you hand it over? Spare your men?”","As soon as he said that, Emperor Ao’s face slightly changed.","“If these people are spared, wouldn’t this live stream be in vain?”","Just now, he had diverted his attention to observe the live broadcast. There were a lot of viewers, and many of them were from noble families. When they saw the situation on the screen, most of them were happy to discuss it and watch the fun. They were all onlookers. Many of them were shocked by the Blackhill Empire and started to reevaluate its strength. But if Emperor Ao and his men let go of the people of Purple Moon in the end, the effect would be greatly reduced.","In the face of the Fifth Heavenly King’s question, Zi Yan was silent for a long time.","There seemed to be tens of thousands of people around talking.","“This is such a mess!","“What should I do?”","Zi Yan’s breathing quickened a little, and she finally compromised, “Let them go first. I’ll stay here. Until they’re safe...”","“I think you’re mistaken. Hand the Roc over and you’ll be safe. If you don’t, they’ll all die slowly,” the Fifth Heavenly King teased.","If he let them go, it would be a waste of time if she ended up killing herself.","If he kept these people, he could use them to restrict her and threaten her.","Zi Yan had also thought of this.","In the current situation, the Fifth Heavenly King would not hurt her high-position officials for the time being. Some unimportant subordinates were his targets to start the killing.","“I’ll give you half an hour. If you don’t hand the Roc over, I’ll kill half of you. If you do, I might let you go if I’m in a good mood,” the Fifth Heavenly King said lightly.","His words made the people on Zi Yan’s side fall silent.","They felt like they were in a dilemma.","The Fifth Heavenly King was so terrifying that no one dared to resist while being pressed by his might.","Even before they came to this planet, many people were fantasizing about whether there would be an undiscovered secret realm on this planet that they could go to other places through its exit.","However, that was almost impossible. They had to face the cruel reality.","Without any chance to escape, they had to face the Fifth Heavenly King here head-on.","Half an hour passed by in a flash.","“I’ll now kill half of you. Let me see where to start.”","...","The eyes of the Fifth Heavenly King flashed with a cold light. Wherever his gaze passed, those who were scanned felt a chill all over and were scared out of their wits.","“There’s no need to do this. If I do not wish to hand the Roc over, it would be useless no matter how many people you kill.”","Zi Yan exhaled and said, “Let them go. I’ll stay here alone.”","“Let them go?” The Fifth Heavenly King sneered. “Maybe you’ve hidden the Roc in someone else’s body and want to take advantage of the chaos to get away. I’m telling you, if you don’t hand it over, no one can leave.”","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Zi Yan’s men finally understood the Fifth Heavenly King’s stand.","They couldn’t help but turn pale.","It turned out that the Fifth Heavenly King had never thought of letting anyone go.","“There’s, there’s still a way!”","An old man not far away from Zi Yan said, “We’ll go back to the fleets. You can seal off the space. When Moon Empress hands over the Roc, you can release us, right?”","“This is also a good idea!”","...","Another high-level official shouted, “Fifth Heavenly King, you should think about it. We also want Zi Yue to give the Roc to you, but she doesn’t listen to me at all!”","“Hmm?”","The Fifth Heavenly King laughed and waved to the two high-position officials who had spoken. “You’re not bad. Do you want to live?”","“Yes!”","The two men answered.","Who would want to die if they were able to survive?","“Kill two companions to show your determination.” The Fifth Heavenly King’s expression was calm.","Hiss!","As soon as he finished speaking, the expressions of the others changed slightly. The two men reacted fast and pulled out their long swords in an instant.","With a flash of light, they killed five or six people around them in a row. The two of them quickly rose into the air.","Seeing that the other experts were about to attack them, the two of them shouted angrily, “We’re carrying out orders in the name of the Fifth Heavenly King. Anyone who dares to stop us will be killed!”","The sound waves surged. The others stopped to attack these two.","The Fifth Heavenly King seemed to be interested, so he glanced around and said, “Who else is the same?”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Countless people broke out in a cold sweat as they looked at the people around them and felt like they were facing a formidable enemy.","Some stayed in groups of three to five, while some were alone, not allowing anyone to get close.","Even so, the scene went chaotic.","Many people tried to kill the ones around them without hesitation.","Gradually, more and more people rose into the air.","Zi Yan closed her eyes when she saw this scene.","Ke Zhan let out a deep sigh.","He was well aware that even if they made it through this crisis, the Purple Moon Empire would still cease to exist.","When the number of people who flew into the air reached a thousand, the Fifth Heavenly King flicked his sleeve.","“Although I have a notorious reputation, I disdain people like you. You shall die now.”","Clatter!","A red cloud appeared, covering the 1,000 people. When the blood-red cloud dissipated, not even a bone of these people was left.","Many of the Purple Moon Empire’s subordinates below felt a chill run down their spines.","It was as if whatever they did, they would still be killed.","What could they do to survive?","The chances were very slim.","They were at a loss.","“What game are we going to play next?”","The Fifth Heavenly King clapped his hands and pondered as if he was thinking about how to play. At the same time, he jokingly said, “There’s plenty of time. We can play slowly.”","At this time, the live broadcast was going on. Although the audience couldn’t see the scene clearly, countless people couldn’t help expressing their thoughts, “The Fifth Heavenly King of the Sacred Wolf Mountain is simply too savage.”","“I don’t know what the Fifth Heavenly King will do next.”","“I feel that the people of the Purple Moon Empire have all become toys that can be manipulated by the Fifth Heavenly King at will.”","“Eh? Why is the signal cut off? Is the connection not stable?”","Sizzle!","A lot of people who were watching the live broadcast suddenly found that the screen was flashing.","It seemed that something was interfering, or it was getting close to weakening the signal.","“I got it!”","The Fifth Heavenly King finally made up his mind.","He chuckled and said, “Moon Empress of the Purple Moon Empire is a woman. It’s just that no one has seen her face, including you high-position officials. Whoever takes off her black robe so that I can take a look at her will be able to survive. Only one person gets to be spared. I mean it this time. You have 10 minutes to do it. Cherish the opportunity. Whoever succeeds can leave directly.”","Swoosh!","Many people’s expressions changed.","“Can I really get to live? Is this the chance to live in a desperate situation?”","Clang!","Ke Zhan drew out his long sword in anger. “I’ll see who dares to do this! Don’t forget how many resources Moon Empress gave you!”","“Ke Zhan, Ke Zhan! Do you really think you’re a piece of cake? Who do you think you are? How dare you talk nonsense here?” An elder spoke with a grim voice.","The Fifth Heavenly King withdrew his palm. When he heard what Ke Zhan said, he almost took action.","It could be said that Ke Zhan had been close to death.","“Moon Empress. This would be the last time I address you this way.”","A square-faced middle-aged man said in a deep voice, “The game of the Fifth Heavenly King is very simple, isn’t it? Even if you are ugly, it’s not shameful for you to be seen by others. Now there is a chance to live. I hope that you can make the right choice and have someone take off your black robe.”","“Hahaha.”","Seeing this, Emperor Ao of the Blackhill Empire burst out laughing. “Whoever takes off her black robe will be spared by the Fifth Heavenly King. But if anyone can strip Purple Moon, I will give him a million crystal stones!”","It was an insult. He wanted to humiliate the Purple Moon Empire.","“You’re just a dog relying on your master’s power!”","Zi Yan suddenly raised her head, looked at the place where Emperor Ao was, and said coldly, “Fifth Heavenly King, take good care of your dog. Also, you don’t have to play these low-level and bad games.”","“Are you mad?” The Fifth Heavenly King waved his hands and said, “Calm down. Let’s discuss this.”","His tone was indifferent. As if he were a god on the field, his lofty posture was fully displayed.","“If you do not wish to continue, then hand the Roc over. I will spare your life. What do you think?”","Everyone could tell that the Fifth Heavenly King was toying with them.","Zi Yan went silent again. She was very powerless.","Swoosh!","Right at this moment, the roar of breaking through the sound barrier suddenly sounded.","A dark shadow was approaching Zi Yan at an extremely fast speed.","“How dare you!”","Ke Zhan and the other seven or eight men were filled with killing intent as they attacked one after another.","But the old man who made the move, despite his serious injury, broke through their attacks and came to Zi Yan.","Clatter!","Zi Yan made a move with anger. She turned sideways and slapped horizontally.","Right at this moment-","Buzz!","A piece of her sleeve was ripped off, revealing her fair palm.","At the same time, Zi Yan’s attack also landed on the man.","Poof!","He couldn’t resist the energy of the Sea Moon Fan at all and was sent flying backward. During this period, he spat out a lot of blood.","When he fell to the ground, he covered his chest, looked at Zi Yan unwillingly, and said with resentment, “You, you could have not done this! Why couldn’t you achieve my aim?! I hate you!”","After that, he died.","His cultivation at the Void-refining Realm Early Stage could not withstand Zi Yan’s full-strength attack at all.","However, Zi Yan was shocked and angry about his attack.","“Fifth Heavenly King!”","Zi Yan seemed to be having a hard time.","There was a glimmer of light on her exposed hand, but her real hand gradually faded.","“Don’t be so agitated. If you die, all of them will die with you. Only if you don’t die will they have a chance to survive. My first request is to take off your black robe and kneel before me with your Original Body,” the Fifth Heavenly King said flatly.","The Blackhill Empire’s Emperor Ao lowered his head and asked, “Fifth Heavenly King, I can see that she is unwilling to obey. Why don’t I help?”","His appearance showed that he was a loyal follower of the Fifth Heavenly King.","The Fifth Heavenly King glanced at him and waved his hand slightly.","“Hahaha.”","The aura of the Emperor Ao of the Blackhill Empire had finally been revealed. After all, he was in the Integration Realm and had some strength.","He stepped in midair and walked toward Zi Yan step by step.","“Moon Empress, I’ve long heard that your strength is not bad. Today, I’ll spar with you. If you win, then I have nothing to say. But if you lose, I’ll make you kneel naked and worship the Fifth Heavenly King!”","Emperor Ao’s goal was very clear. He wanted to ruthlessly humiliate Moon Empress. The more miserable she was, the sharper the Blackhill Empire would appear.","“A battle between the two Imperial Lords. Not bad.” A hint of interest flashed across the face of the Fifth Heavenly King as he added, “I will kill whoever dares to interfere.”","“You’ve gone too far!”","Ke Zhan gritted his teeth.","“Guys, stay out of this.”","Zi Yan took a deep breath and clenched her fists.","Before Emperor Ao could get close, she made more than a dozen Sea Moon Fan attacks powerfully.","Multicolored light burst out.","The energy that was difficult to defend against made Emperor Ao’s eyes narrow.","But after they exchanged hundreds of moves, he found that the Moon Empress below seemed to only know this move.","“There’s nothing else you can do?”","Emperor Ao sneered. He levitated in the air, looking relaxed.","Swoosh!","Another round of attacks swept across the place.","It was filled with boundless power.","These attacks seemed to have broken through the stage of the Void-refining Realm.","Emperor Ao was under a lot of pressure, and his scalp went numb.","In the face of Emperor Ao’s thousands of Five-star Darts, Zi Yan launched more than a dozen energy attacks to counter them.","“You’ve been tricked.”","The frequency of attacks between people at the Integration Realm was so high that Zi Yan was not used to it.","Emperor Ao should have been attacked, but he showed a disdainful smile.","The thousands of darts that flew dozens of meters in front of Zi Yan were all shining. They were connected into threads and formed a high-end formation.","Buzz!","As if leaping through space, Emperor Ao’s figure crossed the void and instantly came to a distance of dozens of meters in front of Zi Yan.","To a Dao Seeking Cultivator, the distance of tens of meters was very short.","“Hahaha.”","Emperor Ao had an arrogant smile on his face.","Clatter!","The hearts of Ke Zhan and the others skipped a beat.","“Shit!”","“Watch out!”","Someone cried out in alarm.","Although most of Zi Yan’s loyal subordinates, such as Ke Zhan, had remained silent, their expressions changed drastically at this time. Some of them even wanted to step forward to stop Emperor Ao.","But they were too late.","“How dare you!”","Ke Zhan drew out his broadsword and was about to slash forward, and the broadsword light pointed at Emperor Ao, who was two meters away from Zi Yan.","He had a slight chance that he could stop Emperor Ao.","But there was no way that Emperor Ao in the Integration Realm would possibly allow them to succeed.","“Who dares to stop me?","“Hahaha!”","Emperor Ao’s arrogant voice spread out, and the void was filled with the shadows he left due to his fast speed.","In Zi Yan’s eyes, all of this seemed to have slowed down, and even her movements were slow.","She subconsciously raised her hand and was about to attack.","But she couldn’t raise her hand because she was too slow.","She slowly closed her eyes.","Her mind was filled with the figures of Zhang Han and Mengmeng, who were the most important people to her.","“Honey, I think... I can no longer wait until you come here.”","She felt very sad and painful.","Ke Zhan and the others were staring with wide eyes at this moment.","Because they noticed that the figure, who seemed to be hiding in the void, had already come to a distance of ten meters from Zi Yan.","At this moment, Ke Zhan’s broadsword light was about to strike.","But it was too late.","It would be too late for the broadsword light to get to Emperor Ao.","At the most critical moment-","Poof!","A dull sound suddenly resounded through the entire field.","A red mist suddenly formed a few meters in front of Zi Yan.","Was that a wave of blood?","According to the shape of the blood mist, Zi Yan might be sprayed all over her.","However, it seemed that there was a figure in her direction that blocked the blood mist.","“What’s that?","“What trick is Emperor Ao playing?”","At this moment, everyone present was a little confused.","But in the next second, a black-clothed figure slowly appeared a few meters away from Moon Empress.","When the blood mist dissipated, Emperor Ao was no longer in the field.","All the people, including the Fifth Heavenly King, were stunned when they saw this shocking scene.","“What’s going on?","“Did Emperor Ao just replace himself?”","Just when everyone was in a state of shock, a trembling voice with self-blame and heartache came from the side of the black-robed man.","“Dear, I... I’m late.”","The person who came was naturally Zhang Han, who rushed over.","Even though he had a lot of things to say, he didn’t know what to say at this moment.","Rumble!","Zi Yan’s body trembled violently.","She instantly raised her head and stared blankly at the man in front of her, whom she had been thinking about day and night.","One second, two seconds, three seconds...","After ten seconds, a voice came under the Moon Empress’s black robe.","“Why are you here so late?”","Swoosh!","Under the watchful eyes of the crowd, Moon Empress in the black robe threw herself into the man’s arms and cried.","“I’m sorry I’m late. This is not what I wanted.” Zhang Han’s voice was full of bitterness.","“Don’t say... you’re sorry. What’s the use of being sorry? I’ve been bullied.”","She kept crying like a delicate girl.","As she complained, her heart was filled with warmth.","With the arrival of her dearest backing, she no longer needed to pretend to be strong.","“It’s all right now.”","Zhang Han held her tightly in his arms and said in a soft tone, “I’m here. Everything’s fine now...”","Hiss!","The people around Zi Yan were all stunned.","Ke Zhan and the others were overjoyed, but at the same time, they were confused.","They had never seen Moon Empress like this.","The key was that her husband was here.","“Hold on a second!”","“Where’s Emperor Ao?”","Some of the high-position officials of the Blackhill Empire noticed Emperor Ao’s disappearance.","“He’s dead.”","One of the Fifth Heavenly King’s men reminded them.","“What did you say?!”","Only then did they realize that their Emperor Ao had been killed.","For a moment, they were all in a daze.","They had come to suppress the Purple Moon Empire, and it was about to be destroyed. However, Emperor Ao, the leader on the victory side, was now dead. They couldn’t believe it.","“Hmm?”","The Fifth Heavenly King raised his eyebrows slightly and looked at Zhang Han in surprise. He didn’t find anything unusual, so he couldn’t help but start pondering.","Most importantly, not even he was able to see how that man had appeared.","“Is he a big shot?”","The Fifth Heavenly King thought for a second. He didn’t care about the life and death of Emperor Ao at all. After thinking for a while, he planned to test Zhang Han’s strength first.","“May I know who you are?” the Fifth Heavenly King asked.","His tone was no longer as indifferent as before, but a little more dignified.","However, Zhang Han didn’t answer him and even ignored him.","Under the gazes of tens of thousands of people, the man slightly tilted his head. His eyes seemed to be full of anger.","He said in an utterly cold tone, “Kill them!","“And spare no one.”"]},{"number":1455,"title":"Chapter 1455 The Power of That Sword","paragraphs":["Chapter 1455 The Power of That Sword","Clatter!","His words shocked heaven and earth.","Many people were startled.","They looked around but didn’t find anything unusual.","The Fifth Heavenly King’s face darkened slightly.","Some of his men sneered.","“I think this guy has gone stupid. ‘Spare no one’? Who will take action for him?”","“Does he think that he is formidable just because he killed Emperor Ao by surprise? Emperor Ao is just a local emperor of a remote Star Area. He is not a master at all.”","“How dare he put on airs in front of the Fifth Heavenly King! He’s courting death!”","“He said that he’ll spare no one. I think we should go down and kill them all.”","Someone licked his lips with a bloodthirsty look.","The Fifth Heavenly King did not express his opinion on this.","“I can use what my men just said to see what the other party is up to.","“But it doesn’t seem to bother him at all.”","After that man finished saying those words, he began to wholeheartedly comfort and console the woman in his arms.","Even Ke Zhan and the others, who were overjoyed at first, were now surprised and bewildered.","“What does Moon Empress’s man mean by that?","“He said ‘kill them and spare no one’.","“And that’s all he said.”","“Do we have any reinforcements?” someone murmured subconsciously.","“We do... do we?” The person next to him wanted to say that they surely had reinforcements to pressure the other party, but as he spoke, he didn’t know whether they had that or not, so he asked instead of answering.","“He’s really good at putting on airs! It’s the first time I’ve seen someone who’s so pretentious!”","The Fifth Heavenly King slightly frowned.","He seemed to have lost his patience.","Everyone’s eyes were focused on the two people who were tightly hugging each other in the center of the field.","Just as the Fifth Heavenly King was about to question them, Zi Yan moved her head back and stopped crying.","Under her black robe, the layer of dark light in front of her face slowly dissipated, revealing a small part of her cheek.","“She seems to be very young.”","“She, she can’t be an ugly woman, can she?”","Many people were suddenly stunned.","As was known to all, no one had ever seen the face of the Purple Moon Empire’s Moon Empress before. Everyone only knew that she was a woman and did not know the rest about her.","And now, the truth was about to be revealed.","Even the Fifth Heavenly King was a little curious, so he no longer wanted to question Moon Empress.","Zi Yan was still sobbing and could not help asking, “Where, where is Mengmeng?”","“She’ll be here soon,” Zhang Han said softly. He raised his hand and gently touched Zi Yan’s cheek. Then, he said with some heartache, “You’ve lost some weight.”","“No, I haven’t.”","Zi Yan sniffled. She raised her right hand, grabbed the left side of her black robe, and pulled it to the right.","She took off the black robe that she had been wearing for two years and threw it to the right.","The black robe drifted off into the distance with the wind.","It was not just a spirit treasure dress that flew away. It also took away a lot of her negative emotions.","“Look, I didn’t lose weight, did I?”","Zi Yan’s eyes were still red, and she couldn’t help crying. She looked delicate and touching.","“What...”","Both the people on her side and her enemies were stunned.","They could clearly see Zi Yan’s beautiful eyes. Even her tears could not hide her beauty. Her delicate facial features were perfect and flawless, and her black hair was fluttering. She was wearing a long dress, and her graceful figure was clearly shown.","The scene looked like a vivid painting of a beautiful woman.","“She is Moon Empress?”","“Wow, she’s so beautiful.”","“Oh my god, I think I’m in love.”","“Moon Empress?” Ke Zhan and the others were dumbfounded.","No one had expected Moon Empress to have such a peerlessly beautiful face.","When they thought of how they had assisted her for about two years, they felt a little proud.","Many people from the Blackhill Empire exclaimed in surprise.","“Who said that the Moon Empress of the Purple Moon Empire is an ugly woman?”","...","“She’s not ugly at all. She’s utterly beautiful.”","“She’s a fairy.”","All the people present were amazed. At this moment, they even forgot that they were enemies. Even the subordinates of the Fifth Heavenly King were praising her.","“She’s a rare, beautiful woman in this world.”","The Fifth Heavenly King narrowed his eyes.","He was indeed tempted, but he still cared more about the Roc other than a beautiful woman.","Finally, a female general said in a rather jealous tone, “Everyone, don’t be bewitched by her!”","However, the murmurs did not affect Zhang Han and Zi Yan, who were looking at each other.","“How long has it been since we last met?” Zi Yan pressed her red lips together slightly.","“Six hundred and fifty-six days.” Zhang Han raised his hand and wiped Zi Yan’s tears. “I miss you every day.”","“Then why did you come here so late?”","...","Zi Yan burst into tears again. She hugged Zhang Han, leaned her head on his shoulder, and sobbed.","“I’ve already thought it through. When you picked me up, I would ignore you first and have you appease me. I also wanted to go to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven and appear in front of you unexpectedly. But that can’t happen now...”","She sounded a little grumpy.","Seeing this, Ke Zhan and the others wanted to say something but stopped on second thought.","Some of them even raised their hands, wanting to say, “I’m sorry to interrupt, but the Fifth Heavenly King is still up there.”","They were all incomparably stunned.","How could the couple be like this in front of so many people?","Ke Zhan held his forehead and shook his head.","To him, Zi Yan looked like a delicate and beautiful wife who had run away from home in a bad temper and was waiting for her husband to pick her up. When they met, she was aggrieved, happy, and angry.","“Alas!”","Ke Zhan raised his head and looked up at the sky.","“The Fifth Heavenly King and the others... If we don’t solve the big problem, we’ll have no way to go.”","As soon as he looked up, the scene he saw caused Ke Zhan’s pupils to constrict, and a wisp of dense happiness was shown on his face.","One of the Fifth Heavenly King’s subordinates said in a deep voice, “This is not a place to date. You two had better send the Roc here as soon as possible, or we’ll start killing your people.”","“Hmm?”","Zhang Han frowned slightly. When he looked up, his eyes became cold.","It was a completely different expression from the gentle look just now.","As if a second ago, he was still saying lovingly, “Sweetie...”","The next second, he looked at others with a fierce look and said, “Fuck off!”","The changes in his look gave others a weird feeling.","“No matter who you are, what happened today...”","The tone of the Fifth Heavenly King was cold.","Before he finished his words-","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Energy ripples appeared in the sky above.","All people looked up.","With everyone’s eyesight, they could see that many king vessels levitating on the edge of the planet had been bombarded, and countless aircraft were emitting fiery light.","They seemed to be able to see the battle between the two fleets.","The Fifth Heavenly King didn’t care about that.","A large number of people flew down, which made his face change dramatically.","The leader of the group was Li Shan.","The Fifth Heavenly King finally couldn’t hold back anymore.","Li Shan was one of the Illusory Sea Manor’s most powerful people.","The Sect Leader of the Illusory Sea Manor was at the Tribulation Stage First Tier, and so was the head of the Sacred Wolf Mountain. But when the two were compared, the former was more powerful.","Moreover, the Illusory Sea Manor had more than a dozen Mastery Realm Peak-Stage masters.","Li Shan was one of them.","He was also one of the few people in the Ocean Astral Domain whom the Fifth Heavenly King was very afraid of.","“What?!”","“It’s Li Shan of Illusory Sea Manor?”","“What is he doing here?”","“What...”","The subordinates of the Fifth Heavenly King were a little flustered.","A person’s fame was very important.","If it were the protectors of the Illusory Sea Manor or some other low-level elders, they wouldn’t be afraid. But it was Li Shan, so they couldn’t help but panic.","“It’s actually the Illusory Sea Manor!”","Ke Zhan suddenly burst into laughter and didn’t conceal it at all. “Hahahaha, we have the backing of the Illusory Sea Manor!”","“We can be saved!”","“We can be saved. Reinforcements have arrived!”","“...”","Excitement was the result of surviving a calamity.","The Fifth Heavenly King took a deep breath.","He was at the Mastery Realm Last-Stage, and his strength was not bad. He was also very famous, but there was still a long way to go before he could defeat Li Shan.","Fortunately, the three major sects of the Ocean Astral Domain were relatively calm now.","With his identity and status as the Fifth Heavenly King, he thought that Li Shan wouldn’t take action.","At the thought of this, he felt a little relieved and painful.","“Damn it! “I can’t get the Roc.","“I can only go back and report the news. I’ll take my time to think about how to get it.”","Having completely given up on the idea, the Fifth Heavenly King cupped his hands and asked politely, “Elder Li, may I ask why you’re here?”","Li Shan was at the forefront of the team. He had his hands clasped behind his back and his eyes were calm. When he came near, he waved his hand, turned his head, and looked at his subordinates.","“Didn’t you hear the words just now? Kill them and spare no one!”","“Elder, shall we kill them all?” Someone brought out his sword, which radiated chilling killing intent as he looked down on the entire field.","“Except for the ones on the ground.”","Li Shan added, feeling a little speechless.","Then, he looked away at the dumbfounded Fifth Heavenly King and said flatly, “Then, let the slaughter begin. Fifth Heavenly King of Sacred Wolf Mountain, come on, let’s have some fun first. As for your life, even if I don’t kill you, someone will come to take it.”","He completely understood the meaning of Zhang Han’s eyes.","Zhang Han was going to personally kill the Fifth Heavenly King.","“You!”","The Fifth Heavenly King turned pale with fright. “Elder Li, you’re going to attack me?”","“Of course.”","Li Shan chuckled, and then his figure suddenly became light.","“Oh no!”","The expression of the Fifth Heavenly King changed drastically, and he hurriedly cast a spell to dodge.","However, Li Shan followed him like a shadow. He kept getting closer and closer. Each of his moves made the Fifth Heavenly King suffer a lot.","There was a problem.","Li Shan thought to himself.","“How much injured should I get him? Hanyang now can kill masters at the Mastery Middle Stage. I guess it will be the same for him to kill the Last-Stage masters. I might as well make Fifth Heavenly King seriously injured to 60% and then let Hanyang vent his anger.”","As Li Shan thought about this, the frequency of his attacks suddenly increased.","“How dare you try to kill me? The Sacred Wolf Mountain won’t let you off!” The Fifth Heavenly King was shocked and furious.","He could see that many of Li Shan’s men had already begun to take action.","With an overwhelming advantage, they began to slaughter his men.","As for the people of the Blackhill Empire, they were no match for Li Shan’s men at all and were all killed.","“Kill them!”","“The time to counterattack has come!”","The people of the Purple Moon Empire let out furious roars as they charged toward the people of the Blackhill Empire from below.","“Go to hell!”","Ke Zhan roared furiously.","On the surface of the planet, the chaotic battle had just begun. It was practically a bloodbath.","During this period, an aircraft suddenly descended from the side.","A master at the Integration Realm personally led the way.","The aircraft stopped beside Zhang Han and Zi Yan.","Swoosh!","A figure quickly rushed over.","“Mummy!” Mengmeng called out.","“Mengmeng.”","Zi Yan’s body trembled, and her tears kept coming out again.","Mengmeng also cried.","At this moment, they hugged each other, tears streaming down their faces.","They vented their emotions by shedding tears of joy.","They were also completely relieved.","The family of three gathered together in the midst of the flames of war.","Mu Xue, Chu Qingyi, and Grand Master Chu were watching quietly from the side.","Chu Qingyi smiled.","Mu Xue quietly wiped the corners of her eyes.","Grand Master Chu looked back and forth.","He looked at Zi Yan’s face carefully, but he didn’t dare to look at her too frequently.","After a long time, the mother and daughter stopped crying.","Mengmeng stayed in Zi Yan’s arms for a long time before she left her.","She blinked her big eyes, asking, “Mummy, now that you’re an empress, I’m a princess.”","“Haven’t you always been a princess?” Zhang Han said with amusement.","“What empress?”","Zi Yan pursed her lips slightly and blinked her beautiful eyes. She looked at Zhang Han and said, “I couldn’t find out anything about the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven here. I was also worried that it would be difficult for you to find me, so I established the Purple Moon Empire. I waited for half a year, and I became anxious...”","She gave a brief account of her experience.","At first, she wanted to establish a force and spread her reputation. Even if Zhang Han came over and missed the opportunity to see her, he could still get the news that she would go back to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.","Later, her force became the Purple Moon Empire. She couldn’t wait to get a long-distance flight. When the empire expanded, it had a war with the Blackhill Empire. Unexpectedly, the Fifth Heavenly King of the Sacred Wolf Mountain joined the Blackhill Empire and hunted her down for a year.","“We were also being hunted earlier.”","After hearing this, Mengmeng said, “We are indeed a family of three. We’ve all been running for our lives.”","Her words made Zhang Han’s mouth twitch.","“We had no choice but to run for our lives.”","He felt helpless when he thought about it.","“Yan.”","Just then, Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali came from the side.","“Dad, Mom.”","“I’m so glad that we can meet,” the couple said with deep emotions.","“Grandpa and Grandma are at the Chu Family’s place in the Astral Domain. Many of the guys are there...” Mengmeng couldn’t wait to say.","Zi Yan relaxed after hearing those words.","At this moment, the battle above was raging, and it was rather intense.","But the battle between high-position officials was very simple.","Li Shan casually patted the Fifth Heavenly King.","There were bloodstains on the Fifth Heavenly King, and he had to exert his full power, but he was more frightened.","“Elder Li, we can discuss it. If you kill me, it will trigger a great battle between the two sects,” the Fifth Heavenly King hurriedly said.","“I don’t care,” Li Shan calmly replied.","He looked like he was impervious to anything.","“Who is he?” Zi Yan asked with curiosity.","“My old friend.”","Zhang Han smiled and looked up. The smile on his face gradually disappeared.","A sharp light rose from the bottom of his eyes.","“The power of the starry sky.”","The planet had been bombarded and had its Source damaged.","Now, the power of the starry sky was at its peak.","The Seven-star Sword appeared in Zhang Han’s right hand. The energy of his Immortal Body of the Five Elements was surging like crazy.","The Seven-star Sword’s control over the power of the starry sky was constantly accelerating.","He began to build up his strength.","In a head-on fight, there was no time to use this kind of magic.","In a duel between experts, time was of the essence. Sometimes, victory would be decided in an instant.","Now, with the right time, location, and environment, Zhang Han had plenty of time to accumulate his strength.","When 80% of the energy in his body was gathered into the Seven-star Sword, Zhang Han suddenly pressed the long sword to the ground.","Poof!","The Seven-star Sword disappeared from the surface of the earth.","“Honey, I don’t want to be here anymore. Let’s go.”","Zi Yan didn’t want to stay there for another second.","“We’ll leave right away.”","Zhang Han said with a smile, “They are too slow with the killing.”","After that, Zhang Han raised his head and looked up.","“Elder Li, tell your men to retreat for a thousand miles.”","“Retreat!” Li Shan immediately gave the order.","Everyone quickly retreated.","When Ke Zhan and the others saw this, they didn’t need to be reminded at all. They quickly retreated and didn’t continue fighting.","“Hahaha. Hanyang, go ahead.” Elder Li laughed.","“You want to kill me?”","The Fifth Heavenly King’s eyes were sharp as he looked at Zhang Han. “You?”","He was afraid of Li Shan, but he was not afraid of the young man below.","Li Shan took a few steps back, which made him relax a bit.","Because he now had a chance to escape.","However-","Zhang Han performed the Space-splitting Punch.","Rumble!","The Fifth Heavenly King only felt that the space around him was shaking like waves.","It was difficult for him to move an inch, but he didn’t run out of options.","“You can’t kill me, young man!”","The Fifth Heavenly King took a deep look at Zhang Han, ready to retreat.","“Shake!”","Zhang Han’s eyes were shining with cyan light.","The Fifth Heavenly King suddenly found that the frequency of trembling around him had increased tenfold.","It was as if he could not escape in these few seconds.","However, what could he do in a few seconds?","The Fifth Heavenly King was not sure, but the next second, his face turned livid.","“What...”","He turned his stiff head and looked to the right.","A one-meter-long Green Peak Sword was whistling over from the sky.","Fifth Heavenly King could feel the power of this sword.","It was filled with boundless energy.","It was as if the power of heaven and earth was contained within.","Clack! Clack! Clack!","The power of this sword cut the space into pieces.","The long sword whistled.","Around the surface of the long sword, there were cracks in the air, and it was dark inside the cracks.","It was the first time the Fifth Heavenly King had seen a sword that could cut through space.","At this time, he was so scared that his face was pale.","“No, no, no! That’s impossible! You... stop!”"]},{"number":1456,"title":"Chapter 1456 Leave after It Is Done","paragraphs":["Chapter 1456 Leave after It Is Done","“Your Majesty, save me!”","“Your Majesty, save me!”","Many of the Fifth Heavenly King’s subordinates roared in shock.","However, the Fifth Heavenly King could only suffer in silence. “You get to fly and ask for help at the same time while I can’t even move. How could you ask me to save you?”","Time seemed to have slowed down.","In the eyes of the Fifth Heavenly King, heaven and earth disappeared.","He felt as if he could only see the sword that could cut through space in front of him.","It was like an aircraft cloud. However, after the sword swept through the area, it left behind a cut space.","The pitch-black void inside was filled with violent energy and turbulence.","The Fifth Heavenly King knew very well that the cut space was even fiercer than the sword light. If he got trapped in it, he might be killed in a minute.","“They’re fleeing.”","Mu Xue looked at the many subordinates of the Fifth Heavenly King.","“How’s Tiny Tot?” Zhang Han asked.","“It’s fine. When we escaped last time, it got a bit exhausted,” Zi Yan replied.","Zhang Han laughed and said, “Let it come out and do some work out since it’s okay.”","“Alright.”","Zi Yan gently nodded her head and communicated with Tiny Tot.","“Murmur.”","Swoosh!","Tiny Tot turned into a stream of light, still in the shape of a penguin. It saw Mengmeng, Dahei, and Little Hei.","“Murmur?”","It was so happy that it flapped its wings. “Coo! Coo!”","It seemed to be in good spirits.","“Go do some work out.”","Zi Yan pointed to the people above.","Tiny Tot instantly transformed into a giant creature that appeared in the void.","It stared at the tens of thousands of fleeing people in the sky and was lost in thought.","Five seconds had passed.","“Coo!","“Coo!”","It let out two cries. Its voice was ethereal. Its wings, tail, and eyes were all shining with blue light.","Clatter!","A layer of dark clouds suddenly appeared in the sky above those who were about to escape.","Tiny Tot displayed an ancient incantation.","The people who wanted to escape into the sky seemed to have been pushed down by a force.","When they flew up there, they would be suppressed by the dark clouds and pushed down.","They immediately changed their direction and fled to the ground.","However, they suddenly found that there was also a layer of black clouds below.","They were caught in the middle.","The black clouds were getting closer and closer, and the sword rays were becoming more and more intense.","They started to panic.","“Stop this. Let me out!”","“AAAAH!”","“Your Majesty, please save us now!”","Many people urged the Fifth Heavenly King.","“You’re the boss of the team, so why are you just standing there?”","“Silence!”","The Fifth Heavenly King used all his strength and shouted. He activated all of his cultivation.","He struggled and could feel that the energy of the space blockade around him was decreasing.","“I’ll be able to escape once the energy gets a little lower!”","The Fifth Heavenly King frantically activated his occult arts, Defense Treasures, and Spirit Treasures that could break the Bounded Domain.","Rumble!","Finally, the spatial fluctuations were unable to stop him.","At the most critical moment, he managed to escape.","...","“Hahahaha.”","Just as the ecstatic laughter was about to spread-","Hiss!","The sword seemed to cut through the void and disappeared in a flash. It came to the Fifth Heavenly King.","The Seven-star Sword, which had been charging for a long time, instantly slashed across the void.","It didn’t hit the Fifth Heavenly King directly.","Starting from under the Fifth Heavenly King’s feet, the space cut by the sword began to cover his entire body.","The Fifth Heavenly King was stunned.","He felt that his body was constantly torn apart by space. It seemed that he could not hold on for more than a few seconds.","“AH!”","He was unwilling to give up and roared. But two seconds later, he looked at Zhang Han blankly and asked, “Who are you? Who the hell are you?”","...","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and did not respond.","“Hahaha.”","The Fifth Heavenly King let out a bitter laugh. “The Sacred Wolf Mountain will not let you off. With my order, war is about to begin...”","Buzz!","He was devoured by the darkness.","An expert of the Sacred Wolf Mountain just died like that.","“Fifth, Fifth Heavenly King is dead.”","The faces of many of the Fifth Heavenly King’s subordinates turned pale.","“Nooooo!”","Amidst all kinds of roars, the Seven-star Sword cut through more than half of the battlefield.","The pitch-black spatial rift devoured tens of thousands of enemies.","Swoosh!","This sword strike was unparalleled, and Zhang Han performed it with all the energy in his body.","“Amazing. What amazing means,” Li Shan praised. “You’re as powerful as ever.”","Zhang Han chuckled and said, “Clear the battlefield.”","Li Shan waved his hand and sent out his men to annihilate the last remaining survivors of the other party.","“Why don’t you introduce us to each other?” Li Shan urged Zhang Han.","He glanced at Zi Yan and was also amazed.","“She’s my wife, Zi Yan.”","Zhang Han smiled and said, “This is Li Shan, one of the previous eight First Elders of the Cloud Shadow Sky. We have a good relationship.”","“Nice to meet you, Elder Li.” Zi Yan smiled and greeted Li Shan.","“Nice to meet you, Sister-in-law.” Li Shan laughed and said, “Although we used to take care of Hanyang, this boy is too stunning and very powerful. But we are brothers from beginning to end, so I would call you sister-in-law. Here are some gifts for our first meeting.”","Li Shan then took out several seventh-tier spirit treasures.","In fact, he didn’t have many treasures, but he didn’t feel distressed to take them out at this time.","“Many thanks, Elder Li.”","Zi Yan blinked her beautiful big eyes, looked at Zhang Han, and accepted the treasures.","“You’re welcome.”","Li Shan said with a smile, “We’ve all guessed what kind of woman could make Hanyang fall in love with her. Now that we’ve met today, I get it that Hanyang is so lucky to have such a beautiful wife as you.”","“Elder Li, you’re flattering me.”","“Now that we’ve dealt with the trouble here, shall we go first? Let’s go to the Illusory Sea Manor as soon as possible.” After Li Shan said that, his expression darkened slightly. He shook his head and said, “That won’t do. Some spaceships above have escaped. They will soon inform Sacred Wolf Mountain about what happened here. You have to go back. We will wait for Sect Leader Ning and others in the Clear Stream Star Area on the edge of the Ocean Astral Domain. We passed by that place when we came here.”","“Is this hard to handle?” Zhang Han asked.","“It is indeed.”","They were straightforward while talking. Li Shan nodded and said indifferently, “The Fifth Heavenly King is one of the top leaders of Sacred Wolf Mountain. His death is of great matter to them, but our Sect Master will protect us. He will just add a few hundred years to the time we stay here. This doesn’t matter. We’ll just wait until you get even more powerful.”","“Okay, we’ll do as you say,” Zhang Han said.","“We’re going home?”","Zi Yan smiled when she said that. Everyone could see that she was very happy.","“We’re going home.”","Zhang Han smiled.","“Are we going to take those people with us?” Mengmeng pointed to the people in the distance curiously and said, “Mummy, they are all your people.”","In the face of this question, Zi Yan thought for a moment. She looked at Zhang Han and then looked at Elder Li.","The tacit understanding between the couple was still very good. Zhang Han knew what Zi Yan was thinking.","He said to Elder Li, “Since I’m here, she no longer needs the Purple Moon Empire. Elder Li, you can arrange for some people who are loyal to my wife to cultivate in the Illusory Sea Manor later.”","“Sure,” Li Shan said. “If there aren’t too many of them, I’ll arrange them to be the inner-door disciples. If they all go to my sect, they’ll have to start as the outer-door disciples.”","Although he had a say in the sect, he did not have absolute power. Moreover, in the Illusory Sea Manor, Sect Leader Ning and the Eight Elders were of the same faction, and there was another group of people who restricted them.","This was the Sect Master’s means to balance the power in the sect.","The enemies gradually disappeared from the battlefield.","The void of the universe also became quiet.","The Fifth Heavenly King had lost some spaceships, and many of his men had found opportunities to escape.","The ones in the spaceships were all shocked.","“Fifth Heavenly King is dead.”","“Heavens, this is truly despairing news. Report this to the sect now.”","“Elder Li Shan from the Illusory Sea Manor attacked the Fifth Heavenly King. He is too ruthless.”","“Could it be that the Illusory Sea Manor is going to start a war in the Ocean Astral Domain?”","This was a matter of great importance. The disciples of the Sacred Wolf Mountain in the spaceships fully understood the meaning of this matter.","Perhaps the two supreme forces were going to clash.","After these people had left, the people of the Purple Moon Empire gradually gathered.","They were standing around in groups, forming a large circle.","“Moon Empress!”","“Congratulations, Moon Empress.”","Some people began to cheer.","That was the joy of victory.","There were also many people who looked ashamed. Just now, they had talked a lot when they tried to force Zi Yan to abdicate.","This was especially true for the high-position officials. They couldn’t even say anything at this moment.","“Moon Empress,” Zhang Han whispered into Zi Yan’s ear with a smile.","She was short of breath because of his masculinity.","She had not leaned against his chest for a long time.","Moreover, she felt a little itchy by her ear because he blew on it, and her heart turned quite soft.","But it was not the time to be romantic now.","She glanced at Zhang Han, pursed her lips and smiled.","“Just do it.”","Zhang Han gently patted her on the shoulder.","Zi Yan was wearing a crystal white dress. She took a few steps forward and looked around.","The Purple Moon Empire had existed for two years. Some of its members were the forces who joined later, and some were the ones who helped Zi Yan fight for sovereignty.","“We are safe now.”","The first thing she said was touching.","After fleeing for a year, they were finally safe. Being able to survive a disaster was always a delightful thing.","“My husband’s here to pick me up.”","What Zi Yan said next was very decisive and straightforward. “So, the Purple Moon Empire, well... I announce that the Purple Moon Empire is disbanded today. All good things come to an end. Here, I wish everyone a bright future.”","Her voice was as pleasant as ever, and as she looked incredibly beautiful, her aura reached its peak.","The scene quieted down.","In the silence, someone could not help but say, “Moon Empress, we can go with you!”","“We can keep developing the Purple Moon Empire in other Astral Domains.”","“...”","In the face of more and more intense words, Zi Yan pursed her red lips lightly and shook her head slightly.","“Next, I will select a group of you to join the Sea Illusion Manor’s inner court. The rest of you can also join the outer court and participate in the inner-door assessment with the other disciples.","“Ke Zhan.”","“Here,” replied Ke Zhan with a complicated expression on his face. He took a deep breath and then walked forward.","He knew that Moon Empress would not change her plan.","However, it would be a great opportunity to enter the inner court of the Illusory Sea Manor.","“Jiang Yan.”","“Here.”","“Lu Lexin.","“Wu Zhengyu.","“...”","Zi Yan called out dozens of names.","The ones she selected were all high-position officials and a few middle-level officials, who were her loyal subordinates.","As for the ones who had pressured her, even those who were higher-ups, Zi Yan didn’t select them.","She wouldn’t stay nice for no reason and would even bear a grudge sometimes.","“Next, I’ll call out a list of names. You know the reason why you can’t join the inner court and the outer court. I’ll leave you some spaceships.”","Zi Yan called out another list of names.","She was using a move.","Everyone who was called out remained silent.","Some of them regretted what they did, while others were unconvinced. However, they didn’t dare to say anything. Even the Fifth Heavenly King had been killed. With their current strength, they could be killed in an instant.","After she called out that list of names, Zi Yan said, “As for the ones I haven’t mentioned yet, I won’t call out your names. You can follow the team to join the outer court. I know that none of you wanted to get killed back then, but if I handed over the Roc, we would all die right after that. I still remember you pressuring me clearly, but it doesn’t matter now. The Purple Moon Empire has been disbanded. All of you can find your teams to leave.”","After finishing speaking, Zi Yan walked back to Zhang Han and held his arm very proudly.","She looked like a queen just now, but now she was like a timid and lovable girl.","Seeing this, the crowd was filled with emotions.","“We are also very glad to see that you’re happy, Moon Empress.” Ke Zhan cupped his hands and said with a smile, “I wonder if we will have a chance to see you again.”","“There will be a chance.” Zi Yan gave a positive answer, but then she teased Zhang Han in a low voice, “But if you want to see me, you have to ask my husband about it first. What if he gets jealous?”","Zhang Han could not help but laugh.","He put his arms around Zi Yan’s waist and did not say anything.","“Ahem, I have something to say.”","Li Shan coughed softly. He then waved his hand at his subordinates and said, “Record their information and arrange for them to enter the inner court. As for you guys, I’ll give each of you 30 more places. You can take your men and join the inner court together. Someone will inform you of the specifics of the dos and don’ts and arrangements.”","After finishing speaking, Li Shan looked at Zhang Han. “Shall we go now?”","“Okay. Let’s go.”","The dozens of people took the aircraft, rose into the air, and slowly disappeared from everyone’s sight.","The Moon Empress had left.","However, she left them with a bigger stage and hope.","The Illusory Sea Manor was one of the top sects in the Ocean Astral Domain. They had never even dared to think about joining it before.","“Inner disciples, come here to record your identity.”","“People who want to join the outer-door disciples, gather at the right side.”","“You guys, hurry up and go. Don’t be an eyesore here.”","“...”","Li Shan’s men began to make arrangements here.","The Fifth Heavenly King was killed.","The news was quickly reported to Sacred Wolf Mountain.","It was said that Elder Li Shan personally led his group from the Illusory Sea Manor to kill the Fifth Heavenly King.","For a time, the higher-ups of the Sacred Wolf Mountain were enraged and began to question the Illusory Sea Manor.","So when Li Shan came to the signal-covered area, he had a lot of voice messages on his communication device.","He did not check them. Instead, he contacted Sect Leader Ning, who was now Elder Ning of the Illusory Sea Manor.","“Why did you kill the Fifth Heavenly King of the Sacred Wolf Mountain?”","Ning Chen’s tone was full of curiosity, without the slightest hint of questioning.","He knew that Li Shan would not take action for no reason.","“Who said I killed him?” Li Shan laughed.","“Were you framed?” Ning Chen asked.","“I’m not going to keep you guessing. Guess who I met?”","“Just say it. Cut the crap,” Ning Chen scolded with a smile.","“Ahem.”","Li Shan’s face was full of smiles. He lowered his voice and pretended to be serious while saying, “Han Yang Immortal... is back.”","Hiss!","Even Zhang Han, Zi Yan, and the others nearby could hear the sound of gasping through the communication device.","“What did you say?”","Ning Chen let out a cry of surprise. Even someone as composed as him was shocked when he heard the news.","“You’re not joking, are you?” Ning Chen hurriedly asked.","“Why would I joke about this?” Li Shan took a deep breath and looked at Zhang Han.","“Video chat now!”","After Ning Chen immediately said that, he hung up the call and started the video chat.","His figure was projected.","He looked at Zhang Han in a daze and said, “Oh my god. Is this happening?”","Zhang Han smiled and said, “Sect Leader Ning, long time no see.”","“Hahahaha, you’re really back! Li Shan, you’re not tricking me, are you? Tell me if this is real.”","Li Shan said grumpily. “Hey, you’re looking at him with your own eyes. How could I possibly create an illusion?”","“This is great! Just wonderful!”","Sect Leader Ning’s face lit up. “Hanyang, what are you waiting for? Come and pick us up.”","They were acquaintances, after all, so they spoke more casually.","“I’m afraid that can’t be done now.” Li Shan smiled bitterly and said, “Although Hanyang has not died, his cultivation... is still recovering.”","“AH!”","Ning Chen patted his forehead, “I didn’t think about that.”","“You guys wait here for a while,” Zhang Han said. “In a few years, I’ll be able to get back to the Tribulation Stage. Then, I’ll come over and take you away.”","“Okay! I’ll be waiting. Then, what’s up with you guys now? Oh, I see. Did the Fifth Heavenly King offend Hanyang? It doesn’t matter. Shall we meet? We should at least have a drink together,” Ning Chen said with a smile.","“We’ve got the place to meet ready, which will be the Clear Stream Star Area. Hurry up and get moving. If Sect Master realizes that you’re leaving, you won’t be able to get there,” Li Shan said.","“I’ll make the arrangements now.”","Ning Chen then hung up.","He couldn’t hide the joy on his face and sent messages to the others one after another.","“Elder Bai, please contact the guys. I’ll give you half an hour to gather by my place immediately.”","“Roger that.”","After discovering the news, Ning Chen began to ponder.","“Now that Hanyang is taking recultivation, I guess he’ll need some spirit treasures. I’ll go to the treasure house to see what’s there and take some. Anyway, Sect Master won’t kill us. He’ll just have us stay a few hundred more years. That doesn’t matter.”","Ning Chen was up to something big and took action right away. He came to the treasure house, took a lot of cultivation resources, and left. Then, they took the aircraft and quickly took off.","Only by the time they got on the king vessel did Ning Chen send a message to the Sect Master.","“Sect Master, we’re going to the Clear Stream Star Area to meet an old friend. We’ll be back in a few days.”","He acted first and reported afterward.","This was the first time in history that they had ever done this.","After all, their Soul Lamps were still in the Sect Master’s hands.","They had no time to report the news. The Sect Master would soon know that the Fifth Heavenly King of the Sacred Wolf Mountain had been killed, and it would be impossible for them to leave the sect then.","Zhang Han’s group also began to fly to the Clear Stream Star Area.","“Let’s have a drink in the next few days.”","At the dining table, Li Shan said, “Sister-in-law, why don’t you drink a bit? This wine isn’t too intoxicating.”","He had a guilty conscience inwardly. “One’ll go crazy if getting intoxicated by this wine.”","“Uh, okay.”","Zi Yan saw them drinking one jar after another.","She couldn’t help but feel a little stunned.","“This way of drinking seems to be quite interesting.”","Zhang Guangyou fainted as soon as he drank a jar.","After all, this wine was Li Shan’s treasured liquor. He usually drank it one glass at a time. Since he had met Zhang Han, he was in a good mood and took all the jars out all at once.","After a few rounds of drinking, everyone was happily talking about their encounters including their joys and sorrows, their partings, and all kinds of emotions in life.","After they finished drinking, Zhang Han and Zi Yan returned to their room, and Mengmeng also stayed there for a long time before leaving.","After drinking some wine, Zi Yan got a little drunk. After the little princess left, she looked at Zhang Han with hazy eyes and gently bit her lower lip. Her eyes were shining with brilliance.","Gurgle!","Zhang Han swallowed forcibly.","“What are you wondering?” Zi Yan asked in a delicate voice.","“Let’s do it.”","Zhang Han’s majestic figure pounced on her.","Clatter!","Clatter!","The fragments of the long dress fluttered.","A layer of energy covered the room and also covered the wonderful melody.","Partings made the heart grow fonder. They had parted a very long time previously."]},{"number":1457,"title":"Chapter 1457 Return","paragraphs":["Chapter 1457 Return","A day later, the Illusory Sea Manor’s Sect Master learned about what had happened.","“Li Shan killed the Fifth Heavenly King of the Sacred Wolf Mountain?”","Upon hearing the news, the Sect Master frowned. “Why did he kill him?”","“It’s said that he did it because of an old friend. The Fifth Heavenly King was caught in the eye of the storm. He tried to hunt Li Shan’s friend down for nearly a year. But when he was about to succeed, Li Shan and his men arrived,” a subordinate reported. “Ning Chen and the others have all left.”","“I see.” The Sect Master closed his eyes. “You will deal with the Sacred Wolf Mountain.”","“Yes, Sect Master.”","After the man left, the Sect Master murmured softly, “I’ll punish them... by adding five hundred years.”","He also knew that Ning Chen and the others didn’t dare to leave. After all, he possessed their Soul Lamps.","As for the fact that they had left in such a hurry to meet an old friend, it meant that they were afraid of Sacred Wolf Mountain, which also showed that their old friend was not very powerful.","The Sect Master was not worried since the other party hadn’t reached the Tribulation Stage.","Moreover, with the status of Ning Chen and the others, it was impossible for them to have any old friends who had reached the Tribulation Stage from a remote Star Area.","The Illusionary Sea Manor’s Sect Master was completely at ease. He felt as though he had them under his control.","If their cultivation went well, some of them might reach the Tribulation Stage in the future as his subordinates.","It was a pleasure for him to have free powerful hitmen.","Originally, the higher-ups of the Sacred Wolf Mountain had been constantly questioning the Illusory Sea Manor when they entered the state of preparedness, asking for an explanation.","As a result, the Illusory Sea Manor reacted intensely. They gathered many people as if they were preparing for a great battle.","This matter had attracted a lot of attention in the Ocean Astral Domain.","Just as many forces thought that the two giants were about to clash, the high-level officials of both sides suddenly had a meeting.","No one knew what they had said, but in the end, they calmed down and withdrew their troops.","The danger of war was gone.","Five days later.","In the Clear Stream Star Area.","On Deer Magic Star with pleasant scenery.","There were many natural wonders here, and the Giant-horned Deer was the most distinctive.","They had two horns, which were very beautiful. Their colors were different. There were many species.","Zhang Han and the others were waiting on the planet.","Many people here had never heard of the Illusory Sea Manor, but its members’ overall strength was only around the Yuan Ying Realm. The sect was about the same size as that of the Sea Dragon Star Area.","In a massive restaurant.","“Hahaha. Hanyang!”","Ning Chen laughed as he raised his arms.","He swore that it might be the most exciting moment of his life.","Bang!","The two of them gave each other a hug.","“This is great. I’m so glad that you’re still alive.”","Elder Bai wiped the corners of his eyes. Apparently, he had tears just now.","“Hey, brat!”","The other elders also greeted Zhang Han one after another, grinning from ear to ear.","“Come here, let me introduce you. This peerless beautiful lady is our sister-in-law, Zi Yan, Hanyang’s beloved wife. This lovely little girl is their daughter, Mengmeng. Hurry up and bring out your gifts,” Li Shan said.","Hearing this, Mengmeng said with a smile, “I like your straightforward character, Uncle Li.”","“Of course, we have some gifts for our first meeting.”","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Almost every one of them had taken out eighth-tier spirit treasures, which were rare treasures in the Ocean Astral Domain.","They also took out a few seventh-tier spirit treasures.","These treasures were precious as the first meeting gifts.","“This is too generous of you,” Zhang Han said helplessly.","“Now is the time for the most important thing.”","Ning Chen smiled and said, “Everyone, please take a seat.”","After the crowd sat at the dining table one after another, Ning Chen put on a serious look.","“We’ll drink and talk about the old days later. Let’s get down to business first. Hanyang is back. This is good news, and we are very happy to hear that he’s still alive, which he needed to achieve with great luck, so it doesn’t matter he has lost his horrifying cultivation. At worst, he can take recultivation. But this requires a large number of resources. Hanyang, you gave us so much in the past. Now we can help you. Hahaha, don’t turn us down. We’ve got a surprise for you.”","“A surprise?” Zhang Han couldn’t help but laugh.","“Yes. Take a look at what this is.”","Ning Chen smiled as he waved his hand.","Buzz!","A three-meter-tall white stone tablet appeared in front of everyone.","...","“Hmm?”","Zhang Han’s pupils contracted. Obviously, what he saw was beyond his expectations. “It’s the Chaotic Stone Tablet?”","“That’s right.”","Ning Chen nodded and said, “This is one of the Profound-grade treasures. Back then, you gave it to us to study, but we couldn’t find anything special about it. Later, I found this Chaotic Stone Tablet at an auction. Guess what? It was classified as a seventh-tier spirit treasure. I directly bought it. During that period, I studied it again, but I still couldn’t feel anything.”","“You once said that it’s hard to sense anything from the Chaotic Stone Tablet before one reaches the Tribulation Stage Eighth Tier.” Elder Bai stroked his beard and said, “We observed it for a few days. This stone is useful for those who understand it, but for those who don’t, it’s just useless.”","“Yes. The value of this Profound-grade treasure is extremely high. However...”","As he spoke, Zhang Han’s eyes narrowed.","The Chaotic Stone Tablet was a natural Profound-grade treasure. It was very valuable and precious. When he first felt it, he found that it could accelerate some changes and patterns.","This was also the origin of the perfected Divine Walking Trick. It was precisely because of the Chaotic Stone Tablet that Zhang Han comprehended the trick.","Perfect-level Divine Walking Trick required the assistance of the Treasure-searching formulas, and it was extremely formidable.","Whether in terms of fighting or escaping, it was one of the divine skills.","...","It was a pity that it was no match for the divine thunder over the sky.","Zhang Han had also bid farewell to his previous way of cultivation. He had basically given up on the Divine Walking Trick.","But he suddenly thought of the magical effect of the Chaotic Stone Tablet.","“The Cosmos Formation with the stone tablet as the center can speed up the changes of the Rain-falling Star.","“I now have the Thunder Body and the Great Demon Body. The Thunder Body needs a very long time to mature. It may take hundreds or thousands of years. It may need to be accelerated. With the Chaotic Stone Tablet, can I speed up the planet’s transformation?”","Zhang Han was lost in thought.","Eventually, his eyes became brighter and brighter.","“It seems feasible. If I succeed, then the Thunder Body might be able to complete its condensation within a few years!”","Zhang Han suddenly burst into laughter.","Glancing at the crowd, he said with a smile, “Sect Leader Ning, you really gave me a surprise. The Chaotic Stone Tablet is a great use for me.”","In Zhang Han’s opinion, consuming the Chaotic Stone Tablet to speed up the construction of the Rain-falling Star was a super good deal.","What he was looking at might be the only Chaotic Stone Tablet in the Cultivation World, but what Elder Bai said was right. The stone would only work in the hands of the ones who understood it.","“It’s good that we can help,” Ning Chen said with a smile. “After all, we still count on you. I guess this time, our Sect Master will add another few hundred years to our time to stay.”","“It doesn’t matter. After I reach the Tribulation Stage, I’ll ask your Sect Master to send you off respectfully in a majestic manner,” Zhang Han teased.","“It’s a deal then.” Sect Leader Ning laughed and took out a Space Ring. “Take it. We’ll be waiting for you.”","Zhang Han observed the ring with his mind, and then he fell silent.","There were a lot of spiritual treasures and all kinds of other things in the Space Ring, which should be all the savings of the nine of them over a thousand years.","Elder Bai patted Zhang Han on the forehead and said, “We are all at the Peak Stage of the Mastery Realm. I don’t know when we can break through to the Tribulation Stage. Now, we don’t really need spirit treasures. The most important thing is for you to return to the peak.”","Due to the limitations of one’s aptitude, some people would never be able to reach the Tribulation Stage in their entire lives. However, some people could increase their cultivation levels without much obstruction.","Zhang Han’s aptitude had long been shown.","“We’ve got everything I need here.”","Zhang Han was silent for a moment and then made obeisance to them.","“Well, enough with the courtesy. Let’s start drinking later. Hanyang, you haven’t reached the Tribulation Stage yet. Let’s see if we can get you drunk.”","Elder Bai put on a rather treacherous look. He waved his hand with a smile.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","A table of white jade jars of wine appeared.","Just the wine jars alone had the aura of fifth-tier spirit treasures.","What kind of wine would be stored in the wine jars refined by fifth-tier spirit treasures?","Zhang Guangyou secretly swallowed a little.","“It seems that they keep their good wine here.”","“Uncle Zhang, I heard that you also like to drink. Men are supposed to be like this. Come on, I’ll pour a glass of wine for you.” Sect Leader Ning got up with a smile.","They were all Zhang Han’s peers, and they respected Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali very much.","Friends and brothers were supposed to be like this.","“That won’t be okay!”","Zhang Guangyou grinned from ear to ear. He raised his hand and said, “When in Rome, do as the Romans do. Since you all use the jars to drink, I can’t lag behind. I’ll drink in the same way.”","“Okay! You’re so forthright, Uncle Zhang. Shall we drink a jar together?” Sect Leader Ning seemed to have a smirk on her face.","“Old Ning, that’s not cool!” Elder Bai glared at him and said, “Uncle Zhang, don’t listen to him. This wine is called Immortal Intoxication. I’ve learned how to brew it from the Al Pike Clan. This has been stored for five hundred and thirty years. Even we can get drunk after drinking two or three jars of it. Today, we’ll get Zhang Han drunk. Uncle Zhang, you shouldn’t get drunk.”","Mengmeng grimaced and made a face when she heard that.","“You want to get my dad drunk? Humph, you wish!”","Zi Yan was sitting next to them with a smile.","She found it nice to see Zhang Han’s old friends.","She still remembered that when she learned that Zhang Han had traveled in the Cultivation World for 500 years, she had wondered how many Divine Women and Saintly Women Zhang Han had slept with.","After all, Childe Zhang in Shang Jing used to have a lot of ex-girlfriends.","However, the birds of a feather flocked together. It was not difficult to tell from the details of their posture that Sect Leader Ning, Elder Li Shan, and Elder Bai were very upright.","“Cheers!”","Everyone raised the wine jars high.","They all began to gulp down the wine.","Gurgle!","After Zhang Guangyou took three big sips, his eyes widened as he felt the shock.","The wine jar was put down, and his face was red.","“Great, great wine!”","Plop!","He lay prone on the table and began to snore.","“He’ll be okay.”","Ning Chen smiled and said, “I guess that he’s drunk. This wine can help one cultivate. Feel free to try it, everyone. You won’t get drunk if you drink only a little.”","Mu Xue poured a cup of wine and took a sip with Chu Qingyi.","Clatter!","The two of them were instantly in a daze.","Mengmeng grinned with a look of disgust and was not willing to drink.","Zi Yan, however, was a little curious. She sat next to Zhang Han, dipped her chopstick in the wine, and licked it.","A burning sensation spread from her throat to her stomach.","It was very spicy.","But then she had a fresh feeling. The taste made her feel refreshed.","It seemed that the wine tasted nice.","However, Zi Yan did not intend to drink it. She just wanted to taste it a bit.","Then, she looked at the others.","Except for the ten people including Sect Leader Ning and Zhang Han, the others didn’t drink much. Grand Master Chu was also tasting wine with a small cup.","Those ten people drank up all ten jars in this round.","“Cool!”","Sect Leader Ning burped and said, “It’s been a thousand years. Hanyang, I’m so happy to see you.”","“This is amazing. Amazing indeed.” Elder Bai echoed.","The others also began to talk about the past, the future, and various other things.","They had a lot of food and wine.","In the end, Sect Leader Ning, Elder Bai, Elder Li, and the rest of the nine people got drunk.","Elder Bai shouted loudly, “I’m not drunk! Don’t stop me, I can keep drinking. If I don’t get him drunk this time, I don’t know when I’ll be able to do it.”","His voice was so loud that many pedestrians on the street outside stopped and looked over.","Unfortunately, they couldn’t see those people on the top floor of the restaurant. They only knew that some big shots were drinking and having fun here.","“I think we’ve drunk enough.”","Zhang Han smiled. He had drunk five jars of wine, but his face remained unchanged.","“Not enough. Come on, let’s continue to drink.”","At this time, one of Sect Leader Ning’s men came in slowly.","“Elder Ning, it’s about time. Should we...?”","In the end, Ning Chen and the others were sent away by that subordinate.","The man also looked at Zhang Han in confusion.","The several elders of the Illusory Sea Manor were all drunk, but Zhang Han looked completely sober.","“That’s amazing.”","“Dad, you’re awesome!”","Mengmeng gave him a thumbs-up and said, “I didn’t expect you to be so great at drinking!”","Zhang Han said happily, “Of course, I am. After all, I’m your dad.”","Looking at his eyes, Zi Yan slightly pursed her red lips. “This guy is still pretending.”","They went all the way back to their spaceship.","After they entered their room, Zhang Han lay down on the bed with a plop.","“Oh, no, I have to sleep for a while. Those people are really good at getting me drunk.”","After saying that, he fell into a deep sleep.","He slept soundly for three days and three nights.","It had been a long time since he had slept like this.","When he woke up, he could feel that his beloved was in his arms.","“You’re awake?”","Zi Yan was flipping through a book. When she saw Zhang Han wake up, she smiled and said, “I’ll make porridge for you.”","As she spoke, she was about to get up, but Zhang Han suddenly grabbed her wrist and gently pulled her back to his arms.","“Let’s cuddle for a while.”","“You’ve slept for three days.” Zi Yan reached out her hand and touched Zhang Han’s chin.","“It seems that the wine was specially prepared for me.” Zhang Han shook his head.","Immortal Intoxication was very precious. It was supposed to be stored in a specific place instead of a Space Ring.","Perhaps Li Shan had specially told the guys to get him drunk with some good stuff.","It was obvious that they had succeeded, but they had also suffered a lot.","Getting drunk was what Ning Chen and the others had planned for a long time. They wanted to get drunk because they didn’t want to part. They just regarded it as a dream. When they woke up from the dream and found that it was real, they would still be happy.","“Alright, I’ll make some porridge for you.”","Zi Yan got up. Wearing a sling nightdress, she walked to the kitchen on the side of the room.","Zhang Han rested his hands on the pillow and looked at Zi Yan’s graceful figure. The long legs under her nightdress were exposed, and her slender arms were simply tempting.","Zhang Han also got up, walked behind Zi Yan, and hugged her. He could clearly feel her wonderful figure.","“I don’t want to have porridge. I just want to eat you.”","“What are you doing? It’s still in the middle of the day.”","“There’s no daytime or nighttime here.”","“...”","It wasn’t until three hours later that the two of them could have porridge and some food. Then, they went out. Everyone was cultivating, so they sat in the lounge for a few hours.","Mengmeng and the others came out of their rooms in succession.","“Now we’re having a real exploration!”","Mengmeng’s interest was piqued.","“Are we going back the same way we came?” Grand Master Chu asked.","“Let’s take the latest route set by the system. We took some detours on the way here,” Zhang Han said.","“Okay.”","Grand Master Chu gave the order.","The system reported, “The flight time will take about half a year. Please prepare the Energy Stones in advance. The spaceship is about to enter the planned route.”","On their way here, they would occasionally encounter a lot of bad turbulence in the starry sky.","Unexpectedly, the journey home was peaceful.","It was as if the weather didn’t want to disturb their good mood after their reunion.","During this period, a lot of interesting things happened, and they took a tour of some fun places.","“Judging from the time in Hua Territory, today is the New Year. Mengmeng is already 18 years old.” Zi Yan smiled and said, “My daughter has grown up.”","“Of course.” Mengmeng said with a proud look, “I’m a grown-up. I get to date someone from now on.”","Hearing this, Zhang Han looked embarrassed, and he said in a soft voice, “Don’t worry. You can’t rush it. Matured cultivators have to be 180 years old at least, not 18 years old.”","“Alas, I’m 39 years old. I’m almost 40 now.” Zi Yan grinned.","“But Mummy, you still look like you’re in your twenties. We’ll really look like sisters to others,” Mengmeng said.","“How about I refine some Beauty-maintaining pills for Mengmeng so that she can maintain her current state?” Zhang Han suddenly felt that his proposal was very good.","“No. I don’t want to take that. I’ll take some when I’m at my most beautiful time. A girl would change a lot when she matures. I’ve just turned 18, and I’ll look even more beautiful later,” Mengmeng muttered.","“Get over yourself,” said Zi Yan.","“...”","Mengmeng’s 18th birthday was celebrated on the spaceship.","Zhang Han and Zi Yan had made the birthday cake themselves.","Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali had made exquisite gifts, which were a stone sculpture of a spaceship. Inside the spaceship, the crowd was sitting at a table with a birthday cake, candles, and a lot of smiling faces.","Mu Xue, Chu Qingyi, and Grand Master Chu’s gifts were all quite special.","Mengmeng was now 18 years old.","Zhang Han had been there for Mengmeng over the past 14 years.","He felt like he was in a dream, and time flew.","All the memories were like a piece of dessert, which was refreshing and sweet.","Their journey remained unimpeded for half a year.","“Beep! We’ve arrived in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.”","A system prompt popped up.","Everyone once again gathered in the lounge.","They looked at the Astral Domain ahead.","“We’re back!”","“Let’s go back to the Chu Family’s place first.”","The spaceship once again jumped into the secondary space.","Twenty days later, they arrived at the Heavenly Double Star where the Chu Family lived.","They entered the space station and came to the Beast Overlooking Peak.","“Big Brother, you’re back!”","Taoist Lord of Azurepeak and Old Taoist Honghu were both excited.","“We managed to find more than a dozen people with the bounty we put out. We have a total of 39 people here.”","“I’ll contact them now and ask them to come back. Almost all of them are traveling on the Heavenly Double Star.”","A few hours later, Zhang Li and Liang Hao were the first to arrive.","“Dad, Mom!”","Zhang Li was relieved to see Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali, and she cried for a while.","Liang Mengqi, Rong Jiaxin, Wang Ya, Wang Ming, Wang Zhanpeng, Lei Tiannan, and many others were also there.","More than 30 people were gathered together.","“Is there still no news about Changqing and Zhao Feng?”","A few people were missing.","Some of them were training on the Vast Heaven Star.","But there was still no news about several other people, such as You Huo, Zhang Mu, Chen Changqing, and Zhao Feng.","Zhou Fei and Liang Mengqi were both very worried about them.","Seeing this, the others tried to comfort these two.","“They should be fine. Changqing is the famous Emperor Qing. He made a name for himself back then and is a legendary figure. He will be okay. Xiaofeng is so calm and steady. They will definitely be fine in the face of all kinds of situations.”","Clang! Clang! Clang!","Chen Changqing asked, “How many crystal stones have you dug today?”","Zhao Feng, “I’ve dug three thousand crystal stones. What about you?”","Chen Changqing said, “More or less. Let’s work harder. We’ll be able to eat when we get five thousand crystal stones.”","Zhao Feng said, “Okay. Let’s do it. “"]},{"number":1458,"title":"Chapter 1458 The Young Demon King Mengmeng","paragraphs":["Chapter 1458 The Young Demon King Mengmeng","Chen Changqing and Zhao Feng were obviously in an awkward situation.","From the start until now, they had been mining for over two years.","They were quite miserable.","However, there was also hope in a life full of malice.","While mining, the two of them studied the occult arts taught by Zhang Han, and their progress was not slow.","It was a pity that they were controlled by others and did not have strong strength, so they could only keep digging here.","“Huh?”","Zhao Feng suddenly exclaimed in surprise, “Brother Qing, I dug a pit. This is an ancient crystal stone mine. Logically speaking, there should not be a pit.”","“Let’s go in and see what’s there.” Chen Changqing hesitated and looked around. The leader didn’t notice them, so the two quickly got in.","The pit was about one meter in diameter, and they had to move forward with their bodies bent.","“Let’s seal off the exit first. We can’t use our divine senses to detect this pit. Let’s investigate the situation first. If there’s any danger, we’ll retreat,” Chen Changqing said.","Hearing what he said, Zhao Feng quickly sealed off the exit.","The two of them walked in and looked down at an angle of about 60 degrees. The diameter of the pit was getting bigger and bigger. Gradually, the two of them could walk side by side, and there was no danger.","After they advanced for two hours, the diameter of the pit reached more than ten meters.","“Yin winds are blowing. There may be Yin creatures here.”","Zhao Feng lowered his voice.","“We need to be careful.”","Chen Changqing was extremely cautious.","“There are more pits here. Which direction should we take?”","There was a fork in the road in front.","“The pits on the left and right sides seem to have existed for a very long time. This very small pit in the middle seems like it’s been newly dug.”","“Let’s take the middle one.”","After some discussion, they continued to walk in.","“This seems to be a big tomb.”","“A tomb underneath the spirit crystal mine. Could it be... that this ancient spirit crystal mine is a burial object?”","“Looks like we need to be more careful.”","“Once something goes wrong, we’ll immediately withdraw.”","“Logically speaking, there should be other passages in a big tomb that might allow us to escape this place.”","“...”","Gradually, they went deep into the great tomb.","The surrounding temperature was getting lower and lower, and when they exhaled, vapor could be seen.","They also found some stone rooms around, but there was nothing in them.","Chen Changqing said in confusion, “I feel like this place has been robbed.”","Right then, a low and suppressed voice suddenly came from ahead, which startled them.","After listening carefully, they found that the voice was a little familiar and full of surprise.","“Emperor Qing, Zhao Feng, come and save me now.”","“Who is it?” Zhao Feng asked loudly.","“Cut the crap. Come here, I can’t hold on any longer!”","Hearing the urgent voice, Zhao Feng was stunned. “It seems to be... Ye Longyuan?”","“Yes, it’s me. Come in now. Hurry!”","Ye Longyuan’s extremely anxious voice was heard again.","The two didn’t waste any time and rushed forward.","Ye Longyuan was holding the lid of a coffin with both hands.","The coffin was black and seemed to have an opening. At the opening, there were two bony claws, which were about to push open the lid of the coffin. It seemed that the one inside was about to come out, while Ye Longyuan was trying his best to push to close the lid. He was drenched in sweat and was obviously exhausted.","Ye Longyuan said in a hurry, “Hurry, come and help me.”","Zhao Feng and Chen Changqing looked at each other, walked over, and pressed Ye Longyuan’s shoulders.","Ye Longyuan was dumbfounded.","“I asked you to push the lid of the coffin. Why are you pushing me?”","“We don’t know if the coffin is dangerous or not, so we’d better push you instead.”","“Are you trying to get me killed?” Ye Longyuan said angrily, “It’s not dangerous. Push the lid now. If he comes out, we will be in danger.”","This time, the two did not hesitate and directly pressed the lid of the coffin.","“It’s so hard to push it!”","The two of them instantly felt an enormous force that was resisting them.","However, with their help, the lid was pushed back.","...","Clack!","The two white bony claws retracted as the coffin lid was returned to normal position.","“Phew.”","Ye Longyuan was so exhausted that he sat down on the ground and said, “Oh my god, I was scared to death. One can’t touch the pitch without being defiled. I almost died this time.”","“What’s in the coffin?” Zhao Feng was confused. “How did you get here?”","“The thing inside is terrifying... Even if I tell you about it, you won’t be of my help. You’ve never seen it before.” Ye Longyuan squinted at them and said, “What are you doing here? Mining? Wait, you came to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven to mine?”","Zhao Feng and Chen Changqing both looked a little embarrassed.","“We’re here to experience life,” Chen Changqing said tentatively,","“Well, you can continue to experience it. I’m leaving.” Ye Longyuan stood up.","“We’ll go together.”","Chen Changqing put his arm around Ye Longyuan’s shoulder and exerted so much force that Ye Longyuan’s bones almost broke.","...","How could Chen Changqing and Zhao Feng let go of this hard-earned opportunity to get out?","Zhao Feng put his arm around Ye Longyuan’s neck.","“Hey, I’m so glad to see you here. We’re homies. Come, let’s get together.”","“Be gentle. Damn it. Be gentle...!”","Two hours later, they followed the pits and came to a place halfway up a mountain.","Ye Longyuan took out his aircraft. They took off and entered a king vessel a little farther away in the universe.","“Let go of me now. I’m going to be strangled to death by you two,” Ye Longyuan said with displeasure.","The two of them immediately let go.","After a moment of silence, Chen Changqing cupped his hands and said, “Thank you.”","“You really helped us a lot. We owe you a favor.” Zhao Feng also thanked Ye Longyuan.","“Well, don’t mention it.” Ye Longyuan said, “If we were on Earth, I wouldn’t have bothered to talk to you two. But after I got out of Earth, I would somehow be nostalgic.”","He got a little emotional.","No matter what grievances they had with each other on Earth in the past, they would always smile or even drink together when they met.","While they were in a distant Star Area, they would still see each other as homies and didn’t mind the grudges they had.","Of course, those with deep hatred were an exception.","“I guess you two are looking for Devil King Zhang, right?","“He’s on the Heavenly Double Star.”","Ye Longyuan looked reverent and said, “Devil King Zhang is so cruel that he can get everything he wants wherever he goes. You may not have heard that he set up a bounty in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven. The ones who find his people will be rewarded with 100 million crystal stones for each person. Eh? I just found two, didn’t I? If so, I won’t have much money to owe.”","“We found you, and we even saved you,” Zhao Feng said.","“Let’s not talk about this for now. I’ll take you to the Heavenly Double Star. Then, I’ll pay off a part of my debt first. Here are one million crystal stones.” Ye Longyuan took out a Space Ring casually and handed it to Zhao Feng. He said proudly, “As for the rest of my debt, I’ll keep owing it. I’ll be of great importance to Devil King Zhang. When he becomes famous in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven in the future, I’ll tell the others that I owe him some crystal stones, and no one will dare to kill me. Hahaha.”","“Well, what a great ambition. I wish you success.” Chen Changqing nodded.","Both he and Zhao Feng were very happy at this time.","They finally came out of the mine and could find Zhang Han and the others.","“Do you know about what happened to Feifei and Chen Chuan?”","“Also, Mengqi was already pregnant.”","“There are dozens of people on the Heavenly Double Star. They should be there. I don’t know. You can go and see if they’re there by yourselves. The journey will take about seven days.”","Chen Changqing and Zhao Feng set off on their way back with incomparable excitement and uneasiness.","At the same time.","Zhang Han’s group set off on their way back to Earth.","There weren’t that many people on this trip.","Chu Qingyi and Mu Xue headed to the Vast Heaven Star. They wanted to go back to their sect and stay there for a while.","After all, Mengmeng would soon go to the Vast Heaven Star to travel.","This time, more than a dozen people, including Liu Qingfeng, Zhang Li, Liang Hao, and Rong Jiaxin, were going back to Earth.","The others would be temporarily staying at the Chu Family’s place.","Grand Master Chu also wanted to go to Zhang Han’s hometown to visit it, but after thinking about it, he gave up the idea. He planned to stay in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven to expand the reward scale and continue to look for the rest of Zhang Han’s group.","The Thunder Snake that Zhang Han was taking disappeared into the void.","He sensed the Seven-star Sword and headed for the entrance of the secret realm flowing in the Domain of seven Desolations.","It could be said that they were returning the same way they came.","Zhang Han found the Ancient Road of Starry Sky in the Domain of Seven Desolations in the secret realm.","When the spaceship entered it, Zhang Han could feel that with the improvement of his state and strength, he got to control the basic rules of the world more easily.","“There are so many demons around.”","“Oh my god, they look so scary.”","It was the first time for Zhang Guangyou, Mengmeng, and the others to take the Ancient Road of Starry Sky.","The screen captured the scenes around the spaceship. There were countless demons hidden in the darkness.","“The Domain of Seven Desolations is my territory. These things don’t dare to act rashly while I’m around.”","Zhang Han smiled and activated his mind.","The demons retreated for ten thousand meters and made way for the crowd.","It was difficult for others to pass through the Ancient Road of the Starry Sky, but Zhang Han’s group was able to do so with ease.","They reached the exit, which was in the depths of the Devil Palace.","Coincidentally, the remaining five Great Demons were discussing something in the palace.","Where did the Demonic God go?","Originally, they could still sense his whereabouts, but now they seemed to be no longer able to do so.","“In the past, Demon Lord Tonghai was able to contact the Demonic God. Now, who can?”","“The Demonic God is dead.”","A light voice suddenly spread out.","Under everyone’s gaze, a spaceship quickly appeared from the Ancient Road of Starry Sky.","Hearing that voice, the faces of all the people present changed greatly. They knew that it was that horrifying master, Zhang Hanyang, they had met before.","The five Demon Lords were stunned at first.","But then, they all bowed and said respectfully, “Demon Overlord, you’ve finally returned.”","“Demon Overlord, you have to uphold justice for us! We’ve all been bullied.”","“There’s an old monster in the Demonic God Temple. He’s very fierce. We’ve all suffered a little.”","“Demon Overlord, we have been waiting for you for a long time.”","After hearing these words, Zhang Han and the others were all stunned.","Their faces were full of confusion.","“When did Daddy become the Demon Overlord?” Mengmeng asked, looking even more dazed.","“Demon Overlord...” Zi Yan’s mouth trembled slightly. “Is he going to live up to the title of Old Demon Zhang?”","“That’s just nonsense!”","Zhang Han coughed softly and said discontentedly, “Don’t call me that. I’m not your Demon Overlord. Your Demonic God attacked me in the Devil Palace and has already died.”","Rumble!","When the five Demon Lords heard the news, they were shocked at first, and then they came to a sudden realization. After that, they became confused and finally filled with reverence.","They all fell to their knees and kowtowed.","“Greetings, Demon Overlord. We wish to serve you forever.”","“We are willing to offer up our main souls.”","“We are willing to...”","Clatter!","The high-level officials, the Demon Monarchs, and the Demon Generals around also prostrated themselves on the ground.","They presented their main souls to Zhang Han.","“What...”","Zhang Han’s face was slightly stiff.","“How could they be so active?","“Furthermore, I don’t want to be the Demon Overlord.”","After he thought about it carefully.","“Alas, forget it. Fine. The Demon Overlord it is then.”","Zhang Han compromised.","He waved his hand and said, “In that case, I shall be the Demon Lord of the Devil Palace. You don’t need to change your way of doing things. Just guard the Ancient Road of Starry Sky for me.”","“Wonderful! Demon Overlord, please cast the spell now,” the five Demon Lords said in unison.","They wanted their main souls to be controlled by the Demon Overlord. Although their lives and deaths would be under his control, in fact, there wouldn’t be much difference even if he didn’t take their main souls since the Demon Overlord could kill them with a snap of his fingers.","For example, the Stone Demon King had been killed with a single finger strike from Zhang Han.","And now, after being controlled, they would become his subordinates. This was a situation that the Demon Lords, the Demon Generals, and the Demon Monarchs were delighted to see.","Zhang Han was not very willing to accept their main souls.","But it was hard for him to decline their generous intentions.","“Mengmeng, you’ll cast the spell,” Zhang Han said.","“Me?”","Mengmeng was stunned.","Zhang Han secretly told her how to cast the spell via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique. Mengmeng learned it for a few minutes.","It made the Demon Lords and the others extremely nervous.","Fortunately, their main souls were finally controlled.","Zhang Han didn’t have soul sense, so he couldn’t cast this kind of restriction spell. Even if he could, it would be troublesome. But Mengmeng was different. She could just use a soul-sense occult art and finish the spell with a seal.","“Greetings, Young Demon Lord.”","Mengmeng put her hands behind her back and said with a bland look, “Call me Young Demon King.”","She always looked a little cute when she was pretending.","“Greetings, Young Demon King.”","The Demon Lords and the others completely bowed their heads.","At this moment, they were overjoyed.","“Present the precious treasures of our clan to them now!”","“No need for that. Keep them here for now. Next time we come to visit, we’ll check those treasures,” Mengmeng said. “We still have something to do, so we’ll leave now.”","Swoosh!","The spaceship turned into a streak of light and quickly left the area of the Devil Palace.","“We made it!”","The oldest Demon Lord laughed out loud and said, “The Demonic God wasn’t very nice to us. He’s not even as good as the Demon Overlord. It is said that the Demon Overlord, Zhang Hanyang, treats his people very well.”","“Now that the Demonic God Temple has a Great Devil King, we have the invincible Demon Overlord, and our Demon Clan will still dominate the world!”","“Humph! Inform the whole world that our Demon Overlord, Zhang Hanyang, the king, has returned!”","“Hahaha, this is wonderful. Let’s drink 3,000 glasses of wine today!”","“...”","The reaction of the Demon Clan made Zhang Guangyou and the others feel like they were in a dream. They seemed to be in a hurry to present their main souls to the Demon Overlord, Zhang Han. Mengmeng, the Young Demon King, controlled their lives and deaths.","“It’s not strange that they have already considered this matter while the Devil King is pressuring them.”","Zhang Han smiled and took out the Seven-star Sword. After traveling for a moment, he cut through the void and created an exit. The spaceship flashed and disappeared.","The spaceship showed up in the Chaotic Region.","The environment here was even more terrible.","But with the Seven-star Sword, Zhang Han would always be able to find a relatively easy way to control the power of stars.","In the Sea Dragon Star Area.","“We’ve finally returned.”","Liu Qingfeng sat on the throne of his office on the Dragon Base Star once again.","“Gather all the high-position officials to have a meeting.”","The meeting only lasted for two hours.","“I didn’t expect things to go so well here.”","Liu Qingfeng was pleasantly surprised. He didn’t expect that the Heavenly Group had already become the ruler of the Sea Dragon Star Area.","Even an insignificant expatriate could receive the highest reception treatment while visiting other sects.","Liu Qingfeng was a man with foresight.","The punishment system was very decisive and straightforward. In the beginning, some people wanted to seek personal benefits, but later, thousands of middle-level officials were punished, and this kind of chaos gradually stopped.","The prosecution system of the Heavenly Group was also relatively complete. As long as one had enough evidence and went through the reporting procedure, the alleged wrongdoer would either die or be disabled.","Therefore, in the current situation, when people asked for help, they didn’t dare to give gifts. The key was that the middle and high-level officials of the Heavenly Group didn’t dare to accept gifts. They all knew that the system was ruthless and that the decision-maker wasn’t around. If they were wanted or judged, they would be dead.","“Next, we’ll establish our force in the Heavenly Dragon Star Province and the 13 Star Areas around it. We’ll infiltrate all the Star Areas.”","Liu Qingfeng began to give orders again.","Zhang Han and the others did not continue to stay there. Instead, they went to the Lost Continent.","They rested for a day on the Dal Star, Mengmeng’s recreational planet.","The next day, under Mengmeng’s control, they entered the Space Passage. There was the Screen Waterfall, Clear Stream, Silver Sea, and Boundless Sea. According to the usual route, when they stepped on the land in the Ancient Mine, they could see a lot of members of the Dark Shadow Clan every once in a while. There were also humans and even built houses.","These people seemed to be waiting for something here.","When the spaceship stopped, Zhang Han and the others got off. “Hey, why did you come here to build houses?” Mengmeng asked.","“We’re waiting for someone. What... a spaceship? Who are you?” The faces of the people below changed.","“You must be Princess Mengmeng since you came from the Boundless Sea. Princess Xiaonao asked us to wait here.”","“Xiaonao? Where is she now?” Mengmeng asked.","“She’s at the Black White Palace.”","“I see,” Mengmeng replied. The Heavenly Pearl appeared in her palm.","“Huh?” Mengmeng was stunned. “Daddy, I think there’s something wrong.”","“What is it?” Zhang Han’s eyes narrowed.","The Heavenly Pearl was surrounded by a faint mist.","“I, um-huh...”","Mengmeng paused. After thinking for two seconds, she still could not figure out how to use the Heavenly Pearl, so she said, “I’ll bring Xiaonao over and ask her about it.”","Clatter!","Mengmeng casually conjured up a Space Portal and entered it in a flash.","About two minutes later, the Space Portal appeared.","Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and Lisa walked over.","“You’ve finally returned,” Lisa said with a smile.","“We came back from a distant place. Why are you here?” Zi Yan asked in confusion.","“When the space was devouring people, we were teleported to the Ancient Mine.” Lisa gave a brief account of what had happened. “There were changes on the Saint Warrior Planet. The connection between the Ancient Mine and the worldlets has disappeared.”","“My dad also said that the passages between the worldlets and the secular world have also disappeared. It’s not just one passage, but all the passages. Every area has been separated. It seems that there have been some changes in the secular world. My dad is trying to solve them. He has been there for more than two years and hasn’t come back yet,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“There are changes in the secular world, so we can’t go back?” Zhang Guangyou asked.","“My dad said that when Mengmeng comes back, she can control the Heavenly Pearl to open the passages,” Yue Xiaonao said with a grin. “Anyway, it’s not a big deal. It doesn’t matter.”","“I’ll have to think about it.”","Mengmeng looked at the Heavenly Pearl in her palm and was lost in thought.","After a moment of pondering, her eyes lit up.","“Ah, I remember!”","The Heavenly Pearl suddenly began to rotate under Mengmeng’s control.","As it rotated, the faint white mist swirling around the pearl slowly dissipated, making the pearl’s original form particularly clear.","All of the passageways were opened again.","This was a situation that even Yue Wuwei couldn’t control, but as the Heavenly Lord, Mengmeng could.","Mengmeng said with a smile, “Alright, let’s go back.”","The spaceship set off once again.","It soon arrived at the Kun Xu World.","Just like how it was in the past, there was nothing unusual about the Kun Xu World. It was very peaceful.","Zhang Han, however, frowned.","“Something’s not right.","“The suppression in the Kun Xu World has been reduced. One can display the cultivation level of the Peak Stage of the Elixir Realm here now. This place is now the same as the King’s Domain and the Kunlun Immortal World.”"]},{"number":1459,"title":"Chapter 1459 Establish a Sect?","paragraphs":["Chapter 1459 Establish a Sect?","“Maybe this is one of those changes?” Wang Ming murmured.","“Let’s go back first and see what’s going on.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly.","With the speed of the king vessel, it would only take them more than half an hour to reach Mount New Moon by slowly flying.","Meanwhile, Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao were very happy to see each other.","Yue Xiaonao said as she ate the fruit, “Mengmeng, you have no idea that I’ve been in the Ancient Mine for more than two years. I was so bored.”","“I appeared on the Vast Heaven Star and joined the Crimson Sunglow Sect. My dad went to pick me up afterward and even fought the Crimson Sunglow Sect. The sect’s Third Elder is Taoist Heavenlight, and he’s quite detestable. He’s just a Third Elder, and my dad dealt with him easily.”","“How did he deal with that elder? Tell me,” Yue Xiaonao said in an envious tone.","The two big girls began to chat.","Most of the time, Mengmeng was the one who talked. Nothing interesting had happened to Yue Xiaonao in the Ancient Mine.","When good friends met, they were in high spirits. Moreover, when they returned to their hometown, that kind of familiar feeling made them feel physically and mentally refreshed.","“Xiaonao, how come you’ve become so heavier than before?” Mengmeng couldn’t help but ask when she saw that Yue Xiaonao was still eating.","“Huh? Have I gained weight?” Yue Xiaonao was stunned.","“You’re really chubby. This is not okay,” Mengmeng said seriously.","“How heavy do I look?” Yue Xiaonao’s expression became serious.","“I feel like you’ve gained a lot of weight. Maybe 10 or 20 pounds?” Mengmeng pursed her lips and shook her head. “I can’t let you go on like this. It’s not good to be too heavy.”","“Then, what should I do? I also want to be as thin as you.” Yue Xiaonao subconsciously put away the snacks.","“You can’t eat all the time.” Mengmeng thought for a moment and said, “You can just eat an apple every meal. You should be able to lose some weight after doing this for a while.”","Yue Xiaonao pondered for a moment and said hesitantly, “Do you mean eating an apple before or after the meal?”","Mengmeng was dumbfounded.","She looked very confused.","She couldn’t make it clear. In the end, Mengmeng came to the conclusion that Yue Xiaonao was carefree and chubby.","Yue Wuwei had been away for more than two years, but Yue Xiaonao didn’t really miss him. If it were Zhang Han who did that, Mengmeng wouldn’t be okay with it.","Of course, this had something to do with the fact that Yue Xiaonao had not been with Yue Wuwei for a long time when she was a child.","Since Mengmeng met Zhang Han when she was four years old, they had rarely separated.","“We’ve arrived at the secular world.”","The crowd followed the previous passage and arrived at the secular world.","The air, the temperature, and the scenery were still the same.","Nothing seemed to have changed.","“We’re back!”","“We’re back.”","They were all in a good mood.","However, when they approached Mount New Moon, something shocking happened.","“Mount New Moon seems to be very lively.” Zi Yan was stunned.","“What’s going on?” Mengmeng widened her eyes.","“Holy crap.” Zhang Li grinned.","After a while, Zi Yan looked at Zhang Han and asked, “Honey, did our home get robbed?”","Looking down from the sky, they could see that Mount New Moon was full of people inside and outside.","The buildings were still there. Except for the Thunder Yang Trees and the other four kinds of thunder yang treasures, the rest were all gone.","The magic paradise was also torn down.","The livestock in the back mountain was gone, and the environment was more or less damaged. The place where the Hundred-formation Image, the Thousand-formation Image, and the Ten-thousand-formation Image were stored had been completely raided. The robbers had gone all out to raid Mount New Moon.","“I guess so.”","Zhang Han also could not believe it.","He didn’t expect that Mount New Moon would be occupied by someone else just nearly three years after they left.","“Who has the guts to do that?”","“Wait.”","Zi Yan’s eyes narrowed slightly, and she immediately took out her mobile phone from her Space Ring.","“Let me see if I can contact the guys. It doesn’t matter if we are robbed, but our men who stayed behind...”","The atmosphere gradually became solemn.","“How dare they raid our territory? I’ll go and kill them!” Yue Xiaonao was furious.","“Don’t be impulsive.” Lisa stopped her and said, “Whom are you going to kill? Are you going to kill all the people below? It’s obvious that there are many secular martial artists down there. If we want to know what’s going on, we’ll wait for Aunt Zi Yan to contact someone and ask. We can go down and inquire about what happened. It won’t be too late to take action after we figure out the situation.”","“I can’t get in touch with them. Their phones have been turned off.” Zi Yan dialed several numbers in her contact list.","“I can’t get in touch with them, either.” Zi Qiang said, “Contact all the people in your contact list. As soon as we reach them, we’ll know what happened exactly.”","Zhang Han said, “Yeah. Let’s go down and take a look first. Put away the king vessel. It’s not suitable for us to use here.”","...","“Okay.”","Mengmeng nodded.","The group left through the cabin door.","They put away the king vessel, descended to the sea area around Mount New Moon, and continued to move forward.","“Wait a minute.”","Mengmeng suddenly let out a cry. She took out the Heavenly Pearl, fiddled with it, and said, “Do you feel it now?","“The rules of the Great Domain have been changed.” Yue Xiaonao carefully felt it and said, “We only have the combat capability of the Building Base Realm here, which is inferior to the Innateness Realm.”","“We’re indeed a little suppressed. In the worldlets, our combat capability would be upgraded by one level, and here it is suppressed by a level.” Zhang Han thought for a while, but he didn’t figure out why.","“I was wondering why I felt so tired when we flew just now. I felt like I needed to spend several times more energy than usual,” Rong Jiali said.","Building Base Realm martial artists could travel by wind, but one had to be at Innateness Realm to truly fly.","Under the Law of this world, they could be regarded as Semi Innateness Realm cultivators, and they were infinitely close to the level of the Innateness Realm. They could fly, but it would consume more energy.","...","“This seems to be a grand martial arts gathering.”","Zhang Han checked the situation with his soul sense, but he only learned a little of it.","“Let’s go and check it out.”","The group of people came to the coast and jumped up from the edge of the cliff behind the mountain.","Many martial artists could be seen coming and going around. Some were standing on the tips of trees, while others were gliding over.","One could even see a small number of well-known martial artists.","An He, the King of Storms, Miao Fei, Ye Tianlang, the head of the National Security Agency, and a few others were all near the Thunder Yang Tree on Mount New Moon.","There were dozens of rows of chairs over there, and they were all sitting on them.","Obviously, those who could sit there were all well-known people in the martial arts world.","But under the Thunder Yang Tree, there was a temporary stage, on which there were many solid wood chairs.","A small number of people in black were walking around nearby. They had the same proud expressions on their faces.","“These people’s auras seem to be a little stronger. How come they are not suppressed by the rules when they are in the Innateness Realm?” Zhang Guangyou frowned.","Gradually, as they walked in, they found more and more people around and the place became crowded.","They could hear a lot of discussions.","“The ancient martial arts world has gone too far.”","“The Black Sun Sect is too bossy.”","“Alas, what can we do? Mount New Moon is the holy land of our martial arts world. However, it has been attacked for two years, and no one has stepped forward to resist. The gates of the worldlets can’t be opened, and the Kunlun Immortal World is gone. The ancient martial arts world that showed up from nowhere is invincible.”","Most of the people in the crowd were the new generation of martial artists. Except for those who went to the Sea Dragon Star Area, the older generation of martial artists was basically in the Kunlun Immortal World or worldlets.","The new generation would replace the old.","It seemed that the young people here rarely knew about the past.","Someone asked in confusion, “How could Mount New Moon be the holy land of the martial arts world? The strength here is not good enough. Look at the ancient martial arts world. With the Black Sun Sect alone, it has destroyed Mount New Moon. It has been almost two years, and no experts have appeared from Mount New Moon. I think its power has been exaggerated. Its fame is just rumors. I guess in the media’s words, it is called hype.”","However, there were also some senior martial artists present.","After one of the old men heard this, he frowned and scolded the young man.","“Mind your words! Young man, if you don’t understand what happened in the golden age of the martial arts world, don’t talk nonsense. Why is Mount New Moon called the holy land? Because any one of the previous members of Mount New Moon could slay the whole martial arts world. Do you understand?”","“Senior, have you ever seen one with your own eyes?” the young martial artist asked.","“I, I haven’t seen one with my own eyes, but my good friend has.”","“Alas,” the young man sighed and said, “rumors only become more and more exaggerated. I finally understand the origin of the holy land. Maybe it’s just an exaggeration. Only the ancient martial arts world is truly powerful. It only has one sect, and people have to look up to it. It’s said that Chu Feng, the Holy Son of the Black Sun Sect, has slayed the martial arts world entirely and is invincible. Today, Chu Feng will also come here and announce that he will establish a branch in the martial arts world. I wonder if I’m qualified to join it.”","“I also want to join the Black Sun Sect.”","Even though Mount New Moon had been razed to the ground, they didn’t feel sad about it at all. It had nothing to do with them. Since they had seen how powerful the Black Sun Sect was, they wanted to join the sect. There were quite a few people like this.","The area around Mount New Moon was crowded with about 20,000 people. In addition to Mount New Moon, there were also many people on the east side of the mountain, which was close to it.","Hearing the discussions around them, Zhang Han and the others knew very well that the ancient martial arts world suddenly appeared in the secular world, and there were sects coming out of it. The Black Sun Sect destroyed Mount New Moon and was going to announce the establishment of a sub-sect today. Chu Feng, the Holy Son, would be the Sect Leader of the sub-sect, and several other sects from the ancient martial arts world would come over as well. They would establish sub-sects in various regions as well as a long-term connection with the secular world.","“The ancient martial arts world has appeared for two years?” Zhang Guangyou frowned slightly. “I don’t have the phone number of the Gai Clan. If Old Gai were here, we could ask him about that.”","Although his voice was low, it still attracted the attention of several young men and women beside him.","One of the women with a ponytail asked, “Are you talking about the Gai Clan in the northeast?”","“Yes. Do you know them?” Zhang Guangyou replied.","“The Gai Clan surrendered. The northern martial arts world of Hua nation was destroyed by the Blazing Fire Sect, and all the sects and families surrendered. Ten days ago, the Blazing Fire Sect established a sub-sect on Mount Flower Cap, and at that time, 30,000 martial artists joined the sect,” the woman said.","“Unfortunately, it was too late for us to join the sect when we got the news.” A young man sighed and said, “But we also have a shot here. The Black Sun Sect is also very powerful.”","“Dad.”","Mengmeng raised her head slightly, touched the edge of her cap with her right hand, and said in shock, “It’s only been a little more than ten years, and no one in the martial arts world here knows you.”","“I guess so.”","Zhang Han smiled faintly and didn’t care about these things.","Mengmeng muttered, “Things turned out to be like this. It seems fine.”","Zhang Han was stunned.","Why did his daughter say that?","“I’ve contacted the guys.”","Xu Xinyu looked excited and said, “I’ve contacted my second brother.”","As she spoke, she lowered her voice and asked a lot of questions.","After hanging up the phone, she delivered the message to the crowd.","Two years ago, a crystal island appeared in the Pacific Ocean.","There was an entrance at the top of the mountain, which led to the ancient martial arts world.","People from several sects in the ancient martial arts world came out. The passage was very stable at first, but then something unexpected suddenly happened.","It was very difficult for the people inside to come out, but those outside could go in.","Until now, the energy in the passage had gradually stabilized, and it wouldn’t be long before it recovered to its original state.","At that time, a few groups of people came out and stirred up trouble in the martial arts world.","There were also many sects of the martial arts world that owned treasured lands. However, Mount New Moon had been targeted by the Black Sun Sect. Because of the changes in the World Law, they could use the skills at the Peak Stage of the Building Base Realm, while the people from the ancient martial arts world could use skills in the Innateness Realm and become invincible.","They delivered an ultimatum to Mount New Moon.","After that, more than a dozen people from Mount New Moon died. Seeing that they really couldn’t stop the enemy, the others gave up.","As for the members of the Zi Clan, the Liang Clan, and other business families, they were protected by the National Security Agency, so they were safe. However, every one of them had paid 50 billion yuan to the Black Sun Sect to keep themselves safe.","At the same time, the remaining martial artists of Mount New Moon were forced to announce that Mount New Moon had fallen.","This place was now the territory of the Black Sun Sect.","“Third Uncle Liang is dead.”","“The second uncle of the Liang Clan is also dead, and eight people of our Zi Clan have died.”","Zi Qiang gasped.","“It isn’t strange that people would die in a battle of martial arts. However...”","“Silence.”","A man in black said loudly, “When the Holy Son comes back later, the Martial Arts Gathering will officially begin.","“Let’s wait until everyone is here and get even with them,” Zhang Guangyou said in a deep voice.","The members of the Black Sun Sect, as well as the most ordinary disciples, all had looks of pride on their faces.","Their strength was superior to everyone else’s, and they were capable of dominating the entire battlefield and looking down on the world.","Nowadays, the secular world had become a game for the major sects of the ancient martial arts world.","It could be said that the martial arts world was no longer attractive to cultivators, but they were still fascinated by a world filled with entertainment.","Even when they were talking, they expressed their yearning.","“The ordinary society is so exciting.”","“Many people work day after day. They don’t cultivate to improve their strength but work to earn living expenses. For a house of dozens of square meters, they have to work hard for many years. My God, when did a house deserve such pursuit?”","“It’s interesting here. Recently, I’ve been spending time on my mobile phone and installed a dating app. I put the photo of Junior Sister Mi on it. It went viral. Many people want to date me.”","“You’re a man. How are you going to date those guys?”","“...”","Everything was very novel, and they liked such a harmonious and complicated society.","This was also one of the reasons why they came over. The most important reason was nothing more than the frequently seen Relics.","“What are Ye Tianlang and the others doing up there?” Zhang Guangyou asked in confusion after looking at them for a moment.","He knew a few people sitting in the seats up there.","Zhang Han heard more information, so he responded, “The opening of a sect at the Martial Arts Gathering should be approved by the major forces today.”","“I see.”","Zhang Guangyou nodded.","At this time, the crowd suddenly became noisy.","“The Thousand Cranes Palace’s Saintly Woman, Ye Feiran, is here!”","Everyone turned their heads to look.","More than a dozen people were flying over from a distance. The leader was a woman in sportswear. She had a ponytail and looked extraordinary.","She was the Saintly Woman of the Thousand Cranes Palace, Ye Feiran. She had established her own sect in the western region.","“Ye Feiran is so beautiful!”","“She deserves to be called the Saintly Woman. She’s also very powerful. It’s said that even Chu Feng has to pay her respect.”","“She’s a very powerful woman.”","“...”","She had a high momentum when she arrived.","However, something important was missing in her momentum.","Mengmeng raised her eyes and looked at the woman before shaking her head.","“It’s far from being good enough as Aunty Xue’s entrance back then.”","She still remembered that Mu Xue was dressed in black and had a sword strapped to her waist during her several entrances. Mu Xue the female demon looked extremely powerful.","Now that she had turned to the good side, it was rare for her to have such tempting laughter.","“We’ll crush them all later.” Yue Xiaonao snorted.","Ye Feiran and the others sat directly on the big chairs, drinking tea. They glanced around and secretly compared the numbers in their hearts. It seemed that the number of people here was not as many as the number of people their Thousand Cranes Palace had taken.","“The Holy Son of the Blazing Fire Sect, Ao Li, is here.”","The crowd once again burst into an uproar.","Everyone’s eyes were fixed on the north.","A group of more than 30 people was flying over at a low altitude.","“Eh? Ye Feiran, you actually got here first? Don’t you hate waiting the most?” Ao Yuan asked from a distance.","“I’m here to see how many disciples Chu Feng has taken in,” Ye Feiran replied indifferently.","“Hahaha! I don’t think you have as many disciples as our Blazing Fire Sect!”","“Number doesn’t matter but quality,” Ye Feiran retorted.","“Well, you’re right, but why do I feel that you’re a little jealous?” Ao Li, the Holy Son of the Blazing Fire Sect, did not show due respect for feelings. He sneered and sat on the other side.","“The people from the Martial Soul Sect have arrived.”","“In Southeast Asia, the Martial Soul Sect dominated the martial arts world there. It is also a very powerful sect. It is said that they have more than 100,000 in-door disciples.”","The crowd became even more shocked.","“Why are you here?” Ao Li frowned as he stared coldly at the leader of the Martial Soul Sect.","“What’s wrong? Is there any place in the world that I can’t go?” The leader of the Martial Soul Sect looked straight at Ao Li. Their eyes met, and there was a sense of tension between them.","Seeing this, some supervisors of the Black Sun Sect felt troubled and didn’t dare to say anything more.","“Milords, please take a seat and rest for a while. Our sect’s Holy Son will be here soon.”","Then, in the next 20 minutes, several groups of people came in succession. Every time a group arrived, it would cause a sensation.","When it was the right time, Chu Feng and a dozen other people landed in the distance.","He was wearing a beige trench coat. His hair was slightly long, and his eyes were soft.","He looked at the field and said in a low and slightly hoarse voice, “Does anyone have any questions about the Black Sun Sect’s establishment today?”","Swoosh!","Instantly, there was dead silence in the field.","Some people were shocked by Chu Feng’s decisiveness. He went straight to the point without courtesy.","His aura was a little cold, and he didn’t seem to be the kind of person who would joke.","He was indeed a ruthless man.","Everyone couldn’t help but feel a little nervous.","“Let’s get started.” Chu Feng looked at Ye Tianlang and the others in the first seats.","Ye Tianlang let out a sigh.","After their acceptance and the ceremony, the Black Sun Sect would be established on Mount New Moon.","People had to be humble when they were trapped in an inferior situation.","Although Ye Tianlang’s momentum was inferior, he still insisted, “First of all, I’m very glad to welcome the Black Sun Sect to establish a sub-sect in the secular martial arts world. Congratulations!","“But there is a problem. As we all know, Mount New Moon is also a major force in the martial arts world. I’m thinking about establishing the sect in another place, and all the expenses will be paid by the National Security Agency. I wonder if you can consider this condition, Chu Feng the Holy Son?”","Ye Tianlang felt helpless in his heart. He had already contacted the Black Sun Sect more than ten days ago when he heard the news, but they ignored him and didn’t even bother to talk to him.","He said his proposal right to them at this moment.","“What did you say?”","Chu Feng’s gentle eyes gradually became sharp as he reprimanded, “Does our Black Sun Sect need your permission to establish a sect in the secular world? Who do you think you are?”","He seemed to think that it was better not to be too harsh on others on his grand ceremony day.","Regardless of Ye Tianlang’s embarrassed expression, he sneered and said, “Well, I didn’t seem to hear you too clearly just now. What did you say? Can you repeat it in front of me, the Holy Son of the Black Sun Sect?”"]},{"number":1460,"title":"Chapter 1460 Are You Just a Fool","paragraphs":["Chapter 1460 Are You Just a Fool","Swoosh!","Ye Tianlang’s face slightly changed.","He braced himself and said a few words, feeling that there was a slight chance that Chu Feng, the Holy Son of the Black Sun Sect, would consider his proposal.","Unexpectedly, the other party directly retorted.","For a moment, Ye Tianlang did not dare to say anything.","The crowd around them discussed animatedly and fell into an uproar.","“Ye Tianlang is the boss of the National Security Agency. Chu Feng, the Holy Son, doesn’t even respect him.”","“It seems that the sects in the ancient martial arts world are the top ones in the secular world.”","“Will they stir up trouble in the secular world in the future?” Someone said worriedly, “In the past, we had the National Security Agency check and balance the situation, and all the major sects and families restricted themselves to a certain extent. But now, with the appearance of the sects of the ancient martial arts world, everything has changed.”","“Yeah, but think about it, if you join such a sect, you can do what you didn’t dare to do before. Haha, this is simply amazing!”","Some people didn’t like the restrictions of the rules, and they were happy to see that Chu Feng didn’t give show respect.","The National Security Agency had suppressed the martial arts world for so many years, and they could finally be unscrupulous and do whatever they wanted now.","“You don’t dare to say it?”","Chu Feng stared at Ye Tianlang with his sinister eyes. Suddenly, he smiled faintly and asked slowly, “Then, Leader Ye Tianlang, do you agree to let the Black Sun Sect establish a sect on Mount New Moon?”","“I...” Ye Tianlang’s mouth moved, and he had a bitter look.","“Don’t be impulsive,” someone beside him reminded him in a low voice. “Tianlang, you can’t stop the general trend at all.”","“Yeah. The Gai Clan in the northeast, Mount New Moon, the Chen Clan in Shang Jing, the Miao Clan in the northwest, and other major families and sects have all surrendered, but only the National Security Agency refused. Then... the consequences are unimaginable. Brother Tianlang, please calm down.”","Hearing the words of the people around him, Ye Tianlang closed his eyes and sighed softly.","“If they are still here...”","He did not continue.","But in the hearts of the people around him, several names flashed through their minds.","“Merciless Zhang Hanyang, Emperor Qing, Mu Xue the female demon, Zhang Guangyou the lord of battle, Immortal King Zhang, and the Heavenly Knights Sect...”","The talents of martial arts who used to dominate the world were all gone. Even the ones of their next generation rarely appeared in the martial arts world.","The blockade of the major passages led to the current situation.","“Hold on for a while.”","Someone said via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “The passages in the Kunlun Immortal World and the worldlets will not be closed all the time. When they open, someone will get even with Chu Feng.”","Ye Tianlang took a deep breath and said, “I have no objection.”","“Very nice.”","Chu Feng flicked a disdainful glance at him and couldn’t be bothered to ask those people one by one. He said, “Does anyone have any objections? If there are no objections, my Black Sun Sect’s Elder Hu will come here in a moment and formally hold the opening ceremony.”","“I think Ye Tianlang’s right.”","All of a sudden, a woman’s voice came from the side.","“Hmm?”","Chu Feng frowned and looked over with a fierce gaze.","A woman with a ponytail in sportswear seemed to be a little nervous.","She slowly walked forward and said, “Everyone knows whom Mount New Moon belongs to. Now that they are out on business, aren’t you afraid of attracting trouble if you occupy Mount New Moon like this? No one has any objection to the establishment of the Black Sun Sect, but please consider establishing the sect elsewhere, Holy Son Chu Feng.”","“Really?” Chu Feng sneered and asked, “Who are you?”","“My name is Lu Guo. I’m a teacher at an elementary school.”","Swoosh!","As soon as she finished speaking, a figure hurriedly flew over from afar.","It was Lu Xiong, Lu Guo’s grandfather.","The amazing cleaner looked a little nervous. He pulled Lu Guo and said, “We’re sorry to have disturbed you.”","As he spoke, he said to Lu Guo sternly, “Go now!”","Worried that Lu Guo would be stubborn, he scolded her via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “Are you stupid? Zhang Hanyang and his companions are in the outside world, and none of them are here. What’s the use of you coming here to stand up for them? You’ll just be courting death!”","“There are so many martial artists in the world. How can the Black Sun Sect defy the natural order?” Lu Guo said angrily.","“Hahahaha.”","Holy Son Chu Feng laughed heartily when he heard this. “Defying the natural order? You’re wrong. May I ask everyone present whether or not you agree for the Black Sun Sect to establish a sect here?”","One of the subordinates reacted quickly and said loudly, “If you agree, then say it.”","In the beginning, a few people said, “I agree.”","Gradually, more and more people began to speak.","“I agree!”","“I agree!”","The sound waves gradually became louder.","It was like the rising sun at dawn, slowly rising, unstoppable.","There were some elderly people in the crowd. They looked around and sighed.","...","“If you do this, you will definitely suffer in the future. Once that person comes back, you... Alas!”","Ye Tianlang and the others slowly closed their eyes. The martial arts world no longer knew Zhang Hanyang. It seemed that many people didn’t know that he had suppressed a generation of the Golden Age alone and made everyone fear.","“That’s enough.”","Ye Tianlang got up and said, “We agree. We also welcome the Black Sun Sect to establish a sect. As for the address, it’s the Black Sun Sect’s own choice, and no one can interfere with it. As the chief instructor of the National Security Agency, I’m here to bear witness to all this.”","“Let’s go!”","Lu Xiong grabbed Lu Guo’s arm and was about to drag her away.","“Did I tell you to leave?”","Chu Feng’s expression relaxed. He sat on a solid wooden chair and said indifferently, “Anyone who disturbs the opening ceremony of the Black Sun Sect must be severely punished. Someone slap him in the face 3,000 times.”","“Ahah.”","Ye Feiran, the Saintly Woman of the Thousand Cranes Palace, laughed charmingly. “It looks like someone is dissatisfied with your Black Sun Sect. Did you pick a bad place? Why don’t you switch to another place?”","Chu Feng ignored her and motioned to his men.","...","Five people moved and strode toward Lu Xiong.","“Holy Son, please calm down. We are just raising an objection and have no intention of disturbing you,” Ye Tianlang said.","“That’s right. Holy Son Chu Feng, it’s our fault. We’re deeply sorry.” Lu Xiong immediately echoed.","“Hmm?”","Chu Feng’s face darkened slightly. “It is the opening day of the sect today. Otherwise, do you think you can still stand here and talk? Cut the crap. I don’t want to kill anyone today. If you accept the punishment obediently, I will spare your lives.”","As soon as these words were spoken, the atmosphere instantly became slightly confrontational.","“Go now!”","Ye Tianlang moved and stood in front of Lu Xiong. He was going to stop Chu Feng’s men from approaching.","“You’re courting death!”","“Black-Wind Palm!”","Those subordinates began to take action. They were able to exert the Innateness Realm power here, while Ye Tianlang could only exert the Peak-Stage Building Base Realm power.","There was a huge gap between them. After just one move, he had no choice but to retreat.","The other disciples of the Black Sun Sect also surrounded the area.","“How dare you! Kneel!”","They were getting closer and closer and continued to compress the encirclement.","Ye Tianlang, Lu Xiong, and Lu Guo attacked those people one after another, but they were unable to resist.","Many people’s eyes widened in anger. They looked at each other. Seven or eight people stepped forward.","Someone said, “Holy Son Chu Feng, please show some mercy.”","“Huh.”","Chu Feng’s face darkened. He slowly stood up and said, “Every one of these people shall be punished with 3,000 slaps as a warning to everyone.”","Bang! Bang! Bang!","More and more people started to fight.","In just two minutes, they were squeezed into a group.","The others all shook their heads.","“Ignorant.”","“Since the general trend is unstoppable, why would they insist on standing up for Mount New Moon?”","“No one can stop the ancient martial arts world while the passages are closed.”","When Ye Tianlang and the others were unable to resist the attacks.","“I’m sorry to have implicated you.” Lu Guo’s eyes were slightly red.","At this moment.","Swoosh!","A dark shadow quickly came to Lu Guo.","It was Chu Feng’s core subordinate, his right-hand man. At this time, with a grim smile, he raised his hand and was about to smash Lu Guo’s beautiful face.","“Scram!”","However, a shocking turn of events occurred.","After watching the battle for a moment, Mengmeng finally couldn’t help but take action.","No one could even see how she got into the battlefield.","A figure appeared before them and stopped in front of Lu Guo.","Even Ye Tianlang and the others didn’t know who the figure was.","But in the next second-","Smack!","A loud and clear voice rang out, shocking the whole place.","Chu Feng’s right-hand man was sent flying thousands of meters away by this slap and died halfway through.","“What?”","Many of the people present were shocked.","Who’d stood up for them?","“Huh?”","Ye Feiran let out a soft cry of surprise, and her gaze was playful. “There seems to be a good show today.”","She glanced at Chu Feng, only to see that his face was gradually turning livid.","Hundreds of disciples of the Black Sun Sect surrounded the group.","Under everyone’s gaze, the girl in front of Lu Guo slowly turned around. She was still wearing a cap, and half of her delicate cheeks could be seen. She looked up slightly.","“Miss, don’t be afraid. We’re back.”","Rumble!","It was like a bolt from the blue, hitting Ye Tianlang and the others head-on.","“Who is she? Who?”","“The Eldest Lady of Mount New Moon!”","“Oh my god!”","“Good heavens!”","“They’re back!”","At this moment, Ye Tianlang was ecstatic.","The people around him were also immediately relieved.","The tens of thousands of martial artists present didn’t know what was going on, but the senior martial artists in the crowd were extremely excited.","“They’re here!”","“That era has returned!”","“Huh.” Chu Feng sneered and walked forward step by step. “Who are you now?”","“Humph!”","Mengmeng snorted and said, “I’m Mengmeng, the Eldest Lady of Mount New Moon!”","“I see.” Chu Feng came to a sudden realization. “It turns out that you’re the leftover evils of Mount New Moon. Your Mount New Moon has been disbanded for a long time. You’ve come here to make trouble on the day of the opening of our Black Sun Sect. It seems that I shouldn’t have shown mercy at this time. But since you dare to show up today, I’ll kill you all in front of the whole world.”","“You are so confident.” Mengmeng was both amused and irritated.","“Am I? I’ll teach you a lesson later. Yep.” Chu Feng seemed to have made up his mind.","“Well, I’ll beg you not to die later,” Mengmeng said flatly.","Clatter!","Countless people in the surroundings were shocked.","In particular, those from the ancient martial arts world, such as the Holy Sons and the Saintly Women, all had slightly strange looks on their faces.","There hadn’t been much interference when they’d founded their sects, but there seemed to be some changes when it came to the Black Sun Sect.","“It’s time for Mount New Moon to be destroyed.” A long saber appeared in Chu Feng’s right hand.","“You’re truly courting death.”","Yue Xiaonao’s voice came from behind.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The people around Yue Xiaonao quickly retreated to make way for a 100-meter radius.","They were afraid that they would be implicated if there was a battle later.","However, at this moment, Zhang Han and the others also showed up.","The moment Ye Tianlang saw Zhang Han, he laughed.","He cupped his hands and said loudly, “Welcome! Zhang Hanyang, the Lord of Mount New Moon, is back!”","“Congratulations on Mount New Moon!”","The people around him said, “Hahaha! We’re so enough with these people’s savage acts!”","Rumble!","Many of the tens of thousands of martial artists who knew about Zhang Hanyang were so excited that their arms trembled.","“He’s back! Merciless Zhang is back!”","“Who is Merciless Zhang? Is he legendary Zhang Hanyang? Is he really powerful?”","“You don’t get it. You don’t get it at all. Young man, you can just watch.”","“...”","The mountain peak was filled with voices.","Most people’s eyes were fixed on Zhang Han.","Even Chu Feng, Ye Feiran, and the others were acting the same.","They even thought of many people’s evaluation of Zhang Hanyang.","“Merciless Zhang Hanyang is invincible all over the world.","“He dominated an era. In that golden era when talents emerged in large numbers, he looked down on the world, and the others were overwhelmed. They either bowed their heads or fled.”","“Zhang Hanyang represents that era.”","Everyone had heard of the legends one by one.","And now, this powerful figure has returned on the day that the Black Sun Sect established a sect.","But that didn’t matter.","The people here were in the Building Base Realm at most, while any disciple from the ancient martial arts world could exert the power of the Innateness Realm.","“You’re finally back!” Lu Xiong laughed.","Seeing this, Zhang Han shook his head slightly. He led his team and walked forward slowly.","When they approached Ye Tianlang’s group, Zhang Han’s expression was calm without the slightest emotion. He looked at Chu Feng as if he were looking at an ant.","For some reason, Chu Feng was a little afraid at this moment. He didn’t seem to want to make the first move.","“May I know which one of you is the Lord of Mount New Moon?” Ye Feiran inquired.","But Zhang Han just ignored her.","He looked at Chu Feng and said in a calm tone, “What did you just say about Mount New Moon? I don’t seem to have heard it clearly. Can you repeat it in front of me, the Lord of Mount New Moon?”","He repeated what Chu Feng had said.","“What can you do even if I repeat it?” Chu Feng sneered and said, “Mount New Moon is just a force that has been destroyed.”","“Is that so?”","Zhang Han chuckled and said, “Among the blind the one-eyed man is king. If the Heaven-earth Formation of Mount New Moon had not been sealed, nobodies like you would have been able to enter the area within five kilometers.”","He could feel the state of Mount New Moon.","The Heaven-earth Formation had been suppressed by the changes in World Law. The Five Thunder Yang Treasures were still here. The herb garden was gone, some buildings had been torn down, and the castle had become dilapidated.","It seemed that those people were going to set up a sect here and had been preparing for the construction.","Chu Feng’s expression turned even colder. “You’re courting death!”","“Kneel!” Zhang Guangyou shouted with a sullen face.","Mengmeng snorted when she heard Chu Feng’s words, and her eyes flashed.","Her power in the Yuan Ying Realm spread.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","The tens of thousands of people present, including Chu Feng, felt as if they had suddenly been trapped in an ice cave. They felt so cold both physically and mentally that they couldn’t even speak.","It was terrifying might that was several stages higher than theirs.","It was hard for them to take it.","“What, what is this?”","Ye Feiran’s face changed.","The other Holy Sons and Saintly Women were so scared that their faces turned pale.","Under the attention of the crowd, the numerous Black Sun Sect disciples led by Chu Feng all knelt.","The scene was extremely shocking.","The disciples who’d wanted to join the Black Sun Sect were even more dumbfounded.","They had never expected a sect as strong as the Black Sun Sect to be crushed like this.","“The era of the martial arts world has changed. It seems that people have forgotten the power of Mount New Moon.” Zhang Han shook his head slightly and took the lead to the stage under the Thunder Yang Tree.","When he passed by Chu Feng, he patted him on the shoulder and said flatly, “You won’t die very soon. After all, you... shall be punished as a warning to everyone.”","It was what Chu Feng had said as well.","But at this moment, Chu Feng’s face was covered in a cold sweat, and he was extremely frightened.","“All of you, get lost!” Yue Xiaonao pointed at Ye Feiran and the others.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Under the enormous pressure, they all left in a flash.","Zhang Han and the others took over those seats one after another.","Ye Tianlang and the others were all in high spirits.","They could finally hold their heads high.","“Eldest Lady, you’ll handle this.”","Zhang Han waved his hand, looked at Mengmeng, and smiled slightly.","He remembered that Mengmeng had just said, “I’m the Eldest Lady of Mount New Moon!”","This was what Zhang Han found very interesting.","“They just said that they would punish our men with 3,000 slaps. An eye for an eye it is then.”","Mengmeng snorted and patted the schoolbag on her back. “Instead of 3,000 slaps, each of them shall be flogged 800 times.”","There was no movement in her schoolbag.","Mengmeng ran her mind slightly. “Dahei!”","“Ow?”","Dahei got up in a daze. When it saw that it was on Mount New Moon, it began to laugh happily.","It jumped out of Mengmeng’s schoolbag, looked around, and scratched its head.","“Why are there so many people? What are they doing here?”","“What...?”","In an instant, Ye Tianlang, Lu Xiong, Ye Feiran, and tens of thousands of other people were all stunned.","“What? It’s speaking in the human tongue?”","“Good heavens, what level of spirit creature is it?”","“The ones kneeling are our enemies, and the ones standing are not good people as well.” Mengmeng’s tone was quite dissatisfied. “Humph, flog these kneeling people 800 times. Dahei, you’ll do it.”","“Holy shit. They’re enemies?”","Dahei shook its head and saw the surrounding situation clearly. The castle was ruined, and its precious livestock area in the back mountain was gone.","Clatter!","Dahei kept growing taller and stopped when it was more than ten meters tall. It widened its angry eyes and looked around. It seemed to be looking for a cane.","Swoosh!","Little Hei’s figure flashed and it jumped out. In just three seconds, it came back with a huge branch.","Dahei didn’t stand at the ceremony. It picked up the stick and walked to the nearest Black Sun Sect disciple with it.","It swung the stick and smashed that disciple.","Boom!","That disciple didn’t even manage to take a single strike before he died.","Dahei lifted his foot and threw him toward the sea. No one knew how many miles he had covered.","Dahei told Mengmeng, “I know how to do it. Flog them 800 times and sink their bodies into the sea.”","Mengmeng’s face was slightly stiff.","Gurgle!","Chu Feng swallowed hard.","He swore that he had never seen such a terrifying scene before.","“Mount New Moon is so powerful?","“Those brats totally made me underestimate it! It simply has the strength to dominate the world.","“I’m doomed.”","Chu Feng wanted to punch his chest and stamp his feet, but he couldn’t move at all while restricted by the great might.","Bang!","Bang!","Bang!","Dahei flogged those people one by one and threw them.","It was as if it was playing a ball.","Mengmeng couldn’t bear to look straight at the scene, which was too violent.","Just at this moment, a light voice came from not far away.","“Hey, this place is quite lively. Chu Feng, you did a good job.”","The Black Sun Sect’s Elder Hu had arrived.","Hearing his words, Ye Feiran and the others actually had an inexplicable feeling.","“Elder Hu, oh, Elder Hu, can’t you use your soul sense to check the situation? How could you speak like that before figuring out what was going on? Are you just a fool?”"]},{"number":1461,"title":"Chapter 1461 The Ruler of the Planet","paragraphs":["Chapter 1461 The Ruler of the Planet","What made Ye Feiran and the others even more shocked was that the strength of Zhang Hanyang and his group was too strong.","They felt like a mountain was pressing down on their heads and might land on them at any time.","It was a feeling of fear of being dominated.","As for the martial practitioners of the new generation, they felt that their outlook on the world had been changed again.","“It turns out that the ancient martial arts world is not invincible.”","“They are people from Mount New Moon. They are the Lord and the First Miss of Mount New Moon.”","“No wonder many people say that Mount New Moon is a holy land for martial arts. As soon as these figures showed up, they suppressed the Black Sun Sect.”","“That’s not true!” A little fangirl of the Black Sun Sect said nervously, “Elder Hu of the Black Sun Sect has just arrived, and he might even be able to turn the tables.”","“Turn the tables?”","The elders present snorted and said, “It’s impossible. In the face of Merciless Zhang, the Black Sun Sect would never have a chance to turn the tables.”","As soon as they finished speaking, Elder Hu seemed to have noticed the situation in the field.","“Hmm?”","He furrowed his brows.","“Get over here!”","Yue Xiaonao stretched out her right hand.","An invisible palm directly grabbed at Elder Hu.","In his perception, he felt an irresistible force dragging him to the ground like catching a chicken and making him prostrate himself with a plop.","Elder Hu was dumbfounded.","He didn’t know why the others could kneel, while he could only lie on his stomach.","“Dahei, flog him!” Yue Xiaonao said loudly.","“I’ll go one by one.”","Dahei held the huge stick. Bang! Bang! Bang!","It didn’t even give those people a chance to beg for mercy.","In front of everyone, just as the Black Sun Sect was about to establish a sect on Mount New Moon today, it was annihilated.","It was dead silence in the field, and even the sound of a needle falling on the ground could be heard.","No one dared to speak.","Ye Feiran and the others were even still nervous.","“Mengmeng, remove the power that is suppressing the formation,” Zhang Han said.","“Okay.”","Mengmeng did as she was told. She controlled the Heavenly Pearl to constantly guide the slightly changed secular rules back to the right track.","The energy of the Heaven-earth Formation of Mount New Moon that had been suppressed for a long time was released.","Buzz!","The Starry Sky Five Elements Formation was in combination with the Five Thunder Yang Treasures.","The energy condensed by the grand formation was stunning.","“What...”","Ye Feiran’s pupils contracted. “What he said is true. Not to mention the Black Sun Sect, even the other sects can’t get close to Mount New Moon with such a grand formation. This is indeed the holy land of the martial arts world! Oh my god. The Black Sun Sect messed with the wrong people.”","The other Holy Sons were on the verge of tears as they silently prayed. “Please spare us.”","It turned out that the more worried they were, the more likely their wishful thinking would fail.","Zhang Han sat on the chair with a calm look and raised his right hand slightly.","Rumble!","The earth quaked and the mountains shook. All the buildings collapsed, the pleasant smell grass on the ground quickly withered, and the ponds disappeared.","But at the next moment, the pleasant smell grass regrew.","All kinds of buildings and streets were revived.","The new castle behind them seemed to have grown bigger than before.","Gates, windows, and so on were quickly formed.","However, electricity was missing. Many street lamps, furniture, cooking utensils, and so on were all missing.","Mengmeng ran to Zhang Han and said, “The punishment for the Black Sun Sect is done.”","“Alright.”","Zhang Han’s eyes swept across the people present.","Wherever his gaze passed, many people got nervous.","“In the past, some people would always say that Mount New Moon was a holy land of martial arts.”","Zhang Han said calmly, “I didn’t care about it at first. It’s just an undeserved reputation. But now, it’s not enough to destroy the Black Sun Sect alone.”","Swoosh!","Ye Feiran and the others’ expressions changed.","...","“From now on, Mount New Moon shall be the holy land of the entire world. Tell every force in the world, including Kunlun Immortal World, all the worldlets, Ancient Mine, and even the King’s Domain, to send their representatives to Hidden Dragon Island to wait. In addition to the branches of Mount New Moon, the other forces will bring half of their sect’s treasures. From now on, Mount New Moon will be the ruler of the planet, and all the sects are required to hand over half of their resources every year. This matter...”","As he spoke, he turned his head, only to find that Zhao Feng and the other men were not there.","He wanted Liang Hao to be in charge of this.","However, Zhang Guangyou said with a smile, “I’ll handle it.”","“All right.”","Zhang Han shook his head and said, “That’s it. Also, if the sects from the ancient martial arts world want to establish their own sects in the secular world, they have to get the consent of Mount New Moon.”","As soon as those words were said, Ye Feiran and the others’ faces darkened.","The other forces were also a little stunned.","Ye Tianlang shook his head. He felt that many forces might not be happy to hand over their resources.","However, what happened next made everyone present silent.","“Let’s go to visit the ancient martial arts world.”","...","Zhang Han got up with Mengmeng and Zi Yan beside him. Dahei ran to the schoolbag quickly, and Little Hei sat next to him.","“I’ll tag along!”","Yue Xiaonao also ran over to them.","Lisa thought for a moment and then followed.","The others, such as Zhang Guangyou and Zi Qiang, stayed.","Clatter!","Under tens of thousands of gazes, Mengmeng casually waved her hand.","A Space Portal appeared in front of everyone.","Zhang Han’s group stepped into it and disappeared.","Gurgle!","Ye Feiran’s eyes almost popped out. She swallowed subconsciously and was extremely nervous.","“What kind of skill is this?”","“My God, where, where did they go?”","“What is that door just now?”","“It’s a door that can shuttle through space. They are gods! They are gods!”","People finally realized the reason why Mount New Moon was called the holy land.","Ye Tianlang and his companions were also stunned.","They were more aware that Mount New Moon had never claimed to be a holy land before. But now, it was the real holy land, the supreme master of the planet. All forces had to lower their heads to Mount New Moon.","Zhang Han and the others left.","Zhang Guangyou was in charge. He said, “You can disperse now and spread the news. I will also send people from the Heavenly Knights Sect to announce that in the secular world, the National Security Agency will assist Mount New Moon to make rules. Especially those from the ancient martial arts world, if they make trouble in the secular world, they will be destroyed.”","Ye Tianlang was excited. He stood up, cupped his hands, and said loudly, “Yes, my Lord!”","The National Security Agency had just been acknowledged. It was obvious that it would be much more convenient for them to carry out their tasks.","The tens of thousands of people around Mount New Moon all dispersed.","They had thought that they would be able to join the Black Sun Sect when they had arrived, but the sect was destroyed.","However, they got to watch a show.","The return of the Lord of Mount New Moon was extremely powerful.","In particular, the news about the overlord of the planet was even more shocking.","After all the irrelevant personnel left, only some of Zhang Han’s acquaintances, such as Ye Tianlang, stayed.","“There are many things on the mountain that need to be rebuilt. Liang Hao, you and your wife will be in charge of this matter,” Zhang Guangyou said.","“Okay, Dad. I’ll call my subordinates later.” Liang Hao nodded.","It was just a small matter. He just needed to contact some of his subordinates.","“I have to buy some livestock, such as cattle and sheep. I remember that it was my brother who bought them himself at the beginning,” Zhang Li muttered.","“We’ll buy them together this time,” Liang Hao said.","The news of the return of the Lord of Mount New Moon and the others soon spread.","The Liang Clan, the Zi Clan, and the Wang Family gathered from all directions and hurried to Mount New Moon.","Lu Xiong and Lu Guo also stayed around.","During this period, Lu Xiong asked where Elder Meng was.","Originally, he didn’t agree with his granddaughter’s relationship with Elder Meng. However, after Elder Meng left, they hadn’t seen each other for a long time, and Lu Guo started cultivating martial arts again. She had made good progress.","At this time, not only did Lu Xiong agree to their relationship, but he also supported them.","On the other side.","Mengmeng and the others appeared in the air above Crystal Island.","As soon as they arrived, they saw Yue Wuwei fiddling with something at the entrance.","“Seal!”","Yue Wuwei cast a spell to flatten the entrance and seal it. The Crystal Island seemed to have turned into a faint mist and dissipated.","Right then, Yue Wuwei saw Zhang Han and the others who had just come over.","“You’re back?” Yue Wuwei was stunned.","“We’re back.” Zhang Han nodded and felt a little strange. “Why did you seal the entrance to the ancient martial arts world?”","“It’s a long story.” Yue Wuwei stroked his beard and looked them up and down. “Let’s talk about what happened to you first. Where have you been teleported to? Some places not far away, I suppose.”","Mengmeng said, “I showed up on the Vast Heaven Star.”","“I was in the Ocean Astral Domain,” Zi Yan said.","Zhang Han said, “I didn’t get sent away.”","Yue Wuwei was instantly stunned.","“What? The Vast Heaven Star? The Ocean Astral Domain? Those places are so far away.” Yue Wuwei was a little shocked. “Why is that? The others have also been teleported away without exception?”","“Yes,” Zhang Han said, “but most of them are in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven. A small number of them are in other places. Now, most of them have gathered.”","“My great-grandfather, Nina, Felina, and some others haven’t been found yet,” Mengmeng replied.","“It’s really strange,” Yue Wuwei said. “Our whole family was in the Ancient Mine. After we came back, all the passages were closed. The pearls under my control didn’t work much. It took us a lot of effort to get to the secular world.”","“Dad, you’ve been too careless. Mount New Moon was occupied by others, but you didn’t handle it. That’s not okay!” Yue Xiaonao’s face was full of disappointment.","“What? Mount New Moon was occupied? Isn’t there a Heaven-earth Formation?” Yue Wuwei frowned slightly.","“The Heaven-earth Formation was suppressed by the rules.” Zhang Han sighed softly. “But it works now.”","“It seems that only when Mengmeng takes action would everything be all right.” Yue Wuwei flew to the front of the crowd and glanced at Yue Xiaonao. “Girl, you’ve gained some weight.”","“That’s not true! I didn’t gain weight!” Yue Xiaonao grinned.","“I didn’t expect that we would suffer a loss this time,” Yue Wuwei said. “When the Crystal Island appeared, I went in. Only then did I find that it was easy to enter but difficult to get out. Inside Crystal Island is a worldlet. The area there is okay, and it’s bigger than the Ancient Mine. I couldn’t get out of it since the passage had not been formed yet. The Crystal Island appeared unexpectedly, but I also found a few big secrets.”","“What secrets?” Zhang Han’s expression slightly changed.","“The Crystal Island is unusual. The strength of the ancient martial arts world is not bad. There is another world inside, just like the Northernmost Sea, where people can accidentally travel to the Domain of Seven Desolations. There is also such a world on Crystal Island. I went there. It wasn’t ordinary. I was bounced back by the space when I saw the one-sided situation. The passage space of Crystal Island has not been formed yet. I spent a lot of effort getting out of it. I sealed Crystal Island, which can speed up the formation of the passage. In a few years, the Crystal Island will reappear.”","While speaking, Yue Wuwei touched his forehead and continued, “It’s a pity I didn’t see Mengmeng come back. Otherwise, I could have let her have a try. Now that Crystal Island has been sealed, I suppose she can’t sense it.”","Mengmeng silently took out the Heavenly Pearl.","She took a few glances at it.","“Open.”","Clatter!","Mists rose.","The Crystal Island appeared again.","Yue Wuwei was stunned.","“I just said that she couldn’t sense it. It turns out to be a slap in my face. She’s so awesome as the Heavenly Lord!”","“There is indeed a problem with the passage here.”","Zhang Han looked at the entrance. The energy was rotating, and the space was extremely unstable.","Mengmeng blinked and pondered for a while. “Should I give it a try? I can sense the entrance, but it seems to be quite troublesome to open it.”","“Forget it. Let’s wait. We’re not in a hurry to go there now.” Yue Wuwei thought for a moment and said, “The energy at the entrance is complicated. If you can’t control it well, it will be counterproductive.”","Hearing this, Zhang Han also nodded and said, “Then let’s put it aside. We’ll go back first.”","“Okay.”","Mengmeng waved her hand, and the Crystal Island slowly dispersed.","“Let’s fly back. Don’t keep using the Space Portal. It consumes too much energy.” Yue Wuwei looked like a loyal butler.","He tried to use the world’s energy as less as possible.","“I think the ancient martial arts world should be connected to some place, like the Domain of Seven Desolations, where the energy bounced me back. I feel an ancient aura, and I think there is also an Ancient Road of Starry Sky.”","As Yue Wuwei spoke, he was also shocked. “The Heavenly Land is not ordinary. It seems that it connects to many places in the Cultivation World.”","“It’s possible,” Zhang Han said.","After chatting for a while, they did not say anything more about this matter.","Zhang Han also mentioned the Land of God’s Meteorite.","In that very high-end place, Mengmeng had obtained millions of top-grade crystal stones on the 99th floor, and there were still many treasures there. The back of the steps of the Land of God’s Meteorite was prepared for Zhang Han. His mind told him that he would have to go through at least the sixth or seventh tier of the Tribulation Realm before he could go there and have a try once more.","The Heavenly Land looked similar to the Saint Warrior Planet, but in fact, it was more advanced.","What kind of place was it exactly?","Zhang Han knew that they were getting closer and closer to the secret of the planet.","They flew back to Mount New Moon.","A lot of people were already on the mountain.","The Zi Clan, the Liang Clan, the Wang Family, and the Rong Clan were all there.","The atmosphere was very lively.","“Zhang Han, you’re finally back.”","“Yan.”","“Liang Hao, where’s your younger sister?”","“...”","The atmosphere of the reunion was extremely harmonious.","But when people talked about the dozen or so people who had died protecting Mount New Moon, the atmosphere became gloomy.","“Bury them at the back of the mountain and hold a funeral. They were heroes.”","Zhang Han made the decision.","That afternoon, everyone cleared out an empty area at the edge of the cliff on one side of the back mountain.","Many nobles of Xiangjiang had arrived.","Several people among the dead had been well-known in the business world.","This was the first time that Mengmeng had attended a funeral.","Looking at their tombstones, Mengmeng knew very well that although she was not very familiar with these people, they had died in the battle to protect Mount New Moon.","For a moment, she got a little sad and emotional.","Mengmeng was 18 years old and had learned a lot of things.","During the entire ceremony, Zhang Han and other important figures of Mount New Moon all stayed there.","When the night fell, the ceremony was over.","Those people’s names would be left on Mount New Moon forever, and their spirits would last.","During the next three days, everyone got busy rebuilding Mount New Moon and making purchases.","The Liang Clan, the Zi Clan, and the Wang Family all moved back to Mount New Moon. The mountain was now much more lively and popular.","In the past few days, the announcement released by Mount New Moon had spread throughout the martial arts world.","In the beginning, some sects were not convinced and didn’t want to go over.","But later, the major sects in the Kunlun Immortal World, the sects in the worldlets, and even the Radiant Sect in the West all did as instructed.","An unprecedented grand gathering was held.","Zhang Han did not show up this day, and Zhang Guangyou took charge of the whole meeting. He had a good time.","All the big shots were active in cooperating and even took the initiative to hand over more than half of their resources in an attempt to suck up to Mount New Moon.","With them as role models, some sects even took the initiative to help manage the order.","Thus, the grand meeting went smoothly.","The herb garden on Mount New Moon became even larger. Not only did the members get back the spiritual herbs that had been taken away before, but they also gained many other rare treasures.","This planet was rich in cultivation resources.","What was even more eye-opening was that the Ancient Mine, the King’s Domain, and the Dark Shadow Clan had also sent their members over on a large scale.","Lord Dong Gu even gave Mount New Moon the resources he had accumulated over the past few years, which made people stunned.","The grand meeting was over.","Everything seemed to have returned to normal.","“Alas, Feifei is not here.”","This day, when they were having breakfast, Zi Yan said, “I wonder if Changqing and the others have gone back yet.”","Zhang Han smiled and said, “Are you worried? “We don’t need to worry. Changqing is very cunning.”","If Chen Changqing heard this, he would definitely burst into tears and say, “Brother Han, stop it.”","At this time, Chen Changqing and Zhou Fei had already met.","They were naturally happy to see each other. They would spend some time together at the Chu Family’s place.","“Hey, are you having breakfast without me?” said Yue Xiaonao before she ran in.","“You’re here to free-load again!” Mengmeng glared at her and said, “Why should we get you to join us? Why did you get up in the morning? Weren’t you going to sleep until noon?”","“Did you forget?” Yue Xiaonao said discontentedly, “We’re going to take the college entrance examination. Aren’t we going to school for a few days?”","“Do we need to go today?” Mengmeng was stunned. “It’s only May 29th. There are still a few days before the college entrance examination. We’ll just go to school and study in the last two days.”","“We don’t have classes in the last two days. I’ve already inquired about it.”","Yue Xiaonao fetched a set of cutlery for herself, sat down, and began to eat happily. “I’m always happy to eat the food Uncle Zhang makes. It’s the best.”","“Haha. But still, you shouldn’t eat too much. Look at your face. It’s bulging,” Zhang Han said, amused.","“I’ve figured it out. It doesn’t matter whether I have a good figure or not. Eating is more important. Anyway, it’s not difficult for me to lose weight.” Yue Xiaonao ate in a relaxed manner.","She didn’t eat little.","“I’ve finished eating.”","After Yue Xiaonao finished breakfast, Mengmeng stood up and said, “Daddy, Mummy, we’re going to school.”","“You need to wear school uniforms, right?” Zi Yan said.","“It doesn’t fit me anymore. It’s too small.”","“Oh, that’s right.” Zi Yan smiled and said, “Mengmeng, you’re 1.7 meters tall. Your previous school uniform must be too small for you now. You’ll just go to school dressed like this. Anyway, there are only a few days left before the exam.”","“My daughter is about to go to college,” Zhang Han said with a smile. “Have you thought of which college to apply to?”","“Not yet,” Mengmeng said with a grin. “I’ll apply to a place far away from home. I don’t want to stay here any longer. Every other student has the same idea. I’ve checked it.”","“You’ll do that?” Zi Yan mocked, “I bet you’ll come home crying without seeing your dad for three days. It’s best if you don’t come back. We’ll go out and hang around on our own.”","“That won’t do!” Mengmeng’s beautiful eyes widened. “I’ll pay attention to you all the time. Don’t even think about going anywhere without me.”","“All right now. Go to school, or you’ll be late.” Zhang Han looked at the time and said, “Shall I drive you there?”","“Wow, Lord Father is actually going to personally send me off. I’m so excited.”","Mengmeng made a face.","In the end, the family of three and Yue Xiaonao got in the panda car that had not been driven for a long time.","When Mengmeng was a little girl, she liked to sit in the back seat and chat with Zi Yan along the way.","From time to time, she would sing.","That scene seemed to have happened yesterday.","But today, Mengmeng had become a big girl and was sitting in the back with Yue Xiaonao","Zhang Han said with a smile as he was driving, “Daughter, sing a song for me.”","“Okay.”","Mengmeng coughed softly and said, “I’ll just sing Mummy’s song. Mummy specially sang this song to me.","“I heard that Snow White is running away, and Little Red Riding Hood is worried about the Big Bad Wolf. I heard that Mad Hatter likes Alice, and the ugly duckling will become a white swan...”","Mengmeng’s singing was always so charming. Zhang Han felt intoxicated while listening to it."]},{"number":1462,"title":"Chapter 1462 The Top Scorer Zhang Yumeng","paragraphs":["Chapter 1462 The Top Scorer Zhang Yumeng","“We’re going to school.”","After arriving at the school, Mengmeng greeted Yue Xiaonao and strolled to the building.","Zi Yan also called Luo Shan at this moment.","After Luo Shan learned that Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao were coming to school, he immediately put down his work and instructed the relative personnel to prepare for the girls’ attendance.","In fact, he didn’t need to give special instructions. The school had been withholding their status as students, and they were not struck off the school roll.","The girls went to the classroom.","The students were all wearing school uniforms, but Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao were both wearing their own clothes, which were very eye-catching.","“Eh? Why are two people here?”","All the students were stunned at first.","“Sister Nao?”","“Mengmeng?”","“Oh my god, you guys are back!”","“Wow! What have you been doing in the past two years? Did you go to another school?”","“...”","After the initial daze, many students were shocked, and a small number of them even greeted Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao and talked to them.","“Hello, everyone.”","Mengmeng waved her hand and walked to the last row of seats on the left with Yue Xiaonao.","There were four vacant seats in the last row, which were for Mengmeng and the other three.","The tables and chairs were not dusty.","However, there was nothing on those tables.","“We went out to do something important,” Yue Xiaonao replied.","“Sister Nao, you’ve become even cuter. You look a bit chubbier,” someone said.","“What are you talking about?” Yue Xiaonao said discontentedly, “I’m not fat. Don’t mention it.”","“Mengmeng is the most beautiful girl in our class. Tut-tut.”","When Mengmeng took off her lovely cap, she was teased by several bold boys.","“You’re getting more and more beautiful. I’m really intoxicated by your look.”","“Too flashy!” Yue Xiaonao commented.","The boys were also naughty and said with a smile, “Sister Nao, you’re still as domineering as ever.”","“Sister Nao, where have you been for the past two years?” a girl asked.","“We went out to have fun,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“What about Felina and Nina?”","“They haven’t come back.”","“What a pity.” Someone said with a look of pity, “At that time, your grades were so good, especially Zhang Yumeng. She hadn’t studied for more than two years. I guess it will be difficult for her to... score high on the college entrance examination.”","The speaker sighed, but she seemed to be inwardly happy.","Mengmeng squinted at her and chuckled. “As long as I’m not dead, you guys would remain inferior to me. I’ll still get to be the top scorer in the college entrance examination this year.”","The girl’s mouth moved. She wanted to refute it, but she couldn’t.","“Wow.”","“So you’ve also studied? In another school?”","“...”","They chatted for ten minutes.","The lead teacher arrived and saw Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao.","“What a rare sight!”","After the teacher joked, her face became serious. “Are you sure you can do a good job on the college entrance exam?”","“Zhang Yumeng just said that she would be the top scorer.”","“Top scorer?” The teacher was stunned for a moment and then said with a smile, “You’ll have to work hard. A few students in our school have nice grades. I heard that a few students from Burry Private School also scored high in the mocks.”","“There will be no problem. Mengmeng will be the top scorer, and I’ll also be on the list!” Yue Xiaonao said.","While they were talking, the vice-principal hurried in.","“Mr. Wu.”","The lead teacher’s face became serious.","“Hi.”","Principal Wu nodded slightly and immediately glanced around the classroom. When he saw Mengmeng, he smiled.","“Mengmeng, you’ve come back.”","When he entered the classroom, the students found that there were two people behind Principal Wu. They were both holding a series of books, practice test papers, and so on,","“These are textbooks from the first year to the third year of high school, as well as all kinds of practice test papers. Feel free to read them,” Principal Wu said, smiling.","...","“Thank you, sir,” Mengmeng said.","After leaving behind the brand new textbooks, Principal Wu said, “If you need anything, contact me at any time.”","“Okay.”","After Principal Wu and the others left, the class also quieted down a little.","To be able to get the principal to personally deliver the textbook, Mengmeng’s identity was obviously extraordinary.","Of course, the lead teacher and some students had known about it when they were in their first year of high school.","During the last few days of class, every teacher would send over some review materials, which were carefully prepared and marked out with key points.","Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao were very quiet in the school.","They quietly read books and enjoyed the last few days of high school.","Since the students were about to go to college, they were in high spirits. Many of them felt that their tough high school life was over.","At noon, they went to the canteen.","...","At the main entrance.","“Oh, Mengmeng! I missed you so much!”","Li Muen quickly rushed over and hugged Mengmeng happily.","“Hey, hey, hey! Be gentle!”","Mengmeng felt a little awkward in her arms.","Since she was a child, she had liked to let her parents hold her. When she grew up, she only often hugged Zi Yan. She would hold Zhang Han’s arm and his hand, and she rarely hugged him.","Mengmeng had been taught by Zhang Han that there should be a prudent reserve between the sexes.","“Why took you so long? It’s been more than two years.” Li Muen was extremely excited.","“Alas, there was an accident. Otherwise, we would have come back long ago,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","“Xiaonao, why are you so fat?” Li Muen greeted Yue Xiaonao and calmed down a lot.","She and Mengmeng had grown up together. She was on good terms with Yue Xiaonao, who joined them later, but they were not as close as she was with Mengmeng.","“Stop it. I’m not fat!” Yue Xiaonao was tired of it. She snorted and said, “I’m just plump. Look at you, and then look at me, humph.”","The atmosphere instantly became tense.","Mengmeng took a look at Li Muen’s boobs, then at hers, and finally at Yue Xiaonao’s.","They were of different sizes.","“Mine seems to be growing a little slowly.” Li Muen blinked and said, “I’ll make up for it later. Let’s go and have lunch first.”","As they spoke, the three of them walked into the canteen. At this moment, the place was already crowded and there weren’t many empty seats left.","“Mengmeng, save the table here. We’re going to buy some food. What would you like to eat?” Li Muen asked.","“I...” Mengmeng thought for a while and said, “I’d like some fries.”","“Okay.”","Li Muen went to buy some food. Yue Xiaonao strolled around and bought a portion of noodles.","They went back to their table and began to eat, chatting while eating.","“Mengmeng, Sister Nao, how long will you stay here this time? The college entrance exam is coming soon,” Li Muen asked.","“We’ll probably stay for a long time. We won’t always go out. If we do, it won’t take too long,” Mengmeng said.","“This is great!”","Li Muen was overjoyed. “That way, we can hang out together. Oh, by the way, why haven’t Felina and Nina come back?”","“They...” Mengmeng sighed softly and said, “They can’t come back for the time being, but I think that they will after a while.”","“I see. They should be busy with something.” Li Muen didn’t understand. She nodded and asked, “Sister Nao, Mengmeng, have you decided which university you want to go to? Shall we go to the same one? My grades are not bad now. I’m sure I can get into the top three local universities, but I don’t want to stay in Xiangjiang.”","“The same goes for me. I’ll no longer stay in Xiangjiang. I’ll go to other cities,” Yue Xiaonao said. “There are so many famous universities, such as Henford University, Benty University, Forden University, and Jandler University.”","“That’s great.” After Li Muen finished speaking, her face froze. “It’s a little difficult for me to get into these universities with my grades. Mengmeng, what can I do to get 700 points?”","“What?”","Mengmeng was stunned for a moment, and then she was lost in thought. Two seconds later, she hesitated and said, “If you want to get 700 points, it seems that you’ll have to leave some questions blank. Otherwise, I don’t know what to do to get the points deducted to 700.”","Clang!","Li Muen’s cutlery fell on the table. She said resentfully, “I shouldn’t have asked you that. It makes me lose my appetite.”","“I’m just telling the truth.” Mengmeng’s big eyes curved as she smiled.","“Why do you ask her? Just ask me,” Yue Xiaonao said reproachfully.","“Are you experienced in this, Sister Nao? That’s right. Your grades were not very good before.” Li Muen finally became a little interested.","“In terms of experience, I have one. I just need to leave a few questions blank to get 700 points,” Yue Xiaonao said.","Li Muen said, “I can’t eat now!”","Both Mengmeng’s and Yue Xiaonao’s ways of getting 700 points were to leave some questions blank, which meant that they thought it was only natural to score higher than 700 points.","What both of them said frustrated Li Muen.","Li Muen took a few glances at the food, silently picked up her cutlery, and began to eat in silence.","At this time, there was a lot of noise around.","The tables around were full, and there were four boys at the next table.","One of the boys, a thin-faced one, said in a bitchy voice, “Today, our teacher even said that students should have some self-control after going to college although they tend to be loose. College students should not only hang out but also study. I think one of the sentences makes sense.”","A little fat boy next to him asked, “Which one?”","“Students tend to be loose after going to college. Tsk tsk.”","“What’s so strange about that?”","“You don’t get it.” Another tall student narrowed his eyes and looked at the thin-faced boy. “Interesting. Some people stay tight both in high school and college.”","“Some become loose in high school.” The thin-faced boy smirked and even raised his eyebrows.","“What are you talking about? It’s quite baffling.” The chubby boy focused on eating.","Hearing their conversation, Li Muen was stunned. The corners of her mouth trembled slightly as she said in a low voice, “It’s dirty.”","...","In the next few days, Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao spent the rest of their time studying.","Soon, the day of the college entrance examination arrived.","It seemed that there were some changes in society.","There were many free buses and taxis, which could take students to and from the examination hall for free.","Even so, many things could be seen on the first day of the college entrance examination at 7:30.","A taxi radio system reported, “Han Duo’s exam admission ticket was left in the car and is being sent to the entrance of the examination hall of the Sixth Middle School...”","Some students forgot to bring their admission tickets or went to the wrong examination room.","Of course, there were also a lot of interesting things.","“Good luck to you all on the exam. It doesn’t matter if you don’t do well. You can work with me at a diner.”","“...”","The college entrance examination was a place to prove one’s hard work. After the students studied hard for so many years, success or failure would be determined in these two days.","Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and Li Muen were all in the examination hall of the First Middle School.","At 7:30 a.m., the gate was crowded with parents.","Zhang Han and Zi Yan were also there.","“Go now.”","Zhang Han waved his hand.","“Okay, wait for my good news,” Mengmeng said casually.","Yue Xiaonao waved at Lisa and Yue Wuwei and said, “Go back now. I’ll be fine.”","Yue Wuwei suddenly raised two fingers and made a gesture to her.","“Huh?”","Yue Xiaonao was stunned for a moment and also raised two fingers. “Is this the meaning of victory?”","“Two cards!”","Yue Wuwei said grumpily, “I mean two cards, not the victory gesture! Have you brought your admission ticket and identification card?”","“I have!” Yue Xiaonao glared at him.","When Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao walked through the school gate, they saw Li Muen waiting aside.","“Here you are.”","Li Muen rubbed her hands and said, “I’m so nervous. I feel that my heart is about to jump out of my chest. My palms are sweaty.”","“Why are you so nervous?” Mengmeng comforted her. “Don’t worry. At worst, you’ll just take the exam next year.”","“Hey, is this how you comfort someone?” Li Muen touched her head.","“Just perform normally. Didn’t you get about 670 points in three mocks?” Yue Xiaonao asked.","“But, but I want to get into Henford University. My scores aren’t good enough to have me admitted to Benty University.” Li Muen felt stressed.","If she didn’t perform well, it would be even more miserable.","“Don’t worry about the exam. Besides, we’re not going to Shang Jing,” Mengmeng said.","“You aren’t?” Li Muen was stunned.","“No.” Mengmeng said, “We don’t have to go to the top universities. We can just go to an interesting one.”","“I see. If you had told me earlier, I would have been relieved.” Li Muen let out a long breath.","She patted her chest and relaxed a lot for a while.","“Then, I’ll just perform as usual. After the exam, I’ll go and check which universities are fun,” Li Muen said.","The three of them were assigned to different exam rooms.","After Mengmeng walked into the examination room, she could see many students sitting upright.","Some of them looked nervous, some relaxed, and some others relaxed to the extreme. These people either had good grades and were very confident in themselves or let themselves go to seed.","Mengmeng sat down. There was a girl in the front seat, who was snotting and sniffing.","Soon, two invigilators came in, one man and one woman.","“First, let me tell you about the dos and don’ts. You’re not allowed to bring any kinds of electronic products that can send or accept information...”","After that, when the bell rang, the male teacher picked up the sealed test paper bag.","“As you can see, it is sealed.”","Then, he shook the bag in front of the representative, opened it, and began to distribute the test papers.","“Papers?”","The female teacher walked over to the girl in front of Mengmeng, picked up a tissue package, and looked at it.","“I’ve caught a cold, Miss.”","The female teacher was silent for a moment and then put the tissue package back.","After more than ten minutes of the exam, the tissues were used up.","The female teacher took out a box of tissues from her bag and placed it next to the girl. Every now and then, she would give her a piece of tissue, which was well-prepared.","This made the girl feel extremely awkward.","However, the teacher’s attention was soon focused on Mengmeng.","“What a beautiful young girl!","“Her handwriting is also very nice.","“Eh? She seems to have a high accuracy rate.","“She’s a great talent.”","While watching Mengmeng answer the questions, the teacher also gave tissues to the girl in the front.","“I’m okay. I’m okay.”","After a while, the girl could not stand it anymore, and her nose was almost red.","...","The two-day college entrance examination was over soon.","Some people were happy, while some people were frustrated.","“We can finally go out and have some fun!”","Li Muen relaxed and said, “Mengmeng, how did you do in the exam?”","“I did okay enough,” Mengmeng said.","“What do you mean by doing okay enough?”","“I think I got about 740,” Mengmeng answered casually.","“Boo-hoo...”","A girl who heard their conversation not far away suddenly burst into tears.","“How about you, Sister Nao?”","“I did a good job this time and scored about 720 points.”","“Boo-hoo.”","A boy finally couldn’t help but burst into tears.","“You even know how many points you got?” Li Muen pondered for a long time and said, “According to your answers, I’m very likely to get more than 680 points.”","The people around them hurriedly left.","“Which university should we apply to?”","“Shall we go out and have fun tonight?”","They had agreed to hang out in the evening.","Everyone went back to their own homes.","They told their parents that they did a good job on the exam.","They dressed up at home and were ready to go.","When the sky turned dark, the three of them began their nightlife.","After hanging around in the bar for a while, they went to the seaside at about nine o’clock and sneaked into other people’s cruises. There were many young masters of the new generation of rich and powerful families in Xiangjiang.","Those people were about the same age as Mengmeng and were very polite.","In the middle of the night, the girls had barbecue by the bay.","They didn’t return to Mount New Moon until later in the night. After playing games for a while, they went to sleep.","After hanging around for a few days, the students would estimate the scores.","When they learned that Mengmeng had scored 740 points, they were all shocked. “She deserves to be a straight-A student.”","“Zhang Yumeng, which university do you want to apply to?”","The lead teacher smiled sweetly and said, “If you have any questions about applying to the university, you can contact me at any time.”","She felt delighted to have the top scorer in her class.","The lead teacher was in a good mood.","“I haven’t decided yet. We’ll discuss it in the evening.”","That night, Yue Xiaonao, Mengmeng, and Li Muen were having coffee together. They had just finished shopping.","“Which university should we apply to?” Yue Xiaonao said, “I’ve checked it out recently. Our scores are good enough for us to pick whichever university we like. You guys make the decision.”","“Mengmeng, you make the decision,” Li Muen said.","Mengmeng hesitated. She said, “I don’t know which one to choose. Forget it. I’ll draw lots.”","“Draw lots?” Li Muen was stunned. “Can we decide which university to go to by drawing lots?”","“That’s a good idea.”","Yue Xiaonao’s interest was suddenly piqued. “Well, Muen, you’ll draw. How many options should we make? Fifty universities?”","“Okay.”","“Excuse me, can I have a pen and several pieces of paper?”","Yue Xiaonao checked with her mobile phone and wrote down 50 universities. She put the scraps of paper in front of Li Muen and fiddled with them.","“Pick one.”","Yue Xiaonao and Mengmeng were staring at her.","“I’m under so much pressure!”","Li Muen swallowed a bit and asked, “Are you sure I’ll get to choose?”","“Of course. Hurry up,” Yue Xiaonao urged her.","Finally, Li Muen slowly stretched out her right hand, picked up a scrap from the lower left side, and opened it.","“It’s Westpam University.”","“Well, okay. This one will do.” Mengmeng nodded and said, “I’ve seldom visited that city.”","“I will definitely get admitted to this.” Li Muen was completely relaxed.","Westpam University was located in West Province and had a long history of cultural development.","Mengmeng and the other two decided which university to go to in this way.","They could do this because their parents didn’t discipline them much.","Yue Wuwei, Lisa, Zhang Han, and Zi Yan allow their daughters to make their own decisions on which university to go to.","As for Li Muen, her mother had a lot of ideas and her father also supported her. But her mother opposed it at first when she said that she would go to the same college as Mengmeng.","In the end, Li Kai denied what his wife had said.","He simply said, “She can do whatever she likes.”","Li Kai had always supported Li Muen to hang out with Mengmeng.","However, Li Kai didn’t want his daughter to be a martial artist at first. “Why would a girl practice martial arts?”","Now, he had no objections.","Time passed very quickly.","When the results of the exam came out, the top scorer, Zhang Yumeng, was well-known all over the country and countless students looked up to her.","Many universities took the initiative to contact her and began to compete for her.","Unfortunately, they could not get in touch with her at all.","Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and Li Muen successfully got admitted to Westpam University.","They were about to start their college life."]},{"number":1463,"title":"Chapter 1463 Enrollment at the University","paragraphs":["Chapter 1463 Enrollment at the University","“School starts on September 1st, and students can enter the school from the 29th to the 31st.”","Mengmeng took the admission letter to Zhang Han and Zi Yan and said, “I’ll be in Class 431 of the Department of Finance of Westpam University.”","“You’ve got the admission letter?” Zi Yan stood up with a smile and said, “Show it to me.”","“Check it out.” Mengmeng handed the letter to Zi Yan.","“The letter is very unique.” As soon as Zi Yan checked it, Zhang Han came over and said, “Let me have a look. It’s our daughter’s admission letter. She’s about to go to college, hahaha.”","Zhang Han couldn’t help laughing as he read the letter.","In Zhang Han’s eyes, Mengmeng’s admission letter to the university was extraordinary.","“When are you going to go there?” Zhang Han asked with a smile.","“We’ve already decided to go there on the 29th. We’ll stay in the West Capital for two days before going to campus,” Mengmeng replied.","“We will give you a ride,” Zhang Han said. He also recalled the days when he was in college. He shook his head and said, “I didn’t understand before why those who went to college had to be sent by their parents. All parents would be worried and reluctant with their kids. This time, we will also send you off.”","“Uh, okay.”","Mengmeng blinked and nodded her head in agreement.","She, Yue Xiaonao, and Li Muen had already decided to leave together, so they didn’t need their parents to send them off.","In the end, only her parents would send her off.","Of course, Mengmeng was very happy to do that.","“We can hang out together for two days. Hee-hee, by the way, Li Muen has booked a flight for us.” Mengmeng suddenly remembered that.","“Don’t we have our own planes?” Zhang Han asked in confusion.","“It’s boring to take a private plane all the time,” Mengmeng said. “Anyway, I’m going to college. I’ll just go to school normally.”","“You’re right.” Zhang Han smiled and said, “I’ll ask someone to help buy two flight tickets later. Oh, by the way, didn’t you lose your bank card last time? Have you applied for a new one yet?”","“I have,” Mengmeng replied.","“How much money do you have in your bank card now?” Zhang Han asked casually.","“I don’t know.” Mengmeng recalled the prompt of the mobile phone message and said, “I guess I still have much left. I don’t spend much money.”","She didn’t pay much attention to the specific number. She only knew that it was a lot.","Zhang Han took out his mobile phone and said, “Dongheng? Ask someone to check my daughter’s flight to the West Capital and buy two tickets for me and Zi Yan...”","He gave the other party some instructions.","Not long after, Mengmeng’s newly bought mobile phone received another message notification.","She clicked to open it and had a look.","A series of money was transferred into her account.","“Father, did you just give me pocket money again?” Mengmeng said with a grin.","“Of course, as a little girl, you should be equipped with a lot of money when you’re studying in another city,” Zhang Han said with a smile.","“You just know how to spoil her.” Zi Yan smiled and rolled her eyes.","“We only have this precious daughter...”","Mengmeng was still listening with a smile, but Zhang Han suddenly changed the subject.","“Why don’t we have a second child? If we do, we won’t have to spoil Mengmeng.”","Zi Yan knew that Zhang Han was joking, so she narrowed her eyes slightly and said, “That’s a good idea. If we have another child, it’d better be a little boy.”","“That won’t do. I’m too old to be an elder sister for a little boy.” After being stunned for a moment, Mengmeng immediately said, “Don’t do it. I don’t want a younger brother or sister now. Besides, aren’t you pleased to have me?”","Zhang Han laughed and said, “We are.”","“Humph!”","Mengmeng snorted, took her admission letter, and ran out happily.","The little girl didn’t know that Zi Yan could only give birth to one child, which made her the only child of the family.","...","There was a total of one month’s holiday.","On the second day, Mengmeng was lying on the bed playing online games.","“Mengmeng, get up. We’re going out for a while.” Zi Yan knocked on the door and entered.","“I haven’t rested enough yet. Where are you going?” Mengmeng asked.","“The Heavenly Dragon Star Province.”","“Huh?” Mengmeng was stunned. “You’re going to the Cultivation World again so soon?”","“We’re going to get some business done. Your dad has prepared the Chaotic Stone Tablet. We’ll go to the Rain-falling Star and put the stone tablet in. Then, we’ll come back,” Zi Yan asked. “Are you going or not?”","“If I’m not going, who’s going to take you out?” Mengmeng immediately got out of bed and began to wash and dress.","“Elder Yue will go with us.” Zi Yan smiled and said, “If you don’t want to go, you can stay at home and look after the house.”","“No. I am going.”","Mengmeng simply packed up and was ready to go.","After about half an hour, Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei came over from the outside.","Yue Xiaonao and Mengmeng were also waiting here.","...","They were the only ones who were going out.","Dahei and Little Hei stayed on Mount New Moon.","The spaceship left the secular world. After more than ten days, it arrived at the Rain-falling Star.","Nowadays, seas were surging, and mountains were whistling in the Rain-falling Star. They could feel the strong wind and waves with their soul senses. They could only see dense dark clouds, lightning, and thunder with the naked eye.","“What’s the use of the Chaotic Stone Tablet?” Yue Wuwei’s face was full of curiosity.","“Haven’t you seen this kind of Profound-grade treasure before?” Zhang Han asked.","“Brat, are you still pretending? Don’t play dumb with me,” Yue Wuwei said grumpily. “I’ve heard that you used to be in the Cultivation World, and you were even at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier. I’ve been fooled by you. Tell me quickly.”","At the thought of this, Yue Wuwei felt rather bitter.","He did not expect Zhang Han to be a hidden big shot.","In the past, Zhang Han had actually reached the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier. But now, he was acting like a green hand to him.","Yue Wuwei recalled the competition he had with Zhang Han over the years.","...","It was as if he was showing off in front of a master.","It was no wonder that Zhang Han knew so many skills.","After all, he was at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier.","Everything seemed to make sense now, but Yue Wuwei felt quite depressed.","“Chaotic Stone Tablet.”","Zhang Han shook his head with a smile and said, “It’s a kind of special Profound-grade treasure. If you want to feel something in the stone tablet, your cultivation needs to reach at least the Tribulation Stage Seventh Tier. The Chaotic Stone Tablet, which can also be called the Chaotic Time Tablet, can accelerate the development of time. When you comprehend it, it can speed up your understanding of occult arts, supernatural powers, and so on. In short, it has a lot of uses. It is a valuable treasure among Profound-grade treasures, surpassing the ninth-tier spirit treasures.”","Yue Wuwei knew that not every kind of Profound-grade treasure was more powerful than a ninth-tier spirit treasure. Profound-grade treasures belonged to a type of spirit treasures that had functions above the seventh-tier ones. They could also surpass the ninth-tier ones.","“Does this mean that the Chaotic Stone Tablet can accelerate the change of the Rain-falling Star?” Yue Wuwei asked.","“That’s right. In the past, it might take a hundred years for the Rain-falling Star to transform. But now, it will only take a few years since we have the Chaotic Stone Tablet.”","After saying that, Zhang Han walked to the cabin door.","Yue Wuwei, Lisa, Zi Yan, Mengmeng, and Yue Xiaonao all followed behind.","When they arrived in the void of the universe, Zhang Han began to cast his supernatural powers. Various kinds of treasures came out in an endless stream, outlining bright threads. The Chaotic Stone Tablet slowly fell from the center of the treasures and sank to the surface of the planet.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","For a moment, the wind and clouds changed. The sky on the Rain-falling Star suddenly became clear. There was no wind or waves. Everything seemed to have stopped.","However, in the next moment, a change suddenly occurred.","Regardless of whether it was lightning or wind, they were actually dozens of times faster.","The extremely intense lightning and thunder made the planet look like a night-luminescent pearl in the universe, shining forever.","“That should do the work.”","The entire process was relatively simple.","“Aren’t you afraid of losing the stone tablet?” Yue Wuwei couldn’t help but ask.","“I’ve used it up.”","Zhang Han’s words made Yue Wuwei’s mouth tremble.","“A Profound-grade Treasure is gone just like that?","“He is quite generous.”","If it were Yue Wuwei, he might not be willing to use it. It would just take a hundred years. He could just wait.","Zhang Han, however, didn’t care about treasures.","He had once attached great importance to the treasures like the Chaotic Stone Tablet, but those treasures didn’t help him pass the divine thunder over the sky. They were either scattered elsewhere or became other people’s treasures.","These things meant nothing to him.","The group set off on their return journey.","They passed by the Dragon Base Star and took a few hours off.","The current situation of the Heavenly Group was completely fine. Moreover, the Blue Sand Wind Domain had also gradually disappeared. The Sea Dragon Star Area had imperceptibly become much closer to the Heavenly Dragon Star Province.","The group got back to the secular world.","It took them 26 days to go back and forth.","They spent only a few hours in total on the Rain-falling Star, and the rest of the time was spent traveling.","This was a miniature image of the Cultivation World. It would take a very long time to travel from one place to another.","But of course, cultivators didn’t lack time.","“It’s the 27th.”","When they returned to Mount New Moon, Mengmeng lay on her big bed and said, “It’s so comfortable. Lying down is better.”","A moment later, Zi Yan came. She sat by the bed and was looking at her mobile phone.","“By the way, Mengmeng, a lot of your classmates are holding a graduation party. Do you want to hold one?”","“Your Majesty, I enjoy being lazy and greedy now. I don’t want to move at all and don’t like trouble. Hey, I feel like having some fruit while lying down,” Mengmeng said lazily.","Zi Yan said grumpily, “Wicked girl.”","She turned around and walked out. She took out some fruit, two glasses of juice, and a few bags of snacks.","Mengmeng said with a grin, “Thank you, Mummy.”","Lying on the bed, she ate snacks on the small table and looked at the tablet with great interest.","She stayed at home for two days and did not go anywhere.","On the 29th, Zhang Han, Zi Yan, Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and Li Muen headed for Xiangjiang International Airport.","The plane would take off at 10:10 a.m.","In just three hours, they arrived at the West Capital Airport.","As one of the best tourist attractions and one of the best cities in the world, West Capital was the provincial capital of West Province.","“Mengmeng, you didn’t even bring your luggage.”","Li Muen looked at the several people carrying light bags and felt a little envious, but she didn’t understand. Even if they were just hanging out for a few days, they should have some daily necessities with them, shouldn’t they?","Yue Xiaonao casually replied, “We’ll just buy the stuff we need.”","“You’re going to study in this city.” Zhang Han chuckled and said, “What should we do now? Shall we go to college first and help you settle down in your dormitory? Or do you feel like touring around the city first?”","“We’ll take the airport bus and go to the university first,” Mengmeng said.","“Okay.”","This time, it was Zhang Han who ran errands and went to buy tickets. They got on the airport bus. About an hour later, they took a different bus and finally arrived at the gate of Westpam University.","The gate looked quite magnificent. Many freshmen and parents could be seen coming and going, and many private cars were coming over.","There were sophomore volunteers on campus to receive freshmen.","Many people were staring at them, especially the sophomores, who were staring at the beautiful junior girls.","When those guys were freshmen, they had no experience and wanted to pick up girls. As a result, in less than a month, they found that many beautiful girls had been pursued by sophomores.","Now that they had become sophomores, they were naturally happy to let their juniors experience the same feeling.","These people would also observe.","Occasionally, they would see parents who sent their children to school, driving luxury cars like the Audi A8L, Land Rover Evoque, Mercedes Benz, Bentleys, and Rolls-Royces, which would attract a lot of attention.","This meant that these freshmen were all from rich families.","However, only a very small number of the freshmen got to have luxury cars as their rides.","The sophomores were more interested in the beautiful juniors.","“Holy shit. Look at those girls.”","After Zhang Han and the others walked into the campus, many sophomore students who received freshmen were suddenly amazed."]},{"number":1464,"title":"Chapter 1464 A Small Matter","paragraphs":["Chapter 1464 A Small Matter","Everyone enjoyed looking at good-looking people.","The beautiful juniors would always attract more glances.","A slightly chubby sophomore came over and asked, “Which department are you guys in?”","Mengmeng said, “I’m in Class 431 the Department of Finance.”","Yue Xiaonao said, “I’m the same.”","Li Muen replied, “I’m in Class 430.”","As a matter of fact, she had a little complaint about why Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao were assigned to the same class and she was assigned to another.","“What a coincidence. I’m also from the Department of Finance, but I’m a sophomore now,” the chubby boy said with a smile, “and this is our department’s reception area.”","After saying that, he turned around and looked at the people behind him. He waved to a tall man with long hair and said, “Little Six, let’s go together and take them to the teaching building.”","“Uh, okay.” The man called Little Six seemed to be a little listless. After hearing the words, he got up and walked over. He was just absent-minded when he saw Mengmeng and the others, so he couldn’t help but be stunned.","“What a beautiful junior!”","On the way to the teaching building.","“Are they your siblings?” The chubby man looked at Zhang Han and Zi Yan.","Although Zi Yan was wearing sunglasses, her gorgeous appearance could not be hidden.","In particular, the faint aura she emitted made him a little bit nervous.","“Well, they are my elder brother and elder sister.” Mengmeng joked.","“Hahaha.” Zhang Han laughed.","Zi Yan couldn’t help but laugh as well.","They were just so young.","“I’m just kidding,” Mengmeng added, “they are my parents.”","Poof!","The chubby sophomore opened his eyes wide and choked on his saliva.","The handsome young man beside him was also stunned.","“Well, Sir and Madam, you are really young.”","The chubby sophomore looked a little embarrassed. He smiled and said, “Well, my name is Ding Bing, and I’m the representative of Class 399, Grade Two. I’m also the deputy director of the Student Union’s Art Department. You can come to me if you need anything in the future. I wonder if you have any special skills, such as singing and dancing.”","“Boss, you’re doing this again. Your question is too abrupt.” The boy called Little Six said, “I’m sorry. He has been in the Art Department for a long time. You guys look pretty. When he saw you, he couldn’t help but ask that.”","“Ahem, ahem.” Ding Bing scratched his head.","“Mengmeng is an all-rounder. She sings very well and her dance is no weaker than that of professional dancers,” Li Muen snorted and said.","“That’s so awesome.” Ding Binf looked at them and said, “Well... which one of you is Mengmeng?”","“This is Zhang Yumeng. She’s amazing. This is Yue Xiaonao. I’m Li Muen.” Li Muen introduced them.","“Are you guys from the same place?” Ding Bing asked.","“Yes, we’re all from Xiangjiang,” Li Muen replied.","“Is this your first time coming to West Capital, Sir and Madam?” Ding Bing asked a few questions and began to chat with the parents.","He had just received a few people. Usually, it was the parents who took the initiative to tell him about their situation, but things seemed to be different when it came to Zhang Han and Zi Yan.","“Sort of.” Zhang Han nodded.","“There are also many fun places in the West Capital.” Ding Bing said, “While visiting some tourist attractions, you should be careful. It’s easy to be tricked, such as that...”","Ding Bing began to chat with Zhang Han and Zi Yan.","He told them about some fun places and nice restaurants. Zi Yan also communicated with him and silently remembered several recommended specialty restaurants.","Ding Bing was a sophomore and the deputy director of the Art Department. He was also skilled at communicating and was eloquent.","On the other hand, Little Six was a little dull and only occasionally said a few words.","When the girls walked into the university, the atmosphere of the campus came to them.","There were also a lot of foreign students here. During the enrollment season of the freshmen, the senior students had already returned to school early to enjoy leisure in the last few days of the holiday.","When the group was about to reach the teaching building, three girls came out of it.","The leading one was about 1.65 meters tall. She had a well-proportioned figure and looked a little cute.","After seeing the people in front of her, she looked Mengmeng and the others up and down carefully and said with a faint smile, “Vice Director Ding? You’re receiving junior girls again. You’re really dutiful.”","“Ahem!”","Ding Bing coughed and said, “Well, Little Six, take the guys upstairs to go through the admission procedures first. I have something to do here, and I’ll be with you soon.”","After saying goodbye, he quickly chased after the girls.","In addition to Li Muen, Zhang Han, Mengmeng, Zi Yan, and the others could all hear Ding Bing whispering.","“Sweetie, don’t be angry. I’m doing this for Little Six’s sake. He has just broken up, and you know what kind of person his girlfriend is. My roommates and I all receiving new students. If we see a suitable one, we’ll introduce her to Little Six right away. We can’t let him get back together with his girlfriend...”","It turned out that the girl was Ding Bing’s girlfriend. Although he was a little fat and was not very good-looking, he was good at talking and got a pretty girlfriend.","Many girls didn’t care about their boyfriends’ looks.","But it was now unknown why that pretty girl got together with Ding Bing.","Mengmeng cast a glance at Little Six.","...","The man was rather dull. He wanted to say something, but he didn’t know what to say, so he silently led the way.","“I can tell your fortune. Did you break up with someone?”","Mengmeng pretended to be a fortune teller and made a gesture.","“What?”","Little Six was startled and a little embarrassed. “No, I don’t think so.”","He didn’t even believe that.","“How did you know?” Little Six asked curiously.","“It’s all written on your face,” Mengmeng said casually.","Zhang Han coughed softly and said, “In fact, the university is not a good place for relationships...”","During their walk from the first floor to the third floor, Zhang Han said six reasons and hadn’t finished. But when they arrived at the place, he no longer mentioned it.","Li Muen was a little confused.","...","What Zhang Han said made her feel that dating in college seemed to be a crime.","Little Six also had a feeling that he was wrong.","After the girls paid their tuition fees, they bought bedding and other daily necessities.","Originally, Zi Yan wanted to take Mengmeng to buy some high-quality bedding and other things.","Mengmeng said that she would not attract attention by being eccentric and she should behave like everyone else in school.","Zhang Han agreed with her decision.","Now, they could occasionally experience an ordinary life.","Little Six said, “I’ll take you to your dormitory.”","“Okay, thank you.”","Zi Yan thanked him. When they went downstairs, they saw Ding Bing smoking next to the trash can not far from the door.","At this time, he was with the cute girl. They were chatting.","“You’ve already collected your things?”","Looking at Mengmeng and the other two, who were all holding bags of various sizes, he said, “Hey, Little Six, why aren’t you helping them with their stuff?”","“They don’t need it,” Little Six said.","Ding Bing glared at him, indicating that he should know things better even if the girls told him they didn’t need his help.","“Come on, I’ll help you carry some. It’s not close to the girls’ dormitory.”","Ding Bing took the initiative to help.","“Thank you so much.”","Yue Xiaonao and Mengmeng exchanged a look.","Both of them handed their bags to Ding Bing.","Seeing this, Li Muen also handed her stuff to him.","The girls were on the same team.","Ding Bing’s girlfriend was a little unhappy when she saw this.","But thinking about it, for Little Six’s sake, she decided to take it down.","In the end, Ding Bing and Little Six took the girls’ luggage and walked to the dormitory.","“Nice to meet you. My name is Zhou Huihui. I’m a sophomore majoring in finance.”","On the way to the dormitory, Ding Bing was in charge of striking up conversations.","Zhou Huihui looked at the girls from the side.","She also secretly praised the beauty of these junior girls.","Mengmeng made her a little jealous. She felt that Li Muen and Yue Xiaonao were about the same as her, which made her glad.","“The two people at the back are her parents? They’re handsome and beautiful. I can tell at a glance that this girl is not ordinary. People like Little Six are way out of her league.”","She directly voted down Little Six’s chances to be with Mengmeng.","She thought Yue Xiaonao was nice, and so was Li Muen.","It was just that these girls might already be seeing someone.","As Zhou Huihui thought about it, she couldn’t help but scold herself. “I should mind my own business.”","“We are all in the sixth building of the girls’ dormitory. Your rooms are on the third floor, and my Room 503 is on the fifth floor. If you need anything in the future, you can go up and come to me,” Zhou Huihui said very enthusiastically.","The dormitory building looked neat and tidy, and the rooms were not big.","In the four-person rooms, there were desks below the beds above.","Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao were the first ones to come to their room.","“Shall we take the beds by the window?”","Yue Xiaonao took her luggage from Ding Bing and threw it on the bed on the right side of the window. “We’ll clean up the place after we take a tour.”","“All right. We’ll keep the luggage here first.” Zhang Han put her luggage on the above.","“You’re going to have military training in a few days. It’s very hot in West Capital, so you need to buy sunscreen,” said Zhou Huihui. “The sun will be scorching during the military training every year.”","“Okay. Thank you for your help,” Zi Yan said to the guys.","Soon, Li Muen and Little Six also came over. They put down the luggage on a bed.","“Why don’t we exchange contact numbers?” Ding Bing said. He glanced at Zhou Huihui and didn’t dare to add the girls on his own. Otherwise, she would be jealous. He said righteously, “Little Six, hurry up and add our juniors on WhatsApp. If they need any help in the future, you can help out.”","Zhou Huihui then smiled slightly.","“Hmph, that’s a suitable move.”","“Uh, okay.”","Little Six took his mobile phone and went over.","He successfully added the three pretty girls on WhatsApp.","“My name is Wu Xiao’an.”","After that, the sophomores said goodbye and left.","On the way out.","“Little Six, do you take a fancy to any one of them?” Zhou Huihui asked with a gossipy face.","“Yeah. Do you like any one of them? These juniors are...”","Ding Bing almost blurted out, “-so beautiful, especially Zhang Yumeng.”","But he quickly changed his mind and said, “-quite suitable for you. The key is which one you have a good impression of, and then you can get to know each other first and start with being friends.”","“I... I haven’t broken up yet,” said Wu Xiao’an helplessly.","“You haven’t?” Zhou Huihui was unhappy. “Your girlfriend kissed a handsome guy from the University of Science and Technology on the street. They must have slept with each other. Will you only break up after you have more proof that she’s been cheating on you?”","“Huihui, you don’t have to say that,” said Ding Bing.","“I’m just telling the truth.” Zhou Huihui made a face.","“What if you’re mistaken?” Wu Xiao’an defended his girlfriend.","“Do you think that’s possible?” Ding Bing frowned. “Or do you think we would lie to you?”","“That’s not what I meant,” said Wu Xiao’an annoyedly. “Forget it, let’s not talk about this. I’ve asked her out today anyway and we’re going to talk about it later.”","“I’ll go with you,” said Ding Bing. “You’ll be bullied if you go alone.”","“Okay, Boss. Lend me some money first. I’ll pay you back next week.” Wu Xiao’an was a little embarrassed to say it but Zhou Huihui was present so he did.","“Hey, it’s just the beginning of school, bro.” Ding Bing was stunned, and his eyes widened.","“I didn’t bring enough money. We’ll meet at the Ancient Island Restaurant tonight. She just got back today,” said Wu Xiao’an.","“How much did you spend? You...” Ding Bing was a little angry but Zhou Huihui was next to him and he did not continue.","“How much do you need?”","“...”","Zhang Han and the others sat in the dormitory for a while.","The group of people went out. Walking on the campus, they could feel the youthfulness.","“I wonder if I can move into your dormitory,” Li Muen said.","“We’re not in the same class,” Yue Xiaonao said. “You can ask about that when the semester starts.”","“Okay. I’ll ask the relevant personnel when the time comes.” Li Muen nodded.","“Uncle Zhang, where are we going? It’s already in the afternoon,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“Let’s go shopping first and buy some daily necessities. Then, we’ll find a hotel to stay in. We’ll tour around tomorrow and the day after tomorrow,” Zi Yan said.","They did those things in the following days.","In the afternoon, they went shopping in the bustling area not far from the school and bought some clothes, toiletries, and so on.","“Where are we going to have dinner?”","Zi Yan said, “Ding Bing mentioned a restaurant called Ancient Island Restaurant. It’s said that its food tastes good. Shall we have a try? It’s near the hotel.”","“Okay.”","Zhang Han had booked two presidential suites in the hotel.","The family of three shared a suit, and Yue Xiaonao and Li Muen shared another suit.","After a short rest, they went out and walked to the Ancient Island Hotel in 20 minutes.","The restaurant had a good environment and a relatively elegant style. All kinds of thoughtful service and high-quality meals were one of the reasons why the price was relatively high.","According to Ding Bing’s recommendation, they had a meal together. Unexpectedly, not only did they have a meal, but they also got to watch a show.","“Aren’t those guys Ding Bing and Wu Xiao’an?”","Yue Xiaonao suddenly looked at the entrance and saw that the two of them were walking to a table not far from the side.","A man and a woman were sitting there waiting, and the man was greeting them politely.","“Nice to meet you. I’m Xiaoyin’s cousin,” the man said.","“Huh?” Wu Xiao’an was stunned.","“What are you waiting for? Why don’t you say hello?” Xiaoyin urged. Her makeup was heavy.","“Nice to meet you.” Wu Xiao’an greeted him immediately and glanced at Ding Bing.","Without saying a word, Ding Bing nodded and sat down.","After ordering and drinking two glasses of wine, Ding Bing asked, “Are you studying at the University of Science and Technology opposite Westpam University?”","“Yes, I’m a senior now.”","“May I know how you’re related to Xiaoyin?”","“He’s my aunt’s son,” Xiaoyin took the initiative to answer.","Seeing that the two of them were sitting together, Ding Bing had a weird feeling.","“Could it be that we were really mistaken?","“But she did kiss him.”","Wu Xiao’an’s face lit up and he relaxed completely.","They finished the meal.","On the way back to school, Wu Xiao’an wanted to send Xiaoyin back to her dormitory, but Xiaoyin wanted to send her cousin back and had something to discuss with him.","“Let’s go together,” said Ding Min. “I happen to want to pay a visit to that university.”","The two of them followed Xiaoyin and the man from a distance. When they reached the dormitory area, they could not find them.","More than ten minutes later, Wu Xiao’an received a message, “I don’t want to see Ding Bing. I’ll go back.”","“What did she say?” Ding Bing asked.","“Nothing much.” Wu Xiao’an was too embarrassed to say it.","It was Xiaoyin’s cousin who paid for the meal.","“Let’s go back first. She’ll be back in the dorm in a bit. Don’t worry about her.” Wu Xiao’an pulled Ding Bing back to their dorm.","“It’s a little strange.” Ding Bing didn’t understand what Xiaoyin meant.","Unexpectedly...","At about eight o’clock in the evening, Mengmeng and the others returned to the hotel.","“Hey? Those two people...”","Yue Xiaonao pointed at the reception desk.","Xiaoyin was holding onto that man’s arm.","“This cousin of hers is so unique.”","With a smirk on her face, Yue Xiaonao took out her phone.","Clack!","She took a picture, found Wu Xiao’an’s number, and sent it.","“Damn it!”","Clang!","The sound of Wu Xiao’an smashing his phone rang out from the dormitory.","...","The next day, Zhang Han and the others enjoyed the scenery of the West Capital and had fun at two tourist attractions.","During the beginning-of-Term season, there were a lot of families touring around, and everywhere was crowded with people.","On August 31st, the third day since their arrival.","At 3 p.m. at the entrance of the university.","“Daddy, Mummy, we’ll go back and clean up the dormitory.”","Mengmeng stood at the gate of the university without moving.","Zhang Han and Zi Yan stood together and looked at Mengmeng.","They were about to part.","Zi Yan’s eyes behind her sunglasses were a little red.","“Go now.”","Zhang Han’s smile seemed to be mixed with a trace of bitterness.","Zhang Han touched Mengmeng’s head and said, “We’ll go back in the evening. Take care of yourself in college. If you miss home, you can go back. It’s not far anyway.”","“Got it.”","Mengmeng slowly moved her feet and looked back after taking a few steps.","“Be careful when you go back.”","She knew that there would be no danger, but she still couldn’t help but say that.","“Bye.”","Zhang Han waved his hand.","Mengmeng did not go any further. Instead, she ran back and hugged Zhang Han and Zi Yan.","“I’ll be back in two days.” Mengmeng was a little sad.","“Alright. Hurry up and go.”","Zi Yan wiped the corners of her eyes and said with a smile, “I’m very happy that you’ve grown up. Wherever you want to go from here, you’ll arrive in a minute. Enjoy your college life and don’t bully your classmates.”","“I won’t bully others.” Mengmeng pouted.","Mengmeng had the Space Portal, so she could go wherever she wanted.","Zi Yan’s sadness and Zhang Han’s bitterness were somehow related to the separation. This was a process of Mengmeng’s growth.","Ordinary people would probably feel worse with parting.","“Then, I’m really going.”","Mengmeng was reluctant to part with her parents.","“Alas, let’s go. I’m speechless.” Yue Xiaonao covered her forehead with her hand.","She complained inwardly. “This family is too clingy. It’s really awkward.”","However, when she turned her head, she saw that many parents were in an even more intense mood.","“I’ll go to the dormitory.”","Mengmeng looked back repeatedly with every step she took until she could not see her parents’ figures.","Zhang Han held Zi Yan’s hand and said, “Let’s go and stroll around.”","“I don’t feel like it,” Zi Yan said, “and we don’t need to buy anything. I’m not in the mood for shopping.”","“There is a community not far away. Its villa area is quite close to the university. Let’s go and have a look. We can buy a villa and a few cars. The girls can use it if they get bored at school or want to party,” Zhang Han said.","“All right. Let’s go then.”","They walked to the sales office.","“Welcome. Our Academy Garden is a high-end residential area... These are the residential buildings on sale.”","“We’ll take this one.” Zhang Han took a glance at the buildings and one with a nice location.","“This villa can be regarded as the best one among the rest. It’s a sample house.”","“This one it is.”","Zhang Han decided quickly. “Call your manager here.”","When the manager arrived, they went to the villa and took a tour.","Zi Yan said, “It is nice. It’s just that we need to replace the furniture. Shall we leave tomorrow? Shall we get this place done first?”","“Well, okay.”","In the afternoon of the next day, the staff of the Academy Garden gave Zhang Han the key.","After Mengmeng learned about this, she immediately called Zhang Han.","“Father, you’re so thoughtful!”","“...”"]},{"number":1465,"title":"Chapter 1465 Roommates","paragraphs":["Chapter 1465 Roommates","The reason why Zhang Han had prepared these things for Mengmeng was that it would be more convenient for her to do what she wanted.","As for whether the stuff could come in handy or not, Zhang Han felt that it wouldn’t at the beginning.","Zhang Han and Zi Yan directly flew back to Mount New Moon.","Mengmeng was no longer in the castle, which made the two feel quite bored.","“Alas!”","Zi Yan sighed softly.","“This should be the 19th time you’ve sighed today.” Zhang Han held Zi Yan in his arms and said, “Didn’t you always say that we should spend some time alone?”","“I said that to Mengmeng on purpose.” Zi Yan rolled her eyes and said, “We’re already an old couple. There’s no need for us to spend some time alone.”","“That’s not right. I think we are passionately in love every day.” Zhang Han said with a smile, “Shall we go on a honeymoon together?”","“Okay.” Zi Yan thought for a moment and began to get interested. “There are many places I haven’t been to. Let’s travel around.”","“An impromptu trip?”","“Sure.”","“...”","After taking a walk around Mount New Moon, the two of them left and began to travel around.","On Mengmeng’s side.","On August 31st.","“I’ll go back to the dormitory first. I have nothing to do today. I’ll ask my counselor tomorrow morning,” Li Muen said.","“Okay.”","Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao went back to their dormitory.","The fan was turned on, and there were a few people in the room.","A girl was wearing sling pajamas and sitting lazily on a chair. Opposite her was a pair of parents. Their clothes were simple, but they were dressed very cleanly. The man’s face was a little tanned, like a farmer who worked in the sun and wind. The woman was packing up some luggage beside him. She even took out some homemade pickles which she stored in cans.","A girl who was tidying up the bedding on the upper bunk was wearing a new sports suit, a pair of glasses, and a single ponytail. She looked nearly 1.7 meters tall, just like Mengmeng.","After Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao came into the room, everyone’s eyes were fixed on them.","“You’re also from Room 301?” the girl in pajamas on the right asked.","“Yes. Hello, everyone,” Mengmeng said.","“Nice to meet you.”","The two parents were both smiling.","The woman smiled and said, “You’re all so good-looking.”","“Haha. Ma’am, you’re flattering me,” Yue Xiaonao said with a smile.","“Zihan, say hello to your classmates.” The woman looked up at her daughter.","“Hello, hello, my name is Lv Zihan.” The voice of the girl with glasses was a little low. It sounded gentle, and she sounded like she was an introvert.","“My name is Zheng Dan,” the girl in pajamas greeted.","Obviously, she was a lively girl. She blinked her eyes and looked around.","“I’m Zhang Yumeng.”","“My name is Yue Xiaonao.”","The two of them also introduced themselves.","After a short chat, Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao began to make their beds.","The bedding was laid out, and some daily necessities were placed in the compartment on the side of the table below.","There were some cosmetics on Zheng Dan’s table. She was a person who knew how to dress up and loved to dress up.","Lv Zihan’s table was different. Some books brought by her father were on the desk.","There were no cosmetics or anything like that.","However, Lv Zihan was also good-looking. She looked better than Li Muen, while Zheng Dan was inferior to her. After all, everyone had different aesthetic standards.","The girls in Room 301 all looked nice.","Soon, all the things were ready.","“Zihan is quite introverted and isn’t good at talking. Please take care of her in the next few years.” Lv Zihan’s father smiled.","“Don’t worry about it, sir,” Zheng Dan said.","“Zihan, you should get along well with your roommates. Call home if you need anything. Your mother and I will go back now, and we have to catch the train,” Mr. Lv said.","“Alright.”","Lv Zihan nodded, put her schoolbag on the bed, climbed out of bed, and went out with her parents.","It took her an hour to come back.","Her eyes were red.","In the past hour, Zheng Dan, Mengmeng, and Yue Xiaonao had been chatting for a while.","They had nice first impressions of each other.","“Shall we have dinner together later?” Zheng Dan glanced at the time and asked.","...","“Okay.”","Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao did not object.","Lv Zihan nodded in agreement.","“What do you want to eat? Or what do you like to eat? Is there anything that you don’t like?” Zheng Dan asked.","“Aren’t... aren’t we going to the canteen?” Lv Zihan asked in a low voice.","“This will be the first time we have a meal together as roommates of Room 301. Why would we go to the canteen?” Zheng Dan shook her head and said, “We’ll eat out. I heard that there is a nice kebab restaurant with a buffet that charges 15 bucks for each person. It’s called Southern Kebab. There is also a famous western restaurant, which charges about 30 bucks per person. Shall we go dutch on our first meal?”","“Go dutch?” Yue Xiaonao sat up from the bed and said, “I haven’t done that. You’ll pick the place. It’s my treat. As the chief of the room, I’ll treat you to dinner.”","“We’ll go dutch.” Zheng Dan insisted. “It’s troublesome to take turns to pay. Besides, it’s the first time we’ve met, so it’s not good to have you spend extra money.”","“Okay,” Mengmeng nodded and agreed.","Some people enjoyed it that way. There was nothing strange about it. Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao also knew that.","They naturally didn’t care if they were going dutch since Zheng Dan insisted.","...","“Which restaurant should we go to? What do you want to eat?” Zheng Dan asked.","Lv Zihan suddenly raised her right hand to ask, “Is, is it okay to have kebabs?”","She was even a little nervous.","“It costs 30 bucks per person to eat that western food. It is so expensive. I’d better go to the kebab restaurant. Otherwise, they might suggest going to a more expensive place.”","Lv Zihan didn’t have much money and couldn’t bear to spend it, but it was her first time dining with the girls, so she had to blend in.","“Then, shall we go now?” Zheng Dan asked.","“Alright, let’s go.”","Zheng Dan changed into a Fendi dress and took the lead in walking out.","“I’ll ask my friend if she wants to join us.”","When they walked to Room 307, Mengmeng pushed the door open a little and looked inside.","It was a little quiet, and the air seemed to be filled with a trace of embarrassment.","“Muen, we’re going out for dinner. Are you coming with us?” Mengmeng asked.","“Yeah.” Li Muen immediately got out of bed.","After she walked out of the room, she said, “It’s only the first day, but the girls are already arguing.”","“How come they’ve got into an argument?” Yue Xiaonao asked curiously.","“It’s about the bed. Someone put a pillow on the bed close to the window as soon as she came. The girl who came later didn’t know about it and tidied that bed. As a result, the former girl came back and asked her to change her bed. As they spoke, the two of them began to quarrel.” Li Muen grinned.","“How could they quarrel because of that?” Yue Xiaonao curled her lips and snorted.","“Let me introduce you to each other. This is our friend, Li Muen.” Mengmeng took the initiative to say, “This is Zheng Dan, and this is Lv Zihan.”","“Nice to meet you.” Li Muen first greeted them and then said, “Do you want to switch rooms?”","“Switch rooms?” Zheng Dan was stunned. “For what? Do you want to switch rooms with us? It’s not like we’re from the same class.”","Lv Zihan looked around and did not speak.","“Forget it. I’ll ask the counselor about this tomorrow.” Li Muen gave up. It didn’t seem to be a good idea for them to change their rooms privately.","Zheng Dan, on the other hand, looked at Li Muen’s clothes, which were all luxury brands that she knew.","She felt that her family background was quite good.","She couldn’t tell that from Mengmeng’s and Yue Xiaonao’s clothes.","“Congratulations on... our first gathering as roommates of Room 301.”","Zheng Dan took the initiative to make a toast. “Cheers.”","“Cheers”","“I’m also around, an outsider from another room,” Li Muen said with a smile.","After the girls went out and went to college, everyone seemed to be much more lively than usual.","Fresh things were always very attractive.","After the meal, they went back to the dormitory. There was nothing to do.","Everyone was chatting and wanted to know more about each other.","Lv Zihan came from a village and her family members were farmers. She was the first top student in her village and was famous.","Zheng Dan was from Xihang.","“We all come from different places, and there are no locals in our room. The girls in the four rooms here are all in Class 431. There are 16 girls in total and 50 boys. There are so few girls.” Zheng Dan began to think.","“What’s the point of having so many boys in a class?” Yue Xiaonao asked.","“Do you have any plans for your living in college?” Zheng Dan smiled and sat up straight on her bed.","Lv Zihan looked over with curiosity.","“Plans?","“Aren’t we supposed to just study?”","“Do you have a plan?” Yue Xiaonao also sat up straight and asked.","“Sort of. Don’t you want to join the Student Union? I want to be the class representative and then join the Student Union,” Zheng Dan said.","While speaking, she was a little nervous.","What put her under pressure was Mengmeng. With Mengmeng’s appearance, if she wanted to be the class representative, wouldn’t those boys all raise their hands in approval?","“I’m not interested.” Yue Xiaonao lay down again.","“What about you, Zhang Yumeng? If you are interested, we can discuss it. You can be the class representative if you want. My main goal is to join the Student Union,” said Zheng Dan.","“Class representative? That’s boring. I’ve had enough of being the class representative,” Mengmeng said.","“Did you used to be one?”","“Yeah. I’ve been a class representative for several years in primary school. That was too troublesome.” Mengmeng recalled the things in the past and smiled.","“That’s amazing.” Lv Zihan praised in a low voice.","“Then, if you don’t want to be the class representative, can you support me?” Zheng Dan was full of interest.","“No problem.” Yue Xiaonao lazily waved her hand.","She was not willing to do something that was not worth it.","“Why don’t you ask Lv Zihan if she wants to compete for the position of class representative?” Yue Xiaonao asked.","“Uh, I forgot.” Zheng Dan looked at Lv Zihan.","Before she could say anything, Lv Zihan shook her head and waved her hand. “I’m not capable enough to be the representative.”","Seeing her delicate look, Mengmeng chuckled and said, “How come you aren’t capable enough? Soldiers who don’t want to be generals are not good soldiers. For example, Zheng Dan has a lot of ideas.”","“I, I don’t know how to command people.” Lv Zihan’s face was slightly red.","She was a little embarrassed.","“Are you afraid that others won’t listen to you?” Mengmeng asked.","“Yeah.” Lv Zihan nodded slightly and was at a loss. “I just want to study.”","“Stop teasing Zihan.” Zheng Dan also relaxed and said with a smile, “Zihan, you’re a bit weak. This won’t do. You will be easily bullied by boys. But with the three of us here, we will protect you. Zhang Yumeng, Yue Xiaonao, will you support me when I run for representative?”","“I’ll root for you,” Mengmeng replied.","“You’ll have my full support.” Yue Xiaonao was lying on the bed, her hands raised.","“I...” Lv Zihan was silent for a moment and said, “I’ll support you as well.”","Although she didn’t show too much enthusiasm, she was trying her best to blend in.","Lv Zihan looked around and was relieved when she saw Zheng Dan’s happy smile.","“Thank you, guys.”","Zheng Dan said, “When I get to be the class representative, I’ll treat you to a meal.”","“Aren’t we going dutch?” Yue Xiaonao asked.","“It’s the first day we’ve met. With our relationship, we can’t be going dutch all the time,” Zheng Dan said casually.","“You make it sound like you’ve succeeded.”","Seeing her proud look, Mengmeng reminded her, “There are 66 students in the class. Now that the three of us are in favor of you, you still have 62 votes to go. Keep it up, girl.”","Zheng Dan didn’t say anything.","After a moment of silence, she said, “You’re right. I’ll go to the other rooms tomorrow to advertise myself. It’s too late now.”"]},{"number":1466,"title":"Chapter 1466 I Want to Be the Class Representative","paragraphs":["Chapter 1466 I Want to Be the Class Representative","On the first day, the girls chatted with each other in the dormitory and got to know Zheng Dan, who was cheerful, and Lv Zihan, who was introverted and delicate.","“At seven o’clock tomorrow, we’ll have a class meeting. It’s already past eleven o’clock. I’ll go to sleep now.” Zheng Dan stopped chatting and fell asleep after browsing on her mobile phone for a while.","Mengmeng was lying on the bed, unable to fall asleep.","“I need to go to the bathroom.”","Mengmeng muttered to herself and got out of bed.","“Hah.”","Yue Xiaonao let out a snort.","“This girl is going to run away.”","As expected-","Mengmeng walked down the corridor to the bathroom, opened the door, and walked in. Then, she disappeared.","She opened the Space Portal and returned to Mount New Moon.","“Daddy, Mummy?”","In the castle, Mengmeng called out twice and found that her parents were not there.","“Humph!”","Mengmeng snorted, and the Heavenly Pearl appeared in her right hand. She tried to sense it carefully.","“They’ve actually gone so far away?”","Mengmeng casually conjured up a Space Portal and took a step forward.","She went to the side of a restaurant.","“Shit. I’m still in my pajamas.”","She had forgotten about this. Mengmeng went back to Mount New Moon, took a set of clothes from the wardrobe, and then went abroad where the weather was hot.","She walked into the restaurant.","“Daddy, Mummy, you two are really having a good time.”","Mengmeng ran to the side and sat down on her own.","“You even went back and changed your clothes? Aren’t your pajamas quite cute?” Zhang Han smiled and said, “The sausages here are not bad. Try some.”","“Okay.”","Mengmeng ordered several kinds of delicious food from the waiter.","“Why did you come here after half a day? How are you doing in the dormitory?” Zi Yan asked.","“I’m doing okay. I noticed that you’ve gone out, so I came to have a look. I’ll go back to sleep in a while,” Mengmeng said while eating.","“You should just stay at school if you have nothing to do. Don’t keep running around all the time, or you’ll interrupt my time alone with your dad,” Zi Yan said.","Zhang Han curled his lips after hearing that.","“She’s lying.”","“Oh, you’re starting to dislike me now?” Mengmeng made a face and said, “I’m here to see my dad, not you, humph.”","“Wicked girl.”","Zi Yan raised her hand and pinched Mengmeng’s beautiful face.","“You are going to start the military training tomorrow, aren’t you?” Zi Yan asked.","“Yeah. We’ll have a class meeting at seven o’clock tomorrow. It seems that there will be a general cleaning. The military training will start at nine o’clock and will last for a total of two weeks,” Mengmeng said.","“I don’t think you’ll be interested in military training...”","Before Zhang Han could finish his words, Zi Yan said, “It depends on the people she’ll spend time with. Isn’t it nice for her to have military training with her classmates?”","“You’re right.”","Zhang Han nodded and said instead, “Mengmeng, you should stay with your classmates and live a normal college life.”","“Okay.” Mengmeng was almost done eating. “I’ll go back now. You two have fun here. I’ll come to you tomorrow or the day after tomorrow. Don’t forget to call me if you have anything interesting to do.”","“Alright.”","Zhang Han smiled and waved his hand.","Mengmeng walked out of the restaurant and left where there was no one around. She first went back to Mount New Moon, changed into her pajamas, and then returned to the dormitory.","She walked into the dorm room, lay on the bed, and slowly fell asleep.","At six o’clock the next day, something was buzzing.","The faint sound of the alarm came from the other dorms.","No one in Mengmeng’s dorm room had set the alarm clock.","But Lv Zihan still woke up at six o’clock. She sat on the bed, waited for two minutes, and whispered, “Guys, it’s time to get up.”","Ordinary people wouldn’t be able to hear such a low voice.","Mengmeng opened her eyes and turned to the side.","“You’re awake so early?”","“It’s five minutes past six. We need to have breakfast and then go to the classroom,” Lv Zihan said in a low voice.","“I’ll get up then.”","...","Mengmeng turned over, sat up, and shouted, “Xiaonao, get up.”","“I didn’t sleep well. Why would I get up?” Yue Xiaonao said with her eyes closed.","She had clearly woken up, but her body was no longer in control. She still wanted to sleep for a while.","“Hurry up, or we’ll be late.”","“It’s only 6:05, isn’t it?” Yue Xiaonao said, “It’s not too late. We can just get up at 6:40... Forget it, forget it. I’m up.”","As she spoke, Yue Xiaonao realized that they were in the dormitory. If they got up, got dressed, and washed, it would take them ten minutes, and it would take them five minutes to go to the canteen. They didn’t have much time after they finished breakfast and went to the classroom.","“Zheng Dan, get up.”","Mengmeng let out another cry.","“Uhhhh...”","Zheng Dan dragged her voice and sat up, sleepy.","“Let’s go wash up.”","...","They took their toiletries and went out. In the bathroom, they brushed their teeth and washed their faces. When they returned to the dorm room, Zheng Dan began to tidy up, and the others also changed their clothes.","The wardrobe was not big, and there weren’t many clothes in it.","Seeing that no one else was putting on makeup, Zheng Dan couldn’t help but speed up. She was ready to put on light makeup.","While they were busy getting dressed, Li Muen came in.","“You guys woke up very early.”","“It’s not early. You’ve already dressed up as well,” Mengmeng said,","“I got up at 5:30. I couldn’t sleep,” Li Muen said.","“What’s the matter? You’ve got used to your own bed?” Yue Xiaonao chuckled and said.","“Not like that. I slept very soundly when I was at Mengmeng’s house. Maybe I’m just too excited,” Li Muen said.","After dressing up, the girls went out to the canteen together.","On the way, they could see a lot of new students, dressed in different styles and chatting with each other.","They had just met, so they must have a lot of topics to talk about.","“Hey.”","Zheng Dan suddenly froze and looked at Mengmeng’s cheek carefully. “Zhang Yumeng, you don’t even need to put on makeup. You have such nice skin.”","She was a little dazed. “I thought you had light makeup on yesterday.”","Today, she found that Mengmeng didn’t use any cosmetics during the whole time. “She looks so beautiful without makeup?”","“Mengmeng is a natural beauty with a gorgeous face,” Li Muen said with a chuckle.","“She’s so beautiful.” Lv Zihan echoed. Her voice was very low. It could be seen that she also wanted to chat with the others, but she was too embarrassed.","“I’m so envious.” Zheng Dan suddenly sighed and said, “If I were so beautiful, wouldn’t it be easy for me to be the class representative?”","Even Li Muen and Zheng Dan knew very well that girls rarely praised other girls for their beauty.","But since the difference between them and Mengmeng was too great, so great that it was suffocating and made them look up to her, their mentality would quietly change.","Zheng Dan was also impressed by Mengmeng’s beauty, so she spoke more casually.","“Well, I just inherited my appearance from my parents,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","Mengmeng had been used to all the compliments on her beauty since she was a child.","“Yes, Uncle Zhang is very handsome, and Aunty Zi is gorgeous. She’s beyond my reach. Alas, if I were half as good-looking as her, I would be happy,” Li Muen enviously said.","“Stop it. It’s as if you’ll become more beautiful if you keep saying that.” Yue Xiaonao curled her lips and said, “Even if you’re envious of others’ appearances, it won’t help. We are what we are. I would be happy as long as I can eat.”","“It seems to make sense.” Li Muen grinned.","“A lot of people are looking at us.” Lv Zihan’s tone was a little nervous, and she did not dare to look up, secretly looking around.","“That’s not strange. In addition to Mengmeng, there are several other beautiful girls here,” Zheng Dan said.","“That’s right,” Li Muen echoed.","“You guys are too pretentious.” Yue Xiaonao said, “Let’s go and have breakfast.”","To a foodie, things other than eating were not a big deal.","“This is the No. 6 Canteen. There’s a buffet and stir-fried food.” Zheng Dan glanced at the canteen.","“Let’s try the food here first. It’s said that the dishes here are not bad.” Yue Xiaonao was in high spirits.","Before they came, they had applied for meal cards.","There were also a lot of dishes for breakfast. Yue Xiaonao bought eight kinds of dishes alone, and the others also took the dishes that they wanted to have or found pleasing to the eye.","The dishes were placed on the table.","“It’s not tasty.” After taking a few bites, Yue Xiaonao was no longer interested. “Alas, Uncle Zhang has spoiled me with his cooking. Mengmeng, can you ask your dad to come here and be your study companion?”","“In your dreams.” Mengmeng snorted and said, “I won’t let you scrounge free meals off us any longer. You can ask your dad to cook for you.","“His cooking skills are not good enough. The food he makes is not delicious,” Yue Xiaonao said pitifully.","However, it still didn’t work. Her trick didn’t work on Mengmeng.","“Lv Zihan, why are you eating so little?”","Zheng Dan took a look at Lv Zihan’s food.","It was very simple. It was a piece of bread and a plate of scrambled eggs with tomato.","This seemed to be too little.","The other girls looked at each other.","They also knew that Lv Zihan came from a poor family, so she might have to be thrifty to save money.","They thought that it was not a big deal to take care of her in daily life.","Yue Xiaonao said, “Zihan, I’ve bought too many dishes. Please help me eat some.”","“I’m fine. Thank you,” Lu Zihan whispered, “I don’t eat much. These are enough.”","“What’s in that small bottle of yours?” Mengmeng suddenly asked.","“The chili sauce that my mom made.”","“Let me have a try,” Mengmeng said.","“Um...” Lv Zihan hesitated.","“It seems so precious to you that you can’t even share it with us,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","“No, no.” Lv Zihan suddenly blushed and said, “I’m afraid you will dislike it.”","“We certainly won’t. Hurry up, or we’ll be late. Xiaonao, get us a spoon so that we can have a little chili sauce,” Mengmeng said.","“Okay.”","Yue Xiaonao took a spoon, which hadn’t been used by others, and got everyone a spoonful of chili sauce.","She also tasted it.","“It tastes pretty good.”","Yue Xiaonao was a little surprised. She said in a surprised tone, “I didn’t expect you to have something delicious.”","Since Yue Xiaonao had taken a fancy to the food, it must taste nice.","“It’s indeed delicious.”","“It’s also the first time I’ve tasted this kind of chili sauce,” Li Muen said.","“This is a kind of specialty food from my village.” Seeing that everyone liked it, Lv Zihan showed a satisfied smile.","“Let’s share our food. It will be a waste to have so many leftovers.” Mengmeng smiled slightly.","Yue Xiaonao moved the dishes she bought in the direction of Lv Zihan and Zheng Dan.","This time, Lv Zihan did not refuse. She mainly ate her own food and occasionally ate the dishes that Yue Xiaonao bought.","A few minutes later, she saw that everyone did stop eating.","There was still a lot of food left.","Lv Zihan sped up and couldn’t eat all the food.","When she left the canteen, she looked back twice and stared at the dishes on the table. “These are wasted.”","Zheng Dan smiled and said, “Then we will buy less next time.”","She found that Lv Zihan was very gentle. This kind of person was easy to suffer losses and got bullied, but the good thing was that she could easily arouse people’s desire to protect her.","“You’re in Class 431. I have to go to another class.”","Back in the teaching building, there were a lot of people coming and going in the corridor.","“Mengmeng, I’ll go now. The military training will start at nine o’clock. I’ll come to you when it’s time for the lunch break,” Li Muen waved and said.","“Okay.”","Mengmeng waved her hand.","She walked to her classroom.","There were a lot of boys in the classroom, who were talking noisily. Many of them were chatting about games and interesting things.","Some were silent, sitting in a chair and browsing on their phones.","There were a lot of people with different personalities. After they went to college, they hadn’t had military training yet and didn’t have to wear school uniforms. Almost everyone was wearing new clothes. Some people were dressed in famous brands. At first glance, one would feel that these people came from wealthy families, but it was unclear whether they were really rich.","For example, some people had to buy an iPhone even if they needed to cut expenses.","Everyone had a sense of vanity.","When Mengmeng, Zheng Dan, and the others came in, the classroom instantly became quieter.","“Damn...”","Many people’s eyes were fixed on Mengmeng.","There was no doubt that she was going to outshine the entire crowd at this moment.","“Let’s sit over there.”","Zheng Dan pointed to the girls’ section, where many girls were sitting together.","She planned to go over and have a chat with the girls to lay the foundation for being the class representative.","“What’s your name? We met twice yesterday, and I thought you were from another class.”","Zheng Dan was chatting with the people from other dorm rooms.","Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao sat there quietly, sizing up their classmates.","Lv Zihan, on the other hand, was a little dull. She wore a pair of glasses, which hid her looks a bit. Mengmeng and the others had seen her face after she took off her glasses. She was really beautiful.","It was almost seven o’clock.","There were fifty male students in the class, which took up the majority.","Zheng Dan found that many of the boys mentioned a name – Chen Yang.","“Chen Yang is awesome! He’s a king!”","“He’s really good at playing online games.”","“Where is Chen Yang?”","“He is smoking in the restroom.”","“This guy has a strong addiction to smoking. It choked us yesterday. Later, he noticed it and dragged the other two to smoke in the corridor. He didn’t smoke in the dorm rooms according to the regulations.”","“...”","Zheng Dan’s first impression of Chen Yang was that he seemed to be quite popular among the boys.","When the bell rang, five or six people walked into the classroom.","The man in the lead was wearing a white short-sleeved shirt, light blue jeans, and white sneakers. He had a good figure, a buzz cut, and a good-looking face.","At first glance, he seemed to be a lively person.","“If I want to be the class representative, maybe I need to get to know Chen Yang first and then communicate with the other boys.”","Zheng Dan pondered to herself.","All of a sudden, she noticed a problem. “Am I going to compete with Chen Yang for the position of class representative?”","She decided to wait and see.","Those people walked in and sat down in the middle row.","“Everyone, be quiet. The counselor is here.”","Chen Yang clapped his hands and reminded everyone.","The classroom suddenly quieted down a lot.","Most of the students felt like they were in high school and had not adapted to college life. They had not yet experienced the difference between counselors and high school teachers.","The counselor was quite heavy.","When he entered the classroom, he said in surprise, “Why are you so quiet?”","His words made many people who would laugh at anything laugh.","Everyone was watching the counselor. In the following years, they would live their college life with him as their supervisor.","“My surname is Hou, and I’m Hou Changjin.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The counselor wrote down his name on the blackboard.","It seemed to be the starting point of Class 431, which was also a chapter of 66 students’ new life. Their college life had officially begun."]},{"number":1467,"title":"Chapter 1467 Military Training Life","paragraphs":["Chapter 1467 Military Training Life","“You can call me Counselor Hou.","“This is my phone number. You should keep it.”","Counselor Hou wrote down his contact information on the blackboard. “In the next four years, if you have any problems, you can come to me.”","The students took out their mobile phones one after another to keep Counselor Hou’s phone number.","If they were in high school, they might have doubted his real intention. When they took out their mobile phones back then, the lead teacher would smile and stretch out her hand. “Hand your phones over.”","University was different. Everyone was already an adult and was close to joining society without someone else minding their trivial business.","The ones who had strong self-discipline would get good grades, and the ones with poor self-discipline tended to do a terrible job in studying.","There were different kinds of students.","After Counselor Hou introduced himself, he held a list and read it.","After a dozen seconds of silence, he suddenly said, “Which one of you is Zhang Yumeng?”","Counselor Hou was about 40 years old, and he spoke with a hint of smile and curiosity.","Clatter!","The students in the classroom began to look around.","They were all staring at the girls. Obviously, it was a girl’s name.","“I am.”","Mengmeng raised her hand.","Many gazes were fixed on her.","Even the air seemed to have become quiet.","“Well, you’re not bad as the top scorer of Xiangjiang.”","Counselor Hou smiled and nodded.","His attitude showed that he fancied Zhang Yumeng’s chances. At the very least, his first impression of Zhang Yumeng was that she had the highest scores among the rest of the class.","Zheng Dan was filled with envy again.","“It will be so easy for Mengmeng to run for the representative.”","“The top scorer of Xiangjiang. That’s really amazing.”","“She’s damned beautiful.”","“...”","Some people began to discuss in a low voice.","“Which one of you is Lv Zihan?” Counselor Hou asked.","“I... I am.”","Lv Zihan lowered her head slightly, raised her hand, and responded in a low voice. Her face was slightly red and she was a little shy.","“Alright.”","Counselor Hou nodded again and called, “Yue Xiaonao?”","“That’s me,” Yue Xiaonao replied lazily.","” Chen Yang?”","Counselor Hou started calling the roll. He just called the names of the students with good grades to see who they were.","“Hello, Counselor Hou. I’m Chen Yang.” Chen Yang raised his hand and greeted him generously.","“Wang Xiaojia.”","“Here.”","“Zheng Dan.”","“...”","After calling the roll, Counselor Hou looked at some people silently.","Mengmeng, Chen Yang, Yue Xiaonao, and a few others were the first ones he could remember.","He needed to check some people repeatedly before remembering them.","“Let’s have a simple talk.”","Counselor Hou sat on the chair on the podium and said, “We’re in Class 431. The grades of the students this year are much higher than before. You can do whatever you want in the university and have fun, but don’t forget to study. It’s not good to fail too many courses. You will get your class schedule in a few days. First, there will be two weeks of military training and a week of activity. You will be required to clean up a part of the school. That is to say, you’ll start having classes in the fourth week of this month. In the first three weeks, you can get familiar with the school environment and join the school clubs.","“Now, I’ll first choose a temporary class representative to manage the order of the class and some trivial matters of military training. In the fourth week, there will be a class representative election, as well as elections for other positions.","“Has anyone of you ever been a class representative?”","In fact, Counselor Hou already knew everyone’s situation. He had read the files of 66 students, so he knew them well.","“I used to be a member of the study committee in high school.” A boy raised his hand and was a little eager.","But soon, another tanned-skinned student said, “I was a class representative throughout my three years in high school.”","He suppressed the crowd by being a representative for three years.","Chen Yang sat aside with a faint smile on his face. It seemed that he was not interested in being the class representative at all.","After seeing this, Zheng Dan was inexplicably relieved.","She also raised her hand and said, “I used to be a class representative in high school.”","...","It was just that she had been the class representative during the first year of high school, and she didn’t say it in detail.","“I was a publicity committee member in high school.”","Some people wanted to say something but stopped on second thought. They put down their hands and sighed secretly. “Alas, I used to be a class representative in junior high school, but it doesn’t seem to work now.”","There were about eight or nine people who raised their hands.","They seemed to be quite interested in being the class representative.","The competition was fierce.","The students also began to talk about it. The class seemed to be on the right track, and many students were chatting.","“It seems that a lot of you have acted as class leaders.”","Counselor Hou put down the list and said with a smile, “I’m very pleased to see you raise your hands enthusiastically. Now, the acting class representative candidate is...”","The atmosphere was a little tense.","Everyone wanted to succeed.","...","Two of them, who had been class representatives for three years in high school, were very confident. They knew that either of them would be the acting class representative candidate.","If that person performed well, he would officially be the class representative in half a month.","However, how things turned out would always surprise people.","“The acting class representative is Zhang Yumeng, who used to be a class representative for six years,” Counselor Hou said with a smile.","“What?”","Mengmeng was stunned.","She didn’t say anything or raise her hand. How did she become the acting class representative?","Moreover, she had been a class representative for six years when she was in elementary school.","But now she was in college.","“Counselor Hou, you must have got it wrong.” Mengmeng grinned.","She did not want to be the class representative.","The acting class representative would be very busy.","“Don’t worry.”","Counselor Hou had a look of trust on his face. He thought that Mengmeng felt that she was not qualified, so he said, “It’s always good to try. Don’t be stressed. The class representative election will take place after half a month. At that time, it will be the formal occupation.”","The implication was that if Mengmeng had a good relationship with her classmates during this period, she would surely get their votes by then.","“I, um...”","Mengmeng grinned and looked at Yue Xiaonao.","“Let’s give applause to Representative Mengmeng to give us a speech!”","Unexpectedly, Yue Xiaonao, who was eager to stir up trouble, took the lead in applauding.","Clatter!","Counselor Hou also smiled and clapped along.","It was unexpected to Mengmeng. She glared at Yue Xiaonao out of the corner of her eye.","However, this was just a small matter.","Mengmeng got up and said, “Since Counselor Hou trusts me so much, I’ll be the acting class representative for the time being. Don’t disobey me. I can be very frightening when I get angry.”","Mengmeng’s delicate cheeks were full of seriousness as she spoke.","Others felt amazed while looking at her.","“Wonderful!”","Many people took the lead and applauded.","Chen Yang, a werewolf, who was a strong competitor of the acting class representative, glanced at Counselor Hou’s choice Mengmeng with a serious look.","“However, Zhang Yumeng is so beautiful.”","He finally raised his hand and clapped.","“If she gets to be the class representative, will I still compete with her?”","“Then, the acting class representative, Zhang Yumeng, will lead everyone to clean the classroom. It’s 7:30 now. I’ll come and check at 8 o’clock.”","After that, Counselor Hou left.","Generally speaking, it was a little difficult for a newcomer to command others to do work.","But it was not difficult for Mengmeng to handle.","“The class shall be divided into three groups. You’re in charge of the first group.” Mengmeng pointed to Chen Yang and said, “You’re responsible for wiping the glass, the second group needs to sweep the floor, and Zheng Dan will be in charge of the third group to clean the blackboard and the desks.”","She handed over the jobs to others.","Chen Yang was in the first group, the boy who had been a class representative for three years was in the second group, and Zheng Dan and the others were in the third group.","Mengmeng was naturally beautiful, which was an advantage. However, there were still some people who didn’t want to move and didn’t know what to do, unless they were told to take a mop and get some water. Only then would they do some real work.","Clap! Clap! Clap!","Chen Yang stood up, clapped his hands, and said with a smile, “Let’s get to work first. It’s just two pieces of glass. I think it’ll be done in ten minutes. The tools are in the front of the classroom. Let’s do it together.”","With someone taking the lead, there would be others following.","All the students got busy.","Zheng Dan and the other boy also began to make arrangements.","There were also some lazy people, but because there were many people, half of them could finish the work in 20 minutes.","It was eight o’clock.","When Counselor Hou returned to the classroom, the whole place was cleaner. Because it was on the first floor, even the windows had been wiped, which made the room very bright.","A good environment could make one feel physically and mentally refreshed.","Counselor Hou showed a satisfied smile.","He also cast a glance at Mengmeng.","He had a good impression of this beautiful student, the top scorer of Xiangjiang.","“Well done.” He praised her.","This put a lot of pressure on Zheng Dan. She looked around and sighed in her heart. “I don’t know if Zhang Yumeng will run for the class representative. If she does, I won’t have a chance.”","In her opinion, Mengmeng was so beautiful that as long as there was no big problem with her work, she would definitely be able to get the most votes. Moreover, Counselor Hou valued her so much. As a counselor, his decision mattered more.","Counselor Hou said, “There’s nothing else to do today. You guys go to the military training room 301 and distribute the uniforms. Then, you can go back to the dormitory to change your clothes. Meet at the pond on the left side of the playground before nine o’clock. During the military training, I’ll visit you often. If you have any questions, contact the instructor in time and you can also contact me.”","Several boys who had been called out by him quickly went to military room 301 to get the uniforms.","After the clothes were distributed, the first class meeting was over.","The students had nearly an hour to dress up.","The military training uniforms were camouflaged. When wearing the same uniform, the girls didn’t look as pretty as usual, but there was also a special beauty in the military training uniforms.","“Mengmeng, why didn’t you take any sunscreen?”","Li Muen ran over and said, “I have some miniature bottles of sunscreen here. Do you want some?”","As she spoke, she even took the bottles out and shook them.","“We’ve also brought some,” said Zheng Dan.","“I don’t need it. I’m not afraid of the wind or the sun,” Mengmeng said.","“Well, okay.” Li Muen nodded and said, “We’ll be on the same team for military training. I don’t know if my weak constitution can hold on. What if I faint because of heatstroke?”","“You won’t. You’re not that fragile,” Yue Xiaonao waved her hand.","When they walked out of the corridor, they met Li Muen’s three roommates, who were walking with some classmates.","Li Muen said hello to them.","At this time, Zheng Dan really couldn’t help but whisper to Mengmeng, “Meng- Mengmeng...”","It was the first time that she had called Mengmeng in such an intimate way as Li Muen and Yue Xiaonao.","“What’s up?” Mengmeng glanced at her.","“Well, do you want to be the class representative? If you do, you’ll have my support. I’ll compete for the coordinator,” Zheng Dan said.","“I don’t want to be the class representative. This is not what I wanted. She made this happen,” Mengmeng rolled her eyes at Yue Xiaonao.","“Hahaha.” Yue Xiaonao laughed and spread out her hands. “What does that have to do with me?”","“So, will you support me?” Zheng Dan was uncertain.","“Sure.”","She didn’t expect Mengmeng to agree with her on this so easily. She just mentioned it briefly, and Mengmeng agreed right away.","After they walked into the square, all the freshmen in military training uniforms came into view. The instructors were resting on one side, waiting for their teams. The military training would last for two weeks, which was also a leisure experience in their life.","Some of them were even eager to train the group of newcomers."]},{"number":1468,"title":"Chapter 1468 Someone on the Same Side","paragraphs":["Chapter 1468 Someone on the Same Side","“Greetings, Venerable Representative.”","Chen Yang walked over and took the initiative to greet Mengmeng.","“Is he a weirdo?”","Mengmeng’s face turned calm. She raised her right hand slightly and said, “Greetings.”","Chen Yang was stunned. “She doesn’t seem startled. Huh.”","“Okay. Venerable Representative, I have a small suggestion.”","“Name it.”","“Shall we set up a class chat group? If we do, we can familiarize ourselves with each other, as well as chat and date,” Chen Yang said with a smile.","“Set up a chat group? Sure.” Mengmeng nodded and said, “You can set it up and add everyone to it.”","She was not willing to do actual work. Whoever had a suggestion could get it done.","“Okay.”","After Chen Yang was done with his business, he asked with a smile, “Representative, you look gorgeous...”","As he spoke, he moved closer to Mengmeng and asked in a low voice, “Do you have a boyfriend?”","“Hey.”","Yue Xiaonao glared at him and said, “If you want to pick up girls, you’d better get rid of your dark circles first.”","“Dark circles?”","Chen Yang stopped where he should have and did not ask any more questions. He touched his face.","“I have dark circles under my eyes. Alas, as a handsome young man, I’m so alone at night without sleep.”","“What an eyesore.”","Mengmeng looked him up and down with a look of disgust.","He even bragged that he couldn’t fall asleep because he was handsome.","“Hahaha.”","Chen Yang smiled and said, “Representative, I may be a strong competitor or your right-hand man. You have to treat me well, or I will go away.”","“I don’t want to be the class representative. Whoever feels like doing the job can get the position.” Mengmeng snorted and said, “You can leave now, or I’ll behead you when I’m in a bad mood.”","“Yes, ma’am!”","Chen Yang straightened his back and bowed to her.","Then, he turned around and left with a smile.","Li Muen, Mengmeng, and the others couldn’t help but laugh.","“He’s interesting,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","He was an interesting guy.","“He just wanted to pick you up,” Yue Xiaonao said bluntly.","Mengmeng was speechless.","“I knew it.” Zheng Dan whispered, “Chen Yang also wants to be the class representative.”","“Are you afraid that you can’t win?” Yue Xiaonao said, “Come on. You can do it. Defeat everyone.”","“Thank you for your kind words,” Zheng Dan said with a smile.","Lv Zihan said in a low voice, “Go get it.”","She looked around and was also very curious about everything in the university.","“From now on, I’ll be your instructor.”","The instructor of Mengmeng’s team was a man who looked about 30 years old. He had a well-proportioned figure, but at this time, he looked a little lazy.","“My surname is Li.","“The military training will begin now. Stand in a military posture with an arm’s length from each other.”","The instructor’s face was calm. He glanced around and suddenly fixed his eyes on Mengmeng. He couldn’t help but be stunned as if he was deep in thought.","He stood in the front and demonstrated, telling everyone to imitate him.","On the right side of their team was Chen Yang and the other boys’ team. They were also very fast, and almost all of them took military training seriously.","It was strange that there were several instructors around. When they trained their teams, they occasionally glanced at Instructor Li, as if they wanted to see how he trained and what kind of attitude he had so that they could imitate him.","Instructor Li put his hands behind his back and approached the front of the team. His eyebrows gradually furrowed.","“What are you doing? I asked you to stand in a military posture, not to raise your butt!","“Where, where do you put your hands? Put your hands together naturally and keep them down.","“Raise your chest and raise your head. Don’t bend your body like a shrimp.”","His tone was harsh as he corrected some students’ problems.","This put a lot of pressure on the students.","“What a strict instructor!”","Seeing that the students all had proper military postures, Instructor Li began to pace back and forth.","Half an hour passed by in a flash.","...","Some of the students almost couldn’t hold on.","“Take a rest for five minutes.”","Clatter!","Many people were moving their arms and legs, feeling a little tired.","However, for some people, it was just a piece of cake, such as Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao.","After a rest, Chen Yang and his two roommates left. Two minutes later, they came back with many bottles of mineral water and distributed them to their classmates.","Upon seeing this, Zheng Dan curled her lips and said, “He’s started to gain favor now.”","She was fine with it.","The students started to stand in the military posture in the next round.","The girls were all okay with it. However, a boy suddenly felt dizzy and broke out in a cold sweat.","“Instructor!”","...","Chen Yang immediately cried out, “Someone fainted!”","The instructor walked over quickly and checked the boy out. “Send him to the infirmary.”","“Let’s go.”","Chen Yang and another boy took the one who passed out to the infirmary.","When they returned, Counselor Hou happened to be there as well. He stood under the shade of a tree not far away and watched the situation.","Chen Yang walked over. No one knew what the two of them were talking about, but it seemed that Chen Yang was a very talkative person.","Seeing this, Zheng Dan began to ponder.","She regarded Chen Yang as her opponent and said in a low voice, “It’s amazing that he can talk to Counselor Hou for a few minutes.”","Lv Zihan, who was in the front, thought that Zheng Dan was talking to her, so she turned her head and asked, “Who?”","Mengmeng, who was standing on the right side of Lv Zihan, said, “Chen Yang. Who else could it be?”","“I see.”","Lv Zihan nodded slightly.","Just at this moment.","The face of the instructor in the front darkened slightly. “Those who are whispering to each other, step forward!”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Many people turned to look over.","Someone thought. “Is the instructor going to make them as an example?”","Mengmeng looked around. “Oh, he means the three of us.”","She walked out of the group.","Lv Zihan followed her silently and lowered her head. She looked as if she had made a big mistake.","“Oh no, why is he so strict?” Zheng Dan looked out of the corner of her eye at the shade of the tree and said, “Counselor Hou saw it, alas...”","“It’s not allowed to whisper to others during military training.”","Instructor Li said in a low voice, “Run ten laps around the sports ground.”","“What?”","Zheng Dan exclaimed in shock.","Ten laps were just too much.","Each lap of the track was 300 to 400 meters. Ten laps meant three to four thousand meters. How could she make it?","Lv Zihan lowered her head slightly and was about to start running.","“I’ll do it alone,” Mengmeng said.","Instructor Li said, “You’ll all do it.”","As he spoke, he suddenly changed the topic. “What’s your name?”","“Zhang Yumeng.”","“Unless the three of you can prove your strength, you’ll have to run,” Instructor Li said. “If you can exchange a few moves with me, I can forgive you for this mistake.”","“Exchange a few moves?” Mengmeng raised her eyebrows slightly and asked, “How shall we fight?”","“Isn’t he asking for a beating?”","But after thinking about it, Mengmeng decided not to beat the instructor up, because that would be too high-profile.","“Have any of you ever learned boxing, martial arts, or Taekwondo?” Instructor Li asked.","“I’ve learned Taekwondo.” Zheng Dan raised her hand and said, “I’m in grade eight. Would that work?”","It was a level higher than that of a novice.","Instructor Li glanced at her and did not respond.","He didn’t care about that strength at all. He was looking at Mengmeng.","“Haha, I’ve learned some fancy skills from my grandpa since I was a child. Why don’t I exchange a few moves with you, Instructor Li?” Mengmeng asked.","Seeing this, Yue Xiaonao was worried. “Will Mengmeng hurt the instructor?”","“Okay. As long as you can exchange three moves with me, I’ll pardon you,” Instructor Li said with a smile.","He seemed to appreciate girls who were good at fighting.","But that was not the case.","The other instructors asked the students to stand in military postures while they looked at Instructor Li from a distance.","“Oh my god, does Violent Dragon Li want to fight against a girl?”","“We can’t copy this. If he hurts the student, it will have a bad impact.”","“Violent Dragon Li has been arranged to take a vacation here because of his excessive behavior during a mission, but he still couldn’t stay idle.”","“Otherwise, how could he be called Violent Dragon Li? He’s a legendary fierce man in our army.”","Two instructors gathered together and discussed in low voices.","Counselor Hou, who was under the shade of the trees, was also worried.","“Is this instructor kidding?","“However, he should know what he should do.","“Zhang Yumeng, from my class, is going to fight against him...”","He felt the need to come over and remind her.","However, as soon as he took a step forward, the fight started.","Instructor Li took a half step back with his right leg, squatted slightly, and waved to Mengmeng.","Mengmeng turned sideways at a very fast speed and gave a roundhouse kick.","Bang!","Instructor Li felt a huge force.","His arms were a little numb, but he reacted very quickly. He took a step back, drew a circle with his left leg, gathered his strength, turned around, and attacked from the right.","His speed was fast, but Instructor Li did not exert much strength.","Mengmeng was stunned when she saw this, and then she lowered her strength tenfold again.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","With a few sweeps of her legs, she fought fiercely with Instructor Li.","But it was also within Instructor Li’s tolerance.","“He turns out to be a Qi Strength Master, who seems to be close to a Wu Dao Grand Master.”","Mengmeng looked him up and down. She didn’t expect that there would be such a master among the instructors.","After seven or eight moves, Mengmeng took two steps back.","“Stop where it should. Don’t be too ostentatious.”","“Have I passed the test?” Mengmeng asked.","“Nice.”","Instructor Li nodded and looked at Zheng Dan and Lv Zihan, who were already stunned. “You two go back to the team.”","“Uh, yes, sir.”","The two of them walked back to the group.","The other girls looked at Mengmeng with envy. They were more shocked than envious.","Who said that women were not as good as men? Not only was she beautiful, but she could also fight. She was a heroine.","However, at this time, Instructor Li took two steps forward. When he was one meter away from Mengmeng, he said in a low voice with a respectful look, “My name is Li Yukai. Greetings, Eldest Lady.”","“What?” Mengmeng was stunned.","“I used to be a soldier under Instructor Liu’s command. I’m grateful for his care over so many years. I have seen his Facebook page and saw your photos. At first, I didn’t dare to recognize you, but when I heard your name, I was sure,” Instructor Li said with a low voice.","“Oh, so you’re one of us,” Mengmeng said.","“Uh, I’m a soldier. But now with the relationship between the National Security Agency and Mount New Moon, you can say that we are on the same side.” Instructor Li said with a smile, “Isn’t the military training a little... too childish for you?”","“It’s all right.” Mengmeng suddenly lowered her voice and said, “I’m a college student now. I’m here to experience life. I can’t attract too much attention.”","“Alright, I understand.”","“Okay.”","“Ahem.”","Instructor Li coughed softly and put on a dignified look again. He looked around.","“Zhang Yumeng is very good. She has very good physical qualities. Daily exercises are very important. You need to learn from her. Zhang Yumeng, go back to the team.”","“Yes, sir!”","Mengmeng replied in a clear voice and walked back to the team.","“Have you had enough rest? Stand still and continue with the military posture.” Instructor Li glared at them.","The people in the group immediately took action, and all of them started to stand in military posture.","However, Instructor Li suddenly found that this vacation seemed to be a little interesting.","Under the shade of the tree, Counselor Hou’s face was full of admiration as he praised, “What a talented and versatile student!”","Chen Yang silently walked back to his team.","He felt that after he did so many things and even chatted with Counselor Hou for a while, his effort was in vain. Even if they chatted for a few days, it would not be as impressive as the scene of Mengmeng fighting against the instructor.","“She’s really amazing. She even masters martial arts.","“I might not be able to win over such a beautiful girl.","“With this skill, even if she becomes my girlfriend, what if she finds out that I have a lover at the University of Science and Technology... She’ll break my legs.”","Thinking of this, Chen Yang gasped. “I can’t woo her. My life is more important.”"]},{"number":1469,"title":"Chapter 1469 The Results Are Set","paragraphs":["Chapter 1469 The Results Are Set","Mengmeng and the instructor exchanged a few moves.","Those who knew martial arts would naturally know that their moves were not simple.","But among all the people present, Yue Xiaonao was the only one who knew martial arts.","The others felt that Mengmeng had learned some martial arts or Taekwondo skills, so she could make a few beautiful moves. The instructor felt that her skills were nice, so he pardoned them.","Many people were envious and admired Mengmeng. It could be said that she was in the limelight at this time.","The most important thing was that her gorgeous appearance was her innate advantage.","Knowing that Instructor Li had a bad temper and was even very strict, everyone became obedient.","After standing in the military posture for a moment, Instructor Li began to teach them how to stand at ease, march, halt, and turn left and right.","The intensity of the training was neither too high nor too low, which would make people feel tired, but they could handle it.","Some instructors said that what the students were undergoing could not be compared with their training at all, but many instructors understood. After all, these were all top students with good grades.","The lunch break lasted for two hours, and the students were dismissed at 11 o’clock.","The crowd went to the canteen.","The instructors also gathered together.","Someone curiously said, “Instructor Li, when you fought with a girl this morning, your acting was really good. You were kicked to the side and took a few steps back. You made it look so real.”","“It seems that Instructor Li is a thoughtful person. He cares about those students’ feelings.”","“...”","Hearing the words around him, Instructor Li’s face was calm and he felt bitter in his heart. “The fight was real!”","When Mengmeng and the other girls were having lunch, they didn’t have stir-fried food because they didn’t feel like it.","They had ready-made food or noodles on the first floor.","Mengmeng had instant noodles, which she ate slowly.","Yue Xiaonao tasted the new dishes.","After taking a few bites, she put down her cutlery and said, “The noodles here aren’t very delicious.”","She hadn’t found anything that suited her taste yet.","“Let’s make do with it. The food here is definitely not as delicious as the food at Mengmeng’s place.” Li Muen made a face.","“Yes. Mengmeng’s family has a restaurant. The dishes there are amazing,” Yue Xiaonao said casually.","Zheng Dan thought about it and wondered if Mengmeng’s family ran a restaurant.","Although they had chatted and were more or less familiar with each other now, they didn’t know much about Mengmeng’s family background, and they didn’t ask her more about it.","Li Muen knew that her family was very well off. Only Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao knew that her father was a real estate agent.","Lv Zihan’s lunch was rather simple.","A total of five of them were eating here.","In addition, there were a lot of classmates nearby.","They were all chatting with each other about military training. Most of the time, they were talking about what they had experienced or what happened to their friends.","Among them, Chen Yang was relatively cheerful and generous, and he had a good reputation in the group of boys. It could only be said that most of them liked him.","But after all, he was a popular guy.","Chen Yang got up happily and said, “I’ll go over there and say hello.”","“Don’t tell me that you take a fancy to the acting class representative, and you want to go over and inquire about her?” someone joked.","“Haha, every gentleman yearns for pretty girls.”","Chen Yang smiled faintly, got up, and walked over with his plate.","He found a place to sit down at Mengmeng’s table.","“Representative, I didn’t expect you to be so skilled. You’re even a heroine,” Chen Yang said with a smile.","“Stop it, or I’ll beat you up.” Mengmeng shook her fist.","“Why do you always come to the girls’ side?” Zheng Dan rolled her eyes.","“I’m here to keep you guys company,” Chen Yang said arrogantly.","“We don’t need your company. You’re so narcissistic,” Zheng Dan replied.","Chen Yang said, “Hey gorgeous, why are you so mad when you talk? I’ve never offended you.”","“Humph.” Zheng Dan pursed her lips and continued to eat.","“Representative, I’ve already set up a boys’ chat group. What’s your WhatsApp number? I’ll add you to the group, and then you can add the girls to it,” Chen Yang said.","“Are you here to ask me to do some work?” Mengmeng asked.","“Uh...” Chen Yang was stunned.","“Alright.” As soon as Mengmeng agreed, she thought that since Zheng Dan wanted to be the class representative, it would be good for her to communicate with the girls. So she said, “Add us to it first, and then let Zheng Dan be in charge of adding the girls.”","“Who is Zheng Dan?” Chen Yang asked subconsciously.","Zheng Dan’s face darkened, and she said grumpily, “Me!”","“Oh, I see.” Chen Yang didn’t seem to care.","However, Zheng Dan was not convinced and glared at Chen Yang.","...","“Stop looking. What if you fall in love with me?” Chen Yang touched his chin.","“You?” Zheng Dan snorted coldly.","“Come, tell me your number. I’ll add you to the group.”","Chen Yang added everyone at the table to the class chat group.","“Little girl, you look a little familiar.” Chen Yang suddenly noticed something interesting. He stared at Lv Zihan without blinking.","“We... we’ve met before?” Lv Zihan replied in a weak voice.","“It should be...” Chen Yang said in a drawl.","At this time, two other boys came over with their food.","“Zhang Yumeng, Yue Xiaonao, and Li Muen.”","Mengmeng turned her head and saw that they were the deputy director of the Art Department, Ding Bing, and his roommate, Wu Xiao’an.","“Even though you’re in military training uniforms, it can’t hide your beautiful looks,” Ding Bing said with a chuckle.","...","“Senior, you’re flattering us,” Li Muen replied.","“He’s just telling the truth.”","Wu Xiao’an spoke and sat at the table next to the girls. He smiled as he said, “You must be exhausted from your military training.”","“It’s okay, a bit tiring,” Li Muen replied.","“I checked the weather forecast. It will be sunny for almost two weeks.” Ding Bing smiled gloatingly. “Last year, it rained for three days during our military training. Now, you’ll enjoy the scorching sun.”","“Military training is such a simple thing. It’s not worth mentioning,” Yue Xiaonao said,","“Zheng Dan, do you see these two people? This chubby guy is the deputy director of the Art Department.” Mengmeng introduced them.","If Zheng Dan wanted to join the Student Union, it would be good for her to get to know a deputy director.","“He’s the deputy director?” Zheng Dan was surprised.","Even Chen Yang was stunned by this.","Looking left and right, he was deep in thought.","“You became the deputy director in a year. That’s amazing,” Zheng Dan said with a smile.","“Alas, I got the position inexplicably.” Ding Bing shook his head.","Ding Bing and Wu Xiao’an ate quickly. They bade their farewells and left after a few minutes of chatting.","Wu Xiao’an was much more cheerful this time.","Seeing that the two were leaving, Chen Yang also stood up and followed them.","“Do you smoke, Seniors?”","Chen Yang smiled and took out a box of cigarettes.","Ding Bing and Wu Xiao’an took it.","“Seniors, do you know Zhang Yumeng and her fellows?” Chen Yang casually asked.","“Yeah.” Ding Bing glanced at him and said, “Zhang Yumeng is obviously a young lady from a good family.”","“How did you know?” Chen Yang asked curiously.","“I can tell from her parents that she’s very extraordinary,” Ding Bing said.","Wu Xiao’an echoed, “She’s really extraordinary. It’s the first time I’ve seen a college student’s parents, who are so young. The thing is that they have amazing temperaments.”","“As an experienced person, I have something to tell you,” Ding Bing said with a smile.","“Really?” Chen Yang showed an interested look, showing that he was happy to listen.","“Don’t date any girls in your class,” Ding Bing said slowly.","“Well? That makes sense.” Chen Yang was lost in thought. In the end, he laughed and gave a determined answer.","“All right, you should continue your military training now. We’re leaving.” Ding Bing was not interested in saying too much and he left with Wu Xiao’an.","After they left, Wu Xiao’an said, “You’re right. It’s really not good to date a girl in my class.”","“You got it.” Ding Bing patted him on the shoulder and said, “I was just saying it casually. Don’t you want to get a girlfriend? If you’re lucky, Zhang Yumeng will...”","“Impossible. I’m not good enough.” Wu Xiao’an shook his head repeatedly, “I don’t want to date anyone now. I just need to study hard and make progress.”","“Is this some kind of joke?”","Ding Bing was a little dazed.","Chen Yang stood at the back and saw that his classmates had not come out yet. He smoked, took out his mobile phone, and called his good buddy to chat.","Just like that, the students’ military training started.","In the first week, they learned all kinds of ranks and then practiced every day.","On the last day of the second week, the welcoming ceremony was held, which included a parade to verify the results of their military training.","The students shouted out their slogans, and the dean’s words were full of humor.","The third week was labor week.","The students were much more familiar with each other, especially the ones in their dorm rooms.","A few of them were quite popular.","Chen Yang was not only popular among boys, but also with girls. However, Zheng Dan also wanted to build a good relationship with everyone and was ready to compete for the position of class representative.","The labor week was over. On Friday, the students were taking evening self-study.","“We’ll decide on the class representative, the coordinator, and other class leaders today.”","Counselor Hou smiled on the podium and said, “I’ve checked you guys out several times during the military training. Also, during labor week, Zhang Yumeng has been the acting class representative. She managed it very well...”","He seemed ready to decide it directly.","Hearing this, Mengmeng was shocked and secretly thought. “Oh no.”","“Counselor Hou, I’ve tried for three weeks. I still don’t think I’m suitable for the position of class representative,” Mengmeng said.","“What?”","Counselor Hou was stunned.","He didn’t try to force her.","After a moment of silence, he said, “If any of you want to be the class representative, get on the stage and write your name on the left side of the blackboard.”","Chen Yang was the first to get up and leave his name on the blackboard.","Seeing this, Counselor Hou nodded slightly. He thought Chen Yang was capable.","Zheng Dan followed closely behind.","There was also a male student named Kang Yuze who wrote his name.","A total of three people had left their names on the blackboard.","“If you want to be the coordinator, write your name on the right side of the blackboard,” Counselor Hou said.","Zheng Dan raised her hand and asked, “Counselor Hou, can I sign up for that as well? I’m afraid that I’ll fail the election of the class representative.”","“No problem.” Counselor Hou nodded.","Zheng Dan walked up to the stage with a smile and left her name on the right side of the blackboard as well.","Chen Yang and Kang Yuze didn’t go on stage as they only wanted to run for class representative.","“Everyone, choose the ones whom you think are suitable to be the class representative and coordinator and write their names on a note. Each of you has one vote. You have two minutes.”","Soon after, the students finished writing the notes.","“Zhang Yumeng, go on the stage and call out the names. And you record them at the back.”","Counselor Hou gave the order.","After saying Mengmeng’s name, he pointed to a boy in the front row.","The two of them went on the stage. Mengmeng took the notes and began to read the names.","“I’ll read the class representative first, and then the coordinator.”","Mengmeng reminded everyone and started calling out the names.","“Chen Yang, Wang Kai.","“Zheng Dan, Dong Xiaoli.","“Chen Yang, Zheng Dan.","“Kang Yuze, Zheng Dan.”","“...”","With Mengmeng’s words, the whole classroom seemed to be filled with tension.","Who would be the class representative? And who would be the coordinator?","“I can’t fail to get both positions, can I? That will be too embarrassing.”","Zheng Dan looked at the scene and saw that each candidate had got five votes so far.","In the beginning, every candidate had almost the same votes.","Gradually, Chen Yang’s votes as the representative of the class began to rise.","When the votes reached a certain level, Zheng Dan knew that she had no chance to be the class representative.","Her eyes fell on the coordinator’s section. Fortunately, she had a high number of votes.","After a few minutes, the results were set.","Chen Yang took the position of the class representative with more than half of the votes, while Zheng Dan took the position as the coordinator with 22 votes, which was one-third of the total votes.","Counselor Hou said, “Representative, give us a speech.”","Chen Yang didn’t have stage fright. He walked to the podium and said a few words.","The same went for Zheng Dan.","Next, there were elections of other class leaders. Mengmeng was still the one calling out the names.","When everything was settled, the class leaders’ team was confirmed.","If everything went according to plan, the elected ones would be the class leaders in the following years.","“Class will start tomorrow. The class schedule is posted on the wall. The specific class will be informed in advance. The morning and evening self-study will be conducted here in this classroom...”","Counselor Hou said a few words. He sat for a while and then left.","At the same time, the students officially began their learning careers at the university."]},{"number":1470,"title":"Chapter 1470 Not Following the Rules","paragraphs":["Chapter 1470 Not Following the Rules","After the evening self-study, the students walked back to the dormitory. The leisure time in college had just begun.","In their university, the dormitory buildings closed at 10 o’clock. The evening self-study ended at 6 o’clock. From 6 o’clock to 10 o’clock, it could be regarded as the students’ leisure time.","There would be a lot of people in the square. There were plenty of people playing badminton, walking, dating, and secretly kissing people who thought no one could see them.","Mengmeng suddenly said, “Zihan, I’ve seen Chen Yang chat with you a lot recently.”","“Yeah. We just... discuss some questions about studying,” Lv Zihan replied.","“He may have found out that you look gorgeous,” Mengmeng said seriously. “You are wearing a pair of glasses, which affects your appearance. You look good when you take off your glasses. Is he wooing you?”","Mengmeng’s tone was a little gossipy.","“No, no. That didn’t happen.” Lv Zihan’s pretty face suddenly turned a little red.","“Why would you be nervous if that’s not the case?” Mengmeng looked suspicious.","“Stop teasing her,” Yue Xiaonao said with a laugh. “Chen Yang didn’t woo her, but I think he seems to be interested in her. Recently, he has been teasing Zihan in the group chat.”","“Maybe.” Zheng Dan said with some interest, “Chen Yang is quite good-looking among our classmates. The key is that he has a kind of... interesting character. I think you won’t feel bored if you date him.”","With that, Zheng Dan asked excitedly, “How many boys have you dated?”","“We’ve just started college. How can we date? Did you date someone in high school?” Mengmeng asked.","“I can tell at a glance that she is experienced,” Yue Xiaonao added.","Even Lv Zihan blinked her curious eyes and looked at Zheng Dan.","“Hey, it’s not strange to date someone in high school.” Zheng Dan seemed to be a little surprised and said, “Have you never been in a relationship before?”","“No,” the three of them replied.","“I’ll ask in a different way. Do you all have your first time?” Zheng Dan asked.","“What do you mean by the first time?” Yue Xiaonao asked.","“I’m asking if you’re a virgin,” Zheng Dan said.","“I am.”","“I am.”","“Me, me too.”","The three of them responded.","“Do you still have your first kiss?”","“Yes.”","“I do.”","“Yeah.”","“I won’t ask anymore.” Zheng Dan looked like she was convinced. “I’m overwhelmed. The school arranged three weirdo roommates for me.”","“You started dating too early,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“That’s not early. I just started it in my second year of high school.” Zheng Dan snorted. “You even have your first kiss. Haha, let me tell you, kissing is like an electric shock. Do you get it? An electric shock, and that kind of deep passion. Tut, tut.”","“Hey, how many guys have you been with?” Mengmeng asked in confusion.","“Not many. I’ve been in two serious datings,” Zheng Dan said.","“What about the ones not serious?” Yue Xiaonao didn’t understand what she meant.","Surprisingly, Lv Zihan was also a little curious and asked in a low voice, “What do you mean by serious dating?”","“Well... we’ve slept together.” Zheng Dan looked around and lowered her voice.","“What?” Lv Zihan’s face instantly turned red.","“Ahem, ahem, you’re really experienced.” Yue Xiaonao rubbed her forehead.","“I guess.” Zheng Dan muttered, “Anyway, you’re not far from falling in love in college. When the time comes, you’ll understand the mysteries within.”","“Let’s go back now. We’ll come out for a walk later,” Mengmeng urged them.","Everyone went back to the dormitory and rested for a while.","“Shall we go out for a walk?” Yue Xiaonao suggested.","“Let’s go.” Mengmeng also wanted to go out.","“I want to read for a while,” Lv Zihan said in a whisper.","She would feel strange if she didn’t do the previews.","“I’m going to meet a few senior girls. I’ll go to the Student Union to have a look,” said Zheng Dan.","She was still working hard to join the Student Union.","“Then, let’s go.”","Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao walked out of the dormitory and called out to Li Muen, “Muen.”","“I’m coming.”","Li Muen was on call at any time, and she was not so interested in studying.","The three of them came out happily and walked on the campus.","“My dad bought a villa in the neighborhood next to the school. It’s been almost a month. I haven’t been there to check it out,” Mengmeng said.","“Then, let’s go over now,” Yue Xiaonao said casually.","...","“Your dad is so thoughtful,” Li Muen said with a smile. “My dad wouldn’t do that. He would only transfer money to my bank account.”","She was even complaining about that.","“Hey, gorgeous, shall we get to know each other?”","Someone came to strike up a conversation. He plucked up his courage and said, “Can I get your WhatsApp number?”","His eyes were fixed on Mengmeng, looking very nervous.","“Nope.”","Mengmeng smiled softly and refused.","This was also a part of her life. She would reject a few guys every day.","The girls had just walked out of the school gate and turned left.","As soon as they arrived at the prosperous commercial street.","“Hey? Isn’t that Chen Yang over there?”","...","Yue Xiaonao suddenly pointed to a place not far ahead and asked, “Is this boy picking up girls?”","There were two boys and two girls next to Chen Yang. One of them was quite beautiful, with almond-shaped eyes and a proud smile on her face. She was quite close to Chen Yang.","“Isn’t that the representative of your class?” Li Muen said with a gossipy face, “This guy has been talking to Zihan recently. He’s absolutely interested in her. Look at the girl next to him. Does this guy want to be two-timing?”","“Chen Yang.”","Mengmeng suddenly let out a cry.","Swoosh!","The five people immediately stopped and looked in their direction. They were all stunned.","When they saw Mengmeng and the other two, the proud girl also looked at them in confusion. She kept looking at them, and when she saw Mengmeng, her eyes paused for a moment, but she didn’t show too much emotion. Instead, she looked at Chen Yang doubtfully.","“Hey!”","Chen Yang was stunned at first, but then he smiled and said, “Acting representative, are you here to take a stroll?”","“Yes. We’re just strolling around here,” Mengmeng replied.","“Let me introduce you. This is the acting representative of our class, and they are all my classmates.” Chen Yang pointed to several people next to him and said, “They are my good friends. We’ve come out to have a gathering by having dinner.”","Obviously, he didn’t want to go too deep into the introduction.","Chen Yang only gave brief introductions. He even politely asked, “Do you want to join us?”","He invited them generously to show that he had nothing to do with Zhang Yumeng and the other two. They were just ordinary classmates.","Generally speaking, when the old classmates had a gathering, they wouldn’t have outsiders join them.","But Mengmeng and the others didn’t seem to be bothered with that rule at all.","“Okay,” Yue Xiaonao nodded and said.","Chen Yang’s face stiffened in an instant.","In the end, Chen Yang decided what to eat. He had already picked a special roast lamb chop restaurant and ordered a few dishes.","There were a total of eight people, and it would cost at least 100 to 120 bucks. For ordinary people, that was not a low cost for a meal.","No one proposed going dutch for this meal. It seemed that Chen Yang and his friends would pay as hosts, and Mengmeng and the other two came here for a free meal as guests.","If Chen Yang knew that not everyone could invite Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao to dinner, he would probably feel honored. Unfortunately, he didn’t know that. In fact, he felt a bit hesitant.","At first, he had a good impression of Mengmeng. But later, when he knew that he was no match for her, he decisively gave up and took a fancy to Lv Zihan.","But now, it seemed that he and the beautiful girl next to him had an affair. Chen Yang seemed to be a playboy.","The beautiful girl beside him asked, “Chen Yang, aren’t you going to introduce them to us properly?”","“Haha, let me introduce them to you. This is Zhang Yumeng, the previous acting representative of our class. This is Yue Xiaonao, and this is...”","In fact, Chen Yang knew Li Muen’s name, but he pretended to be hesitant at this time.","“My name is Li Muen. I’m Mengmeng’s childhood friend, also Xiaonao’s good friend.” Li Muen introduced herself. “I’m in the class next door to yours.”","“Oh, I see.” Chen Yang revealed a look of realization.","“These are my friends, and they are also freshmen at the University of Science and Technology. As for this one, let me introduce her to you.” Chen Yang pointed to the beautiful girl next to him, and his tone and expression became a little more passionate.","“She is my childhood sweetheart, Ye Xiaomu. We have always been together. No, she’s like my echo. No, no, it’s... it’s just that we are very fated. The universities we go to are not far from each other.”","“What are you talking about?!”","Ye Xiaomu glared at him, but she smiled slightly to show her happiness.","It could be seen that Chen Yang could influence her mood.","Ye Xiaomu is a she-wolf.","“Nice to meet you. This is my roommate. You can call her Xiao’ai,” Ye Xiaomu took the initiative to introduce her friend.","They all greeted each other.","Mengmeng and the others didn’t talk much during the meal. Chen Yang kept performing to show his attitude. He would help Ye Xiaomu with some food with his cutlery, and Ye Xiaomu didn’t mind.","The relationship between the two had reached a certain level, but it seemed that they had not expressed their feelings for each other yet, which meant that they had not officially acknowledged being boyfriend and girlfriend.","“Here. Congratulations on becoming the class representative. Have a drink.”","Everyone took a drink and drank it up.","Chen Yang’s friends, who had been depressed at the beginning, gradually became active and showed off their skills unintentionally.","They were almost done eating. In fact, Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and Li Muen did not eat much.","“Thank you for your hospitality, Representative Chen. We still have something to do, so we’ll leave now,” Mengmeng said.","“See you.”","Chen Yang and the others waved their hands in unison.","They watched the girls leave.","“Hey, Brother Yang, do you have the acting representative’s WhatsApp number?” someone asked excitedly.","“No.”","Chen Yang said with a serious face, “Why would I add her on WhatsApp? Although she’s very beautiful, my little sheep matters more to me.”","“What little sheep? You’re so annoying,” Ye Xiaomu said angrily.","However, everyone could see the smile in her eyes.","“Don’t lie to me. You must have a class chat group.” One of the boys’ eyes was fixed on Chen Yang.","His crazy momentum suppressed the crowd, making the other two boys unable to say anything.","“Forget it, forget it. If he likes her, he will take a shot. Anyway, he may not be able to woo her.”","“I have the class chat group. Take it and find her number on her own.” Chen Yang clicked into the group chat without hesitation and handed over his phone.","He inadvertently revealed that he had nothing to do with the beautiful girls, and he didn’t chat with them.","In fact, he was the only one who knew whether he had deleted the chat history.","“Zhang Yumeng’s number is here. I’ll give it a try.”","The boy with a flattop haircut next to Chen Yang tried to add her number with his.","“She accepted my friend request!”","It was as if he had obtained a precious treasure.","The boy looked at his phone excitedly.","He didn’t know what to do, so he asked, “What should I say to her?”","Except for Chen Yang, the two boys began to study it.","“Why don’t you send her a greeting first? What else can you say? You can’t possibly tell her that you like her right away, can you?”","“Right, right. I’ll send a greeting first.” The boy with a flattop haircut typed, “Nice to meet you.”","Beep!","He immediately got a reply.","“It is indeed nice to meet me.”"]},{"number":1471,"title":"Chapter 1471 The Hero Saving a Beauty","paragraphs":["Chapter 1471 The Hero Saving a Beauty","“I’m the one who sat next to Chen Yang during dinner.”","Mengmeng replied, “Now that you mentioned it, I do remember you. I know who you are.”","The boy with a flattop haircut was stunned.","“She left only a few moments ago. She didn’t know who I am until I told her?”","“How old are you, beautiful girl?”","“I’m not even a hundred years old yet. What about you?”","“What a coincidence. Me too.” The boy noticed that the other party seemed to be very lively.","“It’s great that she likes to chat. If we can talk, we can get to know each other. Only in this way will I have a chance to woo her.”","Unexpectedly, after only five minutes of chatting, Mengmeng suddenly stopped messaging him.","It was because she and the girls had already arrived at the villa.","They had learned from the guard that the property management company had arranged for professionals to introduce the area of the villa to Mengmeng and her fellows.","It was the best villa in the neighborhood. It had been bought for nearly a month, but Mengmeng hadn’t spent her time in it yet.","Xiaoli stood in front of the villa. She had the key, and she was the one who arranged for the staff to clean the courtyard every week.","She was quite familiar with the villa. She had tried to sell it several times in the past, but it had never been sold.","“I wonder what kind of person the owner is.","“Three young girls. They seem to be students from Westpam University. Was it her brother who bought the villa? Is he like a young master of a rich family or a wealthy CEO?”","Xiaoli thought about it for a moment.","When Mengmeng and the other two arrived, she smiled and said, “Nice to meet you.”","“Hi. Nice to meet you too,” Mengmeng responded.","Originally, they didn’t need someone to introduce the villa to them. They could know its layout after scanning it with their soul senses, but the property management company was too enthusiastic.","“What do you think of the external environment of the villa?” Xiaoli asked with a smile.","“Not bad,” Li Muen said.","She thought it was just so-so. The villa was not as good-looking as her own house, let alone compared with Xanadu of Mengmeng’s place.","“This is the garage. There are five cars inside.”","Xiaoli opened the garage and the girls saw five cars inside, which were a red Panamera, a light pink Lamborghini, a Bentley, a Mercedes Benz, and an MPV.","Seeing this, the girls didn’t show any reaction at all.","They didn’t even take a few more glances before walking into the villa with calm faces.","Xiaoli was secretly stunned.","In the villa, she gave a general introduction on the first floor.","Xiaoli also implied that the villa would require a housekeeper, and the places such as the swimming pool, the kitchen, and so on needed regular maintenance.","After walking around and getting no special experience, the girls sat on the sofa and chatted for a while before leaving the community.","They were about to walk back to campus.","On the other side.","As soon as Zheng Dan and Lv Zihan walked out of the school gate, they walked toward the commercial street to buy something.","“Zheng Dan?","“Come here. I have something to talk to you about.”","Zheng Dan turned her head and was stunned. “Senior Sister Ma?”","She and Lv Zihan walked over.","“Senior Sister Ma, what’s the matter?” Zheng Dan asked.","Senior Sister Ma was a senior member of the Student Union whom Zheng Dangang had just gotten to know.","They knew each other and were on good terms.","“Are you busy now?” Senior Sister Ma asked in a hurry.","“No. What can I do for you?” Zheng Dan asked.","“Please do me a favor.”","Senior Sister Ma took her a few steps to the side, whispered a few words, and pointed to a boy in gray casual clothes in the distance.","“Zihan, I have something to do. Maybe you’ll go buy the stuff first, or we can do it together tomorrow,” Zheng Dan said.","“Well...” Lv Zihan hesitated for a moment, “I’ll go buy the things now.”","They were about to go to a large stationery store on the commercial street to buy something.","Unexpectedly, as soon as they walked out of the school gate, Zheng Dan needed to do something. However, since they had got there, Lv Zihan planned to go buy some stationery now.","“Okay. I’ll go now. I have something urgent to do.”","After saying that, Zheng Dan quickly left.","Lv Zihan lowered her head slightly and walked along the street.","The lights were not too bright on campus. She raised her head and looked at the bustling commercial street ahead, which was brightly lit.","She suddenly felt as if she was searching for light in the dark. She had to study hard and become excellent.","...","The light reflected by the glasses seemed to be the light that belonged to her.","As soon as she arrived at the commercial street, she passed by a square.","Bang!","A few people walked past her quickly. One of them accidentally bumped into her arm, causing her to stagger slightly and her glasses to fall to the ground.","She was about to pick the glasses up, but she could only vaguely see where they were.","Clack!","Someone stepped on the glasses with one foot.","“My glasses!”","Lv Zihan let out a startled cry.","“Xiaohu, you’ve fucking stepped on someone’s glasses.”","Someone was cursing.","...","“Fuck off! Didn’t you bump into her?”","Hearing the conversation, Lv Zihan suddenly got a little scared. She stood there, at a loss.","She couldn’t see the people around her clearly.","She could only get a general idea of the crowd.","It seemed that there were six or seven people.","At the very front was a man in a white coat.","They stopped and looked at Lv Zihan. Suddenly, they were all silent.","“Hey, it’s a pretty girl.”","Lv Zihan wasn’t wearing her glasses. She was very good-looking and quite charming with a kind of delicate beauty.","The man in white narrowed his eyes slightly and sized her up.","“Brother Guang, shall we...?”","Someone looked at the man in white.","That man had an ordinary appearance. He was relatively thin and cleanly dressed. He was wearing famous brands, and his clothes equipped him with a nice temperament.","He casually waved his hand. “Apologize now since you’ve bumped into her.”","“I’m sorry, pretty girl, I didn’t notice you just now.” The person who bumped into Lv Zihan immediately apologized.","At a glance, one could tell that this man in white, Brother Guang, had high prestige.","“Let’s go get our business done first.”","The man in white left directly and walked forward quickly for dozens of meters before he got in a black Cadillac in the parking lot.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","The others got into the old black Jetta aside.","Brother Guang lit a cigarette with a smile and looked at Lv Zihan, who was not far away, with great interest. He said to the man in the passenger seat, “Xiaoman, go check her out.”","“Hahaha, I knew you’d be interested.”","The man laughed out loud, opened the door, and got out of the car.","At this time, Lv Zihan was dumbfounded. “Do they think that an apology is enough?","“This pair of glasses cost me more than 60 bucks. The frame and the lens are crushed. I’ll need to pay at least 40 bucks to repair them. That will be my food expenses for so many days.”","Lv Zihan was a little disappointed. She was not good at communicating, and she was at a disadvantage while not at home. It was unknown how many times she had suffered.","Just when she thought she was going to bear the loss silently-","“Pretty girl.”","All of a sudden, a person from the crowd just now came to her.","“Here comes hope. Have they realized that they need to compensate me?”","Lv Zihan raised her head slightly and said, “He-hello.”","“Give me your contact information. I’m busy now. I’ll bring you to get a new pair of glasses when I’m done with my business.”","“Okay.” Lv Zihan gave him her phone number.","“Which class and university are you from? What’s your name? I’ll note it on my phone.”","“My name is Lv Zihan. I’m from Class 431 of Westpam University.” She was a little confused and didn’t want to answer, but she was a little scared, so she still told him her information.","He didn’t look like a college student. She would be fine at school. If he were a bad guy, she would stay at the school and tell Counselor Hou about it.","She had basic vigilance, but she was still too inexperienced for a wily old bird.","“Do you have WhatsApp? It’ll be convenient for us to contact each other on that app. If I don’t have time to buy the glasses with you, I’ll transfer the money to you when I get back.”","“Alright.”","Lv Zihan thought for a moment, took out her mobile phone, and added his number on WhatsApp.","Seeing Lv Zihan’s worn mobile phone and simple clothes, the man smirked. He took a step forward, which forced her to take half a step back.","“Pretty girl, do you want to make money?” The man said in a low voice, “Others usually use Iphones and wear expensive brands like Fendi and Gucci. Don’t you want those?”","Lv Zihan plucked up the courage to ask, “What... what do you want?”","But she was extremely nervous.","“Be my girlfriend.” The man chuckled and said, “You can have luxury goods, purses, mobile phones, and money. You can live a superior life in college. What do you think?”","“No.” Lv Zihan refused nervously.","“There’s no need to refuse in such a hurry. You don’t have to pay anything. You just need to be with me for two nights a week. It’s very simple, right? You’ll just need to lie down, and you’ll get a lot of money.” The man walked forward step by step, pressing her.","“What are you doing? Stay away from me!” Lv Zihan was anxious, and her tears could not stop.","“Why are you crying?” The man sneered. “Don’t you want those?”","“No.” Lv Zihan said, “I don’t need you to pay for my glasses. Go away now, or I’ll scream.”","“Do you think I’ll be scared by that?” The man was not afraid at all. “Go ahead and scream. The louder your scream is, the happier I will be.”","“What are you doing?!”","All of a sudden, a stern shout rang out from a few meters away.","The man turned his head and saw a boy running over quickly and blocking in front of Lv Zihan. “Who are you? Are you bullying her?”","His voice was so loud that it attracted the attention of many people around.","The man’s face darkened, and his eyes were sharp. “Who are you?” he asked.","“I’m her boyfriend.”","It was Chen Yang. He had just bid farewell to his friends for a few minutes when he saw this happening.","As he spoke, he grabbed Lv Zihan’s hand.","Lv Zihan trembled, and she quickly withdrew her hand.","Seeing this, the man in the front smiled and nodded. He pointed at Chen Yang with the phone in his hand and asked, “Are you also from Class 431?”","“So what if I am?” Chen Yang glared at him.","“Well, you have balls.” The man smiled playfully, turned around, and quickly left.","“Damn it. You’d better hope that you won’t get to see me again!”","Chen Yang cursed. When the man was far away, he immediately looked at Lv Zihan and asked with concern, “Zihan, are you all right?”","“I’m fine. They broke my glasses. I even gave them my contact information and Whatsapp number...”","As she spoke, Lv Zihan felt wronged and her tears continued to fall.","“Hey, don’t cry. Those people are just scumbags.”","Chen Yang comforted her. “Let’s go back first lest they corner us later.”","“Okay.”","Lv Zihan followed Chen Yang to the school.","“It’s just a pair of glasses. Don’t dwell on it. I’ll buy you a new pair tomorrow. Take it as a reward from the class representative,” Chen Yang said with a smile.","As he spoke, he felt a little guilty. He looked in the direction of the University of Science and Technology and thought, “Xiaomu should have gone back. Please don’t let her see us.”","“Thank you, but I think I’ll pass.” Lv Zihan’s weak look made people feel pity for her.","Chen Yang’s tone suddenly became a little harsh. “What do you mean you’ll pass? As the class representative, I’ve decided it. Are you going to refuse my good intention?”","“I, I...” Lv Zihan really fell for it and didn’t know what to say.","“You look so beautiful when you’re not wearing glasses.” Chen Yang’s tone suddenly softened.","It made Lv Zihan at a loss, and her attention was diverted a lot.","They walked to the road close to their school.","Someone’s questioning came from behind, “What are you doing?”","Chen Yang was startled and shivered.","He quickly turned his head and breathed a sigh of relief when he saw that it was Mengmeng and the other two.","“Zihan, why are you crying?”","Mengmeng took two quick steps forward, frowned, and looked at Chen Yang suspiciously.","“I didn’t do it. Don’t do me wrong.” Chen Yang raised his hands to show his innocence.","At the same time, he secretly sighed. “What a pity. It could have been a chance to get closer to Lv Zihan.”"]},{"number":1472,"title":"Chapter 1472 I’m Inviting You for a Drink","paragraphs":["Chapter 1472 I’m Inviting You for a Drink","Yue Xiaonao approached them and asked, “What happened?”","“Someone harassed Lv Zihan just now and I drove him away,” Chen Yang said simply.","“A few people broke my glasses when they passed by, and then someone came to harass me...”","Lv Zihan was too embarrassed to repeat what that man had said to her. After two seconds of silence, she said, “Chen Yang saw me and came to help.”","“Did you meet a scumbag?” Mengmeng asked, “Who is he? What clothes does he wear? What does he look like?”","“I, I forgot. I couldn’t see him clearly,” Lv Zihan said, looking vulnerable.","After she saw Mengmeng and the others, her mood improved and she stopped crying.","“I didn’t pay much attention to him as well. That person doesn’t look like a student. Forget it. We can’t find him. Let’s go back to school. The outsiders definitely won’t dare to enter the school and make trouble,” Chen Yang said.","“Next time you go out, just tell us. We can go together. How could you leave by yourself?” Yue Xiaonao said.","“Zheng Dan was with me at first. Later, she met a senior and had something to do, so I went by myself,” Lv Zihan whispered.","“There’s no way around it. Be careful next time.” Chen Yang said, “This road is near our university, and there are five universities around it. Although the commercial street is very prosperous, there are different kinds of people there. There was even news that someone was missing, and I’m not kidding. You should try to avoid going out alone. I think Zhang Yumeng and the others are also very busy. Zihan, if you need to go somewhere next time, I’ll go with you.”","“Why would she need you to go with her?” Yue Xiaonao glared at him and said, “It’s so despicable of you to try to two-time your girlfriend.”","“Huh? What are you talking about?” Chen Yang coughed softly and said with a smile, “Yue Xiaonao, you are very cute.”","“Hahaha, he even said that Sister Nao is cute.” Mengmeng suddenly laughed.","She found it very interesting to see Yue Xiaonao embarrassed.","This matter was left unsettled. When they returned to school, Lv Zihan was more relaxed.","“Show me the glasses.” Chen Yang took the pair of glasses from Lv Zihan’s hand and said, “You’re at least nearsighted with 4.0 diopters, aren’t you?”","“3.7 diopters, less than 4.0,” Lv Zihan replied.","“I see. Okay. I’ll leave you guys here. I’ll go to the Sci-Tech University.” Chen Yang excused himself and left.","On the other side.","Brother Guang and the others drove along the street in two cars.","“It seems like she’ll not easily take the bait. She didn’t agree and her attitude was clear.” Xiaoman, who was sitting in the passenger seat, said, “However, that pretty girl is a bit fragile. Even if she is a bit tough, I reckon she won’t make it public afterward.”","A tattooed man in the back seat asked, “I saw a kid coming later. Who was it?”","“He said he was the boyfriend of that pretty girl, but I don’t think so. He’s just a silly boy who doesn’t know anything and still tries to stick his neck out.” Xiaoman sneered.","“This pretty girl is really good-looking, mainly because of her temperament. How should I put it? If she’s tamed, she will definitely be an obedient kitten.” Xiaoman smiled and said, “Brother Guang can easily get her.”","“Haha.” The man in white driving the car chuckled and said, “There’s no hurry. I’ll take my time. Don’t you have her phone number? I’ll try and see if I can keep her as a mistress first. It’s very easy to deal with young girls who have just entered college. It’s just that keeping her is easier. Don’t try to play tough on them. They may not be able to bear it. If something happens, you’ll have to take responsibility.”","“Got it. I’ll give it a shot tomorrow. If it works, I’ll bring her to you, Brother Guang,” said Xiaoman.","“Shall we teach that brat a lesson?” someone asked.","Xiaoman sneered. “We’ll do it at our convenience.”","“Looks like from tomorrow onward, we can go to Westpam University to have some fun.” Someone seemed to be interested.","They could get some cuts if they helped Brother Guang hook up with women. At the very least, Brother Guang was willing to spend money in this respect.","Chen Yang didn’t know that his action of saving a damsel in distress seemed to have caused him a lot of trouble.","At this time, he was still buying glasses. He kept picking before he bought a pair that cost 80 bucks, which he put in the glasses box.","When he returned to school, he went to the girls’ dormitory.","“Excuse me, could you do me a favor?” Chen Yang asked when he saw a girl from another class.","“What’s up?” the girl asked.","“Can you put this in Room 301 for me?”","“Okay.” The girl thought for a moment and said, “Should I tell them anything about this?”","“No. Just put it on the table.”","Chen Yang waved his hand. “Thank you.”","“You’re welcome.”","The girl went upstairs, and her room was also on the third floor, so she took the bag to Room 301.","“There’s a boy downstairs. He seems to be the representative of your class. He asked me to bring this here.” The girl put the bag on the table and turned to leave.","“Hey?” Yue Xiaonao lay on her bed and glanced at Lv Zihan. “Chen Yang bought you glasses. He’s up to no good.”","“Of course.” Mengmeng snorted and said, “He noticed that Zihan is good-looking, so he has bad intentions.”","“I, I don’t want it.” Lv Zihan’s face turned red.","“Just take it. You can’t return it, can you?” Yue Xiaonao waved her hand and said, “When you are free, you can just treat him to a meal.”","“I...” Lv Zihan was hesitant.","“We can go as well when you eat with him, in case he has ulterior motives,” Mengmeng said seriously. “You should put on the glasses first, or you won’t be able to see anything now.”","“Okay.”","Lv Zihan answered in a low voice, got out of bed silently, and went to bed with the glasses bag. She opened it and looked at the glasses. They fit, but she was still in a trance.","“Did I just accept a gift from a boy?","“It seems so.","“Chen Yang... he’s a good friend.”","Chen Yang might burst into tears if he knew what Lv Zihan was thinking.","...","He didn’t want them to be in the friend zone.","The next day.","When Chen Yang was studying in the evening, he found a few strangers passing by in front of the classroom door. They seemed to be looking for someone.","This caused Chen Yang to feel slightly uneasy.","“Is it the guy who harassed Zihan?”","He didn’t know those people, so he couldn’t tell if they were sent by the offender.","They only took a few glances at the classroom before leaving in a hurry.","No one knew whether they were students or not if it was during a break, but they were still wandering in the corridor when it was class time, and some people from the Student Union on patrol would ask them why they were there.","“I chose the restaurant where we’ll eat tonight. This will be our first class gathering.”","Chen Yang walked to the front and said with a smile, “I haven’t told you about the class fund yet. Each of you needs to hand over 20 bucks. The money deducted from the expenses of the gathering will be our class fund, collected and kept by Zheng Dan, the coordinator.”","“Do I need to collect it now?”","...","Zheng Dan winked at Chen Yang.","She thought Chen Yang was quite interesting. He was more suitable to be the class representative than her, and he was usually a witty guy.","She got up and collected the money.","She collected 1,320 bucks in total, which made up the class fund.","In the evening, they had dinner in a private room on the third floor of a kebab restaurant on the street.","“Everyone, let’s drink for our Class 431.”","Chen Yang stood up and raised his glass.","Many people looked at him and raised their glasses together. More than 80% of the boys drank beer, while the girls had soft drinks.","“Cheers!”","The atmosphere was very cheerful. They were freshmen, and they felt close to everyone.","Almost a month had passed, and most of the students in the class knew and got familiar with each other.","If their high school classmates saw them like this, some might say, “Hey, you’re so much livelier than you were in high school.”","“You’re different from before.”","Since they started their college life, some students lived it up.","They had a good time partying and drinking.","As a result, many people got drunk.","Some were so drunk that their faces turned red, and even a chubby boy shouted, “I will woo Zhang Yumeng!”","“You’d better just drop it.”","The person next to him smiled and gently hit his back.","He secretly sighed at the strong power of alcohol.","“He just shouted his mind after getting drunk. That’s simply terrifying.”","“Ah Liu, take good care of your roommates. Let’s go back to the dormitory.”","Chen Yang also drank a lot, about seven or eight bottles. Surprisingly, he could hold his liquor well. At this time, he was a little drunk. He knew he had enough, so he stopped drinking no matter how the others toasted him.","He was very good at controlling himself.","After arranging for everyone to leave the restaurant one after another, he and Zheng Dan paid the bill at the end.","It took them some time to do that as they needed to pay for the broken wine glasses and get some refunds.","The meal cost nearly 800 bucks, which was about 14 bucks per person.","“Dear secretary, keep the rest of the money.” Chen Yang glanced at Zheng Dan and joked.","“Okay, Representative,” Zheng Dan answered with a smile.","She seemed to be getting more and more interested in Chen Yang.","They walked out of the restaurant.","Chen Yang glanced at a karaoke bar called Crown dozens of meters away and shook his head slightly. “I was planning to do karaoke after dinner, but I didn’t expect everyone to be a little drunk.”","“If you want, I’ll go with you.” Zheng Dan narrowed her eyes and smiled.","“You? No.” Chen Yang glanced at her and immediately refused.","“What do you mean?” Zheng Dan stamped her feet in anger.","“Holy shit!”","At this moment, Chen Yang was startled. He immediately turned around, stretched out his arm, and wrapped it around Zheng Dan’s shoulder.","“What are you doing?” Zheng Dan gently pushed him away. She didn’t do anything else, and it seemed to be a deliberate hesitant act. “Are you just going to hug me and take advantage of me?”","“Don’t talk...”","Zheng Dan’s pupils contracted. “Does he want to kiss me?”","However-","“Let’s go now!”","Chen Yang urged in a low voice.","Zheng Dan was stunned.","Just as Chen Yang was about to quickly leave that place, he heard the sound of running behind him.","The man he saw was Xiaoman, the tattooed man, who harassed Lv Zihan a few days ago.","He felt that it seemed to be that person, who had noticed him.","Chen Yang had a bad feeling when he heard the footsteps.","However, as soon as he turned around, he was quickly surrounded by several people.","“Young lad, why are you here?” Xiaoman walked over with a wicked smile on his face.","“Hey, boss.”","Chen Yang also smiled. “What a coincidence.”","“This is your other girlfriend? Lad, you have quite a bit of luck with women.” Xiaoman spoke with a sarcastic tone.","“It’s just that I’m quite popular, so I have some girls. Do you want to know some?” Chen Yang asked as if he was an old friend.","“Great. You can introduce a few to me. Let’s go, I will treat you to a drink.” Xiaoman’s eyes narrowed as he spoke."]},{"number":1473,"title":"Chapter 1473 I’m Sure You Still Want to Drink","paragraphs":["Chapter 1473 I’m Sure You Still Want to Drink","“I’ve had a lot of beer today, so I won’t go on. How about I treat you another day?” Chen Yang said with a smile.","Xiaoman didn’t want to continue playing around. His face darkened slightly. “Let’s go and have a chat in there.”","“Guess how many people will look over here if I shout?” Chen Yang smiled.","“Are you sure you want to give it a try, lad?”","Suddenly, a man put his arm around Chen Yang’s shoulder. Chen Yang could feel something hard in his pocket.","Was it a stick or a dagger?","Chen Yang felt that it was the latter, and his scalp went numb.","“What do you want?” Zheng Dan was scared, so she raised her voice.","Chen Yang was also very scared. If some of those people were crazy and hurt him on impulse, it would be too late for him to ask for help.","“The scenery here is quite nice. One can take a clear picture here.”","Chen Yang reminded the other party not to mess around while there were surveillance cameras.","He then added, “Since you’re in the mood, I’ll drink with you. But she can’t. She needs to go back to school.”","If the other party could let Zheng Dan go, it meant that it was not a big deal. If not, he would resist.","There were surveillance cameras around. However, there was nothing he could do if the other party dared to hurt him.","Chen Yang was brave enough to stay calm in the face of danger.","“You will be enough.”","Xiaoman chuckled, and then he waved.","Zheng Dan looked at those people carefully and ran away quickly. When she was dozens of meters away, she stared at them. It was not until they entered Crown Bar that Zheng Dan quickly ran to school and was ready to call some students who had left earlier.","Chen Yang heaved a sigh of relief when he walked into the karaoke bar.","It didn’t seem to be a big deal.","But then, he also smiled bitterly.","He might have to suffer some physical pain.","Fortunately, he could handle taking a beating.","In the Crown Hall on the third floor, there were seven or eight people.","The leading one was a man in white, who was Brother Guang. He was holding women in his arms and having fun.","“Why did you bring an outsider here?” Brother Guang glanced at Chen Yang and asked.","“What?”","Xiaoman couldn’t hear him clearly, so he waved his hand and ordered his subordinates to lower the volume of the music. He walked over and said, “This brat is the person who saved the pretty girl a few days ago.”","“I see.”","Brother Guang suddenly felt like messing with Chen Yang. He pushed away the woman on the left and picked up a glass of liquor. “Come on, buddy, have a drink.”","“Haha.”","Chen Yang was extremely nervous, but he still smiled. He picked up the glass and finished the liquor in one gulp.","He also cursed in his heart. “This liquor tastes so fucking bad.”","“Wow, bravo.” Brother Guang was a little surprised. “I guess you’re not a coward.”","“If I were, I wouldn’t have come here,” Chen Yang said casually as he sat down.","Clap! Clap! Clap!","Brother Guang applauded and said, “Well said.”","“Let’s drink for that, lad,” Xiaoman immediately picked up a glass of liquor.","Since Brother Guang was in high spirits, he decided to get Chen Yang drunk first.","“Cheers.”","Chen Yang didn’t want to drink it, but he knew that he had to buy time, and Zheng Dan would find someone to help him out.","“It’s boring to drink with small glasses.”","The other man with tattoos on his arms got up, walked to the door, and said loudly, “Waiter! Come here, bring ten cases of beer.”","The beer was quickly delivered.","“How many bottles should I crack open?”","“All of them.” The tattooed man’s voice carried a hint of fierceness.","It took the waiters some time to twist off the caps.","Chen Yang was quite dumbfounded when he saw this.","“They won’t make me drink all these, will they?”","“Come, bro, let’s drink.”","With a cold face, the fierce man with tattoos on his arms picked up a bottle of beer.","Chen Yang picked it up and started drinking without hesitation.","Halfway through the drink, he wanted to vomit, but he still forced himself to drink up the rest.","He looked up and saw that the other party had only taken a small sip.","...","“Damn it!”","Chen Yang cursed in his heart.","It was obvious that they were about to bully him.","“Lad, let’s have another bottle.”","The tattooed man raised the bottle in his hand again.","At this time, several enchanting women with heavy makeup were looking at the scene with a smile. Some of them leaned against Brother Guang and whispered, “Who is this bumpkin?”","Brother Guang ignored her. In fact, Chen Yang had also heard her since the music wasn’t loud.","“Zheng Dan, can I count on you or not? If you don’t come soon, I’ll die here!”","Chen Yang gave a wry smile inwardly.","He braced himself to drink.","On the other side.","...","As Zheng Dan ran, she took out her mobile phone to call the boys.","He called two of Chen Yang’s roommates, but they didn’t answer.","She sped up her pace.","“Help!","“Hey!","“Zihan, wait!”","Suddenly, she saw Lv Zihan and shouted not far away.","“Someone’s calling me.” Lv Zihan stopped and looked behind. “It’s Zheng Dan.”","“Why is she in such a hurry?” Yue Xiaonao asked.","Lv Zihan, Mengmeng, and Yue Xiaonao walked slowly and leisurely. There were also a few students ahead of them.","Zheng Dan came closer and said hurriedly, “Something’s wrong. Chen Yang has been taken away by gangsters.”","“What?” Lv Zihan was shocked.","“Who took him away?” Mengmeng was also stunned.","“He’s been taken to a karaoke bar by a few gangsters. We need to hurry up and call for help.”","“Call, call the police.” Lu Zihan’s face turned a little pale.","Mengmeng frowned slightly. With her soul sense, she immediately saw how Chen Yang was doing.","“Oh, he’s fine. We’ll just go over and pick him up,” Mengmeng said in a relaxed manner.","“We can’t. Those people are very fierce.” Zheng Dan was extremely anxious.","Mengmeng said with a serious face, “Nowadays, gangsters are out of date. Let’s go. We will get him out of there.”","“What...”","Zheng Dan was just about to shake her head.","“Gee, stop wasting time. Let’s go now. What if we can’t see your Brother Chen later?” Yue Xiaonao said impatiently.","They took Zheng Dan’s hand and walked back quickly.","Lv Zihan, who was going with them, looked at them and felt a little unconfident. “We’re just four young girls. Are we going to take someone from the gangsters?”","Walking into the karaoke bar, Zheng Dan was a little stunned.","“No, Mengmeng, we can’t do it,” Zheng Dan said cowardly.","“Alright, you guys wait here. We’ll be right back with Chen Yang.”","“Let’s go together.” Zheng Dan plucked up the courage to follow Mengmeng.","Lv Zihan immediately caught up with them, looking quite concerned about the class representative.","“Where are you...?”","Before the waiter could say anything, Yue Xiaonao said flatly, “We need to go to Crown Hall.”","They went straight into the elevator and went to Crown Hall.","“How do you know he’s over there? Maybe he’s in another place.” Zheng Dan was a little worried. “Why don’t we ask the waiter about it?”","“The punks are usually in Crown Hall,” Yue Xiaonao said perfunctorily.","She directly pushed the door open and walked in.","The volume of the music inside was very low.","There was a foul atmosphere. With a glance, the girls found that six or seven of the dozen people were smoking.","The lights were also quite bright.","After they saw Mengmeng and the others-","Hiss!","Brother Guang gasped.","The others were also stunned.","“Hey.”","“Some pretty girls are here.”","“Come on, pretty girls, please take a seat.”","They were all a little excited.","Chen Yang was still drinking when he saw that it was just the four of them who had come over.","Poof!","Chen Yang spat out a few mouthfuls of beer and sprayed it all over the floor. His eyes were dull and he was a little drunk. He muttered in a low voice, “Am I destined to die? No, Zheng Dan, are you trying to get me killed...”","“Zheng Dan should’ve gone to the guys for help. Why did she get a few girls here, and even Zhang Yumeng, this pretty one?”","He had thought that he would be thrown out after he got drunk. At worst, he would be beaten up.","But now, it seemed that there was no way to resolve this peacefully.","“It’s quite lively here, isn’t it?”","Mengmeng waved her hand and said, “It’s too smoky. Stub out your cigarettes.”","“Didn’t you hear that? The pretty girl told you to stub out the cigarettes,” Brother Guang sternly said to his subordinates.","Clatter!","This group of people immediately put out their cigarettes.","“Come and have a seat, beautiful.”","Brother Guang patted the spot next to him.","He had just pushed a girl away to give her the seat.","“I see that you guys are drinking,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","This smile was very attractive. It was devastatingly beautiful. Her crescent-shaped eyes revealed a kind of tempting beauty.","However, no one noticed the playful look in her eyes.","Perhaps only Yue Xiaonao could get her intention.","While they were talking, Mengmeng and the others sat down on the small sofa on the side.","Lv Zihan was the most nervous, and her hands were clasped.","Zheng Dan was also listless.","Yue Xiaonao just sat there casually.","“Drinking can liven things up,” said Brother Guang with a smile. “Pretty girl, do you want to drink?”","“If I want to drink, this little bit of beer is not enough,” Mengmeng said.","“Really?” Brother Guang burst out laughing. He clapped his hands and said, “Go, get ten more cases of beer.”","“Let me see how many people are here.” Mengmeng glanced around and said, “Get fifty more cases.”","“Fifty cases?”","Xiaoman’s brows were slightly raised.","“Is she kidding us?","“Haha, she looks so bold. She can just wait to be messed with.","“Fifty cases it is.”","He asked the waiter to bring the beer up.","“Let’s all finish a bottle first.” Mengmeng picked up a bottle of beer casually.","“Alright. Let’s do this!”","Brother Guang’s interest was piqued. He voluntarily picked up a bottle of beer.","Everyone else followed suit.","Zheng Dan whispered, “Chen Yang, are you stupid?”","“What?”","Chen Yang looked at the bottle in his hand and wondered if he had just picked it up.","He didn’t seem to remember.","He put down the beer in silence, got up, and sat down next to Zheng Dan.","At this point, no one paid attention to him.","Mengmeng said with a smile, “Cheers, everyone!”","Gurgle, gurgle...","Before the beer could flow into her mouth, it slipped into her Space Ring.","A bottle of beer was easily finished.","“Let’s keep it going.”","Mengmeng picked up the second bottle.","“One bottle for you and one bottle for me. Let’s take turns toasting everyone.” Yue Xiaonao felt bored sitting there. She was eager to see the room in chaos.","Mengmeng took another bottle and said, “A toast to everyone.”","“Hey, let’s take a pause.”","Xiaoman drank two bottles of beer in a row. Coupled with the wine he had just drunk, he seemed to be unable to hold on any longer.","Mengmeng smiled and said, “Come on, let’s keep drinking.”","She launched an undetected wave of gentle energy. Xiaoman only felt as if a bit more strength suddenly appeared in his body. He naturally picked up the beer, gulping it down. He vowed that he didn’t want to drink it, but his hand and his mouth didn’t listen to his commands as if he was craving alcohol.","“What?”","Xiaoman finished it and shook his head. “Has the alcohol got to me?","“How did I finish a bottle unconsciously?”","“Come on, let’s have another bottle. This is so nice.” Yue Xiaonao laughed and followed Mengmeng’s example. She controlled a few people who didn’t want to drink and forced them to drink.","Among them was Brother Guang.","Mengmeng said with a chuckle, “It’s my turn. Let’s have another bottle.”","“A toast to you. You’re all real men!” Yue Xiaonao said in an imposing manner.","“Let me propose another toast to all of you handsome guys.” Mengmeng raised another bottle of beer.","There were more than a dozen bottles in each round, and they drank seven or eight rounds.","Those people began to feel quite dizzy.","Also, Zheng Dan, Chen Yang, and Lv Zihan were dumbfounded.","“Oh my god, how could Zhang Yumeng and Yue Xiaonao both be so good at drinking?!”","Ten minutes later, some of the people present, such as Brother Guang, had foam spitting out from their nostrils.","“A toast...” Yue Xiaonao thought for two seconds and said, “A toast to you for being very handsome.”","“Another toast to everyone. It’s the first time we’ve met. I’m very happy to get to know all of you.” Mengmeng cracked open another bottle.","“I...” Brother Guang’s eyes were dull. “I don’t want to drink anymore.”","“You do. You want to keep drinking,” Mengmeng said.","Brother Guang felt that he was really drunk and couldn’t control himself. He finished another bottle.","“Keep it going,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“I really don’t want to drink anymore,” Brother Guang mumbled as he spat out the beer.","“What? Are you trying to make me look bad?” Yue Xiaonao glared at him.","Everyone drank a bottle of beer in unison.","“My turn,” Mengmeng said with a grin.","“No, no. I’m going to vomit blood if I drink any more.”","“Can’t you do it for my sake?” Mengmeng snorted.","Everyone lost control and drank another bottle of beer in unison.","“A toast to everyone,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“Sister Nao, Sister Nao, I really don’t want to drink anymore.”","“Trust me, you do.”","“Come on, let’s finish another bottle,” Mengmeng said.","“Sister Meng, please, I really can’t take it anymore. Please spare me.” Brother Guang cried bitterly.","“I’m sure you still want to drink. Don’t lie to yourself,” Mengmeng said seriously.","“It’s my turn again...”","Chen Yang looked at the chaotic scene mixed with begging for mercy.","Hiss!","He shivered with fear.","“Why do I feel that Yue Xiaonao and Zhang Yumeng are more like gangsters than gangsters?","“Are these two devils?","“They’re so terrifying!","“Are all the pretty girls nowadays so amazing?”"]},{"number":1474,"title":"Chapter 1474 Eldest Lady","paragraphs":["Chapter 1474 Eldest Lady","On the way back to school.","Chen Yang didn’t expect himself to be able to walk normally after drinking so much. He felt that his body was very light as if he had infinite energy.","“Mengmeng, Xiaonao, are you all right?”","Zheng Dan asked, “Don’t you feel any discomfort after drinking so much?”","“We’re fine. We poured a lot of beer onto the floor,” Yue Xiaonao said perfunctorily.","“Really? You drank all those people under the table, but you two stay fine.” Zheng Dan couldn’t help shivering when she thought of those people lying on the floor.","“It wouldn’t get them into an emergency, would it?” Zheng Dan was a little worried.","“I, I’m just afraid that those people will take revenge afterward,” Chen Yang said in a daze.","“They won’t.” Zheng Dan thought for a moment and comforted him, “It’ll be the holiday in a few days, which will last seven days. Those people will probably forget about it after a while. They won’t just keep an eye on us, will they?”","However, what she said came true.","“Childe Zhao.”","Brother Guang, who liked to wear white clothes, was still a little pale and his eyes were dark. He respectfully said to a bald man in his twenties, “We were humiliated, but we also spotted several beautiful girls, one of whom was a college student with long hair in red. I swear that I have never seen such a gorgeous-looking college student, but she was really good at drinking. She drank us all under the table.”","“Is that so?”","In the private room of the club, there were more than a dozen people, many of whom were big shots that Brother Guang was inferior to, but these people were all under Childe Zhao’s command.","Childe Zhao of the Zhao family was not an ordinary person. But at this time, the dishes had not been served yet. He looked at his watch and said, “One of my distinguished guests may arrive in about half an hour. You have half an hour to bring those people here. If you can’t bring them here, then...”","He patted Brother Guang on the neck.","Hiss!","Brother Guang instantly gasped.","“Fuck. Why can’t I just control my tongue?”","He cursed in his heart. “Ain’t I looking for trouble?”","“I’ll definitely bring them here.”","Brother Guang was nervous.","“Go ahead. Oh, by the way, you will invite them here.” Childe Zhao smiled faintly.","Before Brother Guang left, he heard the others talking.","“I didn’t expect Childe Zhao to make friends with the legendary owner of the Red Name Martial Club!”","“That person is so powerful. With him around, we won’t have to fear Li Xu anymore.”","“...”","The conversation between the big shots was indeed amazing.","Brother Guang had also heard of the Red Name Martial Club, but he had never seen its members before. It was said that it was difficult to join. One needed to be recommended by the senior members before joining the club.","With his status, he couldn’t know anyone of that level.","As for Li Xu, his name was as famous as Childe Zhao’s. Brother Guang had heard a lot about him.","“Come with me.”","When Brother Guang reached the entrance of the club, he got in the car with seven or eight lackeys.","“It’s eleven o’clock now. Hurry up and find them,” said Brother Guang.","“Boss, they’ll finish their class at 11:10. Shall we go there and wait?”","“Let’s go.”","“Damn it. Let’s go and get them!”","...","When it was time for a lunch break.","“What do you want to eat for lunch? I’ll treat you guys to lunch to express my gratitude to you pretty girls for saving me yesterday,” Chen Yang said proudly.","“Thanks, but I’ll pass...” Lv Zihan whispered.","“We’ll have kebabs,” Yue Xiaonao said casually. “Chen, you’re not bad. We did the right thing by helping you. You live up to our expectations.”","“Of course.” Chen Yang patted himself on the chest.","Zheng Dan’s mouth moved, but she didn’t say anything. No one knew what she was thinking.","So the schedule was set. Chen Yang would treat the girls of Room 301 to kebabs.","As soon as they got downstairs, they saw Brother Guang and the others on the basketball court.","“They’re here again.”","Chen Yang’s face darkened. “It seems that they don’t intend to let us go.”","“I’ll call the security guards!” Zheng Dan whispered and ran to the side, ready to call for help.","“Wait, please wait.”","Brother Guang glared at the people behind him.","He walked over, alone, softly and slowly with a warm smile on his face. “Sisters, we mean no harm.”","Chen Yang was dumbfounded.","“What’s going on?”","...","He couldn’t help but be stunned. “Is he conquered after getting defeated in drinking?”","“What are you doing here?” Yue Xiaonao looked Brother Guang up and down and asked, “Didn’t you drink enough yesterday?”","“I did, I did. My head is still aching.” Brother Guang nodded repeatedly.","His humble attitude made Zheng Dan stop and look at him suspiciously.","“Just say why you’re here,” Mengmeng said. “Don’t ask for trouble. Since I’m in a good mood, say what you have to say and get lost.”","“Yes. Don’t worry, ladies.”","Brother Guang’s forehead was covered with sweat, and he was very anxious.","However, this was the best way he could think of.","In front of so many people, he knew that the consequences of his violence would be unimaginable.","Brother Guang said humbly, “Well, my boss is here. Recalling that I was very embarrassed by being drunk yesterday, I told him about it. He’s very interested in you two young ladies and wants to drink with you. Why don’t we have another round? I guarantee that you will be safe. We’ll drink in Allenore Club, where safety is guaranteed. ”","That place was safe for most people, but it seemed that no one could stop Childe Zhao if he was up to something.","...","“Others can die, but I can’t!”","Brother Guang thought to himself.","He felt okay with trapping others. He just found it a pity that he had to trap the beautiful girl in front of him.","“I’m sure she’ll look drop-dead gorgeous when she matures.”","Brother Guang didn’t think too much about it and said, “I’m begging you. You won’t get drunk anyway. Please do me a favor. As long as you go, I will protect you here in the future.”","“Do we need your protection?” Yue Xiaonao glared at him.","“Sorry, we need to have lunch now,” Chen Yang said with a smile.","How could he be willing to go to the club?","By the time they got there, it was hard to say what would happen.","“Whether you’ll go doesn’t matter. I didn’t invite you, did I?” Brother Guang was so pissed that he almost vented his anger. But when he thought of the task, he smiled and said, “Lad, please do me this favor. This is a small place, and it’s easy for us to bump into each other here. Don’t you think so? Pretty girls, I absolutely have no bad intentions. I’m just inviting you for a drink.”","As for whether Childe Zhao had bad intentions, he didn’t know.","“Just stop this. We’ll go,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“Sure, let’s go.” Mengmeng naturally did not care about it.","She felt bored and had nothing to do, so she thought that it wouldn’t matter to go over there.","“Mengmeng.”","Zheng Dan’s face tensed up. She came over and whispered, “Perhaps we shouldn’t go there. It’s too dangerous.”","“It’s okay. It just so happens that someone is treating us to lunch. Let’s go. Don’t worry.” Mengmeng pulled the others forward.","They followed her in a daze.","If she was not powerful, her behavior would be considered courting death. But for Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao, this was just a small game.","“Thank you. Thank you, ladies. This way.”","Brother Guang breathed a sigh of relief and looked at the time. Fortunately, it would take him only half an hour to drive back.","Brother Guang said to his subordinates, “You guys take a taxi back.”","He drove quite fast. The five people took two cars to the club.","When they arrived at the club, they hurried upstairs.","Lv Zihan was very nervous since she got here. It was the first time she had come to a club. The decoration here was elegant and luxurious.","Due to the fact that the other party was a gangster, Lv Zihan was still very scared.","Zheng Dan was relatively calm. With Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao around, she was quite relieved.","Chen Yang felt troubled.","He looked at Mengmeng several times. He wanted to say something but stopped on second thought. In the end, he sighed.","He secretly sent a message to his roommate, “We’re at Allenore Club. I’ll call you later. If I don’t say anything, you’ll call the police immediately and ask them to come to the supreme private room on the fifth floor.”","After sending the message, he set the one-touch call on and put the phone in his pocket before he felt a little relieved.","The moment they opened the door and entered, they saw that the environment inside was very graceful, and there were more than a dozen people at the table.","The person in the lead was naturally Childe Zhao.","“Hey, Guang, you did bring them here.”","“Tut-tut, not bad. They’re very energetic and beautiful.”","“They’re surely pretty!”","“...”","These people were all full of comments.","Childe Zhao suddenly stopped talking. He was hesitant.","The owner of the Red Name Martial Club had high status and was also a member of the martial arts world. It was by chance that Childe Zhao got to know the martial club owner’s son, and he just got the chance to invite the owner here today.","The owner also liked young women. Childe Zhao was originally okay with presenting some girls to him, but he was a little reluctant to let go of such pretty girls.","“Don’t just sit there. Get the waiters to serve the dishes and wine,” Yue Xiaonao said directly.","“Hahaha!”","A few of the big shots immediately laughed.","“Interesting.”","Childe Zhao clapped his hands and said, “Okay. We’ll have the waiters serve the dishes and wine.”","He felt that it was about time, so they could eat first.","“Little girl.”","Someone looked at Mengmeng and said, “Your legs are really slender, thin, and fair. If you wear black silk stockings, you will be very attractive.”","“You’re such a good-for-nothing. You’re quite obscene.” Mengmeng looked at him with some disgust.","If the other party went too far, she would end the game.","“You’re quite mean, but I like it. Hahaha.” The person who spoke laughed out loud.","Gurgle!","Although these people seemed to be friendly, their momentum was extraordinary. Chen Yang swallowed subconsciously. He was very nervous. He saw Brother Guang sitting in the corner and flattering them. At first glance, he knew that many people at this table were even more powerful than Brother Guang.","“Will there be trouble day?” Chen Yang felt greatly troubled.","He didn’t know why Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao dared to come straight over.","But at this point, he could only carefully observe the enemy’s situation. If there was danger, he would call for help in advance.","Childe Zhao said directly, “My guests are here. I’m going out to get them.”","When he hurried out, he saw his good friend and the martial club owner.","“Greetings, Uncle Hong,” Childe Zhao said humbly.","“Greetings.” Owner Hong nodded his head.","“That’s enough with the courtesy. Let’s go. My dad is very easy-going.”","On the way to the private room, Childe Zhao said with a smile, “I heard that you like young pretty girls, so I especially got a few talented students from Westpam University for you. They are definitely good-looking.”","While speaking, Childe Zhao gave a thumbs-up.","“Who did you learn that from?”","Owner Hong shook his head with a smile and looked at his son. “It seems that you’re in a hurry to get me a second wife.”","Seeing that his plan worked, Childe Zhao was secretly happy. “I guess I’m about to get this connection!”","They pushed the door open and entered the private room.","Many of them stood up and greeted Owner Hong respectfully.","“Hello, Owner Hong.”","“Greetings, Owner Hong.”","They all stood up, except for Mengmeng and her fellows.","Brother Guang reminded them, “You should also get up and say hello.”","“Well, okay.”","They stood up and turned around. Mengmeng cupped her hands and said, “So you’re the famous owner of the martial club. Nice to meet you, Owner Hong.”","But when Owner Hong saw Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao, under the watchful eyes of the crowd, he suddenly gasped. Hiss!","His eyes rolled back and he fell to the floor.","It seemed that his legs went limp.","“What’s wrong, Owner Hong?” Childe Zhao was startled.","“Could it be that he has been faking his power? Is he actually weak?”","An unexpected thing happened.","“Oh my god, my god!”","Owner Hong kept patting his chest as if he were suffering from asthma.","He looked at Mengmeng with cold sweat and said in a bitter and anxious voice, “Eldest, Eldest Lady, I didn’t know. I really didn’t know you would be here. This has nothing to do with me.”","He looked so frail, but his words made everyone dumbfounded.","“What did Owner Hong just say?","“Eldest Lady?”","“Tut-tut, I didn’t expect to meet someone from the martial arts world. It’s so boring. You’ve disturbed our good mood.” Yue Xiaonao snorted, her eyes shining.","Smack!","Without further ado, Owner Hong raised his hand and slapped himself.","“I’m sorry...”"]},{"number":1475,"title":"Chapter 1475 Super-rich","paragraphs":["Chapter 1475 Super-rich","“What’s your name?” Mengmeng suddenly asked.","Her question startled Owner Hong to the extent that he started crying. He said, “I’m really sorry, Eldest Lady. It has nothing to do with me. I was just invited as a guest. I don’t know what others have done.”","When his name was asked, Owner Hong was so scared that he trembled and fell to the floor.","“What...” Childe Zhao did not know what to say at all.","Seeing Owner Hong in such a state, he was also very flustered and didn’t know what to do.","Zheng Dan was quite at a loss. Lv Zihan was in a daze and felt that Mengmeng and Xiaonao were so powerful.","The others did not dare to speak at all, including Brother Guang. Cold sweat broke out, and he felt desperate in his heart. “I’m doomed. Did I just trick Childe Zhao?”","“That’s so boring.”","Mengmeng glared at Owner Hong and took the lead to go out.","After she and her companions left, there was dead silence in the room.","“Dad, who, who are they?” Owner Hong’s son asked.","“Yeah. Uncle Hong, we...” Childe Zhao quickly squatted down and tried to pull Owner Hong up.","Smack!","Owner Hong’s face turned red and livid. He raised his hand and slapped him.","“Did you try to trick me and get me killed?","“Do you know who they are?","“I’m going to kill you!”","Bang! Bang! Bang!","The first round of beatings began, and Childe Zhao was beaten up miserably.","The others wanted to stop Owner Hong, but no one dared to do anything when they thought of his combat capability and status.","Two minutes later, Owner Hong clapped his hands and left with a cold face.","Childe Zhao, with a bloody nose and a swollen face, looked at Brother Guang and said without anger, “Fuck this. Beat him up.”","The second round of beatings began.","Brother Guang got beaten up tragically. Watching Childe Zhao and his companions leave, he turned to look at Xiaoman.","“Fuck this. If you hadn’t bumped into those girls, this would’ve never happened. I’ll kill you.”","The third round of beatings began.","Just like that, the party ended with beatings.","Mengmeng and the others were not too affected by this.","They didn’t talk much on their way to the restaurant since everyone was in shock.","After ordering the food, they began to eat.","Zheng Dan widened her eyes and said, “Oh my god, that person was so scared when he saw you. You two...”","“Well, I know martial arts. My family is a martial arts family, which is relatively famous, so the people from that circle are afraid of us,” Mengmeng said simply.","“So that’s how it is.”","Zheng Dan suddenly came to a realization, but her interest was piqued. “Mengmeng, Xiaonao, you are from martial arts families. Do you mean the real kind of martial arts?”","“Yeah.”","“That’s amazing. I was wondering why you were able to fight with the instructor at that time, Mengmeng. I thought it was very strange. I didn’t expect you to be really capable.” Zheng Dan said excitedly, “Do you think I can learn martial arts?”","“Sure. Do a horse stance for two hours first,” Mengmeng replied.","Her words made Zheng Dan give up her crazy idea. She looked at Chen Yang and made a face. “Forget it. We can’t handle a horse stance.”","“Amazing.”","Chen Yang nodded, but he was deep in thought while eating.","He didn’t light up the atmosphere, nor did he talk too much. He ate as usual.","After Chen Yang paid the bill, he smiled at Mengmeng and said, “Sister Meng, Sister Nao.”","“Hey? What’s the matter? Why do you suddenly call me sister?” Yue Xiaonao asked.","“The holiday is coming. I’m going home and I’ll bring you a gift.”","“You’re trying to please us for no reason. What are you up to?” Mengmeng snorted.","“I’ll tell you when the time comes.” Chen Yang laughed.","But he could not suppress the excitement in his heart.","A bold idea emerged in Chen Yang’s mind.","...","The last few days of the courses soon ended. And the one-week holiday arrived.","Almost all the students had gone home. Some liked to travel and planned to go sightseeing together with their friends. For example, Yue Xiaonao and Li Muen were ready to go to West Capital to have fun.","They didn’t even think about counting Mengmeng in. They guessed that this girl would go to her father.","As expected-","That night, Mengmeng disappeared.","...","On the beach of Havoron.","Zhang Han and Zi Yan were surfing. There were many surfies, and they were all playing in the nearby area.","Mengmeng appeared on a yacht. She grabbed a skateboard, rode the wind and waves, and chased after the two.","“Mummy!","“You two are quite leisurely. Now you’re even surfing.”","Zi Yan smiled and asked, “You’re on holiday?”","“Yep. I have seven days off,” Mengmeng said. “Where should we go to have fun?”","Zi Yan said, “We’ll spend our time here first.”","“Is there anyone who hasn’t paid the protection money? I can go and collect the money,” Mengmeng rolled her eyes and said.","“No.” Zhang Han couldn’t help laughing. “Don’t keep thinking about this. If you can’t stay idle, I heard that there are two Relics that you can go and visit.”","“Two Relics? What’s the level?”","...","“One is class B, and the other is class C,” Zhang Han replied.","“Okay. Shall we go to visit the class B Relic?” Mengmeng was more interested in Relics.","Hence, two days later.","On Alson Mountains, many members of the Radiant Sect were stationed there, preparing to explore the class B Relic.","Zhang Han and the other two mingled with the crowd. Their clothes concealed their identities, so they didn’t look obvious among the people.","They entered the Relic.","Surprisingly, it was an apocalypse in that world.","It was like a fragment of a continent with the ruins of a technological city. The sun was very strong, but it was far less powerful than the radiation in the ruins.","There was no one, only a ruined city.","There were also some ox-sized mutant rats and a small number of worms.","“It looks so weird.” Mengmeng looked down from the sky.","“This is what happened to a place after the war,” Zhang Han said. “It’s not so weird.”","“There doesn’t seem to be any treasures here.” Mengmeng glanced around.","“There are some technological products, which will be the treasures. If we can get a few complete ones, they will be of some use to the technology outside,” Zhang Han said with a smile. “But those things are not practical for martial artists. There’s no one here, and the place doesn’t seem to be dangerous, but in fact, it is not. There must be something wrong with it.”","As soon as he finished speaking.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","The sound of a battle could be heard from afar.","In a pitch-black building, many bats with three-meter-long wings flew out and fought against some martial artists.","Zhang Han and the other two toured around. There was nothing special about this class B Relic.","However, the significance of its existence, its past, and the end of its prosperity were all worth pondering.","After leaving the relic, Mengmeng had only two days left for her seven-day-long holiday,","Mengmeng, Zhang Han, and Zi Yan stayed together for another day. They went shopping, toured around, and tasted local specialties.","On the last day of the holiday, Mengmeng went back to school.","Not long after she arrived at the dormitory, Yue Xiaonao and Li Muen came back.","A dinging sound rang out.","Soon, Chen Yang called. “Sister Meng, are you at school now?”","“Shoot if you have anything to say!”","“Drop your lunch. I’ll treat you to something. I’ve brought some very special food over.”","“You brought something over? Is it edible?” Mengmeng asked.","“Uh... it’s edible. You’ll know if it’s delicious after you try it. Wait for me. I’ll be at school in an hour. Let’s meet in... our classroom?” Chen Yang asked.","“Okay,” Mengmeng replied and hung up.","Chen Yang was quite interesting and didn’t mind what others said about him. He would voluntarily ignore the curses. He was quite tough and popular among his classmates.","He always pestered Lv Zihan. Zheng Dan often communicated with him as a class leader. Because she and Mengmeng were roommates, Chen Yang met them more often and they gradually became more familiar with each other.","About an hour later, Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and Li Muen walked to the classroom.","They didn’t have a fixed class, but they had a fixed classroom that would be used for the morning and evening self-study.","As soon as they entered, they saw Chen Yang busying himself with work, while Lv Zihan was sitting next to him.","“Oh, my god.” Li Muen was shocked. “How come you two are together?”","“Yeah. Zihan, this guy didn’t bully you, did he?” Mengmeng asked worriedly.","“No, no.” Lu Zihan’s face was red. “We met at the school gate.”","“Hahaha.”","Chen Yang chuckled and said, “Please have a seat. The food will be ready soon. Have a taste of the special food I brought.”","Mengmeng sat down and asked, “What’s this? Ham?”","Four tables in the classroom were placed together, and an induction cooker was placed on them. All the ingredients were ready. The plug was plugged in, and some vegetables had been put into the cooker. The soup was poured in, and the ham as well as some other meat was placed on the top layer.","A moment later, a fragrant aroma filled the air.","“This is ham, a delicacy passed down from my family to my Second Grandpa. It’s been made with a special nutritious soup, and the ham smells very good,” Chen Yang said. “We’ll be able to eat it after a few minutes.”","“It smells good,” Yue Xiaonao commented.","It was a little special to eat in this way in the classroom. They waited for a few minutes.","Everyone began to pick up their cutleries.","“Not bad. It’s delicious,” Li Muen said in surprise.","“Yeah, it’s delicious.” Even Lv Zihan praised it.","Chen Yang smiled proudly and said, “What do you think, Sister Nao and Sister Meng? How does it taste?”","“Not bad. It’s pretty good.”","Mengmeng had eaten too many delicacies. “Not bad” was already a positive comment from her.","“Yes, it’s better than what most restaurants outside the school serve.” Yue Xiaonao nodded.","“That’s great.”","Chen Yang put down his fork and rubbed his hands. “Well...”","“What is it?” Yue Xiaonao glanced at him.","Chen Yang hesitated for two seconds and said slowly, “Since everyone is here, I’ll get straight to the point. “I feel that Sister Meng, Sister Nao, and Li Muen come from very good families. While we are in college, if we can start a business, our parents will probably be happy as well, won’t they? Look, my family’s delicious food is quite good. This is also the unique recipe of my Second Grandpa. The soup is made of the ingredients we planted in our hometown, and it takes more than a dozen procedures to make it.”","“You want to run a restaurant?” Mengmeng was stunned. “And you want us to invest in it?”","“Uh, yes, that’s right. Are you interested? You can ask your parents. If you’re interested, you can contribute the money. I’ll do the work and when the restaurant starts gaining profit, we’ll share out bonus.” Chen Yang was a little nervous as he spoke.","He had always had this idea, but he didn’t get to fulfill it because he didn’t have a chance. He didn’t know if it would work or not after he told the girls about it. Anyway, he just wanted to give it a try.","He asked for the girls’ help mainly because he had seen so many rich and powerful people fawn over Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao last time. He felt that the two of them were not ordinary people. They should also be rich.","“That’s a good idea, but have you thought it through?” Li Muen said, “Do you need us to invest in even a small restaurant?”","“I’ve made up my mind. I want to establish my brand. This type of food is called Bagna cauda,” Chen Yang said, smiling.","“You’re quite ambitious.” Li Muen took a sip of the drink and said, “If you want to establish a brand, you need to get a website, a trademark, and so on. Bagna cauda will be what your restaurant serves. Have you prepared a lot of necessary things such as market research, location selection, and pricing?”","“Not yet.” Chen Yang grinned and said, “I haven’t taken the first step yet, but I noticed that there is a restaurant on the commercial street on lease. It’s located on the main street and has a good location. There are some clothing stores on both sides. It’s a two-story restaurant and the rent is relatively high. It charges 70 thousand dollars a year.”","Chen Yang said seriously, “I’m also thinking about helping our classmates to expand their hobby in their spare time, such as working part-time as a waiter or bar staff. Zihan will be suitable. She doesn’t like to talk, so she can practice her social skills by working part-time in the restaurant.”","He didn’t mean to have Lv Zihan practice her social skills, but he wanted to help her make money.","It was not a secret that Chen Yang liked Lv Zihan, and he wanted to take care of her as well.","“Hahaha.” Yue Xiaonao narrowed her eyes and said, “You do have good taste.”","“What do you think? Please think about it. You can talk your parents into the plan,” Chen Yang said earnestly. “This is also an attempt of mine. If it succeeds, we will be running a business together.”","“Mengmeng, what do you think?” Li Muen was very interested in this.","“Me? I’m okay with it,” Mengmeng said.","Of course, she was okay with it. She didn’t care about spending money.","“Let’s invest together,” Li Muen said. “I, Mengmeng, and Sister Nao will invest in it. Chen Yang will do the relevant work. We’ll each have 25 percent of the shares. I think that’s a good idea.”","So it was decided so easily.","Chen Yang thought to himself that he had a keen eye.","He was also very happy.","“I’ve made a preliminary calculation. The rental fee is 70 thousand bucks, and the decoration will cost about 20 thousand bucks. As for the business license and the necessary equipment...”","However, before Chen Yang could finish his words, Li Muen said, “Why would you need our help for such a small amount of money?”","There was a hint of displeasure in her tone.","“If you want to do it, do it well. Get a nice and big restaurant in a prime location, and you need better decoration,” Li Muen said.","“How much will that cost?” Chen Yang was stunned.","“It seems that Li Muen also has a lot of money.”","“That doesn’t matter.”","Li Muen said, “You don’t need to worry about how much money you’ll spend. Not to mention Mengmeng and Sister Nao, it will be incredible if you can use up my money.”","She rarely talked about this. But now, when she thought of starting a business with Mengmeng, she was a little excited. She was quite enthusiastic about starting a business.","Chen Yang said in a daze, “That’s just amazing.”","“She said I don’t need to worry about how much money I’ll spend...","“But what about the money?”","Chen Yang thought of the essence of the problem.","He couldn’t do anything without money.","“Each of the three of us will offer 200 thousand bucks. Will that be enough?” Li Muen asked in an uncertain tone.","“I don’t know,” Mengmeng said,","Chen Yang was so happy that he almost fainted. “That will be enough. You’re not kidding me, are you?”","“Why would we be in the mood to do that?”","Li Muen rolled her eyes and said, “200 thousand bucks. Give me your bank account number and I’ll transfer the money to you first.”","Chen Yang subconsciously took out his bank card.","Li Muen tapped on her mobile phone.","Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao also tapped on their mobile phones.","Beep! Beep! Beep!","Upon seeing that the money had been transferred to his account, Chen Yang fainted from happiness and was about to lean into Lv Zihan’s arms.","“What are you doing?”","Yue Xiaonao glared at him.","Chen Yang fell to the floor instead of leaning into the pretty girl’s arms.","“WOW!","“I’m so happy!","“You’re really rich!”"]},{"number":1476,"title":"Chapter 1476 Making a Lot of Money Every Day","paragraphs":["Chapter 1476 Making a Lot of Money Every Day","“I’m going to start a business.”","Chen Yang was extremely happy.","He felt a little dizzy.","Although he had a plan in mind, it was not easy to carry it out. Everything was difficult to start at the beginning, and he didn’t even have the start-up funds.","But now, it had been perfectly resolved.","Chen Yang said with a smile, “Well, let’s sign a contract.”","“We don’t need it. You’ll just get the work done. I’m sure you won’t welch on our agreement,” Mengmeng waved her hand and said.","“Hahaha, if I turn out to be a deadbeat, feel free to beat me up.” Chen Yang laughed out loud. “Now we’ve finished eating, and it’s only noon. I’ll clean up the table. Shall we go to check the location together then?”","Mengmeng and the girls looked at each other.","“Sure.”","“We don’t have much to do in the afternoon anyway, so we’ll go check it out.”","All of them replied.","For the first time in his life, Chen Yang felt so happy while cleaning up the utensils. He put them in a bag and placed them at the back of the classroom casually.","“Let’s go.”","Chen Yang felt that it was the peak of his life to take a few beautiful women to study how to run a restaurant.","However, when he thought about it carefully, he realized that the girls behind him were all big shots.","After walking for more than ten minutes, they arrived at the prosperous area of the commercial street.","“This is the place I told you about. It’s being sold.” Chen Yang pointed at a storefront.","Li Muen looked around and said, “It’s a little remote.”","“It’s indeed a little remote, but a restaurant in a good location would be even more expensive. Moreover, very few people are after it, so we may not be able to rent it,” Chen Yang replied.","“Let’s go and check it out,” Li Muen said. “We can always spend more money on it.”","“I’m happy to hear that, haha!” Chen Yang laughed and took the lead to walk forward.","“This is a good place. It has floor-to-ceiling windows and three floors.” Li Muen suddenly noticed a steak house. It had three floors and was located in the middle of two buildings. Next to it was the pedestrian street. It was in an excellent location.","There were two such storefronts. One was a fast-food restaurant across the street, and the other was that steak house.","“I’m afraid we can’t get it.” Li Muen felt that it was a little difficult to get it.","“We can ask the boss about it. We have the money now anyway,” Chen Yang said. “This steak house is doing well, but it’s not like we don’t have a chance.”","He was bold enough to go straight in and said politely at the counter, “Excuse me, I want to talk to your boss.”","“What?” The receptionist was stunned.","“What is this young man up to?”","“Hahaha.”","Chen Yang smiled faintly, took out his mobile phone, browsed it, and clicked open a message, which showed the money he received. There were a lot of zeroes at the end of the number.","He looked at the receptionist and said, “I have a major business transaction to negotiate with him. Could you please give me his contact information?”","“Okay.”","The receptionist didn’t see the message clearly, but he knew that there was a lot of money. Maybe the boy did have a business transaction to negotiate with the boss. He couldn’t delay it, and he couldn’t call the shots, so he contacted the lobby manager.","“Hello. If you’re here for business, you can talk to me first,” the lobby manager said with a smile.","“There’s no point in talking to you. I need to talk to your boss.” Chen Yang shook his head.","“Sure.”","The lobby manager took out his mobile phone, dialed a number, and explained the matter in a low voice. Then, he handed the phone to Chen Yang.","“Hello.”","“Well, hello.”","“I wonder if you have any intention of transferring the lease of the restaurant? The price is negotiable,” Chen Yang said with a smile.","“The price is negotiable?” The other party smiled. “My steak house nets a profit of 100,000 bucks a year. Why should I transfer the lease to you?”","“Well...” Chen Yang didn’t know what to say. He glanced at Li Muen and the others, and shook his head, indicating that the boss was unwilling to transfer the restaurant.","“Why don’t we contact the landlord and ask him?” Chen Yang asked softly.","However, the person on the other end of the line seemed to have heard it and said with a faint smile, “Don’t bother. I’m the landlord.”","“Alright. Sorry to have disturbed you.” Chen Yang completely gave up on the idea.","But unexpectedly, there was a sudden change.","“I can’t rent the restaurant to you, but if you want to buy the storefront, I can consider selling it,” the other party said.","“What? Buy the storefront?” Chen Yang was shocked.","Hearing this, the person on the other end of the line knew what was going on. He felt that the few people on the phone had the money to rent the restaurant but were not rich enough to buy it.","“Give the phone to me.”","Li Muen took the phone. She was indeed Li Kai’s daughter. She got straight to the point and said, “If we want to buy it, how much does your restaurant cost?”","“3.2 million, no bargain.”","“It’s too expensive. As far as I know, among the storefronts over here, a three-story restaurant like yours is only worth about 2 million,” Li Muen said.","...","“Haha, little girl, you need to take the location into account as well. My restaurant is close to the commercial street. It’s the best place in the college town. The market price of the restaurants that are in urgency of sale is about 2.6 million bucks, which is also in a hurry to sell. I’m not in a hurry to sell mine. The steak house brings me a lot of money. If the price is low, do you think it would be necessary for me to sell it?”","Li Muen was also a little uncertain. She cast a glance at Mengmeng.","Seeing Mengmeng nod casually, Li Muen made an “OK” gesture and said, “2.8 million, and we’ll buy it directly. What do you think?”","The other party instantly fell into silence.","Ten seconds later, the man said decisively, “If you really want to buy it, 3 million. If you offer a lower price, the deal is off.”","Li Muen made a gesture of three, indicating that the man asked for 3 million.","Seeing this, Lv Zihan stood still, for fear that she would disturb them.","Chen Yang felt that his mouth and tongue were dry, and he was quite dumbfounded. “Are these big shots so rich?","“Oh my god, they’re negotiating a deal worth 3 million!”","The lobby manager looked at them in confusion. “They are college students, right...?”","Under several people’s gazes, Li Muen nodded and said, “Okay, 3 million it is. We are in your restaurant now. Can you come here with the contract?”","...","“Now?”","The other party was stunned. He did not expect his restaurant to be sold so hastily.","“I will be there in an hour.”","After that, he hung up the phone.","He was not sure, and he didn’t have much hope for the deal. But it didn’t matter. He hadn’t been to the steak house for a long time, so he could go and have a look. He wouldn’t mind even if they were joking.","After hanging up the phone, Li Muen said excitedly, “3 million. The three of us can each invest 1 million bucks. It’ll be convenient for us to cast up the accounts.”","“Okay,” Yue Xiaonao replied.","“Dear sir and ladies, please have a seat. What would you like to drink?” The lobby manager’s attitude was very humble.","He was this close to kneeling to them.","The students sat at the table and ordered some drinks.","Mengmeng was drinking cola on ice.","She seldom drank fruit juice when she was not home, and no fruit juice could compare with the kind on Mount New Moon. However, she was a little interested in cola and Sprite.","Li Muen said, “I have less than 1 million. I’ll call my dad.”","Chen Yang almost bit his tongue when he heard that.","Among the three big shots, Li Muen was the only one who didn’t have more than 1 million in her account. As for the other two, they both had more than 1 million in their accounts.","“I have 0.6 million here. Each of you only needs to take another 0.8 million.” Chen Yang reminded.","“You’re not going to decorate the restaurant? You’re not going to buy the necessary items?” Li Muen looked at him as if he was a fool.","“Well...”","“You need to set up a company. As we agreed before, you’ll buy the restaurant in the name of the company. Sign an agreement with the landlord today. When the company is established, you can go and deal with the transfer,” Li Muen said.","“That’s amazing.” Chen Yang sighed in admiration. He had never thought of these things.","As he spoke, Chen Yang took out his phone and checked the process of the establishment of the company.","It seemed to be quite complicated.","“Dad.”","Li Muen said directly, “I need one million bucks. Mengmeng, Xiaonao, and I need to invest. We’ll run a restaurant together... Okay. Got it.”","She hung up the phone.","Li Muen made a face and said, “As soon as my dad heard that I would run a restaurant with you, he transferred the money directly without asking about anything else. He gave me 2 million.”","“What...?”","Chen Yang bit his tongue.","He almost burst into tears.","He had thought that he had stuck to a few rich people, but the girls turned out to be super-rich.","“Well...”","Lv Zihan sat there, feeling a little uneasy and unaccustomed. “Why don’t I go back and read?”","There was nothing she could do to help, and she heard that they seemed to be very casual about the money. Her idea was that it would take a long time to spend 2 million dollars.","“Just sit there and watch. This will be our restaurant in the future,” Chen Yang said.","“Are you up to no good again? Enough with that, you jerk.” Mengmeng snorted.","“I’m not a jerk,” Chen Yang said with a smile. “Besides, I won’t be up to no good to you, Sister Meng.”","“You’re so shameless.” Yue Xiaonao touched her forehead and said, “You’re an unbelievable douche, aren’t you?”","Chen Yang had always been like this. He was very talkative and seemed not to mind others joking about him. It was just that he was trying to two-time the girls he liked.","Moments later, the owner of the steak house came, driving a Lexus 570.","He was bald, easy-going, and dressed in ordinary clothes with a bag under his armpit.","Seeing this, the lobby manager immediately went up to him and took him to the girls in person.","“Nice to meet you.”","The owner was a little surprised to see Mengmeng and the others.","“They are negotiating a deal with me at such a young age?","“Perhaps they come from a wealthy family.”","The boss did not show any contempt. He took out the contract and said, “This is the purchase contract. If there is no problem, we can sign it.”","“Shall we sign an agreement first?” Li Muen said, “We want to buy the restaurant in the name of the company, which, however, has not been established yet.”","“Alright then.”","The boss changed the contract.","After a discussion, the girls paid the deposit. When the company was established, they would pay the rest of the money, and then the ownership of the restaurant would be transferred to them.","“Well, I’m looking forward to a fruitful cooperation with you,” Mengmeng smiled.","Although she was only paying for the establishment of a company, she found it quite interesting.","“Hahaha, right back at you. Are you guys available? I’ll treat you to high tea.” The boss laughed.","Since he could sell his restaurant, he could actually do a lot of things and choose more selectively with 3 million bucks. In his opinion, it was not a loss for him to give up the deal of making hundreds of thousands of bucks a year. He could even make a small profit by selling the steak house.","Back then, he had only spent 0.8 million dollars to buy this storefront.","“We won’t be having high tea. We still need to set up our company,” Mengmeng said.","The boss was very practical and took the initiative to say, “It will take at least nearly a month to set up a company. How about this? The staff can’t get another job in a short time. Can you keep them for a week or two? The steak house will continue to operate, and the turnover will be yours. You will also give the guys time to find a new job.”","“Sure.” Mengmeng, of course, was okay with it and nodded.","“Thank you, boss.” The lobby manager and a few waiters were very touched since the boss respected them.","Not every boss had a bad temper.","“I’m going to Fralop this month and will be back in about three weeks,” the boss said.","“We should be done with the establishment in a week,” Mengmeng said.","“Can it be done so soon?” The boss was stunned, but then he remembered that they might have a way out, so he said, “Well, I’ll wait for you here first.”","“...”","After a few simple words, Mengmeng and the others said goodbye and left.","“One week is too short.”","Li Muen said, “But that’s not a problem for Mengmeng.”","“I think so,” Mengmeng said. “I’ll ask about it first.”","“Wow, Mengmeng has so many connections.” Chen Yang said timidly, “I feel like I’ve gotten to know a big shot.”","“It’s too late to flatter me now.” Mengmeng rolled her eyes and said, “You’re already a jerk to me. Don’t always pester Zihan.”","“Representative, Representative is not a jerk,” Lv Zihan whispered.","Her words made Mengmeng’s mouth twitch.","The others burst into laughter, especially Chen Yang, who was laughing happily.","“It’ll be too late by the time you realize that he’s a jerk.” Yue Xiaonao said bitterly, “Why do you acting like a silly sweet girl?”","“I...” Lv Zihan’s face turned red, “I’m not silly.”","Chen Yang chuckled and said, “We’re just friends. Don’t misunderstand us.”","He wasn’t sure what to do.","“Why do I feel that I have to get Mengmeng’s permission if I want to woo Zihan?","“However, it seems that they won’t agree.","“I still have a long way to go.","“I’m just a sentimental man, not a jerk.”","Chen Yang thought about it happily.","He didn’t think much about this cooperation. It was good to make money, but he felt that it was just the first bucket of gold in his life.","“Grandpa.”","Mengmeng dialed a number and asked, “Do you have Ye Tianlang’s contact information?”","“Yes. What’s up, Mengmeng? I miss you. When will you come back?”","“I’ll go back in a few days.”","“Why are you looking for Ye Tianlang?”","“I have some business to do.”","“I’ll send his number to you now.”","After chatting for a while, Mengmeng dialed Ye Tianlang’s number. At this time, she was slightly more than ten meters behind the crowd, and her voice was not loud.","“Chief Instructor Ye.”","“Eldest Lady.”","“I have something to trouble you with.”","“Just name it. You don’t need to be so courteous with me.”","“I’m in the West Capital. I don’t know the director here. Can you give me their phone number?”","“Where are you? I’ll ask him to go there in person.”","“That will be unnecessary. I can just make a phone call.”","“Okay.”","The third call was made to the director of the National Security Agency in the West Capital.","The director seemed to be a little nervous.","“Eldest Lady, what can I do for you?”","“I’m going to start a company here.”","The director’s face was covered with tears. “It’s such a trivial matter. Boss Ye contacted me personally and warned me about it. My life is so hard...”","He immediately made the arrangements.","Less than an hour later, several Hummers arrived at the school gate. Mengmeng and the others got in the cars. The process didn’t take long, and they were offered the best service.","Chen Yang was rendered speechless by the fast speed.","In just three days, it was all done.","When the boss of the steak house transferred the ownership, he was also stunned.","“Your efficiency is too high.”","He felt that he had underestimated these young girls. They were definitely from rich and powerful families.","The company was called Flying Hero Catering.","It was a rather casual name.","Chen Yang began to get busy with his work.","The class representative had begun to skip class.","When he got out to run errands, it would take him an entire day.","He would go to the market and do research.","The restaurant couldn’t serve just one kind of food. They needed to offer pizzas, lobsters, and some other kinds of delicacies.","The menu was initially set.","The steak house was still open, but after the boss was replaced, almost all the original waiters stayed.","Chen Yang ran back and forth to make arrangements.","Although he was tired, he felt that it was particularly meaningful.","Finally, after the second week.","In the teaching building, Counselor Hou was helpless and said, “Chen Yang, you are the class representative. How many classes have you skipped recently?”","“Counselor Hou, I’ve been so busy recently that my legs almost broke down,” Chen Yang said with a bitter smile.","“What have you been busy with?” Counselor Hou frowned slightly. “Isn’t studying more important than other things?”","“I have my reasons,” Chen Yang quickly explained. “I, I’m just about to run a restaurant. I think there are some people in the university who are not very well-off and want to be frugal, such as Lv Zihan. I want to provide them with a part-time job.”","His words were imposing.","When he said it, he had such a noble and righteous aura.","“You’re about to run a restaurant?” Counselor Hou suddenly smiled. “You’re just a freshman, and you’re already starting a business? Besides, you can’t skip classes every day even if you run a restaurant.”","“You’re right. I’m done with my work. I’ll definitely focus on my classes this week,” Chen Yang replied.","“All right. I’ll let you go this time. Focus on the following classes and don’t fail your exams. As the class representative, you can lead the class. That’s all.” Counselor Hou waved his hand.","“Thank you, counselor,” Chen Yang smiled.","That was to say, there was no punishment this time.","Counselor Hou was also a little surprised. He didn’t expect that Chen Yang would start doing business after he started college life for only two months.","Counselor Hou thought it was a small restaurant, but he didn’t expect it to be so big.","At about six o’clock that night.","“Bosses, the renovation has begun today. This is the beginning of our legend!” Chen Yang patted his chest.","“A legend? It’s just a restaurant.” Mengmeng touched her forehead and was a little speechless.","In front of them, the sign of the steak house had been taken off. The outer walls were being renovated. They guys wanted to decorate the restaurant with some good-looking decorations. The floor-to-ceiling windows were very big, and the appearance of the restaurant had not changed much.","The interior decoration had undergone a great change.","The elegant environment would show off the restaurant’s classiness.","The dining area was on the first and second floors, and the kitchen and warehouse were on the third floor.","“We should place a piano on the first floor and a small stage for the resident singers to perform,” Mengmeng pointed to a place and said.","“Huh? How many seats would be wasted if we do that?” Chen Yang was stunned.","“We don’t need too many seats. The environment needs to be great,” Li Muen said. “This will be a chain restaurant. This is the first step of the brand. Once the restaurant becomes famous, we’ll earn a lot with the initial fees alone.”","“All right.” Chen Yang said, “I’ll get some guys to design it. We’ll try to set up as many seats as possible on the second floor. Will that be okay?”","“...”","After studying the layout for a while, Chen Yang rejected some of his ideas.","According to his thoughts, he could set up more seats in the restaurant, like how it was in the college canteen, and the customers would fill them up every day. How much money would that get him?","Every day, he would make a huge profit."]},{"number":1477,"title":"Chapter 1477 Opening for Business","paragraphs":["Chapter 1477 Opening for Business","It would take some time for the restaurant to be renovated and changed.","It would take at least ten days. It could only open for business after it passed the environment test.","However, Mengmeng and the others had already finished some trivial matters.","Mengmeng patted Chen Yang on the shoulder and said, “Young man, you’ve done a good job. You deserve a compliment.”","“Sister Meng, thank you for your compliment. It’s your turn, Sister Nao,” Chen Yang said with a smile.","Yue Xiaonao said, “Get lost.”","“Okay.”","Chen Yang happily left and ran to the Sci-Tech University.","He was still on a date with Ye Xiaomu.","Mengmeng, Li Muen, and Yue Xiaonao were about to go shopping.","Unexpectedly, Mengmeng got a call.","“Mengmeng, our club’s activity will be held in the square at eight o’clock.”","“Okay.”","Mengmeng responded and said to the girls next to her, “Our club is having an activity.”","They signed up for the same club. To be exact, one of the clubs that they signed up for was the same, the Rollerskate Association, which was quite interesting.","Every day, there would be people hanging around in the square.","But it was the first time Mengmeng and the girls attended a club activity.","Back in the dormitory, they took out their brand-new roller skates, which had never been used.","There was a hubbub of voices in the square. It turned out that not only one club was holding an event today.","From a distance, a large loudspeaker box could be seen. There were people from the dance club gathered there, and there were people playing badminton and taking a walk.","There were a lot of students who joined the Rollerskate Association, and many figures could be seen around the square.","Seniors were doing free skating slalom tricks.","When they graduated and left, there would be newcomers to replace them. This was the inheritance of the club.","But every year, there would be a few ones who were stunningly skilled at rollerskating.","Mengmeng and the others didn’t show off their skills here. They just played casually on the side and occasionally watched the dance of the dance club. There were many onlookers and cheers from time to time.","As a freshman, Mengmeng had just experienced the good days of college life.","A moment later, Chen Yang ran to the square.","He came to the girls.","“I have the publicity plan now.”","“Just do it then. Aren’t you also one of the bosses?” Mengmeng asked in confusion.","She felt that he didn’t need to discuss anything with them.","“Alright.”","Chen Yang said, “I’ve invited my Second Grandpa to work in the restaurant for a period. The chefs have also signed a contract. Recently, they have been studying the recipes for roasted ham and other delicacies...","“Have fun here. I’ll go back to the dormitory first.”","He didn’t stay long with Ye Xiaomu because he was busy with the restaurant’s affairs.","It could be said that he had put in a lot of effort.","“Mengmeng, so you can also rollerskate. That’s amazing.”","A few female students passed by and greeted Mengmeng.","As for the students, no one knew Mengmeng’s family background. They all treated her like an ordinary classmate.","This was also something that Mengmeng and the others were willing to see.","Chen Yang and Lv Zihan knew that Mengmeng was rich, but Chen Yang wouldn’t tell anyone about it. Lv Zihan wouldn’t say anything either since she was introverted.","As for Zheng Dan, she had just joined the Student Union and was usually busy with relevant affairs.","On this day, in the square under the night sky.","The rollerskate club was the most eye-catching, not because Mengmeng and the others were there, but because there were too many members.","The members had all kinds of falling postures, and many of the students were walking. Some young couples only cared about each other. They almost kissed each other, but they were knocked down by those who had just learned how to do a fancy trick.","There were also many unexpected situations.","This was what ordinary and fascinating college life was like.","Two weeks passed in a flash.","In the past two weeks, Chen Yang had spent a lot of money printing a lot of flyers. He reached out to a lot of students who were up to part-time jobs in the university group chats and hired them to distribute the flyers on the commercial street.","He also reached out to students from six other universities.","Many people knew that the original steak house at the entrance of the commercial pedestrian street was now going to be replaced by the Flying Hero Bagna Cauda.","Some people saw it and said that the decoration was very grand.","And the price was reasonable.","The ordinary kind of Bagna cauda cost 32 bucks. A portion was more than enough for two people and even three people.","...","There were also all kinds of different delicacies.","Many people were eager to have a try.","On this day.","“The inspection is over. We can open for business now.”","Chen Yang looked at the sign covered by the red gauze and smiled at Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and Li Muen next to him.","“Congratulations, Boss Chen.” Li Muen joked with a smile.","“Haha, you’re the big bosses,” Chen Yang said. “I’ve planned it out. I’ll say that I’ve been hired as a part-time manager here. As for who the boss is, I won’t tell the others. You can be invisible tycoons at ease.”","As Chen Yang spoke, there was a strange look in his eyes.","“You seem to be up to something,” Mengmeng suddenly said.","“No, no, absolutely not.” Chen Yang continued, “We’ll also hire a few part-time students. I’ve told Zihan that she will work part-time here from six p.m. to ten p.m. every Monday, Wednesday, and Friday. Her salary will be 400 bucks a month. I’m afraid that she won’t take the money if I offer her too much.”","“Okay.”","...","Mengmeng thought for a moment and finally nodded.","Indeed, helping was a good thing, but going too far would not end up great.","Chen Yang would go to Lv Zihan to hire her. Since she would make some money on her own, there would be no problem with it.","“400 bucks? That’s too little.” Li Muen said, “She’s one of us anyway. You should double her salary and get her a bonus or something.”","“Dear boss, she will only work here three days a week. It’s definitely not appropriate to offer her that much.” Chen Yang smiled bitterly.","“Why would she only come here for three days?” Li Muen was stunned.","Chen Yang’s eyes flickered and he coughed lightly. “As students, we’re mainly studying. We can’t waste too much time because of part-time jobs, so I will ask Zihan to come and work three days a week.”","“Oh, you’re right.” Li Muen nodded.","Phew...","Chen Yang let out a long sigh.","Lv Zihan would come to the restaurant to work on Monday, Wednesday, and Friday.","However, he told Ye Xiaomu that he was the manager of this restaurant and would be there every Tuesday, Thursday, and Saturday.","He planned to give himself a day off on Sunday, otherwise, he would be too tensed up.","“If Ye Xiaomu comes over on Monday, Wednesday, or Friday...”","Chen Yang felt that he could totally deal with it, and he would think of an excuse when that happened.","She couldn’t just have Bagna cauda every day.","It was impossible for her to come to the commercial street to eat and shop every day,","Chen Yang seemed to be in a panic, but in fact, he had figured it out.","Chen Yang said, “Tomorrow will be the opening day. Bosses, will you be here to show your support?”","“We’ll come over and try the food tomorrow night,” Mengmeng said.","“If it can rule my appetite, the restaurant will definitely be a big hit,” Yue Xiaonao said.","In Room 301 that night.","“Ahh, I’m so tired!”","Zheng Dan staggered in and said, “I didn’t expect to be so busy after joining the Student Union.”","“Isn’t this your dream?” Yue Xiaonao lay on the bed and tilted her head to look at her. “No matter how busy you are, you have to hold on.”","“I’ll hold on. When I’m a sophomore, I won’t be so busy,” Zheng Dan replied.","When she was a sophomore, she would only need to deal with the main affairs. Some trivial things could be left to the freshmen, just like how she was being treated now.","“By the way, there is a restaurant called Flying Hero Bagna Cauda on the pedestrian street. It looks very nice. Shall we try it someday?” Zheng Dan said, even waving the flyer in her hand.","Lv Zihan, who was reading a book, put down the book and was about to say something.","That was Mengmeng’s restaurant.","After thinking for a while, Lv Zihan didn’t say anything. Since the girls didn’t say it, she should better stay silent.","“I, I’ll work part-time there after school every Monday, Wednesday, and Friday,” Lv Zihan said.","“What? You’ve already found a part-time job?” Zheng Dan was shocked, and her eyes were full of surprise. “Lv Zihan, I didn’t realize that you were so awesome. You found a part-time job yourself. Nice. It’s really inspiring.”","“It’s... Chen Yang introduced me to the job. He... he’s the manager there.”","“Pfft.” Zheng Dan almost choked on her saliva. “Representative Chen is actually working as a manager in a restaurant?","“This guy is amazing.”","Zheng Dan sat in a chair, took out her mobile phone, and sent a message to Chen Yang.","“Zheng Dan, be careful.” Yue Xiaonao said, “I find that you seem to be a little interested in Chen Yang.”","“I guess,” Zheng Dan said casually. “I don’t mind having an ambiguous relationship with our class representative.”","“He is a werewolf.” Mengmeng looked stunned.","“What is the werewolf?” Zheng Dan didn’t understand.","“I didn’t expect you to be interested in him.”","“Well... you guys don’t get it,” Zheng Dan said with a smile.","“I don’t think Representative Chen is interested in you,” Mengmeng said.","“The electric shock of romance happened in an instant. Maybe it will come at some time,” Zheng Dan said. “Especially soul communication and eye contact. Think about it, affectionate gaze, blowing a charming kiss, when our lips touch, well... that’s when the electric shock takes place.”","“Oh, my God.” Mengmeng looked helpless. “You’re incredible.”","After that, Mengmeng lay on the bed, looking at the ceiling with her long eyelashes flickering.","“Dating someone?”","She was lost in thought.","She imagined that her boyfriend was a faint figure in her mind, following her back to Mount New Moon.","Then, her dad came from the top of the mountain. He came, and he came running with a machete.","Buzz!","The image was broken by the machete light.","“No, I really can’t think of anyone who can defeat my dad.”","Mengmeng curled her lips.","It didn’t mean that Zhang Han was invincible in the whole world, and there were some people who were more powerful than him, but she didn’t know them.","At 9 a.m. the next day.","For the first time, Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and Li Muen skipped class.","Chen Yang was used to it, even the substitute teacher was used to not having him in class.","Among a burst of cheers, the ribbon at the opening ceremony was cut.","The red gauze that covered the sign of the restaurant fell.","Flying Hero Bagna Cauda was officially established, and there was a publicity banner in front of the door.","For three days after the opening of the restaurant, all the customers would get a 50% discount.","Some people were watching the opening ceremony, and there were even a lot of them, but no one came to eat since it was only 9 o’clock in the morning.","“The first ten customers will get to draw a lottery. I’ve prepared some small gifts.”","Chen Yang pointed at a box on the stage on the first floor of the restaurant.","“I also want to draw a lottery.”","Li Muen’s interest was piqued.","“Please don’t, Boss Li. The gifts I’ve prepared are all small things. I’ll buy you some later,” Chen Yang said.","“But I want to...” Li Muen looked a little conflicted.","Swoosh!","Just at this moment, a noise startled Chen Yang.","“Sister Nao.” Chen Yang closed his eyes and said bitterly, “You’re so fast.”","While they were talking, Yue Xiaonao had already taken a prize box.","Inside the box was a gift.","“That’s interesting.”","Mengmeng also took a prize box.","“My turn.”","Li Muen did not beat around the bush. She simply took one.","“I’ll take one as well.”","Chen Yang threw all caution to the wind and took a prize box.","The four of them took the gift boxes, opened them, and found that they were all small gifts. After taking a few glances at them, the guys placed them on the counter.","At this time, there were nearly ten people in the restaurant, including the waiters, the busboys, the kitchen staff, and so on.","They were all previous staff of the steak house who chose to stay.","Chen Yang’s Second Grandpa was now in charge of the kitchen.","Chen Yang took Mengmeng and the other two to the kitchen on the third floor to have a look. The kitchen was very clean. Chen Yang’s Second Grandpa was wearing a brand new chef’s uniform and looking at the others.","“Wash it again. Make sure it’s clean.”","Second Grandpa Chen was meticulous.","“Grandpa, these are the shareholders, the big bosses.” Chen Yang introduced them to each other.","After the girls greeted Second Grandpa Chen, Li Muen asked, “By the way, if our business is booming, will we run out of our supply?”","“No, we won’t.”","Speaking of this, Second Grandpa Chen was in high spirits. “I didn’t expect that Yang could really run a restaurant. In our hometown, there are five ham processing factories, all of which supply materials to restaurants in various cities. The ham tastes very good. Some restaurants also serve Bagna cauda. But the seasoning our Flying Hero Bagna Cauda uses is unique and tastes very good. I have already informed three of the processing factories that they will provide us with ham. It will only take us a day and a half to drive there and get the goods.”","“By the way, we use rental cars to transport our goods now. The cost is relatively high.”","Before Chen Yang could finish his words, Li Muen said, “Don’t you still have a lot of funds left? You can buy two trucks directly. In the future, when we have branch restaurants or franchisees, it will be convenient for us to go back and forth between the restaurants with the trucks.”","“Really? Okay.” Chen Yang looked excited. “Then I’ll go and buy the trucks today. Haha, I can drive to my heart’s content. But it seems that I can’t a truck. I can only drive a passenger car. Let’s go and buy the trucks now. We will skip the following classes today. Plus the lunch break, we’ll make it back by the afternoon.”","“None of us will go with you. You need to get the trucks on your own,” Mengmeng snorted.","“Come on. I don’t dare to make the decision alone. Please come with me. We’ll be back soon,” Chen Yang said.","“Why don’t we go with him?” Li Muen thought for a moment and said, “Anyway, I don’t want to go to school in the morning.”","“Okay.”","Mengmeng nodded.","They walked out of the restaurant.","When they reached the first floor, Chen Yang looked at the waiters and said, “I haven’t trained you yet. You’re not allowed to chat in the hall. Go and clean up. There’re no customers in the morning, and you can rest in the back.”","“Okay.”","A few waiters walked to the back door.","Chen Yang took the initiative to say, “I’ll get us a taxi.”","“Let’s drive there. It’s too troublesome to take a taxi,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“But we don’t have a car.” Chen Yang was taken aback.","“Who said we don’t have a car?” Li Muen rolled her eyes at him with a smile. “Are you underestimating Sister Mengmeng’s power? Let’s go. We’ll show you.”","They walked to the opposite side of the road and walked into the community.","Chen Yang was a little stunned. “Do they really have a car?”","“This is unexpected. Do you guys own or rent a house here?","“Damn, if we keep going, we’ll arrive at the villa area.”","They walked into the villa area.","Chen Yang swallowed subconsciously.","He felt that he had underestimated their power."]},{"number":1478,"title":"Chapter 1478 You’ve Made Me Very Tempted","paragraphs":["Chapter 1478 You’ve Made Me Very Tempted","“Stop making a fuss,” Li Muen teased.","Chen Yang walked into the villa area, where the environment was much better than that of the high-rise building area because there was more greenery, and it was quiet, elegant, and luxurious. This was Chen Yang’s evaluation of this place.","“When I make money in the future, I will also buy a villa.”","Chen Yang thought to himself.","The crowd continued to walk in and arrived at their destination.","“This villa is so big.”","Chen Yang walked around the courtyard, looking around.","Buzz!","Just as he was looking to the left, a sound suddenly came from the right.","It was the sound of the garage door being lifted.","He looked inside.","“Holy shit!”","Chen Yang suddenly widened his eyes.","“Lamborghini, Panamera, Mercedes-Benz, my God...”","Chen Yang was stunned on the spot.","These luxury cars, which he often saw on TV or websites, were now in front of him. He felt incredibly overwhelmed.","This was also because he would not restrain his feelings. He wore all his emotions on his face. Some people would always appear calm even if they had mixed feelings.","“Don’t just stand there. Get in the car,” Li Muen said.","Under Chen Yang’s gaze, Mengmeng took the car key from the wall, pressed it, and got in the car.","“That’s a Bentley!”","Chen Yang got in the car. He and Li Muen sat in the back seat. As soon as he got in the car, he groped.","He turned to Li Muen and asked, “It’s the first time I’m in a luxury car. It’s so cool. What’s this function?”","It wasn’t strange for him to ask since he didn’t know it. Li Muen didn’t look down on him or be annoyed.","She was very happy to answer Chen Yang’s question.","“Boss Chen, it seems that I have to coach you...”","Mengmeng started the car and drove it out of the villa area slowly.","Yue Xiaonao was sitting in the passenger seat, quietly enjoying the scenery.","In the back seat, Li Muen and Chen Yang chatted, talking about what he didn’t know about the car.","Mengmeng followed the navigation system and went to the truck trading market.","It was about 15 kilometers away.","After chatting for a while, Chen Yang finally got used to the car.","“It’s both psychologically and physically comfortable to sit in a luxury car.”","Chen Yang clicked his tongue in wonder.","“By the way, did you rent that villa or buy it?” Chen Yang asked curiously.","“Mengmeng’s dad bought it at the beginning of the semester so that she can have a place to take a break or go to parties on weekdays,” Li Muen said. “Let me tell you, Mengmeng’s dad, Uncle Zhang, is very good at cooking. The dishes he makes are super delicious. Even though he always cooks for Mengmeng, and normally, others don’t get to try his cooking, I was lucky enough to scrounge free meals from them several times.”","“Really?” Chen Yang said with a laugh, “I heard from Ding Bing that Mengmeng’s dad is very handsome.”","“Of course, he is.”","When Mengmeng spoke of this, there was a trace of joy and pride on her face. She said with a smile, “My father is super handsome.”","“Your family is really rich. Right after you started college, your dad bought a big villa nearby and so many luxury cars. It’s been two months since school started. How come you’ve never driven the cars to show off on the street?” Chen Yang asked.","“She’s tired of driving these cars, of course.” Li Muen leaned against the back of the chair and said leisurely, “I’ve been to the garage in Mengmeng’s house where there are hundreds of luxury cars. I can drive any of them. When we were in high school, Mengmeng drove supercars to school.”","They had become associates. Although Chen Yang was somehow a jerk, his strength had been accepted by their small team, so Li Muen did not intend to hide the most basic information about them.","“This... I’ve only heard of it in legends.” Chen Yang was tongue-tied.","In less than two minutes, he was all smiles. “Well, I have an idea, but I don’t know if I should say it.”","“I guess it’s not something great.” Yue Xiaonao snorted.","“I think since you don’t drive these luxury cars often anyway, wouldn’t it be a waste to put them in the garage?” Chen Yang’s eyes were full of excitement. “I’ll renovate the parking spaces in front of our restaurant, and we can put those luxury cars there. It will definitely attract great attention.”","“What’s the use of this? Whether the restaurant is good or not depends on whether the food is delicious or not,” Li Muen said.","“We’ll have a taste of the food at noon. It’s definitely several times better than what I made that day. The taste won’t be a problem. You can park the cars there conveniently,” Chen Yang said. “You don’t get it. Luxury cars are particularly attractive to people like me. Even though they don’t belong to me, I’ll be in a good mood if I get to look at them every day. The cars will show that our restaurant is a cool place, and it will also make people think that some rich guys dine there.”","“Then you can find some time to drive the cars there,” Mengmeng said indifferently.","“Can I? You’re not lying to me, are you?” Chen Yang was pleasantly surprised.","He was telling the truth. If he had nice cars parked in front of the restaurant, even if they didn’t belong to him, he would feel great looking at them.","“Look at how envious you are.” Yue Xiaonao glanced at him and chuckled. “Mengmeng has agreed. You will drive the cars to the restaurant. You can also drive them in normal times.”","Gurgle!","Chen Yang swallowed and said, “Well, you have the insurance for the cars in place, don’t you? To be honest, I don’t dare to drive them, for fear of getting them scratched.”","“It’s up to you,” Yue Xiaonao replied.","...","“I have the insurance. Scumbag, you can drive to pick up girls. Don’t always hook up with Zihan,” Mengmeng said.","“I... Alas, can’t you see that I’m also sincere to Zihan?”","“Piss off!”","“Okay.”","Chen Yang stopped talking and sat happily in the back seat, feeling like he was at the peak of his life.","Chen Yang got out of the car and said, “We’re here. I’ll ask for some discounts later.”","After all, they would need to buy two medium-sized trucks.","However, he didn’t expect the girls to be so straightforward that they directly asked for the lowest price and asked for payment without asking for any gifts.","Chen Yang reminded them again and again, “We must ask for some gifts.”","It took less than two hours for them to buy the trucks.","They went straight back to the restaurant and parked casually in the parking space.","...","After all, the Bentley was very eye-catching.","To their surprise, all the tables were full.","They had already reached the entrance of the restaurant. The customers could get 50 percent off the cost of their meals. One could have a portion of Bagna cauda for only 16 bucks, and there was even a long queue in front of the restaurant.","“Well, there are two tables by the kitchen. Why don’t you eat there?” Chen Yang asked.","“All right.” Mengmeng didn’t mind it.","They went up to the third floor and saw the busy kitchen.","“Don’t rush it. Sanitation is our priority.”","Second Grandpa Chen was still meticulous. There was some sweat on his forehead, but he looked quite happy with the busy work.","“Yang, according to the current selling rate, we will definitely run out of the ham tonight. I’ve already contacted a guy to express send the supplies here, and they will only arrive tomorrow. You need to buy some ham in West Capital first and get the stuff here by three o’clock in the afternoon,” Secon Grandpa Chen said.","“I’ll get it right away.”","Chen Yang immediately went downstairs. When he saw the staff getting busy, he felt his scalp go numb. There were not enough waiters.","After thinking for a while, he came to a waitress and said, “Go to the wholesale market to buy some ham. It won’t matter if you overbuy. Get someone to send it over as soon as possible.”","“I, I, okay.” The girl was a little hesitant. She was afraid that she would not do it well, but this was also an opportunity.","“Forget it, I’ll go by myself.”","Chen Yang suddenly caught a glimpse of the Bentley outside and was eager to have a try. He quickly ran up to the third floor.","“Sister Meng, I’m going to buy some ham.”","She noticed that his eyes were fixed on the car key on the table.","“Okay, just go.”","Mengmeng casually pushed the car key to him.","“I’m a little nervous. How about...” Chen Yang said stutteringly.","It was the first time he had seen such a straightforward rich lady.","“No one will go with you. Go by yourself,” Mengmeng said grumpily. “Get out of here now.”","“Okay.”","Chen Yang took the car key and left with a smile. Before he left, he said, “Second Grandpa, will you come with me? I’ll take you to get a ride in a luxury car.”","“Get out of my way,” Secon Grandpa Chen annoyingly said.","How could he leave the kitchen when he was so busy?","Chen Yang left the third floor awkwardly and walked to the first floor. He left while shaking the car key. Under the gaze of several waiters, he got into the Bentley.","He enjoyed the envious eyes around him.","Chen Yang gently stepped on the accelerator.","He was very careful while backing the car and taking a turn. It took him three minutes to cover a distance of five meters. He was so nervous that he sweated profusely.","Fortunately, when he arrived at the exit, Chen Yang got the trick of driving the car. It was much easier to drive on the flat road.","“This sound of the engine is so cool. Amazing.","“It’s so strong and so fucking flexible.”","He drove forward for ten minutes.","Chen Yang was suddenly stunned. “Oh my god, I forgot to use the navigation system!”","When he pulled up at the traffic lights, he turned on the navigation system and then drove to the wholesale market.","Chen Yang knew the number of goods in the restaurant, and he bought a lot of goods. Since the restaurant had so many customers at noon, it would almost be the same in the evening.","It was almost two o’clock in the afternoon after he bought the goods in two wholesale markets.","“I’ll have to skip class again this afternoon.”","Chen Yang rubbed his forehead.","When he returned to the restaurant, there were still many people dining inside.","In the past three hours, more than 200 tables had been served and the turnover had reached 5,200 bucks.","This was achieved due to the discount.","It was also because of the discount that there were many customers.","When the discount ended, the restaurant would not be so popular, but Chen Yang was tempted while thinking of the prospect of the business.","“This is really fast money.”","Chen Yang parked the car and went back to the restaurant. He didn’t relax until three o’clock.","“Everyone, take turns to rest for an hour and prepare the ingredients.”","At the back of the restaurant, Secon Grandpa Chen was giving orders.","Chen Yang was reassured and went back to school.","It was five o’clock in the afternoon. Chen Yang didn’t plan to go for self-study after class. After thinking for a while, he asked for leave from Counselor Hou. He took the key to the villa, ran back and forth, and drove the cars to the entrance of the restaurant one by one.","“Boss, you have a lot of luxury cars. This is the first time I’ve seen a supercar at such a close distance.”","Some of the waiters looked back and forth.","“They’re not mine but our big boss’. By the way, don’t call me boss in the future. Call me Manager Chen,” Chen Yang said seriously.","“Yes, Manager Chen.”","Seeing everyone’s reaction, Chen Yang thought for a moment and said, “Ask all the waiters to come and have a small meeting.”","He told everyone to call him Manager Chen at the meeting.","After that, Chen Yang went out to keep an eye on the passers-by when he saw that they were approaching the cars.","Although he had surveillance cameras installed, he was still worried.","He simply stood outside for about half an hour.","More and more people began to come to the restaurant.","“Little sheep.”","Chen Yang went up to Ye Xiaomu with a smile.","“What did you call me?” Ye Xiaomu rolled her eyes.","There were four girls around her. Three of them were her roommates, and the other was her good friend.","“Come on, I’ve already reserved seats for you.”","Chen Yang smiled as he led them in.","Seeing this, some waiters even said with a smile, “Manager Chen.”","“Yeah.”","Chen Yang blinked at them and walked to a dining table with the girls.","They ordered food. The dishes were served.","Chen Yang also kept the girls company and chatted with them. He would occasionally leave for work.","One of Ye Xiaomu’s roommates said, “The cars out there are so cool.”","“Eh? Why do you have so many car keys?”","Someone noticed that Chen Yang had five car keys hanging by his waist.","“The cars out there belong to the owners of the restaurant. They just left the cars in the garage. I suggested that we drive them here,” Chen Yang said, winking at Ye Xiaomu. “I’ll take you for a spin tonight.”","“No need for that,” Ye Xiaomu refused. Furthermore, her expression had grown a bit colder.","Chen Yang did not know what the problem was.","“Are they girls?” Ye Xiaomu’s roommate asked.","“Uh...” Chen Yang seemed to have noticed something.","Could it be that the little sheep was jealous?","He said with a smile, “My bosses are three girls, and the cars belong to them. My Second Grandpa is highly skilled at cooking and was hired to work as a chef here, so I’m here to temper myself by being a manager, managing this restaurant.”","After the explanation, the look on Ye Xiaomu’s face eased up.","“Humph, you can’t always drive other people’s cars. When you earn enough, you’ll buy one for yourself, and I’ll take your ride by then,” Ye Xiaomu said.","“Okay,” Chen Yang said with a smile. “The cars will be parked here for the time being. I’ll drive them when I need to run errands for the restaurant. These cars belong to the company.”","“The company’s cars are all pink and not suitable for you to drive,” Ye Xiaomu said.","“The supercar is indeed a little feminine. I can drive the Bentley and the Benz,” Chen Yang replied.","“You’re amazing. You’re starting a business at such a young age.”","“Yeah. Ye Xiaomu always talks about you.”","“No, I don’t.” Ye Xiaomu retorted.","After the meal, they chatted for a while.","Ye Xiaomu suggested that Chen Yang send her back to school.","The two of them were at the back.","“What do you think our relationship is?” Ye Xiaomu suddenly asked.","They had been together for a long time, but this guy had never confessed his love. He was sometimes close to her and sometimes not, which made Ye Xiaomu displeased.","“We’re childhood sweethearts, of course. Haha, there must be a lot of people wooing you in your school.” Chen Yang changed the topic.","“There are.” Ye Xiaomu rolled her eyes and said, “I just joined the Student Union recently. There will be a party in a few days. Our minister has confessed his love to me.”","“Most of the confessions are useless,” Chen Yang said. “You need a romantic confession, little sheep, and not those scumbags who just talk the talk and don’t walk the walk.”","“...”","“You go back first. I have to go to the restaurant to check the guys’ work. It’s dinner hour now.” At the gate of the Sci-Tech University, Chen Yang said seriously, “Don’t worry about my studies. I usually work in the restaurant on Tuesday, Thursday, and Saturday.”","“Go ahead. Don’t exhaust yourself. I’m happy to see you make such progress. You’re different from before and have become mature. You give me a sense of security,” Ye Xiaomu said with a smile.","They talked like a couple.","However, Chen Yang had yet to confess his love.","“Haha, I’m leaving.” Chen Yang waved his hand with a smile. After Ye Xiaomu left, he turned around and walked quickly.","He ran more than two hundred meters forward.","“Zihan, over here.”","Chen Yang waved his hand and said, “Have a taste of the food today. You’ll start your work after getting familiar with the environment.”","Lv Zihan replied shyly, “Thank you.”","Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and Li Muen were standing next to her.","They were just passing by and did not intend to go to the restaurant for dinner. Zheng Dan and Lv Zihan were going to try out the food.","“And me.”","Zheng Dan said, “Representative Chen, you also promised me.”","“Alright.”","Chen Yang nodded and muttered, “I don’t know what you’re here for.”","“What do you think?”","Zheng Dan leaned back. Thinking that no one else could see her, she threw a flirtatious glance at Chen Yang, pouted her lips, and blew him a kiss.","“Ahem.”","Chen Yang’s mouth twitched slightly. “This girl is getting more and more out of line.”","However, Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao had both sensed it.","“Alas!”","Mengmeng sighed with exhaustion and said, “I’m telling you, don’t mess around.”","“Don’t worry, Sister Meng. I won’t mess with you,” Chen Yang promised as he patted his chest.","Mengmeng looked ahead, ignoring him.","She had Yue Xiaonao, Zheng Dan, and Lv Zihan as her roommates.","Unexpectedly, Chen Yang, a flaky person, had been after Lv Zihan while he had a childhood sweetheart at Sci-Tech University. Lv Zihan didn’t show any opinion about it, but Zheng Dan looked like she was going to hit on him.","“This is madness...","“What’s so good about Chen Yang? He’s just a jerk.”","In terms of his relationship with his classmates, Chen Yang was humorous, cheerful, and optimistic. He was outstanding. However, Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao had seen many outstanding talents before.","Even so, it was quite amazing of him to hang out with Mengmeng and the others.","“Well, enjoy your meal. We’ll have some cold drinks in the front.”","When they arrived at the door of the restaurant, there were still a lot of people inside. Some were lining up while seated.","Cheng Yang had bought a piano. The environment on the first floor was very nice and elegant. He was still hiring singers, but some people had volunteered to play the piano while waiting in line.","There were a lot of things that made the restaurant look nice, and it was indeed popular.","“Wow, these cars...”","Zheng Dan was very tempted as she looked at the cars.","She didn’t like cars, but she liked the wealth and vanity they represented.","“Let’s go. I’ve reserved a table for you inside.”","Chen Yang brought the two girls into the restaurant.","As for Mengmeng and the other two, they didn’t find a suitable cold drinks shop. Instead, they saw a cafe with a good environment, which was called Kooler Cafe.","They entered the cafe, sat down, and ordered three cups of coffee.","A man with slightly disheveled hair but an artistic air was sitting on the small stage with a guitar in his hands, singing a song.","“Hey.”","Mengmeng was stunned.","Upon closer inspection, she found that the resident singer was actually a martial artist.","“What is he doing here? Experiencing different kinds of lifestyle?","“He’s probably a Qi Strength Master.","“He would be quite respected among some influential families and aristocrats in the city.”","“His singing is quite good, and he looks stylish.” Li Muen said with some interest, “His hair is messy and sloppy, but it makes him look even more special. Isn’t our restaurant in need of a regular singer? Shall I ask him if he would be interested?”","“Just ask him about it,” Yue Xiaonao said casually.","“I’ll go to him when he finishes singing,” Li Muen said.","They sat there for half an hour.","The singer got off the stage with the guitar and received his salary.","Li Muen waved her hand and called out, “Excuse me, could you ask the regular singer to come here, please?”","A moment later, the singer came over with his guitar and said with a smile, “Hello.”","“Our restaurant also needs a regular singer. Would you consider our offer?” Li Muen got straight to the point.","The man was stunned.","He narrowed his eyes slightly, glanced around, and fixed his eyes on Mengmeng’s face.","“A restaurant owned by you three? If this pretty girl invites me, I’ll go.” He smiled and pointed to Mengmeng, saying bluntly, “You’ve made me very tempted.”","There was a sudden change in his aura.","It was as if the sloppy literary man had turned into a prince, with an extraordinary temperament.","It was as if he was saying to Mengmeng’s face, “I’m going to woo you.”","“Hmm?”","Mengmeng smiled, and a white light flashed in her eyes. The strong power overwhelmed the man.","Mengmeng dragged her voice and said, “What do you mean by tempted?”"]},{"number":1479,"title":"Chapter 1479 A Conflict","paragraphs":["Chapter 1479 A Conflict","Hiss!","The man gasped and felt his scalp go numb.","The way he looked at Mengmeng had changed. He had become respectful. At the same time, there was a layer of crystal sweat on his forehead.","He was afraid, afraid that Mengmeng would not let him off.","What he had just said was already disrespectful to an expert.","“Mi-milord, what I mean is that I’m admiring your beauty,” the man said with some hesitation.","“Huh?” Li Muen was stunned.","But she also realized that he was from the martial arts world.","“All right, you may leave now.” Mengmeng gently raised her right hand as if she were a king who ruled the world.","Of course, this action was quite similar to Zhang Han’s. After all, she was his biological child.","“Yes, milord.”","The man didn’t dare to stay any longer and quickly ran away.","He didn’t dare to stay for another second.","After he went offstage, a female singer replaced him. She sang very well and melodiously.","“Neither of these two singers is as skilled as Mengmeng,” Li Muen muttered.","“She has Aunty Zi’s guidance. How could she not be skilled at singing?” Yue Xiaonao shook her head.","Mengmeng pursed her lips.","“Mengmeng,” Li Muen suddenly lowered her voice and whispered, “I notice that you have a great body. Why don’t you try on some mature and sexy clothes?”","“Mature and sexy?” The image of a cosplay uniform Mengmeng had seen on the Internet flashed through her mind.","She couldn’t help but gasp and shake her head repeatedly. “No, no, that doesn’t work on me. If my dad sees me wearing those, I’ll be scolded.”","“How could Uncle Zhang bear to scold you?” Li Muen said.","“What’s that saying?” Yue Xiaonao suddenly thought of something. After thinking for two seconds, she said hesitantly, “Being sexy is not coquettish.”","“Come on.” Mengmeng smiled and reached out to pinch Yue Xiaonao’s waist. “If you like sexy clothes, why don’t you wear them?”","“Stop this. I didn’t say I liked those.” Yue Xiaonao quickly dodged.","“Hahaha.” Li Muen watched the fun and suddenly said, “Anyway, I want to have a try. Let’s go to the mall on the weekend.”","The mall that Li Muen was talking about was the kind of high-end shopping mall that sold international brands, which the stores in the university town didn’t have.","“Look, when we swim, we would also be wearing sexy clothes, wouldn’t we?” Li Muen said, “If we don’t go for sexy clothes, there are also some lady-style clothes. Fendi has a new kind of downy dress. It looks very nice. I think it’s suitable for Mengmeng. As for Sister Nao, she’s a little too curvy...”","“Why are you so dirty?” Yue Xiaonao was speechless.","“It’s time for you two to date someone. Which one of us will have a boyfriend first?” Li Muen’s eyes lit up.","She seemed to be looking forward to having a passionate relationship in college.","Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao said at the same time, “You.”","“Why me?” Li Muen was stunned.","“Mengmeng won’t do it.” Yue Xiaonao said methodically, “Even if she wants to date someone, Uncle Zhang won’t agree to it. Ordinary people can’t live up to his standards at all. Anyone who tries to hook up with her will be in danger. As for me, my Mr. Right may be squinting in a corner of some planet. Anyway, I don’t plan to date someone now.”","“Hahaha, you’re already planning the future,” Li Muen said with a laugh.","“It’s the same for me.” Mengmeng thought for a moment and said with a serious look, “Muen, to tell you the truth, people in our circle wouldn’t consider dating someone in their 20s or 30s. I’ve never thought about these problems. Anyway, I’m still young. It’s good to stay this way. I want to stay guided by my father.”","“But you can’t stick with him for the rest of your life,” Li Muen said.","“Oh, what if I can?” Mengmeng shook her head and said, “You know about the martial arts world, don’t you?”","“Shh, keep your voice down.”","Li Muen suddenly looked around and said, “I know about the martial arts society, which is full of strange people and strange things. My dad told me that Mount New Moon is the best in the martial arts world.”","Li Muen gave her a thumbs-up to show that it was number one.","“Do you want to join the martial arts world?” Mengmeng asked.","“Me? Can I? I can’t. It’s too hard for me. I’ll get tired in less than a minute while doing the horse stance.” Li Muen shook her head repeatedly.","She still remembered that Li Kai had communicated with her mother about this problem.","At that time, both her parents had the same opinion. They didn’t allow her to join the martial arts world.","But now, Li Kai’s attitude was relatively casual. He thought that it mainly depended on Li Muen’s opinion, but her mother still did not want her to enter the dangerous martial arts world.","“I think... it’s not that hard. But one can’t cultivate while lying down. Anyway, it’s not as hard as you think. Let’s talk about it later if you’re interested. If you want to cultivate, we can guide you,” Mengmeng said.","“You’re indeed my good friend. Boh.” Li Muen blew a kiss to her.","“It’s so mushy gushy. Oh, my God.” Yue Xiaonao couldn’t stand it anymore. She said, “Li Muen, I think you’re in need of love. Get yourself a boyfriend now.”","“Sister Nao, don’t slander me,” Li Muen said with a grin. “I’m not that casual.”","“If this isn’t casual, I can’t imagine what you will do when you do get CASUAL.”","“...”","The three of them chatted and laughed in the cafe for more than an hour before they returned to school.","When they passed by the restaurant, it was eight o’clock in the evening, and business was still booming. Although it was not full, more than half of the tables had been occupied.","“These two girls are helping out.”","...","Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao exchanged a look.","Zheng Dan and Lv Zihan had come here for dinner, but now they were both wearing waitress uniforms and working as waitresses.","The girls went back to school and walked around the square. When Lv Zihan and Zheng Dan came back, they happened to go back to the dormitory together.","It was ten o’clock in the evening.","They could vaguely hear the quarrels from another room.","“Muen?”","Mengmeng sat up, and Yue Xiaonao quickly got out of bed. “Let’s go and see what’s going on.”","“What’s happening?” Zheng Dan was stunned and quickly got out of bed.","Seeing this, Lv Zihan put down the book in her hand and followed them.","When the four of them walked to the door of Li Muen’s room, they heard the sound inside.","Whom was she arguing with?","...","Yue Xiaonao pushed the door open and walked in.","“Why are you quarreling?”","Yue Xiaonao cast a glance at Li Muen.","She was sitting on a chair, staring angrily at the long-haired girl on the right side of the window.","The girl frowned with an arrogant look.","“She pissed me off.”","Li Muen said, “There was once when we just finished swimming. When we came back, it was a little hot and we wanted to turn on the fan. She said that she felt cold and couldn’t stand it, so she forced us to turn off the fan. Today, I’m feeling a little cold, but she said that she found it hot. I couldn’t stand it. I can let what happened last time go. But you just can’t stop being selfish, can you?”","“Li Muen, why are you like this?” The arrogant girl reprimanded her. “You’re too selfish. Can’t you care more about the feelings of others? You go to other dorm rooms every day. I think you’ve forgotten where you live. Since you like being with others so much, move out then.”","The other two girls didn’t try to persuade her but just watched from the side.","Not only that, but the person on the bed opposite Li Muen also said, “Yes, we all feel very hot, but you’re the only one who’s feeling cold. Why don’t you put on a jacket? It’s just a small matter anyway, and you didn’t have to ask the people from another room to judge it.”","There was only one person who was relatively calm. She said, “All right, let’s put an end to this. Why don’t you girls go back first? It’s just an internal dispute in our dorm room. It’s not a big deal. There’s no need to make a fuss.”","She was going to see Mengmeng and the others off.","Yue Xiaonao and Mengmeng didn’t say anything.","The long-haired girl who had quarreled with Li Muen said sarcastically, “I’ve seen you wear a few famous brands before, but your temper has exposed your nature. You’re a bumpkin. I’ve seen a lot of rich people. All of them are gentle, polite, and modest. As for you, you have a terrible temper. I don’t understand what you’re thinking at all. I’m going to attend a gathering of the upper class this weekend. The people who will attend it are all rich young men and ladies. I need to stay in good health and can’t catch a cold. I’ll play golf with them this weekend, so you’d better be more considerate of others. Don’t be so willful.”","She just wouldn’t back down, and she was lecturing Li Muen in a high-profile tone.","“This is incredible.”","Li Muen was so pissed. She laughed and said, “You’re great. You’re amazing.”","“Hahaha.” Mengmeng clapped her hands with a smile and said, “It’s been a long time since I’ve seen someone brag so much.”","“You think I’m bragging? Hahaha.” The girl smiled faintly.","“Guys, enough with this. Just put up with whatever this is,” someone advised.","Smack!","Li Muen stood up and said, “Put up with this? The more I think about it, the angrier I get. If I take a step back, the more I suffer. This time, I can’t stand it anymore.”","“Can’t you go easy on her?” the girl said again.","Yue Xiaonao sneered and said, “Now why would she do that?”","“Hey, why are you here again?” the girl who got retorted asked.","She and her roommates seemed to have a common hatred for their enemy.","“Haha, take it easy.” Mengmeng waved her hand and said, “We’re not good people.”","“I’m so annoyed to meet someone like her.”","Li Muen said, “Forget it. This is the best you can do in this shabby dorm room. You three are all assholes. I’m not staying here anymore.”","As she spoke, Li Muen pointed at the girl who was arguing with her and said, “Ge Lan, you’d better watch out. You’re quite bold trying to get to know the people of the upper class with your crappy skills. Haha, I guess you’re indeed cheap. Mengmeng, let’s go.”","“Then... let’s go.”","Mengmeng glanced at the people in the dorm room. When they saw that Li Muen was about to leave, they stopped talking.","It seemed that in Ge Lan’s mind, Li Muen’s departure represented her failure in this quarrel and her fleeing in panic.","Ge Lan must be despising Li Muen inwardly. “I don’t need to chase after a desperate enemy. Just ignore her.”","“I can’t believe it!”","“She’s just absurd.”","The girls came to Room 301.","They said a few more words.","“Alas, she’s just a drama queen. Why would you mind her?” Zheng Dan comforted Li Muen.","“Last time, you said that you didn’t get to change your room. Do you want me to help you settle it?” Mengmeng asked.","“No, thanks,” Li Muen said. “Who will I swap rooms with? I think Zheng Dan and Lv Zihan are nice. Forget it. I’ll ask my dad to deal with it later. I’ll switch rooms with someone in my class.”","“Alright.”","“Shall we stay out today?” Li Muen said, “Mengmeng, Xiaonao, stay out with me. Otherwise, I’ll be scared.”","Mengmeng got up and said, “Well, it’s not too late for us to leave now.”","“Hee hee.” Li Muen laughed a few times, and she felt better.","“Go now. When the dorm inspector comes over later, I’ll just make an excuse,” said Zheng Dan.","After saying goodbye, Mengmeng and the other two left the dormitory and returned to the villa in the neighborhood not far away.","This was Mengmeng’s first time staying in this villa."]},{"number":1480,"title":"Chapter 1480 The Wicked Tortured by the Wicked","paragraphs":["Chapter 1480 The Wicked Tortured by the Wicked","In the villa, the girls chatted until midnight. Li Muen was so sleepy that she ran to a bedroom to sleep.","Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao were sitting on the sofa, leisurely watching a funny movie.","“It’s a funny movie full of nonsense.”","Mengmeng was lying on the sofa in her pink nightgown, lazily commenting on the movie.","“It’s not funny at all,” Yue Xiaonao said. “Tell me, where did Nina and Felina go? Will we never see them again?”","“Who knew? Alas...” Mengmeng sighed and said, “I haven’t seen them for a long time. I really miss them.”","“The winter vacation is in two months. We can go to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven to have a look,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“We have to make a trip there. Most of the guys have landed in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven. We should be able to find a lot of them there. Which realm are you in now?” Mengmeng asked.","Yue Xiaonao said bluntly, “I’m already at the Yuan Ying Realm Early Stage. I have my father’s help. It’s easy for me to make a breakthrough, but I can’t be compared with you. You’re the Heavenly Lord. Tut-tut. My breakthrough is the result of my accelerated cultivation.”","“I’ll soon reach the God Transformation Realm.” Mengmeng giggled and said, “It seems that I have to take care of you in the future.”","“Aunty Xue and the others are in the Four Great Sects on the Vast Heaven Star. Are the Four Great Sects very powerful?” Yue Xiaonao asked with a curious look.","Mengmeng pondered for a moment and said, “How should I put it... Their young disciples are very young. Most of them are in the Yuan Ying Realm. Most of their disciples are in the God Transformation Realm, and the outstanding ones can reach the Void-refining Realm. Generally, such disciples will become supervisors, protectors, and even elders. They would be promoted to be elders according to their merits. The powerful elders are in the Integration Realm. It is said that the Sect Masters of the Four Great Sects were at the peak of the Integration Realm a thousand years ago. Some people say that they should have reached the middle stage of the Mastery Realm by now. Anyway, they are elusive. Some people say that the Sect Masters of the Four Great Sects have all gone to the Silver Dragon Galaxy to look for their own opportunities to break through to the Tribulation Stage. Anyway, there are a lot of legends, but no one knows what’s going on specifically.”","“You’re already at the Yuan Ying Realm Peak Stage. According to your previous combat capability, you should be able to defeat a cultivator at the God Transformation Realm Peak Stage, right?” Yue Xiaonao asked again.","“I don’t know. I haven’t tried it yet. I just made my breakthrough recently,” Mengmeng replied.","“I’m so envious. It’s so easy for you to make a cultivation breakthrough.”","“Come on, aren’t you the same?”","“We can go out in two months.” Yue Xiaonao was looking forward to going to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.","“In two months, I will probably break through to the God Transformation Realm,” Mengmeng whispered.","“You’ve unknowingly surpassed Aunty Xue and the others. You’re too powerful.” Yue Xiaonao grinned, indicating that Mengmeng was a freak.","“I’m just like my dad.”","Mengmeng shook her feet and seemed to be in a good mood.","“Well, I’m going to cultivate. I can’t be left too far behind by you.”","Yue Xiaonao got up and walked to a bedroom.","Mengmeng sat there for a while.","“It’s boring to watch TV.”","Suddenly, the Heavenly Pearl appeared in her right hand. When she saw Zhang Han and Zi Yan together in Morben, she casually put on a sports suit and opened the Space Portal to go over.","“Hey, you’re here.”","Zhang Han smiled and said, “Have a seat. Are you hungry? I’ll get you something to eat.”","The couple was sitting on the open balcony of the hotel, enjoying the scenery.","“I’m hungry.”","Mengmeng said with a smile, “I’m hungry. I want to eat fried steak and foie gras.”","“They will be served right away.”","Zhang Han showed a doting smile. He walked into the kitchen, took out some ingredients from his Space Ring, and began to cook.","“Mum, will we go out during my winter vacation?” Mengmeng asked.","Many things were up to Zi Yan to make the decision.","“Sure.”","Zi Yan said, “There are still some people who haven’t been found, such as Xiaofeng and Changqing. We have to go and look for them. If we find them, Feifei will probably come back. There should be a lot of people who want to come back and rest. After all, they have been out for several years. They must be very tired after a long journey.”","“Let me calculate the time we’ll need for the trip,” Mengmeng said while thinking. “The Thunder Snake is very fast. It takes one day to go from here to the Lost Continent, and two days to go from the Lost Continent to the Domain of Seven Desolations. If we take the Ancient Road of Starry Sky to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven, we should be able to reach the Chu Family’s place in about seven days. It will take us ten days in total to go there. The round trip will take us twenty days.”","“You’ll only have two months for the winter vacation. It’s okay if you don’t want to go. You can stay here. We’ll go with Elder Yue,” Zi Yan said.","“Xiaonao and I both want to go to the Vast Heaven Star. Mummy, I’m about to reach the God Transformation Realm, so I need to be a protector, an elder, or something. I want to get an official position,” Mengmeng said.","“Wow, this is unexpected.” Zi Yan smiled, shook her head, and said, “If you want to go, just do it. It’s up to you whether you will take the courses the next semester or not. You’re now an adult anyway.”","“The trip won’t take too long,” Mengmeng said. “Well, let’s talk about it later. Anyway, we’re not in a hurry.”","After they chatted for a while, Zhang Han prepared a sumptuous meal.","On the balcony, Mengmeng had a delicious meal and went downstairs to hang around for a while before leaving.","At this time, it was already dawn on the side of Westpam University.","A new day of college life began.","For Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and even Li Muen, going to college was a very good experience. It was very relaxing.","Chen Yang, on the other hand, was extremely busy.","When the discount that lasted for three days ended, the number of customers decreased a little, but the tables would be full by lunch and dinner hours, and there would be a lot of people waiting in line.","It even attracted the envious or jealous eyes of many restaurant owners around.","In the beginning, everything was going well, but there was a problem after all.","Two weeks later.","“Bah! What the hell is this? How did you cook? There’s a fly in our food!”","There were six men sitting at a large dining table. Judging from their appearances, they were not easy to deal with. One of them, a thin-faced man with a small tattoo under his neck, slammed the table and shouted, “Waiter!”","...","When Zheng Dan saw this, her face changed slightly, and she said to Lv Zihan, “Go upstairs and get Chen Yang here.”","After that, she walked over and said with a smile, “I’m sorry. I’ll get the chefs to make you a new one.”","“There’s a fly in the food. How do we know if there will be another fly in the next dish? What are you thinking?” The thin-faced man was not easy to deal with, and his tone was cold.","Zheng Dan did not know what to do.","Fortunately, Chen Yang had already come down from upstairs.","“Sirs, I’m really sorry.” Chen Yang approached them with a modest attitude and asked about the situation. He also looked at the fly in the dish and felt that something was wrong. The kitchen on the third floor was under the supervision of Secon Grandpa Chen. It was very clean and there were no flies in any aspect. It could be said that there might not be a fly in the whole restaurant. Then, how did a fly end up in the man’s dish?","“Zheng Dan, get the chefs to remake this table’s order, and it’s on the house. We’re very sorry to have this happen, but the kitchen is really clean. If you don’t believe me, you can go to the third floor and have a look.” Chen Yang looked around.","It was also an explanation for the customers at the other tables.","“Haha, do you think an apology would be enough?” The thin-faced man sneered. “We can’t eat here now. We’ve spotted a fly in our food. How do you think we should deal with it?”","He was making things difficult for Chen Yang.","Chen Yang knew that things would not be easy to deal with when he met such a customer.","...","“I wonder if you have any ideas, sir?” Chen Yang asked with a smile.","“How about this? Come out with me. I’ll show you something.”","After saying that, the thin-faced man stood up and walked out.","Chen Yang thought for a moment. He then followed.","Walking to the side, where it was a corner without surveillance cameras, the thin-faced man said, “Give me 10,000 bucks, and I’ll drop this matter. In addition, if you encounter any problems in the future, you can ask us to deal with them. Of course, if you are not willing to pay me, maybe we will have flies in our food again tomorrow and also the day after tomorrow. Or maybe we can order some peanuts and drink some wine while staying for a few hours. I have many ways. It depends on whether you are willing to play along.”","“Is this extortion? And he’s asking for protection money?”","It was the first time Chen Yang had encountered such a situation.","In the past, he had heard from his relatives that when running a restaurant, they would always encounter customers who didn’t pay the bill, were hooligans, and so on. There were a lot of situations.","And now, he had encountered one himself.","“What should I do?”","Chen Yang thought for a moment and said, “I’m just a manager. I have to report this to the boss.”","“Whatever.” The thin-faced man warned, “Don’t try to play any tricks. If you call the police, you won’t have any evidence, but I can guarantee that you won’t have a good time. Understand?”","“Got it, sir.” Chen Yang immediately nodded.","“Huh.”","The thin-faced man took the lead and went back to the dining table. “Then let’s get another one.”","This time, they were no longer in a hurry.","Chen Yang, on the other hand, was a little dejected. “Should I tell Mengmeng and the others about this?","“They should be able to solve it, but with their wealth, they may also choose to give thousands of dollars to settle the matter.”","After a minute of consideration, Chen Yang dialed Mengmeng’s number.","“Boss, someone’s blackmailing us. It’s a hooligan...”","“Just deal with it as you see fit.”","Mengmeng’s answer was simple and straightforward.","“I’ll handle it as I see fit.”","Chen Yang’s gaze was fierce as he said, “Damn it, how dare you blackmail me?”","He was just about to call the police.","Chen Yang was a little surprised to see a group of people coming in. He was stunned and stood up to greet them.","“Brother Guang, you’re here,” Chen Yang said with a smile.","“Hiss, what are you doing here?” Brother Guang’s face was still a little swollen. When he saw Chen Yang, he was shocked and immediately looked around, for fear of seeing Mengmeng and the others.","“There’s no need to be nervous, Brother Guang.”","As if they were good friends, Chen Yang put his arm around Brother Guang’s shoulder with a smile. He pointed to the table not far away and said, “You are omnipotent. Do you know those people?”","“I don’t know them. What’s wrong? Don’t trick me. I’m already very miserable.” Brother Guang reminded.","His subordinates were usually very arrogant, but now they were afraid.","Someone even asked, “Is this restaurant the territory of that queen bee?”","“Yes. I’m the manager here, and those girls are the bosses,” Chen Yang said with a chuckle.","“We are not eating here. Let go of me,” Brother Guang said.","“Relax,” Chen Yang said. “It’s all in the past.”","Brother Guang said, “But my face still hurts.”","“The people over there came here to extort money. I thought you knew them and could talk to them. I didn’t expect that you don’t. It’s a pity that if you could do me a favor, my boss would definitely change her mind. Since you don’t know them, forget it.” Chen Yang let go of Brother Guang.","He felt that Brother Guang’s circle should be more powerful.","The wicked needed to be tortured by the wicked. If Brother Guang could deal with those people at this time, Chen Yang would have less trouble.","“Can it change her mind?” Brother Guang was suddenly tempted. “Really?”","“Of course.” Chen Yang gave a positive answer.","However, he thought to himself. “Who knows if it can change her mind?”","“Hahaha, those people are blackmailing you and collecting protection money. They are just some local ruffians and hooligans.” Brother Guang’s face darkened. “Let’s go and have a look.”","He took the lead and walked over.","Brother Guang simply pulled a chair over and sat down. He picked up a piece of ham and said, “Well, it tastes really good. Nice.”","“Who are you?” Someone’s tone was unfriendly, and he even wanted to start a battle with the beer bottle next to him.","“My name is Guang Meng.”","Brother Guang said lightly, “You don’t know me in the university town? Are you from here? Well, it doesn’t matter if you don’t know me. But you must have heard of Childe Zhao. Don’t tell me you haven’t heard of him.”","“You, you are Guang Meng from Veluriyam Street?” The faces of several people sitting at the table suddenly changed.","The two men who were holding beer bottles immediately changed their movements and touched their hair. They were scared.","“I guess you do know me.”","Brother Guang casually took a tissue, wiped his mouth, stood up, and said, “Let’s go out and talk. I’m afraid you can’t afford the compensation if we do it here.”","He and his subordinates deserved to be in the same group. Several of Brother Guang’s lackeys, who looked fierce, were even more ferocious at this time.","Some of them even put their hands behind their backs and pretended to take something.","Those people at the table were startled. “Are they taking out knives?”","Someone else said in a voice that was neither too loud nor too low, “Xiaoman, go and get everyone to come over here. Bring the weapons along.”","“Okay.”","Xiaoman fiercely nodded, and then he walked out with large steps.","Gurgle!","The ruffians were a little flustered.","Their chief was relatively calm. “Brother Guang, let’s talk things out. After all, we see each other every day.”","“Now you want to talk nicely? Do you know whose place this is?” Brother Guang didn’t really want to make trouble. He stepped on the chair and said slowly in a low voice, “Even Childe Zhao has to bow his head in front of the boss here. Who do you think you are? How dare you make trouble here? I still have some connections in the university town. My face has just become less swollen. If Childe Zhao knows that I didn’t manage this place well, my face will swell again, and I’ll fucking cripple the ones who make that happen!”","“Brother Guang, we, we don’t want to make trouble.” Cold sweat appeared on the forehead of the chief on the other side. He immediately got up and said, “I’m really sorry. I didn’t know this was your territory. We are innocent. Brother Guang, please forgive us. I’ll drink three bottles of beer to show my regret. What do you think?”","At this time, the man behind Brother Guang said, “Brother Guang, today is Xiaoman’s birthday. Since we’ve gone out to have fun, maybe we should spare them.”","They would use this excuse quite often.","“Well, since you all know each other, maybe we should take this easy. It’s not a big deal, and I don’t have to report it to the boss. Otherwise, it will be troublesome if she finds out.” Chen Yang was also smart. Seeing that it was almost enough, he gave everyone a way out.","“Are you really not going to tell the boss?” Brother Guang said in an uncertain tone.","“I really won’t tell her.”","“Okay.” Brother Guang nodded. “Drink these three bottles and we’ll let it go.”","Gurgle, gurgle...","The man finished three bottles in a row.","“I’m sorry, Brother Guang. We’ll leave now and pay the bill.”","The man drank so much that he felt uncomfortable. He forced himself to hold on and left with his companions.","They saw that in the distance, a dozen people were standing in front of several cars under the shade of the trees, eyeing them covetously.","“What a close call.”","“Cut the crap. Let’s go.”","“I knew it. How could the owner be ordinary with such expensive cars parked at the door?”","“Guang Meng is really awesome. He called so many people here in two minutes. Fortunately, they didn’t make a scene. Otherwise, the consequences would be unimaginable.”","“...”","They left in a hurry.","What they didn’t know was that what they saw was just an illusion.","“All right, all right. You can leave now. Thank you, everyone.”","Xiaoman waved his hand at the people.","They were just 12 college students passing by.","This trouble was resolved just like that.","It was quite a coincidence. Brother Guang and the others ate there quietly and left a phone number for Chen Yang. The two of them called each other brothers and were on good terms.","The daily business at the restaurant was also a main part of Chen Yang’s life.","But as the business stabilized, he didn’t need to take care of it every day. He hired a lobby manager. There would be a regular singer performing between 6:30 p.m. and 8:30 p.m. every night.","Flying Hero Bagna Cauda gradually became popular in the university town.","The restaurant’s net income for the first month was 46,000 bucks.","He took 40,000 bucks from the income, divided them into four equal parts, and gave them respectively to Mengmeng and the other two as bonuses.","“10,000 bucks a month. That’s amazing.”","Chen Yang was extremely excited.","However, Li Muen told him that after the brand was established, the membership fee would be the biggest source of income.","The membership price was set at 30,000 per year, and the franchisee would pay for three years at least.","Chen Yang didn’t know if there would be any franchisees. Anyway, he was very satisfied with the amount of money he could make now.","Time passed, one day after another.","On Christmas Eve, many couples were dating and shopping.","On New Year’s Day, the school held a gala.","Mengmeng performed in junior high school. The videos of her singing went viral.","When she started her college life, she was unwilling to go on stage.","Even Ding Bing, who had been promoted to the minister of the Art Department, had come to her five or six times. Mengmeng still didn’t agree.","She sat quietly under the stage and watched the show.","A week after the New Year’s gala, it was time for exams.","Many of Mengmeng’s classmates were a little nervous.","“I haven’t been studying hard recently. Will I fail my exam?”","“It gets very troublesome if you fail the exam. I don’t want to fail the exam either. I’ve been staying up late to revise these days.”","“I hope I won’t fail the exam.”","The exam was over, and the winter vacation began.","Mengmeng, Li Muen, and Yue Xiaonao took a plane and returned to Xiangjiang.","Originally, Li Muen had made a few party plans with her high school classmates. However, Mengmeng had something to do and was about to leave again, so Li Muen was not in the mood to hang out.","“Mengmeng and Sister Nao have something to do, so I won’t go. I’ll go to Fralop with my mum. Let’s get together at the end of the vacation.”","In the end, she didn’t get to have a party with her previous classmates.","Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao were on Mount New Moon now.","Yue Wuwei’s family, Zhang Han’s family, Zhang Guangyou, Rong Jiali, and a few others were all ready to go to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.","“Lili, Liang Hao.”","Zhang Han said, “You will stay here this time. Even if you encounter the previous kind of suppression, you know how to activate the Heaven-earth Formation since I’ve taught you. Look after the place.”","“We get it. You can go now.” Zhang Li waved her hand.","Zhang Han did that mainly to prevent the previous situation.","Although the ancient martial arts world could not be opened for the time being, no one knew if there would be another vicious powerful force.","According to Yue Wuwei, the probability of that happening was less than one in 10,000.","What Zhang Han did was just to guard against the unexpected.","“Goodbye, Aunty Lili. Goodbye, everyone.”","Mengmeng waved at the others. The crowd got on the aircraft and left.","They set off for the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven again."]},{"number":1481,"title":"Chapter 1481 Unrestrained","paragraphs":["Chapter 1481 Unrestrained","“Brother Han!","“Oh my god, Brother Han, I finally get to see you.”","Chen Changqing was excited when he saw Zhang Han.","“Master.”","Zhao Feng and the others also went over to say hello with emotion.","Grand Master Chu, Old Taoist Honghu, and Taoist Lord of Azurepeak had been standing guard over the Chu Family’s place in the Heavenly Double Star this entire time.","In fact, Old Taoist Honghu and Taoist Lord of Azurepeak didn’t even care about their own sects.","What they wanted the most was to reach the Tribulation Stage, so they stayed here to help out.","The effect was obvious.","Now, more than eighty percent of the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven had been scanned by them. Almost everyone knew about the bounty.","“Where have you been in the past three years?” Zhang Han asked strangely.","“Well...”","Chen Changqing said in an embarrassed tone, “Xiaofeng and I have been digging the crystal stone mine.”","Zhang Han was speechless.","“We were directly teleported to the mine. Fortunately, Ye Longyuan went to fight against the enemy, so we followed him out. Master, this is the one million crystal stones that Ye Longyuan gave you. He said that he would continue to owe you. As usual, he will double the debt when he breaks through a small realm,” Zhao Feng said.","Everyone was slightly stunned when they heard this.","“Is Ye Longyuan addicted to owing money?”","“Elder Sister Yan, take us back now. I want to go back.” Zhou Fei, Zi Yan, and the others were talking at the back.","Even Liang Mengqi couldn’t help nodding. “I also want to go back. I miss lying on the beach and basking in the sun.”","Zi Yan replied with a smile, “We’ll be back in a few months.”","“It’s good that you’re all here.”","Zhang Han glanced around and said, “There are still a small number of people whose whereabouts I don’t know. However, this kind of thing can only be left to fate. Judging from your auras, each of you has your own fate. Tomorrow, we are going to the Vast Heaven Star to travel in the Four Great Sects.”","“I’d love that. I’ve had enough rest,” Chen Changqing said with a smile. “Mu Xue and the others are in the Four Great Sects and are doing quite well now.”","“It’s time to get busy.” Zhao Feng’s eyes were also full of fighting spirit.","The two of them came to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven either to mine or to rest in the Chu Family’s place.","Their experience was not as exciting as those who were on the Vast Heaven Star.","“If you’re going, you can take the assessment right now. The Radiant Institute of the Heavenly Double Star has dozens of spots, and you can go there as disciples of the Radiant Institute.” Grand Master Chu suggested.","“Okay.”","Zhang Han nodded when he heard that.","After all, he had a conflict with Taoist Heavenlight before. He didn’t go to the Heavenly Twin Stars to make trouble on purpose this time. Mengmeng disguised herself as a man in the name of Zhang Hanyang when she was there before. She could dress normally now. As for Zhang Han, he used the name Ye Feng in the Crimson Sunglow Sect and the name Zhang Hanyang in the Ling Sea Sword Sect. It didn’t matter what name he used when he went back this time.","The crowd finally decided to go to the Vast Heaven Star. In the evening, they would get ready and set off.","A dozen people, including Zhang Han, Zi Yan, Mengmeng, Chen Changqing, Zhao Feng, and Yue Xiaonao, went to the Vast Heaven Star.","The others would stay here for the time being.","Early the next morning.","The Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute personally led the team to the side of the Beast Overlooking Peak by aircraft.","“Brother Zhang.”","The Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute cupped his hands and said politely, “I’ve prepared your tokens and also your identity information.”","He gave out the tokens.","Many disciples of the Radiant Institute looked at this group of people curiously. Even the Sect Leader had to entertain them in person. It seemed that they had a very powerful background.","The crowd got on the spaceship and headed for the Vast Heaven Star.","“Our Radiant Institute is a subsidiary sect of the Ling Sea Sword Sect, so we can only go to the Vast Wood Star.”","“The Vast Wood Star is very big. The subsidiary forces have dozens of places to take the assessment every year. If you pass the test, you can directly become an inner-door disciple. But if you fail, you’ll need to go back and continue to cultivate. The test is very strict.”","“...”","It was the Ling Sea Sword Sect again.","Zhang Han didn’t expect that by the two times he came here, he went to the Ling Sea Sword Sect. It seemed that they were fated.","The crowd arrived at the Vast Wood Star.","The examination venue was different from that where Zhang Han went last time.","They had now arrived at an internal examination area, located in a mountain range in the center of a continent.","The exam venue was very modern.","There were a lot of people here, all of whom were sent by the subsidiary sects of the Ling Sea Sword Sect.","Most of them were led by the Sect Leaders.","From this, it could be seen that all the Sect Leaders attached great importance to the assessment of the Ling Sea Sword Sect.","In truth, this was also related to how many cultivation resources their sects had to hand in. The more people passed the trial, the less commission they would have to pay. Every sect wanted their disciples, as many as possible, to pass the trial.","As for the assessment, it was great learning. All the Sect Leaders had to treat it with caution, so they came in person. Even if some were busy, they would ask important elders to come over.","...","Tens of thousands of people were gathered in a huge square.","There were eight passageways that led to the eight gates of the great hall.","It was very magnificent.","Most of the people present were young disciples who wanted to take the exam. At this time, they were all nervous and excited.","“I’m Li Kun, the protector of the left wing of the Sword Sect. The assessment begins now. All the major sects, please line up and follow the order.”","A middle-aged man in grey was levitating in the air. After he finished speaking, he landed on the platform above the hall.","He was an examiner and would supervise the entire scene. He didn’t need to go up himself.","Protector Li Kun’s subordinates, as well as some chief supervisors, were responsible for eight assessment sites.","The assessment had begun.","“I wonder what the assessment is about,” Chen Changqing said with curiosity.","“I’ve told you that it’s very simple. I estimate that Chen Chuan can also pass the exam with his aptitude,” the Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute said with a smile.","...","“He’s too young. When he grows up, he can come to the Four Great Sects for training.” Chen Changqing couldn’t help laughing.","He and the Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute were acquaintances.","Chen Chuan had gone to the Radiant Institute to study and cultivate. He had caused quite a stir. But this boy didn’t know that Mengmeng had come. If he knew, he would definitely make a scene to come over.","“Yes, he can do that in a few years.” The Sect Master of the Radiant Institute smiled as he replied.","However, things changed faster than they had planned. When Chen Chuan grew up, there would be no more Four Great Sects on the Vast Heaven Star.","There were eight long teams in the huge bluestone square.","Each sect had its own team. There were too many people in line, and there were sects arriving one after another. Although it take only about ten minutes for each sect to finish the exam, it seemed that it would take a few days for the whole test to be over.","In this way, everyone started a long wait.","They waited for a day and a night.","There was only one team before the team of the Radiant Institute.","In front of the huge door stood a dozen inner-door disciples. There were a few supervisors patrolling, and inside was the examination field.","“I just found out that the team in front of us is Flower Fragrance Pavilion. No wonder there are so many women. Their leader should be the mysterious First Elder.”","The head of the Radiant Institute clicked his tongue in wonder.","“Is Flower Fragrance Pavilion very powerful?” a disciple asked curiously.","“It should be said that it’s quite special. Most of the people from the Flower Fragrance Pavilion are women, but there are also male disciples. It’s a sect full of Cultivational Partners. Before cultivating, the disciples have to find their own Cultivational Partners and do Pair Cultivation. It’s said that they cultivate very fast.” The Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute said, “It belongs to the second echelon of the subordinate forces of the Ling Sea Sword Sect.”","“Its subordinate forces are divided into different echelons?” Mengmeng was stunned after hearing that.","“Of course.” The Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute shook his head and sighed softly. “The subsidiary sects are divided into a total of four echelons. The sects in the first echelon are all very powerful. They are well-known in the Astral Domain. The second echelon may not be very powerful, but their strength is very strong. The third echelon is second to the second echelon, and the fourth echelon is made up of small sects.”","“Which echelon is the Radiant Institute in?” Mengmeng asked again.","“Uh...” The Sect Leader’s face was a little stiff, and he said hesitantly, “We’re close to the third echelon.”","Everyone was stunned by his words.","“It means that it belongs to the fourth echelon, doesn’t it?”","The Sect Leader laughed and said, “There are also differences in the strength of the sects of the fourth echelon. Our Radiant Institute is at the top of the fourth echelon.”","While they were talking-","Swoosh!","Some people suddenly came from the side.","Were they cutting in line?","There were about a hundred of them, and it was a mighty group.","They went straight to the front of Flower Fragrance Pavilion.","The Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute said in a low voice, “They are from the Ice and Fire Sect. It belongs to the first echelon of the subsidiary sects.”","“Can they cut in line directly just because they’re in the first echelon?” Mengmeng asked.","“Well, it isn’t clear. According to the strict rules, it seems that they can’t do that, but Protector Li Kun, who is in charge, doesn’t care about it. So be it,” the Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute said with a wry smile.","They looked left and right. The Ice and Fire Sect seemed to be the first of the first echelon that had arrived.","There were people from the first echelon cutting in line in each of the eight passages.","The people from the Flower Fragrance Pavilion didn’t say anything. They silently watched as the trial ended. The Ice and Fire Sect’s disciples went in to take the trial first.","Before the people of the Ice and Fire Sect finished the exam, another first-echelon sect arrived and stood in front of the Flower Fragrance Pavilion’s team.","When the assessment inside was over, they went straight in.","After that, it was time for the Flower Fragrance Pavilion’s assessment.","Standing outside the door, one could also watch the examination inside.","Mengmeng glanced at it and said, “It’s just a battle? It’s very simple.”","After the crowd watched it for a while, three teams came from the right side in succession.","On behalf of three first-echelon sects, they chatted with each other and walked over, laughing.","Mengmeng saw this and frowned slightly.","“Why are so many people cutting in line?”","Something even more outrageous happened.","“Retreat a hundred meters. Can’t you see us?” someone beside them asked sternly.","The Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute narrowed his eyes slightly, but the other party had a powerful background. He nodded and was about to lead the group to retreat.","“Unbelievable.” Mengmeng couldn’t help but say, “You keep cutting in line whenever you can, and people like you who don’t follow the order are lining up. Do you really think others don’t exist? How dare you shamelessly ask us to retreat a hundred meters? It’s the first time I’ve seen such a shameless person.”","Once she joined the Crimson Sunglow Sect, she had been keeping a high profile even during the time she ran away all the way. Mengmeng had nothing to fear since she saw Zhang Han kill Lord Luo Dong, who was in the Middle Stage of the Mastery Realm, with one hand and then return to the Vast Heaven Star.","She was much more casual in doing things since she had great strength. If cultivators wanted to do whatever they wanted, they had to have enough strength. But now, Mengmeng’s backer was in his peak state, so she had nothing to fear.","Not only Zhang Han, but also Yue Wuwei was standing aside.","Seeing that the other party was dumbfounded, Yue Xiaonao sneered.","“Fuck off and line up at the back. It’s the first time I’ve seen someone cut in line in such a high-profile way.”","“Tut-tut, mind your language.” Yue Wuwei’s beard trembled.","“What’s going on? Yue Xiaonao is just a kid. How can she be cursing? Should I teach her a lesson?”","“What did you say?”","The face of the man who spoke darkened.","Some of the big shots who were chatting ahead also turned their heads.","“Fengwu, it seems that your sect has been laughed at.”","“Hahaha, interesting.”","At this time, the face of the Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute changed, “What? This man is the legendary No. 1 Elder of the Ice Sword Sect, Fengwu. My God. Everyone, please stop talking.”","After he finished speaking, he immediately removed the sound-proof cover and said with a smile, “Guys, I’m sorry.”","“Shut up!” The protector of the Ice Sword Sect, who had been challenged, said with a gloomy face, “Which sect are you from?”","“We are from the Radiant Institute of the Heavenly Double Star.” Cold sweat began to flow down the Sect Master’s forehead.","“I’ve never heard of it.”","Some disciples of the Ice Sword Sect suddenly laughed.","“Radiant Institute? What a joke!”","“You don’t even have the qualifications to cut in line, yet you’re still clamoring?”","“It’s just a bunch of good-for-nothings. Each year, only one or two of them can pass the trial. How dare they bring so many people here?”","“The Radiant Institute is just a small sect. Hahaha, how dare you boast shamelessly! How interesting!”","Hearing the ridicule, the Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute had a darkened expression.","Some people in the queue behind them were also talking about it.","“A fourth-echelon sect dares to be so arrogant with the first-echelon?”","“That’s not arrogance, that’s stupidity.”","“It’s very likely that they’ll be directly disqualified.”","“It’s just that their inner-door disciples are talking too much.”","When one said someone was in the wrong, that might not necessarily be true. But when everyone said that person was in the wrong, it made that person at fault even if it wasn’t true.","Just like now, in everyone’s minds, cutting in line was normal, and it was a symbol of strength.","However, it also had something to do with the Ling Sea Sword Sect. If it was written in the rules that the first-echelon sects could cut in line, Mengmeng and the others would not object.","However, this was an unwritten rule.","Mengmeng felt that those people just openly violated morality.","Her little face darkened.","“Don’t take others’ tolerance for you as your right to put on a shameless act. Your Ice Sword Sect is just so shameless. You’re indeed troublemakers with such ugly faces.”","“Hmm?”","Fengwu, the No. 1 Elder of the Ice Sword Sect, didn’t intend to interfere at first, but at this time, his face darkened slightly, and his aura rose. He was ready to make a move.","Right then, Zi Yan stepped forward. Her eyes and her tone were calm.","“As for the other two sects, you’re taking your mistake as a legitimate act. Is it your or the Ling Sea Sword Sect’s problem? Protector Li Kun, aren’t you going to make things right?”","Rumble!","Her words were like a bolt from the blue, making everyone shocked.","“How dare she challenge Protector Li Kun?”","“Oh my god, is the Radiant Institute crazy?”","“The first-echelon sects cut in line.”","In front of the crowd, Li Kun spoke up, which made the higher-ups of the three sects stop talking.","Li Kun’s eyes were still closed.","As if he didn’t care about it, he said, “There is no right or wrong in cutting in line, and there are no rules. Since some people are not convinced, the examination will become a battle between you and the disciples of the sects who cut in line. The winner can enter the inner court, and the loser is not allowed to participate in the inner court examination for five years.”","“Hahahaha.”","As soon as he said that, the people of the three major sects in front of the Radiant Institute laughed.","“The loser is not allowed to participate in the assessment for five years.”","“Wonderful.”","“In that case, shall we invite our loser, the Radiant Institute, to enter the field?”","At this moment, the face of the Radiant Institute’s Sect Leader looked slightly pale.","His inner-door disciples were also stunned.","“Can we defeat the disciples of the first echelon?”","However, there was no turning back. As newcomers, they were not afraid of experienced cultivators. They were even eager to try. “What if we win?”","“They’re too young.” This was what the Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute was thinking.","He could tell from the expression on the faces of his sect disciples that they were going to give it a try.","“They want to fight against those people.","“That’s nice. Only by experiencing real battles will they understand the gap.","“Moreover, they may not necessarily lose.”","The Sect Leader glanced at Zhang Han.","He also wanted to participate in the test. With Grand Master Chu’s Big Brother around, there should be no problem.","“Come, brothers from the Radiant Institute, let’s go and exchange a few blows.”","One of the supervisors of the Ice Sword Sect waved his hand with a smile.","Under many people’s complicated gazes, they entered the examination hall.","“How will we fight?”","The Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute said, “There must be rules. Since Protector Li Kun didn’t mention it, we can talk about it ourselves. It just so happens that there are several supervisors here.”","“Cut the crap.” The protector of the Ice Sword Sect who had been challenged pointed to the nose of the Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute and said, “You can fight as you want today!”","“Let’s take turns in the battle.” The Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute looked like he was ready to risk everything. “Let’s compete in groups. When either of our teams gets to win, the whole team will advance.”","When the decision was made, the protector did not speak anymore.","Fengwu nodded slightly. “We can take turns to fight. Those who are selected to take the exam will fight one by one. Well, Ice Sword Sect disciples, listen to my order.”","“Yes, elder.”","“Don’t kill them all.”","“Yes, elder!”","As soon as these words were spoken, the Sect Master of the Radiant Institute revealed a slightly panicked expression.","“Come on!”","Mengmeng glanced at Zhang Han. Seeing him nod slightly, Mengmeng went to the big ring in front of her.","She was wearing a cyan robe and a ponytail. Her hair was not short, and it was fluttering in the breeze.","The pretty girl had grown up. Although her face still looks a bit immature, her exquisite beauty was no less than Zi Yan’s when she was the most famous.","“What a bunch of trash. You actually allowed a little girl to fight on the stage first.”","A young man from the Ice Sword Sect who was taking part in the assessment sneered and stepped onto the ring. He looked at Mengmeng with a smile and said, “You are so beautiful. I feel sorry for you. It’s a pity that you will lose. Why don’t you and I make a bet?”","“What do you want to bet on?” Mengmeng’s eyes showed a hint of playfulness.","The man smiled faintly. “If you lose, you’ll be my maid from now on and you’ll serve me in bed.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the temperature in the field suddenly dropped by more than ten degrees.","“No wonder people say that lechers tend to play with fire. No wonder...” Yue Wuwei’s facial muscles were stiff. He touched his cheek, shook his head, and sighed.","“Hahaha!”","At this time, some disciples of the Ice Sword Sect burst out laughing.","“Senior Brother Lenghe is still as unrestrained as ever.”","“This pretty girl seems to be unable to escape from Senior Brother Lenghe’s hands.”","“...”","There were even teasing voices.","However, Zhang Han’s face darkened.","Before Mengmeng could make a move, an invisible palm suddenly appeared beside Lenghe.","Boom!","With a palm strike, the disciple was sent flying hundreds of meters away and hit a stone pillar.","Clack! Clack! Clack!","The stone pillar began to crack.","Plop!","Lenghe fell to the ground and could only breathe his last.","“What?!”","The face of the Sect Leader of the Radiant Sect changed drastically. “Shit.”","“Hmm?”","The eyes of Fengwu, the No. 1 Elder of the Ice Sword Sect, instantly became extremely sharp, and his blade-like aura began to vibrate.","“If we are to fight, we’ll just do it. If we don’t, you’ll die.” Zhang Han frowned and glanced at him.","This glance made Fengwu stop what he was about to do.","“Have you thought this through before making a move against my sect’s disciple?” asked Fengwu, his right hand glowing with a cold light. It was a long spear.","“As a senior of the sect, you actually ignored the rules and took action on your own. The rules have been broken. Why don’t we kill these people directly?” the elders of other sects said coldly.","A chaotic battle was about to break out here.","The chief supervisor of Ling Sea Sword Sect said nervously, “I’m sorry, the person who took action is also within the quota.”","“Heh, even if he is, it was a sneak attack. This kind of person deserves to die.”","Meanwhile, the disciple that went to check on Lenghe shouted in a grim voice, “Elder, Senior Brother Lenghe is out of breath.”","“Kill them!”","It was like a sound representing the start of a battle.","Fengwu immediately took action, white light flickering.","“Fuck off.”","At this time, Yue Wuwei waved his hand lightly.","The wind howled. The three leading elders as well as more than a dozen high-position officials were all sent flying backward. They were badly beaten and spat out several mouthfuls of blood. They couldn’t breathe at all.","“You...”","“What...”","“He is at least at the Middle Stage of the Mastery Realm!”","“Oh my god!”","They all fixed their eyes on Yue Wuwei.","Yue Wuwei touched his beard calmly and said, “Didn’t you hear him? If we are to fight, we’ll just do it. If we don’t, you’ll die.”","There was dead silence in the field.","One could even hear a pin drop.","None of the three first-echelon sects dared to say anything.","Even the supervisors and chief supervisor of the Ling Sea Sword Sect were dispirited at this time.","Someone kindly said to Protector Li Kun via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “Lord Protector Li, come and fix it. Something serious has happened here.”","Gurgle!","Li Kun, who was sitting on the high platform, moved his throat and swallowed.","He cursed in his heart. “Fuck it. You would never come to me when something good happens. You only ask for my help when it’s a bad thing.”","Thinking of this, he looked over there with fear and shook his head repeatedly.","“I can’t go over, I can’t...”"]},{"number":1482,"title":"Chapter 1482 Something’s Wrong with Your Sword","paragraphs":["Chapter 1482 Something’s Wrong with Your Sword","“My, my lord!”","Fengwu was very tough, and he had a reputation as a powerful master in the outside world.","But at this moment, he was the first one to admit defeat. Enduring the pain in his body, he got up and walked over slowly with his body bent.","“I’m sorry that we couldn’t see what’s in front of us.”","Zhang Han’s face darkened. “You couldn’t see what’s in front of you? What do you mean? Are you blind?”","“I...”","Fengwu’s heart seemed to skip a beat and thumped.","Since the other party was so difficult to deal with, he would probably be doomed today.","For a moment, he felt a chill run down his spine and didn’t know what to do.","“We were in the wrong. Milords, please forgive us. We were blind. Well, there’s no need to spar. We’ll let you advance directly. We’ll quit.”","“We’re convinced, we’re convinced, completely convinced.”","“Milord, please do not be impulsive.”","“Milord, please forgive this lowly one. We know that we were wrong.”","The people of the three first-echelon sects directly admitted their mistakes.","Unexpectedly, they made it sound so desolate. It was as if they had made a small mistake and were about to die. They expressed clearly that they should not be sentenced to death.","“Leave now. Stop being an eyesore here.”","Yue Wuwei waved his hand lightly.","“Yes, milord.”","Fengwu and the others looked at each other and left quickly.","They didn’t dare to wipe the cold sweat on their foreheads until they were far away.","“Heavens! We’ve messed with some terrifying masters that we can’t afford to offend!”","“Who is that old man? He’s too powerful. That young man also gave me a lot of pressure.”","“We can’t afford to offend them. We absolutely can’t,” another elder said with a lingering fear. “This kind of one-in-a-billion opportunity has actually been discovered by us. How could the Radiant Institute of the Heavenly Double Star know such powerful figures? Their cultivation is not inferior to that of the Sect Masters of the Four Great Sects at all. Such experts should have gone to the Galaxy a long time ago.”","“Maybe they’re just passing by the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven. No matter what, since we’ve run into them, it’s not shameful for us to lower our heads and admit our mistakes. It’s already a good thing that we’re still alive.”","“...”","The group of people left in a hurry, attracting the strange looks of many teams behind them.","“Why does it seem that the three first-echelon sects have suffered a loss?”","“Who knows what happened in there?”","“The people of the three sects have left, but the Radiant Institute has stayed inside. This...”","The onlookers were also a little confused.","They didn’t know what was going on.","However, Protector Li Kun, who was sitting in the main seat, exclaimed in his heart. “Holy shit. Where did these big shots come from? Not to mention you, even I can’t afford to offend them.”","Li Kun didn’t want to interfere in this matter at all. However, he had the Ling Sea Sword Sect as his backer and the people of the Radiant Institute were also going to join his sect. They were on the same side, so Li Kun was able to remain calm, but he was a little frightened.","“We’re advancing just like that?”","Many disciples of the Radiant Institute were confused.","“That was easy. We’re so powerful!”","“Everyone, you are now inner-door disciples. Well, go along the corridor and record your identities, and then the others can leave. You can rest assured to leave your disciples in the Ling Sea Sword Sect to cultivate. If you want to visit them, just submit an application in advance.”","Experts could be respected wherever they went.","The chief supervisor of the Ling Sea Sword Sect showed a humble attitude.","After this small incident, the people of the Radiant Institute held their heads high and walked along the corridor.","The Sect Leader of the Radiant Institute grinned from ear to ear.","“Thank you, Big Brother. Thank you, everyone.”","Although not all the participants who advanced were qualified, that was the bet. There were special cases every year.","After the disciples had their identity information recorded, the Sect Leader waved his hand at the crowd and said, “From now on, you are all members of the Ling Sea Sword Sect. Cultivate here well. Don’t forget to go back to the Heavenly Double Star to visit me when you have made some achievements in your cultivation.”","“Don’t worry, Sect Leader. I’ll never forget you.”","“...”","They all said goodbye to the Sect Leader. On the other side, Yue Wuwei was unwilling to disguise himself as a young man. Because he was too old to take part in the assessment, he was not one of the participants.","“Dad, when will you come here again?” Yue Xiaonao asked.","“This is the Vast Wood Star. I’ll go to the Vast Heaven Star and wait for you there,” Yue Wuwei said.","As for how he would go to the Vast Heaven Star, no one asked, nor did they care.","Yue Wuwei was now the strongest among everyone on the team, so there was no need to worry about him at all.","“Alright,” Yue Xiaonao replied.","Lisa did not say anything. No one else knew about her current cultivation level. Moreover, no one had ever seen her attack again.","She had Yue Wuwei by her side. Everyone knew that her cultivation level wouldn’t be low.","...","They waited here for two days before the assessment was over. Among the subsidiary sects of the Ling Sea Sword Sect, 310,000 people passed this year.","The number of people in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven was too large. The annual assessment wasn’t even a big one.","The fleets marched toward the Vast Heaven Star in a mighty manner.","Just like Zhang Han’s last trip, they came to a city on the edge of the inner court of the Vast Heaven Star.","Many disciples from the peaks had come to recruit disciples.","The publicity was varied.","“The Ling Sea Sword Sect is the strongest in Tao of the sword. You’re welcome to join the Sword Edge.”","“The pellet refining branch earns money the fastest.”","“It’s safest to learn the maintenance of the array of formations.”","“...”","The Sword Edge was the largest, containing more than a hundred different peaks.","...","These were similar to the major departments of an academy. However, the difference was that even if one joined the Sword Edge, one could learn other knowledge, such as beast training, pellet refining, the array of formations, and so on.","One could take an all-around development and free cultivation.","“Do we need to join a peak?” Mengmeng asked.","Zhang Han thought for a moment and said, “It’s up to you guys.”","“Let’s stay in one place first. There’s nothing to do anyway. Shall we join the Sword Edge?”","“It has many peaks. Which one should we choose?”","“Swordbamboo Peak.”","“Let’s go to Swordbamboo Peak.”","In the end, everyone made a decision.","The Sword Edge was also divided into different factions. Some were proficient in Eidolon swordsmanship, while some were proficient in swift and fierce moves.","The Swordbamboo Peak was a middle-level peak among the other peaks of the Sword Edge. It was not large and did not have many disciples.","However, the three great sword occult arts of the Swordbamboo Peak were extremely difficult to learn. They were respectively Emerald Jade, Violet Bamboo, and Wind Riding.","Wind Riding was a kind of secret technique of the Sword-commanding Technique. It could quickly improve the speed and power of sword commanding. It was quite profound, but many disciples had mastered it.","Violet Bamboo represented the purple Qi from the east, and the bamboo meant a bamboo forest. The vision it created was somewhat similar to the sea of swords, but it was more mysterious and unpredictable, difficult to grasp and defend.","As for Emerald Jade, everyone had only heard of its name. It was a broken piece that no one had mastered yet.","These were the three famous secret sword arts of Swordbamboo Peak.","As for the other peaks, there were at least ten types of occult arts, and at most over a hundred of them. Naturally, their attraction would be greater.","However, Zhang Han and the others didn’t lack the occult arts of the Tao of the sword.","They wanted to join the Swordbamboo Peak which had a relatively small number of people.","“It’s a correct choice for you to join the Swordbamboo Peak.”","That male disciple led the crowd to the Swordbamboo Peak. A total of 183 people joined them.","“Our Swordbamboo Peak has a tradition.”","After arriving at the foot of the Swordbamboo Peak, the man said, “As newcomers, you will have a Senior Martial Brother take care of you for a month. This will be your learning period, as well as the period of getting familiar with the environment and adapting. You are very lucky. This time, it is Eldest Brother Xing Nan who will take care of you. You should not have heard of him. Xing Nan is a famous talent in the north of the Sword Edge. He is the No.1 among the younger generation of the Swordbamboo Peak. He is already a chief supervisor at such a young age and is expected to be promoted to protector within three years. He can teach you a lot of things.”","Upon hearing this, many disciples became excited.","“Our Ling Sea Sword Sect is divided into two areas. The south coast and the north coast are separated by an ocean. Both coasts are respectively divided into the east and west areas. It means that the inner court of the Ling Sea Sword Sect has four major areas. Our peak is located in the east of the south coast. This is the geographical division. The Sword Edge is the No. 1 in swordsmanship. Therefore, Senior Brother Xing Nan won’t be guiding you for free. You have just arrived at the sect, and each of you has a basic 100 points. If you pay 50 points, you can learn some knowledge from him.”","“Senior Martial Brother.” At this time, someone asked, “If we want to learn, we have to pay 50 points. Can we not learn? Can we just enter the sect directly?”","At this time, the senior martial brother who led the team smiled faintly with contempt in his eyes. He shook his head and said, “You can choose not to learn, but in the Swordbamboo Peak, you are new here. Are you sure you want to go against the traditional rules? You have merely 100 points. Most of the time, without the guidance of a senior, you will consume your points easily. Whether you want to buy a loss or a lesson, do you want me to tell you how to choose?”","Many people understood the implication. Obediently handing in the points and entering the sect safely was the first lesson for the newcomers. If they did not cooperate, they would be cheated by the seniors and lose their credit.","When the disciple who had just asked the question saw that the senior martial brother was staring at him, he lowered his head slightly and did not dare to ask anymore.","The thin-faced senior brother asked in a deep voice, “It is your fortune to be able to learn from Senior Brother Xing Nan. Is there anyone else who objects?”","Seeing that a small number of people were ready to object, he said coldly, “You have to abide by the tradition of which peak you go to. If anyone doesn’t comply with the rules, then don’t say that I didn’t warn all of you today if there are any problems in the future.”","Clatter!","No one dared to object any longer.","However, there were still a small number of 183 people who didn’t want to pay 50 points for no good reason.","They’d also heard that the points of the Four Great Sects were extremely precious and could be exchanged for treasures that couldn’t be bought in the outside world.","But everyone knew that the outstanding usually bore the brunt of the attack.","They felt that someone would disagree, but no one would step forward since everyone kept quiet.","Some people even considered that if no one did object, they would follow the tradition. After all, they were in others’ territory.","“Senior Brother, have you finished?”","Suddenly, a woman’s voice was heard.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Everyone looked over.","A woman dressed in a long red gown walked out. Her eyes were very lively. “I’m not going to follow Eldest Brother’s guidance. I’m lazy. Um, Senior Brother, where do we live? Tell me, and I’ll go myself.”","The thin-faced senior brother’s face darkened slightly. He pointed to the mountain and said, “Go to the reception hall and ask.”","Since she started it, there were people following.","Swoosh!","A man silently walked out and followed the woman in red up the mountain.","In just one minute, more than a dozen people stepped out of the line.","“Humph!”","The thin-faced man snorted coldly. Without waiting for the others to leave, he said, “Everyone else, follow me. We’ll go straight to the inner peak.”","The group of people flew straight into the mountain range in all kinds of positions.","Zhang Han and his fellows were among them.","“You made the right choice. I’m afraid that those people have to suffer some losses to understand how to live on Swordbamboo Peak. They won’t just lose 100 points but even more.”","The thin-faced man sneered and then began to get down to business. “The area ahead of us is the Swordbamboo Peak. There are a total of 3,000 peaks in the surrounding area. Later, I will arrange for you to stay on the peaks with a good geographical location.”","While flying, he controlled the communication device to inquire about the information.","“You guys will stay at Yellow Leaf Peak. I’ll send you there.”","A moment later, they arrived at the place. As the name suggested, the Yellow Leaf Peak was very large, surrounded by countless buildings, and there were several halls on the mountainside.","“You’ll go to the hall in the middle. Someone will arrange a residence for each of you and tell you the specific rules. You can wait in this square for a while.”","The thin-faced man took everyone to a martial arts practice field to wait and then left in a hurry.","About ten minutes later, he and a black-clothed man walked over.","“This is Senior Brother Liu Sheng. He’s one of Eldest Brother Xing Nan’s men,” the thin-faced man introduced.","“From today on, I will be in charge of helping you familiarize yourselves with Swordbamboo Peak. Nominally, Xing Nan will be in charge of it, but he’s been busy in recent days.” Liu Sheng looked around and said lightly, “Your basic tuition fees have been paid. Now each of you will pay 50 points. Here, I will teach you the first lesson. There are a total of eight basic swordsmanship sets of the Swordbamboo Peak, and I will teach you them one by one.”","“You’re smart.” The thin-faced man smiled faintly and said, “If the dozen people who left want to learn the basic swordsmanship, they won’t know how to learn it. This is the difference between whether one has a guide. You will stay here and focus on learning from Senior Brother Liu Sheng. I’ll leave now.”","Liu Sheng nodded slightly, and the thin-faced man left.","What they didn’t know was that the dozen people had received eight kinds of basic swordsmanship in the reception hall.","The biggest difference between whether someone had a guide was whether he spent money or not.","Everyone was paying their points.","Some people hesitated, but Liu Sheng had already walked up to them. They had no choice but to hand over their points.","When he came to Mengmeng, she suddenly asked, “Senior brother Liu Sheng, can I learn the sword occult arts by paying general points?”","“We’ll probably learn a very powerful occult art,” Zhang Han said with a smile. “Judging from his face, I think Senior Brother Liu Sheng is very powerful.”","“That’s true.” Zi Yan smiled, blinked her beautiful big eyes, and said, “Senior Brother Liu Sheng is so handsome and capable. If we pay the points, I wonder how many occult arts we can learn.”","“Hahaha.”","Liu Sheng’s eyes were scanning Zi Yan and Mengmeng’s delicate cheeks.","He couldn’t tell that they were mother and daughter.","He just felt amazed.","He forced a smile and said, “You will get to learn the occult arts, and you will learn a lot of them. It all depends on your comprehension.”","As for the others, including Yue Xiaonao, Zhao Feng, and Chen Changqing, their lips were all curled up.","Zhang Han’s family wanted to play. It seemed that Liu Sheng had to suffer a lot of losses.","“Sure enough, we can’t judge a book by its cover. Brother Han looks so innocent, yet he’s horrifying.” Chen Changqing thought to himself.","“I feel that my swordsmanship is very powerful now. Senior Brother Liu Sheng, what realm are you in?” Mengmeng asked in a sweet voice.","“I’m only at the God Transformation Realm Middle Stage. I’m still working hard on my cultivation,” Liu Sheng said. “But don’t worry, I’ll just be guiding you for a few days. When Senior Martial Brother Xing Nan comes, you’ll be able to learn some profound occult arts.”","“I’m at the God Transformation Realm Early Stage, but Senior Brother Liu Sheng is only at the God Transformation Realm Middle Stage. I don’t think you can teach us a lot of things,” Mengmeng said with a suspicious look.","“You’re right.” Zi Yan also sounded a little confused. “There is only a small gap between us. It seems that we don’t have many choices.”","“No, no, no.” Zhang Han put on a serious look and said, “I believe Senior Brother Liu Sheng is very powerful.”","“Haha.”","Liu Sheng didn’t even look at Zhang Han. He just ignored him and said, “Junior Sisters, don’t worry. We can have a friendly competition. The Sword Sect’s God Transformation Realm Middle-Stage cultivators are very different from those in the outside world.”","“A friendly competition? I don’t think that’s a good idea,” Zhang Han said hesitantly.","“I’m talking to two Junior Sisters. Can you stop interrupting me?” Liu Sheng said in a somewhat unhappy tone.","“Okay.” Zhang Han nodded obediently.","“I don’t believe you. Why don’t we have a competition?” Mengmeng said.","“Stop it. Why would Senior Brother Liu Sheng compete with you for free?” Zi Yan said.","Mengmeng didn’t wait for Liu Sheng to speak and continued, “I’ll pay for it. I still have 50 points left. Let’s compete in swordsmanship first. If I lose, I’ll give my 50 points to you, Senior Brother.”","“What if you win?” Zi Yan said doubtfully, “It can’t be a one-sided bet, right? Senior Brother Liu Sheng will be so embarrassed. So many people are watching.”","“That’s right. Forget it. I’ll pay the points. I won’t compete with you anymore. Alas, I won’t,” Mengmeng said regretfully.","“We’ll do it.” Liu Sheng finally could speak. He said seriously, “Since you’re very confident, I won’t bully you. Let’s have a friendly competition and take the points as a bet. If you lose, you’ll give me 50 points. If I lose, I’ll give you 100 points.”","If he won in this way, he would get 50 more points.","With this, he could spar with others. After all, the seniors had to teach the freshmen a lesson.","“Okay. I’ll exchange a few moves with you,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","In the end, it was she who had to spar with Liu Sheng.","“Okay.”","Liu Sheng took a few steps back and looked at the others. “I joined the Ling Sea Sword Sect five years ago. At that time, I was at the Yuan Ying Realm Peak Stage. Now, I’m in the God Transformation Realm Middle Stage. After staying in the Sword Sect for a long time, I finally know how big the gap is between me and the masters in the outside world. I see that many of you are in the God Transformation Realm Early Stage. If you want to spar with me, we’ll have a sword competition. Come on, Junior Sister, let’s start first. I’ll fight you with the Sea-striped Sword, one of the eight basic swordsmanship skills of the Sword Sect.”","“Okay, Senior Brother. I’ve mastered a lot of swordsmanship. We can spar a few more moves,” Mengmeng said.","“Alas, three moves are enough to deal with you, but I’ll practice with you.”","Liu Sheng sighed softly, and a long sword appeared in his hand.","Mengmeng also took out her precious sword.","Liu Sheng wanted to give everyone a demonstration of basic swordsmanship. “The Sea-striped Sword has a total of nineteen moves. Those who have mastered them are very powerful. Look at my first move. I used the Sword Momentum to form ripples to assist in the attack. I was only proficient in this move after three months of practice. The mysteries within...”","Buzz!","Liu Sheng struck out with his sword.","Ripples spread out in waves.","However, a cold light suddenly flashed.","Clang!","A loud sound of collision rang out.","Liu Sheng’s sword suddenly deviated from its target.","A cold light appeared in front of Liu Sheng’s chest.","“Hey!”","Mengmeng was shocked. “Senior Brother Liu Sheng, how, how did you lose so quickly?”","Liu Sheng was dumbfounded.","“Did I lose?","“No way... Has the competition started?”","Liu Sheng recalled the scene just now and said doubtfully, “Something’s wrong with your sword.”"]},{"number":1483,"title":"Chapter 1483 He’s Asking You to Go Over","paragraphs":["Chapter 1483 He’s Asking You to Go Over","“What’s wrong, Senior Brother Liu Sheng?” Mengmeng asked in confusion.","“Ahem, ahem, ahem. The swords used for competition are supposed to be ordinary swords. Why did you take out a fifth-tier spirit treasure?” Liu Sheng coughed softly and said, “But it doesn’t matter. You’ve won this round.”","He had thought that Mengmeng would be polite and call the competition off. But to his surprise-","“Thank you for letting me win, Senior Brother Liu.” Mengmeng cupped her hands.","“Well, you’ll use my sword. Now that I’ve lost a round, I owe you 100 points. Let’s continue,” Liu Sheng said indifferently and handed over his long sword.","“No, thanks. I have an ordinary sword.” Mengmeng changed to a long sword.","“What?” At this time, Zi Yan said in a daze, “Can you put the points on credit?”","“Aren’t you supposed to pay her at once? It’s so boring to put the points on credit. The loser needs to pay the winner at the end of every round.” Chen Changqing echoed in a sarcastic tone, “What if you get it wrong by the end?”","Liu Sheng’s face darkened. He looked at Chen Changqing with dissatisfaction and then said, “I’m your senior brother. Why would I go back on my word? Well, since you have doubts, the loser will pay at the end of every round. I’ll transfer you 100 points now.”","As he spoke, he simply transferred Mengmeng 100 points.","“Senior Brother, you’re so nice. You even give in to newcomers,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","“It’s our first competition. It doesn’t matter if I give in.” Liu Sheng waved his hand and looked imposing. “I’m going to be serious next.”","“Okay, Senior Brother.”","Mengmeng was like an immature novice, looking nervous at first glance.","Upon seeing this, Liu Sheng thought that he had been too careless just now. Losing 100 points would mean he needed to win two rounds.","“Redriver Sword-art.”","Liu Sheng picked up his sword and came up.","“AHH!","Mengmeng exclaimed and closed her eyes. She swung the sword in her hand forward in a seemingly disordered manner.","Clang!","Liu Sheng’s sword was deflected again. At this time, Mengmeng opened her eyes. She seemed to be a little surprised. Her sword drew an arc on the right side, avoided Liu Sheng’s defense, and pointed at his chest again.","“Hmm?” Liu Sheng looked a little confused.","“I’ve lost again.”","Mengmeng cupped her hands and said, “Thank you for letting me win again, Senior Brother.”","Liu Sheng’s breathing was slightly rapid.","“Something’s not right!","“There’s something wrong with her sword technique.”","“Which sect do you belong to?” Liu Sheng asked.","“I’m from the Radiant Institute of the Heavenly Double Star,” Mengmeng replied.","“Very nice.”","Liu Sheng nodded. He was a little upset, but he still transferred the 100 points.","“Let’s keep it going.”","Clang!","“Why is your swordsmanship so sharp?” Liu Sheng looked at the long sword on his chest, and his pupils shrank.","“Damn it. I’ve been fooled. This little girl’s swordsmanship is not bad!”","“I don’t know, either,” Mengmeng replied.","“Heh, let’s go on.”","Liu Sheng was a little angry. Although the other party was very beautiful, he kept losing points, which made him distressed.","“This sword move is called the Swimming Sea!”","Liu Sheng performed the real sword move, which was not one of the eight basic sword moves, but a kind of swordsmanship he used in battle.","Buzz!","The Sword Qi was awe-inspiring.","There was a flash.","Clang! Clang!","This time, the two of them exchanged moves for five seconds.","In a split second, Liu Sheng suddenly felt that the opponent’s sword move was like an overwhelming force, attacking horizontally.","“Shit!”","Liu Sheng was shocked. He had thought of a way to deal with it in a second, but it was too late. The opponent’s sword tip was pointed at his chest again.","“Huh.”","Liu Sheng laughed and said, “Amazing.”","“Thank you for fighting with me, Senior Brother Liu Sheng. I’m not nervous anymore. I didn’t expect that my sword moves would be so powerful,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","“Okay, I’ll give you the points. We’ll continue.”","He had already lost 400 points.","It broke his heart.","...","Liu Sheng swore that he would win this round.","“Forget it. Senior Brother Liu Sheng just wanted to spar with you. You can’t have him give you points all the time.” Zi Yan kindly advised.","“Junior Sister, thank you for your kindness.” Liu Sheng waved his hand and said, “However, a man can’t go back on his word. I’ll practice with her today to increase her combat experience.”","“Okay. Senior Brother Liu Sheng, you’re a nice guy,” Mengmeng said with emotion.","She lifted her sword and began to fight again.","Liu Sheng’s sword moves were changeable, and he could advance and retreat freely.","As for Mengmeng, she looked serious, but in fact, she was very relaxed.","She deliberately fought for 15 seconds.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The four illusory sword lights made Liu Sheng flustered. He thought they were real and defended on the left side. However, Mengmeng shook her body slightly and pointed the real long sword at Liu Sheng’s chest again.","“You!”","...","Liu Sheng was furious. He gritted his teeth and looked at Mengmeng. “What a good sword skill! What a good sword skill!”","His true colors were revealed, and Liu Sheng’s character showed that he cared a lot about points. Even if the other party was an attractive pretty girl, he would hate her if she won his points.","Such people would betray others for their own interests.","“Why are you pretending?” Yue Xiaonao was annoyed and said, “I don’t think you should fight if you can’t win.”","“Hahahaha.”","Liu Sheng was so angry. He laughed. “I can’t win?”","He transferred the points for the fifth time at a high speed.","Originally, Liu Sheng only had more than 300 points, but now he had used more than 100 points from Xing Nan. The points collected from these freshmen were all recorded. “If Eldest Brother Xing Nan discovers this...”","Liu Sheng had a lot on his mind, but he was determined. “I have to win the points back.”","“Since it’s a competition, it’s impossible for me to hold back all the time. You’ve already won five times. I’ll take it seriously next,” Liu Sheng said in a deep voice.","“Oh, I see. You’ve just become serious,” Mengmeng said casually. “Let’s get started. I have 600 points now. I’d love to see if you can win all of them.”","“As you wish. I’m going to start executing my secret sword art.”","Liu Sheng wanted to win the points back. He had a firm will.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The sword light flashed again.","His aura soared to the heavens.","This was the first time he had performed the God Transformation Realm Middle-Stage power.","The crowd around them retreated one after another and watched the battle from a few hundred meters away. Zhang Han and the others were the only ones who were closer.","“I don’t know how many points Liu Sheng will lose. He’s obviously mad,” Chen Changqing said.","Zhao Feng thought for a moment and said, “I guess his heart will tremble if he loses.”","“Sword, rise!” Liu Sheng yelled angrily.","Countless rays of sword light flickered on the surrounding ground.","“Heh, suppression.”","Mengmeng pointed the long sword forward.","She launched a ray of sword Qi straight at Liu Sheng.","Countless streaks of sword light rose from the ground to defend against the attacks.","“Army Breaker.”","Mengmeng changed her move. A streak of sword light turned into a hundred rays, which forcibly broke Liu Sheng’s defense.","Without giving him a second chance to perform the occult art, Mengmeng flashed forward and made two sword moves. While Liu Sheng was defending, she suddenly found a flaw, and the long sword was pointed at his chest again.","Liu Sheng’s face turned red.","“What’s going on?”","“This pretty newcomer is so amazing.”","“She defeated the senior master of Swordbamboo Peak.”","“She’s so powerful!”","“I regret it. I shouldn’t have paid the points. This Senior Brother Liu Sheng doesn’t look powerful.”","“...”","“God damn it!”","Liu Sheng’s red face quickly turned pale. He looked at Mengmeng and said word by word, “Something’s wrong with your sword!”","“What’s the matter?” Mengmeng was stunned.","“There’s something wrong with your sword.” Liu Sheng’s eyes were wide open and confused. “Are you sure you’re from the Radiant Institute? This isn’t their sword move.”","“Oh, that. Are you trying to get to the bottom of it? I can’t tell you whom I learned this from,” Mengmeng said.","“Heh, okay, I really fell into your trap.” Liu Sheng painfully transferred 100 points. “Come on, this time, I’ll use all my strength.”","“Okay, Senior Brother Liu Sheng,” Mengmeng replied.","“Sword, rise!” Liu Sheng’s eyes flashed a light.","“Qing Ming Seal, suppress!”","Mengmeng used the Qing Ming Steal.","A cyan mark appeared in the air, intimidating Liu Sheng’s soul.","It disrupted the powerful sword move he was about to use.","Swoosh!","Mengmeng moved and came to Liu Sheng again. She pointed her sword at his chest.","“You... did you just use other supernatural powers in a sword competition?” Liu Sheng’s face was paler.","“Isn’t it a friendly competition? Can we only use swordsmanship?” Mengmeng asked suspiciously, “Can’t I use any moves I want in a friendly competition?”","“Okay, okay, okay.” Liu Sheng nodded hard and transferred another 100 points in a desperate way.","The sound of discussion could be heard from the surroundings.","“He has already paid 700 points.”","“Senior Brother Liu Sheng has a lot of points. I also want to fight him.”","“He can help the newcomers earn points. Senior Brother Liu Sheng is really our blessing!”","“Let’s wait and see. All of us will take turns to fight him.”","“...”","“What?!”","Liu Sheng’s heart ached.","“I’ve already lost 700 points?","“Oh my god, I’m doomed.","“I have to win. I still have a few trump cards. If I win by every time I use each of them, I can win 500 points. Only in this way can I make up for the points I’ve lost.”","Liu Sheng was like a red-eyed gambler, imagining that he could win, while Mengmeng was like a steady banker, looking at him with a smile, who was giving points.","“Sword, rise!”","This time, Liu Sheng first used the move of soul defense and then began to operate a secret skill of swordsmanship.","“She seems to be stunned.","“I did it!","“She’s defeated by my occult art!”","A sword ray shattered all of the opponent’s defenses. It was aimed at this beautiful and detestable junior sister.","“Hahaha, I won!”","Liu Sheng burst out laughing.","Clack!","The illusion was suddenly broken, and the images around him returned to reality. He felt a little cold in his neck. Was that a sword?","“Senior Brother, you’ve been hypnotized.”","It was the same pleasant voice that rang in her ears.","Like a rising sun, it was very warm, as if it wanted to illuminate the earth.","But when Liu Sheng reacted in the next second, he felt that this was not the rising sun, but the sunset. The voice also turned into the chant of the devil under the sunset.","“100 points.”","Liu Sheng was dumbfounded, but at the same time, he was roaring in his heart. He transferred the points in front of everyone.","“Go on!”","He still had three occult arts. He had to go all out to reduce his losses.","“Suppression!”","Soon, this round was over again.","“One more time!","“Sword, rise!”","“Suppression!”","“Sword, rise!”","“Suppression!”","“...”","Liu Sheng began to doubt everything he had learned.","He had performed all his moves, but he was still defeated.","“Damn it, she’s better than me. Is she trying to trick me?","“How many points did I lose?","“Damn. I have to get them back!”","Liu Sheng wanted to discuss it in a friendly manner and ask for some points back.","“Oh, Senior Brother Liu Sheng, thank you for your points. Let’s spar next time. I’m tired and have to go back to rest.”","Mengmeng waved her hand. Then, she and her companions left the square without even looking back.","“No, I...” Liu Sheng raised his hand and tried to call her back, but he couldn’t.","“Senior Brother, I’m tired. I’m going to rest too.”","Some people began to run away. Before the points were paid, they had to leave first.","“I have a stomachache.”","“I’m hungry. I will faint if I don’t eat.”","“I haven’t slept for three days. If I don’t go to sleep for a while, I will lose my hair.”","The newcomers made all kinds of excuses and left in a hurry after saying a few perfunctory words.","The scene was a little chaotic.","Someone asked, “Well, Senior Brother Liu, can we get a refund?”","“AAAAH!”","When Mengmeng and the others walked far away, they faintly heard Liu Sheng’s angry cry in the square.","“Hahaha, you won 1,200 points. That guy will be heartbroken.” Chen Changqing laughed.","“He deserves it.” Mengmeng snorted and said, “How dare he be so sarcastic to my daddy? He didn’t suffer enough.”","Mengmeng didn’t want to win so much. She just wanted to have some fun. She launched so many attacks just because Liu Sheng said to Zhang Han, “I’m talking to two Junior Sisters. Can you stop interrupting me?”","His tone and attitude were not nice, which made the little princess unhappy.","“You’ve grown up after all. You can protect your father now.” Chen Changqing said with a smile, “You’re so considerate. I have to think about having a second child, a daughter.”","“Hey, the more you think about it, the more likely you will get a son.” Zi Yan couldn’t help laughing.","“Let’s go back to Earth and have a good rest for a while. Feifei has had enough of staying in the outside world,” Chen Changqing said. “In the following few months, we’ll experience the charm of the Four Great Sects. I wonder if Mu Xue, Ah Hu, and the others have made any name for themselves here.”","“You’re all at the God Transformation Realm Last Stage, aren’t you?” Lisa said, “In addition, your combat capability is higher than that of ordinary people. You’re the strongest among the disciples in the Four Great Sects.”","“Our progress is still too slow.” Zhao Feng said, “Even the little princess has surpassed us. It seems that in the future, we have to continue to work hard and strive to protect Master’s... Ahem, ahem, it’s more convenient to cultivate in the outside world. Yeah.”","Halfway through his words, Zhao Feng quickly stopped. He almost said that they would continue to protect Zhang Han’s grandson or granddaughter, who were Mengmeng’s children.","Thinking about it, after so many years, he knew Zhang Han very well, who didn’t want to listen to such things.","In particular, when Mengmeng was a child, he would get angry with anyone who said such things to him.","Now he had become less aggressive, but it had never changed that he didn’t enjoy listening to such things.","Arriving at the main hall, the crowd had their identity information checked and was assigned to different residences. Each person had their own place.","But they didn’t need so many places. Zi Yan and Zhang Han would still live together.","They went to their own residence.","On the other side.","The current leader of the Ling Sea Sword Sect was the current Grand Elder, Tian Chen.","He was an excellent master at the Early Stage of the Mastery Realm.","At this moment, he was refining pellets leisurely.","Although the battle between the Ling Sea Sword Sect and the Heavenly Evil Sect was fierce, the higher-ups of the two sects would not take action easily.","Tian Chen was at the most critical moment of pellet refining.","“Has your Sect Leader gone out?”","A voice suddenly came from his back.","Hiss!","“Who is it?!”","Tian Chen gasped. Ignoring the exploding cauldron, he immediately turned around and unleashed all of his defensive measures.","“Who are you?” Tian Chen looked at the old man in front of him vigilantly.","“Didn’t Little Huzi tell you about me? Four hundred years ago, he met an old man named Yue Wuwei.”","Taoist Dragonlake, the Sect Leader of the Ling Sea Sword Sect, was referred to as Little Huzi by Yue Wuwei.","“WHAT?!”","Tian Chen’s expression changed greatly. He was stupefied, and then he was shocked. In the end, his face turned pale and then extremely respectful. He immediately withdrew his defenses.","He knew Yue Wuwei’s name. He had also heard from the Sect Leader that Yue Wuwei was the only one who reached the Tribulation Stage in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.","That was to say, the only resident Tribulation Stage master in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven was Yue Wuwei.","Now, several hundred years had passed. He didn’t notice it when Yue Wuwei suddenly appeared behind him, which already explained the situation.","He even knew that if the other party wanted to kill him, it could happen in an instant.","Fortunately, they were on the same side.","“Greetings, Senior Yue. I wish you good fortune.”","“Don’t say that.” Yue Wuwei snorted.","He used to think that this sentence was a compliment, but since Mengmeng said, “It’s good fortune to suffer losses. I wish you good fortune...”","Since then, Yue Wuwei had been unwilling to listen to these blessings.","“Yes, senior!”","Tian Chen was extremely cautious, “Our Sect Leader has gone to the Silver Dragon Galaxy to seek an opportunity to break through to the Tribulation Stage. May I know why you’re here, senior?”","“Some of my juniors are here to gain experience,” Yue Wuwei said directly, “and I’ll stay here for a few days.”","“Okay.”","“Just arrange for me to stay at Swordbamboo Peak.”","“Yes, senior.”","“...”","After all, Yue Wuwei was very well-informed.","His arrival at the Oversea Sword Sect caused Grand Elder Tian Chen’s scalp to go numb. He even felt like this senior was a ticking bomb, and he was worried and fearful.","Fortunately, Yue Wuwei was relatively calm. After exchanging a few words with him, he just came with his juniors, including his daughter and the Eldest Lady of his force, to gain experience.","Tian Chen was very cautious.","But he had to guess what Yue Wuwei meant.","“He sneaked here instead of breaking into this place directly. Is he trying to keep a low profile?”","After Yue Wuwei left, Tian Chen personally made arrangements for this matter. After pondering for a long time, he decided to keep a close eye on Swordbamboo Peak and make a judgment based on the situation.","As he observed the residences, he spotted Yue Wuwei’s gang.","It had Zhang Yumeng, Zhang Hanyang, Zi Yan, Zhao Feng, Chen Changqing, Yue Xiaonao, and others.","“I need to be careful and keep an eye on them all the time.”","Elder Tian Chen’s mind had always been on Swordbamboo Peak.","When he learned that Zhang Yumeng had won 1,200 points from a disciple named Liu Sheng, his expression was also a little interesting.","“She has such a powerful background, yet he still dares to challenge her. How stupid.”","That was Tian Chen’s assessment.","But the next day, he saw Liu Sheng taking his fellows there.","He was furious. “Damn it, I’m going to kill this group of people!”","He flashed and flew rapidly in the sky.","When he was about to reach the destination-","“Don’t worry about it.”","Yue Wuwei’s voice appeared in his mind.","Tian Chen understood. He cupped his hands and nodded. “Yes, senior.”","He turned around and left, but he was also paying attention to those people all the time.","Liu Sheng’s group of seven came to Zhang Yumeng’s residence aggressively.","He ran to Zhang Hanyang’s place after failing to find her and saw the people eating.","Liu Sheng’s cheek was still a little swollen, and he snapped at them.","“Let’s go, everyone. Eldest Brother Xing Nan wants you all to go over.”"]},{"number":1484,"title":"Chapter 1484 How Could She Be a Newcomer?","paragraphs":["Chapter 1484 How Could She Be a Newcomer?","“Do you think we will go over just because you say so?”","Yue Xiaonao squinted at them and said, “Go back and tell your master that if he wants to see us, he can come here by himself.”","Before Liu Sheng could speak, a man next to him sneered and said, “It seems that you newcomers don’t know the status of Senior Brother Xing Nan on the Swordbamboo Peak. He is the chief supervisor and has reached the God Transformation Realm Last Stage in just 20 years. He has killed countless enemies and made the Heavenly Evil Sect tremble with fear. He is about to become a protector. He has already shown you enough respect by asking you to go there. Do you dare to disobey him? Do you know what kind of crime it is?”","“Wow, that’s amazing.” Yue Xiaonao applauded.","“Daddy, we...” Mengmeng hesitated for a moment.","Unexpectedly, Zhang Han showed a meaningful smile. He blinked at Mengmeng and whispered, “You can toy with them as you want. It’s up to you.”","“I see.”","Mengmeng giggled. After she stopped laughing, she looked over, stood up, and said, “Lead the way.”","“Let’s go take a look at Eldest Senior Brother Xing Nan, the No. 1 in the younger generation of the Swordbamboo Peak.” Yue Xiaonao also stood up.","The two of them were going to ruin the party.","“Heh.” Liu Sheng snorted and said, “I’m sorry, Eldest Brother Xing Nan wants all of you to go there.”","“He wants everyone to go there. Okay.” Zi Yan looked around and said, “We have to listen to Eldest Brother Xing Nan’s orders. Let’s go.”","Yue Wuwei put down the teacup, and Chen Changqing and the others also put down their cutlery.","The group of people got up and followed Liu Sheng out of the house.","Liu Sheng and the others had no idea what kind of figures the people behind him were.","However, he was still a little stronger and knew that there were experts among them.","The others almost raised their eyebrows and eyes.","They walked for about half an hour.","In a valley, they saw more than a hundred new disciples.","There was a stone platform on which a man in cyan was sitting. He had an extraordinary aura and an indifferent look. He was waving his hand to control some swords within a radius of about 100 meters in front of him, which were flying around. The scene was so beautiful that it could always attract the exclamations of many new disciples.","“Eldest Brother Xing Nan lives up to his reputation as an outstanding figure amongst the young disciples of our Swordbamboo Peak. Amazing! His ability to control swords is extraordinary!”","“It is said that Eldest Brother Xing Nan has only cultivated for 20 years, but he has already reached the God Transformation Realm Last Stage. He is about to reach the God Transformation Realm Peak Stage. He can become a protector with his merits. Now he is a chief supervisor. He is well-known in the Swordbamboo Peak and his fame is all over the sect.”","“Amazing. What an expert. Eldest Brother Xing Nan is truly an expert.”","“...”","He had used some methods to conquer them. They felt that the 50 points they had paid were not wasted.","When Mengmeng and the others arrived nearby, many new disciples noticed them, and their expressions changed.","“It’s them?”","“It’s the beautiful girl who defeated Senior Brother Liu Sheng and won 1,200 points.”","“That’s incredible. A freshman who has some strength plays a trick on Senior Brother Liu Sheng. She’s so scheming that it makes me angry.”","“The more beautiful a girl is, the more likely she is to cheat others. It seems that the elders’ words make sense.”","Xing Nan had only been in contact with them for two days, but he had already made these people favor him.","After all, Xing Nan could teach them a lot of things, and he was very famous and powerful. He was not unapproachable and was easygoing. Gradually, he attracted a lot of people’s attention.","“Haha.” Someone in the crowd sneered and said, “With Eldest Brother Xing Nan’s status, he shouldn’t have called them over. The strange thing is that these people made trouble as soon as they entered the sect. If I were him, I would punish them as a warning to others.”","As soon as that person finished his words, Xing Nan, who was sitting on the stone platform, gave the ones who came an indifferent look.","When he spotted Mengmeng and Zi Yan, he was also slightly stunned.","“They’re beautiful.","“Unfortunately, even if they have a flourishing appearance, they’ll still become dirt in the end.","“Strength is what determined everything.”","Xing Nan muttered in his heart.","His gaze became calm once more, and he controlled the hundreds of swords in the valley to reveal the traces of a sword technique.","It seemed that he didn’t want to talk to Mengmeng. He had to wait until he finished his work.","“If you ask us for nothing, we will leave now,” Yue Xiaonao said.","Xing Nan stopped what he was doing and said flatly without turning around, “People in different levels do things accordingly. When one is a kid, one can fool around. The older people get, they should learn cultivation knowledge. As new disciples, you have done what you shouldn’t do. You have all kinds of skills. It’s an unorthodox way to cheat people. As the chief supervisor of the sect and the Eldest Brother of the Swordbamboo Peak, I have to question you. If you return the 1,200 points to Liu Sheng that you tricked him in front of everyone, I’ll give you a light punishment.”","His words were quite sanctimonious.","Many people even nodded in agreement with his words.","A new disciple said, “He’s right. Hurry up and return the points. We’re all disciples of the Swordbamboo Peak. No one should be the target of your scam.”","“I also feel that they’re a bit out of line. They’re clearly very powerful, yet they act as if they don’t know anything.”","The words of criticism were always heart-wrenching.","But Mengmeng and the others didn’t care much about other people’s opinions.","“Hahaha.”","Mengmeng applauded and said, “Wonderful.”","Liu Sheng played along and asked subconsciously, “What’s so wonderful about it?”","“I won the points with my skills, but you’re asking me to pay them back. You even got some onlookers to complain about it. Don’t you think it’s funny?” Mengmeng said seriously.","“Are you kidding?” Liu Sheng looked angry.","...","Xing Nan, who was sitting on the stone platform, stopped commanding his swords. Frowning, he looked in Mengmeng’s direction and said, “I’m not informing you. I’m giving you orders as the chief supervisor of the sect and the Eldest Brother of the Swordbamboo Peak. Do you understand?”","“Daddy, he’s ordering me to do something I don’t want to do.”","Mengmeng immediately put on a pitiful look.","Hearing this, Zhang Han smiled. He touched Mengmeng’s head, raised his right hand, pointed to the front, and said, “Beat him up.”","“Okay!”","Mengmeng responded with a smile. With a light tap on the ground with her toes, she flew up into the air and stood on the branch of a towering tree. Her expression was calm. A long sword appeared in her right hand. She looked at Xing Nan and said very seriously, “I’m going to beat you up.”","“Hahahaha.”","Xing Nan didn’t get angry. Instead, he laughed out loud and said, “Interesting, interesting. Is this a rookie?”","“What an arrogant newcomer!”","“You really don’t know your place. You dare to fight against Eldest Brother Xing Nan.”","“I can teach her a lesson without Senior Brother taking action.”","...","Seeing that several of his men were ready to take action, Xing Nan waved his right hand and said calmly, “You don’t need to say much. You’re Zhang Yumeng, right? You’re brave and good at fighting. I admire you. But as the chief supervisor of the sect, it’s reasonable for me to correct your mistakes and teach you a lesson.”","“Please, you’re just a chief supervisor. Why do you always talk about this?” Mengmeng said with a helpless look.","“I heard that you like the points. That’s good. Let’s bet 1,200 points on this battle.”","Hearing this, Mengmeng chuckled and even cupped her hands. “Thank you for your generous gift of points, Eldest Brother Xing Nan.”","“Let’s see if you can get them.”","Xing Nan’s face grew grim. During battles, he had a habit of treating every enemy as his archenemy.","And the person in front of him was the target who tricked 1,200 points off them.","Swoosh!","Xing Nan moved and waved his right hand. Hundreds of long swords in the valley condensed into a huge Cyan Peak Sword, which was dozens of feet long and carried vast power.","“Fireball Skill.”","Mengmeng threw out a huge fireball with a diameter of 10 meters.","The crimson flame gave off a scorching heat.","She didn’t even need to use the Dark Cold Fire and only performed the ordinary Fireball Skill.","It directly smashed Xing Nan’s sword formation into pieces.","All kinds of long swords were burned into juice, turned into a faint fluorescent light, and drifted down.","Xing Nan was shocked.","“She does have some strength!","“I need to be careful. I can’t be disgraced in front of these disciples.”","Xing Nan didn’t want to fail miserably. He was cautious enough and didn’t want to make Liu Sheng’s mistake.","His eyes were solemn, and a forth-tier spirit treasure appeared in his right hand, the Flower River Sword.","“Let me show you my Art of Sword Control!”","Xing Nan roared in his heart. A cyan light flashed across his eyes and his sword charged forward with an irresistible momentum.","“Hah. What a cheap trick.”","As Mengmeng spoke, she waved her right hand. Hundreds of fourth-tier spirit treasures formed a sword formation and flew forward.","“Oh my god!","“Oh no!”","Xing Nan gasped and immediately withdrew his flying sword.","Wouldn’t the Flower River Sword shatter into pieces from this collision?","He took out a fifth-tier sword backhand.","“Swordcloud!”","As soon as that occult art was used, the wind and clouds changed dramatically. The fog turned into a sea of clouds and pressed down on Mengmeng.","Mengmeng shook her head slightly.","Her sword formation changed and suddenly burst into dazzling light.","It was like a rising sun shining in the sky.","The sun scattered the fog.","invisibly, it broke Xing Nan’s sword technique.","“So powerful!”","Liu Sheng’s face changed dramatically. “She, she was definitely tricking me yesterday!”","Now that he thought about it, he realized that he had indeed been tricked.","He seemed to have forgotten his original intention. If it weren’t for the fact that he wanted to earn points, there wouldn’t have been a battle.","“Interesting.”","Xing Nan got even more serious. He had even forgotten that the other party was a new disciple of the sect. He imagined that she was a talented disciple of the Heavenly Fiend Sect.","To prove himself, he had to win this battle.","“Return!”","Mengmeng withdrew her hundreds of long swords.","She took out a fifth-tier sword without hesitation.","“You have a lot of spiritual treasures, but I don’t know if you can fully utilize their power.”","Xing Nan began to show off. He looked calm, and he sounded like he was giving instructions.","“Swordbamboo Peak has three occult arts of swordsmanship. I shouldn’t be using them on this occasion. But your strength is not bad, so I want to let the new disciples see the power of the three occult arts. This move is called Bamboo Sea. It took me five years to learn it, and another five years to master it. If you have a Defense Treasure, you can activate it now.”","“That’s amazing!”","Mengmeng lowered her head and subconsciously looked at her hand. Well, it was very slender.","When she looked up, she said, “I forgot how many occult arts of swordsmanship I’ve mastered. There seem to be hundreds of them. What kind of move do you want to see? I’ll defeat you in one move.”","“Hahaha. Should I address you as arrogant or conceited?” Xing Nan laughed and said, “You’re the first new disciple to dare to talk to the chief supervisor of the sect like this. You are indeed arrogant. I hope you can still laugh when I punish you. ”","“Is that so?”","Mengmeng narrowed her eyes, wondering what kind of move she should make to defeat him.","She simply had too many moves.","“Bamboo Sea!”","Under everyone’s gaze, Xing Nan performed the most supreme occult art of the Swordbamboo Peak.","In the forest bathed in the sun, the scene suddenly changed, as if it had become a forest of bamboo that swayed with the wind.","There wasn’t any sword radiance that was powerful to the point of making one suffocate. Everything was just so peaceful. It was like a painting.","One after another, bamboo shadows soared into the sky.","It wasn’t until they were halfway through their assault that their power began to show.","At this time, Xing Nan sighed and said, “You’re too conceited. If you had interrupted me when I used the Bamboo Sea, you might have had a chance to escape. But now that the Bamboo Sea is complete, there’s no way for you to retreat.”","While he was speaking, the crowd around him was shocked.","“Eldest Brother Xing Nan is so powerful.”","“Bamboo Sea. This is Bamboo Sea. When I feel the aura, my heart palpitates. In the future, I will definitely learn how to perform a Bamboo Sea.”","“It deserves to be one of the three supreme occult arts. It’s sharp, fierce, and invincible.”","At this moment, they had witnessed the might of the Bamboo Sea.","There was no doubt that these people also thought that under the attack of the sword occult art, the girl opposite them would not get to escape.","Mengmeng, on the other hand, looked at the incoming Bamboo Sea and did not move.","“Is she scared silly?”","Liu Sheng and the others shook their heads repeatedly. “Xing Nan deserves to be the Eldest Brother. He directly...”","Before they could finish their words, Mengmeng suddenly thought of something.","“Bamboo-eating Panda!”","Clatter!","With the wind whistling, Mengmeng swung the long sword in her right hand. The sword light flashed and the light flowed. Suddenly, a flying panda was created.","This occult art was originally called Sword Dragon.","It was an extremely powerful deadly blow.","Mengmeng would definitely kill Xing Nan with this move, so she gave up on the Sword Dragon and carved the shape of a panda, whose power was less than one-tenth of that of the Sword Dragon.","But it was enough to deal with Xing Nan.","Under the watchful eyes of everyone, the move Mengmeng made was vivid and lifelike as if it was a living creature.","Clack!","The panda simply began to eat the bamboo ahead.","The Sword Qi bamboo was consumed one after another.","“How is this possible?”","Xing Nan fell into a state of confusion.","“What? The supreme occult art has been gnawed?”","Liu Sheng and the others could not believe their eyes.","That was the supreme occult art.","“I’m going to perform illusions.”","Zhang Han had taught Mengmeng a lot of illusions that she minored in. Although the little princess had not learned much, every one of the illusions she had mastered was very useful.","“Illusions?”","Xing Nan was terrified.","“Just do it. Why did you remind me of that?","“Shit!","“This is a trap!","“Could it be that this girl is trying to deceive me?”","Clatter!","Clouds rose, and there appeared a fog.","An enormous figure was faintly discernible, covering the sky and the sun.","It seemed to spit out streaks of black lines.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","Xing Nan was immediately caught up in a frenzied bombardment.","After he felt that he had been beaten for a long time, the fog slowly dissipated.","A dark shadow sneaked into Zi Yan’s wrist.","Then, Mengmeng flashed to Xing Nan and pointed her long sword at his chest.","She simply said, “1,200 points.”","“I...”","Xing Nan looked dumbfounded.","He cried in his heart. “How could she be a newcomer?”","He braced himself and gave 1,200 points to her.","“Well, it has been a waste of time and even money.”","His heart ached so much that it was hard for him to breathe.","Under his blank gaze, Mengmeng turned around and left with her companions. She left very decisively without looking back.","The scene was deathly silent.","The numerous new disciples did not know what to say.","Liu Sheng and the others didn’t dare to speak, for fear of angering Eldest Brother Xing Nan.","“Very good, very good, wonderful!”","No one knew what Xing Nan was thinking. He looked at Liu Sheng and said slowly, “Guide these new disciples. Keep in mind that after you’re done guiding them, get the hell out of here to earn points.”","Xing Nan’s clothes were in a mess, and he left the scene awkwardly. It was unknown whether he was angry or miserably beaten.","“Should the No. 1 of the younger generation of the Swordbamboo Peak be replaced?”","“Is the beautiful girl just now called Zhang Yumeng?”","“She’s simply too powerful. She has truly boosted the morale of the new disciples.”","“...”","Liu Sheng didn’t want to say anything when the crowd was talking about it.","After a long while, he said, embarrassed, “Well, I’ll teach you guys the basic swordsmanship first.”","Suddenly, a figure stepped forward and said in a very kind tone, “Senior Brother, let’s have a competition. Our bets will be the same. Ten points for every round.”","“...”"]},{"number":1485,"title":"Chapter 1485 Chief Supervisor","paragraphs":["Chapter 1485 Chief Supervisor","The next day.","Zhang Han, Mengmeng, and Yue Xiaonao were strolling around in the sect.","Zi Yan and Lisa went out for a walk.","It would take some time to enjoy all the scenery of Swordbamboo Peak.","They casually walked through the forest.","“Isn’t Aunty Jiang also here?” Mengmeng asked.","“She’s here, but I don’t know where she is.” Zhang Han couldn’t help laughing. “The territory of the Ling Sea Sword Sect is huge, and the Four Great Sects are not its only possession on the entire Vast Heaven Star. There are barren areas, Exotic Beasts areas, and many war zones. She may not be in a sect.”","“Then don’t we need to look for them?” Mengmeng asked again.","“It’ll be troublesome to find them. There’s a simple way,” Zhang Han reminded her.","Smart Mengmeng pondered for a moment and suddenly said, “Oh, I see. We’ll just wait until we become famous.”","“That’s easy.” Yue Xiaonao thought for a moment and said, “If we make a scene, we’ll be famous.”","“Make a scene?”","Mengmeng was stunned and said, “Daddy, we don’t need to keep a low profile, do we?”","“No. I’m now at the peak of the bottleneck. Elder Yue is also here. The Vast Heaven Star is very suitable for all of us to train ourselves at present,” Zhang Han said with a smile.","“I see.”","Mengmeng muttered, “Then I can’t be idle all the time.”","Then, she waved her hand and said to the other side of the mountainside via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “Liu Sheng!”","“AHH!”","Not far away, Liu Sheng, who was passing by, was suddenly startled. “Oh my god, I seem to have heard that girl’s voice.”","“On your right,” Mengmeng said.","Liu Sheng turned around stiffly. When he saw Mengmeng and the others, his face turned bitter.","He wanted to leave and ignore them, but he lost control of his legs.","He floated above the woods and soon came to them.","“Do you know the group of famous young disciples in the sect?” Mengmeng asked, “Like the No.1 in the Sword Edge and the outstanding young man from the south coast.”","“I, I know them. What are you going to do?” Liu Sheng said vigilantly, “I’m just an unknown disciple. Don’t fool me.”","“What are you talking about? Who would fool you for no reason?” Yue Xiaonao said discontentedly, “Forget it. Ask Senior Brother Xing Nan to come here.”","“Well, that’s not a good idea. Senior Brother Xing Nan is the chief supervisor of our sect.”","Liu Sheng was terrified. If he called Xing Nan over but Xing Nan got beaten up, he would also be beaten up.","While he was hesitating, Xing Nan flew over from not far away.","“You guys are here.”","Xing Nan’s expression was somewhat complicated.","He didn’t expect that he would be defeated by a new disciple. He had lost the reputation of being the No.1 among the young generation of the Swordbamboo Peak.","“You’ve come at the right time. Lead me the way. I’ll challenge the top talent in the east of the south coast,” Mengmeng said.","She didn’t know the specific situation, but even if the other party was at the Void-refining Realm Early Stage, Mengmeng would still dare to fight him.","“Lead us the way,” Zhang Han said.","“Well...” Xing Nan’s expression changed slightly. “We are from the east of the south coast, but the Taoist title of the No. 1 Talent is Hun Shang. He is an extremely terrifying person. His cultivation is at the God Transformation Realm Peak Stage. His means are superb, and he has the top comprehension ability. He is one of the few most powerful people. He is now the protector of the sect, Protector Hun Shang. You can’t challenge him as a new disciple.”","“Is status necessary to challenge someone?” Mengmeng was stunned.","“Theoretically speaking, it isn’t. However, the truth is that no one will care about you if you don’t have any status.” Xing Nan said: “Everyone, please don’t challenge them for now. Lord Peak Master is asking for you. He is waiting in your courtyard.”","Xing Nan didn’t expect that the news of him being beaten by a new disciple would spread so quickly throughout Swordbamboo Peak.","Many people were curious about where the new disciple came from and how she was so powerful.","The rumors were getting more and more intense, and some were even distorted.","“The person who took action was as beautiful as a celestial fairy.”","“Eldest Brother Xing Nan has been pinned to the ground and beaten miserably.”","“It is said that his legs were broken at that time. The scene was so miserable...”","When Xing Nan heard the news, he immediately asked Liu Sheng and the others to announce the specific situation.","He had stopped the damage in time. Otherwise, if the news kept spreading, it would become “Senior Brother Xing Nan was killed”.","With Liu Sheng and others spreading the truth, more and more people in Swordbamboo Peak knew about this matter.","Xing Nan felt helpless, but there was nothing he could do. His skills were not as good as Mengmeng’s.","Even the Sect Leader had expressed his admiration for Zhang Yumeng.","“Fine. We’ll go back,” Mengmeng said, “Will you come with us? You look quite pleasing today. I’ll hire you as a tour guide with 100 points.”","“I still have something to do.”","Xing Nan felt that he had to protect his last bit of dignity, so he cupped his hands and took his leave.","He didn’t know what a tour guide was, but he felt that it was very likely to be a profession that would be beaten. “Forget it, I can’t afford to offend her, but I can hide.”","After Xing Nan left, Liu Sheng said hesitantly, “Well, do you mean it by 100 points?”","...","“Why would I lie about it?”","Mengmeng glared at him.","“Alright, alright.” Liu Sheng patted his chest and said, “I can do it as well. I also know the talented disciples of our sect.”","“Okay. You’ll do the job.”","They returned to the courtyard on the mountain.","“Lord Peak Master.”","A man with a dignified aura was standing in the yard.","Liu Sheng took the lead to greet him.","“Nice to meet you, Peak Master.” Mengmeng waved her hand.","Yue Xiaonao also greeted him. “Hello.”","Zhang Han nodded slightly to greet him.","...","Liu Sheng was shocked. Why didn’t these people salute when they saw the Peak Master?","The Peak Master of the Swordbamboo Peak cared the most about etiquette.","Unexpectedly, Liu Sheng was surprised again.","Peak Master said with a smile, “Nice to meet you, Zhang Hanyang, Zhang Yumeng, and Yue Xiaonao.”","“What can we do for you, Peak Master?” Zhang Han took the initiative to ask, for he had roughly guessed the reason.","The Peak Master said, “Our Ling Sea Sword Sect is very united, and many things are quite humanitarian. For example, Zhang Yumeng’s strength is excellent. Since she defeated Xing Nan, she is no longer a new disciple, and her points have reached more than a thousand. This can indirectly show her contribution to the sect, so I propose to the Grand Elder that Zhang Yumeng becomes the chief supervisor of the Swordbamboo Peak and a role model for the new disciples. Here, strength matters the most. Well... if your strength is higher and the person you challenge is more powerful, you can even be a protector or even an elder.”","Poof!","Liu Sheng couldn’t help but spit out his saliva.","Upon seeing this, the Peak Master twitched his mouth. His poor acting skills made it obvious that there was something wrong with him. However, Liu Sheng could not figure out what the problem was.","“The formalities of you being the chief supervisor have been completed. Here is your token.”","The Peak Master also felt embarrassed, and even his face was a little hot. He left the token and left with a smile.","After walking far away, he let out a long sigh of relief.","“Phew... Alas, I won’t come here in person for such things in the future. It’s so embarrassing.”","Thinking of his conversation with Elder Tian Chen, he found it unbelievable.","“I’ve become a chief supervisor?”","Mengmeng looked at her token.","“It must be my dad’s deeds,” Yue Xiaonao said in a low voice.","“Yeah.”","Mengmeng also thought of it.","They hadn’t done anything along the way, but in the end, she’d been promoted to the chief supervisor. This kind of thing was absolutely unheard of unless they were related to some insider.","In such a large sect, not to mention the elders and the others, even some of the chief supervisors and protectors were shrewd people. How could they possibly have goodwill for no reason? It was impossible.","Yue Wuwei was the only one on Mengmeng’s team who came here by himself, so he must have been the one who made the arrangement.","“That just made things easy.” Zhang Han smiled. He didn’t care.","Mengmeng said, “Let’s go and have some fun. Xiaonao, do you want to challenge a few first?”","Yue Xiaonao shook her head repeatedly and said, “I can’t. I can’t defeat anyone now, so I won’t go do it.”","“Alright, I’ll go.”","Mengmeng’s face was full of fighting spirit. She said to Liu Sheng, “Lead the way. Let’s go meet Hun Shang, the No.1 master in the east of the south coast.”","“Alright, I’ll lead the way.”","Liu Sheng was a little dazed.","“How come Zhang Yumeng has become a chief supervisor?","“And she became the No. 1 in the Swordbamboo Peak.","“She’s just too formidable.”","“Chief Supervisor Zhang, please allow me to introduce the distribution of the talented disciples in our sect to you,” Liu Sheng said cautiously.","“Tell me.”","“In the Ling Sea Sword Sect, there are countless talents, but they are also divided into several classes. The first class is made up of the No.1s from the east and the west respectively of the south and north coasts. These are the most powerful ones. There are also a small number of well-known branch experts in the first class. The No. 1 Superior of the Sword Edge is invincible on the south shore. In this way, these people are also famous in the other three great sects, and the Heavenly Evil Sect wants their heads. Whoever kills any one of them can get a lot of supreme treasures. Then, the second class is made up of the greatest expert of each small peak, like Senior Brother Xing Nan.”","“Have you ever heard of Jiang Yanlan?” Mengmeng asked.","“Who?” Liu Sheng looked confused. “Jiang Yanlan, I seem to have heard this name somewhere, but I can’t remember. Wait a minute. I’ll ask my friend.”","While he spoke, Liu Sheng began to contact his friends.","A few minutes later, he suddenly understood. “I see. Jiang Yanlan is also a very powerful person. She is number one on Little Crane Peak on the east of the north coast. She is very powerful. She has been traveling in the First War Zone all year round and has made great achievements. Currently, she is also a chief supervisor.”","“Oh, she’s not bad. Unfortunately, I’m going to surpass her soon.”","When it came to this, Mengmeng smiled happily.","This was growth, growth that could be sensed, a sign of strength improvement.","“Time flies so fast!”","Zhang Han suddenly sighed softly and said, “Maybe one day, my daughter will surpass me.”","Poof!","Liu Sheng was choked by his saliva again.","It was not until this moment that he realized that Zhang Yumeng, the chief supervisor and an awesome new disciple, was actually the daughter of the man next to her.","“My God, she’s already so powerful. How powerful would her father be?","“No wonder!","“No wonder she could become the chief supervisor so quickly. No wonder the way the Peak Master looked at them seemed strange. They turned out to be big shots.”","Liu Sheng was even more careful on the way.","The crowd took the aircraft and flew for more than three hours.","“Sword Sea Peak is just ahead.","“Milords, just wait. I’ll declare war!”","After that, Liu Sheng left the aircraft. He was on the Sword Sea Peak, running his spiritual force in his throat. His voice was as loud as the thunder.","“Is Protector Hun Shang around?","“Zhang Yumeng, the No.1 in the Swordbamboo Peak, the chief supervisor of the sect, has come to challenge Protector Hun Shang!”"]},{"number":1486,"title":"Chapter 1486 On Bamboo Sun Mountain","paragraphs":["Chapter 1486 On Bamboo Sun Mountain","“Who is so arrogant? Who dares to make trouble in the Sword Sea Peak?”","Clatter!","There were quite a few people standing on the treetops and watching from a distance on the several peaks ahead.","Some of them were supporters of Hun Shang. They all questioned the other party.","“How dare the Swordbamboo Peak come to challenge the Sword Sea Peak?”","“You’re courting death!”","“Isn’t Xing Nan the No. 1 of the Swordbamboo Peak? I’ve never heard of Zhang Yumeng.”","In the face of these people’s questioning, Liu Sheng just calmly said, “Zhang Yumeng the chief supervisor has become the No. 1 of our Swordbamboo Peak, and she has already defeated Senior Brother Xing Nan. Now, she challenges the Sword Sea Peak’s No. 1, the most powerful expert in the east of the south coast, Hun Shang.”","“Do you think he will accept the challenge just because you say so? Do you know the rules?” Someone sneered. “Senior Brother Hun Shang is busy cultivating. How can he have time to play with you, nobodies?”","“So he doesn’t dare to take it?”","Liu Sheng was risking his life for the 100 points. Of course, there was another possibility. He enjoyed the feeling of using greater powers to bully others.","Behind him, Zhang Yumeng was so powerful, even stronger than Senior Brother Xing Nan. He was now acting as a bully in the Sword Sea Peak and came to declare war, which made him feel really good.","He got to be happy while making money, so it was indeed worth it.","“What’s wrong?”","Liu Sheng held his hands behind his back and looked ahead. “Could it be that Sword Sea Peak doesn’t dare to accept the challenge?","“Or could it be that Senior Brother Hun Shang is afraid of losing the title of number one in the east of the southern coast?","“This is only a spar. There’s no need to be afraid. Senior Brother Hun Shang, please show yourself quickly.”","There was no doubt that he was acting as a poser at a place far from others’ territory.","The people around were all outer disciples of the Sword Sea Peak. Hun Shang and the others were all in the core area, so how could they hear him?","But Liu Sheng didn’t act without a purpose.","“Haha, you’re arrogant enough. I like it.”","Suddenly, a young disciple about 17 or 18 years old flew out of the crowd. With an angry look on his face, he approached the ones who had arrived. When he saw Mengmeng’s face clearly, he was stunned and even his attitude unconsciously softened a lot.","“If you want to challenge Senior Brother Hun Shang, come with me. But I have to warn you first. If you still dare to spout nonsense when you reach the inner peak, you will easily be beaten.” The man glanced at Liu Sheng.","“Got it. Thank you for telling me, brother.” Liu Sheng took his way out and smiled as he cupped his hands.","Upon seeing this, the man in white nodded slightly and he calmed down.","He led the group forward, and the surrounding mountains were in an uproar.","“Someone has come to challenge our Eldest Brother Hun Shang!”","“It seems that there will be a good show, hahaha.”","The news that Zhang Yumeng from the Swordbamboo Peak had come to challenge Hun Shang from the Sword Sea Peak quickly spread throughout the peak.","Zhang Han and the others were still following the young man inside while flying at a low altitude.","It was naturally much more convenient for them to get in while they had someone lead the way.","“This... Zhang Yumeng, you defeated Xing Nan?” the man asked with some curiosity.","Even though Xing Nan wasn’t as powerful as Hun Shang, he had a bit of a reputation.","Seeing Mengmeng nod, the man said, “As you can defeat Xing Nan and be the chief supervisor of the sect, you are indeed qualified to challenge Senior Brother Hun Shang, but you should be careful. Senior Brother Hun Shang is an aloof man. Even if you are a top beauty, he may not show mercy to you. He has never cared about pretty girls.”","Mengmeng waved her hand and said, “It’ll be interesting only when we fight seriously.”","“That’s still uncertain. Senior Brother Hun Shang may not agree to this duel.” The man smiled.","They arrived at the foot of the main peak.","“Please wait for a moment. I’ll go ask Senior Brother Hun Shang.”","“Okay.”","About an hour after the man left, he came down. Beside him was a woman in red. She was good-looking, and there seemed to be a trace of dissatisfaction and provocation between her eyebrows.","“Are you Zhang Yumeng?” the woman asked with a frown.","In terms of looks, she felt that Zhang Yumeng was indeed stunning.","“I am.” Mengmeng nodded and asked straightforwardly, “Shall we do this or not?”","“Is it true that you’re the chief supervisor of the sect?” the woman asked again.","Swoosh!","Mengmeng took out the token.","The woman took a look and said, “As the chief supervisor of the sect and the number one person on the Swordbamboo Peak, you’re indeed qualified to have my brother take action. According to the old rules, you need to prepare 1,000 points and five kinds of sixth-tier spirit treasures before coming.”","“What do you mean by 1,000 points?” Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao were stunned.","“Do I need to spend money while challenging someone?”","They took a look at Liu Sheng.","Liu Sheng expressed that he didn’t understand, too. He had never seen a battle of this level before.","It had been five years since Hun Shang, the No.1 in the east of the south coast, had been challenged. As a result, the challenger lost. When the duel took place, Liu Sheng was not around and had not watched the battle, so he did not know what a duel of this level required.","“You don’t even know that?” The woman smiled lightly and said, “If you want to challenge someone, then you have to prepare certain things. It’s the same for both sides, and the winner will take all the things. Understand?”","“What?” Mengmeng’s eyes widened, and then she rolled her eyes and said, “I can make money by challenging someone.”","...","Hearing this, the woman did not say anything. She turned around and said at the same time, “Newcomer, come back when you are ready.”","“Who said I don’t have the things with me?”","Mengmeng casually took out several kinds of sixth-tier spirit treasures.","The woman’s footsteps paused as she turned to the side. “Then you’ll fight on Bamboo Sun Mountain in three days.”","After saying that, she left.","“It’s a deal!”","Liu Sheng said stutteringly, “1,000 points and five kinds of sixth-tier spirit treasures. That’s a lot.”","“That’s nothing.”","Yue Xiaonao curled her lips.","They went back to their residences.","The most outstanding talent of the younger generation of the Swordbamboo Peak had been replaced.","...","The chief supervisor, Zhang Yumeng, would have a battle on Bamboo Sun Mountain three days later.","Zhang Yumeng challenged Hun Shang, and it would be the collision between the Swordbamboo Peak and the Sword Sea Peak.","This series of words and the news spread throughout the various peaks in the east of the south coast.","“Hahahaha.”","Someone laughed and said, “The strength of the Swordbamboo Peak is three levels lower than that of the Sword Sea Peak. How dare the former challenge the latter? Aren’t they giving out benefits in vain?”","“It’s one thing to challenge others, but the key is that she’s going to challenge Hun Shang. He’s a very terrifying fellow!”","“Amazing. It is said that Zhang Yumeng is extremely good-looking and powerful. She is a new disciple and has won the support of the Peak Master of Swordbamboo Peak.”","“She became a chief supervisor so quickly? Are you sure? Even the elders in charge agreed to this?”","“It’s so terrifying that she became a chief supervisor.”","“It goes without saying that she must know an elder, who is her acquaintance and gave her training. Without a backer, how could she become a chief supervisor in just a few days? Someone like her, who used connections, dares to challenge Hun Shang? Hah! Hun Shang is not someone who will show mercy to women!”","“...”","In the east of the south coast, there were many factions and many circles.","That day, those who knew about this discussed this matter.","The young disciples of the Ling Sea Sword Sect were calm because almost all the famous disciples knew their own strength and seldom fought with each other. The war zones and the secret realms were the places where they showed their strength. The place was chaotic because many people challenged each other every day and fought fiercely.","It had been three years since the competition for the position of number one in the east of the south coast had occurred.","Hun Shang was about to face another challenge. Would he still be able to hold onto his throne?","At Hun Shang’s residence, the woman in red asked in confusion, “Brother, don’t you have no interest in sparring? Why did you agree to it?”","A handsome man was sitting in front of her. His face was cold, like a zombie’s, without any emotion.","After hearing her words, he was silent for a few seconds, put down the teacup in his hand, and slowly said, “I feel like doing some exercise.”","“But you never bothered to do such things before. Did you agree when you heard that Zhang Yumeng was a beautiful woman? She is indeed very pretty. I don’t mind if she becomes my sister-in-law. What do you think?” the woman in red teased.","Hun Shang was still expressionless as he asked, “Hun Xuan, how many years have we been in the Sword Sect?”","“Seven years.”","“It is time to leave.” Hun Shang looked into the distance. His tone was incredibly calm.","“What? Are you about to break through?”","Hun Xuan’s eyes widened, and her expression suddenly became complicated. She said in a distressed tone, “Brother, you should live your own life. You have exhausted yourself. We must kill Elder Blackeye, but we don’t have to rush it. We can wait for another ten years.”","Hun Shang closed his eyes and murmured, “We can’t wait any longer...”","Hun Xuan didn’t say anything and sat on the chair in a daze.","After a while, Hun Shang left and entered the practice room.","Rumbling sounds could be heard from the high-grade alloy practice room.","A terrifying fluctuation was spreading.","In Zhang Han’s residence.","Zhao Feng and Chen Changqing went to cultivate, and they were also familiarizing themselves with the sect.","Only Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei’s families were relatively relaxed. They were eating and drinking wine here.","“Wherever I go, I can hear your news,” Zi Yan said with a smile. “Zhang Yumeng from Swordbamboo Peak and Hun Shang from Sword Sea Peak will fight on Bamboo Sun Mountain three days later. The news has spread so fast.”","She felt that the spread of the news was greater than the work of media’s publicity.","Ling Sea Sword Sect was very large to ordinary disciples, while elite disciples had smaller circles.","“Hun Shang is at the God Transformation Realm Peak Stage. Are you sure you can defeat him?” Zi Yan asked.","“I guess. I haven’t fought him.” Mengmeng said, “If he is an ordinary cultivator at the God Transformation Realm Peak Stage, I can win with a casual fight. But if he is elite, I’ll need to exert more strength.”","“It’s easy for you to say. Don’t get defeated by him later,” Zi Yan said.","“You’re underestimating me. I also have a lot of trump cards. A famous teacher has a brilliant disciple. In the past two years, Daddy has taught me a lot of things,” Mengmeng said with a snort.","At this time, Yue Wuwei took a look at Yue Xiaonao, who was watching the fun. He said grumpily, “Don’t waste your chance to learn from Han. He has so many good resources. You should ask him to teach you something. This guy knows much more than me.”","Ever since he learned that Zhang Han had once been at the ninth tier of the Tribulation Stage, Yue Wuwei had been convinced in terms of knowledge and experience.","The number of things a Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier cultivator could come into contact with was many times greater than his.","“I haven’t mastered what you taught me,” Yue Xiaonao replied casually. “Cultivation can’t be rushed. I’m just at the beginning.”","“Right. She’s not in a rush to learn, but you are.” Lisa teased him.","“You’re right.” Yue Wuwei was speechless. He stroked his beard and stopped talking.","Three days went by in a flash.","The news of the battle between Hun Shang and Zhang Yumeng spread throughout the east of the south coast.","Early in the morning, many people went straight to Bamboo Sun Mountain.","Many people in the west of the south coast had also heard about this, and some of them came to watch the fun.","When Mengmeng and the others arrived.","“Oh my god, there are so many people.”","Yue Xiaonao was greatly shocked.","The dozens of mountain peaks around Bamboo Sun Mountain were packed with people. There was simply no way to count how many people there were.","“Zhang Yumeng!","“Good luck, Senior Sister!”","Liu Sheng ran over from not far away and said, “Do you see the nearest mountains? Those people are all disciples of our Swordbamboo Peak. I saw a lot of protectors coming, as well as Eldest Brother Xing Nan and many others. It is said that our Peak Master will come to watch the battle in person.”","“Alright.” Mengmeng nodded slightly.","Some people would be extremely nervous when they saw such a scene.","Even Mengmeng, who had experienced many grand occasions, had a different feeling when facing such a scene.","“There are so many people here.” Mengmeng made a face.","“Are you under pressure?” Zhang Han said, “If you don’t like them, just ask them to leave.”","When Zhang Han used to fight great battles, there were hundreds of millions of spectators. At first, he had been nervous about it, but he had gotten used to it slowly.","“It’s okay. I’m not afraid of anything with you here,” Mengmeng said.","Her words made Zhang Han laugh and feel happy.","“Go get him.”","Zhang Han patted Mengmeng on the shoulder.","“Okay, I’ll go now.”","Mengmeng got up and flew to Bamboo Sun Mountain.","She stood on a huge stone at the top of the mountain.","At this time, the sun had just risen, and the sun shone on Mengmeng’s back, making her shine with a layer of golden light.","In many people’s eyes, Zhang Yumeng was the rising sun, famous in the Swordbamboo Peak, and she had challenged Hun Shang, the No.1 martial artist in the east of the south coast.","“She’s so beautiful! It’s just like a painting!”","The disciples who had entered the sect at the same time as Zhang Han stood in a group.","“I’ve told you that Zhang Yumeng is not an ordinary cultivator. She is super powerful.”","“I could tell it the moment she defeated Senior Brother Liu Sheng.”","“She’s challenging Hun Shang. She is a role model for the new disciples.”","Liu Sheng and the others listened aside, silent.","At this time, the glory of the Swordbamboo Peak was all about Mengmeng.","“Peak Master is here!”","The Peak Master of the Swordbamboo Peak had arrived.","“Greetings, Peak Master.”","Xing Nan and the others greeted him one after another.","He nodded, walked to the front, looked at Mengmeng, and praised, “This is the most outstanding disciple of our Swordbamboo Peak.”","Xing Nan felt bitter.","He had never received such praise even though he had joined the sect for such a long time.","On the other side.","Among the people of the Sword Sea Peak.","Hun Xuan, who was dressed in red clothes, stood at the very front.","Moments later, their Peak Master and other higher-ups arrived.","“Where is your brother?”","“He’s almost here.”","“Okay. I wonder if it’ll be a wonderful battle.” The Peak Master sighed with emotion. “There are countless new talents in the sect, and this is the foundation of our sect.”","All protectors and even several elders were in the crowd.","Even Grand Elder Tian Chen, who was secretly observing with his mind in his own hall, couldn’t help wondering.","“Hun Shang is quite powerful. I wonder if Zhang Yumeng can defeat him.","“I’m actually a bit nervous. Since she has a powerful background, I don’t know if I should intervene if she can’t defeat him.","“It will be a fair fight. I’ll just watch. If people ask me, I’ll pretend that I don’t know about it.”","“...”","Tian Chen was worried that Yue Wuwei and the others were narrow-minded and cared more about victory or defeat, while his worries were somewhat groundless.","“Hun Shang is here.”","A black-robed figure flew over at high speed from afar.","He landed on Bamboo Sun Mountain.","He looked at Mengmeng calmly and said, “Let’s get it started.”","He was a straightforward man.","Mengmeng’s response was even more straightforward.","She casually threw out three huge fireballs and attacked at the same time.","It was a probing attack.","Seeing this, Hun Shang unhurriedly used an occult art to form an illusory ribbon, which surrounded the fireballs and destroyed them.","At this time, Mengmeng was holding the long whip made of flames in her hand. Zhang Han had taught her how to use the whip. Whether it was in terms of the track of movement or something else, it was perfect. She could move forward and backward freely. She was in a perfect state.","Seeing this, Hun Shang still kept an expressionless face. He made a gesture of casting with both hands and took out nine Five-star Darts.","Each dart was one meter in diameter.","They circled up and resisted the flaming whip.","He moved back and forth, changing his moves countless times.","Everyone was dazzled by the scene.","“It’s still a probing attack.”","“I guess the fierce battle is about to begin.”","The protectors, elders, and even Peak Masters around the mountain could tell some clues from the battle.","“I underestimated Zhang Yumeng. I didn’t expect her moves to contain infinite mysteries. Her whip is powerful, but it can’t take down Hun Shang.”","“I have the same opinion. I thought that Hun Shang would be able to defeat Zhang Yumeng in three moves. I never expected that Zhang Yumeng would completely possess the qualifications to participate in this battle. No wonder she was able to directly defeat Xing Nan, who isn’t a match for her at all.”","“...”","If Xing Nan heard their discussion, he would definitely say to Mengmeng, “It’s all thanks to you. When you become famous in the future, no one will forget me. Every time someone mentions your name, they will say that when Zhang Yumeng first entered the sect, she rose from the Swordbamboo Peak and disabled Xing Nan, the most powerful disciple at that time...”","Xing Nan felt that he was not exaggerating at all.","Hun Shang and Mengmeng fought for a few minutes.","Hun Shang slightly nodded.","The woman in red could understand his gesture. He was expressing that his opponent’s strength was not bad.","“Raindrops.” Hun Shang suddenly spoke.","After which, dark clouds gathered above, and raindrops began to fall.","It was an abnormal sign. In the beginning, every raindrop was very ordinary. It was like natural scenery. However, when it was about to fall, it gradually became sharp. Every raindrop turned into a tiny sword.","This move covered heaven and earth and was a large-scale attack. When the target of the attack was one person, thousands of raindrops could also be combined into a formation, which was very powerful.","“It’s the Sword Sea Peak’s number one occult art, the Raindrops!”","A lot of exclamations sounded from the various peaks.","“Last time, three years ago, when Hun Shang used the Raindrops Technique, he was only able to condense thirty meters of dark clouds. In just three short years, he succeeded in cultivating the Raindrops Technique and condensed three hundred meters of dark clouds. This... is a terrifying rate of progress.”","“With enough time, Hun Shang will definitely become a great expert!”","Even the Peak Master of Sword Sea Peak nodded. “Not bad, his comprehension of this move has reached the advanced stage.”","On the other hand, the Peak Master of Swordbamboo Peak was slightly worried. “This move isn’t easy to defend against.”","Xing Nan’s face grew grim as he said, “I think she’s going to lose.”","He hoped that Zhang Yumeng would win. If even Hun Shang would be defeated by Zhang Yumeng, then it wouldn’t matter that he had been beaten up violently, and he felt happy to be on equal footing with Hun Shang.","In fact, their worries were unnecessary.","“Burning Sky!”","Mengmeng looked up at the raindrops, and her eyes suddenly turned fiery red.","Waves of terrifying flame power burst forth.","Mengmeng had been playing with fire since she was a child. She had learned countless fiery occult arts.","And now, for the first time, she used her powerful fire supernatural power, Burning Sky.","After Zhang Han’s carefully taught supernatural power showed up, many people’s faces changed.","“It’s such a pure flame power.”","“What... what kind of supernatural power is this?”","“Why do I have a feeling that the Raindrops Technique is going to fail?”","Under the watchful eyes of everyone, the illusory sea of flames seemed to have turned into a hurricane that suddenly swept up.","At this moment, the figure standing in the sea of flames was so charming."]},{"number":1487,"title":"Chapter 1487 She’s Zhang Yumeng","paragraphs":["Chapter 1487 She’s Zhang Yumeng","“Where does Zhang Yumeng come from? She’s such an expert!”","Many people gasped when they saw this scene, and they thought it was terrifying.","“Just this sea of flames is enough to allow her to become one of the most outstanding amongst the younger generation of the sect.”","“What a powerful supernatural power! This is definitely her unique skill. Otherwise, the sea of flames would be utterly incapable of displaying such terrifying might.”","“It’s really... extraordinary,” the Peak Master of the Swordbamboo Peak muttered in low voice.","Even Xing Nan was shocked. “No wonder I lost. It seems that she didn’t use her full strength when she fought me.”","For a moment, he seemed to have understood something. It might be too easy for her to fight him.","More and more people began to talk about it.","Buzz!","However, when the attacks collided, the scene returned to calm.","Countless eyes were fixed on the place where the two’s powerful secret skills and supernatural powers met.","The sea of flames was burning the Sword Qi of the raindrops.","“Hmm?”","Hun Shang felt a trace of pressure. He focused his eyes and had to deal with the sea of flames with all his strength.","“Raindrops...","“Such a powerful flame.”","But Hun Shang was not nervous. He made a casting gesture with both hands, and his eyes suddenly burst out a green light.","“Raindrops Accumulation!”","Clatter!","Countless raindrops poured down from the sky. At this moment, they gathered into a river, and their power increased five times while they were also more condensed.","At a glance, it was a river in the air.","But everyone could sense that it was like a sword flow.","The Sword Qi moved like a python. As long as the energy above was continuous, the river would not stop.","“Oh my god!”","The Peak Master of Sword Sea Peak was shocked when he saw this. “Hun Shang has figured out an extension of the Raindrops Technique? Such a change in his move is truly quite stunning.”","It was very difficult to change the move of occult art. One could only comprehend some of it after entering a state of sudden enlightenment. However, it was also a big project to achieve integration and mastery.","Now, Hun Shang had developed the Raindrops Technique into a move that could accumulate raindrops.","This aptitude amazed the Peak Master.","What he didn’t know was that after the first level of Raindrops Accumulation, Hun Shang had the second and even the third level of the advanced technique, whose power was greater than the former. Although he was still comprehending and cultivating, he could still perform the third level of Raindrops Accumulation, which evolved from the first level. Only Hun Shang knew how terrifying its power was.","The first level of Raindrops Accumulation reduced the fire Mengmeng had cast.","“Huh?”","Mengmeng felt that something was different.","“He’s quite capable.”","She thought to herself.","“Fire Phoenix Spreading Wings!”","After running her power a bit, Mengmeng cast another powerful occult art.","Creak!","Under everyone’s gaze, a sudden change took place in the endless sea of flames. Waves of fire kept gathering, and gradually, a living fire phoenix appeared.","It raised its head and roared. Its wings moved, pressing upwards.","“What...”","The Peak Master of the Swordbamboo Peak was stupefied. “She has even mastered this supernatural power?”","Opposite them, near the crowd of the Sword Sea Peak, an elder said in shock, “We often present some things while using supernatural powers or occult arts. Take Hun Shang’s moves as an example. They are like a river, a mountain, a tree, a boulder, and some creatures. Without exception, to carve these things, one needs to have a direct understanding of the creatures to display their power. But this is such a vivid fire phoenix. Could it be... could it be that she has seen one with her own eyes? It’s incredible.”","Mengmeng had never seen a fire phoenix, but Zhang Han had not only seen one but also eaten it.","“She’s that powerful?”","Hun Shang’s younger sister, Hun Xuan, had a serious expression.","In the beginning, she was very sure that her brother would win.","However, after witnessing such a scene, she slightly felt uncertain.","“It’s not simple.”","On the other side, Yue Wuwei suddenly stroked his beard and looked at Hun Shang with a meaningful look.","“This boy has great potential,” Zhang Han said calmly.","“Then...” Zi Yan’s eyes narrowed slightly.","“Who do you think will win?” Yue Wuwei said with a smile, “I guess it will be the boy on the opposite side.”","“It has to be Mengmeng,” Yue Xiaonao said.","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and said with a faint smile, “He may not win even if he has great potential. In terms of trump cards, my daughter has even more.”","...","“But there is still a gap between their strength and their realms,” Yue Wuwei said. “That boy is at the Void-refining Realm Early Stage, and he is not an ordinary cultivator at that. I can tell from the way he displays his occult art that his aura is very steady. I don’t think he has a problem defeating an ordinary cultivator at the Void-refining Realm Middle Stage. Mengmeng is still young. She is only 18 years old and hasn’t cultivated for a long time. It’s amazing that while she’s at the God Transformation Realm Early Stage, she’s fighting a cultivator at the Void refining Realm Early Stage. But she may not be able to defeat that boy.”","“That’s a good analysis.” Zhang Han nodded. He then shook his head several times and, “My daughter can win.”","He was so confident when he spoke.","Because only he knew the background of some of the moves he had taught Mengmeng.","Many of Mengmeng’s occult arts could be extended to the supernatural powers that Zhang Han had comprehended through cultivation. Each of them was a well-known ninth-tier Tribulation Stage skill. How could they be ordinary? The upper limit was extremely high.","Even if Hun Shang had some potential, his skills couldn’t compare with Zhang Han’s. He was a cultivator in the Void-refining Realm. If he was really at the God Transformation Realm Peak Stage as others had said, he might be brutally beaten up.","As the fire phoenix rose into the air, Hun Shang’s pupils contracted slightly. He meditated for a while, and the long sword in his right hand suddenly drew a semicircle.","Buzz!","The incomparably focused defensive layer surrounded him. He turned into a stream of light and quickly dived down.","He was going to fight Mengmeng using close combat.","At the same time, he controlled the first-level Raindrops Accumulation. Its final power used up 70% of the fire phoenix’s energy. He plunged into it. The sword light flickered. It was as if the fire phoenix had exploded internally.","...","Buzz!","The fire phoenix was forcibly cut apart by him.","“Sword move one, Mountain breaking.","“Sword move two, River Cleaving.","“Sword move three, Sky Piercer Slashes!","“Sword move four, Meteor Transformation!”","“...”","Hun Shang slashed out nine times in succession.","The powerful sword Qi caused an uproar again.","“As expected of the No. 1 Expert in the east of the south coast. How formidable!”","“Zhang Yumeng is also amazing, but she’s still too young.”","“Judging from Hun Shang’s aura and state, he’s probably not far from breaking through to the Void-refining Realm. If he reaches the Void-refining Realm, he can be promoted to the higher-up of the sect!”","The Voiding Realm was the standard for protectors. Because of Hun Shang’s high contribution, he had become a protector while he was at the Peak Stage of the God Transformation Realm.","There were also a lot of such disciples. They had proved that they could break through to the Void-refining Realm. With this ability, they could be regarded as protectors in advance.","But no one knew that Hun Shang was not far from breaking through to the Middle Stage of the Void-refining Realm.","Nothing could hide under the nine sword strikes.","Mengmeng knew very well that in the face of such a move, it was very difficult to escape.","But she had never thought of escaping.","Wasn’t it just a head-on fight?","A trace of fierceness suddenly flashed across Mengmeng’s eyes. A long sword appeared in her right hand. Following her gaze, a crystal-cold light burst out at the same time.","“Whale sucking the sea, awe-inspiring sword Qi!”","Buzz!","A pale yellow sword light instantly absorbed all the energy in all directions.","It included some of the energy dispersed by the Raindrops Technique, the energy dissipated by Mengmeng’s fire phoenix, and the surrounding spiritual Qi.","This was an extremely terrifying devouring power.","Even the energy of Hun Shang’s sword moves was trembling.","“This sword move...” Zhang Han sighed softly and said, “It’s called Dusk Sword.”","Without waiting for Yue Wuwei to ask, Zhang Han muttered, “I got to know an old senior back then, whose understanding of swordsmanship reached its peak. It was rare for him to meet an opponent who could be a match for him in the Cultivation World. Many people called him the Sword God. When I met him, he was already in his late years. He was obsessed with the sword and launched the last strike with all his energy, including his vitality. That strike was earth-shattering. Countless dark clouds of Thunder Tribulations for all the Tribulation Stage cultivators in the Star Area were shattered by the power.","“I’ve learned a lot of sword occult arts and even some supernatural powers from him, but none of them could compare with the Dusk Sword. I comprehended the origin of the Dusk Sword through one of his occult arts. Although it couldn’t be compared with that sword strike, it had nearly half of its power. Just because of that, the Dusk Sword is the top occult art in the swordsmanship of the Cultivation World.","“Although my daughter has only learned a little of it, the power she displayed is still quite good.”","In the end, Zhang Han stopped lamenting and laughed.","“Alas, that’s amazing.”","Yue Wuwei looked at the rising yellow sword light, and his beard trembled.","He was also looking forward to the power of the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier.","Even Yue Wuwei couldn’t see through the mystery of this sword strike. In fact, there was no mystery about it. It didn’t have an appropriate state of mind, nor did it have that kind of comprehension. It was just tangible.","Although that was the case, Zhang Han’s goal was that Mengmeng could improve her combat capability after mastering it.","He didn’t expect Mengmeng to become that kind of swordsman.","She could become one, but it would not be necessary.","The others were unable to discern the profundities of the Dusk Sword, but they were able to sense its terrifying might.","“What...”","Hun Shang’s face changed slightly. His expressionless face finally changed.","“This sword strike is amazing.”","Hun Shang retreated rapidly and gave up changing his moves and getting close to Mengmeng.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","The nine rays of sword light were unable to stop the attack of the Dusk Sword at all.","To everyone’s surprise, after the nine beams of sword light were shattered, all the scattered energy was absorbed by the Dusk Sword’s Sword Qi.","It seemed to have become stronger.","“Nice.”","There was a hint of seriousness in Hun Shang’s eyes.","He kept waving his long sword.","After trying for a while, he finally found a flaw.","As the distance between them grew, he found that Mengmeng’s control of the Dusk Sword’s Sword Qi had also become unstable.","“Continue going up!”","Hun Shang flew high into the sky while resisting the Dusk Sword’s Sword Qi.","Under the gazes of countless people, Hun Shang’s face was solemn as he felt the Sword Qi.","“Keep going up.”","Swoosh!","At first, Hun Shang could be seen by others. Gradually, his face could no longer be seen clearly. His figure appeared as just a black shadow.","Soon, the black shadow became sesame-sized, and after a while, it disappeared.","“What is he doing?”","Many people present were stunned.","“Hun Shang has been beaten away?”","“Heavens, the victor hasn’t been decided yet, yet he directly fled from the scene. Absolutely amazing.”","“Brother...” Hun Xuan covered her forehead. “Even though she’s very strong, he shouldn’t have fled so far, right?”","At this moment, everyone finally found out what Hun Shang was doing.","Because he knew that this sword strike wasn’t easy to resist, he dodged.","But as he kept dodging, the distance became too far.","Everyone assumed that since the distance between Mengmeng and Hun Shang was far, the Sword Qi would naturally dissipate as soon as it reached him.","“Can one fight like that during a duel?”","A fat man in the crowd said, “So does it mean that it will be okay if I’ll leave directly and rest for two hours before continuing to fight during a duel?”","“What is Hun Shang doing?”","The sound of the discussion gradually rang out.","Many people thought that Hun Shang should be able to resist this sword strike.","“Maybe this is Zhang Yumeng’s last trump card. If he pays some price to resist it, won’t he win directly?”","“Yeah. I don’t understand what he’s doing either.”","“...”","“Humph.” Hearing these comments, Yue Xiaonao curled her lips.","Mengmeng had a lot of means. The Dusk Sword was powerful, but in Mengmeng’s case, it was just a sword occult art.","In fact, Yue Xiaonao felt that with Uncle Zhang’s character, every move he taught Mengmeng was likely to be as powerful as the Dusk Sword.","Swoosh!","From afar, everyone could see a black dot.","“He’s back?”","Mengmeng blinked her eyes, looking a little dazed.","This kind of very serious escape method also broadened her horizons.","It was truly special.","This was the first time she had encountered such a situation in a battle of mutual sparring.","“Are we going to continue the fight when you come back?” Mengmeng asked at a distance.","“No.”","Hun Shang looked calm and said bluntly, “I can’t resist your strike. I lost this battle.”","After that, Hun Shang glanced at Hun Xuan in the crowd, nodded, turned around, and left.","In the eyes of the crowd, his back looked a little bleak.","After this battle, Hun Shang was no longer the No. 1 Expert in the east of the south coast, while the rising new star, Zhang Yumeng, replaced him.","“You’re amazing.”","Not only was Hun Xuan not angry, but she also looked at Mengmeng with a smile. Her attitude and tone were very good. “Zhang Yumeng, you are beautiful and so powerful. You are simply a role model for our generation.”","“You’re too courteous,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","“I’ll transfer 1,000 points to you. Also, take these five kinds of sixth-tier spirit treasures.” Hun Xuan took out the treasures.","Seeing this, Mengmeng put them away happily and said, “I can make money by challenging someone. This is a good deal.”","“Well, what do you think of my older brother?” Hun Xuan suddenly asked in a low voice.","“He’s not bad. I think he’s quite amazing.” Mengmeng was stunned.","“He’s also quite handsome, isn’t he?” Hun Xuan asked.","“Well, if you think he’s handsome, he’s handsome,” Mengmeng said with a suspicious look.","“What is Hun Xuan doing?","“Why is she acting like a matchmaker?”","“Ahem, don’t talk nonsense, or my dad will beat you.” Mengmeng couldn’t help reminding her.","“What?”","This time, it was Hun Xuan’s turn to be stunned. She pondered for two seconds and said with a smile, “I don’t talk nonsense. You are from Swordbamboo Peak. I will talk to you when I have time.”","“All right.”","Mengmeng saw that Hun Xuan’s smile was meaningful, and she couldn’t help but feel her scalp tingle.","“Could it be that she is a lesbian?","“Oh my god!”","At the thought of this possibility, Mengmeng gasped.","She was ready to go back and find someone to inquire about Hun Xuan.","“It’s nothing. Congratulations on becoming the No.1 in the east of the south coast. With this title, you’ll get a lot of benefits. Take your time to experience it. Well, I’ll talk to you later. There are too many people here. I’ll go first.”","Hun Xuan said goodbye with a smile and left.","When she turned her head, she saw Hun Shang in the distance, who turned around and looked back.","“Look, my brother can’t help peeping at you. He’s awkwardly adorable. Don’t mind him,” said Hun Xuan.","“Go now, or you’ll really be beaten later,” Mengmeng added.","“Hahaha.”","Hun Xuan smiled and left without saying a word.","What she didn’t know was that Hun Shang’s face was extremely darkened.","“Hun Shang has lost.”","The Peak Master of the Sword Sea Peak shook his head and said, “I don’t blame him. Zhang Yumeng is very powerful. She has such cultivation and occult arts and horrible aptitude at such a young age. It’s lucky for our Sword Sect to have so many talents....”","After that, he took the lead in leaving.","“Hahaha, this is the aptitude that the No. 1 of our Swordbamboo Peak should have!” The Swordbamboo Peak of the Swordbamboo Peak burst out laughing.","“Ahem, ahem. Yeah. Ahem...”","What he didn’t know was that Xing Nan, the former number one cultivator beside him, looked so embarrassed.","He couldn’t help thinking. “Peak Master, if you don’t know how to speak properly, can you stop talking and save some dignity for me?”","“Her name is Zhang Yumeng.”","Some of the elders and protectors stared at Mengmeng for a long time. They shook their heads and left.","They felt that this trip to watch the battle had been worth it.","“Zhang Yumeng, the No.1 martial artist in the east of the south coast.”","“She’s Zhang Yumeng from Swordbamboo Peak.”","“She’s Zhang Yumeng.”","“She’s beautiful, has a sweet voice, and is powerful.”","“...”","At this moment, many people remembered the name Zhang Yumeng.","Everyone began to discuss amongst themselves.","They were shocked and felt like they were dreaming.","Hun Shang, who had dominated for many years, had finally been defeated.","The destruction of one myth represented the rise of another.","“I won.”","Mengmeng flew back to Zhang Han and smiled. There was a familiar look in her beautiful big eyes.","“You’ve already won. You’re truly amazing.”","Zhang Han praised her.","“It sounds like you don’t mean it. That’s what you also said when I was a child,” Mengmeng said grumpily.","“Hahaha!”","Zhang Han laughed heartily, and then his face became serious. “Your combat capability has improved a lot, and your cultivation is very solid. This is related to your daily hard work in cultivation. The choice and performance of the occult arts are very specific and unique. Congratulations, my little princess, your training in combat is already good enough.”","“Haha.”","Mengmeng said with a smile, “I still have to continue to learn from you, Father.”","“Look at how smug you are,” Zi Yan said with amusement.","“My dad just bet that you would lose, Mengmeng.” Yue Xiaonao gave her dad away.","“Did I say that?” Yue Wuwei asked with a puzzled look.","“Yes,” Zhang Han, Zi Yan, and Yue Xiaonao said in unison.","Yue Wuwei was speechless.","Hearing what Yue Xiaonao said, Mengmeng snorted and said, “Xiaonao, I have been underestimated. Shouldn’t you do something about it tonight?”","Yue Xiaonao pondered for a moment and asked, “Do you mean I need to cut off my dad’s beard?”","“That’s right.”","“What a good idea!”","“...”","Hearing their words, Yue Wuwei twitched his mouth.","When they were about to return to their residences, Zhang Han said, “That boy Hun Shang is at the Void-refining Realm Early Stage and can fight an ordinary cultivator at the Void-refining Realm Middle Stage. That’s why Elder Yue said you might lose the battle.”","“What?” Mengmeng was stunned. “But what he showed was the power of the God Transformation Realm Peak Stage. Why did he hide his real strength?”","“I don’t know. Maybe he had some ideas.” Zhang Han shook his head and said with a smile, “How much effort did you make?”","Mengmeng thought for a moment and said, “Seventy percent... or maybe eighty percent of all my strength.”","“It’s more than enough.”","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes slightly and said, “If you had fought with all your strength, you might only win by three points. Or to put it simply, you two are evenly matched.”","“Yes, that’s what I mean. They’re evenly matched. That’s already very impressive,” Yue Wuwei said repeatedly.","Zhang Han suddenly added, “But if it’s a life-and-death battle, he will die without a doubt.”","After he said that, Yue Wuwei suddenly fell silent.","Two seconds later, he nodded heavily and said very seriously, “Yes, in a life-and-death battle, he won’t have a chance of survival.”"]},{"number":1488,"title":"Chapter 1488 Breakthrough","paragraphs":["Chapter 1488 Breakthrough","“I’m hungry.”","After returning to the house, Mengmeng wanted to eat something.","“A fierce battle would consume a lot of energy. I will make you some nutritious food.” Zhang Han smiled, walked into the kitchen, and slowly cooked.","He took out a lot of nutritious and energy-filled Exotic Beast meat, stir-fried it, and stewed it.","The others sat in the yard to rest, chatting and talking about what had just happened.","“My daughter,” Yue Wuwei said, “look at Mengmeng. She can now fight against a Dao Seeking Cultivator in the Void-refining Realm. You have to work harder.”","“Got it.” Yue Xiaonao didn’t want to hear it. She said, “I have you guys to protect me anyway. Why would I need to be in such a hurry to learn?”","“What you said makes sense.” Yue Wuwei felt helpless when he heard this. It took him a long time to say this.","He thought to himself. “I still have to protect them for many years anyway. Yue Xiaonao will definitely be able to become a Tribulation Stage Dao Seeking Cultivator in eighty or a hundred years.”","“You did a good job in this battle. It’s kind of interesting,” Yue Wuwei praised.","“How was it interesting?” Mengmeng asked.","“It’s otherworldly and has many means involved. Also, you were flexible in using them. This battle is close to the ones between the upper echelons of the Cultivation World,” Yue Wuwei said.","“It’s far from the top. It’s just a small fight now.” Zhang Han controlled more than a dozen dishes to levitate beside him as they floated to the dining table. Everyone was ready to eat. He sat down and said with a smile, “My daughter is only at the God Transformation Realm Early Stage. Now she can absorb some medicinal pellets to help her make a breakthrough to the Middle Stage. It’s estimated that she can make it in about half a month. Then, she can digest the side effects of those medicinal pellets and stabilize her cultivation for a period. When she reaches the Tribulation Stage, she can go to the Central Galaxy, which is the starting point of the high-end cultivation world and has countless secret realms.”","“The Central Galaxy is too far away. Even I haven’t been there.” Yue Wuwei’s eyes flickered, and he also wanted to go there and explore.","Zhang Han took a sip of wine and said, “The classification of the Astral Domains is just a very general concept.”","While the others at the table were eating, they all listened to him talk about these things with confidence. Zhang Han’s narration was also something they liked.","Some anecdotes were very interesting, but Zhang Han would occasionally talk about them when Mengmeng was around. The guys had never heard Zhang Han talking about them when Mengmeng was not around.","After taking a sip of wine, Zhang Han smiled and said, “The classification system does not mean that a specific Galaxy is designated as an advanced Galaxy. Instead, it refers to the level of the secret realms within. In the secret realms in the Center Galaxy, there are often eighth-tier spirit treasures, even ninth-tier spirit treasures, which are rare and valuable, not ordinary ones. Even in the Heavenly Dragon Star Province, the number of spirit treasures is limited. The Astral Domain of Vast Heaven also has a limit. There are almost no powerful spirit treasures here, let alone Profound-grade treasures...”","While he was talking, what happened, in reality, contradicted his words, but they didn’t see it with their own eyes.","In the void of the universe outside an enormous planet known as the Vast Heaven Star.","Clack! Clack! Clack!","Suddenly, there was a large-scale tremor.","Countless spatial rifts appeared. It was as if a piece of space had been smashed apart. The scale of the spatial rifts was so large that it made one’s hair stand on end.","The space station in the distance didn’t notice it at all.","A glimmer of light suddenly appeared.","Like a sun, it illuminated the starry sky, but the strange thing was that the light was only shining in the crack area and could not be seen.","Swoosh!","Suddenly, a flash of golden light flashed past.","Judging from its outline, it seemed to be a meteorite.","In a free falling way, it descended toward the enormous Vast Heaven Star.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","On the surface, a trace of energy that leaked out from the meteorite caused the ground within a radius of dozens of meters to sink. All the trees, mountains, and rivers were completely destroyed.","At this moment, all the electronic devices on the Vast Heaven Star suddenly short-circuited.","No one had noticed all of this at all.","At that moment, the meteorite seemed to have smashed through the void. Flames suddenly burst out on the ground, and then the meteorite disappeared from the world.","However, the destruction of the entire surface of the earth was very eye-catching.","At the center, there was a faint light, which meant that a brand new secret realm had been born.","The next day.","At dawn, Mengmeng finished her night of cultivation, washed up, and took a walk in the backyard.","Just ten minutes later, her communication device in the sect rang.","She took a look and found that it was a message from Hun Xuan, who told her that she was coming over for a visit.","“That woman in red...” Mengmeng thought for a while and agreed.","Unexpectedly, in just ten minutes, Hun Xuan arrived.","She said with a kind attitude and a smile, “Zhang Yumeng, you don’t mind that I’ve come over to chat with you, do you?”","“Since you’re already here, how can I refuse?” Mengmeng responded.","Hun Xuan was stunned. She felt that Zhang Yumeng was quite lively.","She smiled and asked, “How old are you?”","“You’re here to check my background? How old are you?” Mengmeng asked in reply.","“I’m an adult.”","“I’m an adult too.”","“What a coincidence.” Hun Xuan said, “When I first saw you, I felt that we were fated.”","“Really?” Mengmeng didn’t know why she was here.","Looking at her enthusiastic smile, Mengmeng felt that she should stay away from her a bit.","“Could it be that this girl is really into women?”","...","“Really, of course.” Hun Xuan smiled and said, “I like lively and lovely girls like you.”","“Hahaha, I’m so honored,” Mengmeng said with an embarrassed laugh.","“I knew from the sect’s information that you are a disciple of the Radiant Institute of the Heavenly Double Star?” Hun Xuan said, “I have never been to that planet before, but I have heard of the Radiant Institute. I didn’t expect such a small sect to be able to produce a powerful cultivator like you.”","“My skills are just average.” Mengmeng suddenly asked, “Do you have something to tell me?”","“What? Well, it’s nothing. I just thought that we are fated, so I came to have a casual chat with you.”","Hun Xuan thought about it and decided to find a topic. Otherwise, it would be meaningless to talk about it like this since she couldn’t get anything out of Mengmeng. She said, “Oh, by the way, you are now the No.1 in the east of the south coast. I guess you will face a lot of challenges later. It will distraught you when dealing with so many challenges. Many outstanding disciples have at least five sixth-tier spirit treasures. Do you know what the best way to deal with this situation is?”","“I don’t know.” Mengmeng shook her head slightly.","“The best way is to keep challenging the others.” Hun Xuan said, “When some disciples are ready to take action, you can challenge the No. 1 Expert in the west. His name is Ge Xiliu, and he is at the Peak Stage of the God Transformation Realm. He just became the most powerful person in the west three years ago. He always wants to challenge my brother, but my brother ignored him and has been cultivating hard. In fact, my brother is a very nice guy. He is not only handsome but also honest...”","“Let’s talk about Ge Xiliu, shall we?” Mengmeng asked, grinning.","“Oh, right.” Hun Xuan came to her senses and said, “Ge Xiliu is a disciple of a first-echelon subsidiary sect of the Sword Sect, which is Haoyang Sect. Every year, he will be given a lot of cultivation resources. This guy’s strength has improved very quickly, but he can’t compare with my brother and he’s a little weaker than him in terms of overall strength. Since you can defeat my brother, you can defeat that guy.”","“I see. It’s almost the same as I thought. I’m going to challenge some outstanding disciples,” Mengmeng said. “I’ll do it while I still have some time. I’m going to leave soon. I won’t be back for several months.”","...","“Why will you be leaving?” Hun Xuan asked.","“I need to take a training,” Mengmeng answered casually.","“I see.” Hun Xuan nodded and said, “When you defeat Ge Xiliu, you will be more famous. But you will still be the No.1 in the east, not the No.1 in the west because the Swordbamboo Peak is in the east. Unless you can win... Forget it, let’s not talk about him.”","“Who?” Mengmeng asked.","Hun Xuan didn’t finish her words, which annoyed Mengmeng.","Hun Xuan did not keep Mengmeng guessing. She smiled and said, “He is the No.1 on the south coast. Ten years ago, he suddenly appeared and his strength was powerful. Now, he is in the middle stage of the Void-refining Realm. His Taoist title is Heavenly Hound.”","“He’s a dog?” Mengmeng was really stunned this time.","“It’s the Heavenly Hound, and it’s only his Taoist title.” The corners of Hun Xuan’s mouth were slightly stiff. “The Heavenly Hound has been out all year round, and I don’t know what he is busy with. The origin of his Taoist title is that he has a divine pet, the Holy Wind Dog King, which is famous for its speed. It’s very powerful.”","This remark piqued Mengmeng’s interest. She asked, “Is it male or female?”","“It’s a male dog, it’s said that that dog used to steal some female disciple’s underwear.” Hun Xuan said, “If someone wears a skirt, that dog will always go over and flirt with them, which is very smutty.”","“Oh my god, it’s really a freak,” Mengmeng said.","“Heavenly Hound is the number one expert on the south coast. He swindles people without batting an eye and uses nasty means. Therefore, few people have challenged him in recent years. The main reason is that Heavenly Hound’s strength is strong and he is also a famous expert among the protectors. He has offended many disciples of the other three great sects. Anyone who finds him in the war zone will be hunted down and killed.”","Hun Xuan said, “So we don’t stay with him when we are on a mission. It will be troublesome with him around. Since you are going out to train in a while, it doesn’t matter whether you challenge him or not. When you have time, you can challenge Ge Xiliu. As for Heavenly Hound, it... depends on the situation.”","Hun Xuan’s words were very euphemistic.","In her opinion, Mengmeng would probably not be a match for the Heavenly Hound.","“I’ll be cultivating and learning in half a month. After I’m done with that, I’ll make a trip to the west of the south coast.”","While they were talking, a figure quickly flew over from the distance.","When Mengmeng saw it from a distance, she was stunned. “Huh?”","With a smile on her face, she waved her hand and asked, “You’re here, Aunty Jiang.”","“I knew you guys were here as soon as I heard your name.” Jiang Yanlan quickly approached them. She glanced at Hun Xuan and didn’t say anything to her since she didn’t know her. She said to Mengmeng with a smile, “Master and Ma’am are also here, right?”","“They’re both here. Xiaonao, Elder Yue, Aunty Lisa, Uncle Feng, and Uncle Chen are also here,” Mengmeng said.","“That’s great.” Jiang Yanlan covered her mouth and chuckled. She was very excited. She looked around and felt that it was still early, so she couldn’t disturb the guys.","Finally, her eyes were fixed on Mengmeng again. She sighed with emotion and said, “I didn’t expect that our little princess of Mount New Moon would be so powerful now. It’s really amazing that you’ve become the No. 1 Expert in the east of the south coast.”","“Haha, we all know that you are here, but the sect is too big, so we didn’t go out to look for you. We were waiting for you to come to us,” Mengmeng said.","“Well...” Hun Xuan thought for a moment and said, “Zhang Yumeng, since you have a friend over, I’ll go back now. Call me when you want to challenge Ge Xiliu. I can arrange it.”","“Okay.”","After saying goodbye, Hun Xuan flew back to her own house, sat in a chair, and murmured strangely, “Aunty Jiang. That woman’s surname is Jiang. Who is she?”","She took out the equipment and searched for the sect disciples. There were a lot of them surnamed Jiang. It was no different from looking for a needle at the bottom of the sea.","She searched the supervisors and found that the number of people had decreased sharply.","She then searched the chief supervisors.","Her eyes were fixed on a name.","“Jiang Yanlan, the number one of the Flying Flower Peak. It’s her! It turns out to be her, a disciple of the Flying Flower Peak in the east of the north coast. I was wondering why she looked so familiar. I’ve seen her before.","“They come from the same place. Zhang Yumeng is the little princess of Mount New Moon. Jiang Yanlan’s master and his wife are definitely not disciples of the Radiant Institute on the Heavenly Double Star. It seems that they have some background.”","After thinking for a while, she looked at the yard next door and whispered, “No matter what their background is, I think Zhang Yumeng is suitable for my brother...”","Sitting in the courtyard next door, Hun Shang was eating breakfast, which was rare. When he heard Hun Xuan’s muttering, he sighed. He felt helpless.","How could he think about love before taking revenge?","On the other side, Mengmeng and Jiang Yanlan were sitting in the courtyard.","“Leng Yue came to me before, and we went to other places together,” Jiang Yanlan said. “Leng Yue is in the Authentic Martial Arts Sect, and there are many of our people in their inner court, including Ah Hu, Elder Meng, Jiang Bing, and Yun Feiyang. Everyone knows the news about you. We also went to the Chu Family’s place, rested for a while, and then came back here again. We all knew that you would come here in about half a year. I felt that it was about time.","“Mu Xue, Liu Qi, and Xu Yong are all in the Heavenly Evil Sect.”","“Didn’t Instructor Liu come with you?” Mengmeng was stunned.","“I didn’t let him come.” Jiang Yanlan chuckled. “With our strength, we just need to stay here to gain experience. If we go to the territory of other sects at will, it will be easy to be discovered.”","“I see.”","Jiang Yanlan said, “I’ve been out for so long. I really want to go back to Earth. When will you go back this time?”","“Maybe when I start school. It doesn’t matter if I’m one or two months late,” Mengmeng said. “I’ve started going to college.”","“Everything changes so fast.” Jiang Yanlan shook her head and sighed with emotion, “Time flies.”","“I’ve grown up, haven’t I?”","“You’re right.” Jiang Yanlan asked with a smile, “Which university are you studying at?”","“Westpam University in the West Capital.”","“According to your ability, you should be the top scorer.”","“You’re right about that. I don’t feel any pressure when I take any exam.”","“You’ve been smart since you were a child as our little princess from Mount New Moon.","“Headmaster Shan is also in the Sword Sect. He has gone to the Third War Zone and hasn’t come back yet,” Jiang Yanlan said.","“We’ve found most of our guys except that my Great-Grandpa, You Huo, and the others haven’t been found yet. It’s been so long. I guess they’ll be back soon.”","The two of them chatted about the recent situation.","A moment later, Zhang Han and Zi Yan finished cleaning up.","“Master, Ma’am.”","Jiang Yanlan’s face lit up when she saw the two of them.","“You’re here. I’ll make some breakfast. Have a seat.”","Zhang Han smiled.","At the dinner table, Yue Xiaonao arrived on time.","Lisa and Yue Wuwei arrived only a few minutes later.","Jiang Yanlan repeated what she had told Mengmeng.","When it was noon.","“I’m not going back. Ma’am, don’t you also have a residence?” Jiang Yanlan asked.","“It’s just next door.” Zi Yan pointed in the direction and said, “You can stay there.”","They all came as inner-door disciples, and each of them had a house. In addition to Zi Yan’s house, Lisa’s house was also vacant.","Zhao Feng and Chen Changqing had been cultivating hard recently, so it was rare to see them.","That afternoon, Zhang Han gave Mengmeng three medicinal pellets.","“Go to the training room. After taking the pellets, you can break through to the God Transformation Realm Middle Stage in about half a month,” Zhang Han said.","“Okay, I’ll go now.”","Under everyone’s gaze, Mengmeng took the medicinal pellets and went back to her training room.","Zhang Han roughly estimated that half a month would be enough for Mengmeng, who had no trouble making a breakthrough, to absorb the medicinal pellets and turn them into her own energy.","But something unexpected happened.","After just five days.","When it was noon, Mengmeng came out of the training room.","After looking around, she didn’t see anyone.","“That’s strange. Where did everyone go?”","Mengmeng sat on a branch and waited silently.","It was not until two hours later that she saw everyone walking back.","Mengmeng jumped down and said from a distance, “Where have you been? I’ve been waiting for you for a long time.”","“Hey!”","Yue Xiaonao was startled. “Mengmeng, you’ve finished it so soon? Wasn’t it supposed to take half a month?”","Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei looked at each other.","“She used so little time to finish it.” Yue Wuwei sighed and said, “She’s indeed the Heavenly Lord. She’s really fast.”","The time one needed to make a breakthrough was not constant, but it depended on one’s situation.","The effect of the medicinal pellets given by Zhang Han could allow one to make a stable breakthrough in half a month.","They didn’t expect Mengmeng to finish it in five days.","“Daddy, take a look.”","Zhang Han flashed over and put his right hand on Mengmeng’s shoulder to feel her aura. He was silent for a moment.","“How is it?” Mengmeng asked.","“You made a solid breakthrough.”","Zhang Han thought for a moment and said, “It’s so fast, which means that you have a strong ability to absorb medicinal pellets. If that’s the case, it won’t be long before you break through to the God Transformation Realm Last Stage.”","“Where did you go?”","“Haha, they all went to watch my battle,” Yue Xiaonao said proudly. “I challenged Liu Sheng today. I beat him up.”","Hearing this, Mengmeng couldn’t help laughing.","“Why didn’t she beat someone else up?”","“We’ve been out for some time.” Zhang Han smiled and said, “You two girls shouldn’t be idle. Go out and find some people to practice your skills. It’s good to experience more battles.”","“Okay. I’ll challenge Ge Xiliu in the west of the south coast tomorrow or the day after tomorrow,” Mengmeng said, “and then the No.1 on the south coast, named Heavenly Hound.”","“It’s not easy to defeat Heavenly Hound.” Zhang Han thought for a moment and said, “When we go out these days, I’ll teach you some more profound methods of using occult arts.”","“Oh, okay.”","One had a long way to go in cultivation.","Mengmeng was now enjoying the fun brought by the growth of her strength.","It was a faint sense of satisfaction.","Of course, the precondition was that everyone was around.","Mengmeng had made a great breakthrough in the Crimson Sunglow Sect when she was alone there, but she was not very happy.","The source of the little princess’s happiness was very simple. Whenever she achieved something, she would be praised by everyone, especially Zhang Han and Zi Yan. Both of them would praise her and make her very happy.","“Let’s go.”","That afternoon, Zhang Han took Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao with him.","They left the inner court.","Deep within the mountain range, there was wave after wave of energy fluctuations.","Three days later, they returned.","Hun Xuan came over and chatted for a while. At noon, she went to the west of the south coast in person.","At the gate of others’ territory, Hun Xuan’s voice rumbled like thunder.","“Zhang Yumeng, the No.1 martial artist in the east of the south coast, is going to challenge Ge Xiliu on Able River Peak in three days.”"]},{"number":1489,"title":"Chapter 1489 A Belated Act","paragraphs":["Chapter 1489 A Belated Act","“What?!”","“Zhang Yumeng, the No.1 martial artist in the east, is here?”","“Where is she? I heard that she is a beauty.”","Many disciples flew into the air in succession.","They looked around and found that Hun Xuan was the only one.","After she finished speaking, her voice shook, and even many protectors and elders heard it. They shook their heads with a smile.","A challenge between the sect disciples was quite normal.","Atop a mountain peak.","“Eldest Brother, that wench has come to challenge you.”","There were more than a dozen disciples in front of Ge Xiliu, and one of them said in a dissatisfied tone, “She’s too arrogant. She came to our western region only a few days after she became the No.1 in the east.”","“Heh.” Ge Xiliu rubbed his chin and smiled faintly.","It seemed that he didn’t care.","One of his core subordinates said, “Two hours ago, Hun Xuan communicated with Eldest Brother, and he agreed. I just didn’t expect that Hun Xuan would be so straightforward as to directly announce this matter.”","“Eldest Brother agreed earlier?” Some disciples reacted swiftly, and they cupped their hands and said with a smile, “Congratulations, Eldest Brother.”","“Why are you congratulating me?” Ge Xiliu asked.","“Congratulations on having your reputation shake the world after defeating Zhang Yumeng as the number one person in the west of the south coast.” The man explained.","“Haha.” Ge Xiliu revealed a faint smile.","“Of course, Eldest Brother would definitely not agree if he wasn’t sure that he would win.”","Ge Xiliu continued smiling.","“In three days, we’ll cheer for Eldest Brother. I’m so excited just thinking about him shining brilliantly on Able River Peak.”","Ge Xiliu said, “I’m also excited just thinking about it.”","Just as everyone was laughing, Ge Xiliu cleared his throat. “You guys are still too young.”","“Why?”","“Sometimes, as an outstanding disciple of the sect, if you don’t accept the challenge from another talent, you will be too cowardly,” Ge Xiliu said slowly. “It doesn’t matter whether you win or lose. The most important thing is to participate and experience the vicissitudes of life. Sometimes, losing one or two rounds is also a good thing for you, understand? Failure is the mother of success. If you don’t lose, you won’t know your shortcomings at all. We need to live with this mentality.”","One of the junior brothers hesitated and said, “Eldest Brother, didn’t you say last time that you will only be truly powerful when you win all the time and create invincible glory?”","“Did I say that last time? When did I say that? Did you hear me wrong?” Ge Xiliu’s eyes widened.","Everyone finally realized that their Eldest Brother, Ge Xiliu, was not at all confident and thought that he would lose.","“Eldest Brother, what do you think your chances of winning are?”","“Haha.” Ge Xiliu smiled faintly and said, “That should be at least 30%... 20%... No, at least a 10% chance of winning.”","Poof!","The people around were stunned.","“Such a low chance of victory?”","“Do you think Zhang Yumeng took the first place in the east casually?” Ge Xiliu said with a serious look, “I watched the battle from a distance that day. She is very strong and terrifying.”","In the past, Ge Xiliu wanted to challenge Hun Shang, but Hun Shang didn’t agree. He lost to a talented disciple of the Heavenly Evil Sect in the First War Zone, and that disciple was seriously injured and defeated by Hun Shang within three moves. Ge Xiliu knew who was stronger.","Ge Xiliu was depressed. “Zhang Yumeng can suppress Hun Shang. Now that she has forced him to flee, how can I be a match for her? Although I’m very likely to lose, it’s not impossible for me to win. My illusions are much more powerful than before.”","However, on the other side.","Zhang Han sat in front of Mengmeng and said with a smile, “Daughter, you’ve mastered some illusions, but you’re not very proficient in them, especially in battles. I’ve summarized a set of practice and application methods according to the illusions you’ve mastered. Let me tell you...”","Zhang Han had taught Mengmeng almost all the best things.","The comprehensive teaching of illusions, the array of formations, pellet refining, incantations, and so on had already begun long ago.","The frequency of lecturing was not high, but Mengmeng had a grasp of every subject.","Her array skill was relatively poor, and her pellet refining skill was the best. Her illusions and incantations were also acceptable.","With Mengmeng’s stunning learning ability, she made rapid progress. It was just that the little girl was quite lazy. After cultivating for a while, she would take a rest for a few days.","After all, she had to enjoy life.","This time, many disciples from the east and west sides of the south coast were excited.","It was a battle between east and west.","Who would be superior?","Three days passed in the blink of an eye.","On this day, the Able River Peak was in an uproar.","There were more spectators than the last time.","“Hahaha!”","Zhang Han’s group was standing on the nearest mountain peak. There were not many of them, but their status was not low.","Suddenly, a peal of laughter came from a distance.","They saw Headmaster Shan flying over quickly.","“I thought I would never see you again.” Headmaster Shan looked relaxed. “I almost had an accident in the war zone this time. Fortunately, I came back safely.”","...","“Greetings, Headmaster Shan.” The crowd greeted him.","“You came at the right time.” Zi Yan smiled and said, “The duel is about to start.”","Without exchanging too many courtesies, Headmaster Shan said with emotion, “Like father, like daughter. Mengmeng is really amazing.”","“You can praise me when I win,” Mengmeng said.","Headmaster Shan smiled and said, “You’re so confident.”","Mengmeng did not respond. She gently tapped on the ground and flew to the Able River Peak.","At this moment, everyone was watching.","“Zhang Yumeng!” Many people shouted in unison.","Headmaster Shan shook his head repeatedly when he saw this.","“By the way, you’ve been back to the Heavenly Dragon Star Province, right? How is the situation there?” Headmaster Shan asked.","“Everything’s alright. After the last incident, there were only a few people left, and the connection with the Astral Domain was interrupted. Nothing else has changed. The Dragnet Academy is still the same as before.”","...","“That’s nice...”","While they were chatting.","Suddenly, a man flew to Able River Peak.","It was Ge Xiliu.","“Ge Xiliu, the No.1 in the west, is here.”","A good show was about to begin.","Ge Xiliu had arrived. He looked at Mengmeng from afar and said, “She’s more beautiful than they said. I almost can’t bear to make a move.”","As soon as he finished speaking, many people around were stunned.","Hun Xuan said in a cold voice in a corner, “Brother, he is trying to steal my future sister-in-law.”","“Alas!”","Hun Shang sighed and said tiredly, “Don’t make trouble. Zhang Yumeng is extraordinary. Especially the people behind her, I can’t see through them. I have a vague feeling that there are a few very terrifying people.”","“If she has a powerful background, then so be it. You’re also very outstanding, brother.” Hun Xuan retorted.","Hun Shang shook his head slightly and said, “I’m not considering those things while I haven’t taken revenge. Zhang Yumeng is not suitable for me. She is too immortal, just like an illusion. I’m just a mortal.”","Hun Xuan was speechless for a moment.","“What kind of excuse is that?”","However, she only had a few thoughts in this regard. She wanted to get Hun Shang a partner so that he could let go of his worries. Otherwise, it would not be good for him to keep suppressing himself all the time.","The heated discussion did not affect the two people who were about to start fighting.","A long sword appeared in Mengmeng’s right hand. “Cut the crap. Let’s start.”","“Hahaha, I am not a pushover!”","While Ge Xiliu was laughing, he drew the sword from his waist, slashed horizontally, and performed an occult art.","Clatter!","The pale purple ring-shaped sword light appeared in the void.","“It’s Eldest Brother’s Purple Ring Sword Slash!”","“It is said that when the Purple Ring Sword Slash is practiced to a certain point, a wisp of Sword Qi it creates can split a mountain.”","The light purple ring-shaped sword light, which was more than 100 feet long, rushed toward Mengmeng with terrifying power.","When Hun Shang saw this, his eyes narrowed slightly, and he lamented.","“I didn’t expect Ge Xiliu to have mastered the Purple Ring Sword Slash. With just this one move, he is almost invincible among those at the God Transformation Realm Peak Stage.”","Hun Xuan also looked shocked.","In the vast Ling Sea Sword Sect, there were only a few young disciples who could perform this sword move.","“Slash!”","Ge Xiliu immediately went all out and attacked Zhang Han with all his strength. It made him look like he was about to explode with anger. His eyes lit up and he quickly flew toward Mengmeng with the sword light.","Seeing this, many elders and protectors shook their heads and said, “Among the younger generation of the south coast, except for Heavenly Hound, Hun Shang, and three other powerful figures, there probably aren’t many who can stop this sword move from Ge Xiliu.”","Upon hearing this, many people nodded repeatedly.","“Ge Xiliu has used the Purple Ring Sword Slash from the very beginning. It seems he is determined to win.”","“Senior Brother Ge will definitely win!”","Countless people from the west of the south coast thought that their senior brother Ge Xiliu would win.","But on the other side.","Zhang Han calmly said, “This sword move is not bad. It has artistic conceptions and mysteries, but it’s still too immature. Eh?”","While speaking, Zhang Han suddenly let out a soft cry of surprise and praised, “Ge Xiliu is quite smart. This sword move should be one of his trump cards. He directly performs it and combines it with his illusions. It’s a good move.”","“Will Mengmeng lose in illusions?” Headmaster Shan said with some worry, “He attacks so frequently that it’s easy for her to be fooled.”","Zhang Han shook his head and said, “She won’t?”","“Why is that?” Headmaster Shan was stunned.","Zhang Han said softly, “My daughter has also mastered illusions, and she is better than him.”","Headmaster Shan was speechless.","Mengmeng used to be in the Illusions Department’s class when she was in the Dragnet Academy. Moreover, Zhang Han, the Merciless Man who ranked first on the eight lists, taught her every day.","Under everyone’s gaze.","“Break!”","Mengmeng’s right hand slapped forward.","Clatter!","The ten-foot-tall giant flaming palm whistled forward.","It took Mengmeng three days to break through to the God Transformation Realm Middle Stage to completely control her power.","She had defeated Hun Shang before, but now, she was facing Ge Xiliu, who was really at the Peak Stage of the God Transformation Realm.","The giant flaming palm struck out, and its oppressive might spread.","Ge Xiliu’s face changed.","“Shit! How am I supposed to deal with this?","“As expected, this woman is incredibly powerful.”","“Illusions!”","Ge Xiliu, who had been planning this for a long time, finally performed his illusions.","These two moves were moves that he had already thought of. He directly used them. Whether he got to win or not didn’t matter to him that much.","If he couldn’t defeat Mengmeng with his two trump cards, then he might not be able to defeat her with the other moves. Since he wasn’t in his territory, he had to keep some sort of life-saving means with him, and it wasn’t a private battle. There were spies from the other sects in the Sword Sect.","Under Mengmeng’s gaze, Ge Xiliu’s expression was different from reality. He was yelling, “I admit defeat! I yield!”","“Hmm?”","Mengmeng was stunned and felt that something was wrong. She sensed carefully and smiled faintly.","“Oh, it’s illusions.”","“Oh my god!”","While retreating rapidly, Ge Xiliu was about to use his skills, but he didn’t expect that the other party could directly see through the illusion.","“Your illusions are so weak.”","Mengmeng tilted her head slightly and smiled.","It was very enchanting, amazing, and beautiful.","Ge Xiliu froze for a second.","But the next second, Mengmeng’s facial features suddenly changed.","She looked like a ghost crawling out of the well with her long hair covering her face and her facial features bleeding.","In a flash, she appeared in front of Ge Xiliu, only a dozen centimeters away.","“Hic!”","The huge contrast almost made Ge Xiliu faint.","“Oh my god...”","Ge Xiliu roared in shock.","Under the attention of tens of thousands of people, he transformed into a stream of light and fled into the distance.","The whole place was silent.","In the silence, a cold snort was heard.","It came from the Peak Master of the peak Ge Xiliu had joined.","He said with a sullen face, “Hun Shang fled into the clouds before, and Ge Xiliu fell into the Western Mountain now. Since when did the talented disciples begin to escape from a duel so casually? This is a spar, not a life-and-death battle. How could he flee?”","With that, he left with a cold face.","He felt that Ge Xiliu had been defeated in a pathetic way.","Hun Shang’s gaze froze when he heard this.","Hun Xuan added with a smile, “Hun Shang escaped into the clouds, and Ge Xiliu fell into the Western Mountain. It’s gold.”","Hun Shang said, “I was retreating strategically. If I get serious, she may not be able to defeat me.”","If those words were heard by Ge Xiliu, he would also say, “I’m only retreating strategically as well. This is only your belated action!”","“...”"]},{"number":1490,"title":"Chapter 1490 The Extra Ones Are the Medical Expenses","paragraphs":["Chapter 1490 The Extra Ones Are the Medical Expenses","“I can’t believe it.”","Mengmeng returned to Zhang Han’s side and muttered, “He ran away in the middle of the spar.”","“He saw that you dealt with those two moves with ease, and he knew that he can’t defeat you easily.” Zhang Han said with a smile, “Even if he played all his trump cards, he would still lose, so he might as well simply lose and then leave.”","“But he hasn’t given me his spirit treasures yet.” Mengmeng snorted and said, “If he dares to go back on his word, I will beat him up.”","“Alas, Mengmeng.” Jiang Yanlan sighed softly. “I’ve cultivated for so many years, but I’m only at the God Transformation Realm Last Stage. You’ve only been cultivating for a few years, but you’ve already become so powerful. I feel like I’ve suffered a great blow.”","“Hahaha.” Yue Wuwei suddenly laughed and said, “You can compare yourself with anyone but Mengmeng. Do you know that it’s useless to compare yourself with her?”","Yue Wuwei was also a powerful figure. However, Zhang Han was a reborn expert who had passed the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier, and Mengmeng was even the Heavenly Lord. Yue Wuwei couldn’t even think of anyone who could compare with her.","“You won without any hesitation. Amazing.” Headmaster Shan applauded on the side.","Tens of thousands of people in the surroundings were clamoring and discussing this matter.","“Zhang Yumeng has only been in the sect for a short time, but she has already become the No.1 in the east of the south coast. She has fought several battles and defeated Ge Xiliu, the No.1 in the west. This is simply unprecedented!”","“What a wonderful battle, especially when Senior Brother Ge Xiliu fled without any hesitation. This is worth learning.”","“Keep your voice down. Didn’t you hear what the Peak Master just said?”","“...”","The crowd slowly dispersed, and Zhang Han’s group left faster.","On their way back, Hun Xuan quickly caught up with them.","“Congratulations, Zhang Yumeng, on your wonderful victory.”","“Well, thank you.”","“I’ll go over and chat with you when I have time,” Hun Xuan said with a smile and then left.","Zhang Han took a look into the distance.","Hun Shang was standing there. When he saw his sister’s behavior, he felt a little helpless, but he did not say anything. He was inarticulate.","When Zhang Han’s eyes fell on him, he felt a bit nervous.","“Why do I feel that this look in his eyes is a little... unfathomable?”","He slightly shook his head.","Hun Shang and his sister also left.","A great battle had come to an end.","Zhang Yumeng’s name was spread throughout the south coast of the Sword Sect and even to the extent that many disciples on the north coast had heard of her.","“The holiday is coming to an end.”","“It’s going to be the New Year again. Mengmeng, you’re 19 years old. Oh my god, we’ve grown up.”","Yue Xiaonao counted her age and said, “I feel that it’s time to go out and have fun on my own.”","“With your meager martial arts skills, where are you going to have fun?” Lisa said lightly.","Her words made Yue Xiaonao listless.","Yue Xiaonao and Yue Wuwei often teased each other, but they wouldn’t joke with Lisa.","Ever since Yue Xiaonao was young, Lisa had always been disciplining her.","The crowd returned to their residences in the Swordbamboo Peak.","Only after a few minutes, the Peak Master was there.","“Hahaha, Zhang Yumeng, you’ve really brought great glory to our Swordbamboo Peak. Impressive.” The Peak Master laughed from a distance. When he approached Mengmeng, he said, “Come with me to visit Elder Blackeyed. He has a surprise for you.”","“What’s the surprise about?” Mengmeng blinked and asked.","The Peak Master smiled and said, “He didn’t say it, but I guess there should be some substantial rewards, such as sixth-tier or even seventh-tier spirit treasures.”","“Okay, then let’s go.” Mengmeng got up with a smile.","It would be a waste not to take the rewards.","“Shall we go together?” Zi Yan asked Zhang Han in a low voice.","Zhang Han nodded slightly and said, “Sure.”","Everyone got up and followed the Peak Master to take an articraft and leave.","They had nothing to do anyway, so they thought that it wouldn’t be a bad idea to go over together.","They arrived at their destination.","On top of a mountain peak, there was only one house. It was like a detached villa. Every elder had a mountain peak with rich Spiritual Qi as their house.","Elder Blackeye looked exactly as his name implied. His eyes were pitch-black.","He gave off a strange feeling.","When he saw the crowd, he smiled and said, “You must be Zhang Yumeng.”","“Yes.” Mengmeng nodded.","“Very nice. Entering the sect with cultivation at the stage of the Void-refining Realm is very rare. I hope you can have a happy experience in the Sword Sect,” Elder Blackeye slowly said.","His tone was slow, and he used the word “experience”.","This meant that Grand Elder Tian Chen had already talked to him. The Sect Leader’s senior was among Mengmeng’s group, so Blackeye had to treat them with caution.","“This is your command token. From today onward, you’ll be a protector of the Sword Sect.” Elder Blackeye withdrew a command token that represented the holder’s identity as a protector.","“Thank you, Elder.” Mengmeng took the token and looked at it for a while. She was in a good mood.","...","“These are your rewards for being the new disciples’ role model and a new protector.” Elder Blackeye took out another five kinds of sixth-tier spirit treasures, all of which were some spirit herbs that were useful for cultivation.","At the same time, he said, “If you don’t have a sixth-tier spirit sword, you can go to the Sword Sea and choose a sword you like.","“No, thanks. I have my swords,” Mengmeng replied.","She had quite a few sixth-tier spirit swords, which had all kinds of functions and could deal with many occasions.","Blackeye said with a smile, “Alright then, Protector Zhang. If you are interested, you can continue to challenge the talented disciples. Under the influence of your challenge, the number of people who have challenged others in the sect has increased tenfold than before. This is a good thing.”","“Got it.”","Just as Mengmeng and her companions were about to leave, Elder Blackeye cupped his hands to Yue Wuwei, Zhang Han, and the others.","Zhang Han nodded slightly and then left the place.","“Congratulations, Protector Zhang.”","The Peak Master was rather courteous along the way.","Hun Shang was also a protector of the sect.","...","However, he had achieved many meritorious deeds before becoming a protector.","As for Mengmeng, she didn’t make any contributions but only issued a few challenges.","She had an almost aboveboard backer.","In the past, there had been powerful disciples, but in the end, they were nothing more than supervisors.","The higher-ups didn’t know their origins or loyalty to the sect, so how could they put those disciples in an important position? What if they were spies of the enemy?","“Now we have to call you Protector Zhang, tut-tut,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“It sounds a little awkward.” Mengmeng pouted and said, “I always feel that it refers to my dad.”","“You’ll get used to it slowly,” Zhang Han said with a smile.","On their way to their residences, they also heard a lot of discussions.","“Zhang Yumeng is now in the limelight. She is really powerful. I guess she will challenge Heavenly Hound next.”","“Really? Heavenly Hound is a real expert at the Void-refining Realm Middle Stage. It is said that Zhang Yumeng should be at the Void-refining Realm Early Stage.”","“Her information shows that she is only at the God Transformation Realm Early Stage. It’s too fake. She is obviously pretending to be weak to defeat the strong.”","“Maybe one day, when Zhang Yumeng challenges Heavenly Hound, this piece of news will be spread.”","Many people were discussing this matter.","Mengmeng, as the number one cultivator in the east of the south coast, had defeated Ge Xiliu. The next step she took was to defeat Heavenly Hound, the number one cultivator of the south coast.","Heavenly Hound had Holy Wind Dog King. Moreover, his strength was extremely great. It was unknown just how many years it had been since someone challenged him.","Heavenly Hound, as an outstanding talent on the south coast of the sect, had a great reputation and was ranked among the top on the lists of the other sects.","“I don’t think she’ll do it.”","Many people retorted, “Zhang Yumeng is not a fool. An expert like Heavenly Hound can’t be challenged at will. Without confidence, she won’t ask for a snub.”","“Heavenly Hound has dominated this generation. Zhang Yumeng is definitely no match for him.”","It seemed that Heavenly Hound had quite a few admirers on the south coast.","Mengmeng heard this kind of discussion, but she didn’t think too much about it. Maybe she would challenge him, but she would have to rest for the next two days.","Every time her cultivation was over, she had to entertain herself for a few days at least.","“Dad, Mom, I heard that the scenery over at the Plum Sea is good. Let’s go there tomorrow,” Mengmeng said.","“Sure.”","Zi Yan smiled.","The next day, when the crowd just went out, everyone walked along the forest path like camping.","When they passed by the big platform at the foot of the mountain, a white-shirted man with an extraordinary aura directly walked over.","“Nice to meet you.”","After attracting the attention of Mengmeng and the others, he looked at Mengmeng and said, “You must be Zhang Yumeng.”","“I am,” Mengmeng replied.","“You look very beautiful, but...” The man said lightly, “You need to stop before it’s too late. Senior Brother Heavenly Hound is not someone you can challenge now. If you go to fight him, you’ll only embarrass yourself. You’d better remain as the No.1 in the east of the south coast.”","What he said immediately made everyone realize that he was looking for trouble.","“Who are you?” Mengmeng asked.","“I’m Dong Lai from the Sword Edge.”","With these words, the man took a deep look at Mengmeng and turned to leave.","A small number of disciples around heard it, and their faces couldn’t help changing slightly.","“He’s Dong Lai, the No.1 in Wave Sword Peak.”","“He’s also very strong. He’s a chief supervisor of the sect.”","“But he’s not as powerful as Zhang Yumeng. Why did he provoke her?”","“...”","“Is there something wrong with him?” Mengmeng was baffled.","Zhang Han looked at the white-shirt man for a while and then stretched out his palm.","Dong Lai took a step forward, but he was retreating.","His face changed slightly. He leaned to one side and said, “Zhang Yumeng, as a protector of the sect, are you going to bully me?”","“What?!”","Many people exclaimed in surprise.","“Zhang Yumeng of our Swordbamboo Peak is a protector now?”","“Oh my god, she has advanced so fast!”","Dong Lai was caught by Zhang Han in shock.","“Who asked you to come to her?” Zhang Han asked.","“I came here myself.” Dong Lai lowered his voice and said, “Senior Brother Heavenly Hound has just come back from the war zone and is seriously injured. If you go to challenge him now, even if you win, you will have an unfair advantage. I’m just here to warn you not to challenge him. Otherwise, you will have many enemies on the south coast. I’m trying to persuade you with good words. Do you still want to be rough?”","Zhang Han laughed.","He even applauded and said, “Well said.”","“You’re not here to persuade us. You’re here to disgust us,” Zi Yan said lightly.","“Protector Zhang.” Dong Lai looked at Mengmeng and said, “I’m just telling the truth. If there’s a conflict of words, then I...”","“Cut the crap. If you want to leave, I’ll give you a ride.”","Zhang Han didn’t bother to say anything. He merely ran his power a bit.","Swoosh!","Dong Lai went straight into the sky and almost fainted under the impact of the energy. He felt that the world was spinning and his body was out of his control.","“Sure enough, Zhang Yumeng has a powerful backer.”","Dong Lai thought to himself. He thought that he could fly away after the power stopped, but he still couldn’t control his body. He was very numb. As Dong Lai looked at the ground that was getting closer and closer, his pupils shrank slightly.","“Humph, unbelievable.” Mengmeng said grumpily, “Couldn’t he just talk nicely? Why did he have to ask for trouble?”","“There are different kinds of people here. If you don’t like them, just teach them a lesson.”","After Zhang Han finished speaking, the group continued to move forward.","The Plum Sea was quite far away from Swordbamboo Peak. It would take them at least half a day to reach it.","Fortunately, there was an underground passage on the way to Plum Sea for the high-end matt ground vehicles.","When the crowd arrived at the station, they paid a few crystal stones and got in the vehicle.","There were 50 to 60 people in the carriage.","When those disciples saw Mengmeng and the others, they began to discuss in low voices.","“It’s Zhang Yumeng.”","“Amazing. I watched the battle with my own eyes. She is very powerful.”","“I want to go over and say hello, but I don’t dare.”","“...”","While many people were secretly watching, a woman hesitated for a moment before walking over.","She stood a few meters in front of Mengmeng.","“Nice to meet you, Zhang Yumeng. I admire you.”","Before Mengmeng could respond, she continued, “But I have something to remind you of.”","During the conversation, she raised a sound-proof cover and said, “I heard a lot of people say that you are going to challenge Heavenly Hound next. I just learned that Heavenly Hound came back from the war zone and is injured. He has a lot of supporters. If you want to challenge him, you will cause public anger. You’d better wait for his injury to recover before challenging him.”","Mengmeng did not want to say much after hearing that, so she responded, “Okay. Got it.”","After that, the woman turned and left.","“It seems that Heavenly Hound is a celebrity in our sect,” Zi Yan said softly.","“It’s so not cool.” Yue Xiaonao snorted and said, “It’s not easy for us to come out and have fun, but we keep encountering these annoying people.”","“I don’t know what they’re thinking. They’re so worried about others’ affairs,” Mengmeng muttered.","About ten minutes later, the matt ground vehicle began to slow down and arrived at the station.","At this time, Mengmeng’s group had already arrived at the Plum Sea Station.","After they left the station, they saw a seaside square with pleasant scenery. The most distinctive part was the red plum blossoms, which could be found everywhere on the coast. Even the small island not far away was covered with red plum blossoms.","The most special thing was that red fishes often jumped out of the water or swam in groups in the sea. Some of them looked like big goldfish, but their color and shape were like the red plum petals on the shore.","That was why this place was called Plum Sea.","Facing the sea, everyone was in a good mood.","As they walked to the shore, they enjoyed the scenery.","Mengmeng said in a leisurely tone, “Thirty thousand kilometers long of the river rushes into the sea, fifty thousand kilometers high of the mountain goes up into the sky. The oppressive people’s tears have dried up, and they have longed for their savior for another year. Why do I feel like this Plum Sea has the artistic conception of a battle?”","Mengmeng read a poem casually. The poem was about the people suffering in war, who had shed all their tears under the oppression of the barbarians. They hoped that the imperial army would fight against the north year after year. The poem had the artistic conception of a battle.","Mengmeng also felt a little of that here.","“It does,” Yue Xiaonao echoed.","At this time, Zhang Han smiled and said, “The Plum Sea was originally a battlefield. At that time, there were eight major sects on the Vast Heaven Star.”","“Oh, so that’s how it is.”","Mengmeng came to a sudden realization and then asked curiously, “But how?”","Zhang Han knew what she was asking, so he said, “Most of the time, the artistic conception is like this. It’s very mysterious. It carries history and shows some traces.”","“Well...”","They were enjoying the scenery in a good mood.","There were also many people nearby.","Unexpectedly, there were uninvited guests again.","This time, it was a team with about a dozen people. The leading one, a handsome man in white, came over and made obeisance.","“Greetings, Protector Zhang. I’m Hu Sui from the South Sand Peak.”","“Protector Zhang, we heard that you are about to challenge Senior Brother Heavenly Hound. Is this true?”","This was the third time that Mengmeng had encountered such a thing.","She exhaled a long breath, looking a little impatient. She said, “So what if it’s true?”","“All people will be truly glad if it’s true, but if it’s false, I think you will surely have countless enemies.” Hu Sui said with a faint smile, “You are now a protector and the No.1 in the east. You have defeated Ge Xiliu, so you are indeed qualified to challenge Senior Brother Heavenly Hound. However, Senior Brother Heavenly Hound is not in a good state, but he usually never refuses the request of sparring with his peers. If he doesn’t refuse, we can’t stand it, so we come to remind you that you need to think more about what you should do. ”","“Yes.”","Another person echoed, “Protector Zhang, you’re young and beautiful, and you must be reasonable.”","“To understand others can also help you achieve your own goal. Senior Brother Hu, you don’t need to tell me what to do.”","“Haha, I am only here to inform you of the situation out of goodwill. I have no intention of offending you.” Hu Duan laughed.","“Haha.” Zhang Han suddenly chuckled and said, “I’ve never told my daughter about these principles. What qualifications do you little guys have to be so hypocritical?”","“Are you Zhang Yumeng’s father? Sorry, I didn’t recognize you. It’s my honor to meet you, senior.” Hu Sui and the others cupped their hands.","Seeing this, Mengmeng clapped her hands and said, “It’s really interesting. You’re the third group of people to come to me to talk about this. It’s true that I’m beautiful, but it’s not necessarily true that I’m reasonable. Don’t disturb me again, or I’ll beat that Heavenly Hound today.”","The faces of Hu Sui and the others turned slightly pale.","Hu Sui, in particular, let out a long sigh. “Alright, then I won’t say anything more. Goodbye.”","They turned around and left.","The several disturbances were buzzkills.","Everyone stood on the shore, and Mengmeng spoke less.","Seeing this, Zi Yan chuckled and said, “Let’s go. Since Senior Brother Heavenly Hound is injured, why don’t we visit him?”","“Let’s go!”","Mengmeng’s eyes lit up a little.","She did not listen to the principles of others when it came to what she wanted to do.","“There are so many disciples in the sect. Since they don’t want me to go to him, I’ll have to go and have a look!”","Mengmeng’s eyes revealed a hint of anger that she was about to beat Heavenly Hound up.","If Heavenly Hound knew about this, he would probably be shouting, “I’m not afraid of facing a formidable opponent, but my incompetent juniors are dragging me down!”","If he and Mengmeng were to spar, they would have to contact each other in advance. There was no need for those disciples to go to her and talk about it.","However, these people were kind-hearted, just like the idiot teamplayers in the game. What they did trapped Heavenly Hound, and they would say weakly, “I’m sorry, Eldest Brother.”","It was so annoying and hilarious.","Mengmeng had found out where Heavenly Hound was.","She found that there were a lot of people coming and going on his mountain. He was chatting with some disciples in the square.","When Mengmeng and the others got close to him, they heard Heavenly Hound saying, “Don’t disturb Zhang Yumeng.”","That was nice, but what he said next was not.","“Even if I’m injured, it’s impossible for me to lose.","“This little injury is nothing. I can’t wait for someone to challenge me.","“When I was famous, you were still nobodies. Maybe you weren’t even born by then. Do I need you to plead for me?","“Zhang Yumeng alone is no match for me. What’s there to be afraid of even if she and her companions come at me together?”","His words were so majestic that the dozens of people in front of him were very excited.","“Senior Brother Heavenly Hound is so handsome.”","“This is the invincible will.”","“...”","Mengmeng’s face darkened.","Zhang Han, Zi Yan, and the others were slightly stunned.","Heavenly Hound was quite different from what they had imagined.","“Senior Brother Heavenly Hound, how are you hurt?” Mengmeng stepped forward and gave him a sweet fake smile.","Someone recognized her and suddenly swallowed.","“My Divine Soul has been injured. I just need to recuperate for a while. It doesn’t matter. Junior sister, which peak are you from?” Heavenly Hound asked with a friendly smile.","“Oh, it’s a Divine Soul injury. Dad.”","Mengmeng stretched out her hand to the back.","Hearing this, Zhang Han took out three medicinal pellets.","Hiss!","Those were three sixth-tier medicinal pellets.","Heavenly Hound’s pupils contracted when he saw them.","Mengmeng said again, “We need more.”","Hearing this, Zhang Han took out six more medicinal pellets.","“Well, these medicinal pellets should be enough to cure your injury, right?” Mengmeng said.","“It seems that three pills are enough.” Heavenly Hound said subconsciously, “That’s too much. How can I accept that?”","As he spoke, he took the pellets over.","When he heard what Mengmeng said next, he was immediately stunned.","“Well, take them all. The ones are for your medical expenses.”"]},{"number":1491,"title":"Chapter 1491 He’s Going to Beat Me Up","paragraphs":["Chapter 1491 He’s Going to Beat Me Up","“Medical... medical expenses?”","Heavenly Hound almost lost his balance.","He immediately realized who the beautiful woman in front of him was.","Zhang Yumeng of the Swordbamboo Peak had come to him.","Upon hearing her words, Heavenly Hound figured out that she knew that he was injured, so she came to give him the medicinal pellets and said that the extra ones were for medical expenses. First of all, she wanted to beat him. Secondly, she came here after hearing the news.","“Did someone say something to her?","“They must have said that I’m injured and asked her not to challenge me. They must have said that in a teaching tone or in a sanctimonious manner. Or maybe they pretended to be righteous and told her a lot of principles.","“Fuck. Those people trapped me!”","Heavenly Hound was anxious and angry.","“Think about it, how many people have I tricked in the sect?” Especially those talented disciples. The group of people pretended to persuade Mengmeng with good intentions, but in fact, they were trying to provoke her to beat Heavenly Hound.","Moreover, Heavenly Hound had just bragged and was heard by Mengmeng. It was now extremely embarrassing.","Heavenly Hound lowered his voice and said in a very kind way, “Ahem, ahem, Junior Sister, that... there seems to be some misunderstanding between us. Please listen to me.”","“There’s no misunderstanding. I want to beat you up. I’ll give you five days to take the medicinal pellets to heal. After you recover, you can choose a place.”","After saying that, Mengmeng turned around and left.","Zhang Han and Zi Yan looked Heavenly Hound up and down and then left.","Even they didn’t expect that two of the three groups of people who came to persuade Mengmeng wanted to trap Heavenly Hound, which proved that in their hearts, Mengmeng was completely qualified to fight against Heavenly Hound, and maybe she could even win. However, Heavenly Hound, as the No. 1 Expert on the south coast, still had some fans, and the woman in the matt ground vehicles was a sincere one.","“Junior sister, it’s really a misunderstanding. Don’t go. Eh? Alas...”","Heavenly Hound raised his hand and said that in a regretful tone, but he didn’t take a step forward. He was even happy. “I’ve earned six sixth-tier medicinal pellets. Tut-tut, it’s worth getting beaten up. Zhang Yumeng is really a moneybag. Amazing.”","“What did we talk about just now?”","Heavenly Hound looked calm and looked at the dozens of junior brothers in front of him. He said, “Oh, right. I killed countless enemies in the First War Zone. As the saying goes, money comes from danger. In a small secret realm, I met the main force of Heavenly Evil Sect and killed many enemies...”","After Heavenly Hound finished his speech, those people began to look up to him again.","But someone hesitated and asked, “Senior Brother Heavenly Hound, is that Zhang Yumeng who just arrived? She seems to have challenged you.”","Heavenly Hound said, “Why do you have to bring up this topic? Do you think I care about sparrings?”","“...”","On the way back, Yue Xiaonao detected Heavenly Hound’s information with her soul sense. After reading it for a while, she said, “Why do I feel that this Heavenly Hound is quite good at bragging? He seems to be a little narcissistic.”","“When I saw him, I suddenly felt that there seemed to be something fishy about the two groups of people who came to persuade Mengmeng before,” Yue Wuwei said suspiciously.","“Huh.”","Hearing this, Zhang Han smiled faintly and said, “No matter what the problem is, Mengmeng will just fight him. Heavenly Hound is also a master. It’s worth a fight.”","As for the challenge, Zhang Han was quite supportive of it. Mengmeng’s strength improved very fast, and she didn’t even know what level she was at. In fact, before she knew it, she had few rivals among the younger generation.","Zhang Han was happy to see her fight a few more battles.","They returned to the Swordbamboo Peak.","At noon the next day, Hun Xuan came over. After she saw Mengmeng, her expression was quite strange. “You actually gave Heavenly Hound medicinal pellets and treasures to heal him. After he got them, he will definitely not return them. In fact, if he wins this spar, he will ask you for spirit treasures every day. If he loses, he may not be willing to give you any. Even if he does, he will only give you the most inferior sixth-tier spirit treasure. This guy is a miser.”","“It’s not a big deal. It’s just a few medicinal pellets,” Mengmeng said indifferently.","“Heavenly Hound has committed a lot of crimes in the sect, and at the same time, he has many supporters.” Hun Xuan said, “I didn’t recommend it when you challenged him while he’s injured, but I didn’t expect you to take out the medicinal pellets to help heal him first. In this way, this will be a right and proper spar, and there will not be any problem.”","“I was so annoyed by those people who persuaded me. I didn’t want to fight him at first,” Mengmeng replied casually.","Hun Xuan’s expression changed slightly when she heard this, “How many groups of people went to persuade you?”","“Three.”","“Haha, someone must have made it happen on purpose,” Hun Xuan said with a smile. “Heavenly Hound is good at cheating people, but he knows what he’s doing. He’s very serious while staying in the sect and has protected many of his fellow disciples, so he has many supporters. As for those talents, many of them have been tricked by him. You should be careful when you fight against him. It’s better not to chat with him.”","Hun Xuan had her own intentions. She liked Mengmeng and felt that only an outstanding person like Mengmeng was suitable to be with her brother. As for Heavenly Hound, Hun Xuan had to admit that he was indeed charming. She was also worried that something would happen between Mengmeng and him after she got to know him through fighting.","Hun Xuan had been extremely worried about Hun Shang’s marriage.","Mengmeng did not know what Hun Xuan was thinking. After chatting with her for a while, Hun Xuan said goodbye and left.","On the third day, Heavenly Hound sent someone over.","To be exact, it was a dog that had come, the Holy Wind Dog King.","It was nearly two meters tall, mighty, and domineering.","Mengmeng saw it and said with a smile, “When I come back next time, I’ll bring Little Hei with me. You can get to know each other.”","The Holy Wind Dog King hung a piece of paper in its mouth and placed it on the table. Then, it turned around and ran off.","“It’s quite aloof.”","Mengmeng looked at the paper. There was a landscape painting on it, which was very beautiful. Next to the painting, there were a few words, “Nine Rivers Peak”.","According to the sect’s map, the Nine Rivers Peak was located to the east of the south coast, and it was named after the nine rivers surrounding it.","Except for the mountains that were relatively low around, the other mountains were slightly higher.","It was also a good place to fight.","At the same time, a piece of news spread throughout the Sword Sect.","Heavenly Hound, the No. 1 Expert on the south coast, would fight against Zhang Yumeng, the strongest expert in the east of the south coast, in the Nine Rivers Peak two days later.","“Is Heavenly Hound going to fight?”","...","“Interesting. I haven’t seen Heavenly Hound fight for a long time.”","“...”","For a time, many elders, protectors, and even numerous geniuses on the north coast were extremely interested when they heard of this matter.","The number one person on the north coast, Yun Han, heard this news and ended his cultivation.","“Zhang Yumeng... This is the third time I’ve heard of her. It seems that there is another powerful opponent on the south coast. If she can defeat Heavenly Hound, she’ll challenge me next. I’ll go watch this battle.”","The numerous geniuses of the north coast headed toward the southern coast in succession.","This was a battle that attracted a lot of attention from the sect.","However, another piece of news quickly spread out.","“The supervisors and other higher-ups of the sect are allowed to watch the competition for free. If ordinary disciples want to watch, they have to pay a crystal stone as an admission fee.”","As soon as this news came out, many people were extremely shocked.","“What? Do we need to spend money to watch the battle?”","...","This was what many new disciples thought.","Some senior experts, including some elders of the sect, shook their heads repeatedly.","“As expected, Heavenly Hound is still a miser.”","“In this battle, Heavenly Hound can get millions of crystal stones.”","Even Zi Yan and her companions were a little stunned.","“Is this a concert?” Zi Yan said, “He’s even charging the spectators.”","“Humph, when I defeat him, I’ll make him refund all those crystal stones.” Mengmeng snorted softly.","Mengmeng didn’t care about this. The number of spectators didn’t seem to affect her mentality.","“There are a lot more people here than last time, right?” Yue Xiaonao said, “He really has a mind for making money.”","Unexpectedly, the number of people on Nine Rivers Peak that day shocked Yue Xiaonao.","“So many people? How will he collect all of those crystal stones?”","Yue Xiaonao could not figure out how to collect so many crystal stones in just two hours.","Then, she turned to look.","On the top of each mountain, there were Heavenly Hound’s men. Beside each of them, there was a pile of crystal stones. When ordinary disciples arrived, they could just throw a crystal at those areas.","No one cared about spending a single crystal stone. But when those stones piled up into a mountain, it gave off a strong visual impact.","“Junior Sister Zhang Yumeng, you’re here.”","Heavenly Hound smiled and waved his hand on Nine Rivers Peak. “Come on, let’s have a talk first.”","“Huh.”","Mengmeng snorted and flew into the Nine Rivers Peak with a flash.","“Some disciples are hurrying over after hearing the news. Let’s wait a little longer,” Heavenly Hound said with a smile.","“Why should we keep waiting? So that you can make more crystal stones?” Mengmeng asked.","“Uh, no, no, no. It’s not like that.”","With so many people around, how could he be so cheesy? Heavenly Hound said in a serious tone, “I just feel like waiting a bit.”","Mengmeng felt quite helpless. “You’re so naughty.”","“What do you mean?” Heavenly Hound asked.","“It means that you’re mischievous.” Mengmeng blinked and said, “Will the winner get all of these crystals?”","“What?!”","Heavenly Hound’s face changed, then he shook his head repeatedly and said, “No, these crystals are mine. They have nothing to do with the outcome of the spar.”","“If I don’t fight, will you refund these crystal stones?” Mengmeng suddenly asked.","This made Heavenly Hound’s face change again. “Don’t quit. You are so powerful, you must want to fight with a master, and I am a master!”","“Judging from your look, I don’t want you to succeed.” Mengmeng narrowed her eyes as if she was wondering if she should leave directly.","Heavenly Hound pondered for a moment.","He then put on a smile and said, “Junior Sister, you’re so young and beautiful. If you can defeat me, I can promise you one thing. Well, I can give you a gift.”","“A gift?” Mengmeng was confused.","“That’s right. I am also a famous master of the Vast Heaven Star. I don’t know if you need a guard or not. If you can win, I can protect you when you go out in the future. This is the first time I have made a promise in history, and I only said it because you’re young and beautiful,” Heavenly Hound said with a smile.","He felt that he was very handsome. She was like a little fangirl, and she would agree obediently after he seduced her.","“Would I need your protection? Little brother, this is only your crazy thinking.” Mengmeng’s eyes widened.","“Tut-tut, sister, I’m not crazy. I’m...”","Heavenly Hound’s filthy tone made Zhang Han’s face stiffen slightly. He said to Zi Yan, “This kid is quite interesting.”","“He’s quite interesting.” Zi Yan smiled.","“Huh.”","Zhang Han gave an indifferent laugh.","Swoosh!","He flew forward quickly. Perhaps it was because he felt an itch in his hands, or perhaps it was because he saw that Heavenly Hound was very naughty. His interest was piqued.","When he arrived at the Nine Rivers Peak, he cupped his hands together and said with a smile, “Senior Brother Heavenly Hound, I’m Zhang Hanyang, a new disciple of the Swordbamboo Peak. Since you want to wait a little longer, why don’t we compete with each other first as an opening performance? What do you think?”","In terms of tricking others, Zhang Han was an expert.","Heavenly Hound would never know that the father and daughter in front of him had set up a trap without anyone knowing.","“Ahem, what are you doing here?”","Mengmeng coughed softly and waved her hand, saying, “You can’t spar. Even if it’s just a performance, it’s not okay. What if you get hurt?”","Judging from Mengmeng’s worried look, it seemed that this matter was true.","Heavenly Hound felt something was wrong, but when he looked at Zhang Han, he was lost in thought.","“He is Zhang Yumeng’s father.","“He’s probably even more powerful. He must be even more powerful.","“He clearly knows who I am, yet he still dares to speak like this. Damn...”","Heavenly Hound gasped.","“He’s just putting on an act and saying that to everyone!","“He... he’s going to beat me up!”","Just as Heavenly Hound was feeling a little shocked, he found that his mouth was out of control as he laughed wildly.","“Hahaha, why should I be afraid? Since Junior Brother wishes to spar, we...”","Clatter!","Heavenly Hound’s heart skipped a beat.","He thought to himself. “It’s over. I’m doomed.”"]},{"number":1492,"title":"Chapter 1492 It’s Your Turn to Take Action","paragraphs":["Chapter 1492 It’s Your Turn to Take Action","Heavenly Hound knew he couldn’t fight back.","He couldn’t even control his body. It meant that his opponent’s strength must be horrifying.","She was definitely a giant.","Sure enough, Zhang Yumeng had a strong background.","But things were always full of surprises.","Heavenly Hound stopped talking before he could finish.","He turned around and saw that Elder Tian Chen had flown over.","“Phew...”","Heavenly Hound relaxed a lot.","Tian Chen set up a sound-proof cover and said with a bitter smile, “Brother Zhang, why did you come to the battlefield in person? If it’s because Heavenly Hound does not keep his mouth shut, please don’t mind. I apologize to you on his behalf.”","Hearing this, Zhang Han touched his chin and said, “Am I such an unreasonable person? That’s not the case. I just came down to have fun.”","Zhang Han felt that he was like a fierce Demon King in Tian Chen’s mind, but he was not someone who could kill others at any time.","Now, he really felt that Heavenly Hound was quite interesting and was asking for a beating. He just wanted to beat him up.","Tian Chen was so nervous that Zhang Han didn’t know what to say.","It seemed that the higher-ups also cared about Heavenly Hound very much.","What Zhang Han didn’t know was that Tian Chen had chatted with Yue Wuwei and asked about him. However, Yue Wuwei only said a few words. “He is a horrible devil.”","When Tian Chen heard this, he was terrified. Even his senior called Zhang Han a devil, who was the leader of their forces. His background was too formidable.","Tian Chen, who was watching from a distance, was shocked to see Zhang Han emerge.","If such a powerful figure accidentally crippled Heavenly Hound, it would be a great loss to the sect.","“Dad, go back now. I have to fight later.” Mengmeng waved her hand quickly.","“Okay.”","Zhang Han smiled and flashed back.","The people around were confused.","“Even Grand Elder Tian Chen has appeared personally.”","“I didn’t expect that this battle would alarm Grand Elder Tian Chen.”","“What are they talking about in there?”","“Who is that male disciple? Has he been reprimanded?”","“...”","“Does he want to compete with Senior Brother Heavenly Hound with his strength?”","Some people were very unconvinced and even disliked it.","However, the people who knew the truth, such as Hun Xuan and Hun Shang, were a bit stunned and terrified.","“Zhang Yumeng’s father is obviously going to beat Heavenly Hound up. Grand Elder stopped him personally. It seems that he is even more terrifying than I imagined. Even he even made Grand Elder affably negotiate with him,” Hun Xuan said in surprise.","Hun Shang, who was beside her, didn’t say anything and watched silently.","Hearing the discussion around them, Zi Yan, Jiang Yanlan, and the others shook their heads in silence.","Nowadays, Mengmeng had fabulous glory, but few people knew what kind of figure the little princess’s father was.","“Look at how nervous Grand Elder is.”","After Zhang Han came back, Zi Yan joked, “He went to stop you in person.”","“I’m curious about what he’s worried over.” Zhang Han shook his head slightly and glanced at Yue Wuwei. “I’m an easy-going person. Why would I do a cruel thing?”","“Hahaha, that’s right.” Yue Wuwei laughed awkwardly. He felt a little guilty and thought to himself. “This old monster can’t have figured it out, can he? I didn’t say anything. I just told Tian Chen the truth.”","On Nine Rivers Peak, Elder Tian Chen glared at Heavenly Hound with dissatisfaction and said via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “Don’t flirt with Zhang Yumeng. Her father is very protective of his people. I’m warning you, you will get beaten to death if you dare to go too far.”","“Damn...”","Heavenly Hound gasped and replied, “Understood, elder. Then... then can I still win this time?”","“Well...” Tian Chen hesitated for a moment. “It’s up to you.”","Tian Chen thought about it carefully and said, “Don’t go easy on her. But also, don’t hurt her.”","“Understood.” Heavenly Hound nodded slightly.","This meant that he could win, but he couldn’t hurt his opponent.","“What are you two muttering about?” Mengmeng asked suspiciously.","After sensing for a while, she knew that the two of them were whispering to each other via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","Tian Chen cleared his throat and said, “Ahem, I was just asking about his condition. His recovery is all thanks to the medicinal pellets you gave him.”","“I see.”","Mengmeng didn’t believe it, but she didn’t want to continue asking.","Seeing this, Tian Chen immediately flew away.","He felt that staying behind would only make things more awkward.","“Well, Junior Sister Zhang, shall we wait a little longer? It’s a rare opportunity for us to spar with each other. It will be a pity that many people have come here after hearing the news but don’t get to watch a battle,” Heavenly Hound said seriously.","...","Hearing this, Mengmeng rolled her eyes and nodded. “Okay, let’s wait a little longer.”","“Junior Sister Zhang, you have reached the Void-refining Realm at such a young age. You are amazing,” Heavenly Hound said.","Mengmeng didn’t want to talk to him. She looked around and said, “Where’s your Holy Wind Dog King?”","“It’s not here.” Heavenly Hound said, “It’s not interested in watching a battle.”","“I also have a dog. Its name is Little Hei. It grew up with me,” Mengmeng said with a smile. “I didn’t bring it with me this time. I’ll bring it out in the future.”","“What a coincidence! What kind of dog is Little Hei? Your dog must be extraordinary, right?” Heavenly Hound asked.","Mengmeng raised her head and said quite proudly, “My dog is called the Iron Treasured Golden Emperor Dog.”","“What kind of dog is that?” Heavenly Hound was stunned. He even took out his communicator to check but only got no result of the name.","“Could it be a divine dog?”","“It’s just a rural dog,” Mengmeng said. “It’s a very common breed.”","“I see, hahaha.” Heavenly Hound burst into laughter. “When you bring your pet here, our dogs can communicate with each other. Maybe they can exchange some moves.”","...","He was setting up a trap for the next bet.","In a battle between divine pets, they could bet on some spirit treasures.","“Okay. Little Hei is very powerful,” Mengmeng said confidently.","Behind an able man, there would always be other able men.","Maybe Heavenly Hound wouldn’t believe it if Mengmeng said that Little Hei’s strength was low, but since she showed confidence, Heavenly Hound was relieved.","“That’s how it should be. Although you think your divine pet is powerful, my Holy Wind Dog King also has a lot of trump cards.”","“Then it’s settled.”","Heavenly Hound smiled very happily.","Mengmeng’s smile also revealed a hint of evil.","Holy Wind Dog King was famous for its speed, but Little Hei had never been afraid of anyone in terms of speed. Even Shi Fenghou gasped when he saw it and called it a role model.","“It’s about time, right?” Heavenly Hound said.","At first, he wanted to wait a little longer, but when he thought of Mengmeng’s extraordinary background and a senior who wanted to beat him up, he changed his mind.","“I’d better not dawdle.”","“There are at least five million crystal stones here.”","Heavenly Hound looked at the crystal stone, and his eyes were almost red. “I can win without hurting the other side. For the sake of the crystal stones, I’ll go all out.”","Seeing the hungry look in the Heavenly Hound’s eyes, Mengmeng felt puzzled and also became vigilant. “Is he casting an illusion?”","Mengmeng stepped back dozens of meters, feeling that it was a safe distance, and waited for Heavenly Hound to make the first move.","However, Heavenly Hound was also waiting for Mengmeng to take action.","They rose into the air and looked at each other from a distance.","One second, two seconds... one minute passed.","Heavenly Hound thought to himself. “Why hasn’t she made her move yet?”","Mengmeng snorted in her heart. “You want me to make the first move? No way!”","However, the others didn’t notice anything unusual.","“Look, when experts fight, even the air is filled with killing intent.”","“What a terrifying aura.”","“...”","The psychological effect was too strong.","“Junior Sister Zhang, what happens in the competition stays in the competition. Please forgive me if I go too far,” Heavenly Hound said seriously.","“Haha, you’re talking big.”","He spoke so imposingly that it felt like he’d already won.","“There are eight occult arts of swordsmanship of the Sword Edge. You have just joined the sect, so you should not have practiced them yet. Let me show you today.”","Heavenly Hound put his hands behind his back and took out eight long swords from his Space Ring, including three sixth-tier spirit treasures and five fifth-tier ones.","From the very beginning, he had faced the enemy seriously, showing his determination to win.","“This move is called Ice Cloud. It requires eight spirit treasure longswords to execute. The higher the grade of the treasure sword, the greater its might.","“Go!”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The eight long swords flew over with irresistible force and turned into eight streams of light. They did not possess any might. They were like ordinary flying swords.","But something unexpected happened.","In the middle of the two, eight long swords seemed to cut through the void and flew here.","A strange phenomenon suddenly appeared.","The eight streams of light were constantly connected by threads.","A cloud that looked like a glacier came whistling over with an ice-cold aura.","“Fire Swords.”","Mengmeng waved her sleeve.","Thirty-six sixth-tier spirit treasure long swords appeared.","They pierced forward and directly turned into a huge wave of fire.","When the long swords collided, the dull sound seemed to be performing a song of ice and fire.","“So many sixth-tier spirit treasures!”","Heavenly Hound’s eyes turned redder.","“What a little rich girl, hahaha.”","He was extremely excited, feeling that he could get a lot of precious treasures from Junior Sister Zhang.","However, he had to take his time to plan it. The first thing he needed to do was to win this round.","“Nice.”","After running his power a bit, Heavenly Hound retrieved his long swords, but the remaining power of the Fire Swords was still attacking him.","“This move is called Stabbing Dragon.”","Heavenly Hound controlled one of his sixth-tier swords and slashed it once.","“GRWAAAAAH!”","The ten feet long sword glow appeared to be real. It was just like the body of a sword as it carried a dragon roar and rushed forward in a mighty manner.","“It’s Stabbing Dragon, one of the eight great occult arts!”","“I didn’t expect Heavenly Hound to master this move so well that he can already execute a five-second-long dragon roar.”","“Only many elders can perform a five-second dragon roar to such an extent. Heavenly Hound is really terrifying.”","Tens of thousands of people around exclaimed one after another.","They couldn’t understand Mengmeng’s moves, but the occult art Heavenly Hound displayed originated from the Sword Edge. Many disciples had practiced it, so they knew how difficult it was and how well Heavenly Hound had mastered it.","“Stabbing Dragon?”","Mengmeng took a look and could feel the sharp edge from a distance.","This Stabbing Dragon move carried very powerful varieties. For example, it was able to suddenly accelerate as if it could travel through time and space, which was difficult to defend against.","Mengmeng muttered to herself, “I will use the Sword Dragon to suppress you.”","She pointed her long sword forward.","When she made her move, a golden light flashed in her beautiful eyes.","“Rarrrrgh!”","Golden sword light appeared. It was sixty meters long.","When the sword light left the sword, the effect of the occult art was activated.","A roar that made one’s scalp go numb rang out.","The golden light trembled nonstop, and the image of a golden dragon appeared. It swam forward and looked as if it was to devour everything.","“What... what kind of supernatural power is this?”","“Heavens! Boundless ferocious might and ceaseless roars! This sword move is so terrifying! Is it an occult art of the Sword Edge?”","“This is definitely an extremely powerful occult art. It’s almost as powerful as a supernatural power.”","“Heavenly Hound’s Stabbing Dragon is no match for it.”","Judging from the momentum, it was obvious who was superior.","Even Grand Elder Tian Chen, who was watching from the side, was a little envious.","“This occult art is really... too powerful. How did she execute it? What kind of method is it? How, how can I learn it?”","Many ordinary disciples couldn’t figure it out, but the stronger they were, the more they could understand the mystery and horror of it.","The way some elders looked at Mengmeng had changed as if she were a peerless treasure.","“Well, you’re showing your big gun too early.”","Heavenly Hound let out a cry of pain and desperately sped up the Stabbing Dragon. He shouted as if he was comforting himself, “Watch me pierce your golden dragon!”","“GRWAAAAAH!”","The golden dragon’s shadow was simply unstoppable. As soon as it collided with the sword Qi of Heavenly Hound’s Stabbing Dragon, it bit down, and the sword Qi snapped into two.","“Explode!”","Heavenly Hound had prepared a backup plan.","The Sword Qi exploded.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","The head of the Sword Dragon was blown into pieces, and the whole dragon’s shadow became erratic.","It seemed that this move was cracked by Heavenly Hound.","“Heh.”","Zhang Han smiled and nodded with satisfaction.","Because he knew what Mengmeng was trying to do.","The illusory dragon shadow changed its moves and condensed into nine beams of sword light.","This was also an occult art. It was not too strong, but it was very practical.","“Nine Winds Sword!”","Mengmeng cast the Nine Winds Sword with the remaining energy of the Sword Dragon.","The Sword Qi came with the winds. It was as if it were a part of them.","“Its aura is slightly weak.”","Heavenly Hound narrowed his eyes. “What’s the attacking method of this sword move?”","Only by knowing its attributes would he know how to counter the sword move. These nine wisps of sword Qi were ephemeral and hidden in the wind as if they had merged into one and were difficult to sense.","“Amazing.”","Heavenly Hound praised and pointed forward with his right hand. “Shadowless.”","Shadowless was one of the eight great occult arts.","The invisible sword light rushed over and collided with the nine swords.","It formed a huge storm.","The wind blew in all directions. Many trees on the Nine Rivers Peak were destroyed by the wind, and even a river was flowing backward due to the wind.","Seeing this, many disciples said in horror, “If I were standing within a hundred meters, I would probably be injured by the aftermath of this storm.”","The two strikes dissipated in the void.","Heavenly Hound was quite shocked.","“She’s indeed very powerful. What moves should I use to deal with her?”","Mengmeng, on the other hand, was as calm as ever.","“She’s amazing.”","On another mountain peak, Hun Shang praised, “She’s more powerful than what I thought before.”","“Brother, she’s actually at the Middle Stage of the Void-refining Realm. She’s too strong. You’ve just broken through to that phase. Are you really no match for her?” Hun Xuan whispered.","“If it’s a normal competition, we can fight each other as equals. She won’t be a match in a life-and-death battle,” Hun Shang said softly.","He had a very powerful and secret trump card.","That kind of move was not something that could be easily executed.","Therefore, he was very confident.","On Nine Rivers Peak.","Gradually, the wind stopped.","Heavenly Hound suddenly laughed and said, “Zhang Yumeng, you’re worthy of your reputation. You’re amazing. I have to use some of my real skills to deal with you. This sword move is an illusory one, named Moon in the Mountain. Junior Sister Zhang, you need to watch out.”","“An illusory sword move? I’ve also mastered many of those. Come on.”","Mengmeng raised her right hand and crooked her finger forward.","“Moon in the Mountain!”","Heavenly Hound made an incantation gesture with both hands.","All of a sudden, all kinds of sword lights floated out of the long sword in front of him.","The lines created strange phenomena.","The shadow of a mountain suddenly appeared on Heavenly Hound’s back.","“It’s Moon in the Mountain!”","“Heavenly Hound can even execute Moon in the Mountain!”","“That’s the number one sword technique of the eight great occult arts.”","Many talented disciples were astounded.","The eight great occult arts of the Sword Edge needed to be cultivated step by step.","Last time, Heavenly Hound just used the third greatest occult art. No one had expected that he would use the No. 1 skill this time.","The enormous mountain phantom suddenly dimmed, and a crescent moon rose.","Even from a distance, one could feel the fierce aura.","The moonlight fell, which was the sword light.","Heavenly Hound was very proud of the illusory sword move, Moon in the Mountain. It was one of his trump cards.","This was the first time he had used it in the sect.","It was not difficult to cultivate the eight great occult arts. They only required points. These eight skills were not very powerful trump cards. Displaying them was just a good means to fight against the enemy and prove oneself.","Heavenly Hound displayed the Moon in the Mountain.","Someone said, “Heavenly Hound is worthy of being number one on the south coast with this sword strike.”","“Illusory sword moves...”","Mengmeng thought for a moment and decided to make a move.","“Pluto Slash!”","Seeing this, Zhang Han touched his chin and muttered to himself, “Is she overestimating the opponent by making this move?”","When Yue Wuwei heard this, his expression changed, and he watched more carefully.","It seemed to be an amazing move. If Yue Wuwei was tempted by it, he planned to learn it.","Clatter!","Mengmeng held the sword in her right hand and drew a circle.","Combined with the top occult art, a faint black light appeared on the sword light.","Illusory sword moves, when infused with the illusions’ sword occult arts, required one to gain insights into the illusions.","For example, when the former Sect Master was sitting cross-legged in the mountain and saw the crescent moon rising, he suddenly came to a realization and combined the Moon in the Mountain with the occult arts he had mastered.","Mengmeng’s move was shocking.","The illusion began to appear, and the black fog filled the air.","A huge figure, like a devil, appeared in the black fog.","The shadow held a long scythe in his hand, like the sickle of Death.","That jet-black blade was where the sword will was.","“Holy shit!”","Heavenly Hound was stunned when he saw this.","Grand Elder Tian Chen saw this scene and said, “What the hell? This occult art... How did it come to be? Did she see such a horrible being with her own eyes?”","No one knew what the huge black shadow was, but it looked quite terrifying.","Such a pure and horrifying aura was definitely not simple.","Mengmeng performed the Pluto Slash.","Swoosh!","The illusory figure raised the sickle and slashed forward.","The moonlight Sword Qi was cut, and even the Heavenly Hound’s illusion, the crescent in the mountain, was cut into two halves. The huge mountain was also cut into two halves from the middle.","“It’s too incredible!”","Heavenly Hound let out a cry of shock. His figure turned into dozens of figures, which flew around. As for the real figure, he had fled several miles away and avoided the sword light.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","The huge sword light destroyed the peak of the Nine Rivers Peak.","There was wave after wave of energy fluctuations.","Fortunately, several elders neutralized the aftermath, so it did not cause too much of an impact.","At this moment, the place was silent.","Such a move shocked the whole sect.","“I am absolutely no match for her in terms of illusory sword moves.”","Heavenly Hound touched his stiff cheek and flew back to Nine Rivers Peak in a flash. He looked at Mengmeng and didn’t know what to say for a moment.","He couldn’t defeat her with illusory sword moves, but he had other moves.","“However, I haven’t used my trump card yet.”","Heavenly Hound thought to himself.","After thinking about it, he found that if he attacked first all the time, his moves would be easy to resolve, and it would make him passive.","He looked at Mengmeng and said, “Well, I’ve made several moves. It’s your turn.”","“I’ll make the first move? Alright.”","Mengmeng blinked and suddenly cast an occult art with the long sword in her hand.","“Sunset Rainbow!","“Frozen Sword!","“Blackhorn Sword!","“Allheaven Fire Sword!","“Fiend-killing Nine Slashes!”"]},{"number":1493,"title":"Chapter 1493 Heavenly Hound Went Mad","paragraphs":["Chapter 1493 Heavenly Hound Went Mad","“What the...”","When Heavenly Hound saw the sword occult arts coming one after another, he staggered.","“I shouldn’t have said that! I shouldn’t have asked her to make the first move.","“I can’t believe she would make so many sword moves simultaneously. She didn’t even give me time to catch my breath.”","Heavenly Hound was shocked, and countless disciples watching the battle gasped.","“She is too strong.”","“This is just a friendly competition. If it’s a real fight, Zhang Yumeng will definitely be a very strong opponent.”","“Terrifying! Could it be that the number one expert on the south coast is about to be replaced after this battle?”","“The end of a legend represents an even stronger and more formidable legend.”","Many disciples were wavering. At first, they thought Heavenly Hound would win, but now it seemed that Zhang Yumeng had a better chance of winning.","Hearing a lot of discussions, some people couldn’t help but refute.","“Zhang Yumeng’s moves are indeed powerful, but Senior Brother Heavenly Hound is not weak. He will definitely be able to deal with her moves easily.”","“It won’t be easy. It’s true that he can deal with them. Heavenly Hound is also very powerful.” A young talented disciple couldn’t help laughing in surprise. “Let’s wait and see. This is definitely a wonderful battle.”","Those sword moves were incomparably dense, and every single sword move was filled with boundless profundity. And yet, they were simply too fast.","It seemed that in other people’s eyes, they were all trump cards. But to Zhang Yumeng, they could be used at will as if they were free.","Some disciples even felt distressed.","“Such precious moves are displayed in just a sparring match! What a waste!","“I guess I’m just too poor. I only have three occult arts that are powerful enough to be used as trump cards, but she...","“Alas, she’s too formidable.”","A small number of disciples felt distressed, but more people had feelings of yearning and admiration.","Heavenly Hound’s pupils contracted when he saw this.","But then he frowned.","“This is a bit troublesome.”","He muttered to himself as he continuously swung the long sword in his hand.","“Cold Leaf Sword!","“Swimming-lotus Sword.”","The sword occult arts he performed were extraordinarily imposing.","Heavenly Hound had the advantage that he had a deep understanding of all kinds of occult arts.","After all, Mengmeng was only at the God Transformation Realm Middle Stage.","She was already quite capable to be able to fight neck and neck with an outstanding Dao Seeking Cultivator at the Void-refining Realm Middle Stage, who was a realm beyond her. Zhang Han was very satisfied with that.","Back then, Old Weirdo Zhang had done the same thing.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","The dense sword moves in the air kept colliding.","It was like a battle between two armies, and the mortar was ceaselessly covering and bombarding the other party.","One minute, two minutes... five minutes passed.","Mengmeng’s sword moves were not repetitive.","However, Heavenly Hound used more than 20 occult arts of swordsmanship, and he repeatedly perform them.","Sometimes, he needed to cast two or three occult arts to resist the one Mengmeng displayed.","That was to say, while Mengmeng made 50 moves, Heavenly Hound would have to make more than 100 moves. His energy consumption was twice hers.","“Is she a monster?","“Holy shit!”","Even Heavenly Hound felt a little tired.","He was slightly shocked.","“This won’t do. If this goes on, I will lose sooner or later.”","Rumble!","Finally, he quickly launched five kinds of occult arts. Heavenly Hound said hurriedly, “All right, all right, it’s my turn to make the first move.”","“Hmm?”","Mengmeng was stunned for a moment and then stopped. With such high consumption of spiritual force, Mengmeng only had about 40% of her spiritual force left.","She was ready to make a big move when it dropped to about 30%.","She didn’t expect that the other party would ask for a stop.","“All right. You may go first.”","Mengmeng nodded gently.","Heavenly Hound exhaled deeply and said, “Let me take a breath.”","“Okay.”","...","Mengmeng was floating in the air.","She was wearing a white dress. It was not a thin dress that could show off her figure and required her to put on shorts. Instead, it was a dress bought in the Cultivation World. The long dress had pants equipped inside. It looked beautiful and was convenient for movement.","The chiffon fluttered gently with the wind, accompanied by Mengmeng’s long hair.","At this moment, she was the most eye-catching and beautiful.","“Our daughter has grown up.”","Zi Yan pursed her red lips slightly and said with a smile, “She can be independent and challenge powerful people in the sect, and she is so beautiful.”","“Haha, she’s our daughter after all.” Zhang Han laughed, held Zi Yan’s hand, and whispered in her ear, “We’re not ordinary people. When you and Mengmeng stand together now, you do look like sisters. You look like you are only in your twenties, young, beautiful, and sexy.”","“Hey!”","Zi Yan rolled her eyes at him grumpily.","When the two of them spoke, they naturally set a sound-proof cover.","The two people who were fighting on the peak, especially Heavenly Hound, were ready to take a minute or two to rest.","...","This caused the originally quiet scene to gradually be filled with discussions and exclaims of admiration.","Yun Han, the No. 1 Expert on the north coast, sighed with several people beside him.","“At first, I thought Heavenly Hound’s success rate was more than 70%, but now it seems that it’s hard to say who will win.”","“What? Senior Brother Yun, do you also think Zhang Yumeng can win?”","“Not necessarily.” Yun Han shook his head slightly and said, “They’re betting on millions of crystal stones and five kinds of sixth-tier spirit treasures. Seeing Zhang Yumeng’s sword, Heavenly Hound must be tempted. With his character, he must be serious when he attacks again. Victory or defeat, the answer is about to be revealed.”","As expected-","As soon as Yun Han finished speaking, Heavenly Hound said, “Junior Sister Zhang, I didn’t expect you to be so powerful. It seems that I have to use some of my trump cards to defeat you.”","“Haha, I’ll be waiting,” Mengmeng said indifferently.","“Don’t be careless,” Heavenly Hound reminded her, “I’m omnipotent. Once I use my trump cards, the consequences will be unimaginable. Why don’t you take out a few Defense Treasures first to avoid getting hurt?”","He wanted to pressure the other party unknowingly.","Heavenly Hound was also quite smart.","Many of the spectators below grew cautious and even nervous.","“All right.”","Mengmeng looked helpless and ran her power a bit.","Buzz! Buzz! Buzz!","Dozens of layers of light covered her entirely.","Heavenly Hound was dumbfounded.","His eyes turned even redder, and he was even a little confused. “I didn’t ask you to take out so many Defense Treasures, did I?”","“So I don’t need them now?”","Mengmeng chuckled and put away all the Defense Treasures.","“Well...”","Heavenly Hound said with a little hesitation, “Well, the winner will get five kinds of spirit treasures, and we’ll get to pick them, right?”","It seemed that he was completely coveting Mengmeng’s spirit treasures.","“Cut the crap. We’ll talk about it after you win if you can.”","Mengmeng snorted softly.","“Okay. We’ll talk about it after I win.”","Heavenly Hound laughed out loud while the sword radiance suddenly appeared.","“This sword move is called Heavenly Immortal.","“This is one of my supernatural powers of swordsmanship.”","Clatter!","There was no gorgeous abnormal sign. Instead, it was a simple sword ray. It was three hundred meters long and formed in the sky. It was faintly cyan-colored as it slashed horizontally toward Mengmeng.","This sword strike put a lot of pressure on Mengmeng.","It could be said to be the strongest move Heavenly Hound had made since the battle began.","The simple sword ray seemed to have locked onto her.","Mengmeng felt that there was nowhere to hide, so she could only fight head-on.","In the distance, Tian Chen’s eyes gradually froze. He was quite vigilant, for fear that Mengmeng would get hurt. When Mengmeng couldn’t resist, he would immediately save her.","However, he was overthinking it.","“This strike is not easy to resist.” Yue Wuwei touched his beard and said, “This supernatural power is not weak.”","“It’s not bad.” Zhang Han also nodded. “If they fight with sword moves, my daughter will suffer a little.”","Mengmeng knew a lot of occult arts of various types, and she had not learned a lot of them yet. For the time being, she had not gotten her own supernatural power with comprehension.","But there were also benefits. The more she knew, the stronger her supernatural power would be in the future.","“Four-sided Sword!”","Mengmeng also grew serious.","They were battling with sword occult arts.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","It was the first time that her move had been crushed by her opponent.","Clack!","The sword Qi of the Four-sided Sword was cut off.","Mengmeng launched another five occult arts of the Tao of the Sword.","Unexpectedly, she still failed to block the attack of Heavenly Hound’s sword light.","At this time, the sword light was only 50 meters away from Mengmeng.","Dealing with such a situation, Mengmeng didn’t panic. On the contrary, she became calmer.","Her train of thought was quick.","It was a very short distance. If she couldn’t get rid of the sword light, then she would just dodge.","“Shadow Duplication.”","Clatter!","As soon as the 49 figures appeared, Mengmeng’s real body instantly flew hundreds of meters to the side.","“Explode!”","Heavenly Hound saw that Mengmeng wanted to escape.","He burst out the sword Qi of the Heavenly Immortal.","Rumble!","A huge round whirlwind surrounded Mengmeng.","Heavenly Hound wanted to trap Mengmeng and force her to admit defeat.","“She’s losing it!”","The No. 1 Expert on the north coast, Yun Han, let out a soft sigh. “He defeated me with this move back then.”","“What? Senior Brother Yun, have you fought with Heavenly Hound before?”","“Yes. In a secret realm, I failed to defend against this move,” Yun Han said generously. “Heavenly Hound is very powerful.”","“So, Zhang Yumeng will lose after all. It’s a pity that she has so many occult arts, but she still can’t defeat Heavenly Hound.”","“She knows a lot, but she hasn’t mastered any of her moves. Heavenly Hound is a typical example of someone proficient in a few methods. Zhang Yumeng has many moves, but she doesn’t have his foundation.” Someone commented.","Yue Wuwei’s comment was, “Mengmeng has cultivated for several years. The time is too short, so her cultivation can’t make up for the gap in their realms.”","“Who said she will lose?” Zhang Han asked in confusion.","“Ahem, I was just kidding. I didn’t say that she will lose.” Yue Wuwei stroked his beard.","At this time, Zhang Han smiled confidently.","Heavenly Hound was indeed a powerful opponent. After this battle, Mengmeng would also get to know some of her shortcomings, which would be helpful for her growth in the future.","Zhang Han was happy to see such a thing.","“She’s losing.”","“Zhang Yumeng is losing.”","“As expected of the No. 1 Expert on the south coast. Senior Brother Heavenly Hound is still too powerful.”","“When he gets serious, his strength becomes extremely terrifying.”","Thousands of people were talking about it.","Even Heavenly Hound felt that he had won.","He looked at the storm zone and said in a clear voice, “Junior Sister Zhang, hurry up and admit defeat. I’ll take back my move so that you won’t be frightened.”","Just when everyone thought that Mengmeng had lost, Her voice came from within the storm zone.","“You want to defeat me with such a minor move?”","Clatter!","All of a sudden, in the light cyan storm, a wisp of white light penetrated the zone. It was as if there was a bright light flashing inside.","“What’s that?”","“This, this battle hasn’t ended? And the outcome hasn’t been decided yet?”","The second ray of white light pierced through the storm.","Then the third one...","Many rays of white light seemed to be squeezing the storm zone.","Heavenly Hound’s face changed slightly, and he kept increasing his control over the storm zone.","He tried his best to suppress the white light.","Five seconds had passed.","Clatter!","Heavenly Hound’s heart skipped a beat.","“Shit!”","He knew that the storm zone was about to be breached.","Boom!","A dull sound rang out.","The storm zone was completely destroyed.","When everyone saw the scene inside clearly, they were all stunned.","“What...”","In the distance, Tian Chen’s pupils shrank. “This aura. Oh my god!”","It was the Elemental Source.","He found it extraordinary, but he didn’t know what exactly it was.","Clatter!","White flames were burning.","They devoured the entire storm zone.","The towering trees at the foot of the mountain were frozen because of the cold.","The nine rivers on the Nine Rivers Peak froze at a speed visible to the naked eye.","Even the temperature of the surroundings dropped sharply, making people feel cold as if they had fallen into an ice cave.","“Why is it so cold while there are flames all over the sky?”","In the endless white flames, Mengmeng’s figure was erratic, and her red eyes were shining with two clusters of flames.","The Dark Cold Fire reappeared while Mengmeng was at the God Transformation Realm Middle Stage.","This kind of Alien Fire had even been cultivated several times by Zhang Han and its essence had been improved. It had been purified, improved, and nourished by the Heavenly Pearl for several years before it reappeared.","“What kind of supernatural power is this?”","Heavenly Hound was astounded.","He thought to himself. “Crap. I won’t lose, will I?”","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The flames gradually receded until they disappeared.","But wisps of flames were rotating on Mengmeng’s fingertips. There was a mysterious smile on her face.","“I’ve been playing with fire since I was young.”","Swoosh!","She used the Fireball Skill.","The huge white fireball carried with it an icy chill as it attacked.","“Demonic Shadow Sword!","“Tiger Eye Sword!”","“...”","Heavenly Hound struck out all kinds of sword moves again.","He used six occult arts to put out the fireball.","“What kind of fire is this?” Heavenly Hound asked in shock.","Mengmeng did not answer.","Tian Chen and some of the senior elders present thought, “Alien Fire. This is Alien Fire!","“It is really unexpected that she even possesses the rare Alien Fire.”","On the battlefield, Heavenly Hound said in a serious tone, “I didn’t expect you to have such a trump card in addition to so many powerful skills. It seems that it’s time for me to show my real strength.”","Although Heavenly Hound was powerful, few people knew that he was also a Body Cultivator.","And now, he was ready to use some means of Body Cultivation to defeat his opponent.","However, something unexpected happened.","“Fireball Skill.","“Fireball Skill.","“Fireball Skill.”","“...”","One after another, white fireballs were thrown over.","“Holy shit!”","Heavenly Hound was immediately under great attack.","Even though he was still an individual cultivator and had a lot of trump cards, he couldn’t stand such a crazy bombardment.","The sparring was not a life-and-death battle.","So the competitors wouldn’t use their real trump cards.","But Heavenly Hound knew very well that the other party might have other tricks up her sleeve.","They would see which one of them would win with the moves they displayed.","It was clear that there was nothing Heavenly Hound could do now.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The bombardment went on.","Seeing this, the people around were quite dumbfounded.","“Why do I feel that Zhang Yumeng is crushing Heavenly Hound violently?”","“He’s doomed. I feel like the No. 1 Expert on the south coast is about to be replaced.”","“...”","“You can fight back.” Seeing that Heavenly Hound had been defending, Mengmeng couldn’t help but urge him.","She still had 20% of her spiritual force left. If she couldn’t win after she used up her strength, she would lose.","Mengmeng’s Dark Cold Fire was one of her strongest skills. She still had a few moves to make with the Dark Cold Fire. If it didn’t work, then she would just drop it. She just didn’t have time to use them.","“Stop!”","Heavenly Hound exclaimed, “Junior Sister Zhang, stop now.”","“Hmm?”","Mengmeng hesitated for a moment and stopped casting the Fireball Skill.","Under everyone’s gaze, Heavenly Hound put his hands behind his back. His face was calm and detached.","“There’s no need to continue. You’ve already proven your strength. I do not wish to injure you as my fellow disciple. I admit defeat in this battle.”","“No, no, we can continue to fight. You don’t need to be afraid of hurting me.” Mengmeng waved her hand repeatedly.","“Ahem, I won’t fight anymore.”","Heavenly Hound looked around and said in a loud and clear voice, “I’m very gratified to see a talent like Zhang Yumeng in our sect.”","Tian Chen was speechless.","“This fellow is putting on airs again?”","Heavenly Hound was the only disciple in the entire Sword Sect who could put on the airs and act like a Sect Leader.","Mengmeng didn’t know what to say.","“He’s such an asshole.”","“A real man should keep his word. I’ll ask someone to send five kinds of sixth-tier spirit treasures to the Swordbamboo Peak the next day.”","Heavenly Hound said lightly, “As new disciples, you need to learn from Protector Zhang Yumeng, who is your role model. It is like sailing against the current while taking cultivation. If you don’t make progress, you will retreat step by step. Learning from others is what the sect advocated.”","He looked serious, but in his heart, he thought. “Junior Sister Zhang, I’m praising you like this. You can’t oppose it, can you?”","However, Mengmeng’s answer surprised him.","“Senior Brother Heavenly Hound, you’re too courteous. I’m just a little bit stronger than you. Your strength is still very formidable.” Mengmeng also put her hands behind her back and said seriously, “But unfortunately, you’ve mastered too few occult arts. As the saying goes, live and learn. You can’t stop learning. I think some of the senior disciples in the sect seem to be a little relaxed, and they can’t continue like this.”","The corner of Heavenly Hound’s mouth trembled, but his expression remained unchanged. He nodded and said, “You’re right, Junior Sister Zhang. We should cultivate more occult arts and then choose one that suits us so that we can comprehend our supernatural powers. It’s the same for me. In the future, I’ll often learn from you about the occult arts.”","Mengmeng was speechless.","“I guess he’s not dumb.”","“Well, since the battle is over, let’s disperse.” Heavenly Hound looked at Mengmeng out of the corner of his eye and found that she was looking at the crystal stones on the top of the mountain. He gasped and felt a little distressed, but he still said, “I should share these crystal stones with you because, after all, it’s a battle between you and me.”","Mengmeng rolled her eyes and said, “Haha, do you think I would be short of crystal stones?”","Hearing this, Heavenly Hound felt delighted and much better. He laughed and said, “I can’t thank you enough, Junior Sister Zhang. You’re the winner. It’s natural for you to have all these crystal stones. But as long as you don’t lack them, I’ll...”","“Well, I can’t have enough of crystal stones either.”","Mengmeng suddenly said, “Alas, Senior Brother Heavenly Hound, thank you for your offer. Since you’ve already said it, I can’t refuse. I’ll accept these crystal stones. Where are the disciples of the Swordbamboo Peak?”","“Here!”","Many people stood out from several places.","“Put away these crystals and send them to my courtyard on the Swordbamboo Peak.”","“Yes, Protector!”","These disciples were very excited. They felt honored to be able to work for Zhang Yumeng.","Swoosh!","Heavenly Hound’s face changed.","His eyes were slightly red.","“Ahhhh!”","He roared in his heart.","“She’s really taking them!","“Good heavens!","“Such a powerful figure like her is still taking these millions of crystal stones. Damn it...”","He was extremely mad, but he couldn’t vent his anger. He merely breathed a little faster.","Seeing this, Mengmeng smiled even more sweetly.","“Senior Brother Heavenly Hound, did you say that the winner gets to choose the sixth-tier spirit treasures?”","“I...”","Heavenly Hound shook his dizzy head, took a deep breath to ease his mood, and said in a heavy voice, “I did.”","“Alright, I’ll go to you to pick the treasures another day.”","Heavenly Hound said with a sullen face, “Okay!”","With so many people watching, he couldn’t break his promise.","The most important thing was that he couldn’t go back on his word. If it were someone else, he would do it, but Zhang Yumeng’s father wanted to beat him up.","Thinking of that irresistible force, Heavenly Hound felt his heart bleed.","However, he suddenly recalled something.","“Hahaha, I heard that you also have a peerless divine dog.”","Heavenly Hound thought to himself. “I lost this battle. I got defeated, but my dog can definitely win against hers.”","“That’s a deal. We’ll have another battle when I come back after I go out for training.”","Mengmeng agreed with a smile.","Seeing this, Yue Wuwei stroked his beard.","“What a cunning fox.”"]},{"number":1494,"title":"Chapter 1494 The Peak of His Life","paragraphs":["Chapter 1494 The Peak of His Life","“Zhang Yumeng has become the No. 1 Expert on the south coast.”","“Even Heavenly Hound is no match for her. She is too strong.”","“She’s now well-known in the sect. She’s still a new disciple, but she’s already made such achievements.”","The crowd in the surroundings discussed animatedly, and they were either exclaiming with admiration, sighing with emotion, or admiring Mengmeng.","Right then, Elder Tian Chen spoke up in a clear voice.","“It’s truly not easy for Zhang Yumeng to defeat the Heavenly Hound and become the No. 1 Expert on the south coast. Due to her outstanding performance, we made an exception and promoted her to an elder of the sect.”","Hiss!","As soon as he said that, many people present gasped, and even some high-position officials were a little dizzy. They couldn’t believe their ears.","“She has become an elder of the sect?","“It’s incredible.”","After thinking about it carefully, they suddenly guessed something.","If she didn’t have powerful connections, she wouldn’t have been able to do it so quickly.","It seemed that Zhang Yumeng had connections with the insiders and was highly regarded by Tian Chen.","“Elder Zhang Yumeng!”","“Elder.”","Even the Peak Master of the Swordbamboo Peak came over to greet Mengmeng. “I should call you Elder Zhang from now on.”","The elders of the sect were people of higher status than the Peak Masters.","If a disciple wanted to become an elder step by step, they would need to work hard for many years and make enough contributions.","It only took Mengmeng slightly more than a month to do this.","“She is the youngest elder in the history of our sect.”","“At the same time, she has spent the least time to become the No. 1 Expert on the south coast.”","Many people were discussing.","“If she challenges the most powerful expert on the north coast, Yun Han, then she’ll become the top expert in the younger generation of the sect.”","“She has broken too many records. She became a chief supervisor, a protector, and then an elder as a young talented disciple... She has too many titles.”","“...”","Not far away, Yun Han smiled bitterly.","“I’m afraid she’ll challenge me next. I’m no match for her.”","“Senior Brother Yun, why are you giving up so quickly? You can do it. Believe in yourself.”","Yun Han said, “Believe in my ass. Have a reality check.”","“All right.”","The crowd slowly dispersed, but Zhang Yumeng’s name swept across the entire Sword Sect like a storm.","Moreover, everyone was clearly aware that the other three major sects would find out about this very quickly.","After all, the Four Great Sects had their own spies or partners amongst the ordinary disciples and even some supervisors in other sects.","The situation of the Authentic Martial Arts Sect, the Heavenly Evil Sect, and the Crimson Sunglow Sect was no secret in the Ling Sea Sword Sect. Many people knew about it.","Obviously, the name Zhang Yumeng would gradually spread on the Vast Heaven Star.","However, Zhang Han and the others didn’t get to witness this.","Moreover, the No. 1 Expert on the north coast, Yun Han, did not receive any news of Mengmeng’s challenge.","Because Zhang Han and the others had already taken the spaceship to the Chu Family’s place.","This time, Mengmeng met many people.","Mu Xue, Zhao Feng, Ah Hu, Instructor Liu, Jiang Yanlan, Headmaster Shan, and others all showed their magical powers on the Vast Heaven Star. They left their sects, met on the affiliated planet, and left.","After they and Mengmeng saw each other, Mu Xue clicked her tongue in wonder. “Hey, little princess, you’re already so formidable now. You’re even the number one expert on the south coast of the Sword Sect. You’ve surpassed us.”","“Aunty Xue, you’re flattering me.”","The crowd returned to the Heavenly Double Star and had a gathering.","This time, they went back together to rest for a while.","The group set off on their return journey.","They found a Space Node, opened a passageway, and followed the Ancient Road of Starry Sky to the Domain of Seven Desolations.","“Lord Demon Overlord!”","Many demons greeted Zhang Han when they saw him.","A Demon Lord reported the news.","The Great Devil of the Demonic God Temple had heard that their Demon Overlord, Zhang Hanyang, had gradually stopped fighting.","However, the Demonic God Temple was several times larger.","Zhang Han was not very interested in being the Great Devil King.","He went straight back to the Sea Dragon Star Area.","The group made a trip to the Dragon Base Star.","...","Headmaster Shan left and returned to the academy.","The others went back to Earth.","This time, nothing unexpected happened. It was just as calm as before.","They arrived at Mount New Moon.","“It’s March 2nd.”","Yue Xiaonao said, “Turning on my phone now. There are a lot of messages.”","There were messages from Zheng Dan and Lv Zihan as well as Chen Yang and Counselor Hou’s missed calls.","“I’ll inform them. Shall we go back to school tomorrow or...?” Yue Xiaonao asked.","“Let’s go back tomorrow night.” Mengmeng nodded.","“Okay.”","They rested on Mount New Moon for a day and had a good time.","...","At seven o’clock the next evening, the two girls went straight back to school through the Space Portal.","“Let’s go back to the dormitory first.”","After a vacation, they needed to tidy up their beds in the dormitory.","They got back to their room.","“No one’s here?”","Mengmeng took out the key and opened the door. The room was very clean. Their beds had been tidied up, and the sheets and quilts had been cleaned and folded neatly.","“It’s obvious that Zihan has folded the sheets,” Yue Xiaonao said. “This girl is ingenious.”","“They should have gone to the restaurant,” Mengmeng said.","“Yeah,” Yue Xiaonao said. “I don’t know where Muen is. I’ll call her.”","As soon as she dialed the number, Li Muen ran over in a few minutes.","“Oh, Mengmeng, Xiaonao, you’re finally back.”","Having not seen them for two months, Li Muen missed them very much and smiled happily.","“Shall we go out for a walk?” Yue Xiaonao asked.","“Sure.”","The three of them quickly went out.","Walking on the campus at night, they enjoyed themselves as college students.","Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao had just returned from the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven. The contrast made them also feel great staying on Earth.","They were very idle, enjoying the experience they were having.","They walked around and talked a lot until eight o’clock.","Mengmeng said, “Shall we go to the restaurant?”","“Okay. It’s still the same over there. Everything’s fine,” Li Muen said. “I’ll call Chen Yang.”","Beep! Beep!","After Li Muen dialed the number, her eyes gradually widened. She looked at Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao.","“Well... Chen Yang has been arrested.”","“What? Arrested?” The two of them were stunned.","“Who arrested him? For what?”","Li Muen answered, “He’s at the police station.”","“What happened?”","They looked at each other and quickly walked out of the school.","An hour ago, Chen Yang was still in the restaurant.","He had spent only ten days in his hometown during the vacation.","He and Ye Xiaomu from Sci-Tech University came from the same city. Their mothers were old classmates and they were quite familiar with each other.","Chen Yang’s mother always joked that she liked Xiaomu. If these two young people could get married, the two families would be even closer.","However, Ye Xiaomu’s mother always refused. “No way.”","Chen Yang would occasionally visit Ye Xiaomu’s family.","He also visited her during the New Year.","Before the new semester began, Chen Yang returned to school, ran the restaurant, and even held an event.","Now there was a membership system, and there were many people who applied for a membership card.","The day before school started, Chen Yang saw Lv Zihan. He was now acting like a good friend to Lv Zihan. Since Mengmeng and the other girls warned him, he had become much more well-behaved.","“Alas!”","Chen Yang sat at the counter and chatted with Zheng Dan. “I heard that you have a part-time job?”","“How did you know? Did Zihan tell you?” Zheng Dan asked.","“Yeah.”","“My cousin is selling luxury goods. She’s got a boyfriend recently and wants more spare time. I will take her shifts on Saturday. I’m just doing it to have working experience.” Zheng Dan said, “I have been training for a few days. So? Are you interested in shopping, Childe Chen? You will buy me a purse, and then we can have a romantic night.”","“Ahem, please. I’m not interested in you.” Chen Yang shook his head.","“You don’t have a girlfriend. Why don’t we be together?” Zheng Dan said, pouting and blowing a kiss.","“Who said I don’t have a girlfriend?” Chen Yang glared at her and chuckled. “And I even have two.”","“Who are they? Your friend from Sci-Tech University? What about the other one?”","“The other one may be Zihan.”","“Hee-hee, forget it.” Zheng Dan sneered and said, “Aren’t you afraid that Mengmeng and Sister Nao will beat you up?”","“I am, so I only have one date now, and it hasn’t been confirmed yet,” Chen Yang said. “I won’t confirm my relationship so easily, tsk tsk.”","“You’re such a bad guy.” Zheng Dan said charmingly, “And I like it.”","“You’d better like someone else.”","Chen Yang clapped his hands and got up to receive the customers.","Right at this moment, his phone rang.","Zheng Dan saw the caller ID, which showed “little sheep”.","It was that girl from Sci-Tech University.","“Hey, little sheep.”","“Are you busy?”","“Even if I’m busy, I still have time to talk to you. What can I do for you?” Chen Yang said with a smile.","He could imagine Ye Xiaomu smiling on the other end of the line.","“Well, the members of our Student Union are having a dinner party today. It’s on the second floor of Drezor Restaurant. I guess it won’t end within an hour. It’s quite dark on the streets nearby, so can you come to pick me up?”","“Okay, I will pick you up in a luxury car later.”","“Don’t do that. If others see it, they will think that I’m probably some gold digger,” Ye Xiaomu said.","While they were talking, Chen Yang could hear that the environment on the other side became quite noisy, and there were a lot of people talking.","Ye Xiaomu was back in the private room.","“Xiaomu, come and take a seat here. Whom are you calling?” A man’s voice rang out.","“It’s my... male friend.” Ye Xiaomu stressed at the end of the sentence.","Originally, she wanted to say that it was her boyfriend. There were many guys wooing her in the school, including the Student Union. She wanted to address Chen Yang as her boyfriend on the phone and make those guys give up the idea.","But when she was about to say it, she remembered that Chen Yang had never pursued her or confessed his love to her, so she felt a little resentful.","At the same time, she was also reminding Chen Yang. “Do you want to make it serious or not?”","Chen Yang understood what she meant and laughed bitterly.","Recently, he was quite conflicted. He thought that he wanted to date a few girls when he was in college. He took a fancy to Lv Zihan, but he couldn’t date her. Now he was serious about his career, and he felt at a loss for what to do.","But something unexpected happened.","The man in the private room said loudly, “A male friend? Ha, you don’t need another guy to pick you up. Dude, leave Xiaomu to me. She won’t go back to school tonight.”","“Why won’t she go back to school? To be with him?”","Rumble!","Chen Yang felt astonished and alert when he heard that.","“Dong Da, are you drunk? Don’t make such a joke!” Ye Xiaomo said coldly.","Between her friends in the Student Union and Chen Yang, she chose Chen Yang without hesitation.","It got quiet for a while in the private room.","“Xiaomu, Dong Da is joking. Don’t be angry. Besides, he has been pursuing you for half a year. He is so sincere. I think you should be together.”","“Yeah. Brother Da is a rare rich young man in our department. I like him, but he ignores me.”","“...”","Some people were still echoing.","“Xiaomu, I’ll drive you home tonight. Why do you need someone else to pick you up?” Dong Da took advantage of his drunkenness and said, “Hey, dude on the line, I’ve kissed Xiaomu. Have you?”","Feeling dizzy, Dong Da deliberately said that. He was jealous and unwilling to give up. Looking at the sweet look Ye Xiaomu had on the phone, he was a little angry.","Embarrassed, Ye Xiaomu said angrily, “What nonsense are you spouting?”","Beep!","She hung up the phone.","The more they talked, the more chaotic things went.","Chen Yang’s face quickly turned red and then livid. He gritted his teeth and cursed, “Fuck!”","He even stopped entertaining customers.","Chen Yang strode out of the door, dialed his buddy’s number, and said angrily, “Xiao Ma, call our brothers to come to the pedestrian street. Fuck that guy. We’ll take him down!”","Clatter!","In less than two minutes, more than a dozen people ran out of an Internet cafe not far away.","Students liked to surf the Internet or stay up all night in that place.","“What’s going on, Chen Yang?”","“Who will we fight?”","Among the crowd, some were filled with righteous indignation.","Some people said, “Let’s calm down first. Don’t be impulsive. What happened exactly?”","“Let’s go to Drezor Restaurant!” Chen Yang said angrily.","At this time, Zheng Dan also ran out of the restaurant quickly.","“Chen Yang, you...”","Before she could say anything, the group of people started running.","They were still very familiar with the environment on the pedestrian street.","Drezor Restaurant was located on the side of the main street. Its food was nice and it was a place where the students had gatherings.","Because the road was under construction, the street lights were turned off and it was slightly dim.","“Chen Yang!”","Zheng Dan shouted from behind. Seeing that they were getting farther and farther away, she ran out of breath and followed them quickly.","When they were about to arrive at the restaurant, Chen Yang’s phone rang again.","He didn’t pick it up.","From a distance, he seemed to be able to see that Ye Xiaomu was on the side of the street with a man next to her, who wanted to hold her arm.","“It’s him!”","Chen Yang’s eyes widened in anger.","“Go get him!”","They ran even faster.","Seeing this, Dong Da, who was on the other side, was a little drunk and confused, but he knew that they were up to no good.","He quickly retreated.","But he was not as fast as them.","“Chen Yang! Don’t do it!”","Ye Xiaomu wanted to stop him, but she failed.","Swoosh!","Chen Yang rushed over and kicked Dong Da to the ground.","Dong Da curled up. Facing punches and kicks, he was already quite dumbfounded.","At this time, several students of the Student Union, who had been waiting to see Dong Da woo Ye Xiaomu in front of the restaurant, saw this scene.","“Holy shit!”","The five students rushed over. Dong Da was rich and knew some powerful people. If those students helped him at this time, they might build a good relationship with him.","Therefore, they were willing to do it without hesitation.","One of them turned around and ran to the second floor to call for help.","As a result, the scene became chaotic.","After a chaotic fight, the two sides distanced themselves from each other and continued to quarrel.","Ten minutes later, they were taken away by the police.","On the way, Chen Yang received a call from Li Muen.","Then, the girls knew what happened to him.","Mengmeng, Li Muen, and Yue Xiaonao quickly left the school.","They arrived at the restaurant.","“Give me the car key.”","Mengmeng took the car key from a waiter and drove the Panamera to the police station.","At this time, the officers were dealing with this matter.","Chen Yang’s mouth was slightly swollen as he was punched.","The others were almost fine, but two of them were also a little bruised. Dong Da was the most miserable one. His body was covered with footprints, and his ears were bruised, but it wasn’t serious.","Both sides were being reprimanded.","Since the fight didn’t cause severe consequences, the police mediated between the two parties. Chen Yang and his friends were okay with the result, and some of them were even frightened. It would be bad if they were detained. As for Dong Da, his friends were indignant at first, but the matter was not resolved until Dong Da said that he was fine and was willing to mediate.","“Fortunately, you didn’t cause a big disaster. You are all top students. Why are you so impulsive? If you have done something excessive, won’t you regret it for the rest of your life? If you are expelled from school, the university that you have worked so hard to get into, your life will be ruined. How disappointed will your parents be...”","After a round of criticism, they were allowed to leave.","Dong Da and the others left first.","When they left, they didn’t notice the car on the side of the road.","Dong Da even added, “How dare he hit me? I’ll fucking kill him. He’ll just wait and see.”","“He’s gone too far. I can’t believe Ye Xiaomu called some guys from another school.”","“...”","It could be said that they shared the same enemy.","Mengmeng made a face and said, “This guy knows how to instigate others to fight.”","“All guys would do it,” Yue Xiaonao said while eating a lollipop. “Don’t they all have righteous ardor?”","“I don’t think so. You mean the ones in the martial arts world, right? There are always fights,” Li Muen said. “We’re now living in a peaceful society. It’s not good to fight. Not only will we suffer physical pain, but it will also cost us a lot of money.”","“But it seems that those people still want to make trouble for Chen Yang,” Li Muen added.","“I heard them,” Yue Xiaonao said casually. “That guy wants to pull strings and get Chen Yang fired. Mengmeng, will help Representative Chen out?”","“Huh? Why are you only asking me? Can’t you do it as well?” Mengmeng was stunned.","“They want to compete with us in connections, but we don’t know any powerful figure here,” Yue Xiaonao said casually.","“That’s right, that’s right. Mengmeng, you’re omnipotent. You’ll help Representative Chen get through this,” Li Muen joked.","“Come on, I think you’re flattering me.” Mengmeng spread out her hands and looked helpless.","A few minutes later, Chen Yang and the others came out of the police station.","Beside him, Ye Xiaomu was very dull and did not speak.","The other boys were all chatting.","“Fortunately, the consequences are not severe.”","“Damn it, it was too fierce just now. I couldn’t see anyone within a radius of more than ten meters.”","“You’re right about that. You just fucking kicked me.”","“Did I? I didn’t see it clearly either. It was all black shadows. I couldn’t tell who was on our side.”","“...”","In the car, Li Muen said, “We won’t get out of the car. I’ll make a phone call and tell him.","“Representative Chen, we are in the car next to you. Mengmeng, Xiaonao, and I will go back first. You can ask Sister Meng for help when you need it.”","After saying goodbye, the girls left.","Along the way, Ye Xiaomu remained silent and did not talk to Chen Yang.","Soon, they arrived at the school gate.","“Brothers, go back first. I’ll treat you to dinner tomorrow,” Chen Yang said with a smile.","“Okay.”","“Looking forward to your treat tomorrow.”","“Call me if you need anything.”","“...”","After they said goodbye, only Chen Yang and Ye Xiaomu were left.","They walked into the campus of Sci-Tech University and went to the girls’ dormitory. When they passed by a path under some trees, Chen Yang spoke up.","“Hey, don’t be mad. I was impulsive, but that guy was asking for a beating with what he said. He dared to say that you would not go back to school at night and said that he kissed you.”","“And you believed that?” Ye Xiaomu glared at Chen Yang.","“I didn’t believe it, but I was angry to hear it.”","Chen Yang let out a long breath as if he had made up his mind.","He grabbed her hand, stood opposite her, and said, “Actually, I care about you much more than I imagined.”","“You...” Ye Xiaomu bit her lip. “I couldn’t stop you, and you didn’t listen to me...”","Suddenly, Chen Yang hugged her, lowered his head, and kissed her quickly, leaving her no chance to speak.","Ye Xiaomu’s gaze froze for a moment and then softened.","Moments later, the kiss ended.","Chen Yang whispered, “You’re mine.”","“Are you confessing your love to me?” Ye Xiaomu asked blankly.","“No, it’s not a confession. It’s an announcement,” Chen Yang said.","“That’s so domineering.”","Ye Xiaomu gently touched the corner of Chen Yang’s mouth and asked, “Does it still hurt?”","“No.”","Chen Yang smiled and glanced in the direction of his university.","Three people flashed through his mind, who were Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and Li Muen.","He felt that if he could make friends with the three of them, who were his benefactors, he would be able to save himself 20 years of hard work.","But at the same time, Chen Yang could bring them some fun and help them during their college life."]},{"number":1495,"title":"Chapter 1495 A Part-time Job","paragraphs":["Chapter 1495 A Part-time Job","“Why are you smirking?”","“Because I’m happy.” Chen Yang smiled and took Ye Xiaomu’s hand. “I’ll send you back to the dormitory.”","“Okay.” Ye Xiaomu nodded slightly.","It seemed that she was in a good mood and followed Chen Yang forward happily.","When they were about to arrive at the dormitory-","“I don’t want to stay in the Student Union any longer,” said Ye Xiaomu.","Chen Yang said, “I agree.”","“Aren’t you going to ask why?” she asked.","“It’s because of me, of course,” Chen Yang said arrogantly. “Alas, I’m just so charming.”","“You’re so pretentious,” Ye Xiaomu said. “You’re one of the reasons, and I get so busy in the Student Union. I want to focus on my studies.”","For some reason, they walked very slowly and arrived at the door of the dormitory before they knew it.","“Kiss me.”","Chen Yang moved closer to Ye Xiaomu with a smile.","Swoosh!","Ye Xiaomu’s face suddenly turned red. There were so many people coming and going, so she was embarrassed.","“Just go now. I’m going back. I’ll call you later.”","Ye Xiaomu ran away in panic.","Chen Yang rubbed his chin and left with a smile.","In his heart, the relationship between him and Ye Xiaomu had been confirmed. All he needed was an opportunity to confess his love to her.","“It seems that I need to think about it.”","On the way back, Chen Yang pondered.","What he didn’t know was that danger was slowly approaching.","Head Wang had been teaching at Westpam University for 16 years.","His wife was a businesswoman. Their family was well-off.","At this moment, a very important company called her, but in the end, it was Head Wang who answered the phone.","After a mental struggle, Head Wang agreed to the other party’s request.","The next day.","At two o’clock in the afternoon, Mengmeng and her classmates were having PE class.","Many students were playing volleyball, and there were many onlookers. Some were strolling around.","Chen Yang and his roommates were smoking in the shade of a tree.","All of a sudden, his shoulder was heavily patted.","“Who is it?”","Chen Yang immediately turned around. When he saw who it was, his eyes narrowed.","“It’s Dong Da!","“He’s actually come to me here.”","There were still traces of being beaten on Dong Da’s face.","“What do you want?”","One of Chen Yang’s roommates questioned.","“Chen Yang, let’s go to the teaching building. Head Wang is waiting for you there.”","Dong Da sneered.","“Do you think I’ll go just because you say so? Do you know where the teaching building is?” Chen Yang snorted.","He thought that perhaps there was an ambush waiting for him.","“Boy, how dare you disobey me? Do you know what price you’ll pay? I can make you drop out of school. And you guys, what are you staring at? Do you also want to be expelled? Do you want to hit me? Come on, hit me.”","When Chen Yang noticed Dong Da’s arrogant attitude, his heart gradually sank.","“Do you think I wouldn’t dare to beat you up?”","An impulsive roommate of Chen Yang’s wanted to kick Dong Da when he heard that.","“Don’t move!”","Chen Yang immediately stopped him and said, “Take me to the teaching building.”","“Huh.”","Dong Da sneered and strode forward.","“He’s really going in the direction of the teaching building.”","Seeing this, Chen Yang panicked for some reason.","He and Ye Xiaomu had a chat on the phone last night.","Dong Da came from a well-off family. It was said that when he was a freshman, he often drove a supercar for a ride in the first half of the semester and was very generous. When he was a sophomore, he seemed to have had enough fun and restrained himself a lot. Since Ye Xiaomu joined the Student Union, he had begun to pursue her.","...","Chen Yang and Ye Xiaomu talked for an hour, and he got jealous. He said that he would buy a luxury car sooner or later and take her for a ride.","Chen Yang wasn’t too worried after understanding the situation, but now his heart sank.","“But it shouldn’t be a big deal. I’ll take it if it’s just a demerit.”","Chen Yang was mentally prepared. When he arrived at the entrance of the teaching building, he waved his hand and asked his roommates to go back first.","He and Dong Da went all the way to Head Wang’s office, where there were three people.","In addition to Head Wang, there was a middle-aged man in casual clothes, who was President Li of Austron Company. He was also in charge of this matter, and the other person was Dong Da’s mother.","Dong Da walked into the room and said, “This is the one.”","“Okay.”","Head Wang nodded, looked at Chen Yang, and said with a kind smile, “It’s normal for you, as young students, to have some disputes, but you need to deal with it rationally. I want to know why you hit him last night.”","“I...” Chen Yang hesitated for a moment before telling the truth. “Because he was rude to my girlfriend.”","“How was I rude to her?” Dong Da asked with a puzzled look on his face, “Chen, don’t talk nonsense. The truth is like this. Ye Xiaomu is a new member of our Student Union. Many students were at our party yesterday. I’ve never said anything rude. Everyone who was there can prove it. He hit me on purpose when he saw that I was trying to escort Ye Xiaomu back to school.”","...","“You know very well whether it’s true or not,” Chen Yang said.","President Li and Mrs. Dong seemed to be in no mood to talk.","Head Wang thought for a moment and said, “Because of some emotional problems, you misunderstood him, and then you took action on impulse, right?”","“Yes, he was rude first. I couldn’t help fighting back.”","“Don’t be afraid, Chen. I’m here to uphold justice and make things right,” Head Wang said. “Can you tell me how you started the fight?”","Chen Yang was still too young.","He thought that Head Wang would help him, so he said, “I received a call from my girlfriend. He was very rude to her, so I went to pick up my girlfriend with my friends. When I saw him pulling her, I kicked him directly and then fought him. My lips are still bruised.”","“Chen, your kick has left severe damage on Dong’s kidney.” Head Wang said, “This is too serious. It’s misconduct to start a fight, and it’s forbidden. As a class representative, you didn’t set a good example. Instead, you gathered your friends to beat others up, which has a bad impact on the school.”","Finally, Head Wang clicked on his mobile phone and ended the recording. His tone gradually became unfriendly.","“Therefore, the school has decided to expel you.”","As soon as he finished speaking, President Li took out a document and said, “And you have to pay for Dong Da’s medical expenses, mental damage, and so on. It will be a total of 107 thousand dollars. This is the document. You can take it back and read it. If you don’t carry the compensation out, we’ll press charges.”","Rumble!","Chen Yang was stunned.","He didn’t know what to do.","He looked around in a panic and felt that the smile on Dong Da’s face was very hateful.","All of a sudden, a sentence flashed across his mind, “You can ask Sister Meng for help when you need it.”","This was what Li Muen had said.","At this time, he had no choice but to say, “I, I need to make a phone call.”","“Go ahead. I should have informed your parents about this,” Head Wang said coldly.","“Hello, Sister Meng, I’m in Head Wang’s office. I may be expelled. I don’t know what to do,” Chen Yang said numbly.","He had never experienced serious occasions before, so it was inevitable that his mind would go blank when he encountered such a thing.","However, Mengmeng’s answer reassured him a lot.","“I see. Just wait there.”","After that, she hung up the phone.","“You didn’t inform your parents?” Head Wang frowned.","“No. I...”","“Forget it. I’ll call them myself.” Head Wang sighed and picked up the landline.","“Please don’t, Head Wang. Don’t inform my parents yet.” Chen Yang was a little anxious.","If his parents heard this news, they would definitely be devastated.","“Can you handle it without informing them?”","“I can.”","“Haha, how are you going to handle it?” Head Wang shook his head slightly and dialed a number. “Hello, is it Chen Yang’s mother? I’m Head Wang of Westpam University. I’m sorry to inform you that your son has been expelled from school because of a fight, and he needs to pay more than 100,000 dollars for medical expenses as compensation. Please come to the school, or Chen Yang will be sued.”","“Head Wang, you...”","Rumble!","It was like a bolt from the blue, striking Chen Yang’s heart.","His eyes were slightly red. He knew that his mother must be feeling terrible at home.","Buzz!","His phone buzzed, but he didn’t pick it up. He really didn’t want to tell his mother the news.","Chen Yang had never imagined that he would get into such big trouble.","“Chen, your phone is ringing.” Dong Da smiled triumphantly and said, “It should be your mother. Pick it up now. You’ll have to deal with it sooner or later.”","“You!”","Chen Yang looked at Dong Da with hatred.","“I advise you to calm down,” President Li said lightly. “The matter can still be dealt with now. If you get impulsive, the consequences may be more serious, and you may be imprisoned.”","As he spoke, he thought to himself. “He’s really a young man who hasn’t seen much of the world. He’s scared out of his wits now.”","He even found it a little funny when he recalled that he had been acting like Chen Yang when he was young before.","“Well, now that he has offended Dong Da, who is someone he can’t afford to mess with, it will be a lesson for him that he needs to pay more than 100,000 dollars and drop out of school.”","“I still have something to do.”","Mrs. Dong finally spoke up. She glanced at the Patek Philippe watch and got up to leave.","Right at this moment, the office door was pushed open directly, and no one knocked on it.","Seeing two girls coming in, Head Wang frowned and asked, “Who are you? Which class are you from? Why didn’t you knock on the door?”","“Huh.”","Mengmeng snorted. Seeing that Chen Yang’s eyes were red, she and Yue Xiaonao sat directly on the sofa on the side.","Dong Da’s eyes were fixed, and his mother was also a little confused. President Li just watched silently.","Head Wang got a little angry. “Who are you?”","“Sister Meng, Sister Nao, I, I’ve been expelled,” Chen Yang said weakly. “He called my mom.”","“Mengmeng, Chen has been bullied. After all, he is our friend,” Yue Xiaonao said casually. “Chen, you look so upset. Wipe your eyes now. Sister Meng is going to stand up for you. Everything will be fine. Don’t worry.”","“What?”","Chen Yang was stunned and didn’t quite understand.","Head Wang’s face darkened. “What are you doing?”","“Silence!”","Yue Xiaonao glared at him.","Head Wang felt inexplicably scared and stopped talking.","At this time, Mengmeng also made a move. She raised her head slightly, looked at Head Wang, and said, “Call the principal and ask him to come over.”","“The principal is not at school. Who are you?” Head Wang began to hesitate.","“Could it be that these girls have some sort of background?”","“Fine. If you don’t call him, I will.”","Mengmeng took out her mobile phone. “Hello? Are you familiar with the principle of Westpam University? Ask him to come to Head Wang’s office.”","“You’re talking big.”","Head Wang laughed at once.","If her tone was polite and she asked the one on the line to do things for her, he would believe that she was indeed capable. Her tone was calm as if she was talking to her subordinates, so Head Wang didn’t believe that she had the ability to handle this matter.","“I heard that you are very powerful.”","Mengmeng then looked at Dong Da and the other two and asked, “Which company are you from?”","“Haha, I’m Li Cai from Austron Company,” President Li said with a smile.","“I see.”","Mengmeng made another phone call and said, “Hello? Uncle Feng, does our family have a branch in West Capital? We do, then ask the person in charge to come to my school. Yeah. I have a friend here, and he got bullied. The other party has a wide network of contacts and is from Austron Company. How terrifying, hahaha... What would you come here? You’re not as powerful as me now. Okay. Hurry up and inform them.”","Mengmeng talked with a smile on her face. She looked quite casual. After all, Zhao Feng had watched her grow up.","After the two phone calls, Mengmeng said, “It’s settled. Let’s wait for a while. I will help you.”","As she spoke, she patted Chen Yang on the shoulder.","“Thank you, Sister Meng.”","Chen Yang nodded, his heart filled with gratitude.","Mengmeng was indeed worthy of being his benefactor.","Buzz!","Chen Yang’s phone continued to buzz.","“Pick it up now,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“Okay.”","Chen Yang was ready to risk everything. He picked up the phone and said with a calm tone, “Mom, what’s wrong? You’ve been calling all the time. I’m in class. Huh? Did I get expelled? What are you talking about? Head Wang? Bah! It’s a scam call. The one who called you was just a scammer. Don’t believe whatever they said. I’m doing fine at school.”","Chen Yang calmed down and felt much better after venting his anger. He smiled and said, “Mom, I’m still in class. I’m not allowed to make a phone call. I’ll hang up now.”","He hung up the phone.","Head Wang’s face darkened.","Dong Da said with unfriendly eyes, “I’d love to see what tricks you can play!”","His mother sat back down.","President Li was sitting next to her with his left leg on his right leg, looking relaxed.","“It seems that there are two more people on the expelling list.”","Head Wang sneered.","It didn’t take long for them to wait.","Twenty minutes later, the principal rushed in, sweating profusely.","“Mr. Xu?” Head Wang was slightly shocked.","However, the principal, Mr. Xu, ignored him. He smiled gently and said, “May I ask which one of you is Ms. Zhang?”","Mengmeng’s face darkened. “I am only a student.”","“Hello, hello.”","He didn’t dare to treat her as an ordinary student.","“Do you see what’s going on here?”","Mengmeng gestured to the front and said, “He wants to expel a student just because of a trivial matter. Head Wang has such a high position. These people are from Austron Company. I don’t believe that he doesn’t have anything to do with them. I wonder how many gifts Head Wang has received to make him work so hard for them.”","“That’s not true!”","Head Wang immediately got up to defend himself.","At this moment, Dong Da was quite dumbfounded. Mrs. Dong’s eyes were full of shock, and President Li could not sit still.","“That girl can really get the principal here. Who is she?”","“Sit down!”","The principal suddenly shouted.","Head Wang was so scared that he trembled and sat back down.","“About this matter...” Mr. Xu said after some consideration.","“Investigate them,” Mengmeng merely said.","“Shall I ask my men to do it?”","“No. I’ll ask someone to investigate them.” Mengmeng made another phone call and said, “Mr. Ma, have your men check if Head Wang of Westpam University has any misconduct. I need it in detail.”","Ten minutes later.","Beep!","Mengmeng received an email, in which Mr. Ma told her about Head Wang’s deeds in detail.","Mengmeng looked at Head Wang with a strange look and said, “You’re clean. It’s just that your wife has used her connections to engage in some of the school’s cooperation. That’s none of my business. Mr. Xu, how do you want to deal with him?”","While speaking, Mengmeng handed over her mobile phone.","The principal read the email and said, “He shall be dismissed.”","Clatter!","Head Wang broke out in a cold sweat and did not even dare to speak.","Dong Da and the other two were astounded, including Chen Yang.","He felt dazzled.","“Oh my god, how amazing Mengmeng’s background is!”","Thump! Thump! Thump!","There was a knock on the door.","“Come in.”","A young man pushed the door open and entered.","When President Li saw the young man, his face changed greatly. He immediately got up and said respectfully, “Hello, Boss Liu.”","However, the young man ignored him.","With a smile on his face, he cupped his hands and said respectfully, “Greetings, Eldest Lady.”","Clack!","President Li staggered and collapsed on the sofa. He felt overwhelmed. “What’s going on?”","The branch company of the Liu Group was very powerful in West Capital and was a force that Austron Company needed to look up to. It was unimaginable that the legendary Boss Liu would come here in person.","“Well...”","Seeing that no one spoke, Mengmeng said hesitantly, “What happened exactly?”","“They, they were asking for compensation. They want me to compensate him with 107 thousand bucks,” Chen Yang said, feeling uneasy.","“I see. Make them compensate with the same amount instead. I’m very similar to my dad. We’re both the most reasonable,” Mengmeng said seriously.","Hearing this, Yue Xiaonao covered her forehead and thought. “Is it okay that you’re lying through your teeth?”","“Austron Company is small in scale. I can terminate their cooperation with other companies with just an order. When that happens, it will cause some losses. It is estimated that their financial resources will shrink by 40%. It will take about seven days for the company to go bankrupt,” Boss Liu said.","“What do you think?” Mengmeng asked Chen Yang.","“You’re asking for my opinion?”","Chen Yang fell into deep thought and said, “I think we should be lenient wherever it is possible. Maybe we should be generous. Why don’t we just terminate their cooperation?”","“Hahaha.”","Seeing that he was so cautious, Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao both laughed.","The two of them got up and left.","“Wait for me.”","Chen Yang was stunned at first, and then he followed them out.","President Li and the other two were left with pale faces.","Dong Da has been beaten again.","When he got home, he was beaten for a long time and was really hospitalized.","He had vowed to take revenge, but in the end, he was the one who was doomed.","Chen Yang finally came to realize how powerful the girls were.","“You’re more powerful than I imagined. That’s incredible.","“Queen bees, you are my role models. You are my saviors, my benefactors.","“From now on, I will follow your lead.","“I’ll do anything you instruct me to do.","“I...”","“Just get lost. Don’t waste our time,” Yue Xiaonao said impatiently.","“Well, okay.”","Chen Yang quickly ran away.","“He’s really funny!” Yue Xiaonao snorted.","“He’s our partner,” Mengmeng said, “and we can’t have him bullied.”","“That’s right.” Yue Xiaonao nodded. “That guy is really detestable. It was just a fight. He could’ve just challenged Chen Yang after getting defeated. But still, he asked his parents to expel Chen Yang. He’s not a man at all. I really can’t stand it.”","“Calm down, calm down. You’re talking too loud. Can’t you see that everyone is looking at you?” Mengmeng lowered her voice.","It was just the break time. There were a lot of people on the road since they didn’t have classes for the rest of the day.","Suddenly, a senior saw the two girls and walked over with a smile on his face.","“Zhang Yumeng, I’ve been paying attention to you for many days. I wish to talk to you. I wonder if we can get to know each other and become friends.”","Hearing this, Mengmeng smiled sweetly and said, “Okay. I also feel like talking to someone.”","“Terrific. Shall we go somewhere to have coffee and high tea?”","“Not now. Why don’t we meet by the river in the evening...” Mengmeng said and winked at him. After that, she turned around and left with Yue Xiaonao.","The man stayed in the same spot in a daze. After dinner, he ran to the riverside and waited for a whole night.","Two more days passed.","It was Friday, Mengmeng didn’t have classes in the afternoon, and she had two and a half days of rest.","In Mengmeng’s dorm room.","Zheng Dan climbed onto the bed and lay down lazily. “Hmm, I have to have a good rest. I’ll need to work at Versace for a day tomorrow.”","“What will you do there?” Yue Xiaonao asked curiously.","“I’m going to help my sister manage the shift and make some extra money.” Zheng Dan said, “I’ll work as a shopping guide in Versace. That store is filled with luxury goods.”","While they were talking, Zheng Dan looked curious. “Those who can go there to buy things must be rich.”","“Well, I guess so,” Yue Xiaonao said.","She didn’t think much about it. Versace indeed sold luxury goods.","But for her and Mengmeng, it didn’t matter how much the goods cost. What mattered was whether they looked nice.","Zheng Dan didn’t know the brands of many of Mengmeng’s clothes because those were all high-end brands that were only purchased by the minority. They were relatively fashionable, but they were not so famous. Each piece of her clothes was probably worth a thousand bucks.","Mengmeng also had some cute and lively clothes from rather famous brands.","Lv Zihan’s mouth moved when she heard their conversation. She thought to herself. “Mengmeng and Sister Nao are super-rich.”","“Among us, Zihan has nice skin although she’s not so wealthy. Mengmeng and Sister Nao, you look even better. Your skin is delicate. It seems that I’m the only one who is diligent with rough hands.” Zheng Dan wailed, “This is not fair!”","“Are you sure you’re diligent with rough hands?” Mengmeng asked.","“To be exact, my hands are used to make extra money. Haha, it’s the same anyway. I worked for some days after graduating from high school,” Zheng Dan said.","“Holy cow, that’s amazing,” Mengmeng said in surprise. “What kind of job was it?”","“I was required to use a secret skill to tempt businessmen when wearing black silk stockings.” Zheng Dan made a rather attractive pose while she spoke.","“What?” Mengmeng was stunned at once.","Yue Xiaonao grinned and said, “Oh my god, you are the queen bee.”","“I’m just kidding. I worked as my uncle’s attendant.” Zheng Dan lay back down and said, “He ran a club. I was asked to supervise others.”","“I see.” Lv Zihan nodded and said, “I was terrified by what you said.”","“Why would you believe everything I say?” Zheng Dan said with a smile, “Anyway, I’ll make more money and then buy whatever I want.”","“Well...”","Mengmeng hesitated for a moment.","They had been roommates for so long. She found that Lv Zihan and Zheng Dan were nice. It would not be a big deal for her to help them pay for their expenses.","However, Mengmeng subconsciously felt that she shouldn’t have things change between them. After all, they would still be roommates for several years.","Girls were different from boys. Chen Yang was rough but meticulous. If Mengmeng offered Zheng Dan or Lv Zihan financial help, they might change.","After thinking about it, Mengmeng gave up the idea. There was still a long way to go, and she would think about it later.","She said casually, “Now that we’re talking about this, I’ve never worked before.”","“You two are from rich families,” said Zheng Dan. “I like spending money. I know what my dream is.”","“What is it?”","“Earning money while lying down.” After saying that, Zheng Dan paused and continued, “Don’t get me wrong. I won’t get a sugar daddy. I just want to meet a reliable man. I get to lie at home watching TV and go shopping when I have nothing to do. I think I think Chen Yang is nice. He’s ambitious and hard-working.”","“You may have misjudged him,” Yue Xiaonao said casually.","“Alas, it’s a pity that the nice guy has been taken. He has been getting closer to the little sheep of the Sci-Tech University these days.” Zheng Dan looked gossipy. “Maybe they have confirmed their relationship. Zihan, it seems that he doesn’t want to two-time you anymore.”","“It’s not like that. Representative... Representative Chen is a decent guy,” Lv Zihan said.","“A decent guy? He was absolutely coveting you at the beginning. If I were you, I would have made him fall in love with me long ago.”","“I’m really impressed by you,” Mengmeng muttered.","“Well, I need to check the sales information. Just in case. I need to be a qualified shopping guide.” Zheng Dan took out her mobile phone and began to read the internal group’s information.","“Xiaonao, we have never worked before. Why don’t we give it a try?” Mengmeng asked eagerly.","It didn’t matter whether she worked or not. She just wanted to take a picture and show it to Zhang Han.","“Not for me. I’m lazy. If you want to do it, just go. I can go visit your store,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“Forget it if you don’t want to.” Mengmeng snorted.","“Mengmeng, are you going?” Zheng Dan suddenly sat up and said with great interest, “Well, let’s work together. I’m a little scared without an acquaintance working with me, to tell the truth.”","“Uh, can I get hired at will without any training?” Mengmeng was stunned.","“You have me as your introducer. Besides, with your appearance, the manager will be eager to hire you. Perhaps I should ask her about it first,” Zheng Dan said.","“Okay.” Mengmeng nodded.","Zheng Dan typed on her phone. “I’ll send a photo of you. I guarantee that she’ll agree. Now, it’s an era where beauty is the most important thing. You see, she agreed directly. She said that we would go together.”","“Okay.”","“She asked about what size you wear so that she can prepare workwear for us,” Zheng Dan said.","After that, Zheng Dan’s interest was piqued again.","“I heard from my sister that this field is also very complicated. Generally speaking, people who work part-time are easy to be bullied. But we will be treated nicely. My sister has a good relationship with the manager, who will take care of us. The salary of the part-time job is 40 bucks a day. We’ll need to do a lot of work, such as sales, sorting out the goods, transporting, and so on. Mengmeng, can you handle hard work? If you can’t, I can do more work,” Zheng Dan said.","“I can do it. I’m quite energetic,” Mengmeng said. “I’m just going to have some fun. I want to take a picture of me working and show it to my dad to tell him that his girl is also working part-time. I’d love to see what he will say. Hee hee.”","“He’ll just say that he can give you the money directly. What else will he say?” Yue Xiaonao said.","“He won’t say that. He’s not like Uncle Li Kai.” Mengmeng said, “Muen’s dad is quite interesting. He often gives her money.”"]},{"number":1496,"title":"Chapter 1496 A Trick","paragraphs":["Chapter 1496 A Trick","Mengmeng was ready to work for a day and see what would happen.","Zheng Dan sent a series of information to her, and she memorized it after reading it.","She had nothing to do in the afternoon.","Zheng Dan and Lv Zihan went to the restaurant at about four o’clock. Every weekend, the restaurant was always very busy, and Chen Yang had been keeping an eye on the staff.","At about five o’clock, Chen Yang called.","“What’s up?” Mengmeng asked.","“Boss, it’s business. Someone wants to be our franchisee.” Chen Yang’s tone was full of surprise.","This would be their first franchisee.","Mengmeng was not interested in this, so she said, “I see. Just handle it on your own.”","“Well, he wants to bargain, and I’m not sure about some details.”","“Ask for Muen’s help. She is proficient in business affairs,” Mengmeng said.","“This is our first franchisee. Are you sure you don’t want to come over?” Chen Yang said with a smile.","“No.”","“Fine. I’ll call Muen and ask her.”","A few minutes after the call ended, Li Muen ran over.","“We have a franchisee now. Not bad. It’s only been a few months since the restaurant’s opening. This happened a little faster than I imagined,” Li Muen said.","“It’s the first step to success.” Mengmeng lay on the bed, put down her mobile phone, leaned over, and said, “Maybe Flying Hero Bagna Cauda can be a famous brand.”","“That’s for sure. The food tastes good, so we will have regular customers, and we will have more and more franchisees joining us. Look, we’ll charge them 30 thousand bucks a year as the membership fee. If there are 100 franchisees, it will be 3 million. Each of us will get 1 million. 1 million a year... It doesn’t seem to be a lot. Oh, right, there is also the turnover of the restaurants. We can also make a lot of money by opening up branches,” Li Muen said slowly. “Let’s go and check our first franchisee, shall we?”","“What’s there to check? Just let Chen Yang sign the contract with them,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“Okay. I’ll instruct Boss Chen about the specific details and let him deal with it himself.” Li Muen nodded and dialed Chen Yang’s number again.","They chatted for a while.","In the restaurant, Chen Yang hung up the phone and was entertaining a middle-aged man.","“Sir, I’m ready. This is the contract. If there’s no problem, we can sign it now,” Chen Yang said.","The middle-aged man was confused. “Your boss isn’t coming?”","Chen Yang looked a little shy. “Well, I’m also one of the owners here.”","“Haha, I see. Boss Chen, you’re really young and promising.”","The way he addressed Chen Yang had changed from Manager Chen to Boss Chen.","The man also came prepared. He had been observing the restaurant for half a month and thought that the food tasted good, so the deal was settled as he became the brand’s first franchisee.","That night, Chen Yang wanted to celebrate, but Mengmeng and the others didn’t seem to want to go out. They wanted to sleep in, so Chen Yang called Ye Xiaomu over. The two of them were in love quickly and began to enjoy their relationship in college.","The next day.","At seven o’clock.","Zheng Dan’s alarm clock rang, and she sat up and said, “Mengmeng, Mengmeng, get up. We need to go to work now.”","Mengmeng was lying on the bed and browsing through trending topics. When she heard this, she responded lazily, “I’ve been awake.”","“You woke up so early.”","Zheng Dan yawned. “Then let’s wash up and set off. I need to put on makeup. I’ll try my best to get it done as soon as possible.”","“Okay,” Mengmeng replied.","“Are you really going?” Yue Xiaonao said, “How can you, a spoiled young lady, go to work? Don’t come back in just an hour.”","“Are you looking down on me?” Mengmeng snorted and said, “You are the spoiled young lady.”","“We’re about the same, haha,” Yue Xiaonao said with a smile. “Which store will you work in? I’ll buy some stuff there later.”","“You don’t need to do that,” Mengmeng said. “I’ll just go to experience the feelings of working. Don’t you want to experience it?”","“No. I plan to lie in bed for a day today,” Yue Xiaonao replied.","“Okay.”","Mengmeng got out of bed, washed up, and put on casual clothes.","After Zheng Dan put on her makeup in a hurry, they went out.","“We’re going to take the subway. We’ll take Line 1 at Academy Road Station. It will be three stops before we arrive at the mall.”","“Okay.”","Zheng Dan decided the route they would take, and Mengmeng followed.","It took them 50 minutes to get to the mall by subway at about 8:30.","“We still have some time left. Shall we have breakfast?”","“Well, okay.”","They had a simple breakfast.","When they reported for work.","“Hello, I’m Zheng Dan, and she’s Zhang Yumeng. We’re here to work part-time.”","“Okay. The manager is over there.” A shop assistant pointed to the inside.","...","The manager was a woman in her thirties, and she took good care of her skin.","She said with a smile, “Are you Zheng Dan and Zhang Yumeng? Go to the back room and change into your workwear. When everything is ready, come here for a meeting.”","“Okay.”","The workwear was a red shirt and a black skirt that reached one’s knees.","The staff needed to comb their hair into a ponytail.","A few minutes later, the two girls were dressed up.","“Take a few pictures of me.”","Mengmeng handed her mobile phone to Zheng Dan.","“Okay.”","Mengmeng began to pose under the camera.","She puffed up her cheeks, winked at the camera, and wore a sweet smile.","...","She sent three photos to Zhang Han.","Mengmeng said with a grin, “How do I look? I’m now working, dad.”","Beep!","Two seconds later, Mengmeng’s phone rang.","“Hee hee, do I look nice?”","“This is really... an interesting hobby.” Zhang Han was amused. “Why do you feel like working?”","“I will work part-time with my roommate for a day at Versace.”","“Wow,” Zhang Han said with a smile. “You can experience it, but don’t exhaust yourself.”","“Okay.”","“Come home when you are not busy. I will cook delicious food for you.”","“Got it. I’ll order the dishes after work tonight.”","The words “after work” made Zhang Han feel a little awkward.","“Sure. I’ll wait for you to come back.”","After the phone call, Mengmeng followed Zheng Dan to the front desk with a happy look on her face.","“Let’s have a meeting first.","“Also, new girls, we’re very happy to have you join us.”","“...”","The shopkeeper gave a few simple instructions, mainly about the missions and attitude.","After that, she chatted with Zheng Dan and Mengmeng alone.","“Do you both know how to speak Lestinese?”","“We do.”","“Great. We would have some foreign customers occasionally. If you can’t speak their language, you can ask Xiao Mei to receive them. She has mastered four languages,” the shopkeeper said.","“Got it, Ms. Gan.”","“Well, that’s it. Zhang Yumeng, you’ll stand by the door and receive customers.”","The shopkeeper felt that Mengmeng was really beautiful, so she arranged for Mengmeng to stand by the door.","After staying in the store for a while, the shopkeeper went out to deal with something.","At this time, Xiao Mei, the relatively capable girl, came over and said, “Zhang Yumeng, Zheng Dan, go to transport the goods with Lili.”","Mengmeng said hesitantly, “Ain’t I supposed to receive customers here?”","“You’ll do it after moving the goods.”","Unexpectedly, it took them three hours to move the goods, sort them, and tidy them.","Some of the goods were very heavy.","Zheng Dan was a little exhausted, but Mengmeng didn’t feel tired at all. Lili was a senior who only did some light work. The heavy work was basically done by Zheng Dan and Mengmeng.","It was almost one o’clock.","“Let’s have lunch first. You can receive the customers here.”","Lili was at the counter with Zheng Dan and Mengmeng.","The two girls stood on both sides of the door, waiting for the arrival of the customers.","Lili wandered around, occasionally sitting at the counter for a while.","“Pretty girl, I think this purse matches your temperament very well. I really want to buy it for you. What do you think?”","A man who came to strike up a conversation greeted Mengmeng politely.","Mengmeng shook her head slightly and said, “No, thanks.”","“What a pity. Maybe the style here is not suitable for you. If you have time, let’s go to Hermes over there. I’ve paid attention to some of the new products. They’re all nice. There must be one that suits you,” the man said with a smile.","“I don’t like purses.” Mengmeng refused.","When the man heard this, his eyes lit up. He wanted to say something but stopped on second thought. He played hard to get.","“This is my business card. I hope I can get to know you.”","The man left a business card and made a phone call gesture.","Mengmeng waved her hand with a smile. After he turned around, she casually threw the business card into the trash can.","“You’re so young.”","Lili came over, picked up the business card, and looked at it. “Cheng Hui, the general manager of the Lucky Art Company. He is a big shot. Zhang Yumeng, you are so beautiful, and you are suitable to be a saleswoman. With just one look, you can make a nice performance by acting like you’re willing to go on a date. You should learn more things. Those men can stare at you but can’t get you, and they are most likely to spend money on you.”","“Uh, what you said makes sense.” Mengmeng looked awkward and smiled.","“It’s okay. You’ll slowly learn.”","Lili smiled and said, “It’s already one o’clock. You should go and have a rest.”","“Okay.”","The two girls left the storefront. Looking at the lunchbox, Mengmeng had no appetite.","However, Zheng Dan had done a lot of work. She was hungry and eating happily.","“Mengmeng, why don’t you eat?” Zheng Dan asked in confusion.","“I have no appetite.”","“Are you too tired?”","“No. I will eat delicious food at night. I plan to starve at noon so I can eat more at night,” Mengmeng said.","“Are you sure? We still have work to do in the afternoon.”","“I’m sure.”","After chatting for a while, Zheng Dan patted her leg and said, “I’m so exhausted.”","Mengmeng didn’t feel tired, but she didn’t find the work interesting either. It was even a little boring.","There were not many customers in the morning, but in the afternoon, the number of customers gradually increased.","The salesgirls were all in the front to receive the customers.","Mengmeng received five, but none of them bought anything.","It was like the store hadn’t opened yet.","Xiao Mei, who was relatively capable, suddenly whispered to Lili, “This will do.”","“Yes. Get ready. You go first.” Lili also responded in a hurry.","Mengmeng and Zheng Dan looked at each other and did not understand what they meant.","Following their gazes, they saw a man and a woman outside the store. The man was in his thirties and had a plump figure. The woman seemed to be in her early twenties. She clung to the man and spoke in a sweet voice.","“This sweater is not bad.” The woman said in a sweet voice, “Darling, what do you think?”","“It’s pretty good, but I think that one from Gucci suits you,” the man said with a smile.","How could the young woman be his match? They had been shopping for a whole day. If he didn’t want to buy the things she wanted, he could just give a perfunctory answer.","“Miss, let me introduce it to you. But please don’t touch it with your hands. This sweater is very easy to get stained,” Xiaomei said hurriedly and directly introduced the price. “This is the latest edition of this year, and it costs 2 thousand bucks.”","Hearing this, the woman withdrew her hand, snorted discontentedly, and turned to look at the purses on the other side.","“Honey, this purse looks pretty good.”","“It’s not allowed to touch the purses either,” Xiao Mei said.","“How would I know if it suits me without trying it on?” The woman spoke with displeasure.","“You can try it on.” There seemed to be a hint of contempt in Xiao Mei’s eyes. Without giving the woman permission, she put the purse there and said, “This purse is also a new product. There’s no discount. The price is 4,000 dollars.”","The man frowned but didn’t say anything.","The woman took a deep breath and said, “I’ll try it on, thank you.”","At this time, Lili came over with two glasses of water.","“Sir, Madam, here’s some pure water.”","She had a sweet smile on her face and her attitude was very nice.","“Thank you.”","The man was really thirsty. After drinking half a glass of water, he put it on the counter next to him.","“I need to try the purse,” the woman added.","“Alright,” Xiao Mei said lightly and helped the woman put on the purse.","It matched her clothes and looked very good. The woman’s eyes lit up slightly. “It’s so beautiful.”","“It’s just so-so. Let’s go to the opposite store and see if there’s anything suitable there,” the man suddenly said.","“Uh, okay.”","The woman reluctantly took off the purse.","At this time, Xiao Mei muttered in a low voice, “If you don’t want to buy it, why did you try it?”","The couple just happened to hear it.","“What did you say?”","The man asked unhappily, “Where’s your manager?”","“Hello, sir, what’s going on?” Lili hurried over and asked with a sweet smile.","“What’s wrong with her? She’s looking down on us as just a shopping guide. Why is she putting on airs?” the man said angrily.","“Sir, please calm down.” Lily hurriedly persuaded him and then questioned, “Xiao Mei, what’s wrong with you? Apologize to them now.”","“I’m sorry. I didn’t say anything harsh. I’m on my period, so I’m in a bad mood,” Xiao Mei said.","“You’re upsetting others just because you are in a bad mood.” The man glared at her. He then looked at Lili and said, “Tell me about this purse.”","“Okay.”","Lili’s eyes lit up and she looked very happy. “This purse is made by...”","It was a very detailed introduction, and it stressed the value of the item. She went on and on.","“We’ll buy it.”","The man nodded and decided to buy the purse for the young woman.","He did say that they were buying it from Lili and it had nothing to do with Xiao Mei.","Right then, there was a look of regret on Xiao Mei’s face.","Seeing this, the man and the woman were secretly delighted.","It was a very nice shopping experience. When the couple left, Lili pointed at Xiao Mei and said, “Your bonus for this month has been deducted.”","“Please, don’t do it. I have my excuses,” Xiao Mei said loudly, staring at the backs of the two people with a smile on her face. “Manager, manager? It’s done, hahaha.”","“Another done deal.” Lili said with a smile, “It’s obvious that he brought his young lover here just to stroll around. Humph, he doesn’t want to spend money but wants to keep a lover? Dream on.”","“It’s not bad that he bought her a purse.” Xiao Mei said, “He’s a mature guy. If it were a young boy, we could sell two or three purses.”","“Very few young guys would come to shop here...”","The two of them began to chat.","Mengmeng was dumbfounded as she watched from the side.","“Damn it, this trick is awesome.”","“It’s amazing.” Zheng Dan said in surprise, “It’s too surprising. It’s a waste that they aren’t actresses. You know what? I believed what they said at first.”","“I believed it as well. Their means are superb.” Mengmeng muttered, “It’s only the first day of work, and I’ve already encountered such a trick. Alas, this is a complicated society. This job is still not suitable for a newcomer like me.”","It was time for peak shopping hours in the afternoon.","The manager came back at three o’clock.","As soon as she came back, a foreign couple arrived.","“Hello?”","Xiao Mei walked over. This time, she had a professional smile on her face as she greeted them in Lestinese. “Is there anything I can do for you?”","The man muttered a few words.","Xiao Mei’s face stiffened slightly. “It’s Fralope.”","“Can you speak Lestinese?” Xiao Mei asked.","The man said in Lestinese, “We’re not fluent in it.”","“What should I do?” Xiao Mei turned her head and said, “Manager, bring me the translator.”","Xiao Mei was turning on the equipment.","The foreign couple looked around casually. The two of them seemed to be communicating with each other and said a few words. When Xiao Mei was done setting up the equipment, they were going to leave.","“What a pity. Judging from their clothes, they should be wealthy.” The manager shook her head secretly.","They would miss out on some chances to make a deal. This happened.","But to the manager’s surprise, Mengmeng waved her hand and said in fluent Fralope, “Sir, Madam, it doesn’t matter if you don’t have enough cash. You can use your Fralope bank card, but you’ll need to pay some tax fees.”","“Oh, my God. Finally. You’re the first one we’ve ever met who can speak Fralope here.”","The woman exhaled and said with a smile, “Your Fralope is great.”","“Thank you. I’ve lived in Fralop for a period and learned the language,” Mengmeng replied.","Clatter!","The manager was stunned. Her eyes lit up and she had a new opinion about Mengmeng.","Xiao Mei was also in a daze. She looked at the translator and found that it was inferior to Mengmeng’s real-time translation.","Even Zheng Dan was a little shocked and felt that Mengmeng was very awesome.","She found it amazing that Mengmeng was proficient in a foreign language.","“Which cities have you visited?”","“Brenzor, Torash, Pessay, and many other cities. I think the specialties there taste quite good,” Mengmeng said.","“You’ve been to so many places,” the woman said with a smile.","“...”","After chatting for two minutes, the woman picked up the purse she had just taken a fancy to, paid for it, and left happily.","“Amazing.”","The manager gave Mengmeng a thumbs-up.","Zheng Dan asked in a low voice, “You even know how to speak Fralope. What other languages can you speak?”","“The general ones,” Mengmeng replied.","Zheng Dan asked, “What do you mean?”","Mengmeng said, “I can speak most languages.”","Zheng Dan remained silent for a long time.","The day’s work experience ended quickly.","Zheng Dan was tired, while Mengmeng was relaxed.","But she still decided not to come next time. She mainly wanted to experience the feeling of working. She had taken photos and didn’t need to come again.","Xiao Mei came over and said, “We’ve made two transactions today. I’ll treat you to dinner tonight.”","It seemed that she also wanted to make friends with Mengmeng.","She rarely did this as a senior.","“Thank you, but we have some activities at school tonight, so we won’t go for dinner.” Mengmeng declined politely.","“Okay.”","Xiao Mei responded.","“Oh, by the way, Ms. Gan, the one I sold is on her sister. I won’t come for work again,” Mengmeng said.","“You won’t? Come on. I’ll raise your salary.”","The manager really appreciated Mengmeng’s skills and tried to keep her.","Mengmeng insisted and shook her head.","In the end, the manager sighed softly and did not pressure her.","After getting their salaries, Mengmeng and Zheng Dan changed their clothes and left.","“40 bucks.”","Zheng Dan rubbed her hands and said, “This is the result of a day’s work. I’m so tired. I don’t know how long I can hold on.”","“Why are you working so hard?” Mengmeng asked, “You just need to earn the money you need.”","“Alas, I just want to make some money to buy some big brands. Childe Chen is young and rich, but he wouldn’t be together with me. I can only work hard by myself,” said Zheng Dan.","“All right. Let’s go back.”","Mengmeng felt that the more Zheng Dan talked, the dirtier the topic would be, so she stopped her in time.","They got back to school. A moment later, Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao returned to Mount New Moon through the Space Portal.","“You’re back.”","Six or seven people, including Zhang Han, Zi Yan, and Zhou Fei, were sitting in the pavilion and chatting.","After seeing the two girls, everyone greeted them.","“The diligent little princess is back.”","“How much did you earn today?”","“I made 40 bucks today, without the commission included,” said Mengmeng with a snort.","“Was it fun?” Zi Yan smiled.","“It was nice. I just stood there when I had nothing to do. It was quite boring. I won’t do it again,” Mengmeng muttered.","“You’ve worked hard for a whole day. It’s time to make up for it. Order the dishes you like,” Zhang Han said with a smile.","“What should we eat?”","Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao began to order.","The two of them named more than a dozen kinds of their favorite dishes, and Zi Yan also named two.","Just like that, the guys had dinner together.","Zhou Fei, Chen Changqing, and the others were in a good mood after having the dishes cooked by Zhang Han.","Chen Changqing, in particular, said repeatedly, “It doesn’t look nice, but it tastes really good.”","“If you don’t like it, don’t eat it.” Zhou Fei said disdainfully, “You eat the most.”","Chen Changqing smiled awkwardly.","After dinner, Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao strolled around Mount New Moon for a while and then played online games.","The next day, they went back to school.","Time always passed quickly in school.","They just went to some fixed places every day.","It was fun to have funny classmates.","Two months later, the sports meeting was over.","Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao didn’t wait until it was time for the final exam.","“Mengmeng, I’m now at the Yuan Ying Realm Last Stage. When are we going to the Vast Heaven Star? I’m also ready to exceed myself in the sect.”","Yue Xiaonao could no longer hold back.","“I’ll ask my dad about it,” Mengmeng said.","“Ask him now.”","Mengmeng picked up the phone and dialed the number.","“Dad, when are we going to the Vast Heaven Star? Xiaonao can’t wait any longer. She’s been clamoring to go there to gain experience these days.”","“Chen, Xue, and the others are almost ready. They have been cultivating for some time and are breaking through to the God Transformation Realm Middle Stage one after another. They also want to go to the Vast Heaven Star,” Zhang Han said with a smile.","“Shall we set off tomorrow?” Mengmeng asked.","“I think you’re also anxious,” Zhang Han said with a laugh.","“Hahaha, yeah.”","Mengmeng laughed at once.","“Dad knows me well.”","Recently, she had been a little bored at school.","Living a peaceful life was enjoyable, but she also needed excitement. Going out to fight and train was the source of excitement.","“Shall I tell the school authority about your leave?” Zhang Han said.","“I’ll do it. I’ll tell the principal about it. We are acquaintances,” Mengmeng said casually.","In the past, it was Zi Yan or Zhang Han who arranged everything for Mengmeng at school. But now, the little princess could do it herself. After all, she had grown up.","That afternoon, Mengmeng asked for a long leave. She might come back next semester.","After returning to Mount New Moon, she was ready to set off overnight.","Before leaving, Mengmeng went back to change her clothes and carry her schoolbag.","Dahei flew into it.","Mengmeng patted Little Hei on the head and said seriously, “Little Hei, have you heard of the Holy Wind Dog King?”","Little Hei asked, “What is that? What Dog King?”","“Well, you probably don’t know it. There is a Holy Wind Dog King. We’ll go there and challenge it this time. Little Hei, if you perform well, we can win a lot of crystal stones and spiritual treasures,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","Little Hei nodded slightly and said, “Got it, Little Master.”","“Ahem, ahem.”","Seeing this, Jiang Yanlan, who was not far away, coughed softly.","She thought to herself.","“Alas, Heavenly Hound, you are the former No. 1 Expert on the south coast, but Mengmeng is now targeting you. I wonder how much you will lose.","“Holy Wind Dog King, Little Hei...”","Jiang Yanlan suddenly felt that Heavenly Hound’s eyes would turn red again this time.","He dared to have a bet with the little princess of Mount New Moon. This guy was too bold."]},{"number":1497,"title":"Chapter 1497 The Second Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 1497 The Second Battle","A few days later, the crowd returned to the Heavenly Double Star.","There seemed to be only a few people who hadn’t returned, including Nina, Felina, Zhang Mu, You Huo, and a few others.","Everyone guessed that those people were probably in other regions, and it might take them several years to return since the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven was huge.","Yue Wuwei, who was sitting next to Zhang Han, suddenly thought of something and said, “By the way, when I sealed the entrance of the ancient martial arts world, there seemed to be a trace of energy stirring in the light gates where my friend disappeared. Maybe in the near future, the light gates will open again. At that time, the number of Bone Demons inside will increase sharply.”","Hearing this, Zhang Han pondered for a moment and said, “When the light gates appear again, we’ll go into the ancient martial arts world and explore. There should be some secrets.”","“That’s a vast world. It’s easy to get lost. But with you around, we can explore deeper.” Yue Wuwei nodded.","Everyone was a little curious about this.","They had all explored the light gates for training. There were all kinds of Bone Demons inside, which were all kinds of human-shaped or beast-shaped skeletons. They would be broken as soon as they were hit. Their combat capability was relatively low. They had no will, and their combat capability was not too high. It was like a continent inside the light gates. The guys felt that any one of them could slay a light gate now.","But was that really the case?","Looking at Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei’s cautious expressions, they suddenly realized that the world of the light gates seemed to be extraordinary.","Even Yue Wuwei couldn’t reach the depths, so it could be imagined how terrifying it was.","However, that kind of thing was not something that everyone could worry about.","There was no problem at the moment, but it would be in the future.","“We’re going to Vast Heaven Star this time.”","Jiang Yanlan glanced at Instructor Liu and said, “See you in the First War Zone.”","“Ahem, I won’t go back to the Heavenly Evil Sect,” Instructor Liu said. “I don’t want to be a spy either. Why don’t I join the Sword Sect directly?”","“Who cares?” Jiang Yanlan rolled her eyes. “I don’t need you to be a spy. I’m going to beat you up, just like before.”","She thought of the past when Instructor Liu took a fancy to her and kept provoking her in a weird way. As a result, Jiang Yanlan got used to beating him up and developed feelings for him.","The feelings of love always appeared inadvertently.","“You want to betray the sect? I’ll kill you!” Mu Xue shouted.","“He’s indeed asking for a beating.” Xu Yong said with a laugh, “Look at our team. The Authentic Martial Arts Sect has Leng Yue, Ah Hu, Elder Meng, Jiang Bing, and Yun Feiyang. The Heavenly Evil Sect has Mu Xue, Instructor Liu, and me. The Sword Sect has Jiang Yanlan, Headmaster Shan, as well as the boss and Mengmeng. They are the most powerful. If there’s a war, the Authentic Martial Arts Sect will just watch while the Sword Sect fights with the Heavenly Evil Sect. We are not strong enough and can’t defeat them. Instructor Liu, do you still want to be a spy?”","“When did I ever say I wanted to be a spy?” Instructor Liu shook his head seriously.","“It’s really interesting. Imagine a war between the Four Great Sects. Our boss belongs to the Sword Sect, so the Sword Sect will definitely win. None of us comes from the Crimson Sunglow Sect. Our Authentic Martial Arts Sect and the Heavenly Evil Sect can compete with each other,” Ah Hu said with a smile.","“Seriously,” Xu Yong said, “it’s true that the disciples of the Heavenly Evil Sect are ferocious, but in fact, they are not bad. The competition is fierce, but they don’t kill people. It’s really strange. How did the Heavenly Evil Sect and the Ling Hai Sword Sect start the war? More than 70 percent of the more than 100 battlefields are occupied by these two sects.”","“The Heavenly Evil Sect and the Ling Hai Sword Sect are just two of the most intense sects.” Yue Wuwei smiled faintly and said, “The Four Great Sects have always been competing, constantly weakening each other’s strength in order to achieve balance. The famous masters in your sects are wanted in other sects. If they are killed, the killer will be rewarded with abundant rewards. It’s every man for himself.”","“No matter how they fight, we are still the men of Mount New Moon,” Elder Meng said.","“Uncle Meng.” Mengmeng suddenly became interested. “I heard that your date with Teacher Lu Guo was quite successful this time. You two are dating, aren’t you? You shouldn’t have come for training. Look at my dad. When he wooed my mom back then, he was with her all the time. Aren’t you afraid that Teacher Lu Guo will be taken away by others?”","“Ahem, ahem, ahem, well, we, I haven’t proposed yet.” Elder Meng blushed.","“Stop pretending.” Zhao Feng scolded him with a smile, “Next time you go back, propose to her and stay with her for at least three years. Even our little princess knows about it. Don’t waste Lu Guo’s time, understand?”","“Yeah. I will definitely make it serious next time.” Elder Meng smiled.","It was a smile of love.","They were talking and laughing, and the atmosphere was harmonious. It was as if they were a family. This was the unity of Mount New Moon.","It was also what attracted everyone’s attention and was protected by them.","Leng Yue didn’t say anything and didn’t talk much, but she looked at the guys with a smile on her face.","Their small families were all gathered on Mount New Moon. Countless small families had gathered to form a big family.","When they arrived at the subsidiary planet, the squad split up.","Zhang Han and the others came to the space station.","“A routine check-up. Damn, it’s Zhang Yumeng. Greetings, Elder Zhang Yumeng.”","When the disciples of the space station saw Mengmeng, they saluted her one after another.","Mengmeng was stunned at first, but then she looked indifferent and put her hands behind her back. “You may rise now.”","They didn’t know what it meant to rise, so they all looked up at Mengmeng.","“Do your job well. The sect won’t mistreat you,” Mengmeng said pretentiously and casually threw out more than a dozen medium-grade crystal stones.","“Thank you, Elder.”","Several disciples were pleasantly surprised. Under their admiring gazes, the group entered the atmosphere layer of the Vast Heaven Star.","When Zhang Han saw this scene, he touched his chin and couldn’t stop smiling. “Sure enough, she is my biological daughter. Her style of doing things is very similar to mine.","“Think about it. For so many years, Mengmeng has grown up under my guidance.”","If it weren’t for Zi Yan’s supervision, Zhang Han would have raised a little unscrupulous devil who would do whatever she wanted.","Mengmeng’s mother was very powerful and fierce. She was the Moon Empress while training outside, but at home, she was a gentle lady.","Swoosh!","The aircraft drew an arc in the air.","The people at the space station informed their friends that Elder Zhang Yumeng was back.","Many people gradually learned about it, and this matter also spread.","The number one expert on the south coast, Zhang Yumeng, had returned after training for a few months.","Would she continue to be a legend this time and challenge the number one expert on the north coast, Yun Han?","...","“Fight him!”","Countless Swordbamboo Peak disciples called out, “Fight Yun Han!”","“Become the number one in the sect’s younger generation!”","“...”","The shout-outs were extremely loud, and the people from the north coast knew about it. They sneered and said, “Why would Senior Brother Yun Han be afraid of you, Zhang Yumeng?”","However, someone familiar with Yun Han asked, “Senior Brother Yun Han, now it’s said that Zhang Yumeng wants to challenge you. Given her warlike nature, I’m afraid she will really do it. You have to be prepared to win glory for our north coast.”","Yun Han’s face was full of confusion. “To be prepared to do what?”","“To win glory.”","Yun Han asked, “What?”","“To win glory.”","“What do you mean?”","...","Those disciples were stunned.","Looking at their confused faces, Yun Han let out a long sigh and said, “I’ve talked to Heavenly Hound. He hasn’t used his trump card yet, but he thinks that Zhang Yumeng has more trump cards. He is probably no match for her, let alone me. I can’t even defeat Heavenly Hound, let alone Zhang Yumeng.”","“Does it mean that you will definitely lose?”","“Yes, I will definitely lose, but I won’t admit defeat so easily. If she wants to defeat me, she has to take the challenge seriously.” Yun Han was also very confident in this aspect.","However, Mengmeng did not challenge Yun Han after she came back.","She also learned from Jiang Yanlan that Yun Han was no match for Heavenly Hound, so there was no need for her to challenge him.","Mengmeng didn’t care about the title of No.1 among the younger generation of the sect.","At the same time, Heavenly Hound was bragging to more than 30 junior brothers and sisters.","“I’ve been fighting in the First War Zone for so long, and there’s no one in the younger generation that I’m afraid of. The Heavenly Evil Sect is just so-so.","“However, there are also some powerful people whom you should avoid when you see them...”","Swoosh!","A figure flew over from a distance.","“Zhang Yumeng?”","Heavenly Hound was stunned. He stood up and looked in that direction.","“It’s Zhang Yumeng. She’s here.”","“Heavenly Hound!” Mengmeng said from a distance, “Why aren’t you saluting me upon seeing me?”","Heavenly Hound was speechless.","“Hahaha, greetings, Elder Zhang Yumeng,” Heavenly Hound said with a smile.","Those junior brothers and sisters said, “Greetings, Elder Zhang.”","“Hmm.”","Mengmeng looked a little satisfied. She nodded slightly and said, “When will we fight?”","“You mean?” Heavenly Hound pondered.","“Where is your Holy Wind Dog King?” Mengmeng asked.","“Why don’t we do it now?”","“Let’s pick a place,” Mengmeng said flatly.","“How about...” Heavenly Hound suddenly stopped talking, rolled his eyes, and secretly said to Mengmeng via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “How about the Nine Rivers Peak? This place is too small for my Holy Wind Dog King to perform.”","“Alright.”","“I’ll be there in a minute,” Heavenly Hound said. He then stood up and waved his hand, saying, “I’ll be seeing Elder Zhang later. We’re going to have a romantic date. You can leave now.”","“Senior Brother Heavenly Hound, your ability to talk nonsense has increased again.”","“I’m telling the truth.” Heavenly Hound said seriously, “Didn’t you see that she was smiling when she talked to me? Haha, young man, when I was picking up girls, you might still haven’t been born yet.”","Heavenly Hound was famous for his strength and bragging, but some of his fellow disciples were willing to listen to him. This was also the reason why Heavenly Hound was so popular. He liked to communicate with his fellow disciples and occasionally teach them a few moves or two, which made their trip worthwhile.","When the crowd dispersed, Heavenly Hound took out the communication device and said, “Inform the chief disciples of all the peaks that Zhang Yumeng and I, the most powerful disciple, will have a second battle on Nine Rivers Peak. This is private. They can watch the battle, but they aren’t allowed to take too many people with them.”","Heavenly Hound didn’t like secret battles. For other sects, the Holy Wind Dog King might be a secret killing move.","But some talented disciples of the sect could still be trusted.","He wouldn’t feel great if there was no audience, so he ordered people to call those talented disciples.","When this group of people heard that Heavenly Hound and Zhang Yumeng would fight for the second time on Nine Rivers Peak, they were shocked at once.","“Didn’t Heavenly Hound go all out last time? Is it a real battle this time?”","When Yun Han heard the news, he was a little stunned. Then, he smiled and said, “I told you that Zhang Yumeng might not challenge me. Let’s go and watch their second fight.”","“This battle will probably be more exciting. Heavenly Hound will probably show some of his real trump cards in this private battle.”","Without exception, the people who were notified were all set off for Nine Rivers Peak.","Even Elder Tian Chen and many other elders and protectors of the sect set off one after another.","At the same time, they were curious about why Zhang Yumeng was going to challenge Heavenly Hound again on the first day she came back.","Who could be superior in the second battle?"]},{"number":1498,"title":"Chapter 1498 Master Hei","paragraphs":["Chapter 1498 Master Hei","“Dog King.","“You are the Holy Wind Dog King, the king of dogs. How can you be afraid of other dogs?”","Heavenly Hound was in the abode on the back mountain, where the Holy Wind Dog King lived. He knew that the Holy Wind Dog King was not willing to spar with others, so he went straight to the point and tried to persuade it.","“When Zhang Yumeng came just now, she was incredibly arrogant. She said that her dog was invincible in the world and that my Holy Wind Dog King was nothing.","“I was not happy to hear that. Wasn’t she looking down on you?","“We will definitely win this battle. We will make her see how powerful you are.”","After Heavenly Hound talked for a long time, his mouth and tongue were dry. At first glance, he found that the Holy Wind Dog King looked disdainful and disbelieving.","“We will win quite a bit this time and we will have a lot of spiritual herbs. I will exchange them for the Vast Wood Cow for you to eat.”","Only then did the Holy Wind Dog King become interested. It stood up and strolled to Heavenly Hound’s side.","“Good boy, let’s go. This event, humph, I must get all of the treasures I lost back. It’s the first time in so many years that I, Heavenly Hound, have lost treasures.”","Heavenly Hound was aggressive and flew quickly to Nine Rivers Peak with Holy Wind Dog King.","The situation on the other side was different.","“Little Hei, let’s go. Come with me to crush an opponent. A dog, to be specific,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","Swoosh!","A black stream of light instantly cut through the void hundreds of meters away and came to Mengmeng’s feet.","Little Hei asked, “Will I kill it with one bite or two?”","Mengmeng was speechless when she heard that.","She took a deep breath and said, “Little Hei, you can’t do this. Just like just now, why were you so fast? Slow down, or people won’t be able to keep up with you and will be scared away. How are we supposed to trick people while you act so fast?”","Little Hei said, “I don’t know how to trick people.”","“Then you’ll just trick the dog. Do you know how to pretend to be weak? Take your time and pretend to be weak. This will need some acting skills. Act weak to me.”","“Hahaha.” Xiao Hei stuck out its big tongue and shook its tail.","Mengmeng stroked her chin and said, “You don’t look weak.”","Little Hei’s voice was much lower. “I can’t do it.”","“This won’t do!” Mengmeng’s pretty face changed. “Little Hei, don’t speak human language. Try to bark.”","“Awoooooooo.”","“It’s not like that. Be gentle and lower the sound.”","“Awoo.”","“That’s not right. Hey, I remember it. You’ll bark like the second king of the White Dog Clan.”","“Woof... woof?”","“Hee hee, that will do. That’s it.” Mengmeng immediately laughed.","“Girl.” Zhang Han flew over with the others. He smiled and said, “Don’t make things difficult for Little Hei. Look at how embarrassed it is.”","“We have to put on a good show,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","When they arrived at Nine Rivers Peak, there were already some people there. There were more than 1,000 of them, and they had all rushed over after hearing the news.","“She’s here.”","“Elder Zhang Yumeng.”","Hun Xuan flew over and asked curiously, “Why are you going to fight Heavenly Hound again?”","“It’s not the two of us who will be fighting.”","Mengmeng shook her head slightly.","Under Hun Xuan’s curious gaze, Mengmeng and Little Hei quickly came to Nine Rivers Peak.","On the other side, Heavenly Hound also had the Holy Wind Dog King with him.","Everyone glanced around and suddenly realized something.","Could it be a battle between two dogs?","As expected, Heavenly Hound said in a clear and loud voice, “A few days ago, I sparred with Elder Zhang Yumeng, and I lost. Zhang Yumeng won. Coincidentally, I have the Holy Wind Dog King, and she also has a dog. So, we agreed to let our divine pets have a fight. Zhang Yumeng’s divine pet is also very powerful. I guess it will be a wonderful battle, so I called you here to watch.”","“That’s how it is.” Tian Chen laughed.","“Since it’s a battle between divine pets, we need to restrain ourselves. Holy Wind, don’t hurt the other side. Just subdue it,” said Heavenly Hound.","The Holy Wind Dog King had been staring at Little Hei. When it heard this, it nodded slightly.","It was a little confused. It always felt that something was wrong.","“Little Hei, you will need to do the same.” Mengmeng patted Little Hei on the head.","Little Hei pondered, opened its mouth, and wagged its tail. “Woof, woof.”","Mengmeng couldn’t help smiling for a moment.","She looked at Heavenly Hound.","“Is this guy not going to say anything?”","After waiting for a few seconds, Heavenly Hound rubbed his hands together and said, “Elder Zhang Yumeng, I think you have a lot of spiritual treasures. Why don’t we have some fun?”","“What?”","...","Mengmeng was stunned and looked alert. “What are you up to?”","“I lost millions of crystal stones and five kinds of sixth-time spirit treasures last time. Shouldn’t we also make a bet this time?” Heavenly Hound said hesitantly.","After preparing for so long, he was finally going to win back both the treasures he lost and his interest.","“Well...” Mengmeng hesitated.","Heavenly Hound put on a serious face and said, “If you don’t agree, then we quit.”","“All right.” Mengmeng said in a resigned tone, “If we’re not betting on a lot of treasures, I can still agree.”","“Don’t worry. We won’t.”","Heavenly Hound said with a smile, “We’ll take turns. I’ll go first, you call, and then you’ll go. We’ll put the spirit treasure or crystal stone on the top of the mountain, and whoever wins will get all of them.”","“I don’t know much about such a game, but I have no problem with it,” Mengmeng said.","“It’s simple.”","Heavenly Hound waved his hand casually, and 500,000 crystal stones appeared. “I’ll go with 500,000 crystal stones first, and then you’ll call.”","...","“I see.”","Mengmeng also took out 500,000 crystal stones.","“It’s your turn,” Heavenly Hound said. “If you take out crystal stones, I’ll call. If you take out spiritual herbs, I’ll call with the same. You put in the gems and whatever, and I’ll follow suit. It’s absolutely fair and just.”","“Then I’ll go with six million crystal stones. I won six million and five hundred thousand crystal stones last time when I defeat you. I’ll bet on it first,” Mengmeng muttered.","Heavenly Hound’s heart ached when he heard that.","“Those were mine, and they were all gone!”","The people around were a little stunned.","Was this a public bet?","Tian Chen and the other elders’ facial muscles trembled slightly.","“Heavenly Hound is really, really... unbelievable.”","They came here to watch the battle, but they didn’t expect Heavenly Hound to make such a bet.","However, no one spoke. Since Elder Tian Chen was merely watching, no one else could interfere. Moreover, this kind of battle with a bit of stake was normal, but when Heavenly Hound named it, it somehow sounded not right.","It was as if he would earn those treasures.","“How much will he lose?” Zi Yan whispered in Zhang Han’s ear.","“I don’t know. Let’s wait for him to stop. I guess that’s the amount.” Zhang Han laughed and said, “Now our daughter is powerful. She won’t easily get tricked.”","“She learns from you. You’re so smart, humph.” Zi Yan winked at him.","Sure enough, the scene was the same as what Zhang Han had said.","“I call with six million crystal stones.”","Heavenly Hound didn’t expect the pace to be so fast. He gritted his teeth and took out six million crystal stones.","Then, he took out five kinds of fifth-tier spiritual herbs. “I’ll go with five.”","“Call.”","Mengmeng first took out the spiritual herbs. Then, after thinking for a while, she took out ten kinds of sixth-tier spiritual herbs and said, “My turn.”","“I’ll call!”","Heavenly Hound’s eyes lit up, and he shouted in his heart. “What a rich girl! I’m making a fortune this time!”","“I’ll go with 20 more fifth-tier gems.” Heavenly Hound took out the spiritual treasures.","“Call,” Mengmeng said. “I’ll add 30 more sixth-tier gems.”","“A sure call! Hahaha, great, that’s how the game should be played.” Heavenly Hound laughed and said, “Then I won’t stand on ceremony. I’ll go with ten sixth-tier spirit weapons.”","Mengmeng said, “I’ll add another 20.”","“...”","The two of them kept throwing out all kinds of treasures.","The surrounding talented disciples were secretly stunned.","“They have too many spiritual treasures.”","“Senior Brother Heavenly Hound has so many spirit treasures?”","The insiders said, “Please, Heavenly Hound has been in the War Zones all year round, and I don’t know how many treasures he has robbed.”","“Zhang Yumeng is also very powerful. She didn’t even blink when she took out her spirit treasures.”","“...”","There was a lot of discussion in the crowd.","With so many spirit treasures, people were envious.","Gradually, Heavenly Hound began to hesitate.","At present, most of the treasures he took out were useless, and a few of them were useful. But the treasures he took out later were of great use to him, such as some spiritual herbs, gems, or other treasures with powerful functions.","He was reluctant to take them out.","“Forget it, forget it. Zhang Yumeng has spirit treasures. I can’t trick too many from her. These are enough.”","Heavenly Hound thought for a second and said with a smile, “Shall we make these the bet?”","“Sure.” Mengmeng said bluntly, “How will we compete?”","“One gets to be the winner when it subdues the other.”","Heavenly Hound smiled and said, “Don’t worry, I won’t let my Holy Wind Dog King hurt your divine pet.”","“Uh, okay.” Mengmeng looked very easy-going.","“They will fight here, and they can fight until one side runs away or is exhausted? If one side gets defeated and is in danger, we can terminate the battle, but the loser will be the loser,” Heavenly Hound said.","“It’s quite detailed.” Mengmeng chuckled.","“Of course.”","Heavenly Hound looked indifferent as he said, “I, Heavenly Hound, have a prominent reputation. My Holy Wind Dog King also makes enemies tremble with fear upon hearing its name. I’m not joking. You can tell from their physique that your black dog is at a disadvantage. However, don’t worry. I saw that our divine pets’ energy waves are all at the God Transformation Realm Peak Stage. It shouldn’t be a problem for them to spar.”","“I see. Okay.”","“I didn’t expect you to be so easy-going, Elder Zhang. Hahaha, I’ll kindly accept these spirit treasures later.”","Heavenly Hound stopped pretending and said with a laugh, “Holy Wind, don’t use your killing move later. Just subdue the other party, understand?”","The Holy Wind Dog King nodded slightly.","“How is it? Isn’t it spiritual?” Heavenly Hound said proudly, “Shall we start now?”","Everyone’s eyes were fixed on the two of them.","Many people looked at Mengmeng with suspicion.","She knew that Heavenly Hound liked to trick talented disciples, but she still agreed to the bet.","Wasn’t it obvious that she was offering him her treasures?","Furthermore, she had taken out so many spiritual treasures. How heartbroken would she be if she lost?","The most important thing was that the Holy Wind Dog King looked majestic and tall.","In contrast, the black dog was so weak that it was even a little thin.","However, at this moment, Mengmeng finally showed her true colors.","She beamed and patted Little Hei on the head, saying, “Did you hear that? He said that we’ll only need to subdue the other party. Let’s do as he says.”","Under everyone’s gaze, Little Hei spoke human language directly.","“Got it.”","Poof!","Heavenly Hound was stunned and his pupils contracted sharply. He asked blankly, “Wait, who spoke just now?”","Hearing this, Little Hei raised its head proudly and said indifferently, “It was me, Master Hei!”","Heavenly Hound was astounded. “Holy... fuck!”"]},{"number":1499,"title":"Chapter 1499 Chaotic Times","paragraphs":["Chapter 1499 Chaotic Times","“It’s speaking in the human tongue.”","“This black dog can speak human language.”","Tian Chen’s pupils contracted as he thought to himself. “It’s a Great Devil.”","Those Exotic Beasts that could speak the human language must be superiors.","Some had even become ancient demonic beasts.","But now, he didn’t expect that an ordinary black dog would be such a kind of Exotic Beast.","“What...”","Many people felt a little dizzy when they saw this.","This was especially true for the beast-taming Dao Seeking Cultivators with divine pets. Their eyes were bloodshot.","“This is a Great Devil!”","“I want one too.”","“...”","They were extremely envious, but they could only watch from a distance.","Among them, Heavenly Hound was the most dumbfounded.","His face became very bitter, and he muttered blankly, “What’s happening?”","When he saw the treasures on the top of the mountain out of the corner of his eye, his heart ached so much that he couldn’t breathe.","Heavenly Hound asked via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “Holy Wind, are you sure you got this?”","Unexpectedly, he got no response at all. He turned his head and saw the Holy Wind Dog King looking at Little Hei with a serious face.","“This is bad.”","Heavenly Hound had a heavy heart. He coughed and said, “Let’s get it started.”","Swoosh!","Swoosh!","Mengmeng and Heavenly Hound flew back hundreds of meters.","The battle between Exotic Beasts was about to begin.","Little Hei’s eyes suddenly became fierce. It raised its mouth slightly, revealing sharp fangs like swords.","Gurgle!","Holy Wind Dog King moved its throat. It seemed to be swallowing saliva. It moved and flew forward quickly under great pressure. At the same time, it cast an innate supernatural power, the Wind Domain.","Unexpectedly, a black shadow flashed by quickly.","It was extremely fast.","Everyone turned pale with fright.","“It’s so fast!”","Heavenly Hound’s face changed dramatically. “Shit.”","There seemed to be a huge gap between Little Hei and the Holy Wind Dog King.","Heavenly Hound didn’t say anything.","However, Holy Wind Dog King just barked. “Woof, woof, woof.”","No one understood what it meant.","The awe-inspiring Holy Wind Dog King directly dispersed the Wind Domain. It raised its front paw in the air, showing that it admitted defeat.","Only then did everyone realize what was happening.","A black figure slowly appeared one meter away from the Holy Wind Dog King.","Little Hei was too fast.","It was so fast that the Holy Wind Dog King felt the crisis and immediately admitted defeat. It didn’t even have time to react.","Little Hei stared at the Holy Wind Dog King and said, “Back off.”","“Woof!”","The Holy Wind Dog King obediently flew backward and ran away without looking at Heavenly Hound, who was dumbfounded.","“No.” Heavenly Hound began to feel upset.","The people around were stunned and then began to talk about it.","“Heavenly Hound lost again.”","“He didn’t win the battle of divine pets and gets defeated in the second battle.”","“Haha, interesting.”","Yun Han said from a distance, “Heavenly Hound, looking at your solemn look, I thought you would win, but the result is truly delightful.”","Many other talents who had been tricked spoke up one after another.","“Hahaha, yeah. No wonder Heavenly Hound asked us to come here. It turns out that he has invited us to watch a good show.”","“This should be the fastest match of the year.”","“It’s exactly the same result as the previous one. The Holy Wind Dog King’s style of doing things is really similar to yours.”","...","Hearing the mocking words around him, Heavenly Hound stared at those people angrily.","“I lost again,” Heavenly Hound said, “Elder Zhang, as for these spiritual treasures, I’m sure that you...”","Mengmeng waved her hand and interrupted Heavenly Hound. “I can’t have too many spiritual treasures.”","Seeing the smile on Mengmeng’s face, Heavenly Hound’s mouth moved and he was at a loss for words.","Watching Mengmeng put away all the treasures, Heavenly Hound seemed to have nothing to lose. He asked, “Well, Elder Zhang, do you need an attendant? The kind that gets paid?”","“Yeah.”","“Do you think I will be suitable for the job?” Heavenly Hound asked.","“Sure.”","“Well...”","“I will offer you 100,000 crystal stones a month.”","“Forget it then.”","...","Heavenly Hound’s face darkened, and he said in a dull voice, “I have never submitted to anyone. You, Zhang Yumeng, are the first who ever made me do it. Wait and see. I will definitely win next time.”","“Hahaha, feel free to challenge me.” Mengmeng waved her hand with a smile.","Heavenly Hound was about to leave.","At this time, Grand Elder Tian Chen coughed softly.","“Since everyone is here, I’d like to say something.”","Heavenly Hound’s expression changed and he stopped in his tracks.","Everyone turned to look at Tian Chen.","He said, “About a month ago, someone in our sect found something unusual in the Flying Sand Plains. The ground within a radius of 500 kilometers sank. It seems that it has been attacked. But the strange thing is that within a few months of the change, there was no fluctuation coming from there. All the people of the Four Great Sects have found out about this.","“Some people are exploring there. I went there in person and finally found out the reason. A large-scale secret realm appeared in the center of the Flying Sand Plains, where the void often flashed with light. The high-position officials of the Four Great Sects had a meeting. The Crimson Sunglow Sect was in charge of making a passage of the secret realm. However, when it was opened, an accident happened and the secret realm exploded, causing the entire Flying Sand Plains to be filled with secret realms. That is to say, this secret realm is on the surface of the continent, not an Alternate Space. Unfortunately, in the air and underground, the Flying Sand Plains are surrounded by a layer of the illusory energy, making it difficult to enter the place. But everyone has also found more than a dozen entrances. It is estimated that the Bounded Domains by the entrances will become weak in the next few days. We can go in. The Flying Sand Plains will become an important training ground for the Four Great Sects. Some elders will lead the team. You will go back and prepare for the training, and we will set off tomorrow.”","Clatter!","As soon as these words were spoken, everyone was extremely surprised.","“We’re going out to fight?” Heavenly Hound’s expression was full of interest.","From the words of the Grand Elder, he learned that this trial in the secret realm was huge and rare to have in a hundred years. This was the golden age of the Four Great Sects on the Vast Heaven Star, and it was also extremely fierce competition. It was unknown how many people would become famous, and which talents would be killed.","Heavenly Hound loved to fight. After hearing the news, he even got goosebumps. Even his heartache caused by losing so many spirit treasures dissipated a lot.","“I’ve lost some spirit treasures, but I can still cheat others. I can’t defeat Zhang Yumeng, but I will defeat others.”","Tian Chen said, “That’s right. You will go out to fight.” Tian Chen nodded. “But be careful. The trial in the Flying Sand Plains is not a trivial matter. Once you fail, you will also die. I have three lists here, which record the information of the talented disciples of the Authentic Martial Arts Sect, the Crimson Sunglow Sect, and the Heavenly Evil Sect. There are many people you need to pay attention to. I’ll ask someone to send the lists to you later. Of course, the other three sects also have a list of our Ling Sea Sword Sect. We’ve got the news about this list in the Authentic Martial Arts Sect. You can also read it. The other two sects have done a good job of keeping secrets. I don’t know how much information they have about you and what their comments are.","Tian Chen said, “If there’s nothing else, you can leave now. If you want to take the trial, go back and prepare.”","No one thought too much about it. They no longer paid attention to the battle between the two divine pets. Instead, they left one after another and went back to prepare for the upcoming battle.","Tian Chen flew to Zhang Han’s side with more than a dozen people.","He looked at Yue Wuwei, cupped his hands, and said, “I wonder if you will go there or not.”","“Will we?” Yue Wuwei glanced at Mengmeng.","He longer asked for Yue Xiaonao’s opinion now. She could go anywhere the team went as she could enjoy delicacies.","“Of course, we’re going,” Mengmeng said.","“Haha, then Elder Zhang Yumeng, you will also lead a team.” Tian Chen laughed and said, “The Flying Sand Plains have a vast area. We will send 39 elders to lead the teams. Each elder will have a team and some talented disciples will participate. At that time, you will set up a communication network...”","Tian Chen gave a brief account of the matter. Mengmeng thought for a moment and agreed.","The purpose of leading a team was to take care of the talented disciples. Everyone went in separately, and they could have support if they were in trouble.","However, the situation on the battlefield was constantly changing. It was still unknown whether the help seekers could really hold on until the reinforcements arrived.","It could also be regarded as a precaution against unexpected distribution.","“The chief leader is First Elder Hanlong. You can contact him at any time if you need anything.”","The elder next to Tian Chen, Hanlong, cupped his hands and said, “Sorry to trouble you.”","He made it sound like Mengmeng was the one in charge.","In fact, he was also saying those words to Yue Wuwei.","In the sect, only the core high-position officials knew that the real safe team was Mengmeng’s team, but others didn’t know.","On the surface, Mengmeng’s strength was that of an elder, but her combat capability was at the Void-refining Realm Middle-Stage. Most of the other elders were at the Voiding Realm Peak Stage. Some were at the Integration Realm Early Stage or the Middle Stage.","In terms of strength, Mengmeng was definitely at a disadvantage, and Tian Chen felt that not many disciples would join her team.","As expected-","On the same day, Tian Chen sent word to many talented disciples, who set up teams. Aside from First Elder Hanlong, there were thirty-eight teams.","The number of people in each team was increasing rapidly, but Mengmeng’s team was growing slowly.","But someone checked it and found that although she didn’t have many teammates, all of them were excellent.","“I’ve lost so many treasures. I have to get at least some back. I have to sign up for Zhang Yumeng’s team.”","Heavenly Hound signed up without hesitation.","Hun Xuan said, “Brother, the opportunity has come. As teammates, we can communicate more with others. I’ve already signed up for Zhang Yumeng’s team.”","Hun Shang and Hun Xuan joined Mengmeng’s team.","“I’ll join in the fun. I don’t need the protection of a super-powerful elder.” Yun Han thought for a moment and joined in.","There were also a few people such as Jiang Yanlan who joined Mengmeng’s team, more than 20 in total.","Zhang Han and Zi Yan didn’t sign up. They just went wherever Mengmeng went.","Amongst the genius disciples of the Sword Sect, except for those who were extremely confident and felt that they didn’t need an elder’s protection, almost all of them joined Mengmeng’s team. Many other rational people signed up for the other elders’ teams one after another.","There were nearly a hundred disciples in every elder’s team. They had at least 60 or 70 team members. Mengmeng only had more than a dozen disciples on her team.","However, everyone was more interested in the lists of the major sects.","These were the opponents’ information, as well as the Authentic Martial Arts Sect’s evaluation of the Sword Sect.","They were also very curious.","Mengmeng and the others were sitting at the dining table. She flipped through the messages and said, “I wonder if I’m on the list.”","“I think so. News spread very fast on the Vast Heaven Star,” Jiang Yanlan said with a smile.","“There are so many people’s names here. It’s dazzling.”","Mengmeng muttered and clicked open the list of the Ling Sea Sword Sect.","“The first place is Heavenly Hound. The evaluation is that this person is powerful and has a lot of means. He has no scruples in fighting. When you see him, you should be careful. It’s suggested to leave right away.","“It seems that Heavenly Hound is quite famous.”","Mengmeng spoke as she scrolled through the messages.","“The second place is Yun Han. It’s said that he is fast and proficient in assassination occult arts.","“The third place is me.”","The information showed that Zhang Yumeng, a new disciple of the Sword Sect, was now the strongest on the south coast. She was powerful and had mastered a lot of occult arts. She was proficient in fiery skills and the Tao of the sword. When one saw Zhang Yumeng, one had to be careful. The suggestion was that those with the strength at the Void-refining Realm Middle Stage could fight against her.","“It seems that the people of the Authentic Martial Arts Sect don’t know what real talent means.” Zhang Han said with some dissatisfaction, “No wonder this sect has no prestige. This evaluation is too ridiculous.”","Seeing Zhang Han’s look, Zi Yan couldn’t help laughing. “You’re really... I’m speechless. Mengmeng hasn’t been in the sect for a long time. In other people’s eyes, maybe she has already used up all her trump cards since she became the No.1. They assume that they’ve known everything about her moves, so they don’t need to be too afraid of her. As for Heavenly Hound and the others, they all have trump cards that people need to be afraid of.”","“Huh.”","Zhang Han touched his chin and said, “Mengmeng, when we go out to fight against the enemy this time, we will use different moves. We’ll show them if we have any trump cards.”","“Well, okay.” Mengmeng pouted and said with a lovely expression, “Shouldn’t we keep a low profile?”","“Don’t keep a low profile. Keep a high profile when it’s necessary,” Zhang Han said.","“It’s amazing to take third place.” Yue Wuwei suddenly said in a dull voice, “My daughter is probably not even on the list.”","“Huh? What do you mean by that, Elder Yue?” Yue Xiaonao glared at him and said, “We’re eating. Do you want to affect my appetite?”","“No, no. Hurry up and eat.” Yue Wuwei immediately admitted defeat.","“I’ll check how my dad is ranked.”","Mengmeng didn’t care much about this. She scrolled through the messages and said, “His name is at the back. It’s already behind the 300th place. The realm of Zhang Hanyang is unknown, and his strength is unknown. When you see this person, you have to be cautious. Maybe Zhang Yumeng is nearby. Hahaha, it’s so funny.”","Mengmeng immediately laughed happily.","Zhang Han also laughed and shook his head.","“Aunty Jiang is ranked about 100th. Her information is quite comprehensive. She is at the God Transformation Realm Last Stage or the Peak Stage. Her strength is not ordinary.","“Uncle Feng, Uncle Chen is not on the list, and neither is my mum.”","After reading the list of the Authentic Martial Arts Sect, Mengmeng began to read about the famous masters of other sects.","“This is what our sect knows about the other sects.","“The No. 1 of the Authentic Martial Arts Sect is Pingkong. He has cultivated the Overwhelming Sacred Body Essential and reached the level of the Earth Sacred Body three years ago. His defense is extremely strong and his speed is very fast. He is proficient in the eight occult arts of the Martial Arts Sect. He has mastered the Dragon-tiger Fist, and he can conjure strange phenomena. One must be extremely cautious when encountering him.","“Aunty Leng Yue and the others are also on the list.”","Mengmeng read the comments of Leng Yue, Ah Hu, Elder Meng, Jiang Bing, and Yun Feiyang respectively. They were all on the list.","Hearing this, Zhao Feng said to Chen Changqing with a smile, “It seems that we are left behind since we are not on the list.”","“Then I’ll make use of the secret realm of the Flying Sand Plains to make my title Emperor Qing well-known,” Chen Changqing said lightly.","After cultivating for so long, he had reached the God Transformation Realm Peak Stage. The power of all eight drought demonic dragon was about to reappear in the world.","“The evaluation of the Heavenly Evil Sect hasn’t been made yet. I guess we’ll know when we see Mu Xue and the others,” Jiang Yanlan said.","They had no acquaintances in the Crimson Sunglow Sect, but some of them had joined the Heavenly Evil Sect. The sect’s evaluation of the Sword Sect would be clear when they met.","“These comments are just a side view. Don’t pay too much attention to it,” Chen Changqing said.","“That’s right.” Mengmeng nodded in agreement. “No one knows that my dad is so powerful. Uncle Chen and Uncle Feng can get on the list with their strength, but they didn’t. This must be the same case in other sects.”","“That’s right.” Zhao Feng smiled and said, “Many new talents will emerge from this trial in the great secret realm.”","“Get ready. We’ll set off tomorrow.”","They had a delicious dinner.","Under the setting sun, the whole sect was filled with a murderous atmosphere.","Many disciples knew that the competition between the Four Great Sects was about to begin again.","Some people discussed it.","“The last time there was such a large-scale secret realm was decades ago. It was said that blood flowed like a river, which was extremely terrifying. Some talents died while some rose.”","“It’s the survival of the fittest. The turbulent times of the Flying Sand Plains are coming. I get nervous just thinking about it.”","“It’s a pity that we haven’t been in the sect for a long time, and our strength is still low. We can’t participate.”","“How can new disciples have such an opportunity?”","“Zhang Yumeng does.”","“...”","Mengmeng was not only popular among the new disciples but also in the whole sect.","The next day, a group of people came to Swordbamboo Peak one after another.","Hun Xuan said with a smile, “Zhang Yumeng, we’re here.”","She didn’t call Mengmeng Elder because she still wanted Mengmeng to be her sister-in-law, so she didn’t address her in a formal way.","“Elder Zhang.”","Yun Han and the others were very courteous.","They came to the backyard and greeted Mengmeng.","It was only more than a dozen people, not many.","Other than these talented disciples, the remaining disciples were made up of a large group and were led by specific elders.","The last one to arrive was Heavenly Hound.","“Elder Zhang, how have you been?”","Heavenly Hound said with a smile, “I guess I’ll have to trouble you during this trip. Of course, if you have any trouble, I will do my best to help you.”","He spoke in a very generous manner. It seemed that he was filled with righteousness.","With the Holy Wind Dog King by his side, he looked even more awe-inspiring.","But Little Hei couldn’t stand it. It bared its fangs and growled in a low voice, “Ow, ow, ow...”","Swoosh!","The Holy Wind Dog King shivered and immediately lay prone on the ground, wagging its tail at Little Hei.","Heavenly Hound was speechless.","At this time, Mengmeng waved her hand and said, “If there is any trouble, contact me in time. I will take care of everyone. Don’t talk too much. Let’s go.”"]},{"number":1500,"title":"Chapter 1500 The Great Secret Realm","paragraphs":["Chapter 1500 The Great Secret Realm","“Let’s go.”","Yun Han smiled in the crowd.","He felt that he would have a good time by following Mengmeng than following other elders.","Just like that, the group of people boarded the aircraft.","They went to the edge of the south coast to gather.","There were many disciples on this trip. All kinds of aircraft had risen into the air and were whistling into the distance.","When Zhang Han and the others arrived, they saw the aircraft going on an expedition.","“How many people are going for the trial? Aren’t there only dozens of teams?” Mengmeng was stunned.","“Who knows? It looks like there are a lot of people.” Yue Xiaonao shook her head slightly.","“There are a lot of people going out to gain experience,” Hun Xuan said with a smile, “and only the elite disciples of our sect have the right to sign up. The other disciples are also led by different protectors or chief supervisors. They will train in the peripheral areas of the secret realm mainly for exploring. The secret realm is vast, and there are always some important places with spirit treasures or other secret realms.”","“Oh, I see.” Mengmeng nodded slightly.","“Haven’t you trained with your sect before?” Heavenly Hound asked curiously.","“If it’s true, isn’t she just a novice? However, I lost so many spiritual treasures to a novice?”","“Call me Elder.” Mengmeng glared at him and said, “You’re so impolite.”","Heavenly Hound noticed Little Hei’s gaze and glanced at the Holy Wind Dog King that was obediently lying on the ground next to him, so he couldn’t help but say in an embarrassed tone, “Yes, Elder.”","“I can’t mess with Zhang Yumeng. Otherwise, my Holy Wind Dog King will be bullied.”","He didn’t know how Mengmeng got the Great Devil, and it was so fierce.","“Shall we set off directly?” Mengmeng asked.","“The place we are going to may not be the same as the other teams. Let’s gather up first. We can also ask First Elder Hanlong,” said Hun Xuan.","“Okay, I’ll ask.”","Mengmeng immediately contacted the elder.","First Elder Hanlong quickly gave her the coordinates and asked them to go there. He also informed them that more than a dozen teams had set off first.","“Then let’s go.”","The spaceship cut through the void. At first, it flew in the same direction as the other aircraft in the air. Later, it gradually deviated from the route of action and flew on its own.","It wasn’t safe to pass through half of the Sixth War Zone. Even the dozen squads needed to move together.","But First Elder Hanlong knew something about the situation of Mengmeng’s team. He couldn’t wait for those with ulterior motives to make trouble for them. In a word, those people would be courting death.","After flying for three and a half days, they finally arrived at their destination.","It was said that the Flying Sand Plains had sunk a lot, but the place could no longer be seen from the outside. There was a thin layer of fog on the plains, and the environment inside was partly hidden and partly visible. It seemed to be a little different from the past.","There was a mountain peak very close to them. Many aircraft were parked on the flat ground nearby.","Some elders and teams of the Sword Sect stood according to different positions and were clearly distinguished.","When Mengmeng and the others came down, they immediately attracted a lot of attention.","“Zhang Yumeng, Yun Han, Heavenly Hound, Hun Shang, Hun Xuan, Jiang Yanlan...”","“Elder Zhang’s team members are all top figures.”","“No wonder she has so few team members. One can’t join her team without qualified strength.”","That remark was what many people thought.","When the sign-up started, many people considered joining Zhang Yumeng’s team.","But soon, some famous people joined in, which also attracted a lot of attention. They wanted to join in, but they felt a little awkward with the sudden addition of them among the top disciples. Besides, the other elders were stronger after all, so they gave up the idea of joining Mengmeng’s team.","“Elder Zhang, you came here on your own?” Elder Blackeye laughed from afar.","“Yes, we flew here on our own. It seems that we need to wait for the other teams for a while,” Mengmeng replied.","She didn’t notice that a few meters behind her, Hun Shang and Hun Xuan were staring at Elder Blackeye without saying a word.","“Is this the peripheral Bounded Domain?”","Heavenly Hound moved and slowly approached the mist of the Bounded Domain.","“Don’t go over.”","Blackeye furrowed his brows slightly and said, “If you accidentally enter it, you will have to leave the Bounded Domain from another place. If you appear in the crowd of the Heavenly Evil Sect, you may die.”","“Damn. Is it so dangerous?”","Heavenly Hound immediately retreated a few meters, observed carefully for a few seconds, and retreated to the front of Mengmeng.","At this time, Zhang Han, Yue Wuwei, Zi Yan, Zhao Feng, and the others did not speak.","Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei looked at each other.","“I sensed a trace of unusual aura,” Yue Wuwei said via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique. “There may be some precious treasures in this big secret realm.”","“I don’t know if there are precious treasures, but this secret realm is quite interesting,” Zhang Han replied with the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique. “It’s unusual. We should be careful.”","When Yue Wuwei heard this, his eyes became a little more serious. “The situation last time won’t happen, will it?”","Yue Wuwei was really upset that their men had been transmitted. He hated those irresistible things.","Zhang Han’s eyes lit up, and he kept sensing with his sense. He could see some clues from the outside. He shook his head slightly and said, “The secret realm is just a secret realm. It’s not that terrifying. What happened last time was because of the means beyond the Cultivation World.”","“Alas!”","...","Speaking of this, Yue Wuwei sighed softly and said, “Sir Mysterious took action back then after all, and it caused a great impact.”","Zhang Han did not say anything more.","Elder Blackeye also reminded the others.","“Everyone, wait here patiently. All the teams have arrived. We’ll wait for half a day. When the entrance show signs of weakening, we can enter.”","In another direction.","In the east of the Flying Sand Plains, there were many teams of the Authentic Martial Arts Sect.","Their talents also had their own teams. Some leading elders were chatting with each other.","“During this trial, the competition between the talents of the Heavenly Evil Sect and the Ling Sea Sword Sect will be fierce.”","“Of course, the talents from both sides are wanted.”","“Our sect doesn’t have to worry about that. All of you, listen carefully. You can participate in the trial and seize the treasures. But if you meet someone stupid, just kill them. The Authentic Martial Arts Sect is fearless.”","“...”","...","Within a team, Leng Yue and the others were gathered together.","“We can meet all our people from Mount New Moon in the secret realm, right?”","“I checked the lists. In addition to the little princess, Jiang Yanlan is the only one on the list of the Sword Sect.” Ah Hu said with a chuckle, “Brother Feng and Brother Qing don’t have any influence over there.”","“That’s good.” Yun Feiyang said rationally, “It’s easy to trick others while pretending to be weak.”","“We have to be careful.” Leng Yue reminded them, “Although we have a lot of defensive means and spirit treasures, our cultivation is only in the middle level among the people who enter this time. There are many disciples and elders at the stage of the Void-refining Realm.”","“Oh, right. Elders in charge usually don’t take action, right? Is that an unwritten rule of the Four Great Sects?” Jiang Bing asked curiously. “If that’s the case, then our little princess can’t take action as well. She’s an elder of the Sword Sect now.”","“Who said it’s a rule?” Ah Hu shook his head and said, “Just now, Elder Xi said that only the leading elders and some famous elders would not take action. The others may not be the case. Moreover, there may be a war between the Heavenly Evil Sect and the Ling Sea Sword Sect.”","“Let’s just focus on the trial and try to defeat some talented disciples.”","“...”","They were chatting.","On the side of the Heavenly Evil Sect, there was also a small team. Mu Xue, Instructor Liu, and Xu Yong were gathered together.","“I’m at the God Transformation Realm Peak Stage. I’m not afraid of this trial,” Mu Xue said flatly.","“You make it sound as if we are not at the Peak Stage. You broke through a few days earlier than us,” Instructor Liu said arrogantly. “Back then, I was just a minion. You are Mu Xue the female demon. I didn’t expect that my cultivation level would catch up with yours now.”","“Liu, don’t show off in front of me. Otherwise, if you hook up with the junior sister, I’ll tell Yanlan.” Mu Xue snorted.","“What do you mean by hooking up? Don’t talk nonsense.” Instructor Liu’s face darkened. “She had some questions, and I just answered perfunctorily.”","“I doubt if you were perfunctory or active,” Xu Yong joked.","“Hahaha.”","Instructor Liu snorted.","“I didn’t expect that the people of our sect attached so much importance to Mengmeng.” Mu Xue’s expression suddenly became more serious. “She ranks first on the list, and the reward is ten times more than that of Heavenly Hound. Many talents are tempted to kill her.”","“How dare they go to Mengmeng? They will be courting death.” Instructor Liu’s eyes were slightly cold. “If I meet those people, I’ll kill a few first.”","“Don’t rush it. Let’s play it by ear. She has Master and Elder Yue with her, so there won’t be any problem.” Mu Xue nodded slightly.","It could be said that they were from the Heavenly Evil Sect, but that was just on the surface.","In fact, they only regarded themselves as members of Mount New Moon.","“However, I’m a little curious. Xu Xiaoqiang from the sect is going to fight with our little princess. I think they’re well-matched in strength,” Instructor Liu said.","“Xu Xiaoqiang...” Mu Xue’s expression became serious. “He is very strong.”","“He’s also a funny guy,” Xu Yong said. “It’s said that he had fought with Heavenly Hound more than a dozen times and had the upper hand. However, eight of his spirit treasures were robbed, and Heavenly Hound was injured six times.”","“I don’t know where Xu Xiaoqiang comes from. He is a mysterious man,” Mu Xue said hesitantly. “No one knows which force he belongs to, but First Elder values him very much. He has a lot of spirit treasures, so he doesn’t mind having a few of them taken away. Heavenly Hound on the south coast of the Sword Sect is no match for him, and Mengmeng has also defeated Heavenly Hound. I still think Mengmeng will be more powerful, and no one can defeat her with their trump cards.”","“I don’t think so. Xu Xiaoqiang is at the Void-refining Realm Middle Stage, and he can often fight with the elders at the Last Stage. The little princess is only at the God Transformation Realm Middle Stage.” Xu Yong said with a wry smile, “Did you forget that? You thought the little princess was at the Void-refining Realm Middle Stage.”","Mu Xue patted her forehead and said, “Yeah. Mengmeng is only in the God Transformation Realm, but her combat capability is too terrifying. Like father, like daughter. It’s understandable.”","“...”","Three of the Four Great Sects had people from Mount New Moon, and only the Crimson Sunglow Sect didn’t.","In fact, the Crimson Sunglow Sect should have recruited the most valued little princess of Mount New Moon, but things went contrary to their wishes. There was even some resentment between Mengmeng and the sect’s Third Elder, Taoist Heavenlight.","“The energy at the entrance is beginning to weaken.","“Wait a moment.”","First Elder Hanlong said, “I’ll open the entrance. You’ll enter one after another and search separately. If you find the Place of Inheritance, inform the sect as soon as possible.”","The Place of Inheritance was what the various sects fought over with all their might in the secret realm.","The spirit treasure can improve one’s physique, but the inheritance can improve the foundation of the sect.","“We’re going in.” Heavenly Hound narrowed his eyes slightly.","“We’ll do as First Elder Hanlong said. You can feel my coordinates after entering. Don’t stay too far away from me, or I can’t save you if something happens.” Mengmeng said very responsibly, “You need to send me a message at a fixed time every day besides encountering accidents.”","“It’s too troublesome to send a message every day. I’ll send it every three days,” Heavenly Hound said.","“What about the rest of you?” Mengmeng asked.","Yun Han replied, “That’s okay for me.”","The others nodded as well.","“Then you’ll send me a message every three days,” Mengmeng said.","When they were about to enter, Heavenly Hound rubbed his hands and said excitedly, “I must grab more spirit treasures from Xu Xiaoqiang this time.”","“Xu Xiaoqiang...” The corners of Yun Han’s mouth trembled slightly. “You lose to him every time, so why are you always looking for him?”","“Haha, who said I’m not a match for him? I was just showing my weakness for the sake of snatching the treasures.” Heavenly Hound snorted.","“You are really confident.” Yun Han shook his head, and a trace of fear flashed in his eyes. “Xu Xiaoqiang’s spear skills are so powerful that I almost couldn’t escape.”","“Who is Xu Xiaoqiang?” Mengmeng asked curiously when she saw that everyone looked serious.","Hun Xuan explained beside her, “Xu Xiaoqiang is an outstanding talent of the younger generation of the Heavenly Evil Sect. He has a lot of merits and is very strong. He has a red tassel spear, which is said to be a seventh-tier spirit treasure. His spear skills are extremely strong and he is not an easy opponent. Similarly, he also likes to cheat people. However, he is not so bloodthirsty.","“With your strength, you need not be too nervous when you see Xu Xiaoqiang. He merely won against Heavenly Hound by a little. I believe that you also possess a powerful trump card.” Hun Xuan smiled.","“I see.”","Mengmeng nodded slightly.","“If anyone dares to provoke Mengmeng, we’ll crush them all,” Yue Xiaonao muttered.","Seeing this, Yue Wuwei couldn’t help teasing, “Don’t say anything if you’re just watching the fun.”","“Elder Yue, you must have grown a beard again recently,” Yue Xiaonao said discontentedly.","Yue Wuwei immediately fell silent.","He looked at her with a smile.","Elder Hanlong shouted, “Enter the secret realm!”","A wooden tripod appeared in his hand, from which suddenly shot out a stream of light.","It entered the weak point of the Bounded Domain and directly bombarded a gap.","Now everyone could finally see the scene inside.","Mountains rose and fell, trees grew, and hundreds of plants flourished.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Team after team flashed into it.","They were the vanguards in the secret realm.","After entering, they split up into different groups. Each group gradually split up to explore their surroundings and advance forward.","Mengmeng only had her friends around her.","Zhao Feng, Chen Changqing, and Jiang Yanlan were not in a hurry to leave.","“Something’s not right.","Yue Wuwei sensed for a moment and suddenly took out a treasure. It was a black ball, which was constantly rotating and absorbing the surrounding energy.","He suddenly said, “The secret realm has existed for a long time, but there are many new auras. Is this a combination of a new and an old secret realm?”","“Why would you even have such a treasure?” Zhang Han asked in confusion.","“Ahem, did you feel anything?” Yue Wuwei changed the subject.","The others all looked at the two of them. It seemed that the secret realm was a little unusual.","“I don’t find anything unusual. This is the periphery of the secret realm.” Zhang Han said, “But as you said, there are new changes in the old secret realm. I think the changes are external. Let’s go inside and see what’s going on.”","Everyone was curious about what would be in the secret realm.","They moved forward slowly.","Apart from the mountains and lush forests, there was nothing else.","Chen Changqing looked around and said, “There doesn’t seem to be an animal here.”","As soon as he finished speaking.","“Ow!”","Little Hei’s nose twitched, and it suddenly stared at the right side with vigilance.","“Let’s go over.”","Zhang Han’s expression changed slightly.","The group of people quickly flew to the right.","Five minutes later, they finally saw something.","“It’s the skeleton of an Exotic Beast.”","“It belongs to an Iron-bone Crocodile.” Yue Wuwei said, “This Exotic Beast is famous for its tough bones. Judging from its bone aura, it should have been dead for some years.”","However, as soon as he finished speaking, he needed to eat his words.","Little Hei sniffed and said in a low voice, “Master, it hasn’t been long since it died, and there’s still the smell of blood on its bones. The further in we go, the hotter the air becomes.”","“Hmm? Did I make a mistake?”","Yue Wuwei was stunned. After careful observation, he found a clue.","“There are a lot of places nearby that are filled with the smell of blood,” Little Hei added. “I can smell the blood, but I can’t sense anything else. Nor can I find any spirit treasures. It’s as if this land has been destroyed and the mountains and trees have been reborn.”","“In this case, it may be an unknown energy storm or an occult art performed by someone with extraordinary cultivation. If this is happening only nearby,” Zhang Han said.","“It seems that it’s not easy to make an Iron-bone Crocodile like this,” Yue Wuwei said. “I guess we’ll find the reason if we go deeper.”","Seeing this, Mengmeng thought for a moment and took out a jade slip, which was a spirit treasure for contacting the team.","She reminded her team members, “All of you, be careful. This secret realm is quite unusual.”","She didn’t tell Elder Hanlong about this. After all, they hadn’t figured out anything yet. Her team should be the fastest. They should be at the forefront. It wouldn’t be too late to talk about it after they figured out the situation.","Zhang Han and the others continued to move forward.","There were mountains, rivers, lakes, glaciers, and volcanoes.","One could see that the Flying Sand Plains didn’t look the same as before.","Especially those who had been here, they were quite vigilant when they saw this.","The Flying Sand Plains were similar to a desert, with fine sand everywhere, as well as oases and plants, but the place didn’t use to have the variety it did now.","On the first day, the second day, and the third day, the group seemed to be still on the periphery.","They continued to move forward at a moderate speed.","They still didn’t see any creatures, only lush green plants.","It was the sixth day.","Whoosh!","Mengmeng’s jade slip suddenly buzzed.","She sensed it and heard Heavenly Hound’s roar.","“Damn it. Elder, bring the guys to save me!”","Hearing this, Mengmeng was stunned and immediately said, “Dad, there’s a problem. Heavenly Hound needs help.”","“Lead the way.”","Zhang Han’s eyes narrowed slightly.","They flew toward the target at a high speed. Mengmeng kept sensing the seal. Heavenly Hound was very far away from them. He was at the very front, constantly running toward her as if something was ceaselessly chasing after him from behind.","“Ow!”","When they were about to approach him, Little Hei’s eyes became sharp and it roared in a low voice.","“Come and save me now! This thing is too terrifying!”","Heavenly Hound screamed in the distance.","Behind him was a crystal-white skeleton in the shape of a giant lizard.","Its bones reflected light, sparkling and holy.","Heavenly Hound cursed angrily, “It keeps absorbing my Qi and blood. I can’t stop it. What a dark thing!”","“It absorbs Qi and blood.”","Zhang Han looked over and looked a little confused.","This thing had the appearance of a darkness-type creature, but in reality, it wasn’t all that. It had a holy aura, which was a bit strange."]}]);
